values
  ('322920508547278704', 'The Violent Professionals', 1973, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Sergio Martino, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Luc Merenda, Richard Conte, Silvano Tranquilli, Carlo Alighiero, Martine Brochard, Luciano Bartoli, Lia Tanzi, Steffen Zacharias', 'R', 'With or without help from law enforcement officers, a lone individual decides to crack down on the syndicate.', 'With or without help from law enforcement officers, a lone individual decides to crack down on the syndicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/987PLaP2NQbO3Zf9ToHZJ17rWr5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58080'),
  ('938909194981128440', 'The Violent Years', 1956, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'William Morgan, William C. Thompson', 'Edward D. Wood Jr.', 'Jean Moorhead, Barbara Weeks, Art Millan, Theresa Hancock, Joanne Cangi, Gloria Farr, Glenn Corbett, Lee Constant', null, 'A newspaper publisher''s daughter suffers from neglect by her parents. She and her friends turn to crime by dressing up like men, holding up gas stations, raping young men at gunpoint, and having makeout parties when her parents are away. Their "fence" gets them to trash the school on request of sinister un-American clients, and they run afoul of the law, apple pie, and God himself.', 'A newspaper publisher''s daughter suffers from neglect by her parents. She and her friends turn to crime by dressing up like men, holding up gas stations, raping young men at gunpoint, and having makeout parties when her parents are away. Their "fence" gets them to trash the school on request of sinister un-American clients, and they run afoul of the law, apple pie, and God himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yz0Ezoq5XomtJAn8CeucniqZHQJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56157'),
  ('588522693433269112', 'The Violet Seller', 1958, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Luis César Amadori, Antonio L. Ballesteros, José Puyol', 'Jesús María de Arozamena', 'Sara Montiel, Raf Vallone, Frank Villard, Ana Mariscal, Laura Valenzuela, Tomás Blanco, Pastor Serrador, Tony Soler', null, 'On New Year''s Eve 1899, Soledad is peddling violets in a Madrid busy street when she meets aristocrat Fernando. The couple falls in love but their different social backgrounds threatens the relationship. Fernando is under constant pressure from his older brother Alfonso who reminds him of his duties including his engagement to Magdalena, a countess. Disregarding all social conventions and scandalizing high society, Fernando sets up Soledad in a plush apartment and announces their marriage plans.', 'On New Year''s Eve 1899, Soledad is peddling violets in a Madrid busy street when she meets aristocrat Fernando. The couple falls in love but their different social backgrounds threatens the relationship. Fernando is under constant pressure from his older brother Alfonso who reminds him of his duties including his engagement to Magdalena, a countess. Disregarding all social conventions and scandalizing high society, Fernando sets up Soledad in a plush apartment and announces their marriage plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riP0KZ7Bnt4Fq7cn0sNeHNnUx58.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119643'),
  ('728202816034353314', 'The Violin', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Martín Boege, Francisco Vargas', 'Francisco Vargas', 'Ángel Tavira, Gerardo Taracena, Dagoberto Gama, Mario Garibaldi, Fermín Martínez, Silverio Palacios, Justo Martínez, Octavio Castro', null, 'In an unnamed Latin American country that closely resembles Mexico, the government fights a rural insurgency with torture, assault, rape, and murder. Soldiers descend on a town, cutting off the rebels from their cache of ammunition hidden in a field. A family of grandfather, son, and grandson are among the rebels in the hills. The grandfather, with his violin over his shoulder, tries to pass the checkpoint, ostensibly to tend his corn crop. The commanding officer lets him pass but insists on a daily music lesson.', 'In an unnamed Latin American country that closely resembles Mexico, the government fights a rural insurgency with torture, assault, rape, and murder. Soldiers descend on a town, cutting off the rebels from their cache of ammunition hidden in a field. A family of grandfather, son, and grandson are among the rebels in the hills. The grandfather, with his violin over his shoulder, tries to pass the checkpoint, ostensibly to tend his corn crop. The commanding officer lets him pass but insists on a daily music lesson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMTKKdZIwRxIB9LflUfgUUgVIFD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68259'),
  ('1092359001127260592', 'The Violin Player', 2016, 'Drama', 'Bauddhayan Mukherji, Avik Mukhopadhyay', 'Bauddhayan Mukherji', 'Ritwick Chakraborty, Adil Hussain, Nayani Dixit, Sonam Stobgais, Jayant Gadekar', null, 'A Bollywood session violinist finds expression in an unlikely place. The day unfolds to reveal startling truths about music, art, life and survival.', 'A Bollywood session violinist finds expression in an unlikely place. The day unfolds to reveal startling truths about music, art, life and survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oX55o8YSMEWwh0QQHcfEdHjXMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372844'),
  ('212693870963843175', 'The Violin Teacher', 2015, 'Drama, Music', 'Sérgio Machado', 'Sérgio Machado', 'Lázaro Ramos, Sandra Corveloni, Kaique de Jesus, Elzio Vieira, Fernanda de Freitas, Marin Alsop, Graça De Andrade, Hermes Baroli', null, 'After failing to be admitted into the OSESP Orchestra, a talented violinist is forced to give music classes to teenagers in a public school. He soon finds his world transformed by the power of music and friendships formed with his pupils.', 'After failing to be admitted into the OSESP Orchestra, a talented violinist is forced to give music classes to teenagers in a public school. He soon finds his world transformed by the power of music and friendships formed with his pupils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYrXWsSJ17NTWCJXkLKEHDHsUQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228152'),
  ('525641612776929090', 'The Viral Factor', 2012, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Kenny Tse Chung-To, Chin Ka-Lok', 'Jack Ng Wai-Lun, Dante Lam Chiu-Yin', 'Jay Chou, Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Lin Peng, Michelle Bai, Andy On Chi-Kit, Liu Kai-Chi, Carl Ng Ka-Lung, Sammy Hung Tin-Chiu', null, 'Agent Jon contemplates leaving the force until he learns his brother is working as a mercenary for a former colleague who betrayed their team.', 'Agent Jon contemplates leaving the force until he learns his brother is working as a mercenary for a former colleague who betrayed their team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7J0SlFWcVFdErk5Vaax35xb19de.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83706'),
  ('1000022844444132808', 'The Virgin of Lust', 2002, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Arturo Ripstein', 'Max Aub, Paz Alicia Garciadiego', 'Juan Diego, Ariadna Gil, Luis Felipe Tovar, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Julián Pastor, Alberto Estrella, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Eligio Meléndez', null, 'In Vera Cruz in the 1940s, Nacho, an Indian, waits tables at Don Lázaro''s café at Hotel Ofélia. He falls for Lola, an opium-addicted, alcoholic whore who''s hopelessly in love with Gardenia Wilson, a masked wrestler who slept with her once but knows she''s unbalanced. Don Lázaro warns Nacho about Lola, and Nacho knows his love will be unrequited, but he''ll do anything, regardless of how degrading, to be near her. Lola, for her part, can be sadistic. Republican exiles who are regulars at the café encourage Lola''s desire to assassinate Franco. Nacho in turn mixes this political mirage with his fascination with the plot of "The Mikado." Where do fantasies and obsessions lead?', 'In Vera Cruz in the 1940s, Nacho, an Indian, waits tables at Don Lázaro''s café at Hotel Ofélia. He falls for Lola, an opium-addicted, alcoholic whore who''s hopelessly in love with Gardenia Wilson, a masked wrestler who slept with her once but knows she''s unbalanced. Don Lázaro warns Nacho about Lola, and Nacho knows his love will be unrequited, but he''ll do anything, regardless of how degrading, to be near her. Lola, for her part, can be sadistic. Republican exiles who are regulars at the café encourage Lola''s desire to assassinate Franco. Nacho in turn mixes this political mirage with his fascination with the plot of "The Mikado." Where do fantasies and obsessions lead?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAAqoRxORhyKnoFVZ1nhsKGQqQk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101564'),
  ('430821110381873415', 'The Virgin of the Quarry Lake', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Laura Casabé, Diego Tenorio', 'Benjamín Naishtat', 'Dolores Oliverio, Fernanda Echevarría del Rivero, Agustín Sosa, Luisa Merelas, Isabel Bracamonte, Candela Flores, Dady Brieva, Víctor López', null, 'On the eve of the 2001 outbreak, Natalia falls madly in love with her lifelong friend Diego. The romance is interrupted when he meets the more experienced Silvia. With the help of her grandma Rita, Natalia decides to call on incantations and curses to jinx Diego and Silvia''s blossoming relationship.', 'On the eve of the 2001 outbreak, Natalia falls madly in love with her lifelong friend Diego. The romance is interrupted when he meets the more experienced Silvia. With the help of her grandma Rita, Natalia decides to call on incantations and curses to jinx Diego and Silvia''s blossoming relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqbUNS0uvqWEgvTWFuxba7Qs4yi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:862739'),
  ('213520872174218446', 'The Virgin Psychics', 2015, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Sion Sono, Hajime Kanda', 'Sion Sono', 'Shota Sometani, Elaiza Ikeda, Erina Mano, Makita Sports, Motoki Fukami, Reiya Masaki, Megumi Kagurazaka, Ken Yasuda', null, 'Shy high schooler Yoshirō and his friends mysteriously develop psychic powers, leading to chaotic and often erotic comedic situations as the virginal ESP teens try to understand their new gifts.', 'Shy high schooler Yoshirō and his friends mysteriously develop psychic powers, leading to chaotic and often erotic comedic situations as the virginal ESP teens try to understand their new gifts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JBH43btcgOp283vpi9j24MJrwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350725'),
  ('1122052393040749927', 'The Virgin Queen', 1955, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Henry Koster, Charles G. Clarke', 'Mindret Lord, Harry Brown', 'Richard Todd, Bette Davis, Joan Collins, Jay Robinson, Herbert Marshall, Dan O''Herlihy, Robert Douglas, Romney Brent', 'NR', 'Sir Walter Raleigh overcomes court intrigue to win favor with the Queen in order to get financing for a proposed voyage to the New World.', 'Sir Walter Raleigh overcomes court intrigue to win favor with the Queen in order to get financing for a proposed voyage to the New World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UbeN94QSvD9iv46ddHB3S5fucP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43327'),
  ('1097990460880228939', 'The Virgin Soldiers', 1969, 'War, Comedy, Drama', 'John Dexter, Kenneth Higgins', 'Ian La Frenais, John Hopkins, John McGrath', 'Hywel Bennett, Lynn Redgrave, Nigel Davenport, Jack Shepherd, Nigel Patrick, Rachel Kempson, Michael Gwynn, Tsai Chin', 'R', 'The core of the plot is the romantic triangle formed by the protagonist, a conscripted soldier named Private Brigg, a worldly professional soldier named Sergeant Driscoll, and Phillipa Raskin, the daughter of the Regimental Sergeant Major. The location is a British army base in Singapore during the Malayan Emergency.', 'The core of the plot is the romantic triangle formed by the protagonist, a conscripted soldier named Private Brigg, a worldly professional soldier named Sergeant Driscoll, and Phillipa Raskin, the daughter of the Regimental Sergeant Major. The location is a British army base in Singapore during the Malayan Emergency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnjaxCvh2ydCzlVKTsXW59IMJC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168348'),
  ('431605820986460405', 'The Virgin Suicides', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sofia Coppola, Edward Lachman, Christopher Binney', 'Sofia Coppola', 'Kirsten Dunst, Josh Hartnett, James Woods, Kathleen Turner, Michael Paré, A. J. Cook, Hanna Hall, Leslie Hayman', 'R', 'A group of male friends become obsessed with five mysterious sisters who are sheltered by their strict, religious parents.', 'A group of male friends become obsessed with five mysterious sisters who are sheltered by their strict, religious parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NCQtXPQnaHRjOZVmktA9BSM35F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1443'),
  ('574976994390161355', 'The Virgin''s Bed', 1969, 'Drama, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Philippe Garrel, Michel Fournier', 'Philippe Garrel', 'Zouzou, Pierre Clémenti, Tina Aumont, Philippe Garrel, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Valérie Lagrange, Pierre-Richard Bré, Babette Lamy', null, '30 year old child enters the new city, riding on a donkey. He says he is the Savior. He has spent no time among men. He is trembling with cold. His clothes are soaked. His mother was overprotective ; his father conspicuously absent. He knows that he must face the mockery, refusal, ignorance and blindness of the men around him. They travel in gangs, in large numbers : soldiers, mercenaries or the like, on majestic, imposing horses. Everything is out of proportion to his thin, bewildered, innocent body ; he is the madman of the new city...', '30 year old child enters the new city, riding on a donkey. He says he is the Savior. He has spent no time among men. He is trembling with cold. His clothes are soaked. His mother was overprotective ; his father conspicuously absent. He knows that he must face the mockery, refusal, ignorance and blindness of the men around him. They travel in gangs, in large numbers : soldiers, mercenaries or the like, on majestic, imposing horses. Everything is out of proportion to his thin, bewildered, innocent body ; he is the madman of the new city...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9hZQAXfnyXKAKR9tZbqI66xPkk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115108'),
  ('966258051227784350', 'The Virginian', 1929, 'Western', 'Victor Fleming, J. Roy Hunt, Edward Cronjager', 'Owen Wister, Kirk La Shelle', 'Gary Cooper, Walter Huston, Richard Arlen, Mary Brian, Helen Ware, Chester Conklin, Eugene Pallette, Victor Potel', 'NR', 'A good-natured cowboy who is romancing the new schoolmarm has a crisis of conscience when he discovers his best friend is engaged in cattle rustling.', 'A good-natured cowboy who is romancing the new schoolmarm has a crisis of conscience when he discovers his best friend is engaged in cattle rustling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RX4GfCawXHtd0WMrHz5nSzXv7i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42616'),
  ('482220988606784509', 'The Virginian', 1946, 'Western', 'Stuart Gilmore, Harry Hallenberger', 'Albert Hackett, Frances Goodrich', 'Joel McCrea, Brian Donlevy, Sonny Tufts, Barbara Britton, William Frawley, Fay Bainter, Henry O''Neill, Tom Tully', 'NR', 'Arriving at Medicine Bow, eastern schoolteacher Molly Woods meets two cowboys, irresponsible Steve and the "Virginian," who gets off on the wrong foot with her. To add to his troubles, the Virginian finds that his old pal Steve is mixed up with black-hatted Trampas and his rustlers...then finds himself at the head of a posse after said rustlers; and Molly hates the violent side of frontier life.', 'Arriving at Medicine Bow, eastern schoolteacher Molly Woods meets two cowboys, irresponsible Steve and the "Virginian," who gets off on the wrong foot with her. To add to his troubles, the Virginian finds that his old pal Steve is mixed up with black-hatted Trampas and his rustlers...then finds himself at the head of a posse after said rustlers; and Molly hates the violent side of frontier life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nF1Oc6V9N4c3Dv0B2oojcFELKiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121230'),
  ('635909560259011726', 'The Virginity Hit', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Andrew Gurland, Huck Botko, Luke Geissbühler', 'Andrew Gurland, Huck Botko', 'Matt Bennett, Zack Pearlman, Jacob Davich, Justin Kline, Krysta Rodriguez, Nicole Weaver, Savannah Welch, Tina Parker', 'R', 'Four guys, one camera, and their experience chronicling the exhilarating and terrifying rite of passage: losing your virginity. As these guys help their buddy get laid, they''ll have to survive friends with benefits, Internet hookups, even porn stars during an adventure that proves why you will always remember your first time.', 'Four guys, one camera, and their experience chronicling the exhilarating and terrifying rite of passage: losing your virginity. As these guys help their buddy get laid, they''ll have to survive friends with benefits, Internet hookups, even porn stars during an adventure that proves why you will always remember your first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krUYZAjEZ5n5GL7tuLoQGfxja0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42889'),
  ('527790608828602720', 'The Virgo, the Taurus and the Capricorn', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Luciano Martino, Giancarlo Ferrando, Franco Cirino', 'Cesare Frugoni, Luciano Martino, Francesco Milizia', 'Edwige Fenech, Alberto Lionello, Aldo Maccione, Olga Bisera, Alvaro Vitali, Erna Schürer, Michele Gammino, Mario Carotenuto', null, 'Distressed that her wayward husband, Gianni (Alberto Lionello), forsakes her favors and seduces a series of other women, drop-dead gorgeous Gioia (Edwige Fenech) turns to handsome lothario Patrizio (Ray Lovelock) to help her get revenge. Will her enthusiastic affair help Gianni see the error of his ways? Luciano Martino directs this saucy comedy that also stars Aldo Maccione, Alvaro Vitali and Olga Bisera.', 'Distressed that her wayward husband, Gianni (Alberto Lionello), forsakes her favors and seduces a series of other women, drop-dead gorgeous Gioia (Edwige Fenech) turns to handsome lothario Patrizio (Ray Lovelock) to help her get revenge. Will her enthusiastic affair help Gianni see the error of his ways? Luciano Martino directs this saucy comedy that also stars Aldo Maccione, Alvaro Vitali and Olga Bisera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vX4jO4kvrQzHBpkiLVTAePdWMLs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208873'),
  ('1003690780552708270', 'The Virtuoso', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Nick Stagliano, Frank Prinzi, Karim Nabil', 'James C. Wolfe', 'Anthony Hopkins, Anson Mount, Abbie Cornish, Diora Baird, Eddie Marsan, David Morse, Richard Brake, Chris Perfetti', 'R', 'Danger, deception and murder descend upon a sleepy town when a professional assassin accepts a new assignment from his enigmatic boss.', 'Danger, deception and murder descend upon a sleepy town when a professional assassin accepts a new assignment from his enigmatic boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufFbnDMa1XNJxWYxlYv2jEPxUcD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:808023'),
  ('1065529774219992589', 'The Virtuous Bigamist', 1956, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mario Soldati', 'Aldo De Benedetti', 'Fernandel, Giulia Rubini, Fosco Giachetti, Alberto Sordi, Leda Gloria, Andrex, Renato Salvatori, Jean Brochard', 'NR', 'The Provence, somewhere in the 1950''s. Paul Verdier, traveling salesman, leaves his home and his quarrelsome wife for his weekly round. On the train he meets a young woman, Marie, who looks a little lost. No wonder. Marie is pregnant but lacks the customary husband. She''s returning to her village but is not exactly looking forward to the confrontation with her parents and the villagers, all pretty conservative people. After getting to know Paul a little better (for which there is ample time during the trip by train and bus) Marie decides to ask Paul to act as her husband, just to allay the suspicions of her family. After some hesitating Paul accepts, charmed by the girl and unaware of the complications such is bound to cause to his own life.', 'The Provence, somewhere in the 1950''s. Paul Verdier, traveling salesman, leaves his home and his quarrelsome wife for his weekly round. On the train he meets a young woman, Marie, who looks a little lost. No wonder. Marie is pregnant but lacks the customary husband. She''s returning to her village but is not exactly looking forward to the confrontation with her parents and the villagers, all pretty conservative people. After getting to know Paul a little better (for which there is ample time during the trip by train and bus) Marie decides to ask Paul to act as her husband, just to allay the suspicions of her family. After some hesitating Paul accepts, charmed by the girl and unaware of the complications such is bound to cause to his own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m575XGPxVYHDzu20fWA7usZuhtz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82835'),
  ('1007171701600865678', 'The Virtuous Scoundrel', 1953, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sacha Guitry, François Gir', 'Sacha Guitry', 'Michel Simon, Louis de Funès, Marguerite Pierry, François Guérin, Laurence Badie, Claude Gensac, Léon Walther, Pauline Carton', null, 'La Vie d''un honnête homme English: The Virtuous Scoundrel, is a French comedy drama film from 1953, directed by Sacha Guitry, written by Sacha Guitry, starring Michel Simon and Louis de Funès.', 'La Vie d''un honnête homme English: The Virtuous Scoundrel, is a French comedy drama film from 1953, directed by Sacha Guitry, written by Sacha Guitry, starring Michel Simon and Louis de Funès.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlff7dF94RWnhqrAMeC5qrEp44N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80044'),
  ('347352519081367706', 'The Visit', 1964, 'Drama', 'Bernhard Wicki, Armando Nannuzzi', 'Friedrich Dürrenmatt', 'Ingrid Bergman, Anthony Quinn, Irina Demick, Paolo Stoppa, Hans Christian Blech, Romolo Valli, Claude Dauphin, Jacques Dufilho', 'PG', 'Carla Zachanassian had a child by Serge Miller as a teenager. When Serge refused to marry her, she was driven out of town. By her own wit and cunning, she has returned as a multi-millionaire for a visit. The town lays out the red carpet expecting big things from Carla, only to learn that her sole purpose is to see Serge Miller killed...', 'Carla Zachanassian had a child by Serge Miller as a teenager. When Serge refused to marry her, she was driven out of town. By her own wit and cunning, she has returned as a multi-millionaire for a visit. The town lays out the red carpet expecting big things from Carla, only to learn that her sole purpose is to see Serge Miller killed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3BdC8nEa8TlSg1EqXflhon1BHB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151138'),
  ('48801105414901925', 'The Visit', 1989, 'Drama', 'Mikhail Kozakov, Vladimir Shevtsik', 'Mikhail Kozakov, Igor Shevtsov', 'Yekaterina Vasilyeva, Valentin Gaft, Svetlana Nemolyaeva, Igor Kashintsev, Valentin Nikulin, Grigoriy Lyampe, Viktor Bortsov, Valentin Smirnitskiy', null, 'In her teens, Mme. Zachanassian had to flee her home town in disgrace. Now she''s old and rich and the town is facing bankruptcy. But she returns with news that she wants to help - as long as the townsfolk kill someone for her.', 'In her teens, Mme. Zachanassian had to flee her home town in disgrace. Now she''s old and rich and the town is facing bankruptcy. But she returns with news that she wants to help - as long as the townsfolk kill someone for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjXreWxPDqVjZHCZSJPP6I8J7E4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121968'),
  ('455625669785871127', 'The Visit', 2008, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Nikolaus Leytner, Hermann Dunzendorfer', 'Friedrich Dürrenmatt', 'Christiane Hörbiger, Michael Mendl, Muriel Baumeister, Lisa Kreuzer, Dietrich Hollinderbäumer, Helmut Berger, Hans von Borsody, Rolf Hoppe', null, 'In her teens, Mme. Zachanassian had to flee her home town in disgrace. Now she''s old and rich and the town is facing bankruptcy. But she returns with news that she wants to help - as long as the townsfolk kill someone for her.', 'In her teens, Mme. Zachanassian had to flee her home town in disgrace. Now she''s old and rich and the town is facing bankruptcy. But she returns with news that she wants to help - as long as the townsfolk kill someone for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qF69pOf3sRiPfE3swbOvozG9Oyc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66586'),
  ('774784322423733556', 'The Visit', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'M. Night Shyamalan, Maryse Alberti, Brian Moon', 'M. Night Shyamalan', 'Olivia DeJonge, Ed Oxenbould, Deanna Dunagan, Peter McRobbie, Kathryn Hahn, Celia Keenan-Bolger, Samuel Stricklen, Patch Darragh', 'PG-13', 'A brother and sister are sent to their grandparents'' remote Pennsylvania farm for a week, where they discover that the elderly couple is involved in something deeply disturbing.', 'A brother and sister are sent to their grandparents'' remote Pennsylvania farm for a week, where they discover that the elderly couple is involved in something deeply disturbing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtMfKRCa2V5b7d9k4piogB72mcY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298312'),
