  ('980078047259386670', 'The Visitation', 2006, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Robby Henson', null, 'Edward Furlong, Kelly Lynch, Randy Travis, Richard Tyson, Ellen Geer, Priscilla Barnes, Martin Donovan, Noah Segan', 'PG-13', 'In Antioch, the former Father Travis Jordan lost his faith on God three years ago when his beloved wife was murdered and the criminals never found. Suddenly, miracles happen in the little town: the son of the newcomer and veterinary Morgan Elliot survives a car accident without a single scratch; Travis''s dog Max revives after being buried; a paraplegic walks; a wounded woman and her father with b', 'In Antioch, the former Father Travis Jordan lost his faith on God three years ago when his beloved wife was murdered and the criminals never found. Suddenly, miracles happen in the little town: the son of the newcomer and veterinary Morgan Elliot survives a car accident without a single scratch; Travis''s dog Max revives after being buried; a paraplegic walks; a wounded woman and her father with b', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oVMtjMKEVSbvrEqMbRhjyfM0BF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24648'),
  ('110392605630545173', 'The Visitor', 1963, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Antonio Pietrangeli, Marcello Ugolini, Armando Nannuzzi', 'Antonio Pietrangeli, Ettore Scola, Ruggero Maccari', 'Sandra Milo, François Périer, Mario Adorf, Gastone Moschin, Angela Minervini, Ettore Baraldi, Giancarlo Bellagamba, Bruno Benatti', null, 'Certain that "the right man" is crucial to her escaping the confines of the Italian village where she lives, Pina places an ad in the newspaper. She gets a response from Adolfo, who agrees to travel from his residence in Rome to visit her. As flashbacks shed light on both their pasts, suspense builds about how they will relate to one another.', 'Certain that "the right man" is crucial to her escaping the confines of the Italian village where she lives, Pina places an ad in the newspaper. She gets a response from Adolfo, who agrees to travel from his residence in Rome to visit her. As flashbacks shed light on both their pasts, suspense builds about how they will relate to one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10wF2maItcvhUzBHqkwtoAlRU0z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96454'),
  ('767329899972978397', 'The Visitor', 1979, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Giulio Paradisi, Ennio Guarnieri, Meyer Glickman', 'Luciano Comici, Robert Mundi', 'Mel Ferrer, Glenn Ford, Lance Henriksen, John Huston, Joanne Nail, Sam Peckinpah, Shelley Winters, Paige Conner', null, 'An ancient intergalactic warrior arrives on Earth to put a stop to a demonic child''s plot to reproduce Satan''s next generation of evil.', 'An ancient intergalactic warrior arrives on Earth to put a stop to a demonic child''s plot to reproduce Satan''s next generation of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8UceYrcX1KuFznKxMtp9N7JpQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54013'),
  ('418872875154372486', 'The Visitor', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Music', 'Tom McCarthy, Oliver Bokelberg, Nicholas R. Bell', 'Tom McCarthy', 'Richard Jenkins, Haaz Sleiman, Danai Gurira, Hiam Abbass, Marian Seldes, Maggie Moore, Michael Cumpsty, Bill McHenry', 'PG-13', 'A college professor travels to New York City to attend a conference and finds a young couple living in his apartment.', 'A college professor travels to New York City to attend a conference and finds a young couple living in his apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XRRSD7swlYrGBhZ8vOR2yngIKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12473'),
  ('126044027730627730', 'The Visitor', 2011, 'Drama', 'Tor Iben', 'Tor Iben', 'Sinan Hancili, Martina Hesse, Peter Beck, Engin Sert, Volker Figge, Ferhat Türkoglu, Ingmar Skrinjar, Volker Waldschmidt', null, 'Cibrâil, a young policeman, is living happily with his girlfriend in Berlin. He is well integrated in society despite his Turkish background. One day his girlfriend''s cousin comes to stay and Cibrâil''s life is turned upside down.', 'Cibrâil, a young policeman, is living happily with his girlfriend in Berlin. He is well integrated in society despite his Turkish background. One day his girlfriend''s cousin comes to stay and Cibrâil''s life is turned upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEkhdj68M0tTG8yLIGYqI2Ra71s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185016'),
  ('28016914746289799', 'The Visitor', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Justin P. Lange, John McAlary, Federico Verardi', 'Adam Mason, Simon Boyes', 'Finn Jones, Jessica McNamee, Donna Biscoe, Thomas Francis Murphy, Dane Rhodes, Shanna Forrestall, Susan McPhail, Sue Rock', 'NR', 'After a series of tragedies including the death of his father-in-law, Robert and his wife Maia leave their home in London to move back to her childhood home. But when Robert discovers an old portrait in the attic of a man who is his spitting image, he goes down a rabbit hole to discover the identity of this mysterious doppelganger known only as the visitor. It isn’t long until he realizes – where the visitor goes, death follows.', 'After a series of tragedies including the death of his father-in-law, Robert and his wife Maia leave their home in London to move back to her childhood home. But when Robert discovers an old portrait in the attic of a man who is his spitting image, he goes down a rabbit hole to discover the identity of this mysterious doppelganger known only as the visitor. It isn’t long until he realizes – where the visitor goes, death follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FchVTEnjQw6m5NnQBa8QwjUv6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881487'),
  ('967025453705583532', 'The Visitor from the Future', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Adventure', 'Matthieu Misiraca, François Descraques', 'François Descraques', 'Florent Dorin, Enya Baroux, Raphaël Descraques, Arnaud Ducret, Slimane-Baptiste Berhoun, Mathieu Poggi, Audrey Pirault, Lénie Chérino', null, 'In a devastated future, the apocalypse threatens the Earth. The last hope lies with a man capable of time travel. His mission: to return to the past and change the course of events. But the time police hunts him down in every era. A race against time begins for the Visitor from the Future...', 'In a devastated future, the apocalypse threatens the Earth. The last hope lies with a man capable of time travel. His mission: to return to the past and change the course of events. But the time police hunts him down in every era. A race against time begins for the Visitor from the Future...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsMIi4W3MvLChEUk8tiiHffyhQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:810389'),
  ('1073984754842284096', 'The Visitors', 1972, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Elia Kazan, Nicholas T. Proferes', 'Chris Kazan', 'Patrick McVey, Patricia Joyce, James Woods, Steve Railsback, Chico Martínez', 'R', 'Bill, Martha and their little child Hal are spending a quiet winter Sunday in their cosy house when they get an unexpected visit from Mike Nickerson and Tony Rodriguez. Mike and Tony are old acquaintances of Bill; a few years back, in Vietnam, they were in the same platoon. They also became opposed parties in a court martial - for a reason that Bill never explained to Martha. What happened in Vietnam, and what is the reason for the presence of Mike and Tony ?', 'Bill, Martha and their little child Hal are spending a quiet winter Sunday in their cosy house when they get an unexpected visit from Mike Nickerson and Tony Rodriguez. Mike and Tony are old acquaintances of Bill; a few years back, in Vietnam, they were in the same platoon. They also became opposed parties in a court martial - for a reason that Bill never explained to Martha. What happened in Vietnam, and what is the reason for the presence of Mike and Tony ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlnSJXYfCzbmBN2utn7BRZX5Lak.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102699'),
  ('311710743930403664', 'The Visitors', 1988, 'Horror', 'Jack Ersgard, Patrik Ersgård, Hans-Åke Lerin', null, 'Kjell Bergqvist, Lena Endre, Johannes Brost, Joanna Berglund, Jonas Olsson, Patrik Ersgård, Bernt Lundquist, Lena Lindblom', null, 'Frank, Sara and their two children have recently moved into the house of their dreams on the countryside. Frank is disturbed by mysterious sounds and somebody tears down the wallpaper from the walls. He contacts a ghost-hunter, Allan, to find out the truth.', 'Frank, Sara and their two children have recently moved into the house of their dreams on the countryside. Frank is disturbed by mysterious sounds and somebody tears down the wallpaper from the walls. He contacts a ghost-hunter, Allan, to find out the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrndhfRfb1i8yTQCuOSKLJcVqKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16079'),
  ('432957321035145185', 'The Visitors', 1993, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Jean-Yves Le Mener, Jean-Marie Poiré', 'Christian Clavier, Jean-Marie Poiré', 'Jean Reno, Christian Clavier, Valérie Lemercier, Marie-Anne Chazel, Christian Bujeau, Isabelle Nanty, Gérard Séty, Didier Pain', 'R', 'After a wizard''s spell goes awry, 12th-century Gallic knight Godefroy de Papincourt, Count of Montmirail finds himself transported to 1993, along with his dimwitted servant, Jacquouille la Fripouille. Startled and perplexed by modern technology, the duo run amok, destroying cars and causing chaos until they meet Beatrice de Montmirail, an aristocratic descendant of the nobleman, who may be able to help them get back to 1123.', 'After a wizard''s spell goes awry, 12th-century Gallic knight Godefroy de Papincourt, Count of Montmirail finds himself transported to 1993, along with his dimwitted servant, Jacquouille la Fripouille. Startled and perplexed by modern technology, the duo run amok, destroying cars and causing chaos until they meet Beatrice de Montmirail, an aristocratic descendant of the nobleman, who may be able to help them get back to 1123.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPCq0buG5PaXgKjzT2ktjrjlpbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11687'),
  ('974388842188277978', 'The Visitors II: The Corridors of Time', 1998, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jean-Marie Poiré', 'Jean-Marie Poiré, Christian Clavier', 'Christian Clavier, Jean Reno, Muriel Robin, Marie-Anne Chazel, Christian Bujeau, Pierre Vial, Jean-Paul Muel, Claire Nadeau', null, 'The sequel to The Visitors reunites us with those lovable ruffians from the French Medieval ages who - through magic - are transported into the present, with often drastic consequences. Godefroy de Montmirail travels to today to recover the missing family jewels and a sacred relic, guarantor of his wife-to-be''s fertility. The confrontation between Godefroy''s repellent servant Jack the Crack and his descendent, the effete Jacquart, present-day owner of the chateau, further complicates the matter.', 'The sequel to The Visitors reunites us with those lovable ruffians from the French Medieval ages who - through magic - are transported into the present, with often drastic consequences. Godefroy de Montmirail travels to today to recover the missing family jewels and a sacred relic, guarantor of his wife-to-be''s fertility. The confrontation between Godefroy''s repellent servant Jack the Crack and his descendent, the effete Jacquart, present-day owner of the chateau, further complicates the matter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1xMb4GfTuyKSRUoeewBF27dtKa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10353'),
  ('1026255144652213271', 'The Visitors: Bastille Day', 2016, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jean-Marie Poiré, Stéphane Le Parc', 'Christian Clavier, Jean-Marie Poiré', 'Jean Reno, Christian Clavier, Franck Dubosc, Karin Viard, Sylvie Testud, Marie-Anne Chazel, Ary Abittan, Alex Lutz', null, 'Stuck in the corridors of time, Godefroy de Montmirail and his faithful servant Jacquouille are projected to a time of profound political and social upheavals: the French Revolution... specifically, The Terror, time of great dangers, during which the descendants of Godefroy and Jacquouille had their castle and all their property confiscated by arrogant aristocrats, fleeing and lifes hanging by a thread.', 'Stuck in the corridors of time, Godefroy de Montmirail and his faithful servant Jacquouille are projected to a time of profound political and social upheavals: the French Revolution... specifically, The Terror, time of great dangers, during which the descendants of Godefroy and Jacquouille had their castle and all their property confiscated by arrogant aristocrats, fleeing and lifes hanging by a thread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2AV9HgEjTPwY2FMzyqI36Wdqb7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248705'),
  ('742732801271115772', 'The Visual Bible: Matthew', 1993, 'Drama, History', 'Michael Ferris, Tobie Swanepoel, Regardt van den Bergh', 'Johann Potgieter', 'Richard Kiley, Bruce Marchiano, Gerrit Schoonhoven, Dawid Minnaar, Kevin Smith, Hannes Muller, Charlton George, Jaqques De Klerk', null, 'The only dramatization using the actual scriptures...word for word from the New International Version (NIV). In Israel, then known as Judea of the Roman Empire, Nazarene Jesus Christ travels around the country with His disciples preaching to the people about God and salvation of their souls.', 'The only dramatization using the actual scriptures...word for word from the New International Version (NIV). In Israel, then known as Judea of the Roman Empire, Nazarene Jesus Christ travels around the country with His disciples preaching to the people about God and salvation of their souls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owrMlqBWzqMvXe9KTftzEP35GqO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38298'),
  ('274574741821031367', 'The Vixen', 1969, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jean Aurel', 'Jean Aurel, Jacques Laurent', 'Brigitte Bardot, Maurice Ronet, Christina Holme, Anny Duperey, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Tanya Lopert, Honoré Bostel, Guy Michel', null, 'Clara becomes a secretary who must cater to all the desires of the womanizing writer Jérôme, while he tries to write his memoirs.', 'Clara becomes a secretary who must cater to all the desires of the womanizing writer Jérôme, while he tries to write his memoirs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEhiYy6lORWMxaF44fjmnGpOJhc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92251'),
  ('540942270587757626', 'The Voice Inside', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Çağrı Bayrak', 'Engin Günaydın', 'Engin Günaydın, Leyla Lydia Tuğutlu, Füsun Demirel, Ersin Korkut, Hamdi Kahraman, Nazlı Tosunoğlu, Onur Buldu, Sırrı Süreyya Önder', null, 'Selim is a writer and lives in a world of one''s own without self confidence. He decides to live with his mother to escape from loneliness. One day he meets a beautiful and rich girl whose name is Aysil. Then Aysil falls in love with Selim and she believes that Selim''s mother and her friends will bring happiness to her.', 'Selim is a writer and lives in a world of one''s own without self confidence. He decides to live with his mother to escape from loneliness. One day he meets a beautiful and rich girl whose name is Aysil. Then Aysil falls in love with Selim and she believes that Selim''s mother and her friends will bring happiness to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDvxgQ5BeCfyOTAINR3UkHCpnBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345807'),
  ('518436654175957985', 'The Voice of Hind Rajab', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Kaouther Ben Hania, Juan Sarmiento G., Marie Fischer', 'Kaouther Ben Hania', 'Hind Rajab, Motaz Malhees, Saja Kilani, Amer Hlehel, Clara Khoury, Nesbat Serhan, Ramy Brahem', 'NR', 'January 29, 2024. Red Crescent volunteers receive an emergency call. A five-year old girl is trapped in a car under fire in Gaza, pleading for rescue. While trying to keep her on the line, they do everything they can to get an ambulance to her. Her name was Hind Rajab.', 'January 29, 2024. Red Crescent volunteers receive an emergency call. A five-year old girl is trapped in a car under fire in Gaza, pleading for rescue. While trying to keep her on the line, they do everything they can to get an ambulance to her. Her name was Hind Rajab.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7M8kQB46T11vmDMD6E239jsqTz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1480382'),
  ('414469881177910255', 'The Voice of Sin', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Hideo Yamamoto, Nobuhiro Doi, Yoshimasa Fujie', 'Akiko Nogi', 'Shun Oguri, Gen Hoshino, Mikako Ichikawa, Meiko Kaji, Junko Abe, Ryudo Uzaki, Yutaka Matsushige, Kanji Furutachi', null, 'Eiji Akutsu is a newspaper reporter. He is working on unsolved case that took place 30 years ago. The case involved a group of people extorting several companies for money. The group sent cassette tapes to the companies. Eiji Akutsu comes across a mysterious cassette tape. Meanwhile, Toshiya Sone lives in Kyoto and runs a tailor shop. He discovers a cassette tape among his late father''s possessions. He plays the cassette tape and hears his voice from his childhood days.', 'Eiji Akutsu is a newspaper reporter. He is working on unsolved case that took place 30 years ago. The case involved a group of people extorting several companies for money. The group sent cassette tapes to the companies. Eiji Akutsu comes across a mysterious cassette tape. Meanwhile, Toshiya Sone lives in Kyoto and runs a tailor shop. He discovers a cassette tape among his late father''s possessions. He plays the cassette tape and hears his voice from his childhood days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdmomwzq6066B6Mi9JD5MeMxpD4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718497'),
  ('116735185622633931', 'The Voice of the Moon', 1990, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Federico Fellini, Gianni Arduini, Daniela Barbiani', 'Tullio Pinelli, Ermanno Cavazzoni', 'Roberto Benigni, Paolo Villaggio, Angelo Orlando, Nadia Ottaviani, Marisa Tomasi, Syusy Blady, Dario Ghirardi, Nigel Harris', null, 'Odd couple Ivo Salvini, recently released from a mental asylum, and former prefect Gonnella wander through the countryside and discover a dystopia made of television commercials, beauty pageants, rock music, Catholicism, and pagan rituals.', 'Odd couple Ivo Salvini, recently released from a mental asylum, and former prefect Gonnella wander through the countryside and discover a dystopia made of television commercials, beauty pageants, rock music, Catholicism, and pagan rituals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1E9bSjMK72pqYvpPioFuQd3IUBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59050'),
  ('670634769900505220', 'The Voice of the Water', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Bert Haanstra, Anton van Munster', 'Bert Haanstra, Simon Carmiggelt, Anton Koolhaas', 'Simon Carmiggelt', null, 'The Netherlands and water, they are inseparable from one another. Water in its soothing form, as a place of work and pleasure and as a source of threat and misery. Bert Haanstra thought it a great subject for a big cinema documentary and made The Voice of the Water. At the start, while the credits are still running, it is already apparent how remarkable and original he portrays the beauty of the landscape of the Dutch coastline. In the following ninety minutes we see numerous people that live, work and recreate on, by and in the water. Often they are being observed in a gentle humorous way that reminds us of The Human Dutch. Some people prefer to stay far away from all the wetness: the little boy having a swimming lesson, but who doesn’t dare to put his head under water, is forever imprinted on the memory of many of the viewers.', 'The Netherlands and water, they are inseparable from one another. Water in its soothing form, as a place of work and pleasure and as a source of threat and misery. Bert Haanstra thought it a great subject for a big cinema documentary and made The Voice of the Water. At the start, while the credits are still running, it is already apparent how remarkable and original he portrays the beauty of the landscape of the Dutch coastline. In the following ninety minutes we see numerous people that live, work and recreate on, by and in the water. Often they are being observed in a gentle humorous way that reminds us of The Human Dutch. Some people prefer to stay far away from all the wetness: the little boy having a swimming lesson, but who doesn’t dare to put his head under water, is forever imprinted on the memory of many of the viewers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/PBq3fJXrPCZghEZ4vludeyzXN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227637'),
  ('1111265966483372408', 'The Voiceless', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Pascal Rabaté', 'Pascal Rabaté', 'Yolande Moreau, Gustave Kervern, François Morel, David Salles, Charles Schneider, Romain Francisco, Timothée Prince', null, 'A small clan lives in the underworld of a rubbish dump. They recycle the waste they find or steal, in order to cobble their home together. Life there could be so sweet, were it not for a chief inspector hot on their heels.', 'A small clan lives in the underworld of a rubbish dump. They recycle the waste they find or steal, in order to cobble their home together. Life there could be so sweet, were it not for a chief inspector hot on their heels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cuRGdK79PtZ6RQKnELlCzOZdDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717691'),
  ('966767227353575999', 'The Voices', 2014, 'Comedy, Crime, Horror, Fantasy', 'Maxime Alexandre, Marjane Satrapi', 'Michael R. Perry', 'Ryan Reynolds, Gemma Arterton, Anna Kendrick, Jacki Weaver, Ella Smith, Paul Chahidi, Stanley Townsend, Adi Shankar', 'R', 'A mentally unhinged factory worker must decide whether to listen to his talking cat and become a killer, or follow his dog''s advice to keep striving for normalcy.', 'A mentally unhinged factory worker must decide whether to listen to his talking cat and become a killer, or follow his dog''s advice to keep striving for normalcy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weY5OVSFmxvA3D4lfyhgvugklEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244458'),
  ('435978186427662331', 'The Voices', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Wesley Alley, Bradley Fowler, Bradley Fowler', null, 'Amanda Markowitz, Victoria Matlock, Brendan Sexton III, Lin Shaye, Juliana Sada, Jessica Sonneborn, Bradley Fowler, Sharon Roggio', 'R', 'Angry and upset after a sudden breakup with her fiancé, Grace Crawford seeks sanctuary at the remote home of her sister, Catherine. It becomes clear that Catherine is suffering from paranoid schizophrenia, much like their late mother, who had taken her own life. While coming to terms with this heavy realization, Grace also uncovers another terrible little secret that has her struggling to maintain her own sanity and ultimately scurrying to save herself and her family from further harm.', 'Angry and upset after a sudden breakup with her fiancé, Grace Crawford seeks sanctuary at the remote home of her sister, Catherine. It becomes clear that Catherine is suffering from paranoid schizophrenia, much like their late mother, who had taken her own life. While coming to terms with this heavy realization, Grace also uncovers another terrible little secret that has her struggling to maintain her own sanity and ultimately scurrying to save herself and her family from further harm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFV4GnGheaTRpe5FHHbxyWsOpsp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639250'),
  ('625807349582019096', 'The Void', 2016, 'Mystery, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jeremy Gillespie, Steven Kostanski, Samy Inayeh', 'Jeremy Gillespie, Steven Kostanski', 'Aaron Poole, Kathleen Munroe, Art Hindle, Daniel Fathers, Kenneth Welsh, Ellen Wong, Stephanie Belding, Mik Byskov', 'NR', 'In the middle of a routine patrol, officer Daniel Carter happens upon a blood-soaked figure limping down a deserted stretch of road. He rushes the young man to a nearby rural hospital staffed by a skeleton crew, only to discover that patients and personnel are transforming into something inhuman. As the horror intensifies, Carter leads the other survivors on a hellish voyage into the subterranean depths of the hospital in a desperate bid to end the nightmare before it''s too late.', 'In the middle of a routine patrol, officer Daniel Carter happens upon a blood-soaked figure limping down a deserted stretch of road. He rushes the young man to a nearby rural hospital staffed by a skeleton crew, only to discover that patients and personnel are transforming into something inhuman. As the horror intensifies, Carter leads the other survivors on a hellish voyage into the subterranean depths of the hospital in a desperate bid to end the nightmare before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WhZAPi3vomEQdzAPIYTvmvWaxI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378018'),
  ('151145648673953569', 'The Volcano', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Alexandre Coffre, Pierre Cottereau', 'Laurent Zeitoun, Yoann Gromb, Alexandre Coffre', 'Valérie Bonneton, Dany Boon, Denis Ménochet, Bérangère McNeese, Albert Delpy, Constance Dollé, Malik Bentalha, Myriam Azencot', null, 'The eruption of the Icelandic volcano Eyjafjallajökull causes major disruptions to travelers'' plans around the world. For Alain and Valérie, it''s a catastrophe. Because to make it to the small Greek village in time for their daughter''s wedding, this divorced couple, whose mutual hatred knows no bounds, will be obliged to set out on the road together.', 'The eruption of the Icelandic volcano Eyjafjallajökull causes major disruptions to travelers'' plans around the world. For Alain and Valérie, it''s a catastrophe. Because to make it to the small Greek village in time for their daughter''s wedding, this divorced couple, whose mutual hatred knows no bounds, will be obliged to set out on the road together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zszXmplKgcZ6WILGxZ1Jax8Ck72.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219318'),
  ('1119876822333601266', 'The Volcano: Rescue from Whakaari', 2022, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Rory Kennedy', 'Dallas Brennan, Mark Bailey', null, 'PG-13', 'A close examination of the Whakaari / White Island volcanic eruption of 2019 in which 22 lives were lost, the film viscerally recounts a day when ordinary people were called upon to do extraordinary things, placing this tragic event within the larger context of nature, resilience, and the power of our shared humanity.', 'A close examination of the Whakaari / White Island volcanic eruption of 2019 in which 22 lives were lost, the film viscerally recounts a day when ordinary people were called upon to do extraordinary things, placing this tragic event within the larger context of nature, resilience, and the power of our shared humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LQUp64Ub9JfnLVuzyhEHdc7DBg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018645'),
  ('765917731690475644', 'The Volunteer Worker', 1940, 'Animation', 'Riley Thomson, Ray DeVally', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'A trailer created for the Community Chest features Donald as a charity collector having a hard time.', 'A trailer created for the Community Chest features Donald as a charity collector having a hard time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlwUU3BTkbRHGyTich62eRNzm6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151417'),
  ('1152369978626237975', 'The Volunteers: The Battle of Life and Death', 2024, 'Drama, War, History', 'Chen Kaige, Zhao Fei, Chu Wenming', 'Zhang Ke, Chen Kaige', 'Zhu Yilong, Xin Baiqing, Zhang Zifeng, Zhu Yawen, Arthur Chen, Wang Yanhui, Xiao Yang, Wu Jing', null, 'The movie focuses on the battle of Cheolwon, where the 63rd Army of the Chinese People''s Volunteer Army (CPVA) was ordered to enter the battlefield of Cheolwon in May 1951, just after a month-long battle, to fight against four divisions of the United Nations Army (UNA). The volunteers fought with bloodshed and finally brought the enemy to the negotiation table.', 'The movie focuses on the battle of Cheolwon, where the 63rd Army of the Chinese People''s Volunteer Army (CPVA) was ordered to enter the battlefield of Cheolwon in May 1951, just after a month-long battle, to fight against four divisions of the United Nations Army (UNA). The volunteers fought with bloodshed and finally brought the enemy to the negotiation table.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6iSPGkpEHwcztNmNIMr21M6inK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1298727'),
  ('753319768527673639', 'The Volunteers: To the War', 2023, 'Drama, War, History', 'Chen Kaige, Zhao Fei, Zhou Guanzhao', 'Zhang Ke', 'Tang Guoqiang, Wang Yanhui, Liu Jin, Xin Baiqing, Zhang Songwen, Huang Xiaoming, Zhang Ziyi, Zhu Yawen', null, 'In the early days of the founding of the People''s Republic of China in 1949, New China was faced with "internal and external troubles". Since the outbreak of the Korean Civil War, the U.S. military has repeatedly provoked the border between China and North Korea, and civilians have been brutally bombed. In order to maintain the hard-won peace and long-term stability for generations, in October 1950, the Chinese People''s Volunteers entered North Korea, and the "Resist US Aid Korea" war kicked off.', 'In the early days of the founding of the People''s Republic of China in 1949, New China was faced with "internal and external troubles". Since the outbreak of the Korean Civil War, the U.S. military has repeatedly provoked the border between China and North Korea, and civilians have been brutally bombed. In order to maintain the hard-won peace and long-term stability for generations, in October 1950, the Chinese People''s Volunteers entered North Korea, and the "Resist US Aid Korea" war kicked off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pR7DL8qVbebsE4aBdoEbCRv4JjF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1076500'),
  ('596833961402801227', 'The von Trapp Family: A Life of Music', 2015, 'Drama, Music', 'Ben Verbong, Jan Fehse', 'Chris Silber, Tim Sullivan', 'Matthew Macfadyen, Eliza Bennett, Rosemary Harris, Cosima Shaw, Yvonne Catterfeld, Lauryn Canny, Robert Seeliger, Brigitte Kren', null, 'Agathe von Trapp, the eldest daughter of a well-known musical family, overcomes many obstacles to pursue her musical career and move to the United States.', 'Agathe von Trapp, the eldest daughter of a well-known musical family, overcomes many obstacles to pursue her musical career and move to the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62Zm67du0RNALUmBFkSjAAWnEof.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367416'),
  ('901416456630970466', 'The Vourdalak', 2023, 'Fantasy, Horror, Drama', 'Adrien Beau, Soone Hoang, David Chizallet', 'Adrien Beau, Hadrien Bouvier', 'Ariane Labed, Kacey Mottet Klein, Grégoire Colin, Vassili Schneider, Claire Duburcq, Gabriel Pavie, Erwan Ribard, Adrien Beau', null, 'The Marquis d’Urfé finds refuge in the home of a strange family after becoming lost in a hostile forest while working as an emissary for the King of France.', 'The Marquis d’Urfé finds refuge in the home of a strange family after becoming lost in a hostile forest while working as an emissary for the King of France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNyfKJUgabNcKSOw7C7hag4ANiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1047223'),
  ('709220849876739028', 'The Vow', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Sucsy, Rogier Stoffers', 'Marc Silverstein, Abby Kohn, Jason Katims', 'Rachel McAdams, Channing Tatum, Sam Neill, Scott Speedman, Jessica Lange, Tatiana Maslany, Lucas Bryant, Kristina Pesic', 'PG-13', 'Happy young married couple Paige and Leo are, well, happy. Then a car accident puts Paige into a life-threatening coma. Upon awakening she has lost the previous five years of memories, including those of her beloved Leo, her wedding, a confusing relationship with her parents, or the ending of her relationship with her ex-fiance. Despite these complications, Leo endeavors to win her heart again and rebuild their marriage.', 'Happy young married couple Paige and Leo are, well, happy. Then a car accident puts Paige into a life-threatening coma. Upon awakening she has lost the previous five years of memories, including those of her beloved Leo, her wedding, a confusing relationship with her parents, or the ending of her relationship with her ex-fiance. Despite these complications, Leo endeavors to win her heart again and rebuild their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5GUXzTvt7kSQbdQrSvbYNoa8HB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72570'),
  ('545372621493035773', 'The Voyage', 1974, 'Drama, Romance', 'Vittorio De Sica, Ennio Guarnieri, Umberto Castagna', 'Luisa Montagnana, Massimo Franciosa, Diego Fabbri', 'Sophia Loren, Richard Burton, Ian Bannen, Barbara Pilavin, Renato Pinciroli, Daniele Vargas, Sergio Bruni, Ettore Geri', 'PG', 'The charming Adriana gets sick after her husband''s death. Her brother-in-law takes her on a journey to meet a doctor, while love overwhelms them.', 'The charming Adriana gets sick after her husband''s death. Her brother-in-law takes her on a journey to meet a doctor, while love overwhelms them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2ixG4bdqf8PahVB0vVr3yqH8I0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115487'),
  ('828460271668441884', 'The Voyage of Captain Fracassa', 1990, 'History, Comedy, Adventure', 'Luciano Tovoli, Ettore Scola, Francesco Bonelli', 'Ettore Scola, Furio Scarpelli', 'Massimo Troisi, Ornella Muti, Vincent Perez, Emmanuelle Béart, Jean-François Perrier, Ciccio Ingrassia, Toni Ucci, Remo Girone', null, 'Serafina, Pulcinella and Isabella are three lusty, beautiful members of a traveling theatrical troupe touring the French countryside in the 17th century, leaving in their wake a crop of broken hearts. This picaresque romantic comedy is based on the 1863 novel Le Capitaine Fracasse by Theophile Gauthier. In the story, the company stops at a castle owned by the scruffy young Baron de Sigognac, who is deeply smitten with the charms of the middle-aged (and somewhat morose) beauty Serafina. He decides to travel with the company, and Serafina perversely tries to get him to woo the youngest of the company, the newly bereaved Isabella.', 'Serafina, Pulcinella and Isabella are three lusty, beautiful members of a traveling theatrical troupe touring the French countryside in the 17th century, leaving in their wake a crop of broken hearts. This picaresque romantic comedy is based on the 1863 novel Le Capitaine Fracasse by Theophile Gauthier. In the story, the company stops at a castle owned by the scruffy young Baron de Sigognac, who is deeply smitten with the charms of the middle-aged (and somewhat morose) beauty Serafina. He decides to travel with the company, and Serafina perversely tries to get him to woo the youngest of the company, the newly bereaved Isabella.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ooQ3Oyw0uQhZmmkPiXMu1MYxSy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63057'),
  ('274593288549542403', 'The Voyagers', 2022, 'Fantasy, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Ludovico Di Martino, Marco Bassano', 'Ludovico Di Martino, Gabriele Scarfone', 'Matteo Schiavone, Fabio Bizzarro, Andrea Gaia Wlderk, Francesca Alice Antonini, Fabrizio Gifuni, Vanessa Scalera, Gianmarco Saurino, Federico Tocci', null, 'Time jump to 1939 with teenager Max and his friends as they try to navigate Mussolini''s Rome and find Max''s missing brother.', 'Time jump to 1939 with teenager Max and his friends as they try to navigate Mussolini''s Rome and find Max''s missing brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38N7GRJLu7IWyEdil96YobJ5LWM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:885303'),
  ('830925805699163276', 'The Vulture', 1982, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Elemér Ragályi, Ferenc András', 'Ferenc András', 'György Cserhalmi, Hédi Temessy, Zita Perczel, Ferenc Bács, Maria Gładkowska, Péter Blaskó, Marianna Moór, Pap Vera', null, 'Two old women who happen to be pickpockets stole money from Simon, the taxi driver. The police are unable to find the thieves, so Simon decides to find them himself.', 'Two old women who happen to be pickpockets stole money from Simon, the taxi driver. The police are unable to find the thieves, so Simon decides to find them himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIhVUSqd5m9fZEfIfrd4KBnHdVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96411'),
  ('1145547193007217075', 'The Vultures', 1984, 'War, Comedy', 'Henri Verneuil, Edmond Séchan', 'Michel Audiard, Pierre Siniac, Henri Verneuil', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Michel Constantin, Jacques Villeret, Michel Creton, Marie Laforêt, François Perrot, Gérard Buhr, Matthias Habich', null, 'April 5, 1943: a battalion of the Foreign Legion arrives in El Ksour, Tunisia, to escort a fortune in gold bars to the home front. A German ambush awaits, and all but four die. Thanks to the street smarts of Sergeant Augagneur, the Legionnaires successfully counter attack. The bank manager and his seductive wife arrive, and so does a German lieutenant, whom the French arrest. Augagneur wants to steal the gold; warrant officer Mahuzard wants to do his duty. A series of alliances form and break apart, the group dwindles in number, and the gold heads south toward Betahoua. But in whose possession?', 'April 5, 1943: a battalion of the Foreign Legion arrives in El Ksour, Tunisia, to escort a fortune in gold bars to the home front. A German ambush awaits, and all but four die. Thanks to the street smarts of Sergeant Augagneur, the Legionnaires successfully counter attack. The bank manager and his seductive wife arrive, and so does a German lieutenant, whom the French arrest. Augagneur wants to steal the gold; warrant officer Mahuzard wants to do his duty. A series of alliances form and break apart, the group dwindles in number, and the gold heads south toward Betahoua. But in whose possession?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3C4gZ9uZdsJzWUJYcMXlRQZ8WT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72664'),
  ('678812366727232210', 'The Vyborg Side', 1939, 'Drama', 'Andrey Moskvin, Grigori Kozintsev, Leonid Trauberg', 'Grigori Kozintsev, Leonid Trauberg', 'Boris Chirkov, Valentina Kibardina, Mikhail Zharov, Nataliia Uzhvii, Yuriy Tolubeev, Aleksandr Chistyakov, Anatoliy Kuznetsov, Dmitriy Dudnikov', null, 'The final part of trilogy about the life of a young factory worker, Maxim. Following the Russian Revolution, Maksim is appointed state commissar in charge of the national bank. With great efforts, he learns the complexies of the banking trade and begins to fight off sabotaging underlings. Dymba, now a violent enemy of the Republic, tries to rob a wine store but is arrested with Maksim''s help. Maksim also exposes a conspiracy of a group of tsarist officers who prepare an attempt against Lenin. He then joins the Red Army in its fight against the German occupation.', 'The final part of trilogy about the life of a young factory worker, Maxim. Following the Russian Revolution, Maksim is appointed state commissar in charge of the national bank. With great efforts, he learns the complexies of the banking trade and begins to fight off sabotaging underlings. Dymba, now a violent enemy of the Republic, tries to rob a wine store but is arrested with Maksim''s help. Maksim also exposes a conspiracy of a group of tsarist officers who prepare an attempt against Lenin. He then joins the Red Army in its fight against the German occupation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abaWgUwtBNQQCvbjvID8edX0Iol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262747'),
  ('438428032175894488', 'The Wabbit Who Came to Supper', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'Bugs Bunny exploits the situation when an uncle leaves Elmer Fudd three million dollars on the condition that he harm no animals, especially rabbits.', 'Bugs Bunny exploits the situation when an uncle leaves Elmer Fudd three million dollars on the condition that he harm no animals, especially rabbits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aT0a5TxwPwwirKkTBRprGzRvZH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100383'),
  ('215300510254273949', 'The Wackiest Ship in the Army', 1960, 'Comedy, War', 'Richard Murphy, Charles Lawton Jr., Sam Nelson', 'Richard Murphy', 'Jack Lemmon, Ricky Nelson, John Lund, Chips Rafferty, Tom Tully, Joby Baker, Warren Berlinger, Patricia Driscoll', 'NR', 'Lieutenant Rip Crandall is hoodwinked into taking command of the "Wackiest Ship in the Navy" – a real garbage scow with a crew of misfits who don''t know a jib from a jigger. What none of them knows, including Crandall, is that this ship has a very important top-secret mission to complete in waters patrolled by the Japanese fleet. Their mission will save hundreds of allied lives – if only they can get there in one piece.', 'Lieutenant Rip Crandall is hoodwinked into taking command of the "Wackiest Ship in the Navy" – a real garbage scow with a crew of misfits who don''t know a jib from a jigger. What none of them knows, including Crandall, is that this ship has a very important top-secret mission to complete in waters patrolled by the Japanese fleet. Their mission will save hundreds of allied lives – if only they can get there in one piece.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m20XB2JRygYywjwdGAoi5OFjtX9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43752'),
  ('54067811806552349', 'The Wackness', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jonathan Levine, Petra Korner', 'Jonathan Levine', 'Josh Peck, Ben Kingsley, Famke Janssen, Olivia Thirlby, Mary-Kate Olsen, Jane Adams, Method Man, Aaron Yoo', 'R', 'Set in New York City in the sweltering summer, The Wackness tells the story of a troubled teenage drug dealer, who trades pot for therapy sessions with a drug-addled psychiatrist. Things get more complicated when he falls for one of his classmates, who just happens to be the doctor''s daughter. This is a coming-of-age story about sex, drugs, music and what it takes to be a man.', 'Set in New York City in the sweltering summer, The Wackness tells the story of a troubled teenage drug dealer, who trades pot for therapy sessions with a drug-addled psychiatrist. Things get more complicated when he falls for one of his classmates, who just happens to be the doctor''s daughter. This is a coming-of-age story about sex, drugs, music and what it takes to be a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmtlqHZs8YBXcpMw4BgA3SGJfg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13990'),
  ('1150355699592337955', 'The Wacky Adventures of Ronald McDonald: Scared Silly', 1998, 'Animation', 'John Holmquist, John Holmquist', 'Eryk Casemiro, Michael Bloom, Vanessa Kaufman', 'Kevin Michael Richardson, Alex D. Linz, Kath Soucie, Christine Cavanaugh, Dee Bradley Baker, Pamela Adlon, Charlie Adler, David Hussey', 'NR', 'Ronald and his friends going on a camping trip in the Far-Flung Forest where Ronald discovers an old house which he assumes is haunted by a ghost called the Far-Flung Phantom. The campers are forced to stay in the old house due to the stormy weather where a holographic head named Franklin leads them through a challenging game which will eventually help them to escape.', 'Ronald and his friends going on a camping trip in the Far-Flung Forest where Ronald discovers an old house which he assumes is haunted by a ghost called the Far-Flung Phantom. The campers are forced to stay in the old house due to the stormy weather where a holographic head named Franklin leads them through a challenging game which will eventually help them to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUTnOv9iXxgPexpZAPWjRts4wwW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433387'),
  ('40182207651163591', 'The Wacky Adventures of Ronald McDonald: The Visitors from Outer Space', 1999, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Jeffrey Scott-Smith', 'David Regal', 'Joe Maggard, Charlie Adler, Pamela Adlon, Carol Kane, Jim Cummings, Dee Bradley Baker, Gregg Berger, Christine Cavanaugh', null, 'A family of aliens kidnaps the Hamburglar, and it''s up to Ronald and the gang to save him!', 'A family of aliens kidnaps the Hamburglar, and it''s up to Ronald and the gang to save him!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wriwSdrFdAJLgpLHEERj5RdFKzm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154708'),
  ('1002484057975790006', 'The Wacky Wabbit', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett, Treg Brown', null, 'Arthur Q. Bryan, Mel Blanc', 'G', 'While seeking gold in the desert, prospector Elmer Fudd stumbles across mischievous Bugs Bunny.', 'While seeking gold in the desert, prospector Elmer Fudd stumbles across mischievous Bugs Bunny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1w7B1XdEZUurZRM61StOcYWUsk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53998'),
  ('1022552124752307456', 'The Wages of Fear', 2024, 'Action', 'Gilles De Saint-Aubert, Cheyenne Corre, Denis Mauguit', 'Julien Leclercq, Hamid Hlioua', 'Franck Gastambide, Alban Lenoir, Ana Girardot, Sofiane Zermani, Astrid Whettnall, Bakary Diombera, Alka Matewa, Rabie Kati', 'R', 'When an explosion at an oil well threatens hundreds of lives, a crack team is called upon to make a deadly desert crossing with nitroglycerine in tow.', 'When an explosion at an oil well threatens hundreds of lives, a crack team is called upon to make a deadly desert crossing with nitroglycerine in tow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFK2ZLQUzo9pea0jfMCHDfvWsx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:984324'),
  ('722042417490904251', 'The Wagoner', 1963, 'Drama', 'Ousmane Sembène, Christian Lacoste', 'Ousmane Sembène', 'Ly Abdoulay, Albourah', null, 'A cart-taxi driver goes to the city to make a living, but out of sympathy with other poverty-stricken people, he works for free and goes hungry himself.', 'A cart-taxi driver goes to the city to make a living, but out of sympathy with other poverty-stricken people, he works for free and goes hungry himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZv1eXYJAfys02TtdilGRRtMS7X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69909'),
  ('547633892026076905', 'The Wagons Roll at Night', 1941, 'Drama, Romance', 'Everett Alton Brown, Sidney Hickox, Ray Enright', 'Fred Niblo Jr., Barry Trivers', 'Humphrey Bogart, Sylvia Sidney, Eddie Albert, Joan Leslie, Sig Ruman, Cliff Clark, Charley Foy, Frank Wilcox', null, 'An escaped circus lion provides the impetus for the meeting of carnival owner Nick Coster and Matt Varney, a small-town man who suddenly becomes a lion tamer when he manages to subdue the big cat. While acclimating to carnival life, Matt begins a romance with Nick''s sister, Mary, causing tension between Matt and Nick. The latter must also juggle his stormy relationship with glamorous circus star Flo Lorraine.', 'An escaped circus lion provides the impetus for the meeting of carnival owner Nick Coster and Matt Varney, a small-town man who suddenly becomes a lion tamer when he manages to subdue the big cat. While acclimating to carnival life, Matt begins a romance with Nick''s sister, Mary, causing tension between Matt and Nick. The latter must also juggle his stormy relationship with glamorous circus star Flo Lorraine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIbnArx55PvUNz9zu6jYVTf7bpH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94565'),
  ('1140502648187985944', 'The Wailer', 2006, 'Horror', 'Andrés Navia', 'Rafy Rivera', 'Vanessa Rice, John Patrick Jordan, Brenda Mejia, Eltony Williams, Nicole Danielle, Hugo Medina', 'NR', 'On their way to Mexico, six students are stranded in a small town where years before a tragedy took place.', 'On their way to Mexico, six students are stranded in a small town where years before a tragedy took place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dY6Z17E0cSia5cLLNPfk1uMXZqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116946'),
  ('410049438441603429', 'The Wailer 2', 2007, 'Horror', 'Paul C. Miller', 'Rafy Rivera', 'Seth Michaels, Roger Cudney, Nadia van de Ven, Dulce Alvarado, Pepe Romay, Antonio Manuel del Asco, Alfredo Solares, Jose Sosa', null, 'After Professor McBride learns that the body of his daughter Julie was never found, he takes it upon himself to go on a quest to discover the truth about his daughter''s disappearance. With the help of Chava, a young Mexican anthropologist and a cult of old witch ladies, he embarks on a mission to exorcise the body of Julie from the evil soul of La Llorona.', 'After Professor McBride learns that the body of his daughter Julie was never found, he takes it upon himself to go on a quest to discover the truth about his daughter''s disappearance. With the help of Chava, a young Mexican anthropologist and a cult of old witch ladies, he embarks on a mission to exorcise the body of Julie from the evil soul of La Llorona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NW3nfpKWYLREe8gjcYPMZRTSB3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105877'),
  ('854746792704066251', 'The Wailing', 2016, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Choi Cha-won, Hong Kyung-pyo, Na Hong-jin', 'Na Hong-jin', 'Kwak Do-won, Hwang Jung-min, Chun Woo-hee, Jun Kunimura, Kim Hwan-hee, Heo Jin, Jang So-yeon, Kim Do-yoon', 'NR', 'A stranger arrives in a little village and soon after a mysterious sickness starts spreading. A policeman is drawn into the incident and is forced to solve the mystery in order to save his daughter.', 'A stranger arrives in a little village and soon after a mysterious sickness starts spreading. A policeman is drawn into the incident and is forced to solve the mystery in order to save his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXlL7yYwpXInhltamtzKQFBG08G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293670'),
  ('259068156915031561', 'The Wailing', 2024, 'Horror', 'Pedro Martín Calero, Constanza Sandoval, Carlos Antolín Esteve', 'Pedro Martín Calero, Isabel Peña', 'Ester Expósito, Mathilde Ollivier, Malena Villa, José Luis Ferrer, Claudia Roset, Lía Lois, Sonia Almarcha, Tomás del Estal', null, 'Andrea, in search of her biological family, feels stalked by an invisible threat. Other women before them have suffered the same fate. Twenty years earlier, on the other side of the world, Camille, fascinated by Marie, tries to warn her of a threat hanging over her.', 'Andrea, in search of her biological family, feels stalked by an invisible threat. Other women before them have suffered the same fate. Twenty years earlier, on the other side of the world, Camille, fascinated by Marie, tries to warn her of a threat hanging over her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wB5fVj1Se9TFt9q1CHAtoPiuMyZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1299372'),
  ('1100043241591166464', 'The Wailing of the Maghrib', 2023, 'Horror', 'Sidharta Tata, Ujel Bausad, Widhi Susila Utama', 'Khalid Kashogi, Sidharta Tata, Agasyah Karim', 'Ali Fikry, Nafiza Fatia Rani, Bima Sena, Aulia Sarah, Taskya Namya, Andri Mashadi, Kevin Abani, Muhammad Abe Baasyin', null, 'A terror chases the souls of Adi and Saman. Ayu knows the reason as to why they are tormented - a sin committed at the most dangerous time of Maghrib Time. What sin have they committed and what will happen to Adi, Saman, Ayu and their village?', 'A terror chases the souls of Adi and Saman. Ayu knows the reason as to why they are tormented - a sin committed at the most dangerous time of Maghrib Time. What sin have they committed and what will happen to Adi, Saman, Ayu and their village?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLkviJkau1cRMCoAa06R1gkH2Hn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064312'),
  ('1124323449905617912', 'The Wait', 2015, 'Drama', 'Piero Messina, Francesco Di Giacomo', 'Giacomo Bendotti, Ilaria Macchia, Andrea Paolo Massara', 'Juliette Binoche, Lou de Laâge, Giorgio Colangeli, Antonio Folletto, Domenico Diele, Corinna Locastro', 'NR', 'In the vast rooms of a beautiful Sicilian villa, Anna receives an unexpected guest. Twenty-something Jeanne has arrived from France, declaring herself to be the girlfriend of Anna’s son, Giuseppe, who has invited her to the house to spend Easter together. But this is news to Anna, and Guiseppe is not yet there...', 'In the vast rooms of a beautiful Sicilian villa, Anna receives an unexpected guest. Twenty-something Jeanne has arrived from France, declaring herself to be the girlfriend of Anna’s son, Giuseppe, who has invited her to the house to spend Easter together. But this is news to Anna, and Guiseppe is not yet there...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxWlMDP1vmr85VWiLPTTLL43fTx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330348'),
  ('747539619780588291', 'The Wait', 2020, 'Comedy, Music', 'Nolt Vutthisak, Ronapee Pensri', 'Nolt Vutthisak', 'Kritthee Visitkitjakarn', 'NR', '"The Wait" tells the story of a lonely drummer during the self-distancing period in 2020, who has grown frustrated with the absence of his band. Killing time, the self-taught drummer must do something by his own imagination.', '"The Wait" tells the story of a lonely drummer during the self-distancing period in 2020, who has grown frustrated with the absence of his band. Killing time, the self-taught drummer must do something by his own imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAHtwxhYAprWiSChGH3wWMNcAi2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835298'),
  ('776037494728069203', 'The Wait', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Aku Louhimies, Johan Wasicki', 'Aku Louhimies, Inka Kallén', 'Inka Kallén, Aku Hirviniemi, Andrei Alén, Adeliina Arajuuri, Eino Heiskanen, Mats Sundqvist, Juulia Häyrinen, Petro Pasi', null, 'The idyllic and secluded Finnish archipelago. The pandemic soars across the world. Elli’s world trembles as her husband’s old friend arrives at the island.', 'The idyllic and secluded Finnish archipelago. The pandemic soars across the world. Elli’s world trembles as her husband’s old friend arrives at the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5qhyVvLkK5e0B5XTvThrSzNyJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716814'),
  ('394050040846137278', 'The Wait', 2023, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'F. Javier Gutiérrez, Miguel Ángel Mora, Fany Mije', 'F. Javier Gutiérrez', 'Víctor Clavijo, Ruth Díaz, Moisés Ruiz, Pedro Casablanc, Manuel Morón, Antonio Estrada, Nico Montoya, Luis Callejo', null, 'Eladio, hunting estate keeper, takes a bribe from a veteran hunter. Weeks later, his whole life falls apart. What looked like the opportunity of a lifetime, turns into a macabre descent to hell when he finds out that his misfortune might not be entirely by chance.', 'Eladio, hunting estate keeper, takes a bribe from a veteran hunter. Weeks later, his whole life falls apart. What looked like the opportunity of a lifetime, turns into a macabre descent to hell when he finds out that his misfortune might not be entirely by chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPcqiq0SQwsWYoRSbGDgtSN1gxD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053993'),
  ('16528478589229147', 'The Waiter''s Dream', 1910, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Émile Cohl', null, null, null, 'Four customers are having a peaceful game of cards in a quiet café. The atmosphere being heavy, the waiter falls asleep and has an unsettling dream about the ills of alcohol, among other things.', 'Four customers are having a peaceful game of cards in a quiet café. The atmosphere being heavy, the waiter falls asleep and has an unsettling dream about the ills of alcohol, among other things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZCciegDx0rsAajxZOu35ruKmCd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189587'),
  ('878295026159134033', 'The Waiting List', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Juan Carlos Tabío, Hans Burmann', 'Senel Paz, Juan Carlos Tabío', 'Vladimir Cruz, Jorge Perugorría, Tahimí Alvariño, Noel García, Alina Rodríguez, Antonio Valero, Mijail Mulkay, Jorge Alí Pérez', null, 'At a rundown bus station in rural Cuba, the line of passengers waiting just keeps getting longer. The problem is that every bus that passes by is already full. Their only hope is to wait for the station''s bus to be fixed. As the disparate group settles in, relationships start forming between the passengers: Emilio, a young engineer, becomes smitten with a beautiful young woman who is en route to meet her Spanish fiancé, a blind man gets support from the others to go to the head of the line. Frustration and disorder reign when the one bus brakes down and no one can leave. Resigned to working together, the group magically transforms the station into a beautiful place where no one wants to leave.', 'At a rundown bus station in rural Cuba, the line of passengers waiting just keeps getting longer. The problem is that every bus that passes by is already full. Their only hope is to wait for the station''s bus to be fixed. As the disparate group settles in, relationships start forming between the passengers: Emilio, a young engineer, becomes smitten with a beautiful young woman who is en route to meet her Spanish fiancé, a blind man gets support from the others to go to the head of the line. Frustration and disorder reign when the one bus brakes down and no one can leave. Resigned to working together, the group magically transforms the station into a beautiful place where no one wants to leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXBnl9AKK95P1IC2P4YZfK3rjo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43776'),
  ('999098215801604714', 'The Waiting Room', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Goert Giltay, Jos Stelling', 'Jos Stelling', 'Gene Bervoets, Bianca Koedam, Annet Malherbe', null, 'A large train station, it might be anywhere in a big city. Waiting passengers, some are curiously observing each other, some are too much involved with their own petty problems to pay attention to anything else. Our man, self- assured, practically undresses some of the woman present with his eyes, at least as long as his wife is absent, trying to get them some coffee. A beauty in blue returns his challenging looks, he can hardly believe it''s true. Obviously, it is his lucky day today. By the time his wife returns our man has experienced some astonishing things under the watchful eyes of the fellow passengers. And most probably he will be much more reserved next time he sees a beautiful blonde.', 'A large train station, it might be anywhere in a big city. Waiting passengers, some are curiously observing each other, some are too much involved with their own petty problems to pay attention to anything else. Our man, self- assured, practically undresses some of the woman present with his eyes, at least as long as his wife is absent, trying to get them some coffee. A beauty in blue returns his challenging looks, he can hardly believe it''s true. Obviously, it is his lucky day today. By the time his wife returns our man has experienced some astonishing things under the watchful eyes of the fellow passengers. And most probably he will be much more reserved next time he sees a beautiful blonde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erkWD3jjpMhJiMQfM7kmcndJKwo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296779'),
  ('1140901688719864536', 'The Waiting Room', 2004, 'Drama', 'Zeki Demirkubuz, Zeki Demirkubuz, Filiz Peksen', 'Zeki Demirkubuz', 'Zeki Demirkubuz, Nilüfer Açıkalın, Nurhayat Kavrak Demirkubuz, Serdar Orçin, Ufuk Bayraktar, Eda Toksöz, Nuri Bilge Ceylan', null, 'Ahmet, a filmmaker on Dostoyevsky''s ''Crime and Punishment'', sinks into depression, alienates loved ones, and abandons his film.', 'Ahmet, a filmmaker on Dostoyevsky''s ''Crime and Punishment'', sinks into depression, alienates loved ones, and abandons his film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4OFHY4RfvGabSoVqB44HDRL9ly.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52188'),
  ('1106800275296956542', 'The Wakhan Front', 2015, 'Drama, Fantasy, War', 'Clément Cogitore, Sylvain Verdet', 'Clément Cogitore, Thomas Bidegain', 'Jérémie Renier, Swann Arlaud, Kévin Azaïs, Marc Robert, Finnegan Oldfield, Christophe Tek, Clément Bresson, Sâm Mirhosseini', null, 'Afghanistan, 2014. As the withdrawal of troops approaches, Captain Antarès Bonassieu and his squad have been assigned a surveillance mission in a remote valley of Wakhan, on the border of Pakistan. Despite Antarès and his men’s determination, control of the secluded valley will slowly fall out of their hands. One dark night, soldiers begin to mysteriously disappear in the valley.', 'Afghanistan, 2014. As the withdrawal of troops approaches, Captain Antarès Bonassieu and his squad have been assigned a surveillance mission in a remote valley of Wakhan, on the border of Pakistan. Despite Antarès and his men’s determination, control of the secluded valley will slowly fall out of their hands. One dark night, soldiers begin to mysteriously disappear in the valley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehewOFIcDyG6Fm3B7SG3bXHENuz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336663'),
  ('875375791367855695', 'The Waldheim Waltz', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Ruth Beckermann', 'Ruth Beckermann', 'Kurt Waldheim', null, 'Ruth Beckermann documents the process of uncovering former UN Secretary General Kurt Waldheim’s wartime past. It shows the swift succession of new allegations by the World Jewish Congress during his Austrian presidential campaign, the denial by the Austrian political class, the outbreak of anti-Semitism and patriotism, which finally led to his election.', 'Ruth Beckermann documents the process of uncovering former UN Secretary General Kurt Waldheim’s wartime past. It shows the swift succession of new allegations by the World Jewish Congress during his Austrian presidential campaign, the denial by the Austrian political class, the outbreak of anti-Semitism and patriotism, which finally led to his election.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1evd0xDPQJ7mGVrsiICCKKtDaox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499673'),
  ('553702903491582390', 'The Walk', 2015, 'History, Drama, Adventure', 'Robert Zemeckis, Dariusz Wolski, Mathieu Giguère', 'Robert Zemeckis, Christopher Browne', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Ben Kingsley, Charlotte Le Bon, James Badge Dale, Clément Sibony, César Domboy, Benedict Samuel, Ben Schwartz', 'PG', 'The story of French high-wire artist Philippe Petit''s attempt to cross the Twin Towers of the World Trade Center in 1974.', 'The story of French high-wire artist Philippe Petit''s attempt to cross the Twin Towers of the World Trade Center in 1974.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSoPmBq0kaU9jwZNbpEVwua8J3s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285783'),
  ('556498973127481023', 'The Walker', 2007, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Paul Schrader, Chris Seager', 'Paul Schrader', 'Woody Harrelson, Kristin Scott Thomas, Lauren Bacall, Ned Beatty, Moritz Bleibtreu, Lily Tomlin, Willem Dafoe, Mary Beth Hurt', 'R', 'Carter Page III, a middle-aged gay man in Washington, D. C., is a "walker", a single man who escorts other men''s wives to social events so the husbands do not have to. One of the women he escorts, Lynn Lockner, is the wife of a United States senator and is carrying on an affair with a lobbyist. When she finds the lobbyist murdered, she embroils Carter in an investigation that leads to the highest levels of the federal government.', 'Carter Page III, a middle-aged gay man in Washington, D. C., is a "walker", a single man who escorts other men''s wives to social events so the husbands do not have to. One of the women he escorts, Lynn Lockner, is the wife of a United States senator and is carrying on an affair with a lobbyist. When she finds the lobbyist murdered, she embroils Carter in an investigation that leads to the highest levels of the federal government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPt75oLdldVWjeq6Omnn1Es4EuF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13251'),
  ('283726833521422840', 'The Walking Dead', 1936, 'Crime, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Hal Mohr, Michael Curtiz, Russell Saunders', 'Ewart Adamson, Lillie Hayward, Peter Milne', 'Boris Karloff, Ricardo Cortez, Edmund Gwenn, Marguerite Churchill, Warren Hull, Barton MacLane, Henry O''Neill, Joe King', null, 'Down-on-his-luck John Ellman is framed for a judge''s murder. After he''s convicted and sentenced to death, witnesses come forth and prove his innocence. But it was too late for a stay to be granted and Ellman is executed. A doctor uses an experimental procedure to restore him to life, though the full outcome is other than expected.', 'Down-on-his-luck John Ellman is framed for a judge''s murder. After he''s convicted and sentenced to death, witnesses come forth and prove his innocence. But it was too late for a stay to be granted and Ellman is executed. A doctor uses an experimental procedure to restore him to life, though the full outcome is other than expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRZ0NNqaQewNuN6yvw2HXowFCiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27115'),
  ('456919805148429123', 'The Walking Dead', 1995, 'Drama, War', 'Preston A. Whitmore II, Charlie Picerni, John L. Demps Jr.', 'Preston A. Whitmore II', 'Allen Payne, Eddie Griffin, Joe Morton, Vonte Sweet, Roger Floyd, Ion Overman', 'R', 'Five young marines on a suicide mission in Vietnam, struggle for survival in a jungle minefield. The mean streets of home did not prepare them for this.', 'Five young marines on a suicide mission in Vietnam, struggle for survival in a jungle minefield. The mean streets of home did not prepare them for this.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0RtcIN4oSzSZoNs0nJMevfGYS4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95963'),
  ('983631275055777492', 'The Walking Dead: The Return', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Jes Thorud, Jacob Harlow, Bob Stivers', null, 'Andrew Lincoln, Danai Gurira, Norman Reedus, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Chandler Riggs, Steven Yeun, Lauren Cohan, David Morrissey', 'R', 'Stars of "The Walking Dead," Andrew Lincoln and Danai Gurira, walk down memory lane and visit iconic locations where pivotal moments between their characters, Rick and Michonne, were filmed.', 'Stars of "The Walking Dead," Andrew Lincoln and Danai Gurira, walk down memory lane and visit iconic locations where pivotal moments between their characters, Rick and Michonne, were filmed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3clopfmZ8x6s1reWC6fxgXkysZz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1246596'),
  ('618170257219336311', 'The Walking Deceased', 2015, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Scott Dow', 'Tim Ogletree', 'Tim Ogletree, Joey Oglesby, Dave Sheridan, Troy Ogletree, Sophia Ali, Danielle Garcia, Mason Dakota Galyon, Jacqui Holland', 'R', 'A group of survivors from all walks of the apocalypse – an idiotic Sheriff with definite coma-induced brain damage, his hardass son and a hobo with only a crossbow to stave off the walking dead, four squabbling friends forced to survive this zombieland together, and a lonely zombie who just needs love to fully regain his warm body – leave their once-safe mall hideout in search of the rumored Safe Haven Ranch, a refuge untouched by the zombie virus that has ravaged humanity.', 'A group of survivors from all walks of the apocalypse – an idiotic Sheriff with definite coma-induced brain damage, his hardass son and a hobo with only a crossbow to stave off the walking dead, four squabbling friends forced to survive this zombieland together, and a lonely zombie who just needs love to fully regain his warm body – leave their once-safe mall hideout in search of the rumored Safe Haven Ranch, a refuge untouched by the zombie virus that has ravaged humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ss6eqPxe9vmsYOxb3LGUs5mIXvq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312793'),
  ('293016092187537106', 'The Walking Hills', 1949, 'Western', 'John Sturges, Charles Lawton Jr., Sam Nelson', 'Alan Le May', 'Randolph Scott, Ella Raines, William Bishop, Edgar Buchanan, Arthur Kennedy, John Ireland, Jerome Courtland, Russell Collins', 'NR', 'A study in greed in which treasure hunters seek a shipment of gold buried in Death Valley.', 'A study in greed in which treasure hunters seek a shipment of gold buried in Death Valley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYWOAhLk4TyAyImgXbXQMbkDVaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241754'),
  ('50776908653459863', 'The Wall', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ante Zaninović, Zdravko Pavičić', 'Ante Zaninović', null, null, 'A wall blocks the path of two people. One man submits, while the other refuses to admit defeat.', 'A wall blocks the path of two people. One man submits, while the other refuses to admit defeat.', null, 'tmdb:movie:147719'),
  ('198799684282990829', 'The Wall', 1983, 'Drama', 'Yılmaz Güney', 'Yılmaz Güney', 'Tuncel Kurtiz, Ayşe Emel Mesçi, Malik Berrichi, Nicolas Hossein, Isabelle Tissandier, Zirek, Ali Berktay, Selahattin Kuzmoglu', null, 'Produced, written and directed by Yılmaz Güney within his own personal experiences of capital offense, he dedicates Duvar to male teenagers aged 13 to 19 living behind the bars under diabolical treatments. These teenagers get barbaric corporal punishments, injurious harrows, tortures and sexual abuses just for taking the responsibility of their destiny on a wrong turn.', 'Produced, written and directed by Yılmaz Güney within his own personal experiences of capital offense, he dedicates Duvar to male teenagers aged 13 to 19 living behind the bars under diabolical treatments. These teenagers get barbaric corporal punishments, injurious harrows, tortures and sexual abuses just for taking the responsibility of their destiny on a wrong turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jIMiyyPJkNvoT9sO7YuY8GRnqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47680'),
  ('917680367452915460', 'The Wall', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Julian Pölsler, Bernhard Keller, Helmut Pirnat', 'Julian Pölsler', 'Martina Gedeck, Ulrike Beimpold, Karlheinz Hackl, Wolfgang Maria Bauer, Julia Gschnitzer, Hans-Michael Rehberg', 'NR', 'A woman inexplicably finds herself cut off from all human contact when an invisible, unyielding wall suddenly surrounds the countryside. Accompanied by her loyal dog Lynx, she becomes immersed in a world untouched by civilization and ruled by the laws of nature.', 'A woman inexplicably finds herself cut off from all human contact when an invisible, unyielding wall suddenly surrounds the countryside. Accompanied by her loyal dog Lynx, she becomes immersed in a world untouched by civilization and ruled by the laws of nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTx2WGltGqtnAB66zfYyAblJKeR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115442'),
  ('1128076783151263715', 'The Wall', 2017, 'War, Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Matt Haggerty, Angie Glover, Doug Liman', 'Dwain Worrell', 'Aaron Taylor-Johnson, John Cena, Laith Nakli', 'R', 'An American sniper and his spotter engage in a deadly cat-and-mouse game with an Iraqi sniper.', 'An American sniper and his spotter engage in a deadly cat-and-mouse game with an Iraqi sniper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8POAZwZpp24l1IgKKM8ZRAQ2kid.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405775'),
  ('417765299330882027', 'The Walls of Malapaga', 1949, 'Drama, Romance', 'René Clément, Louis Page', 'Alfredo Guarini, Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Jean Aurenche', 'Jean Gabin, Isa Miranda, Vera Talchi, Andrea Checchi, Robert Dalban, Ave Ninchi, Checco Rissone, Renato Malavasi', null, 'A French fugitive arrives in Genoa, where he becomes entangled with an Italian woman and her daughter.', 'A French fugitive arrives in Genoa, where he becomes entangled with an Italian woman and her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwiLJb8xzbh4JSwMxg990Rm7D3A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65718'),
  ('460589014548445923', 'The Walls of Sana''a', 1974, 'Documentary', 'Sebastiano Celeste, Pier Paolo Pasolini, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini', null, 'The capital of Yemen, the city of Sana''a, holds an important part of history within its walls filled with medieval architecture and culture. But that same culture was about to disappear with the country''s modernization which came after the civil war in the 1960''s. To impeach such modern invasion, director Pasolini pledges to UNESCO for the recognition of Sana''a as a World Heritage Site.', 'The capital of Yemen, the city of Sana''a, holds an important part of history within its walls filled with medieval architecture and culture. But that same culture was about to disappear with the country''s modernization which came after the civil war in the 1960''s. To impeach such modern invasion, director Pasolini pledges to UNESCO for the recognition of Sana''a as a World Heritage Site.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxfItVYy6QHdZriLmWhJyYhExvm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48869'),
  ('265624021105125944', 'The Wanderer', 1967, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Gabriel Albicocco, Quinto Albicocco', 'Jean-Gabriel Albicocco', 'Brigitte Fossey, Jean Blaise, Alain Noury, Alain Libolt, Juliette Villard, Christian de Tillière, Marcel Cuvelier, Thérèse Quentin', null, 'Rural France, the 1890s. Always in motion, Augustin wanders three times. First, as a youth, while a boarder near Bourges, he''s lost in the woods and finds a chateau where an engagement party''s in progress: there he falls eternally in love with Yvonne and she with him. Back at school, he hears she is in Paris, so he follows in a vain search and meets a woman, jilted by her lover. In the countryside a few year''s later, Augustin''s friend François finds Yvonne and brings Augustin to her. They marry, but the next day, Augustin leaves to fulfill a youthful promise he made to Yvonne''s brother. François comforts the pregnant Yvonne as they await Augustin''s return.', 'Rural France, the 1890s. Always in motion, Augustin wanders three times. First, as a youth, while a boarder near Bourges, he''s lost in the woods and finds a chateau where an engagement party''s in progress: there he falls eternally in love with Yvonne and she with him. Back at school, he hears she is in Paris, so he follows in a vain search and meets a woman, jilted by her lover. In the countryside a few year''s later, Augustin''s friend François finds Yvonne and brings Augustin to her. They marry, but the next day, Augustin leaves to fulfill a youthful promise he made to Yvonne''s brother. François comforts the pregnant Yvonne as they await Augustin''s return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KmfschJkjJ38O5xaeBtRpHNXiO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5035'),
  ('1093904712436529767', 'The Wanderers', 1973, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kon Ichikawa, Setsuo Kobayashi', 'Kon Ichikawa, Shuntaro Tanikawa', 'Ichirō Ogura, Isao Bitō, Kenichi Hagiwara, Reiko Inoue, Fujio Tokita, Yoshi Katō, Tadao Futami, Shō Natsuki', null, 'Follows the fluctuating fortunes of three ronin in feudal Japan who wander from castle to castle, selling their services to whichever lord will fill their rice bowls. Though they use the servants'' entrance, they still feel themselves bound by the samurai code of Bushido; and this tension leads to tragedy.', 'Follows the fluctuating fortunes of three ronin in feudal Japan who wander from castle to castle, selling their services to whichever lord will fill their rice bowls. Though they use the servants'' entrance, they still feel themselves bound by the samurai code of Bushido; and this tension leads to tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rN2O2fdMe7OjeFTPLMdLmmSvNn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107536'),
  ('296558756874436097', 'The Wanderers', 1979, 'Drama', 'Michael Chapman, Philip Kaufman, Laurie B. Eichengreen', 'Rose Kaufman, Philip Kaufman', 'Ken Wahl, John Friedrich, Karen Allen, Toni Kalem, Alan Rosenberg, Jim Youngs, Tony Ganios, Linda Manz', 'R', 'The streets of the Bronx are owned by ''60s youth gangs where the joy and pain of adolescence is lived. Philip Kaufman tells his take on the novel by Richard Price about the history of the Italian-American gang ‘The Wanderers.’', 'The streets of the Bronx are owned by ''60s youth gangs where the joy and pain of adolescence is lived. Philip Kaufman tells his take on the novel by Richard Price about the history of the Italian-American gang ‘The Wanderers.’', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8vxJHlCbmmnUX3p8bEAzXZfcIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233'),
  ('288025144865704543', 'The Wandering Earth', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama', 'Frant Gwo, Liu Yin', 'Liu Cixin', 'Wu Jing, Qu Chuxiao, Li Guangjie, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Zhao Jinmai, Michael Kai Sui, Qu Jingjing, Zhang Yichi', 'PG-13', 'When the Sun begins to expand in such a way that it will inevitably engulf and destroy the Earth in a hundred years, united mankind finds a way to avoid extinction by propelling the planet out of the Solar System using gigantic engines, moving it to a new home located four light years away, an epic journey that will last thousands of years.', 'When the Sun begins to expand in such a way that it will inevitably engulf and destroy the Earth in a hundred years, united mankind finds a way to avoid extinction by propelling the planet out of the Solar System using gigantic engines, moving it to a new home located four light years away, an epic journey that will last thousands of years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3MXFdFjrYmoxOEFgE1wuphwo2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535167'),
  ('583887843276844879', 'The Wandering Earth II', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Frant Gwo, Achille Vanderhaeghen, Liu Yin', 'Liu Cixin', 'Wu Jing, Andy Lau, Li Xuejian, Sha Yi, Ning Li, Wang Zhi, Zhu Yanmanzi, Andy Friend', 'NR', 'Humans built huge engines on the surface of the earth to find a new home. But the road to the universe is perilous. In order to save earth, young people once again have to step forward to start a race against time for life and death.', 'Humans built huge engines on the surface of the earth to find a new home. But the road to the universe is perilous. In order to save earth, young people once again have to step forward to start a race against time for life and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAZzFYS36UFT0SKhKVmEY7qShal.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842675'),
  ('133976941607479163', 'The Wandering Earth III', 2027, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Frant Gwo, Michael Liu', 'Frant Gwo, Gong Geer', 'Wu Jing, Andy Lau, Li Xuejian, Qu Chuxiao, Li Guangjie, Tong Liya, Zhao Jinmai, Sha Yi', null, 'The sun is about to be destroyed, and humans have built huge thrusters on the surface of the earth to find a new home. However, the road to the universe is full of dangers. In order to save the earth, young people from the wandering earth era stepped forward for the third time and started a life-and-death battle against time.', 'The sun is about to be destroyed, and humans have built huge thrusters on the surface of the earth to find a new home. However, the road to the universe is full of dangers. In order to save the earth, young people from the wandering earth era stepped forward for the third time and started a life-and-death battle against time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pNAki9AIaJGhNFOs8ePTFI0lDc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1231322'),
  ('379758601979039407', 'The Wandering Image', 1920, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fritz Lang, Guido Seeber', 'Thea von Harbou, Fritz Lang', 'Mia May, Hans Marr, Rudolf Klein-Rogge, Harry Frank, Loni Nest', null, 'When Irmgard becomes pregnant from Georg, a free-love disciple, she decides, for the sake of her child, to pretend they are married. The secret plan is to wed his twin brother, John, who will pretend to be Georg in front of the priest. Soon after that happens, Georg disappears and is declared dead. Years later, Irmgard is trying to escape John, who is obsessed with her. In the mountains, she finds a stranger willing to protect her.', 'When Irmgard becomes pregnant from Georg, a free-love disciple, she decides, for the sake of her child, to pretend they are married. The secret plan is to wed his twin brother, John, who will pretend to be Georg in front of the priest. Soon after that happens, Georg disappears and is declared dead. Years later, Irmgard is trying to escape John, who is obsessed with her. In the mountains, she finds a stranger willing to protect her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKihlPmSmn5HgiJqjN1T4qMGnn6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115515'),
  ('960219488041836332', 'The Wandering Jew', 1904, 'Fantasy, Drama, History', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A Jew who mocked Jesus on the cross is visited by a devil and an angel.', 'A Jew who mocked Jesus on the cross is visited by a devil and an angel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijjszxlHCCeyIl4i8GzTm0BzED4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144665'),
  ('525523720799484870', 'The Wandering Soap Opera', 2018, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Leo Kocking, Chamila Rodríguez, Rodrigo Avilés', 'Raúl Ruiz', 'Pamela Fernandez, Roberto Chignoli, Mario Lorca, Luis Alarcón, Marcela Arroyave, Maria Erica Ramos, Roberto Poblete, Luis Vera', null, 'The film revolves around the concept of soap opera. Its structure is based on the assumption that Chilean reality does not exist, but rather is an ensemble of soap operas.', 'The film revolves around the concept of soap opera. Its structure is based on the assumption that Chilean reality does not exist, but rather is an ensemble of soap operas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsVZr1hdkfnxIxJNjeOQGC97VF3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467254'),
  ('111082261804303566', 'The Wandering Swordsman', 1970, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Hua Shan', 'Ni Kuang', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Bolo Yeung, Lily Li, Chan Sing, Liu Gang, Wang Kuang-Yu, Lan Wei-Lieh, Chang Pei-Shan', null, 'In this thrilling martial arts twist on the tale of Robin Hood, a charismatic highwayman with formidable sword skills decides to help the poor by robbing from thieves and distributing the wealth. This plan doesn''t sit well with the criminals, who band together to stop him. Fortunately, our hero has a powerful blade on his side, not to mention popular beauty Lily Li at his side. A high-spirited blend of action, romance, and comedy, this Shaw Brothers classic from fearless director Chang Cheh is a timeless example of pure high-voltage entertainment.', 'In this thrilling martial arts twist on the tale of Robin Hood, a charismatic highwayman with formidable sword skills decides to help the poor by robbing from thieves and distributing the wealth. This plan doesn''t sit well with the criminals, who band together to stop him. Fortunately, our hero has a powerful blade on his side, not to mention popular beauty Lily Li at his side. A high-spirited blend of action, romance, and comedy, this Shaw Brothers classic from fearless director Chang Cheh is a timeless example of pure high-voltage entertainment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maAag6mrmxLuchagzFiOozp4ehZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54529'),
  ('1138008921252607156', 'The Wannabes', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Barré', 'David Marsais, Grégoire Ludig', 'Grégoire Ludig, David Marsais, Julien Pestel, Damien Gillard, Gaëlle Lebert, Juliette Plumecocq-Mech, Théo Gross, Patrick Hongniat', null, 'Daniel and Stéphane, two salesmen working in the same store but who cannot stand each other, decide despite everything to team up to participate in television games so they can pay their debts.', 'Daniel and Stéphane, two salesmen working in the same store but who cannot stand each other, decide despite everything to team up to participate in television games so they can pay their debts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MdTly7XxHhSgnlHuJcqzrj7Uso.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:740460'),
  ('497403667035316019', 'The Wannsee Conference', 1984, 'Drama, History', 'Heinz Schirk, Horst Schier', 'Paul Mommertz', 'Dietrich Mattausch, Harald Dietl, Jochen Busse, Peter Fitz, Dieter Groest, Reinhard Glemnitz, Franz Rudnick, Robert Atzorn', null, 'A real time recreation of the 1942 Wannsee Conference, in which leading SS and Nazi Party officals gathered to discuss the "Final Solution to the Jewish Question". Led by SS-General Reinhard Heydrich, the Wannsee Conference was the starting point for the Jewish Holcaust which led to the mass murder of six million people.', 'A real time recreation of the 1942 Wannsee Conference, in which leading SS and Nazi Party officals gathered to discuss the "Final Solution to the Jewish Question". Led by SS-General Reinhard Heydrich, the Wannsee Conference was the starting point for the Jewish Holcaust which led to the mass murder of six million people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZno9DqrpOYJYnAHlg8Cq2s2EC3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42088'),
  ('804710091768431679', 'The War', 1994, 'Drama, War', 'Jon Avnet, David Rubin, Geoffrey Simpson', 'Kathy McWorter', 'Elijah Wood, Kevin Costner, Mare Winningham, Lexi Randall, LaToya Chisholm, Christopher Fennell, Donald Sellers, Leon Sills', 'PG-13', 'The son of a Vietnam War Veteran must deal with neighborhood bullies as well as his dad''s post-traumatic stress disorder while growing up in the deep south in the 1970''s.', 'The son of a Vietnam War Veteran must deal with neighborhood bullies as well as his dad''s post-traumatic stress disorder while growing up in the deep south in the 1970''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMJYqr5zs7rz54oZhiX4ez1BI5E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19855'),
  ('790530200780613332', 'The War and the Dream of Momi', 1917, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Drama, Animation, War', 'Segundo de Chomón, Giovanni Pastrone, Segundo de Chomón', 'Giovanni Pastrone', 'Stellina Toschi, Alberto Nepoti, Valentina Frascaroli, Enrico Gemelli, Luigi Petrungaro, Gina Marangoni', null, 'Helmed by Giovanni Pastrone, with Segundo de Chomón ably handling the stop-motion animation segment, The War and the Dream of Momi is equal parts patriotic pageantry and eye-popping puppetry.', 'Helmed by Giovanni Pastrone, with Segundo de Chomón ably handling the stop-motion animation segment, The War and the Dream of Momi is equal parts patriotic pageantry and eye-popping puppetry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uQPYE7dypV3QUAtz2qvi24b6uE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174734'),
  ('14656668652981925', 'The War at Home', 1996, 'Drama', 'Emilio Estevez', 'James Duff', 'Emilio Estevez, Kathy Bates, Martin Sheen, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Carla Gugino, Corin Nemec, Ann Hearn, Marcus H. Nelson', 'R', 'Jeremy Collier is a Vietnam veteran who has returned home and is struggling to cope with the war experiences that haunt him. He is also at odds with his family, who cannot begin to understand what he has been through. Jeremy''s battles with his family finally spiral out of control on Thanksgiving Day, when a bitter secret is revealed', 'Jeremy Collier is a Vietnam veteran who has returned home and is struggling to cope with the war experiences that haunt him. He is also at odds with his family, who cannot begin to understand what he has been through. Jeremy''s battles with his family finally spiral out of control on Thanksgiving Day, when a bitter secret is revealed', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/la11ac7YYCDBsizOkKxqwn71VKQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59232'),
  ('807486008902952330', 'The War Below', 2021, 'War, Drama, History', 'J.P. Watts, Nick Cooke, Paul Morris', 'Thomas Woods, J.P. Watts', 'Sam Hazeldine, Tom Goodman-Hill, Kris Hitchen, Elliot James Langridge, Sam Clemmett, Joseph Steyne, Sonny Ashbourne Serkis, Anna Maguire', null, 'During World War I, a group of British miners are recruited to tunnel underneath no man''s land and set bombs from below the German front in hopes of breaking the deadly stalemate of the Battle of Messines.', 'During World War I, a group of British miners are recruited to tunnel underneath no man''s land and set bombs from below the German front in hopes of breaking the deadly stalemate of the Battle of Messines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdr6n7CuOyexmLUTynRgT3QRQSc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:810413'),
  ('45595543603896729', 'The War Between Men and Women', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Melville Shavelson, Charles F. Wheeler, Mike Moder', 'Danny Arnold, Melville Shavelson', 'Jack Lemmon, Barbara Harris, Jason Robards, Herb Edelman, Lisa Gerritsen, Moosie Drier, Severn Darden, Lisa Eilbacher', 'PG', 'A sarcastic near-sighted cartoonist, averse to commitment, falls for a single mother of three — the only woman who can stand his strong anti-feminist opinions.', 'A sarcastic near-sighted cartoonist, averse to commitment, falls for a single mother of three — the only woman who can stand his strong anti-feminist opinions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hehmh38TQgAqiczF1hwK2Qc1Iqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163392'),
  ('492352191392804029', 'The War Boys', 2009, 'Drama', 'Ron Daniels, Horacio Marquínez', 'Bruce McLeod, Naomi Wallace', 'Benjamin Walker, Peter Gallagher, Brian J. Smith, Victor Rasuk, Greg Serano, Debrianna Mansini, Maria Bethke, Micaela Nevárez', 'R', 'Home from his freshman year of college, David is reunited with his childhood buddies Greg and George - the War Boys are together again. They used to sit in their pick up truck on the US-Mexican border waiting to chase illegal immigrants across the wasteland– just for fun. Now the boys hijack a semi hoping to sell what they think are black market televisions and make a quick buck.', 'Home from his freshman year of college, David is reunited with his childhood buddies Greg and George - the War Boys are together again. They used to sit in their pick up truck on the US-Mexican border waiting to chase illegal immigrants across the wasteland– just for fun. Now the boys hijack a semi hoping to sell what they think are black market televisions and make a quick buck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i57UvoI66TU8kWCrxViusgfLoIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39958'),
  ('811195796534715168', 'The War Game', 1966, 'War, TV Movie', 'Peter Watkins, Peter Bartlett', 'Peter Watkins', 'Michael Aspel, Kathy Staff, Peter Watkins, Peter Graham', null, 'A docudrama depicting a hypothetical nuclear attack on Britain. After backing the film''s development, the BBC refused to air it, publicly stating "the effect of the film has been judged by the BBC to be too horrifying for the medium of broadcasting." It debuted in theaters in 1966 and went on to great acclaim, but remained unseen on British television until 1985.', 'A docudrama depicting a hypothetical nuclear attack on Britain. After backing the film''s development, the BBC refused to air it, publicly stating "the effect of the film has been judged by the BBC to be too horrifying for the medium of broadcasting." It debuted in theaters in 1966 and went on to great acclaim, but remained unseen on British television until 1985.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puJGNnrAPOv3BUMI9mKlCJp3UrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26508'),
  ('787019880773473003', 'The War in Space', 1977, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action', 'Jun Fukuda, Yuzuru Aizawa, Kyohei Imamura', 'Ryuzo Nakanishi, Hideichi Nagahara', 'Kensaku Morita, Yuko Asano, Ryō Ikebe, Masaya Oki, Hiroshi Miyauchi, Hideji Ōtaki, Katsutoshi Atarashi, Akihiko Hirata', null, 'The year is 1988, and in the midst of recovering from a near-miss with a large comet, Earth finds that there are much worse matters at hand: the sudden arrival of a strange army of aliens and their fleet of unstoppable warships.', 'The year is 1988, and in the midst of recovering from a near-miss with a large comet, Earth finds that there are much worse matters at hand: the sudden arrival of a strange army of aliens and their fleet of unstoppable warships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HRIBpaeEkoNyVYEw4rMg1avQiY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38268'),
  ('297355752472461137', 'The War Is Over', 1966, 'Drama', 'Alain Resnais, Sacha Vierny, Florence Malraux', 'Jorge Semprún', 'Yves Montand, Ingrid Thulin, Geneviève Bujold, Jean Dasté, Dominique Rozan, Jean-François Rémi, Marie Mergey, Michel Piccoli', null, 'Diego is one of the chiefs of the Spanish Communist Party. On his way from Madrid to Paris, he is arrested at the border for an ID check but manages to get free. When he arrives in Paris, he starts searching for one of his comrades to prevent him from going to Madrid where he could be arrested.', 'Diego is one of the chiefs of the Spanish Communist Party. On his way from Madrid to Paris, he is arrested at the border for an ID check but manages to get free. When he arrives in Paris, he starts searching for one of his comrades to prevent him from going to Madrid where he could be arrested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tyYpZOk1qI7h98usC9cslgf1QA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4781'),
  ('645949832721572789', 'The War Is Over', 1989, 'War, Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Loup Hubert', 'Jean-Loup Hubert', 'Richard Bohringer, Antoine Hubert, Julien Hubert, Martin Lamotte, Isabelle Sadoyan, Raoul Billerey, Jean-François Dérec, Jacques Mathou', null, 'The film is set in France in August 1944 at the end of the war. German troops are in retreat as the allies are coming in. Two French boys run from home and on their journey they stumble upon a German soldier. Soon they become friends and together they head towards Lyon...', 'The film is set in France in August 1944 at the end of the war. German troops are in retreat as the allies are coming in. Two French boys run from home and on their journey they stumble upon a German soldier. Soon they become friends and together they head towards Lyon...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwsGEnEbuOnuRKhC1QIFuN8Ea4e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59349'),
  ('924141139523863104', 'The War Lord', 1965, 'History, Drama, War', 'Franklin J. Schaffner, Russell Metty, Douglas Green', 'Millard Kaufman, John Collier', 'Charlton Heston, Richard Boone, Rosemary Forsyth, Maurice Evans, Guy Stockwell, Niall MacGinnis, James Farentino, Henry Wilcoxon', 'PG', 'A knight in the service of a duke goes to a coastal village where an earlier attempt to build a defensive castle has failed. He begins to rebuild the duke''s authority in the face of the barbarians at the border and is making progress until he falls in love with one of the local women.', 'A knight in the service of a duke goes to a coastal village where an earlier attempt to build a defensive castle has failed. He begins to rebuild the duke''s authority in the face of the barbarians at the border and is making progress until he falls in love with one of the local women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fMXFuKQ6ww0fwq854kjWDtsQJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42664'),
  ('482223946454227929', 'The War Lover', 1962, 'Drama, War, Adventure', 'Philip Leacock, Robert Huke', 'Howard Koch', 'Steve McQueen, Robert Wagner, Shirley Anne Field, Gary Cockrell, Michael Crawford, Burt Kwouk, Bill Edwards, Chuck Julian', 'NR', 'Buzz Rickson is a dare-devil World War II bomber pilot with a death wish. Failing at everything not involving flying, Rickson lives for the most dangerous missions. His crew lives with this aspect of his personality only because they know he always brings them back alive.', 'Buzz Rickson is a dare-devil World War II bomber pilot with a death wish. Failing at everything not involving flying, Rickson lives for the most dangerous missions. His crew lives with this aspect of his personality only because they know he always brings them back alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YHNVfhiUuZ3bJ5J0OsOM60ppzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55305'),
  ('195568582493619018', 'The War of Bumpkins', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lorenzo Conte, Davide Barletti, Christian Bonatesta', 'Davide Barletti, Lorenzo Conte, Barbara Alberti', 'Pasquale Patruno, Letizia Pia Cartolaro, Donato Paterno, Angelo Pignatelli, Alice Azzariti, Piero Dioniso, Ernesto Mahieux, Claudio Santamaria', null, 'Global politics in a fairytale nutshell: the eternal struggle between the ruling elite and the underclass, condemned to ignorance.', 'Global politics in a fairytale nutshell: the eternal struggle between the ruling elite and the underclass, condemned to ignorance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJpkeCoQB1z8PtiWXfZovYQJJwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434864'),
  ('62673362765081761', 'The War of the Gargantuas', 1966, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ishirō Honda, Koji Kajita, Hajime Koizumi', 'Takeshi Kimura, Ishirō Honda', 'Kenji Sahara, Kumi Mizuno, Russ Tamblyn, Jun Tazaki, Kipp Hamilton, Yoshibumi Tajima, Nobuo Nakamura, Hisaya Ito', 'G', 'Gaira, a humanoid sea beast spawned from the discarded cells of Frankenstein''s monster, attacks the shores of Tokyo. While the Japanese military prepares to take action, Gaira''s Gargantua brother, Sanda, descends from the mountains to defend his kin. A battle between good and evil ensues, leaving brothers divided and a city in ruins.', 'Gaira, a humanoid sea beast spawned from the discarded cells of Frankenstein''s monster, attacks the shores of Tokyo. While the Japanese military prepares to take action, Gaira''s Gargantua brother, Sanda, descends from the mountains to defend his kin. A battle between good and evil ensues, leaving brothers divided and a city in ruins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8EH0y601mhYJmchoTRoo92Q0FS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3146'),
  ('512528827217349369', 'The War of the Nonni', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Donato Sileo, Gianluca Ansanelli', 'Tito Buffolini, Gianluca Ansanelli', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Max Tortora, Ana Caterina Morariu, Luca Angeletti, Bianca Guaccero, Herbert Ballerina, Greta Santi, Luigi Fosco', null, 'Jerry and Tom are two grandparents who compete for the sympathy of their grandchildren.', 'Jerry and Tom are two grandparents who compete for the sympathy of their grandchildren.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3b78WRaAyTOo8nVyf9rtzVFSepV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1118772'),
  ('601529161914442228', 'The War of the Robots', 1978, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Alfonso Brescia, Silvio Fraschetti', 'Alfonso Brescia, Aldo Crudo', 'Antonio Sabàto, Yanti Somer, Malisa Longo, Patrizia Gori, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Aldo Canti, West Buchanan, Massimo Righi', null, 'An alien civilization, which facing eminent extinction, kidnaps two famous genetic scientists from Earth. A troop of soldiers is dispatched to combat the humanoid robots and rescue the victims.', 'An alien civilization, which facing eminent extinction, kidnaps two famous genetic scientists from Earth. A troop of soldiers is dispatched to combat the humanoid robots and rescue the victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ngPtuxYB2Q4lA0aVSSTpxjBtVJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113105'),
  ('410201882076845430', 'The War of the Roses', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stephen H. Burum, Danny DeVito, Jeffrey M. Ellis', 'Michael J. Leeson', 'Michael Douglas, Kathleen Turner, Danny DeVito, Marianne Sägebrecht, Sean Astin, Heather Fairfield, G.D. Spradlin, Peter Donat', 'R', 'Barbara and Oliver Rose live happily as a married couple. When Barbara starts to wonder what life would be like without Oliver and likes what she sees, the two begin a campaign to force each other to leave their house, with their divorce lawyer D''Amato caught in the middle.', 'Barbara and Oliver Rose live happily as a married couple. When Barbara starts to wonder what life would be like without Oliver and likes what she sees, the two begin a campaign to force each other to leave their house, with their divorce lawyer D''Amato caught in the middle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VWwYsuXhRImUtrJGvN6bYJB2He.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249'),
  ('539013614158673913', 'The War of the Worlds', 1953, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Michael D. Moore, Byron Haskin, Loren L. Ryder', 'Barré Lyndon', 'Gene Barry, Ann Robinson, Lewis Martin, Les Tremayne, Frank Kreig, Vernon Rich, Sandro Giglio, Ann Codee', 'G', 'The residents of a small town are excited when a flaming meteor lands in the hills, until they discover it is the first of many transport devices from Mars bringing an army of invaders invincible to any man-made weapon, even the atomic bomb.', 'The residents of a small town are excited when a flaming meteor lands in the hills, until they discover it is the first of many transport devices from Mars bringing an army of invaders invincible to any man-made weapon, even the atomic bomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzc75Za4ArqfXIIr7STNnIE5rnA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8974'),
  ('1077583442456432145', 'The War of the Worlds: Next Century', 1981, 'Science Fiction', 'Piotr Szulkin, Zygmunt Samosiuk', 'Piotr Szulkin', 'Roman Wilhelmi, Krystyna Janda, Jerzy Stuhr, Stanisław Tym, Witold Pyrkosz, Zbigniew Buczkowski, Bogusław Sobczuk, Mariusz Dmochowski', null, 'Poland, Christmastime. A band of hyperintelligent, bloodthirsty Martians take over the country and enlist hapless television newscaster Iron Idem as the voice of their propaganda machine. But when Iron dares to go off message, he makes an enemy even greater than the aliens—the state itself.', 'Poland, Christmastime. A band of hyperintelligent, bloodthirsty Martians take over the country and enlist hapless television newscaster Iron Idem as the voice of their propaganda machine. But when Iron dares to go off message, he makes an enemy even greater than the aliens—the state itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2a9C1Sq1AQlK8eXDN1KCnK55XZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185354'),
  ('515252900950508247', 'The War on Democracy', 2007, 'History, Documentary, War', 'John Pilger, Sean Crotty, Chris Martin', 'John Pilger', 'John Pilger, Hugo Chávez, Philip Agee, Jacobo Árbenz, Richard Nixon, Henry Kissinger, E. Howard Hunt, Ari Fleischer', 'R', 'Set both in Latin America and the United States, the film explores the historic and current relationship of Washington with countries such as Venezuela, Bolivia and Chile. Pilger says that the film "...tells a universal story... analysing and revealing, through vivid testimony, the story of great power behind its venerable myths. It allows us to understand the true nature of the so-called "war on terror". According to Pilger, the film’s message is that the greed and power of empire is not invincible and that people power is always the "seed beneath the snow".', 'Set both in Latin America and the United States, the film explores the historic and current relationship of Washington with countries such as Venezuela, Bolivia and Chile. Pilger says that the film "...tells a universal story... analysing and revealing, through vivid testimony, the story of great power behind its venerable myths. It allows us to understand the true nature of the so-called "war on terror". According to Pilger, the film’s message is that the greed and power of empire is not invincible and that people power is always the "seed beneath the snow".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12oQAIiqYSjWmZtIY1XtHYpCk7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22452'),
  ('578219196536158539', 'The War Room', 1993, 'Documentary, History', 'D. A. Pennebaker, Chris Hegedus, Nick Doob', null, 'James Carville, George Stephanopoulos, Heather Beckel, Paul Begala, Bob Boorstin, Bill Clinton, Hillary Clinton, Chelsea Clinton', 'PG', 'A behind-the-scenes documentary about the Clinton for President campaign, focusing on the adventures of spin doctors James Carville and George Stephanopoulos.', 'A behind-the-scenes documentary about the Clinton for President campaign, focusing on the adventures of spin doctors James Carville and George Stephanopoulos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prfxsyG4SnlnqqulavCJ4RksFUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26408'),
  ('662572292015122241', 'The War Wagon', 1967, 'Western, Action, Crime', 'Burt Kennedy, William H. Clothier, Al Jennings', 'Clair Huffaker', 'John Wayne, Kirk Douglas, Howard Keel, Robert Walker Jr., Keenan Wynn, Bruce Cabot, Joanna Barnes, Valora Noland', 'PG', 'An ex-con seeks revenge on the man who put him in prison by planning a robbery of the latter''s stagecoach, which is transporting gold. He enlists the help of a partner, who could be working for his nemesis.', 'An ex-con seeks revenge on the man who put him in prison by planning a robbery of the latter''s stagecoach, which is transporting gold. He enlists the help of a partner, who could be working for his nemesis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGSv9mfHocleVwH4Q8d38SkwQP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27277'),
  ('397604959472056100', 'The War with Grandpa', 2020, 'Comedy, Family', 'Tim Hill, Jeff J.J. Authors, Alan Steinman', 'Matt Ember, Tom J. Astle', 'Robert De Niro, Uma Thurman, Rob Riggle, Oakes Fegley, Laura Marano, Cheech Marin, Jane Seymour, Christopher Walken', 'PG', 'Peter is thrilled that his Grandpa is coming to live with his family. That is, until Grandpa moves into Peter''s room, forcing him upstairs into the creepy attic. And though he loves his Grandpa, he wants his room back - so he has no choice but to declare war.', 'Peter is thrilled that his Grandpa is coming to live with his family. That is, until Grandpa moves into Peter''s room, forcing him upstairs into the creepy attic. And though he loves his Grandpa, he wants his room back - so he has no choice but to declare war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltyARDw2EFXZ2H2ERnlEctXPioP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425001'),
