  ('625188198499217182', 'The Ward', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Carpenter, Yaron Orbach, Lynn Wegenka', 'Shawn Rasmussen, Michael Rasmussen', 'Amber Heard, Mamie Gummer, Danielle Panabaker, Jared Harris, Laura-Leigh, Lyndsy Fonseca, Mika Boorem, Sydney Sweeney', 'R', 'Kristen, a troubled young woman, is captured by the police after burning down a farmhouse and is locked in the North Bend Psychiatric Hospital. Soon, she begins to suspect that the place has a dark secret at its core and she''s determined to find out what it is.', 'Kristen, a troubled young woman, is captured by the police after burning down a farmhouse and is locked in the North Bend Psychiatric Hospital. Soon, she begins to suspect that the place has a dark secret at its core and she''s determined to find out what it is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2dqoY5cYop46SKebNXRNL5EXEM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45657'),
  ('649580258333198995', 'The Warlords', 2007, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Peter Chan Ho-Sun', 'Lan Xu, Chun Tin-Nam, James Yuen Sai-Sang', 'Jet Li, Andy Lau, Takeshi Kaneshiro, Xu Jinglei, Wei Zongwan, Ku Pao-Ming, Wang Kuirong, Zhou Bo', 'R', 'The civil war in China has ruined many lives including General Pang''s. A wounded General Pang is saved by a beautiful young woman along with two other men. Together they vow to eradicate the rebels.', 'The civil war in China has ruined many lives including General Pang''s. A wounded General Pang is saved by a beautiful young woman along with two other men. Together they vow to eradicate the rebels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sAWyaASakMW9f3LSXK8Br3RCED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14392'),
