  ('384763566415964169', 'The Warped Ones', 1960, 'Drama, Crime', 'Koreyoshi Kurahara, Yoshio Mamiya, Kyosa Yoshida', 'Nobuo Yamada', 'Tamio Kawachi, Eiji Gō, Hiroyuki Nagato, Kōjirō Kusanagi, Noriko Matsumoto, Yuko Chishiro, Reiko Arai, Yōko Kozono', null, 'A juvenile delinquent gets out of the pen and immediately embarks on a rampage of untethered anger, most of it directed at the girlfriend of the journalist who helped send him up.', 'A juvenile delinquent gets out of the pen and immediately embarks on a rampage of untethered anger, most of it directed at the girlfriend of the journalist who helped send him up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gK9TCfADR37uN94LP1Ue3xNxh1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95508'),
  ('929163164816791452', 'The Warrant', 2020, 'Western', 'Joth Riggs, Christopher Villalba, Jeffrey Karantza', 'Shea Sizemore', 'Neal McDonough, Steven R. McQueen, Annabeth Gish, Casper Van Dien, Gregory Cruz, Greg Perrow, Roxanna Dunlop, Esteban Cueto', null, 'After fighting in the Civil War, two Union Army buddies find themselves on opposite sides of the law with the post-war peace at risk.', 'After fighting in the Civil War, two Union Army buddies find themselves on opposite sides of the law with the post-war peace at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAShmkZrxnKe9QvsBg869PmS2zL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676156'),
  ('979092462424982832', 'The Warren Museum: A True Case of the Nightmare Society', 2026, 'Documentary, Horror', 'Raiza Revelles', 'Raiza Revelles', 'Claudia Ramírez Lomelí, Renata Revelles, Gerardo Avendaño, Andrea Ramírez, Patricio Ramírez', null, 'The group of friends The Nightmare Society spent an entire morning searching for the activity of the beings and demons that inhabit the house and museum of the famous researchers Ed and Lorraine Warren. This is what they recorded.', 'The group of friends The Nightmare Society spent an entire morning searching for the activity of the beings and demons that inhabit the house and museum of the famous researchers Ed and Lorraine Warren. This is what they recorded.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYzE0M2I0ZWEtNzE0MS00YmFlLWEyMTgtYTA5Mzc0ZDYyZDk4XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-warren-museum-a-true-case-of-the-nightmare-society'),
  ('459809077470427066', 'The Warring States', 2011, 'Drama, Action, Romance, War', 'Jin Chen, Yuen Bun, Xiong Xinxin', 'Shen Jie', 'Sun Honglei, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Kim Hee-seon, Jiang Wu, Jing Tian, Kiichi Nakai, Guo Degang, Feng Enhe', null, 'Rival Chinese military strategists Sun Bin (Sun Honglei) and Pang Juan (Francis Ng) clash in this historic war adventure set during the Era of Warring States.', 'Rival Chinese military strategists Sun Bin (Sun Honglei) and Pang Juan (Francis Ng) clash in this historic war adventure set during the Era of Warring States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stVevEJ1iJcfUWt0yYOx6QwAsh3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63457'),
  ('914501475394893507', 'The Warrior', 2001, 'History, Drama, Action, War', 'Kim Hyung-koo, Kim Sung-soo, Lee Kang-san', 'Kim Sung-soo', 'Jung Woo-sung, Ahn Sung-ki, Ju Jin-mo, Park Yong-woo, Zhang Ziyi, Park Jeong-hak, Jeong Seok-yong, Lee Du-il', null, 'In 1375, China was in chaos between Yuan Dynasty and Ming Dynasty. Coryo (an ancient kingdom of Korea then) sent a delegation of many diplomats, soldiers and a silent slave to make peace with the new Chinese government. However, this delegation got charged as spies and sent in exile to a remote desert.', 'In 1375, China was in chaos between Yuan Dynasty and Ming Dynasty. Coryo (an ancient kingdom of Korea then) sent a delegation of many diplomats, soldiers and a silent slave to make peace with the new Chinese government. However, this delegation got charged as spies and sent in exile to a remote desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0lpQfqQHN7vEYzSHOk6B65dQbb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1436'),
  ('1108949406750400515', 'The Warrior and the Sorceress', 1984, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'John C. Broderick, Leonardo Rodríguez Solís', 'Ryuzo Kikushima, Hideo Oguni', 'David Carradine, Luke Askew, María Socas, Anthony De Longis, Harry Townes, William Marin, Armando Capo, Arthur Clark', 'R', 'The mighty warrior, Kain, crosses the barren wastelands of the planet Ura, where two arch enemies, Zeg and the evil degenerate Balcaz, fight incessantly for control of the village''s only well. Kain sees his opportunity and announces that his sword is for hire... but his eyes stay clearly on the beautiful captive sorceress Naja, and his newly awakened purpose.', 'The mighty warrior, Kain, crosses the barren wastelands of the planet Ura, where two arch enemies, Zeg and the evil degenerate Balcaz, fight incessantly for control of the village''s only well. Kain sees his opportunity and announces that his sword is for hire... but his eyes stay clearly on the beautiful captive sorceress Naja, and his newly awakened purpose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jSoWzOuuNQgeAXWGK3cB64H18I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46500'),
  ('260457516270539698', 'The Warrior and the Wolf', 2009, 'History, Action, Drama', 'Tian Zhuangzhuang, Wang Yu', 'Tian Zhuangzhuang', 'Maggie Q, Joe Odagiri, Tou Tsung-hua', null, 'Set during China''s the Warring States Period (476-221 BC), benevolent warrior Chenkang Lu (Joe Odagiri) enters into a torrid love affair with a woman (Maggie Q) from the nomadic Harran tribe. Their relationship sends the warrior to a place where humans were once wolves...', 'Set during China''s the Warring States Period (476-221 BC), benevolent warrior Chenkang Lu (Joe Odagiri) enters into a torrid love affair with a woman (Maggie Q) from the nomadic Harran tribe. Their relationship sends the warrior to a place where humans were once wolves...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qah2wCZmif4dDxloj84sspiwBZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32922'),
  ('604212869018457031', 'The Warrior Princess', 2021, 'History, Action, Drama', 'S. Baasanjargal', null, 'Tserendolgor Munkhbat, Altantur Altanjargal, Setgeltuvshin Bayarbat, Tumurtogtokh Davaakhuu, Badrakh Battogtokh, Munkhtumur Dondov, Temuujin Odkhuu, Gerelsukh Otgon', null, 'Princess Khotulun is the daughter of Haidu Khan of the Ugudei dynasty. The film tells the story of Princess Khotulun, the son of Kublai Khan, known in Western and Eastern history as a wrestling princess, and her struggle to reclaim her Golden Sutra.', 'Princess Khotulun is the daughter of Haidu Khan of the Ugudei dynasty. The film tells the story of Princess Khotulun, the son of Kublai Khan, known in Western and Eastern history as a wrestling princess, and her struggle to reclaim her Golden Sutra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmfPD15AR0FXyNTQE19TbuJNrwu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960481'),
  ('170479477636382288', 'The Warrior''s Brother', 2002, 'Adventure, History', 'Pierre Jolivet, Pascal Ridao, Sonia Larue', 'Pierre Jolivet, Simon Michaël', 'Vincent Lindon, Guillaume Canet, Mélanie Doutey, François Berléand, Brunelle Lemonnier, Frédéric Lacave, Perkins Lyautey, Roch Leibovici', null, '13th century France. To live, to survive, requires weapons. Which do you choose? Weapons of war, which give the power to punish and kill? Or the sword of knowledge, which gives the power to read and heal? Two brothers, separated long ago, must do battle. Alongside, and coming between them, a woman... Thomas, the mercenary, his body marked by scars of varying degrees of valor, left the family farm many years ago. When he returns, his mother, the local healer, is dead. She passed on her skills to her younger son, Arnaud. But he has lost his memory after a beating from a gang of ruthless outlaws. And so, Arnaud''s young and defiantly resourceful wife, Guillemette, must persuade Thomas to help her in the quest for lost knowledge.', '13th century France. To live, to survive, requires weapons. Which do you choose? Weapons of war, which give the power to punish and kill? Or the sword of knowledge, which gives the power to read and heal? Two brothers, separated long ago, must do battle. Alongside, and coming between them, a woman... Thomas, the mercenary, his body marked by scars of varying degrees of valor, left the family farm many years ago. When he returns, his mother, the local healer, is dead. She passed on her skills to her younger son, Arnaud. But he has lost his memory after a beating from a gang of ruthless outlaws. And so, Arnaud''s young and defiantly resourceful wife, Guillemette, must persuade Thomas to help her in the quest for lost knowledge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHgBlj0T7AGJWT63Vz8pfa6Ul4p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67739'),
  ('751806746871029290', 'The Warrior''s Way', 2010, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Western, Thriller', 'Lee Seung-moo, Kim Woo-hyung', 'Lee Seung-moo', 'Jang Dong-gun, Kate Bosworth, Geoffrey Rush, Danny Huston, Ti Lung, Tony Cox, Analin Rudd, Markus Hamilton', 'R', 'A warrior-assassin is forced to hide in a small town in the American Badlands after refusing a mission.', 'A warrior-assassin is forced to hide in a small town in the American Badlands after refusing a mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otjBqNDpZ3C9mzfDOI4kaiib3Qd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46528'),
  ('201400992037276492', 'The Warriors', 1979, 'Action, Thriller', 'Walter Hill, Andrew Laszlo, David Sosna', 'David Shaber, Walter Hill', 'Michael Beck, James Remar, David Patrick Kelly, Dorsey Wright, David Harris, Deborah Van Valkenburgh, Brian Tyler, Tom McKitterick', 'R', 'Prominent gang leader Cyrus calls a meeting of New York''s gangs to set aside their turf wars and take over the city. At the meeting, a rival leader kills Cyrus, but a Coney Island gang called the Warriors is wrongly blamed for Cyrus'' death. Before you know it, the cops and every gangbanger in town is hot on the Warriors'' trail.', 'Prominent gang leader Cyrus calls a meeting of New York''s gangs to set aside their turf wars and take over the city. At the meeting, a rival leader kills Cyrus, but a Coney Island gang called the Warriors is wrongly blamed for Cyrus'' death. Before you know it, the cops and every gangbanger in town is hot on the Warriors'' trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6YZpBq4BhQr1K985J3CuL1cA8J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11474'),
  ('722409692165441938', 'The Warriors Gate', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Matthias Hoene, Maxime Alexandre', 'Robert Mark Kamen, Luc Besson', 'Uriah Shelton, Ni Ni, Dave Bautista, Mark Chao You-Ting, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Sienna Guillory, Dakota Daulby', 'PG-13', 'After a mysterious chest opens a gateway through time, teen gamer Jack is transported to an ancient empire terrorized by a cruel barbarian king. Jack will need all of his gaming skills as he battles to defeat the barbarian, protect a beautiful princess, and somehow find his way back home.', 'After a mysterious chest opens a gateway through time, teen gamer Jack is transported to an ancient empire terrorized by a cruel barbarian king. Jack will need all of his gaming skills as he battles to defeat the barbarian, protect a beautiful princess, and somehow find his way back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8l2DHcrCTgy1XuFHZmL2BbClJVO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413658'),
  ('388547563273864362', 'The Wash', 2001, 'Action, Comedy', 'DJ Pooh, Ime Etuk, Richard Gonzales', 'DJ Pooh', 'Dr. Dre, Snoop Dogg, DJ Pooh, Angell Conwell, Bruce Bruce, Tommy Lister Jr., Eminem, Shaquille O''Neal', 'R', 'With the rent due and his car booted, Sean has to come up with some ends...and fast. When his best buddy and roommate Dee Loc, suggests that Sean get a job busting suds down at the local car wash.', 'With the rent due and his car booted, Sean has to come up with some ends...and fast. When his best buddy and roommate Dee Loc, suggests that Sean get a job busting suds down at the local car wash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xb63VT8E4Q2RjLT7qnzvc5jRFAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13408'),
  ('600892384058127946', 'The Washing Machine', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Sergio D''Offizi, Ruggero Deodato', 'Luigi Spagnol', 'Philippe Caroit, Ilaria Borrelli, Katarzyna Figura, Barbara Ricci, Laurence Regnier, László Borbély, Claudia Pozzi, Yorgo Voyagis', null, 'Three sisters - voluptuous Vida, Maria (nicknamed "Sissy"), and Ludmilla - live together in a run-down apartment building in Budapest. The sisters all vie for the attentions of Yuri Petkov, a dubious middle-aged pimp who plays them off against each other. One evening, Ludmilla claims to have found Yuri''s body stuffed into their washing machine, but when Inspector Stacev arrives to investigate the body has disappeared. The good-looking young inspector attempts to discover the truth but in doing so becomes drawn into the sisters'' bizarre sex games...', 'Three sisters - voluptuous Vida, Maria (nicknamed "Sissy"), and Ludmilla - live together in a run-down apartment building in Budapest. The sisters all vie for the attentions of Yuri Petkov, a dubious middle-aged pimp who plays them off against each other. One evening, Ludmilla claims to have found Yuri''s body stuffed into their washing machine, but when Inspector Stacev arrives to investigate the body has disappeared. The good-looking young inspector attempts to discover the truth but in doing so becomes drawn into the sisters'' bizarre sex games...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4L5RHrQAJwRCDyRrlyqdMqeMCF5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30881'),
  ('559524535780348484', 'The Washingtonians', 2007, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Peter Medak', 'Richard Chizmar, Johnathon Schaech, Bentley Little', 'Caroline Carter, Julia Tortolano, Venus Terzo, Johnathon Schaech, Myron Natwick, Esme Lambert, Abraham Jedidiah, Saul Rubinek', null, 'A family man unearths an old letter, claiming that historical figure George Washington was a cannibal, and that a colonial-era reenactment group may be upholding that way of life.', 'A family man unearths an old letter, claiming that historical figure George Washington was a cannibal, and that a colonial-era reenactment group may be upholding that way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMayQn7nYbaFvW1zwSujv1nfkNa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319206'),
  ('565197807936053228', 'The Wasp', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Guillem Morales, Giulia Lyla Balsamo, John Sorapure', 'Morgan Lloyd Malcolm', 'Naomie Harris, Natalie Dormer, Dominic Allburn, Leah Mondesir-Simmonds, Olivia Juno Cleverley, Rupert Holliday-Evans, Jack Morris, Jake Donald-Crookes', 'R', 'Heather bumps into Carla, having not spoken to her in years, and presents her with a very unexpected proposition that could change both of their lives forever.', 'Heather bumps into Carla, having not spoken to her in years, and presents her with a very unexpected proposition that could change both of their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgsjF2QmnCUi3GGsoAUyoOrvOgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1019404'),
  ('250183305816216252', 'The Wasp Woman', 1959, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Harry Neumann, Roger Corman', 'Leo Gordon', 'Susan Cabot, Anthony Eisley, Michael Mark, Barboura Morris, William Roerick, Frank Gerstle, Bruno VeSota, Roy Gordon', 'NR', 'The head of a major cosmetics company experiments on herself with a youth formula made from royal jelly extracted from wasps, but the formula''s side effects have deadly consequences.', 'The head of a major cosmetics company experiments on herself with a youth formula made from royal jelly extracted from wasps, but the formula''s side effects have deadly consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yU5PuyeXX7EHG5d1AdWMforNfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27545'),
  ('1003116006997798903', 'The Wasp Woman', 1995, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jim Wynorski, Mike Mickens', 'Guy Prevost, Daniella Purcell', 'Jennifer Rubin, Doug Wert, Daniel J. Travanti, Maria Ford, Melissa Brasselle, John Henry Richardson, Gerrit Graham, Richard Gabai', 'R', 'Eager to boost sales, cosmetic maker Janice Starlin orders her scientists to develop a new youth formula derived from queen wasp enzymes. But when Janice accidentally overdoses on the formula, she’s shockingly transformed into a giant, vicious wasp.', 'Eager to boost sales, cosmetic maker Janice Starlin orders her scientists to develop a new youth formula derived from queen wasp enzymes. But when Janice accidentally overdoses on the formula, she’s shockingly transformed into a giant, vicious wasp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaL2mwwYndBJ9ADfVhtt23EEsW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27546'),
  ('426912729778925750', 'The Wasted Times', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Cheng Er, Du Jie', 'Cheng Er', 'Ge You, Zhang Ziyi, Tadanobu Asano, Du Chun, Gillian Chung, Zhao Baogang, Ni Dahong, Yuan Quan', 'NR', 'Shanghai gangsters grapple with lust and loyalty on the eve of war with Japan as they try to navigate an alliance with the enemy''s army.', 'Shanghai gangsters grapple with lust and loyalty on the eve of war with Japan as they try to navigate an alliance with the enemy''s army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQm1jnqrQQoDxBRYFKQ9uq8Rbm7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382572'),
  ('72068241883996531', 'The Wasteland', 2021, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'David Casademunt, Isaac Vila', 'Fran Menchón Ortiz, David Casademunt, Martí Lucas', 'Inma Cuesta, Asier Flores, Roberto Álamo, Alejandra Howard, Marià Llop, Víctor Benjumea', null, 'Lucía and her son live isolated from society in a flat place where there’s practically no life. The small family unit formed by mother and son hardly ever receives visitors, and their goal is to lead a quiet existence. At first they succeed, but the appearance of a mysterious, violent creature that starts stalking their small house will put the relationship that unites them to the test.', 'Lucía and her son live isolated from society in a flat place where there’s practically no life. The small family unit formed by mother and son hardly ever receives visitors, and their goal is to lead a quiet existence. At first they succeed, but the appearance of a mysterious, violent creature that starts stalking their small house will put the relationship that unites them to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lchjXJm2oqEVkpuXVX8YglbgKUZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800410'),
  ('796660443658445238', 'The Watch', 2008, 'Drama, Mystery, Horror, TV Movie', 'Jim Donovan, Manfred Guthe', 'Ben Ripley', 'Clea DuVall, James A. Woods, Elizabeth Whitmere, Victoria Sanchez, Morgan Kelly, Robert Reynolds, Matthew Kabwe', null, 'Cassie, a psych student, was kidnapped and traumatized as a child by a disturbed person. To exorcise her demons and to finish her thesis, she decides on an experiment in isolation, working at a secluded watch tower as a fire lookout. But once she''s alone, strange things start happening. Or is she just paranoid? Cassie is terrified that her past may be coming back to haunt her.', 'Cassie, a psych student, was kidnapped and traumatized as a child by a disturbed person. To exorcise her demons and to finish her thesis, she decides on an experiment in isolation, working at a secluded watch tower as a fire lookout. But once she''s alone, strange things start happening. Or is she just paranoid? Cassie is terrified that her past may be coming back to haunt her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbOoLlTZnGyg13cLZ3ULtmeNsn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42272'),
  ('849769039414821026', 'The Watch', 2012, 'Comedy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Barry Peterson, Akiva Schaffer, Jack Gill', 'Evan Goldberg, Jared Stern, Seth Rogen', 'Ben Stiller, Vince Vaughn, Jonah Hill, Richard Ayoade, Rosemarie DeWitt, Erinn Hayes, Erin Moriarty, Jill Jane Clements', 'R', 'Four everyday suburban guys come together as an excuse to escape their humdrum lives one night a week. But when they accidentally discover that their town has become overrun with aliens posing as ordinary suburbanites, they have no choice but to save their neighborhood – and the world – from total extermination.', 'Four everyday suburban guys come together as an excuse to escape their humdrum lives one night a week. But when they accidentally discover that their town has become overrun with aliens posing as ordinary suburbanites, they have no choice but to save their neighborhood – and the world – from total extermination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwfgYA9wGpV4QLB0LrcexwfwC19.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80035'),
  ('821546561608908407', 'The Watcher', 2000, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Joe Charbanic, Michael Chapman', 'David Elliot, Clay Ayers', 'James Spader, Keanu Reeves, Marisa Tomei, Ernie Hudson, Chris Ellis, Robert Cicchini, Yvonne Niami, Jenny McShane', 'R', 'FBI agent Joel Campbell, burnt-out and shell-shocked after years spent chasing serial killers, flees L.A. to begin a new life for himself in Chicago. But five months later, Joel''s best laid plans are abruptly cut short when his new hometown becomes the setting for some particularly gruesome murders--murders that could only have been committed by one man: David Allen Griffin. One of Joel''s most elusive and cunning nemeses, Griffin has followed his former pursuer to Chicago in order to play a sadistic game of cat and mouse. Taunting Joel with photographs of his intended victims and leaving his crime scenes meticulously free of clues in order to keep the police at bay, Griffin derives as much pleasure out of watching Joel react to every movement as watching his victims die. But when Griffin moves into Joel''s inner circle, Joel must quickly find some way to stop him before someone close to him becomes the next one to die.', 'FBI agent Joel Campbell, burnt-out and shell-shocked after years spent chasing serial killers, flees L.A. to begin a new life for himself in Chicago. But five months later, Joel''s best laid plans are abruptly cut short when his new hometown becomes the setting for some particularly gruesome murders--murders that could only have been committed by one man: David Allen Griffin. One of Joel''s most elusive and cunning nemeses, Griffin has followed his former pursuer to Chicago in order to play a sadistic game of cat and mouse. Taunting Joel with photographs of his intended victims and leaving his crime scenes meticulously free of clues in order to keep the police at bay, Griffin derives as much pleasure out of watching Joel react to every movement as watching his victims die. But when Griffin moves into Joel''s inner circle, Joel must quickly find some way to stop him before someone close to him becomes the next one to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsMvndtd3KPAvJ3q7zKZuNSB1R3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10685'),
  ('358588192577421281', 'The Watcher', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Pedro Luque, Ryan Rothmaier', 'Ryan Rothmaier', 'Erin Cahill, Edi Gathegi, Denise Crosby, Riley Baron, Kevin Daniels, Tracie Thoms, Obba Babatundé, Sab Shimono', 'PG-13', 'Unaware of its terrible history, a young couple purchases their dream home. But it soon becomes clear that they may not be alone in the house... and that someone -- or something -- is determined to drive them out.', 'Unaware of its terrible history, a young couple purchases their dream home. But it soon becomes clear that they may not be alone in the house... and that someone -- or something -- is determined to drive them out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVQYgAZCgkRRSWC2gnj71Ndj19T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421049'),
  ('279252510616542349', 'The Watcher in the Woods', 1980, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'John Hough', 'Gerry Day', 'Bette Davis, Lynn-Holly Johnson, Kyle Richards, Carroll Baker, David McCallum, Benedict Taylor, Frances Cuka, Richard Pasco', 'PG', 'After an American family moves to an old country manor in rural England, one of the daughters is tormented by the spirit of the owner''s long lost daughter, who mysteriously disappeared 30 years ago during a solar eclipse.', 'After an American family moves to an old country manor in rural England, one of the daughters is tormented by the spirit of the owner''s long lost daughter, who mysteriously disappeared 30 years ago during a solar eclipse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eamuIAxT8SOZ4vmGINLS83z2PYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21970'),
  ('416270525862059641', 'The Watchers', 2024, 'Fantasy, Horror, Mystery', 'Daithí Quinn, Ian Adams, Jack Eustace', 'Ishana Night Shyamalan', 'Dakota Fanning, Georgina Campbell, Olwen Fouéré, Oliver Finnegan, Alistair Brammer, John Lynch, Siobhan Hewlett, Hannah Dargan', 'PG-13', 'A young artist gets stranded in an extensive, immaculate forest in western Ireland, where, after finding shelter, she becomes trapped alongside three strangers, stalked by mysterious creatures each night.', 'A young artist gets stranded in an extensive, immaculate forest in western Ireland, where, after finding shelter, she becomes trapped alongside three strangers, stalked by mysterious creatures each night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZVEUPychdvZLrTNwWErr9xZFmu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1086747'),
  ('636711890496437231', 'The Watchmaker', 2026, 'Crime', 'Jonas Lawes', 'Sebastian Secker-Walker, Sebastian Secker Walker', 'Olle Sarri, Hanna Alström, Casper Berglund, Otto Fahlgren, Jarmo Mäkinen', null, 'Stockholm, February 1968. A petty theft spirals when Sebbe and Adam accidentally destroy the pocket watch meant for an unknown client. Desperate, they turn to watchmaker Karl for an urgent repair, but their anxiety soon shifts to a darker fear. Confined to Karl’s cramped workshop, distrust and rising paranoia transform their predicament into a claustrophobic psychological chamber play. As midnight nears, buried truths and old revenge surface.', 'Stockholm, February 1968. A petty theft spirals when Sebbe and Adam accidentally destroy the pocket watch meant for an unknown client. Desperate, they turn to watchmaker Karl for an urgent repair, but their anxiety soon shifts to a darker fear. Confined to Karl’s cramped workshop, distrust and rising paranoia transform their predicament into a claustrophobic psychological chamber play. As midnight nears, buried truths and old revenge surface.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FjZv1nU6OSEVA8nyDNkT1U3yIFhh.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-watchmaker-2026'),
  ('541905689735046314', 'The Watchmaker of St. Paul', 1974, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Pierre-William Glenn, Claude Othnin-Girard', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Jean Aurenche, Pierre Bost', 'Philippe Noiret, Jean Rochefort, Jacques Denis, Yves Afonso, Julien Bertheau, Jacques Hilling, Clotilde Joano, Andrée Tainsy', null, 'Lyons, France. Michel Descombes is a watchmaker who lives alone with his teenage son Bernard. When the police visit and informs him that Bernard killed a man and is on the run with a girl, Michel realizes that he knew far less about his son than he thought.', 'Lyons, France. Michel Descombes is a watchmaker who lives alone with his teenage son Bernard. When the police visit and informs him that Bernard killed a man and is on the run with a girl, Michel realizes that he knew far less about his son than he thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLDETyjhqsEDmryQ17i46wV3ECr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8425'),
  ('852361565887069776', 'The Watchman', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Nikita Gankin, Anzhela Timerkhanova, Evgeny Goryainov', 'Yury Bykov', 'Yury Bykov, Vladislav Abashin, Alla Yuganova, Arthur Beschastny, Gela Meskhi, Oleg Zima, Aleksey Simonov, Nikolay Kozak', null, 'The protagonist Vlad is a man of about forty; he lives and works as watchman in an old sanatorium that is due to be demolished. He obviously needs this work to live the life of a hermit. One night a married couple appears at the sanatorium: Vera and Stas. They are on the run. They are pursued by former friends and business partners of Stas. Vlad decides to help them, because he too is hiding from the past. Each character is threatened with the inevitable payment for wrong choices in the past, but helping each other, they try to expiate these faults.', 'The protagonist Vlad is a man of about forty; he lives and works as watchman in an old sanatorium that is due to be demolished. He obviously needs this work to live the life of a hermit. One night a married couple appears at the sanatorium: Vera and Stas. They are on the run. They are pursued by former friends and business partners of Stas. Vlad decides to help them, because he too is hiding from the past. Each character is threatened with the inevitable payment for wrong choices in the past, but helping each other, they try to expiate these faults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67w4MXBPE0AA47QRDh0yuIJO2rf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575184'),
  ('790597460074083558', 'The Water', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Elena López Riera, Giuseppe Truppi, Irene Díaz', 'Philippe Azoury, Elena López Riera', 'Bárbara Lennie, Nieve de Medina, Luna Pamiés, Alberto Olmo, Irene Pellicer, Pascual Valero, Nayara Garcia, Lidia Maria Canovas', null, 'Ana, her mother and grandmother live in a small town in southeastern Spain where all three are regarded with suspicion.', 'Ana, her mother and grandmother live in a small town in southeastern Spain where all three are regarded with suspicion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUdDRXx1EaJ299Zl2kTkVJGOhm0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936386'),
  ('299049248180914992', 'The Water Babies', 1978, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, Adventure, Music', 'Lionel Jeffries, Edward Scaife, Tony Cuthbert', 'Michael Robson', 'James Mason, Bernard Cribbins, Billie Whitelaw, Tommy Pender, Samantha Gates, Joan Greenwood, David Tomlinson, Jon Pertwee', null, 'Grimes, an amoral chimney sweep, occasionally likes to steal valuables from his clients. One day, on the verge of being caught, he frames his young apprentice, Tom, for the crime. Tom runs away and jumps into a river where, instead of drowning, he finds himself transformed into a mystical aquatic creature. Swimming and breathing effortlessly, he discovers a colorful underwater world replete with creatures both cruel and kind.', 'Grimes, an amoral chimney sweep, occasionally likes to steal valuables from his clients. One day, on the verge of being caught, he frames his young apprentice, Tom, for the crime. Tom runs away and jumps into a river where, instead of drowning, he finds himself transformed into a mystical aquatic creature. Swimming and breathing effortlessly, he discovers a colorful underwater world replete with creatures both cruel and kind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpgFomQKyvpsxazK0SB5pB7S8xo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34467'),
  ('560522585914373488', 'The Water Diviner', 2014, 'War, Drama', 'Russell Crowe, Andrew Lesnie, Tuesday Stone', 'Andrew Anastasios, Andrew Knight', 'Russell Crowe, Olga Kurylenko, Yılmaz Erdoğan, Cem Yılmaz, Jai Courtney, Ryan Corr, James Fraser, Ben O''Toole', 'R', 'In 1919, Australian farmer Joshua Connor travels to Turkey to discover the fate of his three sons, reported missing in action. Holding on to hope, Joshua must travel across the war-torn landscape to find the truth and his own peace.', 'In 1919, Australian farmer Joshua Connor travels to Turkey to discover the fate of his three sons, reported missing in action. Holding on to hope, Joshua must travel across the war-torn landscape to find the truth and his own peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIlVtC22BDNiiAiCvSZoOS7FhY9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256917'),
  ('1095245164513015595', 'The Water Horse', 2007, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Jay Russell, Oliver Stapleton, Sarah Rose', 'Robert Nelson Jacobs', 'Alex Etel, Emily Watson, Ben Chaplin, David Morrissey, Priyanka Xi, Craig Hall, Brian Cox, Erroll Shand', 'PG', 'A lonely boy discovers a mysterious egg that hatches a sea creature of Scottish legend.', 'A lonely boy discovers a mysterious egg that hatches a sea creature of Scottish legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9DV6KItNutJmrPzT1xrAO6fIzy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54318'),
  ('134294833537928669', 'The Water Magician', 1933, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Shigeru Miki, Seiryo Takuaki', 'Yasunaga Higashibōjō, Shinji Masuda, Kennosuke Tateoka', 'Takako Irie, Tokihiko Okada, Ichirō Sugai, Bontarō Miake, Kumeko Urabe, Suzuko Taki, Kôji Ôizumi, Joe Ohara', null, 'Taki no Shiraito is a very independent young woman with a famous water juggling act in a travelling carnival troupe. She falls in love with an orphaned carriage driver Kinya Murakoshi, and pledges to put him through law school in Tokyo. She always encloses money in her letters to him, until one hard winter there is no work to be found.', 'Taki no Shiraito is a very independent young woman with a famous water juggling act in a travelling carnival troupe. She falls in love with an orphaned carriage driver Kinya Murakoshi, and pledges to put him through law school in Tokyo. She always encloses money in her letters to him, until one hard winter there is no work to be found.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swsj8ztIliCleW4IrseIk5TcAfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168751'),
  ('167836204101426100', 'The Water Man', 2020, 'Adventure', 'David Oyelowo, Matthew J. Lloyd, Ime Etuk', 'Emily A. Needell', 'David Oyelowo, Amiah Miller, Lonnie Chavis, Rosario Dawson, Maria Bello, Alfred Molina, Aaron Trainor, Ted Rooney', 'PG', 'Hoping to save his sick mother, a boy named Gunner and his friend Jo venture into the remote Wild Horse forest to search for a mythical figure who possesses the secret to immortality. When they go missing, Gunner''s father Amos must immerse himself in his son''s world to find them.', 'Hoping to save his sick mother, a boy named Gunner and his friend Jo venture into the remote Wild Horse forest to search for a mythical figure who possesses the secret to immortality. When they go missing, Gunner''s father Amos must immerse himself in his son''s world to find them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krupbFlSTnnKIjpRryrg2CTdeIL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346687'),
  ('974710392246127851', 'The Water Margin', 1972, 'Action, Drama', 'Pao Hsueh-Li, Wu Ma, Chang Cheh', 'Ni Kuang', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Tetsuro Tamba, Toshio Kurosawa, Tung Lin, Ku Feng, Chin Feng, Elliot Ngok Wah, Wong Chung', null, 'The corruption in the Sung Dynasty of 11th century China is so rampant that it inspires a band of Oriental Robin Hoods - the Honorable 108. Mountain bandits who nevertheless live by a scrupulous code of conduct, the Honorable 108 pledge to end the repression of the brutal overlords.', 'The corruption in the Sung Dynasty of 11th century China is so rampant that it inspires a band of Oriental Robin Hoods - the Honorable 108. Mountain bandits who nevertheless live by a scrupulous code of conduct, the Honorable 108 pledge to end the repression of the brutal overlords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEWO3xJiiqBPAsyPLsZmo54HK3C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43672'),
  ('518895555929005600', 'The Water Monster', 2019, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Xiang Hesheng, Xiang Qiuliang', null, 'Liu Lincheng, Zhu Lilan, Wang Hongqian, Wu Hao, Wang Jianguo, Rong Weifeng, Li Da Chuan, Le Sihong', null, 'Shui Sheng witnessed his father being killed by the "water monkey" monster when he was young. Ten years later, the water monster reappeared and killed the younger brother and father of the heroine Xiang Lan. In order to save her, Shui Sheng launched a fierce battle to break feudal superstitions and to catch the water monster.', 'Shui Sheng witnessed his father being killed by the "water monkey" monster when he was young. Ten years later, the water monster reappeared and killed the younger brother and father of the heroine Xiang Lan. In order to save her, Shui Sheng launched a fierce battle to break feudal superstitions and to catch the water monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EIuwtPElLUtoxFkPR6ROSftYbe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615925'),
  ('1140712559323143004', 'The Waterboy', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Frank Coraci, Steven Bernstein, Marty Eli Schwartz', 'Adam Sandler, Tim Herlihy', 'Adam Sandler, Kathy Bates, Henry Winkler, Fairuza Balk, Jerry Reed, Lawrence Gilliard Jr., Blake Clark, Peter Dante', 'PG-13', 'Bobby Boucher is a water boy for a struggling college football team. The coach discovers Boucher''s hidden rage makes him a tackling machine whose bone-crushing power might vault his team into the playoffs.', 'Bobby Boucher is a water boy for a struggling college football team. The coach discovers Boucher''s hidden rage makes him a tackling machine whose bone-crushing power might vault his team into the playoffs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miT42qWYC4D0n2mXNzJ9VfhheWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10663'),
  ('900590496549230434', 'The Waterdance', 1992, 'Drama', 'Neal Jimenez, Michael Steinberg, Mark Plummer', 'Neal Jimenez', 'Eric Stoltz, Helen Hunt, Wesley Snipes, William Forsythe, Elizabeth Peña, William Allen Young, Tony Genaro, Grace Zabriskie', 'R', 'Author Joel Garcia breaks his neck while hiking, and finds himself in a rehab center with Raymond, an exaggerating ladies man, and Bloss, a racist biker. Considerable tension builds as each character tries to deal with his new found handicap and the problems that go with it, especially Joel, whose lover Anna is having as difficult a time as he is.', 'Author Joel Garcia breaks his neck while hiking, and finds himself in a rehab center with Raymond, an exaggerating ladies man, and Bloss, a racist biker. Considerable tension builds as each character tries to deal with his new found handicap and the problems that go with it, especially Joel, whose lover Anna is having as difficult a time as he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fLc2xBZ3lK6AToG7iO1v1UAeqJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61418'),
  ('318189348408134536', 'The Watermelon Woman', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Cheryl Dunye, Renae Dinnerman, Ted Shields', 'Cheryl Dunye, Douglas McKeown', 'Cheryl Dunye, Guinevere Turner, Valarie Walker, Lisa Marie Bronson, Cheryl Clarke, Irene Dunye, Brian Freeman, Ira Jeffries', null, 'A young black lesbian filmmaker probes into the life of The Watermelon Woman, a 1930s black actress who played ''mammy'' archetypes.', 'A young black lesbian filmmaker probes into the life of The Watermelon Woman, a 1930s black actress who played ''mammy'' archetypes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBBqKfkvzSk6Rk7bfRXU9kR916N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44479'),
  ('753675232020189449', 'The Watermill Princess', 1994, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Zdeněk Troška, Renata Čihulková, Marek Kališ', 'Vratislav Marek, Zdeněk Troška', 'Radek Valenta, Andrea Černá, Yvetta Blanarovičová, Jakub Zindulka, Lucie Bílá, Alois Švehlík, Oto Ševčík, Ladislav Županič', null, 'In a South Bohemian village in the middle of silver ponds and dark forests lives Jindřich (Radek Valenta), who one day goes out into the world with a firm decision to free the cursed princess. On the way, he reaches a haunted mill, where the beautiful Eliška (Andrea Černá) lives with her father. Eliška likes the young man, so she tells him that the cursed princess is in the pond and Jindřich remains in the mill as a helper. However, the devil and the waterman, who like Eliška, don''t like that. With the help of various intrigues and incantations, they try to expel Jindřich from the mill, but soon a third groom appears there - an old rich man. However, since Eliška rejects all the suitors, the miller''s father gets angry and gives her an ultimatum: either she chooses a suitor herself by the full moon, or the one who asks for her hand first gets her. So a fight ensues between the grooms...', 'In a South Bohemian village in the middle of silver ponds and dark forests lives Jindřich (Radek Valenta), who one day goes out into the world with a firm decision to free the cursed princess. On the way, he reaches a haunted mill, where the beautiful Eliška (Andrea Černá) lives with her father. Eliška likes the young man, so she tells him that the cursed princess is in the pond and Jindřich remains in the mill as a helper. However, the devil and the waterman, who like Eliška, don''t like that. With the help of various intrigues and incantations, they try to expel Jindřich from the mill, but soon a third groom appears there - an old rich man. However, since Eliška rejects all the suitors, the miller''s father gets angry and gives her an ultimatum: either she chooses a suitor herself by the full moon, or the one who asks for her hand first gets her. So a fight ensues between the grooms...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kopmdZqBQ4NT4FhjIF3goDVUMMX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82716'),
  ('624515783399706698', 'The Wave', 1981, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Alexander Grasshoff, Hanania Baer, Leslie Waldman', null, 'Bruce Davison, Lori Lethin, John Putch, Johnny Doran, Pasha Gray, Wesley Pfenning, Marc Copage, Robert DeLapp', null, 'A teacher conducts an experiment in an American high school where students learn how easy it is to be seduced by the same social forces which led to the horrors of Nazi Germany.', 'A teacher conducts an experiment in an American high school where students learn how easy it is to be seduced by the same social forces which led to the horrors of Nazi Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ua2Z4aWCF2NBk3MuMP0JfCMqlys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31074'),
  ('841920983927082480', 'The Wave', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Dennis Gansel, Torsten Breuer, Hendrik Holler', 'Johnny Dawkins', 'Jürgen Vogel, Frederick Lau, Max Riemelt, Jennifer Ulrich, Christiane Paul, Elyas M''Barek, Cristina do Rego, Jacob Matschenz', null, 'A school teacher discusses types of government with his class. His students find it too boring to repeatedly go over national socialism and believe that dictatorship cannot be established in modern Germany. He starts an experiment to show how easily the masses can become manipulated.', 'A school teacher discusses types of government with his class. His students find it too boring to repeatedly go over national socialism and believe that dictatorship cannot be established in modern Germany. He starts an experiment to show how easily the masses can become manipulated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtJ4u0fpTZhibxAJHzXtcdCxhsL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7735'),
  ('228860811742986260', 'The Wave', 2015, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Roar Uthaug, Anders Granlund, John Christian Rosenlund', 'John Kåre Raake, Harald Rosenløw-Eeg', 'Kristoffer Joner, Ane Dahl Torp, Jonas Hoff Oftebro, Edith Haagenrud-Sande, Fridtjov Såheim, Laila Goody, Arthur Berning, Herman Bernhoft', 'R', 'Although theorised, no one is really ready when a mountain pass above the scenic and narrow Geiranger fjord in Norway collapses and creates a tsunami over 300 feet high. A geologist is one of those caught in the middle of it.', 'Although theorised, no one is really ready when a mountain pass above the scenic and narrow Geiranger fjord in Norway collapses and creates a tsunami over 300 feet high. A geologist is one of those caught in the middle of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUra0UF9MLlTRZH9LCA8xYvhd6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336882'),
  ('858050362703615697', 'The Wave', 2019, 'Science Fiction', 'Gille Klabin, Aaron Grasso', 'Carl W. Lucas', 'Justin Long, Tommy Flanagan, Katia Winter, Donald Faison, Sheila Vand, Sarah Minnich, Bill Sage, Monique Candelaria', 'R', 'A man on the verge of a promotion takes a mysterious hallucinogenic drug that begins to tear down his reality and expose his life for what it really is.', 'A man on the verge of a promotion takes a mysterious hallucinogenic drug that begins to tear down his reality and expose his life for what it really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWFHGTfCOzMphfJW3DPdfbq7Vyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619263'),
  ('656037147278447298', 'The Wax Mask', 1997, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Sergio Stivaletti, Sergio Salvati', 'Lucio Fulci, Daniele Stroppa', 'Robert Hossein, Romina Mondello, Riccardo Serventi Longhi, Gabriella Giorgelli, Umberto Balli, Valery Valmond, Gianni Franco, Massimo Vanni', null, 'Paris, 1900: a couple are horribly murdered by a masked man with a metal claw who rips their hearts out. The sole survivor and witness to the massacre is a young girl. Twelve years later in Rome a new wax museum is opened, whose main attractions are lifelike recreations of gruesome murder scenes. A young man bets that he will spend the night in the museum but is found dead the morning after. Soon, people start disappearing from the streets of Rome and the wax museum halls begin filling with new figures...', 'Paris, 1900: a couple are horribly murdered by a masked man with a metal claw who rips their hearts out. The sole survivor and witness to the massacre is a young girl. Twelve years later in Rome a new wax museum is opened, whose main attractions are lifelike recreations of gruesome murder scenes. A young man bets that he will spend the night in the museum but is found dead the morning after. Soon, people start disappearing from the streets of Rome and the wax museum halls begin filling with new figures...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBaPj7OLO3nFL5z5lDcsxP2hGWw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28494'),
  ('232744050467743083', 'The Way', 2010, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Emilio Estevez, Juan Miguel Azpiroz', 'Jack Hitt', 'Martin Sheen, Emilio Estevez, Deborah Kara Unger, Yorick van Wageningen, James Nesbitt, Tchéky Karyo, Ángela Molina, Carlos Leal', 'PG-13', 'When his son dies while hiking the famed Camino de Santiago pilgrimage route in the Pyrenees, Tom flies to France to claim the remains. Looking for insights into his estranged child’s life, he decides to complete the 500-mile mountain trek to Spain. Tom soon joins up with other travelers and realizes they’re all searching for something.', 'When his son dies while hiking the famed Camino de Santiago pilgrimage route in the Pyrenees, Tom flies to France to claim the remains. Looking for insights into his estranged child’s life, he decides to complete the 500-mile mountain trek to Spain. Tom soon joins up with other travelers and realizes they’re all searching for something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaRfG7n92IiuYcKLl7LJo2gr6qO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59468'),
  ('167021839760775205', 'The Way Ahead', 1944, 'Drama, War', 'Carol Reed, Guy Green, Frank Bevis', 'Eric Ambler, Peter Ustinov', 'David Niven, Stanley Holloway, James Donald, John Laurie, Leslie Dwyer, Hugh Burden, Raymond Huntley, Jimmy Hanley', 'NR', 'A mismatched collection of conscripted civilians find training tough under Lieutenant Jim Perry and Sergeant Ned Fletcher when they are called up to replace an infantry battalion that had suffered casualties at Dunkirk.', 'A mismatched collection of conscripted civilians find training tough under Lieutenant Jim Perry and Sergeant Ned Fletcher when they are called up to replace an infantry battalion that had suffered casualties at Dunkirk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJP2JsLnlyv4pkT7crrJYz0V4pE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28916'),
  ('1102249557531852765', 'The way back', 2014, 'Animation', 'Sang-a Oh', 'Hui-hwan Cheon, Sang-a Oh', 'Su-bin Jeon, Jong-wook Choi', null, 'Passing all four seasons for a day, she is on her way back. And then, she falls into a peaceful sleep with a cozy feeling that doesn''t exist anywhere.', 'Passing all four seasons for a day, she is on her way back. And then, she falls into a peaceful sleep with a cozy feeling that doesn''t exist anywhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piTJDpadPGLmhFuOby9330h8zy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308429'),
  ('871116890284036660', 'The Way Back', 2010, 'Drama, Adventure, History', 'Peter Weir, Russell Boyd, Emil Gigov', 'Peter Weir, Keith R. Clarke', 'Ed Harris, Jim Sturgess, Saoirse Ronan, Colin Farrell, Mark Strong, Gustaf Skarsgård, Dejan Angelov, Dragoș Bucur', 'PG-13', 'A small band of multicultural convicts stages a daring escape from a WWII-era Siberian gulag, and embarks on a treacherous journey across five countries in a desperate race for freedom and survival.', 'A small band of multicultural convicts stages a daring escape from a WWII-era Siberian gulag, and embarks on a treacherous journey across five countries in a desperate race for freedom and survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQ6hxfpD5XQGJz0ekVle5zegam7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49009'),
  ('751278632710443740', 'The Way Back', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Maxime Jenne, Dimitri Petrovic', null, 'Hussein Rassim, Juliette Lacroix', null, 'Hüseyin Al Baldawi arrives in Brussels in August 2015. He has traveled thousands of kilometers until he got there from Iraq. A year after his arrival, he receives his residence permit and decides to go to Greece. This journey from Brussels to Athens involves the viewers on the difficulties faced by Hüseyin and thousands of other immigrants. While the story of Hüseyin is taking shape through the countries he travels, the forgotten people he meets and the selfish society of Europe give us many messages, as well.', 'Hüseyin Al Baldawi arrives in Brussels in August 2015. He has traveled thousands of kilometers until he got there from Iraq. A year after his arrival, he receives his residence permit and decides to go to Greece. This journey from Brussels to Athens involves the viewers on the difficulties faced by Hüseyin and thousands of other immigrants. While the story of Hüseyin is taking shape through the countries he travels, the forgotten people he meets and the selfish society of Europe give us many messages, as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgCwIG0DyXf0uLlRQPGa2b4sQeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716220'),
  ('887034440369854447', 'The Way Back', 2020, 'Drama', 'Gavin O''Connor, Eduard Grau, Kevin Lum', 'Brad Ingelsby', 'Ben Affleck, Al Madrigal, Michaela Watkins, Janina Gavankar, Glynn Turman, Melvin Gregg, Brandon Wilson, Will Ropp', 'R', 'A former basketball all-star, who has lost his wife and family foundation in a struggle with addiction, attempts to regain his soul and salvation by becoming the coach of a disparate ethnically mixed high school basketball team at his alma mater.', 'A former basketball all-star, who has lost his wife and family foundation in a struggle with addiction, attempts to regain his soul and salvation by becoming the coach of a disparate ethnically mixed high school basketball team at his alma mater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylPnfaphW3FrLBUVwAREVtiL9My.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529485'),
  ('822160284604978173', 'The way back home', null, null, 'Hugo Casto', null, null, null, 'After a hangout, a young man goes on a long journey back home.', 'After a hangout, a young man goes on a long journey back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2VhEgDilqE8FyiSIPd7QArFpdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1293571'),
  ('74759431939956118', 'The way back home', 2023, 'Drama', 'Karin Miyagi', 'Karin Miyagi', 'Rintaro Mizusawa, Takara Sakumoto, Teruhiro Tanaka, Sora Shiota, Hitomi Kyan, Yoshi Sakō, Masato Hagiwara', null, 'Childhood friends Hinata and Hayato are training hard in kendo for their final high school inter-high school competition. One day, Hinata is scouted by an entertainment agency. This causes a rift in their relationship. The film depicts these two young boys who grow up to be adults while still carrying the pain & doubts from their youth.', 'Childhood friends Hinata and Hayato are training hard in kendo for their final high school inter-high school competition. One day, Hinata is scouted by an entertainment agency. This causes a rift in their relationship. The film depicts these two young boys who grow up to be adults while still carrying the pain & doubts from their youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lg3eVtBoAi47kWXHBvLyHlqYe1S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1139188'),
  ('475969517682901701', 'The Way Home', 1981, 'Drama, History', 'Aleqsandre Rekhviashvili, Archil Pilipashvili', 'Aleqsandre Rekhviashvili, Erlom Akhvlediani, Rezo Kveselava', 'Vakhtang Panchulidze, Ramaz Chkhikvadze, Avtandil Makharadze, Zhanri Lolashvili, Vladimer Tsuladze, Teimuraz Bichiashvili, Zura Kipshidze, Zinaida Kverenchkhiladze', null, 'The film is set in southern Georgia during Ottoman control, where inhabitants, who were driven from their homes due to enemy invasions, try to return home through different means. One of these inhabitants is the young scholar Antimoz.', 'The film is set in southern Georgia during Ottoman control, where inhabitants, who were driven from their homes due to enemy invasions, try to return home through different means. One of these inhabitants is the young scholar Antimoz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkDZc7NxN491B2aatCqgy49Rb2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262732'),
  ('979598221179153939', 'The Way Home', 2002, 'Drama, Family', 'Lee Jeong-hyang, Lee Chol-o, Yoon Hong-sik', 'Lee Jeong-hyang', 'Kim Eul-boon, Yoo Seung-ho, Dong Hyo-hee, Min Kyung-Hyun, Yim Eun-kyung', null, 'This is the story of a 7-year-old boy, Sang-woo, born and raised in the big city, and his mute grandmother, who has spent her whole life in a small rural village.', 'This is the story of a 7-year-old boy, Sang-woo, born and raised in the big city, and his mute grandmother, who has spent her whole life in a small rural village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rydddngVZNdOFEvdYpIxiY3A6om.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33251'),
  ('787606082135318302', 'The Way I See It', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Dawn Porter, Clair Popkin', null, 'Pete Souza, Barack Obama, Donald Trump, Samantha Power, Susan Rice, Michelle Obama, Melania Trump, Joe Biden', 'PG-13', 'Former Chief Official White House Photographer Pete Souza''s journey as a person with top secret clearance and total access to the President.', 'Former Chief Official White House Photographer Pete Souza''s journey as a person with top secret clearance and total access to the President.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxbjC3Pzs9WTD7yz7aMMzm6fBIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729779'),
  ('825451204972710628', 'The Way I Spent the End of the World', 2006, 'Drama', 'Cătălin Mitulescu, Marius Panduru', 'Andreea Vălean, Cătălin Mitulescu', 'Timotei Duma , Dorotheea Petre, Carmen Ungureanu , Ionuţ Becheru , Cristian Văraru, Jean Constantin, Monalisa Basarab, Florin Zamfirescu', null, 'Bucharest 1989 - the last year of Ceausecu''s dictatorship. Eva lives with her parents and her 7 year old brother, Lalalilu. One day at school, Eva and her boyfriend accidentally break a bust of Ceausescu. They are forced to confess their crime before a disciplinary committee and Eva is expelled from school and transferred to a reformatory establishment. There she meets Andrei, and decides to escape Romania with him. Lalalilu becomes convinced that Ceausescu is the main reason for Eva''s decision to leave. So with his friends from school he devises a plan to kill the dictator.', 'Bucharest 1989 - the last year of Ceausecu''s dictatorship. Eva lives with her parents and her 7 year old brother, Lalalilu. One day at school, Eva and her boyfriend accidentally break a bust of Ceausescu. They are forced to confess their crime before a disciplinary committee and Eva is expelled from school and transferred to a reformatory establishment. There she meets Andrei, and decides to escape Romania with him. Lalalilu becomes convinced that Ceausescu is the main reason for Eva''s decision to leave. So with his friends from school he devises a plan to kill the dictator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIjQQ7XR2CBB58XSmmYeH2G0fFg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96010'),
  ('192057396708295108', 'The Way of the Bug', 2018, 'Comedy, Action', 'Xiao Shenyang', null, 'Xiao Shenyang, Pan Binlong, Vivian Sung, Michael Chan Wai-Man, King Shih-chieh, Liu Hua, Cao Rui, Hu Ming', null, 'A young man from a rural village travels a long way to meet his long-lost grandfather on his deathbed, only to find himself taking over the large triad enterprise his grandfather left behind, with hilarious results.', 'A young man from a rural village travels a long way to meet his long-lost grandfather on his deathbed, only to find himself taking over the large triad enterprise his grandfather left behind, with hilarious results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lDGYxg9VYaPMcbTLKISPFUIX5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536370'),
  ('1088364795473525248', 'The Way of the Dragon', 1972, 'Action, Crime', 'Tadashi Nishimoto, Bruce Lee, Chih Yao-Chang', 'Bruce Lee', 'Bruce Lee, Nora Miao, Chuck Norris, Wei Ping-Ao, Huang Tsung-Hsun, Robert Wall, Hwang In-shik, Chin Ti', null, 'After a Chinese restaurant in Rome is threatened by the mafia, who will stop at nothing to acquire the property, the owner recruits a family friend in Hong Kong, kung fu expert Tang Lung, to help them defend their business.', 'After a Chinese restaurant in Rome is threatened by the mafia, who will stop at nothing to acquire the property, the owner recruits a family friend in Hong Kong, kung fu expert Tang Lung, to help them defend their business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7AIITQ624sfldI4SsX4htXPH1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9462'),
  ('914740593512726423', 'The Way of the Gun', 2000, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Christopher McQuarrie, Susie Balaban, Kenneth Kokin', 'Christopher McQuarrie', 'Ryan Phillippe, Benicio del Toro, Juliette Lewis, Taye Diggs, Nicky Katt, Geoffrey Lewis, Scott Wilson, Dylan Kussman', 'R', 'Two criminal drifters without sympathy get more than they bargained for after kidnapping and holding for ransom the surrogate mother of a powerful and shady man.', 'Two criminal drifters without sympathy get more than they bargained for after kidnapping and holding for ransom the surrogate mother of a powerful and shady man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrjMMdgn1a4ChlaBmlzKnb78nr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1619'),
  ('958108955495506869', 'The Way of the Househusband: The Cinema', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Toichiro Ruto, Toshiya Matsushita, TAKANO Manabu', 'Manabu Uda, Toichiro Ruto', 'Hiroshi Tamaki, Haruna Kawaguchi, Jun Shison, Yuta Furukawa, Tina Tamashiro, Naoto Takenaka, Izumi Inamori, Kenichi Takitoh', null, 'The most notorious househusband in history appears!! The sinister yakuza who left behind many legends in the underworld, "The Immortal Dragon". He washed his hands of the yakuza lifestyle, and the new path he chose… was "househusband"! In the never-before-seen narrative, "Tacchan" charmed living rooms everywhere. And now the "ultimate spokesman for housewives (and househusbands) everywhere,"the Yakuza Househusband, returns!', 'The most notorious househusband in history appears!! The sinister yakuza who left behind many legends in the underworld, "The Immortal Dragon". He washed his hands of the yakuza lifestyle, and the new path he chose… was "househusband"! In the never-before-seen narrative, "Tacchan" charmed living rooms everywhere. And now the "ultimate spokesman for housewives (and househusbands) everywhere,"the Yakuza Househusband, returns!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pd7JQ7hnwgTKEgM4L22Yx1WbqtB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950565'),
  ('697188858160104231', 'The Way of War', 2009, 'Action, Thriller', 'John Carter', 'Scott Schafer', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., J.K. Simmons, John Terry, Jaclyn DeSantis, Lance Reddick, Clarence Williams III, Jayson Warner Smith, Sarah Ann Schultz', 'R', 'Paramilitary operative David Wolfe stumbles upon an international conspiracy connecting presidential cabinet members to a Middle Eastern terrorist plot. Wanting to expose the truth, Wolfe defies orders and returns to the US as an army of one fighting for American security and integrity', 'Paramilitary operative David Wolfe stumbles upon an international conspiracy connecting presidential cabinet members to a Middle Eastern terrorist plot. Wanting to expose the truth, Wolfe defies orders and returns to the US as an army of one fighting for American security and integrity', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24dZfEqkJnLTYjPJfPUJGr2GrX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15945'),
  ('200950404276272887', 'The Way Things Go', 1987, 'Documentary', 'Peter Fischli, David Weiss, Pio Corradi', 'Peter Fischli, David Weiss', null, null, 'Artists Peter Fischli and David Weiss create the ultimate Rube Goldberg machine. The pair used found objects to construct a complex, interdependent contraption in an empty warehouse. When set in motion, a domino-like chain reaction ripples through the complex of imaginative devices. Fire, water, the laws of gravity, and chemistry determine the life-cycle of the objects. The process reveals a story concerning cause and effect, mechanism and art, and improbability and precision, in an extended science project that will mesmerize the mind.', 'Artists Peter Fischli and David Weiss create the ultimate Rube Goldberg machine. The pair used found objects to construct a complex, interdependent contraption in an empty warehouse. When set in motion, a domino-like chain reaction ripples through the complex of imaginative devices. Fire, water, the laws of gravity, and chemistry determine the life-cycle of the objects. The process reveals a story concerning cause and effect, mechanism and art, and improbability and precision, in an extended science project that will mesmerize the mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Av0uOmsji4IZWrUHa6CnVZBULL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1388'),
  ('30430991894823690', 'The Way to Shadow Garden', 1954, 'Horror', 'Stan Brakhage', 'Stan Brakhage', 'Walter Newcomb', null, 'This way madness - or experimental filmmaking - lies. A solitary man in coat and tie enters an apartment. It''s midnight. He appears agitated and distraught. He throws a glass of water in his face and laughs. He takes off the coat and tie. His moods swing. He stares at a light bulb. He removes his shirt. He lights a cigarette. He looks at a book. He does something drastic and self-destructive. He opens doors to a garden.', 'This way madness - or experimental filmmaking - lies. A solitary man in coat and tie enters an apartment. It''s midnight. He appears agitated and distraught. He throws a glass of water in his face and laughs. He takes off the coat and tie. His moods swing. He stares at a light bulb. He removes his shirt. He lights a cigarette. He looks at a book. He does something drastic and self-destructive. He opens doors to a garden.', null, 'tmdb:movie:150906'),
  ('126305441775598827', 'The Way to the Heart', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Wendy Ord, Mike Kroetsch, Jana Phillips', 'Alexa Gilker', 'Meghan Heffern, Peter Graham, Jon Cor, Sydney Hendricks, Bob Blumer, Will Taylor, Sandra Clermont, Anna Jacyszyn', null, 'Ava, an award-winning chef at a big-city restaurant, has lost her spark. Her boss sends her out to find herself to save her menu and her job. She returns home and finds little to inspire her, but when she reunites with her childhood friend Logan, Ava has to get her head out of the clouds and her foot out of her mouth to rediscover her passion for food.', 'Ava, an award-winning chef at a big-city restaurant, has lost her spark. Her boss sends her out to find herself to save her menu and her job. She returns home and finds little to inspire her, but when she reunites with her childhood friend Logan, Ava has to get her head out of the clouds and her foot out of her mouth to rediscover her passion for food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFKzEhOhkPwMxWms1n15xLMCXa2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987032'),
  ('844457261565327722', 'The Way to the Stars', 1945, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Anthony Asquith, Derick Williams, Anthony Hearne', 'Richard Sherman', 'Michael Redgrave, John Mills, Rosamund John, Douglass Montgomery, Renée Asherson, Stanley Holloway, Basil Radford, Felix Aylmer', 'NR', 'Life on a British bomber base, and the surrounding towns, from the opening days of the Battle of Britain, to the arrival of the Americans, who join in the bomber offensive. The film centres around Pilot Officer Peter Penrose, fresh out of a training unit, who joins the squadron, and quickly discovers about life during war time. He falls for Iris, a young girl who lives at the local hotel, but he becomes disillusioned about marriage, when the squadron commander dies in a raid, and leaves his wife, the hotel manageress, with a young son to bring up. As the war progresses, Penross comes to terms that he has survived, while others have been killed.', 'Life on a British bomber base, and the surrounding towns, from the opening days of the Battle of Britain, to the arrival of the Americans, who join in the bomber offensive. The film centres around Pilot Officer Peter Penrose, fresh out of a training unit, who joins the squadron, and quickly discovers about life during war time. He falls for Iris, a young girl who lives at the local hotel, but he becomes disillusioned about marriage, when the squadron commander dies in a raid, and leaves his wife, the hotel manageress, with a young son to bring up. As the war progresses, Penross comes to terms that he has survived, while others have been killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBxYrwRZ5YSqQplA2pF80JbyOFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44087'),
  ('233854726142193545', 'The Way to You', 2026, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Norma Bailey, Paul Suderman', 'Nicole Baxter', 'Kim Matula, Aaron O''Connell, Sarah Luby, Jacob Blair, Chelsea Brown', 'TV-G', 'New Yorkers Emma and Conrad agree to help each other find their missed connections after a subway blackout. Their search might lead to love, but not where either of them expects to find it.', 'New Yorkers Emma and Conrad agree to help each other find their missed connections after a subway blackout. Their search might lead to love, but not where either of them expects to find it.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F2%2Fgracenote%2F2cc9e52b10b85b0ca0cfaf6080100100.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-way-to-you-2026-1'),
  ('1110132181882812174', 'The Way Way Back', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jim Rash, Nat Faxon, John Bailey', 'Nat Faxon, Jim Rash', 'Liam James, Steve Carell, Toni Collette, AnnaSophia Robb, Sam Rockwell, Allison Janney, Maya Rudolph, Amanda Peet', 'PG-13', 'Shy 14-year-old Duncan goes on summer vacation with his mother, her overbearing boyfriend, and her boyfriend''s daughter. Having a rough time fitting in, Duncan finds an unexpected friend in Owen, manager of the Water Wizz water park.', 'Shy 14-year-old Duncan goes on summer vacation with his mother, her overbearing boyfriend, and her boyfriend''s daughter. Having a rough time fitting in, Duncan finds an unexpected friend in Owen, manager of the Water Wizz water park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DgA0EDDVv37C8xISc3Vv0rhxlL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147773'),
  ('713509747890870969', 'The Way We Are', 2008, 'Drama', 'Ann Hui, Tsim Ho Tat', 'Lou Shiu-wa', 'Nina Paw Hei-Ching, Cecilia Chan Lai-Wan, Juno Leung Chun-Lung, Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Mary Poon, YoYo Fong Cho-Yiu, Chan Lai-Hing, Carson Chung', null, 'Cheung, a single mother living in an area with high crime rates, works hard to provide for her son while helping out her elderly neighbor.', 'Cheung, a single mother living in an area with high crime rates, works hard to provide for her son while helping out her elderly neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11rB0GJxfafjWTp5RZfjqSDQ1KO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56575'),
  ('509175944035293386', 'The Way We Are', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Caner Özyurtlu, Damla Çelikel', 'Caner Özyurtlu', 'Berrak Tüzünataç, Engin Öztürk, Şebnem Bozoklu, Özge Özpirinçci, Meriç Aral, Boran Kuzum, Hümeyra, Burak Altay', null, 'A group of old friends get together to be with their beloved aunt/grandmother who took care of them when they were kids for her last days. And things get complicated.', 'A group of old friends get together to be with their beloved aunt/grandmother who took care of them when they were kids for her last days. And things get complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m270dUDEoLA4YDqVOVERE9RfDUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645292'),
  ('204920313040307593', 'The Way We Laughed', 1998, 'Drama', 'Gianni Amelio, Luca Bigazzi, Lorella Chiapatti', 'Gianni Amelio, Lillo Iacolino, Alberto Taraglio', 'Enrico Lo Verso, Francesco Giuffrida, Fabrizio Gifuni, Calogero Caruana, Roberto Marzo, Davide Negro, Giorgio Pittau, Pasqualino Vona', 'NR', 'Studying to become a teacher in 1950s Northern Italy, Sicilian immigrant Pietro is joined by his big brother Giovanni. Pietro shows considerable promise in his field, prompting illiterate Giovanni to take on even the toughest jobs in order to support his sibling''s academic pursuits.', 'Studying to become a teacher in 1950s Northern Italy, Sicilian immigrant Pietro is joined by his big brother Giovanni. Pietro shows considerable promise in his field, prompting illiterate Giovanni to take on even the toughest jobs in order to support his sibling''s academic pursuits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axL1q2ctgUaRG2ek2lZijRqb9Vw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58098'),
  ('675715220608394603', 'The Way We Were', 1973, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sydney Pollack, Harry Stradling Jr.', 'Arthur Laurents', 'Barbra Streisand, Robert Redford, Bradford Dillman, Lois Chiles, Patrick O''Neal, Viveca Lindfors, Allyn Ann McLerie, Murray Hamilton', 'PG', 'Opposites attract when, during their college days, Katie Morosky, a politically active Jew, meets Hubbell Gardiner, a feckless WASP. Years later, in the wake of World War II, they meet once again and, despite their obvious differences, attempt to make their love for each other work.', 'Opposites attract when, during their college days, Katie Morosky, a politically active Jew, meets Hubbell Gardiner, a feckless WASP. Years later, in the wake of World War II, they meet once again and, despite their obvious differences, attempt to make their love for each other work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5x563ze56iI4iNsCBxTnDkt28i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10236'),
  ('231886693900924867', 'The Way West', 1967, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Western', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, Terry Morse Jr., William H. Clothier', 'Ben Maddow, Mitch Lindemann', 'Kirk Douglas, Robert Mitchum, Richard Widmark, Lola Albright, Jack Elam, Stubby Kaye, Michael McGreevey, Harry Carey, Jr.', 'NR', 'In the mid-19th century, Senator William J. Tadlock leads a group of settlers overland in a quest to start a new settlement in the Western US. Tadlock is a highly principled and demanding taskmaster who is as hard on himself as he is on those who have joined his wagon train. He clashes with one of the new settlers, Lije Evans, who doesn''t quite appreciate Tadlock''s ways. Along the way, the families must face death and heartbreak and a sampling of frontier justice when one of them accidentally kills a young Indian boy.', 'In the mid-19th century, Senator William J. Tadlock leads a group of settlers overland in a quest to start a new settlement in the Western US. Tadlock is a highly principled and demanding taskmaster who is as hard on himself as he is on those who have joined his wagon train. He clashes with one of the new settlers, Lije Evans, who doesn''t quite appreciate Tadlock''s ways. Along the way, the families must face death and heartbreak and a sampling of frontier justice when one of them accidentally kills a young Indian boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cexs9SGcB9JGfBBO1mKeFS1dzc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42703'),
  ('947741439018241845', 'The Wayward Bus', 1957, 'Drama', 'Victor Vicas, William Eckhardt, Charles G. Clarke', 'Ivan Moffat', 'Joan Collins, Jayne Mansfield, Dan Dailey, Rick Jason, Betty Lou Keim, Dolores Michaels, Larry Keating, Robert Bray', 'NR', 'Three strangers embark on a life-changing journey on a fateful bus ride. As the road presents challenges, each character faces his or her own shortcomings, not knowing where life will lead next.', 'Three strangers embark on a life-changing journey on a fateful bus ride. As the road presents challenges, each character faces his or her own shortcomings, not knowing where life will lead next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kr53Hlol4e6B4bXamWRo0DJYi98.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152992'),
  ('152520334633603153', 'The Wayward Canary', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Mickey gives Minnie a canary for a present. Soon there are several little canaries; they get into the inkwell and fly around the house, making a mess, though it''s nothing compared to the shambles Mickey makes of the house while chasing them.', 'Mickey gives Minnie a canary for a present. Soon there are several little canaries; they get into the inkwell and fly around the house, making a mess, though it''s nothing compared to the shambles Mickey makes of the house while chasing them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAOJpAImXv6cl69WWfa2JWOKx3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161614'),
  ('954216598287985558', 'The Wayward Cloud', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Tsai Ming-liang, Liao Pen-jung, Vincent Wang', 'Tsai Ming-liang', 'Lee Kang-sheng, Chen Shiang-Chyi, Lu Yi-ching, Yang Kuei-mei, Sumomo Yozakura, Lam Fai-Kan, Siu Wun-Man, Shu-Mei Hung', null, 'Hsiao-Kang, now working as an adult movie actor, meets Shiang-chyi once again. Meanwhile, the city of Taipei faces a water shortage that makes the sales of watermelons skyrocket.', 'Hsiao-Kang, now working as an adult movie actor, meets Shiang-chyi once again. Meanwhile, the city of Taipei faces a water shortage that makes the sales of watermelons skyrocket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9982mkMphAfTGrXbCiOkCwTGVug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36253'),
  ('47243880638134646', 'The Wayward Girl', 1959, 'Drama', 'Edith Carlmar, Sverre Bergli', 'Otto Carlmar', 'Liv Ullmann, Atle Merton, Rolf Søder, Nanna Stenersen, Tore Foss, Randi Brænne, Egil Hjorth-Jenssen, Ingrid Øvre Wiik', null, 'Gerd, considered a woman of dubious morals, falls in love with a boy whose family does not accept their relationship, so both run away and settle in a cabin in the woods where they meet a sullen man who tests their love.', 'Gerd, considered a woman of dubious morals, falls in love with a boy whose family does not accept their relationship, so both run away and settle in a cabin in the woods where they meet a sullen man who tests their love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPIYP9op28UYK01YLFKF026arWc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56691'),
  ('503450170236541198', 'The Wayward Wife', 1953, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mario Soldati, Cesare Olivieri, G.R. Aldo', 'Giorgio Bassani, Sandro De Feo, Jean Ferry', 'Gina Lollobrigida, Gabriele Ferzetti, Nanda Primavera, Alda Mangini, Renato Baldini, Franco Interlenghi, Marilyn Buferd, Alfredo Carpegna', null, 'Gemma, caught between her desires and reality, struggles to navigate her marriage and personal ambitions.', 'Gemma, caught between her desires and reality, struggles to navigate her marriage and personal ambitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1luP5xAH7BVAJKtgOuufJU04ytA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199479'),
  ('437598947570710771', 'The We and the I', 2012, 'Drama', 'Michel Gondry, David Fischer, Alex Disenhof', 'Jeffrey Grimshaw, Paul Proch, Michel Gondry', 'Michael Brodie, Laidychen Carrasco, Raymond Delgado, Jonathan Ortiz, Jonathan Worrell, Alex Barrios, Meghan Murphy, Chenkon II Carrasco', 'NR', 'The We and the I is the heartfelt and comical story of the final bus ride home for a group of young high school students and graduates.', 'The We and the I is the heartfelt and comical story of the final bus ride home for a group of young high school students and graduates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djoIALNKsNFHfr9Ln0GGxI3if2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109391'),
  ('790540509858106186', 'The Weak and the Wicked', 1954, 'Drama', 'J. Lee Thompson, Gilbert Taylor, Robert Lennard', 'J. Lee Thompson, Anne Burnaby', 'Glynis Johns, Diana Dors, John Gregson, Olive Sloane, Rachel Roberts, Jane Hylton, Athene Seyler, Sybil Thorndike', 'NR', 'Jean Raymond an upper class woman with a gambling addiction, is given a twelve-month prison sentence resulting from her inability to pay her debts. At first she is overwhelmingly depressed by life in the women''s prison; gradually, however, her misery is relieved by the many close friends she makes there. This sympathetic drama traces the contrasting lives and often faltering progress of the inmates of a women''s prison.', 'Jean Raymond an upper class woman with a gambling addiction, is given a twelve-month prison sentence resulting from her inability to pay her debts. At first she is overwhelmingly depressed by life in the women''s prison; gradually, however, her misery is relieved by the many close friends she makes there. This sympathetic drama traces the contrasting lives and often faltering progress of the inmates of a women''s prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVmwnbdE9MlnM8TPoNKol7c9CyV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127275'),
  ('72352546811265867', 'The Weakness of the Bolshevik', 2003, 'Drama', 'Manuel Martín Cuenca, Alfonso Parra, Óscar Marcos Bello', 'Manuel Martín Cuenca, Lorenzo Silva', 'Luis Tosar, María Valverde, Mar Regueras, Nathalie Poza, Manolo Solo, Rubén Ochandiano, Jordi Dauder, Enriqueta Carballeira', null, 'After getting into a minor traffic accident, Pablo attempts to make light of the situation by asking the driver of the other car, Sonsoles, out on a date. When she refuses and instead files an injury report, Pablo snaps and begins stalking her. He soon discovers that Sonsoles has a beautiful teenage sister, Maria, with whom Pablo is immediately infatuated -- a lust that soon turns dark. Can Pablo control his obsession, or will it consume him?', 'After getting into a minor traffic accident, Pablo attempts to make light of the situation by asking the driver of the other car, Sonsoles, out on a date. When she refuses and instead files an injury report, Pablo snaps and begins stalking her. He soon discovers that Sonsoles has a beautiful teenage sister, Maria, with whom Pablo is immediately infatuated -- a lust that soon turns dark. Can Pablo control his obsession, or will it consume him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFmFyW3aCTRXCnQ0skIdmntlji7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15948'),
  ('674927297622177478', 'The Weapon', 1956, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Val Guest, Reginald H. Wyer, Frank Ernst', 'Fred Freiberger', 'Steve Cochran, Lizabeth Scott, Herbert Marshall, Nicole Maurey, Jon Whiteley, George Cole, Laurence Naismith, Stanley Maxted', 'NR', 'A boy accidentally shoots a friend with a gun he found in the rubble of a destroyed building. The gun turns out to be a clue in a ten-year-old murder case.', 'A boy accidentally shoots a friend with a gun he found in the rubble of a destroyed building. The gun turns out to be a clue in a ten-year-old murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oQyb7HL6I5ZBLLKt61bw86cXhJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29212'),
  ('570205376641954773', 'The Weapon', 2023, 'Action', 'Tony Schiena, Mark Justice, Mark Atkins', 'Tony Schiena, Michael Caissie', 'Tony Schiena, AnnaLynne McCord, Sean Patrick Flanery, Jack Kesy, Cuba Gooding Jr., Bruce Dern, Litzy Domínguez, Chuck Zito', 'R', 'Dallas is a one-man killing machine on a mysterious rampage. His attacks on biker gangs and meth labs anger the Vegas mob boss who’s holding Dallas’ girlfriend hostage. But who is Dallas working for? Even torture won’t make him talk, and he won’t stop until justice is served.', 'Dallas is a one-man killing machine on a mysterious rampage. His attacks on biker gangs and meth labs anger the Vegas mob boss who’s holding Dallas’ girlfriend hostage. But who is Dallas working for? Even torture won’t make him talk, and he won’t stop until justice is served.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slQYCDzCMM8SBh9Xa3aPeM2fekA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081620'),
  ('789744907400371320', 'The Weapon, the Hour, the Motive', 1972, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Francesco Mazzei', 'Vinicio Marinucci, Bruno Di Geronimo, Mario Bianchi', 'Renzo Montagnani, Bedy Moratti, Eva Czemerys, Salvatore Puntillo, Claudia Gravy, Alcira Harris, Arturo Trina, Adolfo Belletti', null, 'Don Giorgio, a handsome young priest and teacher in a convent, is involved with two lovers: Orchidea and Giulia. When he repents and vows to return to the Church, he is savagely beaten to death. Not long after, Giulia has her throat slashed. Inspector Boito falls in love with and prepared to marry Orchidea, who is also the main suspect. The key to solving the case seems to lie with an inquisitive boy called Ferruccio, who is kept locked up and drugged. He witnessed one of the murders, but will anyone believe his story?', 'Don Giorgio, a handsome young priest and teacher in a convent, is involved with two lovers: Orchidea and Giulia. When he repents and vows to return to the Church, he is savagely beaten to death. Not long after, Giulia has her throat slashed. Inspector Boito falls in love with and prepared to marry Orchidea, who is also the main suspect. The key to solving the case seems to lie with an inquisitive boy called Ferruccio, who is kept locked up and drugged. He witnessed one of the murders, but will anyone believe his story?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gczWjmoY81MEaKEKySNlfbJglHH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105151'),
  ('158516328755401890', 'The Weapons of Death', 1981, 'Action, Drama', 'Paul Kyriazi, Garrick Huey', 'Paul Kyriazi', 'Eric Lee, Gerald Okamura, Bob Ramos, Ralph Catellanos, Louis Bailey, Sid Campbell, Alan Gin, Garrick Huey', 'R', 'In San Francisco''s Chinatown, a band of thugs kidnaps a girl for a large Chinese gang. Her half-brother gathers a team of expert fighters to get her back.', 'In San Francisco''s Chinatown, a band of thugs kidnaps a girl for a large Chinese gang. Her half-brother gathers a team of expert fighters to get her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wD3WNNH5YTZLu4QdxLGb6RwPSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155380'),
  ('197407681232618336', 'The Wearing of the Grin', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, John T. Smith', null, 'Porky Pig spends the night at an Irish castle after being caught in a storm, and gets in trouble with the two leprechauns who live there.', 'Porky Pig spends the night at an Irish castle after being caught in a storm, and gets in trouble with the two leprechauns who live there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2DrMxUdCRURJkyF9uRaxK2vgEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84601'),
  ('1106779224192879773', 'The Weasel''s Tale', 2019, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Juan José Campanella, Félix "Chango" Monti', 'Augusto Giustozzi, José A. Martínez Suárez', 'Graciela Borges, Oscar Martínez, Luis Brandoni, Marcos Mundstock, Clara Lago, Nicolás Francella, Luz Cipriota, Manuel Martínez Sobrado', null, 'A group of old actors and filmmakers tries to resist the efforts of a young couple to kick them out of their mansion.', 'A group of old actors and filmmakers tries to resist the efforts of a young couple to kick them out of their mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcAHJpXWOOLukNW7nSe5snBt0xK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574088'),
  ('703454137268788423', 'The Weather Man', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gore Verbinski, Phedon Papamichael, Jennifer Rudnicke', 'Steven Conrad', 'Nicolas Cage, Michael Caine, Hope Davis, Gemmenne de la Peña, Nicholas Hoult, Michael Rispoli, Gil Bellows, Judith McConnell', 'R', 'A Chicago weather man, separated from his wife and children, debates whether professional and personal success are mutually exclusive.', 'A Chicago weather man, separated from his wife and children, debates whether professional and personal success are mutually exclusive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQilVzOxLPxvBn9hAuvGpKTpONM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6963'),
  ('705709132211229886', 'The Weather Underground', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Bill Siegel, Sam Green', null, 'Lili Taylor, Bernardine Dohrn, Mark Rudd, Brian Flanagan, David Gilbert, Bill Ayers, Kathleen Cleaver, Laura Whitehorn', null, 'The remarkable story of The Weather Underground, radical activists of the 1970s, and of radical politics at its best and most disastrous.', 'The remarkable story of The Weather Underground, radical activists of the 1970s, and of radical politics at its best and most disastrous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuTAf8DJkj2vljaprE5upLP3nWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14108'),
  ('1004257998155942346', 'The Weathering Continent', 1992, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Koichi Mashimo, Akihiko Iguchi', 'Koichi Mashimo', 'Toshihiko Seki, Minami Takayama, Yusaku Yara, Masashi Hironaka, Hiroko Emori, Banjo Ginga, Daisuke Gori, Masato Hirano', null, 'Three adventurers – a warrior, a priest, and a young woman – traverse a land devastated by centuries of environmental calamities searching only for a way to survive. In their journeys they stumble across first the remains of a band of desperate treasure-hunters, and then the treasure they were seeking: Azec Sistra, the legendary City of the Dead. Unfortunately, the bandits responsible for slaughtering the treasure-hunters have also found their way to the city, but more worrisome still are the guardians which protect Azec Sistra from those who would violate the spirits at rest there…', 'Three adventurers – a warrior, a priest, and a young woman – traverse a land devastated by centuries of environmental calamities searching only for a way to survive. In their journeys they stumble across first the remains of a band of desperate treasure-hunters, and then the treasure they were seeking: Azec Sistra, the legendary City of the Dead. Unfortunately, the bandits responsible for slaughtering the treasure-hunters have also found their way to the city, but more worrisome still are the guardians which protect Azec Sistra from those who would violate the spirits at rest there…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21u9g8RgxJ95Qe15H0FzCOqLmss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39690'),
  ('454115889134079335', 'The Web', 1947, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Irving Glassberg, Michael Gordon, F.O. Collings', 'William Bowers, Bertram Millhauser', 'Ella Raines, Edmond O''Brien, William Bendix, Vincent Price, Maria Palmer, John Abbott, Fritz Leiber, Howland Chamberlain', 'NR', 'A brash young lawyer takes a short-term, high-paying job as bodyguard for a slick business exec being threatened by a former partner, and quickly realizes he may be in over his head.', 'A brash young lawyer takes a short-term, high-paying job as bodyguard for a slick business exec being threatened by a former partner, and quickly realizes he may be in over his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYlaxnJYYwTYfh9JIqGD90Qf70h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29113'),
  ('63438474690192098', 'The Web of Death', 1976, 'Action, Drama, Fantasy', 'Chor Yuen, Chang Chuan-tsan, Wong Chit', 'Ni Kuang', 'Elliot Ngok Wah, Lo Lieh, Ching Li, Wang Hsieh, Angela Yu Chien, Wong Chung, Lily Li, Ching Miao', null, 'Lo Lieh is the ringleader of the Snake Sect, intent on reviving a deadly faction known as the "Five Poison Web." In order to do so, he has an affair with the sexy ringleader of the Scorpion Sect, Angela Yu Chien. However, there is also the Centipede Sect to contend with, as well as other assorted martial artists, among them played by Shaw Brothers talents Yueh Hua, Ching Li, and Lily Li.', 'Lo Lieh is the ringleader of the Snake Sect, intent on reviving a deadly faction known as the "Five Poison Web." In order to do so, he has an affair with the sexy ringleader of the Scorpion Sect, Angela Yu Chien. However, there is also the Centipede Sect to contend with, as well as other assorted martial artists, among them played by Shaw Brothers talents Yueh Hua, Ching Li, and Lily Li.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NcfKAoAQEdJTcd5sWP1P6LzIGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58954'),
  ('365373138579226122', 'The Wedding', 1973, 'Drama', 'Lütfi Akad, Gani Turanlı', 'Lütfi Akad', 'Hülya Koçyiğit, Ahmet Mekin, Kamran Usluer, Erol Günaydın, Ajlan Aktuğ, Sırrı Elitaş, Yaşar Şener, Turgut Boralı', null, 'A family migrates to Istanbul from the rural parts of Anatolia, and they bring their traditions with them. The men of the family are giving away the girls of the family in return for a hefty bride-price. Zelha, one of the girls, revolts against this attitude and tries to save her sisters.', 'A family migrates to Istanbul from the rural parts of Anatolia, and they bring their traditions with them. The men of the family are giving away the girls of the family in return for a hefty bride-price. Zelha, one of the girls, revolts against this attitude and tries to save her sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwPA7ijDrYcjyuRsKbHu5TsYA6C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272045'),
  ('31111920710119788', 'The Wedding', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pavel Lungin, Aleksandr Burov, Olga Loginova', 'Aleksandr Galin', 'Marat Basharov, Mariya Mironova, Andrei Panin, Aleksandr Semchev, Vladimir Simonov, Mariya Golubkina, Natalya Kolyakanova, Oleg Esaulenko', null, 'The beautiful Tanya returns to her small mining town, after supposedly working as a model in Moscow. She decides to marry her shy school sweetheart Mishka, who now works in the mine. The miners finally receive some pay, but Mishka still ends up with no money to buy his bride a gift, so he seeks the help of his perpetually drunk buddy Garkusha. Mishka''s poor working-class family all help to put on a fine wedding with copious amounts of vodka, even though they are suspicious of Tanya''s occupation in Moscow, and of her connection with her Mafia ex-boyfriend Borodin.', 'The beautiful Tanya returns to her small mining town, after supposedly working as a model in Moscow. She decides to marry her shy school sweetheart Mishka, who now works in the mine. The miners finally receive some pay, but Mishka still ends up with no money to buy his bride a gift, so he seeks the help of his perpetually drunk buddy Garkusha. Mishka''s poor working-class family all help to put on a fine wedding with copious amounts of vodka, even though they are suspicious of Tanya''s occupation in Moscow, and of her connection with her Mafia ex-boyfriend Borodin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhOjTjPmuHcLnP1YkWNrJhheDf6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91520'),
  ('52968455414672487', 'The Wedding', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Wojtek Smarzowski, Andrzej Szulkowski', 'Wojtek Smarzowski', 'Robert Wabich, Marian Dziędziel, Andrzej Zaborski, Wojciech Skibiński, Bartłomiej Topa, Arkadiusz Jakubik, Krystyna Rutkowska-Ulewicz, Tamara Arciuch', null, 'Wojnar is a wealthy man who is marrying off his beautiful daughter Kasia, in a small town in present day Poland. Wojnar had to bribe the groom with a fancy car, since Kasia was pregnant by another man. At the end of the ceremony, the car is delivered by a gangster, who immediately demands the promised money and the deed to land from Kasia''s grandfather. Unfortunately grandpa is unwilling to let go of the land. Meanwhile each of the workers at the reception demand to be paid, so Wojnar, who is very reluctant to part with his money, tries to haggle and bribe his way out of all the situations.', 'Wojnar is a wealthy man who is marrying off his beautiful daughter Kasia, in a small town in present day Poland. Wojnar had to bribe the groom with a fancy car, since Kasia was pregnant by another man. At the end of the ceremony, the car is delivered by a gangster, who immediately demands the promised money and the deed to land from Kasia''s grandfather. Unfortunately grandpa is unwilling to let go of the land. Meanwhile each of the workers at the reception demand to be paid, so Wojnar, who is very reluctant to part with his money, tries to haggle and bribe his way out of all the situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nifnApRgBBbDeX4dPNPcA2Udl8j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10819'),
  ('634602093405234855', 'The Wedding', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Til Schweiger', 'Til Schweiger, Lo Malinke', 'Til Schweiger, Samuel Finzi, Milan Peschel, Lilli Schweiger, Stefanie Stappenbeck, Jeanette Hain, Katharina Schüttler, Bianca Nawrath', null, 'Three friends from school, Thomas, Nils and Andreas, are still searching for love in their adult lives.', 'Three friends from school, Thomas, Nils and Andreas, are still searching for love in their adult lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OkNZ5kOdPWJlt3wfph0hNSqqqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649028'),
  ('116202107630255311', 'The Wedding', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Igor Šeregi, Tomislav Sutlar', 'Igor Šeregi, Marko Backović, Marko Jocić', 'Rene Bitorajac, Dragan Bjelogrlić, Linda Begonja, Vesna Trivalić, Roko Sikavica', null, 'Miljenko, a successful Croatian businessman, recieves the news that his company had just filed for bancruptcy. Things seem to be looking up, however, when his daughter anounces not only her engagement, but also her pregnancy and upcoming nuptuals. The only caveat? The love of her life is none other than the son of the Serbian prime minister.', 'Miljenko, a successful Croatian businessman, recieves the news that his company had just filed for bancruptcy. Things seem to be looking up, however, when his daughter anounces not only her engagement, but also her pregnancy and upcoming nuptuals. The only caveat? The love of her life is none other than the son of the Serbian prime minister.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2NaiiFPxzBc3JunKJcqkVI6LKA1.jpg', 'plex:movie:svadba-2026'),
  ('793091998600643041', 'The Wedding Banquet', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ang Lee, Jong Lin', 'Ang Lee, Neil Peng, James Schamus', 'Winston Chao, Gua Ah-leh, Lung Sihung, May Chin, Mitchell Lichtenstein, Vanessa Yang, Dion Birney, Jeanne Kuo Chang', 'R', 'A Taiwanese-American man is happily settled in New York with his American boyfriend. He plans a marriage of convenience to a Chinese woman in order to keep his parents off his back and to get the woman a green card. Chaos follows when his parents arrive in New York for the wedding.', 'A Taiwanese-American man is happily settled in New York with his American boyfriend. He plans a marriage of convenience to a Chinese woman in order to keep his parents off his back and to get the woman a green card. Chaos follows when his parents arrive in New York for the wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arWCA8lg0rbdlwHUMvI46LNDhnL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9261'),
  ('189625192971155580', 'The Wedding Banquet', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Andrew Ahn, Ki Jin Kim', 'Ang Lee, Neil Peng, James Schamus', 'Bowen Yang, Lily Gladstone, Kelly Marie Tran, Han Gi-chan, Joan Chen, Youn Yuh-jung, Bobo Le, Camille Atebe', 'R', 'Frustrated with his commitment-phobic boyfriend Chris and running out of time, Min makes a proposal: a green-card marriage with their friend Angela in exchange for her partner Lee''s expensive IVF. Elopement plans are upended, however, when Min''s grandmother surprises them with an extravagant Korean wedding banquet.', 'Frustrated with his commitment-phobic boyfriend Chris and running out of time, Min makes a proposal: a green-card marriage with their friend Angela in exchange for her partner Lee''s expensive IVF. Elopement plans are upended, however, when Min''s grandmother surprises them with an extravagant Korean wedding banquet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48scEvAG0H4PBWTt86sJeazExpN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1278827'),
  ('475207973747212497', 'The Wedding Cake', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Denys Granier-Deferre, Aurélien Devaux', 'Denys Granier-Deferre', 'Jérémie Renier, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Dominique Lavanant, Léa Drucker, Clémence Poésy, Danielle Darrieux, Christophe Alévêque, Julie Depardieu', null, 'The wedding of Vincent and Berenger does not begin well. For starters, the fabulous cake for the reception falls apart as the butler of the château, and one of the caterers is taking down a flight of stairs falls. The cream puffs are carefully picked up from the floor an arranged as though nothing happened. The bride comes from a bourgeois family, presided by Maddie, an old lady with a secret in her heart. The wedding, to be performed at the local church, by father Victor, proves to be not the classic marriage that has been planned...', 'The wedding of Vincent and Berenger does not begin well. For starters, the fabulous cake for the reception falls apart as the butler of the château, and one of the caterers is taking down a flight of stairs falls. The cream puffs are carefully picked up from the floor an arranged as though nothing happened. The bride comes from a bourgeois family, presided by Maddie, an old lady with a secret in her heart. The wedding, to be performed at the local church, by father Victor, proves to be not the classic marriage that has been planned...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZfyRBGT3ws3QtAcXCXirY4CFXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41179'),
  ('479937608632289764', 'The Wedding Cottage', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Terry Ingram', 'Sandra Berg, Laurie B. Turner, Judith Berg', 'Erin Krakow, Brendan Penny, Drew Henderson, Lauren Bradley, Mariesa Crouse, Aaron Douglas, Matreya Scarrwener, Annabel Kershaw', 'G', 'A wedding guide creator must convince an uninspired artist and owner of a special wedding cottage to renovate the rundown cottage to host a contest-winning couple for their dream wedding.', 'A wedding guide creator must convince an uninspired artist and owner of a special wedding cottage to renovate the rundown cottage to host a contest-winning couple for their dream wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCL19os5OXvEYU4GpMYUpgVMHeV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1093764'),
  ('35323402035819918', 'The Wedding Date', 2005, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Clare Kilner, Oliver Curtis, Carl Proctor', 'Dana Fox', 'Debra Messing, Dermot Mulroney, Amy Adams, Jack Davenport, Sarah Parish, Jeremy Sheffield, Peter Egan, Holland Taylor', 'PG-13', 'With the wedding of her younger sister fast approaching, Kat Ellis faces the undesirable prospect of traveling alone to London for the ceremony. While this is bad enough, Jeffrey, the man who left her as they moved closer to marriage, happens to be the groom''s best man. Determined to show everyone -- most of all Jeffrey -- that her romantic life is as full and thrilling as ever, Kat hires a charming male escort as her date.', 'With the wedding of her younger sister fast approaching, Kat Ellis faces the undesirable prospect of traveling alone to London for the ceremony. While this is bad enough, Jeffrey, the man who left her as they moved closer to marriage, happens to be the groom''s best man. Determined to show everyone -- most of all Jeffrey -- that her romantic life is as full and thrilling as ever, Kat hires a charming male escort as her date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0AEzycJ6V8dLVlSudCUAA9mzgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6961'),
  ('950008888733692742', 'The Wedding Day', 2021, 'Drama', 'Wojtek Smarzowski, Piotr Sobociński Jr.', 'Wojtek Smarzowski', 'Robert Więckiewicz, Michalina Łabacz, Ryszard Ronczewski, Mateusz Więcławek, Agata Turkot, Agata Kulesza, Przemysław Przestrzelski, Tomasz Schuchardt', null, 'The story of a WWII tragedy in a Polish village mixed with the story of a wedding taking place in the same place 80 years later. A bitter look at a xenophobic community that forgets its own history.', 'The story of a WWII tragedy in a Polish village mixed with the story of a wedding taking place in the same place 80 years later. A bitter look at a xenophobic community that forgets its own history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fadrlGAKd4eKon1HDPYSVGCF1K9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:720318'),
  ('835168225848702094', 'The Wedding Director', 2006, 'Drama', 'Marco Bellocchio, Pasquale Mari, Chiara Agnello', 'Marco Bellocchio, Peppino Sciortino', 'Sergio Castellitto, Donatella Finocchiaro, Sami Frey, Bruno Cariello, Gianni Cavina, Maurizio Donadoni, Carmelo Galati, Claudia Zanella', null, 'Franco Elica is a film director casting a remake of a pious melodrama in Rome. He''s melancholy, heading south for a break. On a beach, he meets a man who films weddings and is roped into helping film the wedding of the daughter of a severe and imperious prince. The wedding is one of convenience - the prince needs money, the groom is a mama''s boy. Elica is attracted to the bride, Boda, and tries to convince her not to marry. No matter how outrageous his behavior, the prince keeps Elica on as the wedding director. As the wedding approaches, what''s real blurs with Elica''s imagination. Is he mad?', 'Franco Elica is a film director casting a remake of a pious melodrama in Rome. He''s melancholy, heading south for a break. On a beach, he meets a man who films weddings and is roped into helping film the wedding of the daughter of a severe and imperious prince. The wedding is one of convenience - the prince needs money, the groom is a mama''s boy. Elica is attracted to the bride, Boda, and tries to convince her not to marry. No matter how outrageous his behavior, the prince keeps Elica on as the wedding director. As the wedding approaches, what''s real blurs with Elica''s imagination. Is he mad?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NuV5eJL9ut52xPFq69Xw8k2T1N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24185'),
  ('761870444363979624', 'The Wedding Fix', 2022, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Nicholas Humphries, Corey MacGregor, Bryant Marshall', 'Taylor Warren Goff, Josh Brekhus', 'Andrea Brooks, Patch May, Beverley Elliott, Alisha Ahamed, Edem Nyamadi, Tristan Shire', 'G', 'Reeling from a break-up, professional over-planner Gwen pitches in to help put the finishing touches on her best friend’s wedding. But when she''s teamed up with best man Josh, a free-spirited nature guide, she finds that pulling together this wedding might not be as easy as she thought.', 'Reeling from a break-up, professional over-planner Gwen pitches in to help put the finishing touches on her best friend’s wedding. But when she''s teamed up with best man Josh, a free-spirited nature guide, she finds that pulling together this wedding might not be as easy as she thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttToHIbMIYw52a7BhGAiGlRUKjk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:887708'),
  ('427983932303602941', 'The Wedding Guest', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Michael Winterbottom, Giles Nuttgens', 'Michael Winterbottom', 'Dev Patel, Radhika Apte, Jim Sarbh, Harish Khanna, Nish Nathwani, Meherbaan Singh, Sidhu Manpreet', null, 'Jay is a man with a secret who travels from Britain to Pakistan to attend a wedding—armed with duct tape, a shotgun, and a plan to kidnap the bride-to-be. Jay and his hostage end up on the run across the border and through the railway stations, back alleys, and black markets of New Delhi.', 'Jay is a man with a secret who travels from Britain to Pakistan to attend a wedding—armed with duct tape, a shotgun, and a plan to kidnap the bride-to-be. Jay and his hostage end up on the run across the border and through the railway stations, back alleys, and black markets of New Delhi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sm3PCprf2qrF90OD5vN4iPablMM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500899'),
  ('186356445903293101', 'The Wedding March', 1928, 'Drama, Romance', 'Erich von Stroheim, Ray Rennahan, Roy H. Klaffki', 'Harry Carr, Erich von Stroheim', 'Erich von Stroheim, Fay Wray, George Fawcett, Maude George, Cesare Gravina, Dale Fuller, Matthew Betz, Zasu Pitts', 'NR', 'Against the backdrop of Vienna''s hidebound caste system, aristocrat and army officer Nicki is attracted to peasant Mitzi, although he knows it cannot last. Acquiescing to familial pressure, he ultimately gives her up to marry the more socially acceptable – albeit crippled – heiress Cecelia. Mitzi, for her part, is heartbroken and must resign herself to marrying churlish butcher Schani Eberle.', 'Against the backdrop of Vienna''s hidebound caste system, aristocrat and army officer Nicki is attracted to peasant Mitzi, although he knows it cannot last. Acquiescing to familial pressure, he ultimately gives her up to marry the more socially acceptable – albeit crippled – heiress Cecelia. Mitzi, for her part, is heartbroken and must resign herself to marrying churlish butcher Schani Eberle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ej61Px6QKN1lTbkU9b1kqEHnWEW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42537'),
  ('612091871824623242', 'The Wedding March', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Marco Ferreri, Mario Forges Davanzati, Enzo Serafin', 'Diego Fabbri, Marco Ferreri, Rafael Azcona', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Shirley Anne Field, Alexandra Stewart, Gaia Germani, Catherine Sinet, Anna María Aveta, Tecla Scarano, Gianni Bonagura', null, 'Satirical film in four episodes about family and marriage.', 'Satirical film in four episodes about family and marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld5RVIMqrDMcjZqzTwMho9GzxDe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150605'),
  ('983287808839044564', 'The Wedding Night', 1935, 'Drama, Romance', 'King Vidor, Gregg Toland', 'Edith Fitzgerald', 'Gary Cooper, Anna Sten, Ralph Bellamy, Helen Vinson, Sig Ruman, Esther Dale, Leonid Snegoff, Eleanor Wesselhoeft', 'NR', 'While working on a novel in his country home in Connecticut, married writer Tony Barrett develops romantic feelings for Manya Novak, the daughter of a neighboring farmer. Manya is unhappily engaged to Frederik Sobieski. After a snowstorm, Tony and Manya get trapped together in his house overnight. The next day, Manya''s father insists that her wedding to Frederik take place in spite of Manya''s misgivings. Drunkenness and jealousy result in tragedy at the wedding reception that night.', 'While working on a novel in his country home in Connecticut, married writer Tony Barrett develops romantic feelings for Manya Novak, the daughter of a neighboring farmer. Manya is unhappily engaged to Frederik Sobieski. After a snowstorm, Tony and Manya get trapped together in his house overnight. The next day, Manya''s father insists that her wedding to Frederik take place in spite of Manya''s misgivings. Drunkenness and jealousy result in tragedy at the wedding reception that night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PMkPuifnusyiLLMuXiMUiZb4nF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32004'),
  ('573682099720133129', 'The Wedding of the Trapalhões', 1988, 'Comedy, Family', 'José Alvarenga Jr., Ricardo Aragão', 'Paulo Andrade, Mauro Wilson, Carlos Alberto Diniz', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Nádia Lippi, José de Abreu, Nill, Afonso Nigro', null, 'A misogynist and shabby farmer, brother of other three goofy hillbillies leaves to the big city searching for a wife and wins the heart of a hot tempered woman.', 'A misogynist and shabby farmer, brother of other three goofy hillbillies leaves to the big city searching for a wife and wins the heart of a hot tempered woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYtgB6HN3jVD5kCYt4fgwVeepZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88697'),
  ('787711204466851152', 'The Wedding Pact', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Matt Berman, Keith L. Smith', 'Matt Berman', 'Haylie Duff, Chris Soldevilla, Leslie Easterbrook, Angie Everhart, Alison Becker, Joyce Hyser, Scott Michael Campbell, Alexandra Manea', 'PG-13', 'Two best friends in college Mitch and Elizabeth make a pact that if in ten years after graduation they are both not married they will marry each other. Ten years later Mitch (still single) finds out Elizabeth never got married so he decides to travel across the country, find her and follow through on their pact. What he soon realizes is it wont be a simple as he thought.', 'Two best friends in college Mitch and Elizabeth make a pact that if in ten years after graduation they are both not married they will marry each other. Ten years later Mitch (still single) finds out Elizabeth never got married so he decides to travel across the country, find her and follow through on their pact. What he soon realizes is it wont be a simple as he thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQ8kya0t6OiZovU0mvaPlnoa38E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254047'),
  ('579920724057056714', 'The Wedding Party', 1969, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Wilford Leach, Brian De Palma, Cynthia Munroe', 'Wilford Leach, Brian De Palma, Cynthia Munroe', 'Charles Pfluger, Jill Clayburgh, William Finley, Robert De Niro, Valda Setterfield, Raymond McNally, Judy Thomas, John Braswell', 'R', 'Young Charlie begins to develop cold feet as his wedding looms nearer. Desperate to throw the plans off-track, he tries a variety of tactics, including attempting to rekindle the relationship between his fiancée, Josephine, and her former boyfriend.', 'Young Charlie begins to develop cold feet as his wedding looms nearer. Desperate to throw the plans off-track, he tries a variety of tactics, including attempting to rekindle the relationship between his fiancée, Josephine, and her former boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfEkKOCeFmfWwkuaO4wTvtM7E3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74137'),
  ('569295696041735634', 'The Wedding Party', 2005, 'Comedy, Action', 'Danny Elsen, Dominique Deruddere', 'Dominique Deruddere, Christoph Darnstädt', 'Armin Rohde, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Arne Lenk, Julia Schmidt, Imogen Kogge, Josef Heynert, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Fabian Hinrichs', null, 'In rural Westphalia, Franz Berger struggles to keep his inn open. On this day, a bluff, overbearing bully, Hermann Walzer, has booked the dining room for a wedding banquet for his son Mark. There''s bad blood between Berger and Walzer, so when the first course, shrimp cocktail, is off, Hermann storms out with the wedding party vowing not to pay. Franz locks the loo door, taking prisoners of the bride and Hermann''s wife while he also locks the estate''s outer gates, leaving Hermann and the rest outside. Walzer, a pheasant hunter, lays siege; shotguns, rifles, grenades, a shovel, and other weapons leave no one safe. Will it take death to bring these men to their senses?', 'In rural Westphalia, Franz Berger struggles to keep his inn open. On this day, a bluff, overbearing bully, Hermann Walzer, has booked the dining room for a wedding banquet for his son Mark. There''s bad blood between Berger and Walzer, so when the first course, shrimp cocktail, is off, Hermann storms out with the wedding party vowing not to pay. Franz locks the loo door, taking prisoners of the bride and Hermann''s wife while he also locks the estate''s outer gates, leaving Hermann and the rest outside. Walzer, a pheasant hunter, lays siege; shotguns, rifles, grenades, a shovel, and other weapons leave no one safe. Will it take death to bring these men to their senses?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aztR5kyjjESy8uTyBJBXLRfDYVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11567'),
  ('858954717984120658', 'The Wedding Photographer', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Ulf Malmros', 'Ulf Malmros', 'Björn A. Ling, Tuva Novotny, Kjell Bergqvist, Johannes Brost, Lotta Tejle, Tomas Tjerneld, Johanna Strömberg, Johan Östling', null, 'When the factory in Molkom shuts down, Robin leaves his beloved hometown to try his luck in Stockholm as a wedding photographer. This experience changes not merely his outlook on life but also his hairstyle.', 'When the factory in Molkom shuts down, Robin leaves his beloved hometown to try his luck in Stockholm as a wedding photographer. This experience changes not merely his outlook on life but also his hairstyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvgJIUt4X0H2oyXpo6Ae52hCAZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33494'),
  ('122210522866402488', 'The Wedding Planner', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Adam Shankman, Julio Macat, Gary Marcus', 'Pamela Falk, Michael Ellis', 'Jennifer Lopez, Matthew McConaughey, Justin Chambers, Joanna Gleason, Lou Myers, Kathy Najimy, Charles Kimbrough, Judy Greer', 'PG-13', 'San Francisco''s premiere wedding planner, Mary Fiore is rescued from an accident by the man of her dreams, pediatrician Steve Edison, only to find he is the fiancé of her latest client. As Mary continues making their wedding arrangements, she and Steve are put into a string of uncomfortable situations that force them to face their mutual attraction.', 'San Francisco''s premiere wedding planner, Mary Fiore is rescued from an accident by the man of her dreams, pediatrician Steve Edison, only to find he is the fiancé of her latest client. As Mary continues making their wedding arrangements, she and Steve are put into a string of uncomfortable situations that force them to face their mutual attraction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meq4bLUPcBlOG3Z5YdiWuBMlpO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2018'),
  ('412464763891610701', 'The Wedding Ringer', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Mark Anthony Little, Ronan O''Connor, Andrew Ward', 'Jeremy Garelick, Jay Lavender', 'Kevin Hart, Josh Gad, Kaley Cuoco, Affion Crockett, Olivia Thirlby, Jorge Garcia, Nicky Whelan, Dan Gill', 'R', 'Doug Harris is a loveable but socially awkward groom-to-be with a problem: he has no best man. With less than two weeks to go until he marries the girl of his dreams, Doug is referred to Jimmy Callahan, owner and CEO of Best Man, Inc., a company that provides flattering best men for socially challenged guys in need. What ensues is a hilarious wedding charade as they try to pull off the big con, and an unexpected budding bromance between Doug and his fake best man Jimmy.', 'Doug Harris is a loveable but socially awkward groom-to-be with a problem: he has no best man. With less than two weeks to go until he marries the girl of his dreams, Doug is referred to Jimmy Callahan, owner and CEO of Best Man, Inc., a company that provides flattering best men for socially challenged guys in need. What ensues is a hilarious wedding charade as they try to pull off the big con, and an unexpected budding bromance between Doug and his fake best man Jimmy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ciR2suRkfJen9lQvfz22lgCj7g7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252838'),
  ('276499433490525953', 'The Wedding Singer', 1998, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Tim Suhrstedt, Frank Coraci, David Cass Jr.', 'Tim Herlihy', 'Adam Sandler, Drew Barrymore, Christine Taylor, Allen Covert, Matthew Glave, Ellen Albertini Dow, Angela Featherstone, Alexis Arquette', 'PG-13', 'Robbie, a local rock star turned wedding singer, is dumped on the day of his wedding. Meanwhile, waitress Julia finally sets a wedding date with her fiancée Glenn. When Julia and Robbie meet and hit it off, they find that things are more complicated than anybody thought.', 'Robbie, a local rock star turned wedding singer, is dumped on the day of his wedding. Meanwhile, waitress Julia finally sets a wedding date with her fiancée Glenn. When Julia and Robbie meet and hit it off, they find that things are more complicated than anybody thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVvyTrcZQb7kC2DPDzyo25WcxXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11003'),
  ('437931050356343594', 'The Wedding Unplanner', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Chechu Graf, Dani de la Orden, Chantal Celiz', 'Eric Navarro, Reem Kherici, Marta Sánchez', 'Belén Cuesta, Álex García, Silvia Alonso, Antonio Dechent, Mariam Hernández, Gracia Olayo, Salva Reina, Ricardo Castella', null, 'Marina is a woman in her thirties who works organizing weddings. Not because she is an inveterate romantic just because, as she says, "when people are in love, they don''t care about money". Unlike her customers, she enjoys a life without ties or commitments, until the moment when she falls in love with Carlos. The problem is not only he is about to get married, but also his fiancee is Marina''s childhood friend and they have hired her as their Wedding Planner.', 'Marina is a woman in her thirties who works organizing weddings. Not because she is an inveterate romantic just because, as she says, "when people are in love, they don''t care about money". Unlike her customers, she enjoys a life without ties or commitments, until the moment when she falls in love with Carlos. The problem is not only he is about to get married, but also his fiancee is Marina''s childhood friend and they have hired her as their Wedding Planner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjx2VovTdQ91dL6vPL9opHZclvW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623926'),
  ('711882526133121681', 'The Wedding Veil', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Terry Ingram, William McKnight', 'Judith Berg, Sandra Berg', 'Lacey Chabert, Kevin McGarry, Autumn Reeser, Alison Sweeney, Fiona Vroom, Zachary Gulka, Catherine Lough Haggquist, Karen Kruper', 'G', 'Three longtime college friends who discover a mysterious, antique veil fabled to unite its bearer with her true love. After discovering a long-lost painting, museum curator Avery and successful, new board member Peter investigate the artwork''s origins as they plan a charity fundraiser to unveil its restoration.', 'Three longtime college friends who discover a mysterious, antique veil fabled to unite its bearer with her true love. After discovering a long-lost painting, museum curator Avery and successful, new board member Peter investigate the artwork''s origins as they plan a charity fundraiser to unveil its restoration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOaYiZyNZQotd1ye5Zw3WctDhy5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:910759'),
  ('944318553724862686', 'The Wedding Veil Expectations', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Benson, William McKnight, Paul Etherington', null, 'Lacey Chabert, Kevin McGarry, Autumn Reeser, Alison Sweeney, Karen Kruper, Marco Soriano, Barry W. Levy, Doron Bell', 'G', 'Avery and Peter try to keep the romance alive while renovating the old house they bought and juggling work, but everything takes on a new perspective when they get some news they’ve been hoping for.', 'Avery and Peter try to keep the romance alive while renovating the old house they bought and juggling work, but everything takes on a new perspective when they get some news they’ve been hoping for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLXwOSXGnFcTtIL5gKoWpTDfdfE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1056735'),
  ('382685449185667790', 'The Wedding Veil Inspiration', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Terry Ingram', 'Betsy Morris', 'Autumn Reeser, Paolo Bernardini, Lacey Chabert, Alison Sweeney, Carlo Marks, Kacey Rohl, Lynda Boyd, Don Mike', 'G', 'Emma''s plans get thrown off course when Paolo returns to Italy to take care of his father and she discovers a new passion for making art accessible to all.', 'Emma''s plans get thrown off course when Paolo returns to Italy to take care of his father and she discovers a new passion for making art accessible to all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUbRVuZYKFm5qFDZDYWnVQRWEi4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1056737'),
  ('1040908886278140215', 'The Wedding Veil Journey', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Ron Oliver, Alexander Krumov', 'Karen Berger', 'Alison Sweeney, Victor Webster, Lacey Chabert, Autumn Reeser, Ché Grant, Katerina Geronikolou, Alexander Nicolaou, Jane Asher', null, 'Tracy and Nick agree to set aside work to make time for a long overdue honeymoon to Greece. However, they soon find themselves confronting life choices when they get stranded on a secluded island.', 'Tracy and Nick agree to set aside work to make time for a long overdue honeymoon to Greece. However, they soon find themselves confronting life choices when they get stranded on a secluded island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTjk3NTwKWlsMEjWKPKNxCyywTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1056738'),
