  ('866524495468319719', 'The Weekend Away', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Sara Ana Vrtovec, Noah Greenberg, Kim Farrant', 'Sarah Alderson', 'Leighton Meester, Christina Wolfe, Ziad Bakri, Luke Norris, Amar Bukvić, Iva Mihalić, Adrian Pezdirc, Marko Braić', 'PG-13', 'When her best friend vanishes during a girls'' trip to Croatia, Beth races to figure out what happened. But each clue yields another unsettling deception.', 'When her best friend vanishes during a girls'' trip to Croatia, Beth races to figure out what happened. But each clue yields another unsettling deception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MS0QEl7UK2gdFFbHfNwuYlsq4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:840882'),
  ('1008566250156955811', 'The Weekend Murders', 1970, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Michele Lupo, Guglielmo Mancori', 'Massimo Felisatti, Fabio Pittorru, Sergio Donati', 'Anna Moffo, Ida Galli, Gastone Moschin, Peter Baldwin, Lance Percival, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Christopher Chittell, Marisa Fabbri', 'R', 'An aristocratic English family gather for the reading of their father''s will. The family are dismayed to find that everything has been left to Barbara, the deceased''s favourite daughter. The butler is soon found stabbed to death and Sergeant Thorpe, the local bobby, telephones Scotland Yard for assistance. Inspector Grey arrives and he and Barbara narrowly escape being shot. Cousin Ted and his wife Pauline are both killed. Sergeant Thorpe recalls some photos which Ted asked to have developed...', 'An aristocratic English family gather for the reading of their father''s will. The family are dismayed to find that everything has been left to Barbara, the deceased''s favourite daughter. The butler is soon found stabbed to death and Sergeant Thorpe, the local bobby, telephones Scotland Yard for assistance. Inspector Grey arrives and he and Barbara narrowly escape being shot. Cousin Ted and his wife Pauline are both killed. Sergeant Thorpe recalls some photos which Ted asked to have developed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snnk5BQsQmeuO1UCB8gfJitDUMU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87335'),
  ('434927455805840353', 'The Weeknd: Live at SoFi Stadium', 2023, 'Music', 'Micah Bickham, Chase Smith, The Weeknd', null, 'The Weeknd, Tanya Karn, Jennifer Mariela Bermeo', 'R', 'Filmed at LA''s SoFi Stadium, The Weeknd brings down the house – and your living room – in this epic concert event.', 'Filmed at LA''s SoFi Stadium, The Weeknd brings down the house – and your living room – in this epic concert event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWr5LdDIAKxslXBv7kQy8ao0Zm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081789'),
  ('362830061365452551', 'The Weeping Meadow', 2004, 'Drama, History', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Andreas Sinanos', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Tonino Guerra, Petros Markaris', 'Alexandra Aidini, Nikos Poursanidis, Giorgos Armenis, Vasilis Kolovos, Eva Kotamanidou, Toula Stathopoulou, Thalia Argyriou, Smaro Gaitanidou', null, 'The story follows a family of refugees from the early twentieth century through to the Civil War. Through movements, separations, and reunions, personal lives intersect with Greece’s major historical transformations. Space and time are in constant flux, while the characters remain trapped in an unending search for a homeland.', 'The story follows a family of refugees from the early twentieth century through to the Civil War. Through movements, separations, and reunions, personal lives intersect with Greece’s major historical transformations. Space and time are in constant flux, while the characters remain trapped in an unending search for a homeland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lXTXN5i9rqO55uSQ6dqdAln5i9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37952'),
  ('105860190262125151', 'The Weight', 2013, 'Drama', 'Jeon Kyu-hwan, Kim Nam-gyun', 'Jeon Kyu-hwan', 'Cho Jae-hyun, Park Ji-a, Yoon Dong-hwan, Lee Jun-hyeok, Kim Sung-min, Ra Mi-ran, Yoo Seung-hyeon', null, 'Jung is a mortician at the morgue, who has to rely heavily on medicine for his severe tuberculosis and arthritis. Despite his illness, cleaning and dressing the dead is a noble and even beautiful work. His life over there is both a reality and a fantasy while the corpses are his models and friends for his paintings, his sole living pleasure. Why this morbid hobby? Jung was adopted by a horrible woman who used him as a slave for her dress shop. The natural son of the woman is younger than Jung and has a strange desire. He wants to transform his male body into a female one. Despite the love and hate relationship Jung has with his brother and burdened with the weight of life and the difficulties he has to deal with at his job, Jung endures the pain and prepares a last gift for his brother...', 'Jung is a mortician at the morgue, who has to rely heavily on medicine for his severe tuberculosis and arthritis. Despite his illness, cleaning and dressing the dead is a noble and even beautiful work. His life over there is both a reality and a fantasy while the corpses are his models and friends for his paintings, his sole living pleasure. Why this morbid hobby? Jung was adopted by a horrible woman who used him as a slave for her dress shop. The natural son of the woman is younger than Jung and has a strange desire. He wants to transform his male body into a female one. Despite the love and hate relationship Jung has with his brother and burdened with the weight of life and the difficulties he has to deal with at his job, Jung endures the pain and prepares a last gift for his brother...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vzOs8fFDQoPX5qcH1QgTHOsWAm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133476'),
  ('663390255020380575', 'The Weight Of The World On My Shoulders', 2019, 'Drama', 'Nicola Campiotti', null, 'Giuseppe Fiorello, Sara Zanier, Andrea Pennacchi, Stefano Rossi Giordani, Gianluca Gobbi, Enrico Ianniello', null, 'Marco Parisi have worked in a small Turin factory for thirty years. The bankruptcy trustee gives him a year to seek investors keeping the company alive. At the end of the year, it is Marco himself who decides to take over.', 'Marco Parisi have worked in a small Turin factory for thirty years. The bankruptcy trustee gives him a year to seek investors keeping the company alive. At the end of the year, it is Marco himself who decides to take over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WZYehFSEeVsMliBIHs26tD5BgT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583218'),
  ('468380505512466673', 'The Weight of Water', 2001, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Kathryn Bigelow, Adrian Biddle, Sarah Dunsworth', 'Alice Arlen, Christopher Kyle', 'Sean Penn, Catherine McCormack, Elizabeth Hurley, Sarah Polley, Josh Lucas, Ciarán Hinds, Richard Donat, Ulrich Thomsen', 'R', 'A newspaper photographer researches an 1873 double homicide and finds her own life paralleling that of a witness who survived the tragic ordeal.', 'A newspaper photographer researches an 1873 double homicide and finds her own life paralleling that of a witness who survived the tragic ordeal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkFW3Vgz6rAds4cvHBke8fryeZ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13526'),
  ('409378011218097287', 'The Weirdo', 1989, 'Drama, Horror', 'Andy Milligan', 'Andy Milligan', 'Steve Burington, Jessica Straus, Naomi Sherwood, Lynne Angus, John Rand, Janet Roberts, Lynne Caryl, Carroll Oden', 'R', 'After years of torment and torture, a disturbed young man snaps and takes out his frustration in particularly violent ways.', 'After years of torment and torture, a disturbed young man snaps and takes out his frustration in particularly violent ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukwn6zSob38K3aG2iwekEHv9Fbo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88352'),
  ('182519353030614653', 'The Well', 1951, 'Drama', 'Russell Rouse, Ernest Laszlo, Leo C. Popkin', 'Clarence Greene, Russell Rouse', 'Gwendolyn Laster, Richard Rober, Maidie Norman, George "Spike" Hamilton, Ernest Anderson, Dick Simmons, Lane Chandler, Pat Mitchell', null, 'In a racially mixed American town, a five-year-old black girl falls unnoticed into a hidden, forgotten well on her way to school. Having nothing better to go on, the police follow up a report that the child was seen with a white stranger, and rumors run wild. Before hapless, innocent Claude Packard is even found, popular hysteria has him tried and convicted. But is he guilty?', 'In a racially mixed American town, a five-year-old black girl falls unnoticed into a hidden, forgotten well on her way to school. Having nothing better to go on, the police follow up a report that the child was seen with a white stranger, and rumors run wild. Before hapless, innocent Claude Packard is even found, popular hysteria has him tried and convicted. But is he guilty?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spCIIPdOgW5NIMA4evLFBmw1prB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29112'),
  ('723915124338117230', 'The Well', 1968, 'Drama, Western', 'Ali Uğur, Metin Erksan, Mengü Yeğin', 'Metin Erksan', 'Nil Göncü, Hayati Hamzaoğlu, Aliye Rona, Osman Alyanak, Demir Karahan, Ahmet Kostarika', null, 'Fatma is kidnapped several times by a wild man because she cannot be persuaded to marry. A third attempt at forced submission ends tragically for both, due to the young girl''s fatal rebellion.', 'Fatma is kidnapped several times by a wild man because she cannot be persuaded to marry. A third attempt at forced submission ends tragically for both, due to the young girl''s fatal rebellion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LwSsk9mPtlLK48ZwB12QjQvS6E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270062'),
  ('1125448102648364253', 'The Well', 1997, 'Drama', 'Samantha Lang, Mandy Walker, P.J. Voeten', 'Laura Jones', 'Pamela Rabe, Miranda Otto, Paul Chubb, Frank Wilson, Steve Jacobs, Geneviève Lemon, Kati Edwards, Stephen Rae', null, 'A young girl named Katherine and her older friend Hester live on an isolated farm run by Hester and her father Francis. Katherine works as a maid and wants to leave because there''s too much work. Hester, however, becomes attracted to Katherine and holds her there, promising to give her less work in the future. When Francis dies, Hester decides to sell the farm for cash. They move to a small cottage on the edge of the farm and plan to go to Europe, but a tragic accident and the theft of their money changes their plans.', 'A young girl named Katherine and her older friend Hester live on an isolated farm run by Hester and her father Francis. Katherine works as a maid and wants to leave because there''s too much work. Hester, however, becomes attracted to Katherine and holds her there, promising to give her less work in the future. When Francis dies, Hester decides to sell the farm for cash. They move to a small cottage on the edge of the farm and plan to go to Europe, but a tragic accident and the theft of their money changes their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOFsDKdLaUFewJXNnNwHq5hTZaF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58708'),
  ('633991085871069641', 'The Well', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Federico Zampaglione, Giovanni Dentici, Flavio Verde', 'Federico Zampaglione, Stefano Masi, Stefano Masi', 'Lauren LaVera, Claudia Gerini, Giovanni Lombardo Radice, Linda Zampaglione, Jonathan Dylan King, Lorenzo Renzi, Yassine Fadel, Taylor Zaudtke', null, 'A young restorer travels to a small village to restore a medieval painting to its former glory. She will put her life in danger due to a curse attached to the painting.', 'A young restorer travels to a small village to restore a medieval painting to its former glory. She will put her life in danger due to a curse attached to the painting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBC4AlWK7WgNd49wEpY9GnpZxrt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1091267'),
  ('654288468384493971', 'The Well Beloved One', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Guel Arraes', 'Cláudio Paiva, Guel Arraes', 'Marco Nanini, José Wilker, Matheus Nachtergaele, Zezé Polessa, Andréa Beltrão, Drica Moraes, Caio Blat, Maria Flor', null, 'Elected major of the small city of Sucupira, after unfortunate situation, Odorico must open the city cemitery and face acusations of being corrupt, to end his term on good terms with the people.', 'Elected major of the small city of Sucupira, after unfortunate situation, Odorico must open the city cemitery and face acusations of being corrupt, to end his term on good terms with the people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iV393cSCUOdV2AweBHsJZ0qWWhz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49374'),
  ('417703224800305421', 'The Well Digger''s Daughter', 2011, 'Romance, Drama', 'Daniel Auteuil, Simon Witte, Jean-François Robin', 'Daniel Auteuil', 'Daniel Auteuil, Àstrid Bergès-Frisbey, Kad Merad, Sabine Azéma, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Émilie Cazenave, Marie-Anne Chazel', 'NR', 'It''s the beginning of the WWII. South of France. Patricia, 18, is the oldest daughter of a well-digger, Pascal, who considers her a princess because of her moral qualities. She''s kind, devoted. One day, she briefly meets a young man, Jacques, the son of Mazel, owner of the shop where her father buy his material. He''s handsome and teasing. Her father''s friend, Felipe, would love to marry her, and he invites her to an aviation show. She accepts his invitation only because she knows Jacques is a pilot and will be there. Soon, she''ll carry his child, and he''ll be gone, and the family will have to deal with this out-of-wedlock pregnancy...', 'It''s the beginning of the WWII. South of France. Patricia, 18, is the oldest daughter of a well-digger, Pascal, who considers her a princess because of her moral qualities. She''s kind, devoted. One day, she briefly meets a young man, Jacques, the son of Mazel, owner of the shop where her father buy his material. He''s handsome and teasing. Her father''s friend, Felipe, would love to marry her, and he invites her to an aviation show. She accepts his invitation only because she knows Jacques is a pilot and will be there. Soon, she''ll carry his child, and he''ll be gone, and the family will have to deal with this out-of-wedlock pregnancy...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0MGH7xXcbGao6uNJOyRAQj5l1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62580'),
  ('915379037654527040', 'The Well of Doom', 1974, 'Action', 'Ting Shan-Hsi, Yeh Ching-Piao, Lin Sun Chie', 'Ting Shan-Hsi', 'Wang Ping, Wang Yong, Chang Chi-Yu, Sha-Li Chen, Hsueh Han, Yu Wang, Pao Chin, Yuan Shen', null, 'A father tricks his three daughters into joining him on a mountain excursion to search for food. Deceiving his children, the father is actually searching for a hidden treasure relayed to him by an old monk.', 'A father tricks his three daughters into joining him on a mountain excursion to search for food. Deceiving his children, the father is actually searching for a hidden treasure relayed to him by an old monk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AikyvO4oEFsbKmvPgJ8hzeoIf3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187494'),
  ('1133362208092990385', 'The Well-Digger''s Daughter', 1940, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Marcel Pagnol', 'Marcel Pagnol', 'Raimu, Fernandel, Josette Day, Fernand Charpin, Line Noro, Georges Grey, Milly Mathis, Claire Oddera', 'NR', 'A rural maiden''s two suitors go off to war, leaving her pregnant.', 'A rural maiden''s two suitors go off to war, leaving her pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngXX6PyLLoLDgJI2C2HdiD0Qdgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84875'),
  ('110130086616918712', 'The Welts', 2004, 'Drama', 'Magdalena Piekorz, Marcin Koszałka', 'Wojciech Kuczok', 'Michał Żebrowski, Jan Frycz, Agnieszka Grochowska, Wacław Adamczyk, Borys Szyc, Alan Andersz, Leszek Piskorz, Jan Peszek', null, 'Following the death of his mother in ''80s Poland, 12-year-old Wojciech has taken the brunt of his stressed father''s frustrations with him; the boy frequently gets punished via belt. Wojciech''s father occasionally tries to, instead, bond with him, but soon snaps back to his short-fused habits. Apart from Wojciech''s friend Bartek, no one does anything to help. Jump to present day, Wojciech is a furrow-browed journalist who spends most of his spare time spelunking alone. Just like his father, he has serious anger management issues. Fellow caver Tania feels inexplicably attracted to him, but the love of a good woman may not be enough.', 'Following the death of his mother in ''80s Poland, 12-year-old Wojciech has taken the brunt of his stressed father''s frustrations with him; the boy frequently gets punished via belt. Wojciech''s father occasionally tries to, instead, bond with him, but soon snaps back to his short-fused habits. Apart from Wojciech''s friend Bartek, no one does anything to help. Jump to present day, Wojciech is a furrow-browed journalist who spends most of his spare time spelunking alone. Just like his father, he has serious anger management issues. Fellow caver Tania feels inexplicably attracted to him, but the love of a good woman may not be enough.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/biGYQDXFBjLhXrcgc0JLD8qDld.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36402'),
  ('1100727562176705203', 'The Wendell Baker Story', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Steve Mason, Andrew Wilson, Luke Wilson', 'Luke Wilson', 'Luke Wilson, Eva Mendes, Jacob Vargas, Owen Wilson, Harry Dean Stanton, Kris Kristofferson, Seymour Cassel, Eddie Griffin', 'PG-13', 'Luke Wilson plays a good-hearted ex-con who gets a job in a retirement hotel. Three elderly residents help him win back his girlfriend as he lends them a hand in fighting hotel corruption.', 'Luke Wilson plays a good-hearted ex-con who gets a job in a retirement hotel. Three elderly residents help him win back his girlfriend as he lends them a hand in fighting hotel corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdBiC4J0QMDOoPzX4eudGnTM0MJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12183'),
  ('596212757868736444', 'The Werewolf', 1956, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Fred F. Sears, Will Sheldon, Edward Linden', 'Robert E. Kent, James B. Gordon', 'Steven Ritch, Don Megowan, Joyce Holden, Ken Christy, George Lynn, S. John Launer, Harry Lauter, Eleanore Tanin', 'NR', 'The arrival in a small mountain town of a dissheveled stranger launches a series of murders committed by some sort of animal. As the town doctor and his daughter attempt to help the stranger, the sheriff investigates the murders; and they uncover a sinister experiment involving two rogue scientists, a car accident victim, his wife and children, and a serum that causes a man to turn into a ravaging werewolf.', 'The arrival in a small mountain town of a dissheveled stranger launches a series of murders committed by some sort of animal. As the town doctor and his daughter attempt to help the stranger, the sheriff investigates the murders; and they uncover a sinister experiment involving two rogue scientists, a car accident victim, his wife and children, and a serum that causes a man to turn into a ravaging werewolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWWzmxfK0dKjTpEbPWZXlPRhGPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44545'),
  ('1010351198534789269', 'The Werewolf Game: The Beast Side', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Izuru Kumasaka, Kyouhei Tamazawa, Hiroki Matsui', 'Ai Yamazaki', 'Tao Tsuchiya, Aoi Morikawa, Misato Aoyama, Kisetsu Fujiwara, Yui Sakuma, Karin Ono, Ryo Kato, Naoki Kunishima', null, '10 high school students including Yuka Kabayama are suddenly led to a room and must play the jinrou game. Yuka Kabayama has the jinrou card. She has to hide that fact and kill the players who have the citizens cards one by one. Yuka Kabayama gets excited by her situation.', '10 high school students including Yuka Kabayama are suddenly led to a room and must play the jinrou game. Yuka Kabayama has the jinrou card. She has to hide that fact and kill the players who have the citizens cards one by one. Yuka Kabayama gets excited by her situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yImAIVPhIuegZFiialia72bgSCr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359636'),
  ('913882072243502049', 'The Werewolf of Washington', 1973, 'Horror', 'Robert M. Baldwin, Milton Moses Ginsberg', 'Milton Moses Ginsberg', 'Dean Stockwell, Katalin Kallay, Henry Ferrentino, Despo Diamantidou, Thayer David, Nancy Andrews, Clifton James, Biff McGuire', 'PG', 'After being unknowingly inflicted with the bite of a werewolf while on a visit to Europe, White House press secretary Jack Whittier begins to turn into a deadly beast by night, terrorizing Washington D.C. and presenting a very deadly threat to the President.', 'After being unknowingly inflicted with the bite of a werewolf while on a visit to Europe, White House press secretary Jack Whittier begins to turn into a deadly beast by night, terrorizing Washington D.C. and presenting a very deadly threat to the President.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTvVXSymO5nAd1cR3Gm1OIncUXM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88065'),
  ('1140958718968447279', 'The Werewolf Versus the Vampire Woman', 1971, 'Horror', 'León Klimovsky, Leopoldo Villaseñor, José Antonio Pérez Giner', 'Hans Munkel, Paul Naschy', 'Paul Naschy, Gaby Fuchs, Patty Shepard, Andrés Resino, Barbara Capell, Yelena Samarina, José Marco, Betsabé Ruiz', 'R', 'Elvira is travelling through the French countryside with her friend Genevieve, searching for the lost tomb of a medieval murderess and possible vampire, Countess Wandessa. They find a likely site in the castle of Waldemar Daninsky, who invites the women to stay as long as they like. As Waldemar shows Elvira the tomb that supposedly houses the countess, she accidentally causes the vampire to come back to life, hungrier than ever. Daninsky has a hidden secret of his own, but will it be enough to save the two girls from becoming Wandessa''s next victims?', 'Elvira is travelling through the French countryside with her friend Genevieve, searching for the lost tomb of a medieval murderess and possible vampire, Countess Wandessa. They find a likely site in the castle of Waldemar Daninsky, who invites the women to stay as long as they like. As Waldemar shows Elvira the tomb that supposedly houses the countess, she accidentally causes the vampire to come back to life, hungrier than ever. Daninsky has a hidden secret of his own, but will it be enough to save the two girls from becoming Wandessa''s next victims?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7dammDmgyynv3luBlr3mQaxQUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28403'),
  ('644135566849056691', 'The West Point Story', 1950, 'Music, Comedy', 'Roy Del Ruth, Eddie Prinz, Ray Heindorf', 'Irving Wallace, John Monks Jr., Charles Hoffman', 'James Cagney, Virginia Mayo, Doris Day, Gordon MacRae, Gene Nelson, Alan Hale Jr., Roland Winters, Raymond Roe', 'NR', 'A Broadway director helps the West Point cadets put on a show, aided by two lovely ladies and assorted complications.', 'A Broadway director helps the West Point cadets put on a show, aided by two lovely ladies and assorted complications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VwiwooiP0EXRnrODZ70aynw6Rd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52848'),
  ('733747900769084057', 'The Westerner', 1940, 'Western', 'William Wyler, Walter Mayo, Gregg Toland', 'Jo Swerling, Niven Busch', 'Gary Cooper, Walter Brennan, Doris Davenport, Fred Stone, Forrest Tucker, Paul Hurst, Chill Wills, Lilian Bond', 'NR', 'Drifter Cole Harden is accused of stealing a horse and faces hanging by self-appointed Judge Roy Bean, but Harden manages to talk his way out of it by claiming to be a friend of stage star Lillie Langtry, with whom the judge is obsessed, even though he has never met her. Tensions rise when Harden comes to the defense of a group of struggling homesteaders who Judge Bean is trying to drive away.', 'Drifter Cole Harden is accused of stealing a horse and faces hanging by self-appointed Judge Roy Bean, but Harden manages to talk his way out of it by claiming to be a friend of stage star Lillie Langtry, with whom the judge is obsessed, even though he has never met her. Tensions rise when Harden comes to the defense of a group of struggling homesteaders who Judge Bean is trying to drive away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DpDg1GYiqAKoCozbunCqPYvRPD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14710'),
  ('925810024675125243', 'The Whale', 2022, 'Drama', 'Alice Johnson, Duccio Fabbri, Matthew Libatique', 'Samuel D. Hunter', 'Brendan Fraser, Sadie Sink, Ty Simpkins, Hong Chau, Samantha Morton, Sathya Sridharan, Jacey Sink, Allison Altman', 'R', 'A reclusive English teacher suffering from severe obesity attempts to reconnect with his estranged teenage daughter for one last chance at redemption.', 'A reclusive English teacher suffering from severe obesity attempts to reconnect with his estranged teenage daughter for one last chance at redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQ0gylJMxWSL490sy0RrPj1Lj7e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785084'),
  ('786504733913005436', 'The Whaler Boy', 2020, 'Drama', 'Philipp Yuryev, Mikhail Khursevich, Yakov Mironchev', 'Philipp Yuryev', 'Vladimir Onokhov, Kristina Asmus, Vladimir Lyubimtsev, Nikolai Tatato, Arieh Worthalter, Mariya Chuprinskaya, Ankas Aymetgirgin, Yevgeni Ayanto', null, 'Everything changes in the life of a young 15-year-old Chukchi hunter Lyoshka with the advent of the Internet in the village. He falls in love – for the first time and deeply – with the silent video chat girl. Upon learning that she lives in Detroit, Lyoshka decides on the most desperate act in his life.', 'Everything changes in the life of a young 15-year-old Chukchi hunter Lyoshka with the advent of the Internet in the village. He falls in love – for the first time and deeply – with the silent video chat girl. Upon learning that she lives in Detroit, Lyoshka decides on the most desperate act in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lM2iC1cDJZqMNkRHRzKRpzGvbou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598268'),
  ('45573854184457783', 'The Whalers', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dick Huemer, David Hand', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Mickey, Donald, and Goofy are crewing a whaling ship. Their mishaps include Donald fighting off some hungry birds, Mickey and a bucket of water that keeps doing a boomerang impression, and Goofy firing the cannon and getting stuck high in the air, and ultimately inside a whale. And when he lands the whale well, let''s just say they''re gonna need a bigger boat.', 'Mickey, Donald, and Goofy are crewing a whaling ship. Their mishaps include Donald fighting off some hungry birds, Mickey and a bucket of water that keeps doing a boomerang impression, and Goofy firing the cannon and getting stuck high in the air, and ultimately inside a whale. And when he lands the whale well, let''s just say they''re gonna need a bigger boat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIi833E5TKsAXfEtTjXXmryxisX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67606'),
  ('399742654488379480', 'The Whales of August', 1987, 'Drama', 'Lindsay Anderson, Mike Fash, Beverly Burton', 'David Berry', 'Bette Davis, Lillian Gish, Vincent Price, Ann Sothern, Harry Carey, Jr., Margaret Ladd, Mary Steenburgen, Tisha Sterling', 'NR', 'Two aged sisters reflect on life and the past during a late summer day in Maine.', 'Two aged sisters reflect on life and the past during a late summer day in Maine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQ4yKrRaC3KTOfanyJWJD0CmCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49815'),
  ('604767431522583486', 'The Wheelchair', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Marco Ferreri, Juan Julio Baena', 'Rafael Azcona, Marco Ferreri', 'José Isbert, Pedro Porcel, José Luis López Vázquez, María Luisa Ponte, Antonio Gavilán, José ''Lepe'' Álvarez, Chus Lampreave, Ángel Álvarez', null, 'Don Anselmo, a retired old man, decides to buy a motorized disabled stroller since all his pensioner friends own one. His family strongly refuses him to purchase the vehicle, so don Anselmo decides to take extreme measures to achieve his goal…', 'Don Anselmo, a retired old man, decides to buy a motorized disabled stroller since all his pensioner friends own one. His family strongly refuses him to purchase the vehicle, so don Anselmo decides to take extreme measures to achieve his goal…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDh5pJ4EnIEwR9JS7DU0Mt47p6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99883'),
  ('1019067506248174030', 'The Wheeler Dealers', 1963, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Arthur Hiller, Charles Lang', 'George J.W. Goodman, Ira Wallach', 'James Garner, Lee Remick, Phil Harris, Chill Wills, Jim Backus, Louis Nye, John Astin, Elliott Reid', 'G', 'Henry J. Tyroon leaves Texas, where his oil wells are drying up, and arrives in New York with a lot of oil money to play with in the stock market. He meets stock analyst Molly Thatcher, who tries to ignore the lavish attention he spends on her but, in the end, she falls for his charm.', 'Henry J. Tyroon leaves Texas, where his oil wells are drying up, and arrives in New York with a lot of oil money to play with in the stock market. He meets stock analyst Molly Thatcher, who tries to ignore the lavish attention he spends on her but, in the end, she falls for his charm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKQVrAV2hbdhcJUTq4nyFfIXxJO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42988'),
  ('230168255365871834', 'The Whip and the Body', 1963, 'Drama, Horror', 'Mario Bava, Ubaldo Terzano', 'Ugo Guerra, Ernesto Gastaldi, Luciano Martino', 'Daliah Lavi, Christopher Lee, Tony Kendall, Ida Galli, Harriet Medin, Gustavo De Nardo, Jacques Herlin, Luciano Pigozzi', null, 'Disowned in the past by his father, Kurt Menliff, a cruel and sadistic nobleman, returns to the family castle to reclaim his inheritance.', 'Disowned in the past by his father, Kurt Menliff, a cruel and sadistic nobleman, returns to the family castle to reclaim his inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lydaya4kSCMpev4UwrqrM05fa9k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27636'),
  ('200996810857808313', 'The Whip Hand', 1951, 'Thriller, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Nicholas Musuraca, William Cameron Menzies', 'Frank L. Moss, George Bricker', 'Carla Balenda, Elliott Reid, Edgar Barrier, Raymond Burr, Otto Waldis, Michael Steele, Lurene Tuttle, Peter Brocco', 'NR', 'A small-town reporter investigates a mysterious group holed up in a country lodge.', 'A small-town reporter investigates a mysterious group holed up in a country lodge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyzZUElFJiusnF82fehPUAtLs0h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61138'),
  ('745776662450087755', 'The Whipping Boy', 1994, 'Family, TV Movie', 'Sydney Macartney, Clive Tickner, Heike Jödicke', null, 'Truan Munro, Nic Knight, Karen Salt, Andrew Bicknell, Christoph M. Ohrt, Angus Wright, Mathilda May, Kevin Conway', 'G', 'A bored little prince makes a poor rat hunter his whipping boy but after his pranks at the royal court almost causes a war with the neighbor king he runs away with the whipping boy to escape from his first spanking. After being in the real world his life will change making him a prince fit to rule.', 'A bored little prince makes a poor rat hunter his whipping boy but after his pranks at the royal court almost causes a war with the neighbor king he runs away with the whipping boy to escape from his first spanking. After being in the real world his life will change making him a prince fit to rule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vs57MGHMVpUXR7AHRnBYNRh3qbL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58552'),
  ('951540778301318750', 'The Whirlpool of Fate', 1925, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jean Renoir, Alphonse Gibory, Jean Bachelet', 'Pierre Lestringuez', 'Catherine Hessling, Charlotte Clasis, Pierre Champagne, Maurice Touzé, Georges Térof, Madame Fockenberghe, Harold Levingston, André Derain', null, 'Orphan Virginia is left destitute following her father''s death and her uncle''s alcoholism; she finds refuge with bohemians but is forced to flee, eventually finding romance and a life-altering experience that triggers surreal dreams.', 'Orphan Virginia is left destitute following her father''s death and her uncle''s alcoholism; she finds refuge with bohemians but is forced to flee, eventually finding romance and a life-altering experience that triggers surreal dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MyuQkjqInfSIUm8HyUKgaBEKlH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113781'),
  ('989282854048286698', 'The Whiskered Nanny', 1977, 'Family, Comedy', 'Vladimir Grammatikov, Lev Rogozin, Vladimir Kipa', 'Aleksandr Misharin, Andrey Veytsler', 'Sergei Prokhanov, Lyudmila Shagalova, Yelizaveta Uvarova, Vladimir Aleksandrov, Tatyana Nikolayeva, Arsen Berzin', null, 'Young man Kesha starts working in the Kindergarten.', 'Young man Kesha starts working in the Kindergarten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvYYYn556KE97zu088Ysqrd6ugm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63584'),
  ('962905244438278210', 'The Whiskey Bandit', 2017, 'Action, Crime', 'Nimród Antal', 'Nimród Antal', 'Bence Szalay, Piroska Móga, Zoltán Schneider, Björn Freiberg, Imre Csuja, Sándor Oszter, Attila Ifj. Vidnyánszky, Dániel Mertz', null, 'Between 1993 and 1999, one man robbed 29 financial institutions in Budapest. Banks, post offices and even travel agencies fell victim to his crime spree. The police had no leads and no hope of finding him during his six-year stint. The only clue left behind at the crime scenes was the distinct aroma of whiskey. The media christened him the “Whiskey Bandit”. Never physically harming anyone, many began to eagerly follow his escapades through the media. A Transylvanian immigrant, who also happened to be a goalie for one of the city''s largest hockey teams, named Attila Ambrus, was finally identified as the “Whiskey Bandit”. The police had finally captured him... or so they thought.', 'Between 1993 and 1999, one man robbed 29 financial institutions in Budapest. Banks, post offices and even travel agencies fell victim to his crime spree. The police had no leads and no hope of finding him during his six-year stint. The only clue left behind at the crime scenes was the distinct aroma of whiskey. The media christened him the “Whiskey Bandit”. Never physically harming anyone, many began to eagerly follow his escapades through the media. A Transylvanian immigrant, who also happened to be a goalie for one of the city''s largest hockey teams, named Attila Ambrus, was finally identified as the “Whiskey Bandit”. The police had finally captured him... or so they thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaL59BF0jcHsvqxx3SSho3ZLAiY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401600'),
  ('405604916155612881', 'The Whisper', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Gustavo Hernández', 'Juma Fodde', 'Luciano Cáceres, Marcelo Michinaux, Ana Clara Guanco', null, 'Fleeing from their violent father, siblings Lucía and Adrián take refuge in a remote mansion. With the help of a hidden micro-camera on a cat, Lucía uncovers a terrifying secret: their neighbors are part of a criminal network that kidnaps teenage girls to make snuff films, and they intend to get rid of the siblings. As Lucía fights to protect her brother, she must face a dark family curse that follows them into their newfound sanctuary.', 'Fleeing from their violent father, siblings Lucía and Adrián take refuge in a remote mansion. With the help of a hidden micro-camera on a cat, Lucía uncovers a terrifying secret: their neighbors are part of a criminal network that kidnaps teenage girls to make snuff films, and they intend to get rid of the siblings. As Lucía fights to protect her brother, she must face a dark family curse that follows them into their newfound sanctuary.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FsanKujWA3g7StpK9y7NU78FAJ6O.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-whisper-2026'),
  ('192655971915234870', 'The Whisperer in Darkness', 2011, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Sean Branney', 'Andrew Leman', 'Matt Foyer, Autumn Wendel, Stephen Blackehart, Barry Lynch, Matt Lagan, Paul Ita, Andrew Leman, Annie Abrams', null, 'Folklore professor Albert Wilmarth investigates legends of strange creatures in the most remote hills of Vermont. His enquiry reveals a terrifying glimpse of the truth that lurks behind the legends.', 'Folklore professor Albert Wilmarth investigates legends of strange creatures in the most remote hills of Vermont. His enquiry reveals a terrifying glimpse of the truth that lurks behind the legends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOulUsrnMvrzstbu1NEz13zzxY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87178'),
  ('114479080127667873', 'The Whisperers', 1967, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bryan Forbes, Gerry Turpin, Ray Freeborn', 'Bryan Forbes', 'Edith Evans, Eric Portman, Ronald Fraser, Nanette Newman, Harry Baird, Jack Austin, Gerald Sim, Lionel Gamlin', null, 'Margaret Ross is an impoverished old woman who lives alone in a seedy apartment and enjoys a rich fantasy life as an heiress. One day she discovers stolen money hidden by her son and believes her fantasy has come true.', 'Margaret Ross is an impoverished old woman who lives alone in a seedy apartment and enjoys a rich fantasy life as an heiress. One day she discovers stolen money hidden by her son and believes her fantasy has come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8T9P7cm3F9stR2J3OtrkK4LNq0e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70635'),
  ('785023942182435252', 'The Whispering', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Choi Sang-hun', null, 'So Joo-yeon, Kim Min-gue, Choi Hee-jin, Kim Tae-min, Kim Young, Shin Jae-seung, Park Jin, Kang Se-jung', null, 'Six high school students, who have finished their college entrance examinations, accidentally discover a haunted house with eerie rumors to it. Inside there, the students start to hear the whispers of death and vanish one by one, as unstoppable, extreme terror engulfs them.', 'Six high school students, who have finished their college entrance examinations, accidentally discover a haunted house with eerie rumors to it. Inside there, the students start to hear the whispers of death and vanish one by one, as unstoppable, extreme terror engulfs them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shg9c1gsc1aSsCeYxcjIkupt6O2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535186'),
  ('557391685830785771', 'The Whispering of the Gods', 2005, 'Drama', 'Tatsushi Ōmori, Ryo Otsuka', 'Yoshio Urasawa', 'Hirofumi Arai, Léona Hirota, Keita Kimura, Nao Omori, Masashi Yamamoto, Akifumi Miura, Akaji Maro, Renji Ishibashi', null, 'Rou has returned to the monastery he was raised in. As he listens to the whispering of the Gods through his germanium radio, Rou defies God in every which way and puts religion to the test.', 'Rou has returned to the monastery he was raised in. As he listens to the whispering of the Gods through his germanium radio, Rou defies God in every which way and puts religion to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxKiPggdckYqDiuWpegQl8ij56T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134766'),
  ('776234004805135157', 'The Whispering Shadow', 1933, 'Action, Mystery', 'Colbert Clark, Albert Herman', 'Barney A. Sarecky, George Morgan, Norman S. Hall', 'Bela Lugosi, Malcolm McGregor, Viva Tattersall, Robert Warwick, Roy D''Arcy, Karl Dane, Henry B. Walthall, Lafe McKee', 'NR', 'A mysterious criminal known as The Whispering Shadow commits crimes by means of a gang he controls by television and radio rays. Jack Norton, whose brother was murdered by The Whispering Shadow, suspects that the eerie Professor Strang - whose ghostly wax museum contains figures far too lifelike - may be involved in the crimes.', 'A mysterious criminal known as The Whispering Shadow commits crimes by means of a gang he controls by television and radio rays. Jack Norton, whose brother was murdered by The Whispering Shadow, suspects that the eerie Professor Strang - whose ghostly wax museum contains figures far too lifelike - may be involved in the crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h19xCeDBYdBld0GJ54Zq1bCE5zl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161796'),
  ('450406452542512895', 'The Whispering Star', 2015, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Sion Sono, Maya Ayabe, Akira Ono', 'Sion Sono', 'Megumi Kagurazaka, Yūto Ikeda, Kenji Endo, Kōko Mori', null, 'A feminine android delivers packages to scattered humans throughout the galaxy. With years to spare, the android and us have time to contemplate the meaning of being human.', 'A feminine android delivers packages to scattered humans throughout the galaxy. With years to spare, the android and us have time to contemplate the meaning of being human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ABCXEIRhnFUJIpoqK8VRi3fwWj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355993'),
  ('586107167747233658', 'The Whistle Blower', 1986, 'Action, Thriller', 'Simon Langton, Fred Tammes', 'Julian Bond', 'Michael Caine, James Fox, Nigel Havers, John Gielgud, Felicity Dean, Barry Foster, Gordon Jackson, Kenneth Colley', 'PG', 'A war veteran tries to investigate the murder of his son who was working as a Russian translator for the British intelligence service during the Cold War. He meets a web of deception and paranoia that seems impenetrable...', 'A war veteran tries to investigate the murder of his son who was working as a Russian translator for the British intelligence service during the Cold War. He meets a web of deception and paranoia that seems impenetrable...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmkhdouM05tCQDIEQVqKwpK2NGh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25720'),
  ('106474275130064398', 'The Whistleblower', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Larysa Kondracki, Kieran McGuigan, David Antoniuk', 'Eilis Kirwan, Larysa Kondracki', 'Rachel Weisz, Vanessa Redgrave, Monica Bellucci, David Strathairn, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Benedict Cumberbatch, Liam Cunningham, Paula Schramm', 'R', 'Nebraska cop Kathryn Bolkovac discovers a deadly sex trafficking ring while serving as a U.N. peacekeeper in post-war Bosnia. Risking her own life to save the lives of others, she uncovers an international conspiracy that is determined to stop her, no matter the cost.', 'Nebraska cop Kathryn Bolkovac discovers a deadly sex trafficking ring while serving as a U.N. peacekeeper in post-war Bosnia. Risking her own life to save the lives of others, she uncovers an international conspiracy that is determined to stop her, no matter the cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIVcea2BHHi7RJgucGEmpt3zkED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65760'),
  ('286822659398709868', 'The Whistleblower', 2014, 'Drama', 'Yim Soon-rye, Park Young-jun, Kim Gyeong-seok', 'Lee Choon-hyung', 'Park Hae-il, Lee Kyung-young, Yoo Yeon-seok, Park Won-sang, Ryu Hyun-kyung, Song Ha-yoon, Kim Su-an, Kim Kang-hyun', null, 'Lee Jang-hwan receives widespread acclaim and media attention after successfully cloning human embryo stem cells. A TV news program PD, Yoon Min-cheol, receives a phone call from an anonymous source who says he has worked with Dr. Lee on the stem cell project. The source blows the whistle on Lee''s work, revealing how Lee fabricated research results and engaged in unethical practices.', 'Lee Jang-hwan receives widespread acclaim and media attention after successfully cloning human embryo stem cells. A TV news program PD, Yoon Min-cheol, receives a phone call from an anonymous source who says he has worked with Dr. Lee on the stem cell project. The source blows the whistle on Lee''s work, revealing how Lee fabricated research results and engaged in unethical practices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fizySa53ba70jdoEbSeONQlu5nF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296633'),
  ('1045419578069456548', 'The Whistler', 1944, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'William Castle, James S. Brown Jr., Richard Monroe', 'Eric Taylor', 'Richard Dix, Gloria Stuart, J. Carrol Naish, Alan Dinehart, Trevor Bardette, William Benedict, Charles Coleman, Clancy Cooper', 'NR', 'A guilt-ridden man blames himself for his wife''s death and secretly pays an assassin to kill him. But then he finds out that his wife isn''t dead at all. And now the assassin is on his trail, with no way to call off the hit.', 'A guilt-ridden man blames himself for his wife''s death and secretly pays an assassin to kill him. But then he finds out that his wife isn''t dead at all. And now the assassin is on his trail, with no way to call off the hit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNc6cUawDIaBmg63wbsUcPh67YK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28668'),
  ('579577068742775922', 'The Whistler', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Lefebvre, Christophe Offenstein', 'Philippe Lefebvre', 'François Berléand, Thierry Lhermitte, Virginie Efira, Alain Chabat, Sami Bouajila, Fred Testot, Clémentine Célarié, Constance Dollé', null, 'Cannes, the French Riviera. Armand Teillard is happy with life; a busy store downtown, a delightful girlfriend, a magnificent record collection and lunch every day at Sofia and Martial''s family restaurant with a perfect sea view. So when Sofia tells Armand that Zapetti, a property developer with mafia connections, is putting the squeeze on her to sell up, he is horrified. Armand is an easy-going guy, but when he gets mad... actually, Armand never gets mad. He leaves that to his twin brother, Maurice, The Whistler. When Maurice rides into town in his Aston Martin and designer suit, Zapetti, his mob and the corrupt local politicians are in trouble. But what if, behind the dyed hair and tinted contact lenses, Maurice and Armand are one and the same guy? Is Cannes big enough for the both of them?', 'Cannes, the French Riviera. Armand Teillard is happy with life; a busy store downtown, a delightful girlfriend, a magnificent record collection and lunch every day at Sofia and Martial''s family restaurant with a perfect sea view. So when Sofia tells Armand that Zapetti, a property developer with mafia connections, is putting the squeeze on her to sell up, he is horrified. Armand is an easy-going guy, but when he gets mad... actually, Armand never gets mad. He leaves that to his twin brother, Maurice, The Whistler. When Maurice rides into town in his Aston Martin and designer suit, Zapetti, his mob and the corrupt local politicians are in trouble. But what if, behind the dyed hair and tinted contact lenses, Maurice and Armand are one and the same guy? Is Cannes big enough for the both of them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEjsGn2CQC8IlSy90i6Yyi1WMEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37638'),
  ('570183143592446177', 'The Whistler: Origins', 2018, 'Drama, Horror', 'Gerard Uzcategui, Gisberg Bermúdez Molero', 'Irina Dendiouk, Gisberg Bermúdez Molero', 'Leónidas Urbina, Valeria Oribio, Vladimir Garcia, Martín Márquez, Fernando Gaviria, Daniela Bueno, Ananda Troconis, Oswaldo Hidalgo', null, 'In the mid-nineteenth century, in a small Venezuelan village, Father Giovanni and a clerk write the story of a supernatural case that they have witnessed, is the story of a mysterious specter, which the people of the town have baptized as "El Silbón". In the current age, we know a family made up of Gabriel and Mayra, Ana''s parents. Gabriel suspects that his daughter is possessed by the devil since she is trying to kill him. Gabriel asks the priest of his parish for advice, which is the same one Father Giovanni wrote about the Silbón over a hundred years ago.', 'In the mid-nineteenth century, in a small Venezuelan village, Father Giovanni and a clerk write the story of a supernatural case that they have witnessed, is the story of a mysterious specter, which the people of the town have baptized as "El Silbón". In the current age, we know a family made up of Gabriel and Mayra, Ana''s parents. Gabriel suspects that his daughter is possessed by the devil since she is trying to kill him. Gabriel asks the priest of his parish for advice, which is the same one Father Giovanni wrote about the Silbón over a hundred years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iad3W2u2j2zh6hYE9IMc9UWyhp5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548178'),
  ('390393725611298797', 'The Whistlers', 2019, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Corneliu Porumboiu, Ovidiu Paunescu, Ingrid Cristea', 'Corneliu Porumboiu', 'Catrinel Marlon, Vlad Ivanov, Rodica Lazăr, Sabin Tambrea, Antonio Buíl, Agustí Villaronga, István Téglás, George Piștereanu', null, 'A Romanian police officer, determined to free from prison a crooked businessman who knows where a mobster''s money is hidden, must learn the difficult ancestral whistling language (Silbo Gomero) used on the island of Gomera.', 'A Romanian police officer, determined to free from prison a crooked businessman who knows where a mobster''s money is hidden, must learn the difficult ancestral whistling language (Silbo Gomero) used on the island of Gomera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osVaEZasM0LH6l5OPflFIT4G1H8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504582'),
  ('929249208755116309', 'The White Balloon', 1995, 'Drama, Family', 'Jafar Panahi, Farzad Jadat, Parviz Shahbazi', 'Abbas Kiarostami', 'Aida Mohammadkhani, Mohsen Kafili, Fereshteh Sadr Orafaee, Anna Borkowska, Mohammad Shahani, Mohammad Bakhtiar, Aliasghar Smadi, Hamidreza Tahery', null, 'Several people try to take advantage of a little girl''s innocence to hustle money her mom gave to her to buy a goldfish with.', 'Several people try to take advantage of a little girl''s innocence to hustle money her mom gave to her to buy a goldfish with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6jrlgZZx3zSFPDPTVOYpueljgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46785'),
  ('1067821839618000692', 'The White Bird Marked with Black', 1972, 'War, Drama', 'Vilen Kalyuta, Yurii Illienko', 'Yurii Illienko, Ivan Mykolaichuk', 'Ivan Mykolaichuk, Yurii Mykolaichuk, Alexandr Plotnikov, Larysa Kadochnykova, Bohdan Stupka, Nataliia Naum, Gemma Firsova, Vasyl Symchych', null, 'A family struggles to survive in an area that was claimed as part of Rumania, Poland and Ukraine, all within a short span of time. When World War II comes, various family members choose different masters; some even choose to work for the Soviets. War, struggle, marriages, births, deaths--all these events punctuate the story of this large family.', 'A family struggles to survive in an area that was claimed as part of Rumania, Poland and Ukraine, all within a short span of time. When World War II comes, various family members choose different masters; some even choose to work for the Soviets. War, struggle, marriages, births, deaths--all these events punctuate the story of this large family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZfs7wmL3jrKiCsbhYH5MoN2keb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255739'),
  ('309201308741941731', 'The White Buffalo', 1977, 'Western, Adventure, Action', 'J. Lee Thompson, Paul Lohmann, Pat Kehoe', 'Richard Sale', 'Charles Bronson, Jack Warden, Will Sampson, Kim Novak, Clint Walker, Stuart Whitman, Slim Pickens, John Carradine', 'PG', 'In this strange western version of Moby Dick, Wild Bill Hickok hunts a white buffalo he has seen in a dream. Hickok moves through a variety of uniquely authentic western locations - dim, filthy, makeshift taverns; freezing, slaughterhouse-like frontier towns and beautifully desolate high country - before improbably teaming up with a young Crazy Horse to pursue the creature.', 'In this strange western version of Moby Dick, Wild Bill Hickok hunts a white buffalo he has seen in a dream. Hickok moves through a variety of uniquely authentic western locations - dim, filthy, makeshift taverns; freezing, slaughterhouse-like frontier towns and beautifully desolate high country - before improbably teaming up with a young Crazy Horse to pursue the creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szvuG051LtheWv94QBcqldE4Wsu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47914'),
  ('678818566644813425', 'The White Bus', 1967, 'Drama', 'Lindsay Anderson, Kip Gowans, Miroslav Ondříček', 'Shelagh Delaney', 'Patricia Healey, Arthur Lowe, John Sharp, Julie Perry, Stephen Moore, Victor Henry, Anthony Hopkins, Abdul Rahman Akim', null, 'A despondent young woman travels home to the North of England.', 'A despondent young woman travels home to the North of England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SI9wIrU4RdjbJgBuDMJmsT2iEs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88264'),
  ('730059054978409634', 'The White Cliffs of Dover', 1944, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Clarence Brown, George J. Folsey, Robert H. Planck', 'Claudine West, Jan Lustig, George Froeschel', 'Irene Dunne, Alan Marshal, Roddy McDowall, Frank Morgan, Van Johnson, C. Aubrey Smith, May Whitty, Gladys Cooper', 'NR', 'American Susan travels with her father to England for a vacation. Invited to a society ball, Susan meets Sir John Ashwood and marries him after a whirlwind romance. However, she never quite adjusts to life as a new member of the British gentry. At the outbreak of World War I, John is sent to the trenches and never returns. When her son goes off to fight in World War II, Susan fears the same tragic fate may befall him too.', 'American Susan travels with her father to England for a vacation. Invited to a society ball, Susan meets Sir John Ashwood and marries him after a whirlwind romance. However, she never quite adjusts to life as a new member of the British gentry. At the outbreak of World War I, John is sent to the trenches and never returns. When her son goes off to fight in World War II, Susan fears the same tragic fate may befall him too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6g71AmExvAIKOZB3vdEBR5WArm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52440'),
  ('1001550404631073847', 'The White Countess', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'James Ivory, Christopher Doyle, George Every', 'Kazuo Ishiguro', 'Ralph Fiennes, Natasha Richardson, Hiroyuki Sanada, Lynn Redgrave, Vanessa Redgrave, Madeleine Potter, Madeleine Daly, Allan Corduner', null, 'In 1930s Shanghai, ''The White Countess'' is both Sofia, a fallen member of the exiled Russian aristocracy, and a nightclub created by a blind American diplomat who asks Sofia to be the centerpiece of the world he wants to create.', 'In 1930s Shanghai, ''The White Countess'' is both Sofia, a fallen member of the exiled Russian aristocracy, and a nightclub created by a blind American diplomat who asks Sofia to be the centerpiece of the world he wants to create.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65AKidOOKrfyQkiVYtkgDJVM4CA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18840'),
  ('1110006860952066986', 'The White Crow', 2018, 'Drama', 'Ralph Fiennes, Mike Eley', 'David Hare', 'Oleg Ivenko, Adèle Exarchopoulos, Chulpan Khamatova, Ralph Fiennes, Alexey Morozov, Raphaël Personnaz, Olivier Rabourdin, Ravshana Kurkova', 'R', 'The story of Rudolf Nureyev, whose escape to the West stunned the world at the height of the Cold War. With his magnetic presence, Nureyev emerged as ballet’s most famous star, a wild and beautiful dancer limited by the world of 1950s Leningrad. His flirtation with Western artists and ideas led him into a high-stakes game of cat and mouse with the KGB.', 'The story of Rudolf Nureyev, whose escape to the West stunned the world at the height of the Cold War. With his magnetic presence, Nureyev emerged as ballet’s most famous star, a wild and beautiful dancer limited by the world of 1950s Leningrad. His flirtation with Western artists and ideas led him into a high-stakes game of cat and mouse with the KGB.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OF4zAdfQWKDTiiRpbZvZUsLioq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477887'),
  ('604463020017898060', 'The White Dawn', 1974, 'History, Adventure, Drama', 'Philip Kaufman, Michael Chapman, Jon Anderson', 'James Houston, Thomas Rickman', 'Warren Oates, Timothy Bottoms, Louis Gossett Jr., Joanasie Salamonie, Simonie Kopapik, Pilitak, Sagiaktok, Munamee Sako', 'R', 'In 1896, three survivors of a whaling ship-wreck in the Canadian Arctic are saved and adopted by an Eskimo tribe but frictions arise when the three start misbehaving.', 'In 1896, three survivors of a whaling ship-wreck in the Canadian Arctic are saved and adopted by an Eskimo tribe but frictions arise when the three start misbehaving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e74001YinU9Z8FR7Oepj1q9LgF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6966'),
  ('562328519086162376', 'The White Devil', 2019, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Ignacio Rogers, Fernando Lockett', 'Ignacio Rogers', 'Ezequiel Díaz, Violeta Urtizberea, Julián Tello, Martina Juncadella, Nicola Siri, William Prociuk, Ailín Salas, Teresita Terraf', null, 'A camping trip for a group of friends turns into an unexpected nightmare when one of them encounters a mysterious stranger.', 'A camping trip for a group of friends turns into an unexpected nightmare when one of them encounters a mysterious stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6LN8REYpdGjymzGkgVlujCXqqA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593963'),
  ('932509474219324093', 'The White Diamond', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Henning Brümmer, Klaus Scheurich', 'Rudolph Herzog, Werner Herzog, Annette Scheurich', 'Werner Herzog, Graham Dorrington, Annette Scheurich, Marc Anthony Yhap, Dieter Plage, Adrian de Schryver, Michael Wilk, Anthony Melville', null, 'This 2004 documentary by Werner Herzog diaries the struggle of a passionate English inventor to design and test a unique airship during its maiden flight above the jungle canopy.', 'This 2004 documentary by Werner Herzog diaries the struggle of a passionate English inventor to design and test a unique airship during its maiden flight above the jungle canopy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYSEPp5uyXZ0UXNhTGQtwvGUGKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23965'),
  ('414675789236488558', 'The White Disease', 1937, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Hugo Haas, Otto Heller, Antonín Kubový', 'Hugo Haas', 'Hugo Haas, Zdeněk Štěpánek, Bedřich Karen, Václav Vydra, Ladislav Boháč, Karla Oličová, Jaroslav Průcha, František Smolík', null, 'In a country whose people have just been successfully persuaded of their superiority and the justification for military expansion by the fiery speeches of a dictator, the bacillus of a highly destructive form of leprosy has spread. It is called morbus Tshengi, or popularly „white disease“. The only one who has developed an effective cure for it is a physician of the poor named Galén. But he refuses to reveal the secret of his cure as long as the powerful destroy human lives through wars.', 'In a country whose people have just been successfully persuaded of their superiority and the justification for military expansion by the fiery speeches of a dictator, the bacillus of a highly destructive form of leprosy has spread. It is called morbus Tshengi, or popularly „white disease“. The only one who has developed an effective cure for it is a physician of the poor named Galén. But he refuses to reveal the secret of his cure as long as the powerful destroy human lives through wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51MYX08nrjKNDeGBjam6Z8SWoe7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212871'),
  ('242636296661050338', 'The White Dove', 1960, 'Drama', 'František Vláčil, Anna Lackovičová, Pavel Kopta', 'Otakar Kirchner, Vladimír Valenta, František Vláčil', 'Kateřina Irmanovová, Karel Smyczek, Anna Pitašová, Václav Irmanov, Gustav Püttjer, Hans-Peter Reinecke, František Kovářík, Vladimír Erlebach', null, 'A poetic film about a dove getting lost on its way to Prague getting shot down by a paralyzed boy. An artist who finds the dove becomes friends with the boy. Together they take care of it bringing it back to recovery.', 'A poetic film about a dove getting lost on its way to Prague getting shot down by a paralyzed boy. An artist who finds the dove becomes friends with the boy. Together they take care of it bringing it back to recovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/it4piDRBxH20Q9hcGEeBEsw5mWj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117046'),
  ('832873270943990943', 'The White Dragon', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Wilson Yip, Albert Mak Kai-Kwong', 'Law Yiu-Fai, Wilson Yip', 'Cecilia Cheung, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Avi K. Garg, Liu Guancheng, Andy On Chi-Kit, Ding Xiaolong, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Suet Nei', null, 'In this swordfighting comedy, a young noblewoman falls in love with a prince of the Imperial House. By accident, she acquires the martial arts skills of the White Dragon. New in her power, she learns that there are definite advantages in performing "good deeds" as the Little White Dragon.', 'In this swordfighting comedy, a young noblewoman falls in love with a prince of the Imperial House. By accident, she acquires the martial arts skills of the White Dragon. New in her power, she learns that there are definite advantages in performing "good deeds" as the Little White Dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3QYkUOtOpRvQo3UDVrHyINV58L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10109'),
  ('459630847407588769', 'The White Gorilla', 1945, 'Action, Adventure', 'Harry L. Fraser, William C. Thompson, Robert E. Cline', 'Harry L. Fraser', 'Ray Corrigan, Lorraine Miller, George J. Lewis, Francis Ford, Budd Buster, Charles King, Harry Belmore, Eugenia Gilbert', 'NR', 'A white gorilla causes trouble in the deepest heart of Africa. The film uses footage from the silent 1927 serial Perils Of The Jungle.', 'A white gorilla causes trouble in the deepest heart of Africa. The film uses footage from the silent 1927 serial Perils Of The Jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WO4YMenTRK8HejTVXpAmIdkjfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86537'),
  ('358388926002011928', 'The White Haired Witch of Lunar Kingdom', 2014, 'Fantasy', 'Jacob Cheung Chi-Leung, Andy Lam Kwok-Wah', 'Guo Junli, Yali Zhu', 'Fan Bingbing, Huang Xiaoming, Vincent Zhao Wenzhuo, Wang Xuebing, Ni Dahong, Cecilia Yip Tung, Shera Li, Kevin Yan', null, 'In the twilight of the Ming Dynasty, the Imperial court is plagued by corruption as tyrants rule over the land. With the Manchurians preying on a weakened empire, war is imminent. To save the victims from their suffering, sorceress Jade Raksha fights the soldiers that oppress people for their own gain. As payback, local government officials decide to pin the murder of Governor Zhuo Zhonglian on Jade, turning her and the members of her cult into wanted fugitives for a crime they didn''t commit.', 'In the twilight of the Ming Dynasty, the Imperial court is plagued by corruption as tyrants rule over the land. With the Manchurians preying on a weakened empire, war is imminent. To save the victims from their suffering, sorceress Jade Raksha fights the soldiers that oppress people for their own gain. As payback, local government officials decide to pin the murder of Governor Zhuo Zhonglian on Jade, turning her and the members of her cult into wanted fugitives for a crime they didn''t commit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fzybbRNycYYqujAtLKHsf9UUmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257648'),
  ('811919742605121547', 'The White Hell of Pitz Palu', 1929, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Arnold Fanck, G.W. Pabst, Marc Sorkin', 'Ladislaus Vajda, Arnold Fanck', 'Gustav Diessl, Leni Riefenstahl, Ernst Petersen, Ernst Udet, Mizzi Götzel, Otto Spring, Kurt Gerron, Charles McNamee', null, 'Dr. Johannes Krafft climbs a 12,000-foot mountain over and over again to search for his wife, who was lost on their honeymoon. Another couple makes the dangerous climb with him.', 'Dr. Johannes Krafft climbs a 12,000-foot mountain over and over again to search for his wife, who was lost on their honeymoon. Another couple makes the dangerous climb with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b70oc25pi85XI0R4mSPuG78BNoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29043'),
  ('171074012153847215', 'The White Helmets', 2016, 'Documentary, War', 'Orlando von Einsiedel, Franklin Dow', null, 'Khalid Farah, Mohammed Farah, Abu Omar, Raed Saleh', null, 'As daily airstrikes pound civilian targets in Syria, a group of indomitable first responders risk their lives to rescue victims from the rubble.', 'As daily airstrikes pound civilian targets in Syria, a group of indomitable first responders risk their lives to rescue victims from the rubble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5wJW2MrmhoZYSrCzaB8WxkYDEC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416211'),
  ('1125851299295254739', 'The White Horse', 1962, 'Music, Comedy, Drama, Western', 'Rafael Baledón, Rosalío Solano', 'Adolfo Torres Portillo', 'Joselito, Antonio Aguilar, Sara García, Luz María Aguilar, David Reynoso, Florencio Castelló, Eleazar García, Emilio Garibay', null, 'Claimed by his grandmother, who lives in a Mexican village, Joselito begins the journey from Spain. Once there, while traveling in a stagecoach, is assaulted by bandits. Joselito manages to escape and, walking aimlessly, he meets Antoine, a rider who is ex officio of random player, and become close friends.', 'Claimed by his grandmother, who lives in a Mexican village, Joselito begins the journey from Spain. Once there, while traveling in a stagecoach, is assaulted by bandits. Joselito manages to escape and, walking aimlessly, he meets Antoine, a rider who is ex officio of random player, and become close friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csat4J4YYg8INsDUEUqlJv7VypQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226343'),
  ('460653441905785508', 'The White Horse Inn', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Werner Jacobs, Heinz Schnackertz', 'Oskar Blumenthal, Helmuth M. Backhaus, Gustaf Kadelburg', 'Peter Alexander, Waltraut Haas, Karin Dor, Adrian Hoven, Estella Blain, Gunther Philipp, Werner Finck, Erik Jelde', null, 'Leopold, head waiter at the "Weißen Rössl" (White Horse Inn), is secretly in love with the owner of the restaurant, Josepha. But she''s only interested in the lawyer Dr. Siedler. Jealous, Leopold comes up with a plan to gain Josepha''s attention.', 'Leopold, head waiter at the "Weißen Rössl" (White Horse Inn), is secretly in love with the owner of the restaurant, Josepha. But she''s only interested in the lawyer Dr. Siedler. Jealous, Leopold comes up with a plan to gain Josepha''s attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osykq2Sgw3odStIESCm6DgkrSeE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6792'),
  ('918193869102690914', 'The White Knights', 2015, 'Drama', 'Joachim Lafosse, Jean-François Hensgens', 'Jérôme Beaujour', 'Vincent Lindon, Louise Bourgoin, Valérie Donzelli, Reda Kateb, Yannick Renier, Stéphane Bissot, Raphaëlle Lubansu, Jean-Henri Compère', null, 'Jacques Arnault, head of Sud Secours NGO, is planning a high impact operation: he and his team are going to exfiltrate 300 orphan victims of the Chadian civil war and bring them to French adoption applicants. Françoise Dubois, a journalist, is invited to come along with them and handle the media coverage for this operation. Completely immersed in the brutal reality of a country at war, the NGO members start losing their convictions and are faced with the limits of humanitarian intervention.', 'Jacques Arnault, head of Sud Secours NGO, is planning a high impact operation: he and his team are going to exfiltrate 300 orphan victims of the Chadian civil war and bring them to French adoption applicants. Françoise Dubois, a journalist, is invited to come along with them and handle the media coverage for this operation. Completely immersed in the brutal reality of a country at war, the NGO members start losing their convictions and are faced with the limits of humanitarian intervention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utqwJMUCOGoEPYU9uk7ceE6KSVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334918'),
  ('898131268809737082', 'The White Lady', 1965, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Zdeněk Podskalský, František Valert, Vladimír Zelenka', 'Karel Michal, Zdeněk Podskalský', 'Vlastimil Brodský, Rudolf Hrušínský, Miloš Kopecký, Irena Kačírková, Jiřina Bohdalová, Josef Bek, Čestmír Řanda, Václav Voska', null, 'This castle has its own ghost - a mysterious White lady. She emerges from the painting on the wall when someone speaks out magic formula. White lady is good ghost, she can make someone''s wishes true. Even if it is a new duct. But a miracle is not the thing that Communist leaders want in the town.', 'This castle has its own ghost - a mysterious White lady. She emerges from the painting on the wall when someone speaks out magic formula. White lady is good ghost, she can make someone''s wishes true. Even if it is a new duct. But a miracle is not the thing that Communist leaders want in the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2qyBuAp8AuEGPDpNuYzCaF0cK2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117570'),
  ('332377693240399471', 'The White Masai', 2005, 'Drama', 'Hermine Huntgeburth, Martin Langer', 'Hermine Huntgeburth, Johannes W. Betz, Günter Rohrbach', 'Nina Hoss, Jacky Ido, Katja Flint, Antonio Prester, Janek Rieke, Helen Namaso Lenamarken, Nicolas Sironka, Damaris Itenyo Agweyu', null, 'A girl, Carola, whose vacation in Kenya takes an interesting turn when she becomes infatuated with a Masai. Carola decides to leave her boyfriend to stay with her lover. There, she has to adapt to the Masai''s way of life and get used to their food which includes milk mixed with blood. She also has to face her husband''s attitude towards women and what he expects from a wife. Nonetheless, Carola is welcomed warmly into the tribe she has chosen to join.', 'A girl, Carola, whose vacation in Kenya takes an interesting turn when she becomes infatuated with a Masai. Carola decides to leave her boyfriend to stay with her lover. There, she has to adapt to the Masai''s way of life and get used to their food which includes milk mixed with blood. She also has to face her husband''s attitude towards women and what he expects from a wife. Nonetheless, Carola is welcomed warmly into the tribe she has chosen to join.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hNAYqhwmVYtvxgSZFiKmWJDClP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6967'),
  ('313545534650063472', 'The White Meadows', 2009, 'Drama', 'Mohammad Rasoulof, Ebrahim Ghafori', 'Mohammad Rasoulof', 'Hassan Pourshirazi, Younes Ghazali, Mohammad Rabbani, Mohammad Shirvani, Omid Zare, Mohammad Rabbanipour', null, 'Rahmat travels to a host of islands in a vast salt pan in order to collect the inhabitant''s tears for an unknown purpose. He is joined on his mysterious journey by a young boy searching for his father. As their travel nears its end, a potent critique of Iran''s political leadership emerges.', 'Rahmat travels to a host of islands in a vast salt pan in order to collect the inhabitant''s tears for an unknown purpose. He is joined on his mysterious journey by a young boy searching for his father. As their travel nears its end, a potent critique of Iran''s political leadership emerges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJLARSgAzVxqNKim6nS3ibfeLrR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98238'),
  ('236984984709823481', 'The White Orchid', 1954, 'Adventure, Romance', 'Reginald Le Borg, Enrique Wallace, Gilbert Warrenton', 'David Duncan, Reginald Le Borg', 'William Lundigan, Peggie Castle, Armando Silvestre, Rosenda Monteros, Jorge Treviño, Alejandro de Montenegro, Miguel A. Gallardo, Ramón Sánchez', null, 'In the Southern Mexican jungle, an adventurous archaeologist is accompanied by an equally daring female photographer in a search for a lost Toltec city. They engage a guide to lead them on their expedition, and soon find themselves in the jungle''s depths, far from civilization. Soon both the guide and the archaeologist are vying for the affection of the photographer. They must all deal with enormous danger and sacrifice before their quest is complete.', 'In the Southern Mexican jungle, an adventurous archaeologist is accompanied by an equally daring female photographer in a search for a lost Toltec city. They engage a guide to lead them on their expedition, and soon find themselves in the jungle''s depths, far from civilization. Soon both the guide and the archaeologist are vying for the affection of the photographer. They must all deal with enormous danger and sacrifice before their quest is complete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGZ5PBTAhFXi5PliI3pg0MScQuT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244221'),
  ('1005328268720680470', 'The White Planet', 2006, 'Documentary, Family', 'Jean Lemire, Thierry Piantanida, Thierry Ragobert', null, 'Jean-Louis Étienne', null, 'The White Planet or in French, La Planète Blanche, is a 2006 documentary about the wildlife of the Arctic. It shows interactions between marine animals, birds and land animals, especially the polar bear, over a one year period. The fragility of the Arctic is hinted at as a reason to prevent climate change. It was nominated for the Documentary category in the 27th Genie Awards in 2007.', 'The White Planet or in French, La Planète Blanche, is a 2006 documentary about the wildlife of the Arctic. It shows interactions between marine animals, birds and land animals, especially the polar bear, over a one year period. The fragility of the Arctic is hinted at as a reason to prevent climate change. It was nominated for the Documentary category in the 27th Genie Awards in 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ca68j8E3whkfAFhxEetaAVtaDa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50543'),
  ('130407055761179232', 'The White Queen', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Loup Hubert, Claude Lecomte', 'Jean-Loup Hubert', 'Catherine Deneuve, Richard Bohringer, Bernard Giraudeau, Jean Carmet, Laure Moutoussamy, Isabelle Carré, Muriel Pultar', null, 'In 1960, in a coastal town near to Nantes, Jean Ripoche lives with his wife Liliane, their four children and Liliane’s father Lucien. Jean divides his time between running his plumbing business and making a float for the Nantes carnival. The Ripoche’s ordered lives are thrown into turmoil when Jean’s former friend, Yvon Legualoudec, returns to the town – with his black wife Annabelle and their three children. Before he disappeared twenty years ago, without saying a word, Yvon was Jean’s rival for Liliane’s affections. As bitter memories resurface, the relationship between Jean, Yvon and Liliane become strained.', 'In 1960, in a coastal town near to Nantes, Jean Ripoche lives with his wife Liliane, their four children and Liliane’s father Lucien. Jean divides his time between running his plumbing business and making a float for the Nantes carnival. The Ripoche’s ordered lives are thrown into turmoil when Jean’s former friend, Yvon Legualoudec, returns to the town – with his black wife Annabelle and their three children. Before he disappeared twenty years ago, without saying a word, Yvon was Jean’s rival for Liliane’s affections. As bitter memories resurface, the relationship between Jean, Yvon and Liliane become strained.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPURXkk1W80loTgh6Uheku26GB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164023'),
  ('1136310830131854029', 'The White Rabbit', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Florian Schwarz, Philipp Sichler', 'Holger Karsten Schmidt, Michael Proehl', 'Devid Striesow, Louis Hofmann, Lena Urzendowsky, Shenja Lacher, Julia Jäger, Samia Chancrin, Christoph Schechinger, Patrick Heyn', null, 'A young 13-years-old girl searches for love in the internet. But the truth about the persons behind the computers can be terrible.', 'A young 13-years-old girl searches for love in the internet. But the truth about the persons behind the computers can be terrible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZLS0Xvxzuw6OkNfT97ku1r4ZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404306'),
  ('1043481078424692025', 'The White Reindeer', 1952, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Erik Blomberg, Erik Blomberg', 'Mirjami Kuosmanen, Erik Blomberg', 'Mirjami Kuosmanen, Kalervo Nissilä, Åke Lindman, Jouni Tapiola, Arvo Lehesmaa, Tyyne Haarla, Kauko Laurikainen, Pentti Irjala', null, 'A newly-married woman becomes frustrated as her husband, a reindeer herder for an Arctic village, spends much of his time away. Desperate for affection, she visits a shaman who offers a potion that makes her irresistibly desirable, with unexpected and deadly results.', 'A newly-married woman becomes frustrated as her husband, a reindeer herder for an Arctic village, spends much of his time away. Desperate for affection, she visits a shaman who offers a potion that makes her irresistibly desirable, with unexpected and deadly results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8k31fiN2QOWW6j1f9TwSiRy0bnF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84944'),
  ('882597842160158334', 'The White Ribbon', 2009, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Michael Haneke, Anja Müller, Christian Berger', 'Michael Haneke', 'Christian Friedel, Ernst Jacobi, Leonie Benesch, Ulrich Tukur, Fion Mutert, Ursina Lardi, Burghart Klaußner, Steffi Kühnert', 'R', 'An aged tailor recalls his life as the schoolteacher of a small village in Northern Germany that was struck by a series of strange events in the year leading up to WWI.', 'An aged tailor recalls his life as the schoolteacher of a small village in Northern Germany that was struck by a series of strange events in the year leading up to WWI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54dlnGDexrwAFlDb8HWKfmmX4LB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37903'),
  ('682316367217793260', 'The White River Kid', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Arne Glimcher, Michael Chapman', 'David Leland', 'Bob Hoskins, Antonio Banderas, Ellen Barkin, Wes Bentley, Kim Dickens, Swoosie Kurtz, Beau Bridges, Randy Travis', 'R', 'Two con men are traveling through the American South when they are held hostage by a serial killer who is running from the authorities.', 'Two con men are traveling through the American South when they are held hostage by a serial killer who is running from the authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdULc09j1WCnQDLcHcd4jIHH9TW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47701'),
  ('487069015253585800', 'The White Rose', 1982, 'Drama, History', 'Michael Verhoeven, Axel de Roche', 'Mario Krebs, Michael Verhoeven', 'Lena Stolze, Wulf Kessler, Oliver Siebert, Ulrich Tukur, Werner Stocker, Anja Kruse, Martin Benrath, Hans-Jürgen Schatz', null, 'During the Second World War, a small group of students at Munich University begin to question the decisions and sanity of Germany''s Nazi government. The students form a resistance cell which they name the "White Rose" after a newsletter that is secretly distributed to the student body. At first small in numbers and fearful of discovery, the White Rose begins to gain massive support after a Nazi Gauleiter nearly incites a student riot after a provokative speech. At this point, the matter is taken over by the German Gestapo, who pledge to hunt down and destroy the members of the White Rose.', 'During the Second World War, a small group of students at Munich University begin to question the decisions and sanity of Germany''s Nazi government. The students form a resistance cell which they name the "White Rose" after a newsletter that is secretly distributed to the student body. At first small in numbers and fearful of discovery, the White Rose begins to gain massive support after a Nazi Gauleiter nearly incites a student riot after a provokative speech. At this point, the matter is taken over by the German Gestapo, who pledge to hunt down and destroy the members of the White Rose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2LVdGxEcmrL1FFSfonD5n4xtkK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11057'),
  ('413956745307715879', 'The White Seal', 1975, 'Animation', 'Chuck Jones', 'Rudyard Kipling, Chuck Jones', 'Roddy McDowall, June Foray', 'G', 'In one seal herd, a young seal pup with a rare white colouring named Kotick is born. When as he matures, he learns of the deadly threat that human hunters pose to the herd through their activities. While Kotick is able to save the herd on one occasion, he is fully aware that the threat is not over. Now he must take on the seemingly impossible quest to find a home for his herd where humans will never intrude.', 'In one seal herd, a young seal pup with a rare white colouring named Kotick is born. When as he matures, he learns of the deadly threat that human hunters pose to the herd through their activities. While Kotick is able to save the herd on one occasion, he is fully aware that the threat is not over. Now he must take on the seemingly impossible quest to find a home for his herd where humans will never intrude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/437D0gP8d4S9piiyIf8uqBwfhgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48002'),
  ('683075866376882077', 'The White Shadow', 1924, 'Drama', 'Graham Cutts, Alfred Hitchcock', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Betty Compson, Clive Brook, Henry Victor, A.B. Imeson, Olaf Hytten, Daisy Campbell, Bert Darley, Maresco Marisini', null, 'In Paris, a wild girl becomes possessed by the soul of her twin who died to save her life.', 'In Paris, a wild girl becomes possessed by the soul of her twin who died to save her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sqoJB0MOhb5UHfMLFNxGEXSSg0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143534'),
  ('608896282327868734', 'The White Sheik', 1952, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Federico Fellini, Arturo Gallea, Stefano Ubezio', 'Tullio Pinelli, Federico Fellini, Ennio Flaiano', 'Alberto Sordi, Brunella Bovo, Leopoldo Trieste, Giulietta Masina, Ernesto Almirante, Lilia Landi, Fanny Marchiò, Gina Mascetti', 'NR', 'In Italy, small-town newlyweds Wanda and Ivan Cavalli embark on their honeymoon in the big city of Rome. Ivan dutifully wants to keep appointments with family and church, but Wanda is only interested in meeting her favorite photo-strip star known as "The White Sheik". While Wanda impetuously sneaks away to locate the object of her affections, disconsolate Ivan tries his hardest to keep up appearances with the couple''s relatives.', 'In Italy, small-town newlyweds Wanda and Ivan Cavalli embark on their honeymoon in the big city of Rome. Ivan dutifully wants to keep appointments with family and church, but Wanda is only interested in meeting her favorite photo-strip star known as "The White Sheik". While Wanda impetuously sneaks away to locate the object of her affections, disconsolate Ivan tries his hardest to keep up appearances with the couple''s relatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kyO9tTwiD4zsQKqMicP2AVxglww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43361'),
  ('979295453962137513', 'The White Ship', 1941, 'Drama, War', 'Giuseppe Caracciolo, Roberto Rossellini, Cesare Girosi', 'Roberto Rossellini, Francesco De Robertis', 'Augusto Basso, Elena Fondi', null, 'Although released anonymously, as was the custom with all films produced by the Italian Navy, La Nave Bianca is the first feature-length effort directed by Roberto Rossellini; it is also very much the work of its co-writer and supervisor Francesco De Robertis. The film combines a documentary look at the Italian Navy during World War II with newsreel combat footage and a scripted love story performed by non-professional actors.', 'Although released anonymously, as was the custom with all films produced by the Italian Navy, La Nave Bianca is the first feature-length effort directed by Roberto Rossellini; it is also very much the work of its co-writer and supervisor Francesco De Robertis. The film combines a documentary look at the Italian Navy during World War II with newsreel combat footage and a scripted love story performed by non-professional actors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NdHt1zvhy249pOMbK9aiw8IHvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64032'),
  ('1069992883351703000', 'The White Sister', 1923, 'Drama, Romance', 'Henry King, Roy F. Overbaugh', 'George V. Hobart, Charles E. Whittaker', 'Lillian Gish, Ronald Colman, Gail Kane, J. Barney Sherry, Charles Lane, Juliette La Violette, Gustavo Serena, Alfredo Bertone', null, 'Angela Chiaromonte is the daughter of a wealthy Italian prince who is killed in a fall from his horse. Though Angela stands to inherit half of a large estate, her older half-sister burns the will and thus inherits everything herself, throwing Angela into poverty. Fortunately, Angela is engaged to marry dashing Captain Giovanni Severi - but he soon is captured by Arabs while on an expedition to Africa. Believing him dead, Angela, dedicating her life to his memory, becomes a nun, unaware that her lover has escaped his captors and is returning to Italy. The dramatic climax takes place against a backdrop of the eruption of Mount Vesuvius.', 'Angela Chiaromonte is the daughter of a wealthy Italian prince who is killed in a fall from his horse. Though Angela stands to inherit half of a large estate, her older half-sister burns the will and thus inherits everything herself, throwing Angela into poverty. Fortunately, Angela is engaged to marry dashing Captain Giovanni Severi - but he soon is captured by Arabs while on an expedition to Africa. Believing him dead, Angela, dedicating her life to his memory, becomes a nun, unaware that her lover has escaped his captors and is returning to Italy. The dramatic climax takes place against a backdrop of the eruption of Mount Vesuvius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zhB3szrmfHHHpafY4kSTGciMkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70734'),
  ('10540493959435101', 'The White Sound', 2001, 'Drama', 'Matthias Schellenberg, Hans Weingartner, Tobias Amann', 'Katrin Blum', 'Daniel Brühl, Anabelle Lachatte, Patrick Joswig, Katharina Schüttler, Ilse Strambowski, Michael Schütz, Eno Hünninger, Karl Danguillier', null, 'Lukas, a young schizophrenic man, has to deal with a new town, a new relationship, and the paranoia in his head.', 'Lukas, a young schizophrenic man, has to deal with a new town, a new relationship, and the paranoia in his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYJLb69aANQhf6EvewCnKRpiJ5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273'),
  ('691593983807421909', 'The White Space', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Francesca Comencini, Luca Bigazzi', 'Francesca Comencini, Federica Pontremoli, Valeria Parrella', 'Margherita Buy, Gaetano Bruno, Giovanni Ludeno, Antonia Truppo, Guido Caprino, Salvatore Cantalupo, Maria Paiato, Lia Zinno', null, 'An unexpected pregnancy and premature birth become a burden that Maria is unprepared for. Lacking control over events for the first time in her life, she retreats into an emotional space where she is alone, until the day arrives when she must learn to live again for the sake of her vulnerable child.', 'An unexpected pregnancy and premature birth become a burden that Maria is unprepared for. Lacking control over events for the first time in her life, she retreats into an emotional space where she is alone, until the day arrives when she must learn to live again for the sake of her vulnerable child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npBy4U4362pIZihJHYecLqKqItA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56844'),
  ('819335487365093034', 'The White Spider', 1963, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Harald Reinl, Werner M. Lenz', 'Egon Eis', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Karin Dor, Horst Frank, Werner Peters, Dieter Eppler, Friedrich Schoenfelder, Mady Rahl, Paul Klinger', null, 'After an automobile accident, in which a man is unrecognizably burnt to a crisp, his wife''s only able to confirm the corpse''s identity by his talisman: a small, white spider. However, soon, there are more corpses walking around than at a comic con convention and every single one of them was a white spider sitting on or nearby the body.', 'After an automobile accident, in which a man is unrecognizably burnt to a crisp, his wife''s only able to confirm the corpse''s identity by his talisman: a small, white spider. However, soon, there are more corpses walking around than at a comic con convention and every single one of them was a white spider sitting on or nearby the body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8gryiCFIdyJU0hCoewsjdXiRD2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245501'),
  ('402594292657905139', 'The White Stadium', 1928, 'Documentary', 'Arnold Fanck, Othmar Gurtner, Richard Angst', null, 'Sonja Henie', null, 'A profile of the 1928 Olympic Games in St. Moritz, Switzerland.', 'A profile of the 1928 Olympic Games in St. Moritz, Switzerland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfZcuZFku6DFJwJL6rMFRUSNekj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270944'),
  ('928705790669135927', 'The White Storm', 2013, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming, Chas Chau', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Ram Ling Chi-Man, Manfred Wong Man-Chun', 'Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Louis Koo, Yuan Quan, Ben Lam Kwok-Bun, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Lo Hoi-Pang, Berg Ng Ting-Yip', null, 'An operation in Thailand against a notorious drug lord changes the destiny of a Hong Kong Police Department narcotic team. Five years later, a drug dealing brings them together again.', 'An operation in Thailand against a notorious drug lord changes the destiny of a Hong Kong Police Department narcotic team. Five years later, a drug dealing brings them together again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fju7gEgHx0s1O7zeCB0BobInhvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233112'),
  ('844791672573261154', 'The White Storm 2: Drug Lords', 2019, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Ricky Ko, Herman Yau', 'Erica Li, Eric Lee, Herman Yau', 'Andy Lau, Louis Koo, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Karena Lam Kar-Yan, Cheung Kwok-Keung, Carlos Chan Ka-Lok, Michelle Wai Si-Nga, Jun Kung', null, 'A financial tycoon, once a triad member, tries to eradicate the drug market while an old accomplice aims to be Hong Kong''s first drug lord.', 'A financial tycoon, once a triad member, tries to eradicate the drug market while an old accomplice aims to be Hong Kong''s first drug lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ja9oIIP33Pgm9295Gn67zBz8Vjy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512731'),
  ('509445225187296849', 'The White Storm 3: Heaven or Hell', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Herman Yau, Mandy Ngai Man-Yin', 'Herman Yau', 'Louis Koo, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Aaron Kwok, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Edward Chui Wai-Tung, Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Power Chan Kwok-Pong', null, 'An undercover cop who invade a drug cartel led by a notorious Thai drug lord. In classic heroic bloodshed fashion, the two develop a bond of brotherhood.', 'An undercover cop who invade a drug cartel led by a notorious Thai drug lord. In classic heroic bloodshed fashion, the two develop a bond of brotherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtsEksiUjysMYv4gxdRQcbu2v6V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1093485'),
  ('135337500754676512', 'The White Stripes: Under Great White Northern Lights', 2009, 'Documentary, Music', 'Emmett Malloy', null, 'Jack White, Meg White', null, 'In 2007 the legendary American duo White Stripes toured Canada. Besides playing the usual venues they challenged themselves and played in buses, cafés and for Indian tribal elders. Music video director Emmett Malloy followed the band and managed to capture both the special tour, extraordinary concert versions of the band''s minimalist, raw, blues-inspired rock songs and the special relationship between the extroverted Jack White and the introspective Meg White - a formerly married couple who for a long time claimed to be siblings. The film makes striking use of the band''s concert colors: red, white and black.', 'In 2007 the legendary American duo White Stripes toured Canada. Besides playing the usual venues they challenged themselves and played in buses, cafés and for Indian tribal elders. Music video director Emmett Malloy followed the band and managed to capture both the special tour, extraordinary concert versions of the band''s minimalist, raw, blues-inspired rock songs and the special relationship between the extroverted Jack White and the introspective Meg White - a formerly married couple who for a long time claimed to be siblings. The film makes striking use of the band''s concert colors: red, white and black.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddYQd5ARAA6ZpDC0WuCOIdZeO2U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34767'),
  ('420633136388679374', 'The White Suit', 1999, 'Romance, Drama', 'Lazar Ristovski', 'Lazar Ristovski', 'Lazar Ristovski, Radmila Shegoleva, Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić, Velimir Živojinović, Danilo ''Bata'' Stojković, Bogdan Diklić, Branimir Brstina, Nikola Kojo', null, 'A sergeant officer lives a life of a loner, reads literary classics and dreams about acting. On his journey by train, he madly falls in love with a prostitute, but her pimp - another passenger on a train - is not willing to let her go, which makes their destiny tragic.', 'A sergeant officer lives a life of a loner, reads literary classics and dreams about acting. On his journey by train, he madly falls in love with a prostitute, but her pimp - another passenger on a train - is not willing to let her go, which makes their destiny tragic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifWqkvXm13h45EVYhKppRQg3MhF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109029'),
  ('848984887712169027', 'The White Sun of the Desert', 1969, 'Action, Drama, Romance, Comedy, Adventure, War', 'Vladimir Motyl, Eduard Rozovsky, B. Dovlatov', 'Valentin Ezhov, Rustam Ibragimbekov', 'Anatoliy Kuznetsov, Pavel Luspekayev, Spartak Mishulin, Kakhi Kavsadze, Raisa Kurkina, Nikolai Godovikov, Tatyana Fedotova, Musa Dudayev', null, 'The setting is the east shore of the Caspian Sea (today''s Turkmenistan) where the Red Army soldier Fyodor Sukhov has been fighting the Civil War in Russian Asia for a number of years. After being hospitalised and then demobbed, he sets off home to join his wife, only to be caught up in a desert fight between a Red Army cavalry unit and Basmachi guerrillas. The cavalry unit commander, Rahimov, "convinces" Sukhov to help, temporarily, with the protection of abandoned women of the Basmachi guerrilla leader Abdullah''s harem. Leaving a young Red Army soldier, Petrukha, to assist Sukhov with the task, Rahimov and his cavalry unit set out to pursue fleeing Abdullah.Sukhov and women from Abdullah''s harem return to a nearby shore town. Soon, looking for a seaway across the border, Abdullah and his gang come to the same town...', 'The setting is the east shore of the Caspian Sea (today''s Turkmenistan) where the Red Army soldier Fyodor Sukhov has been fighting the Civil War in Russian Asia for a number of years. After being hospitalised and then demobbed, he sets off home to join his wife, only to be caught up in a desert fight between a Red Army cavalry unit and Basmachi guerrillas. The cavalry unit commander, Rahimov, "convinces" Sukhov to help, temporarily, with the protection of abandoned women of the Basmachi guerrilla leader Abdullah''s harem. Leaving a young Red Army soldier, Petrukha, to assist Sukhov with the task, Rahimov and his cavalry unit set out to pursue fleeing Abdullah.Sukhov and women from Abdullah''s harem return to a nearby shore town. Soon, looking for a seaway across the border, Abdullah and his gang come to the same town...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QTcytLWn5syM2N1U1DJDkEGPj4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20848'),
  ('468995272902513725', 'The White Tiger', 2021, 'Drama', 'Ramin Bahrani, Paolo Carnera', 'Ramin Bahrani', 'Adarsh Gourav, Rajkummar Rao, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Mahesh Manjrekar, Vijay Maurya, Kamlesh Gill, Swaroop Sampat, Tawhid Rike Zaman', 'R', 'An ambitious Indian driver uses his wit and cunning to escape from poverty and rise to the top. An epic journey based on the New York Times bestseller.', 'An ambitious Indian driver uses his wit and cunning to escape from poverty and rise to the top. An epic journey based on the New York Times bestseller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JnmseS3DZ6ad2VMbrnbGCs8Rst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628534'),
  ('345643533171131894', 'The White Tower', 1950, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Ted Tetzlaff, Ray Rennahan', 'Paul Jarrico', 'Glenn Ford, Alida Valli, Claude Rains, Oskar Homolka, Cedric Hardwicke, Lloyd Bridges, June Clayworth, Lotte Stein', 'NR', 'Mountain climbers in the Swiss Alps mull over past problems while trying to conquer a perilous peak.', 'Mountain climbers in the Swiss Alps mull over past problems while trying to conquer a perilous peak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUjkoryVpnOnJBnMLPizEqYlhbe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92775'),
  ('1061004638150132459', 'The White Viking', 1991, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Hrafn Gunnlaugsson, Tony Forsberg', 'Hrafn Gunnlaugsson', 'Gottskálk Dagur Sigurðarson, Maria Bonnevie, Egill Ólafsson, Tomas Norström, Þorsteinn Hannesson, Helgi Skúlason, Jón Tryggvason, Gunnar Jónsson', null, 'Norway in the 10th century. Askur, son of the powerful Thorgeir marries Embla, daughter of one of the few remaining landowners in Norway, in a pagan ceremony. King Olav, a ruthless christian, wants to eredicate all traces of non-christian beliefs and captures the two of them during the ceremony. In order to free Embla, Askur must go to Iceland and convert the people there to catholicism.', 'Norway in the 10th century. Askur, son of the powerful Thorgeir marries Embla, daughter of one of the few remaining landowners in Norway, in a pagan ceremony. King Olav, a ruthless christian, wants to eredicate all traces of non-christian beliefs and captures the two of them during the ceremony. In order to free Embla, Askur must go to Iceland and convert the people there to catholicism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1fThSUzsy9ZuNHQkbveI0Z3g3n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39518'),
  ('691280381698340054', 'The White Warrior', 1959, 'Action, Adventure, History', 'Riccardo Freda, Mario Bava, Leopoldo Savona', 'Gino De Santis, Ákos Tolnay', 'Steve Reeves, Giorgia Moll, Scilla Gabel, Renato Baldini, Gérard Herter, Milivoje Živanović, Nikola Popović, Jovan Gec', null, 'The story of Hadji Murad, a 19th-century Chechen chieftain who led his warriors in a fight against the invading forces of the Russian Czar.', 'The story of Hadji Murad, a 19th-century Chechen chieftain who led his warriors in a fight against the invading forces of the Russian Czar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFN4xwm03U4DCSdvOKdXDKGcubQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271572'),
  ('279722356168236938', 'The Whiz Kids', 2001, 'Drama', 'Jan Krüger, Torben Liebrecht, Oliver Schwabe', 'Jan Krüger', 'Martin Kiefer, Marlon Kittel, Rose Bender, Iris Minich, Britta Jatzwauk, Benno Günther, Phillip Nilgen, Lukas Nilgen', null, 'Two sixteen-year-old boys, Marcos and Johannes, spend their days racing, wrestling, hanging out, watching videos and playing hide-and-seek at nights. A closeness develops between the two of them, which soon starts to become a calamity to their friendship.', 'Two sixteen-year-old boys, Marcos and Johannes, spend their days racing, wrestling, hanging out, watching videos and playing hide-and-seek at nights. A closeness develops between the two of them, which soon starts to become a calamity to their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNZJUZgfxnD60VA5vGf7qDdHVWB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177123'),
  ('780155095571689920', 'The Who: The Kids Are Alright', 1979, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jeff Stein', 'Jeff Stein', 'Roger Daltrey, John Entwistle, Pete Townshend, Keith Moon, Ringo Starr, Steve Martin, Russell Harty, Tom Smothers', 'PG', 'Through concert performances and interviews, this film offers us a comprehensive look at the British pioneer rock group, The Who. It captures their zany craziness and outrageous antics from the initial formation of the group in 1964 to 1978. It notably features the band''s last performance with long-term drummer Keith Moon, filmed at Shepperton Studios in May 1978, three months before his death.', 'Through concert performances and interviews, this film offers us a comprehensive look at the British pioneer rock group, The Who. It captures their zany craziness and outrageous antics from the initial formation of the group in 1964 to 1978. It notably features the band''s last performance with long-term drummer Keith Moon, filmed at Shepperton Studios in May 1978, three months before his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30KLQduKvVzuYbqHMrWBcDHKs7O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22984'),
  ('218141093781531577', 'The Whole Nine Yards', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime', 'David Franco, Jonathan Lynn, Jean-Pierre Paquet', 'Mitchell Kapner', 'Matthew Perry, Bruce Willis, Natasha Henstridge, Amanda Peet, Michael Clarke Duncan, Rosanna Arquette, Kevin Pollak, Harland Williams', 'R', 'After a mobster agrees to cooperate with an FBI investigation in order to stay out of prison, he''s relocated by the authorities to a life of suburban anonymity as part of a witness protection program. It''s not long before a couple of his new neighbours figure out his true identity and come knocking to see if he''d be up for one more hit—suburban style.', 'After a mobster agrees to cooperate with an FBI investigation in order to stay out of prison, he''s relocated by the authorities to a life of suburban anonymity as part of a witness protection program. It''s not long before a couple of his new neighbours figure out his true identity and come knocking to see if he''d be up for one more hit—suburban style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDV7ntPLY0ZDBT722Odsi80nFrn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2069'),
  ('279185289786179615', 'The Whole Shebang', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hanno Lentz, Doris Dörrie', 'Doris Dörrie', 'Hannelore Elsner, Nadja Uhl, Hinnerk Schönemann, Axel Prahl, Peter Striebeck, Fabian Hinrichs, Robert Stadlober, Stefanie von Poser', null, 'After a series of catastrophically failed marriages, Apple is single again. Blame on Apple''s attachment is in her opinion, her mother Ingrid. Because this Apple has punished not only with her hippie name, but was in every way a raven mother. When Ingrid spends an All Inclusive vacation in Spain, her mother and daughter are confronted with a dramatic event from their past.', 'After a series of catastrophically failed marriages, Apple is single again. Blame on Apple''s attachment is in her opinion, her mother Ingrid. Because this Apple has punished not only with her hippie name, but was in every way a raven mother. When Ingrid spends an All Inclusive vacation in Spain, her mother and daughter are confronted with a dramatic event from their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wH44amLQxrcFFeqr3y4JAQ54utk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258357'),
  ('203881090866545055', 'The Whole Shootin'' Match', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eagle Pennell, Eagle Pennell', 'Lin Sutherland, Eagle Pennell', 'Lou Perryman, Sonny Carl Davis, Doris Hargrave, Eric Henshaw, David Weber, James N. Harrell, Margaret Becker, Wayne Bell', null, 'Lloyd and Frank, two lifelong friends and self-styled entrepreneurs in Austin, try to find the get-rich-quick scheme that will actually get them rich. Lloyd has developed a new invention that he''s sure will finally lead to the success he and Frank have been chasing their whole lives. Their golden ticket is a combination mop, vacuum cleaner and floor polisher, but before prosperity arrives, reality intrudes on their plans.', 'Lloyd and Frank, two lifelong friends and self-styled entrepreneurs in Austin, try to find the get-rich-quick scheme that will actually get them rich. Lloyd has developed a new invention that he''s sure will finally lead to the success he and Frank have been chasing their whole lives. Their golden ticket is a combination mop, vacuum cleaner and floor polisher, but before prosperity arrives, reality intrudes on their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSa1N3EVO67cB1xNEgzf6yMAD0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121200'),
  ('493572664047613793', 'The Whole Ten Yards', 2004, 'Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Howard Deutch, Neil Roach, K.C. Colwell', 'George Gallo', 'Bruce Willis, Matthew Perry, Amanda Peet, Natasha Henstridge, Kevin Pollak, Frank Collison, Johnny Messner, Silas Weir Mitchell', 'PG-13', 'Jimmy "The Tulip" Tudeski now spends his days compulsively cleaning his house and perfecting his culinary skills with his wife, Jill, a purported assassin who has yet to pull off a clean hit. Suddenly, an uninvited and unwelcome connection to their past unexpectedly shows up on Jimmy and Jill''s doorstep; it''s Oz, and he''s begging them to help him rescue his wife, Cynthia.', 'Jimmy "The Tulip" Tudeski now spends his days compulsively cleaning his house and perfecting his culinary skills with his wife, Jill, a purported assassin who has yet to pull off a clean hit. Suddenly, an uninvited and unwelcome connection to their past unexpectedly shows up on Jimmy and Jill''s doorstep; it''s Oz, and he''s begging them to help him rescue his wife, Cynthia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fbglyCpPqK1u40fhncLXKAF74A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2122'),
  ('752934141020651801', 'The Whole Town''s Talking', 1935, 'Comedy, Crime', 'John Ford, Joseph H. August, Eddie Donahoe', 'Robert Riskin, Jo Swerling', 'Edward G. Robinson, Jean Arthur, Arthur Hohl, James Donlan, Arthur Byron, Wallace Ford, Donald Meek, Etienne Girardot', null, 'Ordinary man-in-the-street Arthur Ferguson Jones leads a very straightforward life. He''s never late for work and nothing interesting ever happens to him. One day everything changes: he oversleeps and is fired as an example, he''s then mistaken for evil criminal killer Mannion and is arrested. The resemblance is so striking that the police give him a special pass to avoid a similar mistake. The real Mannion sees the opportunity to steal the pass and move around freely and chaos results.', 'Ordinary man-in-the-street Arthur Ferguson Jones leads a very straightforward life. He''s never late for work and nothing interesting ever happens to him. One day everything changes: he oversleeps and is fired as an example, he''s then mistaken for evil criminal killer Mannion and is arrested. The resemblance is so striking that the police give him a special pass to avoid a similar mistake. The real Mannion sees the opportunity to steal the pass and move around freely and chaos results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7L0o3XXJpq6fg0OalH3CjR7k68S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52561'),
  ('1002305188835776244', 'The Whole Truth', 1958, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'John Guillermin, Wilkie Cooper, Ronald Spencer', 'Jonathan Latimer', 'Stewart Granger, Donna Reed, George Sanders, Gianna Maria Canale, Michael Shillo, Peter Dyneley, Hy Hazell, Jimmy Thompson', 'NR', 'On the French Riviera, movie producer Max Poulton is on location shooting a film starring his lover, Gina Bertini. But when the rueful Max ends his fling with Gina to return to his loyal wife, Carol, the jilted actress threatens to reveal details of their affair to Carol. Later, at a party at Max''s villa, investigator Carliss arrives with news that Gina has been killed and that Max is a murderer suspect.', 'On the French Riviera, movie producer Max Poulton is on location shooting a film starring his lover, Gina Bertini. But when the rueful Max ends his fling with Gina to return to his loyal wife, Carol, the jilted actress threatens to reveal details of their affair to Carol. Later, at a party at Max''s villa, investigator Carliss arrives with news that Gina has been killed and that Max is a murderer suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5gdsGUfQtoeq1fx6Zc0F4wxLYX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118543'),
  ('122468461409655606', 'The Whole Truth', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Timothy Bird, Tommy Martin, Jules O''Loughlin', 'Nicholas Kazan', 'Keanu Reeves, Renée Zellweger, Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Gabriel Basso, Jim Belushi, Jim Klock, Ritchie Montgomery, Christopher Berry', 'R', 'A defense attorney works to get his teenage client acquitted of murdering his wealthy father.', 'A defense attorney works to get his teenage client acquitted of murdering his wealthy father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iL3Bx4YOqYdAMlx4czLyygA09MC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331583'),
  ('737733297976798576', 'The Whole Truth', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Natdanai Naksuwan, Wisit Sasanatieng', 'Chanchana Homsap, Apiwat Bunchalaksi, Wisit Sasanatieng', 'Sompob Benjathikul, Tarika Thidathit, Sutatta Udomsilp, Nattapat Nimjirawat, Nicole Theriault, Sadanont Durongkhaweroj, Keetapat Pongruea, Thasorn Klinnium', 'R', 'When two siblings stumble on a strange hole in the wall of their grandparents'' house, horrifying incidents reveal sinister secrets about their family.', 'When two siblings stumble on a strange hole in the wall of their grandparents'' house, horrifying incidents reveal sinister secrets about their family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xo2OFHncAymOQtzHwPFF0nyHPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:895001'),
  ('998304189129904651', 'The Whole Wide World', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dan Ireland, Claudio Rocha', 'Michael Scott Myers', 'Vincent D''Onofrio, Renée Zellweger, Ann Wedgeworth, Harve Presnell, Benjamin Mouton, Helen Cates, Leslie Buesing, Chris Shearer', null, 'In 1930s Texas, pulp fiction master Robert E. Howard is introduced to Novalyne Price, a teacher with aspirations of becoming an author herself, and they begin a unique relationship filled with conversation and imagination. Although the possibility exists for romance, Howard''s obsession with his work and dedication to his sick mother leads Price to look elsewhere for love, leaving Howard feeling betrayed and alone.', 'In 1930s Texas, pulp fiction master Robert E. Howard is introduced to Novalyne Price, a teacher with aspirations of becoming an author herself, and they begin a unique relationship filled with conversation and imagination. Although the possibility exists for romance, Howard''s obsession with his work and dedication to his sick mother leads Price to look elsewhere for love, leaving Howard feeling betrayed and alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajMk4ueXcOCbxwJjJecltiGhYrn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18451'),
  ('570978623387550660', 'The Whoopee Boys', 1986, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Byrum, Ralf D. Bode', 'David Obst, Steve Zacharias, Jeff Buhai', 'Michael O''Keefe, Paul Rodríguez, Denholm Elliott, Carole Shelley, Andy Bumatai, Eddie Deezen, Marsha Warfield, Elizabeth Arlen', 'R', 'Two obnoxious and dim-witted misfits attempt to save a school for needy children by attempting to sneak into the wealthy high society of Palm Beach to get the money needed for their cause.', 'Two obnoxious and dim-witted misfits attempt to save a school for needy children by attempting to sneak into the wealthy high society of Palm Beach to get the money needed for their cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzlouRv4V9FxaElt4VNUeLUlaws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15029'),
  ('804730023787522295', 'The Whoopee Party', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Music', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'A house party. While Minnie plays piano and the guests dance, Mickey, Goofy, and Horace prepare a snack, which is brought out to much fanfare and immediately devoured. A band forms and plays Scott Joplin''s The Entertainer; Mickey dances with Patricia Pig and various inanimate objects also dance, while all cry "Whoopee!" from time to time. The police come to break up the party.', 'A house party. While Minnie plays piano and the guests dance, Mickey, Goofy, and Horace prepare a snack, which is brought out to much fanfare and immediately devoured. A band forms and plays Scott Joplin''s The Entertainer; Mickey dances with Patricia Pig and various inanimate objects also dance, while all cry "Whoopee!" from time to time. The police come to break up the party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eMVsGkqKbqCzf3NfFrtb64WBxE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70880'),
  ('190097433194064013', 'The Whore and the Whale', 2004, 'Drama', 'José Luis Alcaine, Luis Puenzo, Raúl Rodríguez Peila', 'Ángeles González-Sinde, Lucía Puenzo, Luis Puenzo', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Pep Munné, Mercè Llorens, Martín Caloni, Pompeyo Audivert, Miguel Ángel Solá, Nicolás Tognola', null, 'A Spanish writer finds an old coffer with photographs of an Argentine man who fought and died in the Spanish Civil War, and of a woman. Her quest for answers brings Vera to the Argentine Patagonia.', 'A Spanish writer finds an old coffer with photographs of an Argentine man who fought and died in the Spanish Civil War, and of a woman. Her quest for answers brings Vera to the Argentine Patagonia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYQ4j7zB3dYWjLd7tdQyG76GdO2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59979'),
  ('988407076019593404', 'The Whore''s Son', 2004, 'Drama', 'Jürgen Jürges, Michael Sturminger', 'Michael Sturminger, Michael Glawogger', 'Chulpan Khamatova, Stanislav Lisnic, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Maria Hofstätter, Ina Gogálová, Gabriel Usein, Emanuel Usein, Stefan Sidlo', null, 'Ozren is raised in Vienna by his mother Silvija, who works as a prostitute, and his aunt and uncle. The film shows the demimonde of Vienna in the early 1990ies and deals with Ozren''s finding out that his mother is not a waitress (as he was initially told) and with the way he copes with it.', 'Ozren is raised in Vienna by his mother Silvija, who works as a prostitute, and his aunt and uncle. The film shows the demimonde of Vienna in the early 1990ies and deals with Ozren''s finding out that his mother is not a waitress (as he was initially told) and with the way he copes with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77rJIGhcduKsKcjx0zssFacgDx1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6216'),
  ('697350720977423302', 'The Whores', 1994, 'Drama', 'Aurelio Grimaldi, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Aurelio Grimaldi', 'Ida Di Benedetto, Guia Jelo, Lucia Sardo, Sandra Sindoni, Paola Pace, Alessandra Di Sanzo, Marco Leonardi, Adriano Chiaramida', null, 'Orlanda, Liuccia, Milù, Blu Blu and Veronica are five women in Palermo, Sicily, each different from the other. But, along with transvestite Kim and young man Maurizio, they all share something: they''re "buttane", hookers, who spend the day between the streets and home; some got children, some got problems with the pimps, some with the clients...', 'Orlanda, Liuccia, Milù, Blu Blu and Veronica are five women in Palermo, Sicily, each different from the other. But, along with transvestite Kim and young man Maurizio, they all share something: they''re "buttane", hookers, who spend the day between the streets and home; some got children, some got problems with the pimps, some with the clients...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5D22PB1qSxwctFnNDi5qU5lEtFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49714'),
  ('836434786445948605', 'The Wicked', 2013, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Winther, Eduardo Enrique Mayén', 'Michael Vickerman', 'Devon Werkheiser, Nicole Forester, Justin Deeley, Caitlin Carmichael, Cassie Keller, Jamie Kaler, Jess Adams, Diana Hopper', 'NR', 'A Group of teenagers test the legend of an immortal witch and get more than they bargained for. It''s almost Halloween and six young people, spooked but not undaunted by the folklore surrounding an old haunted house, make their way to the abode of the legendary Wicked, perhaps hoping to provoke the malevolent witch, but clearly not prepared for what they''ve certainly unleashed.', 'A Group of teenagers test the legend of an immortal witch and get more than they bargained for. It''s almost Halloween and six young people, spooked but not undaunted by the folklore surrounding an old haunted house, make their way to the abode of the legendary Wicked, perhaps hoping to provoke the malevolent witch, but clearly not prepared for what they''ve certainly unleashed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpkdYglyMhTi1UkmgFn3jTAwPLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131689'),
  ('1091854812458369606', 'The Wicked Carabel', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Ricardo Torres', 'Wenceslao Fernández Flórez', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, María Luz Galicia, Rafael López Somoza, Julia Caba Alba, Manuel Alexandre, Joaquín Roa, Rosario García Ortega, Xan das Bolas', null, 'Since he wants get married, the young Carabel, who is employed in a real estate agent, decides to ask their bosses for a raise in order to maintain his future wife. However, all he gets is to be fired. He then realizes that honesty is what has led him to unemployment and decides to change his life and live outside the law. He plots to steal the safe from his former company', 'Since he wants get married, the young Carabel, who is employed in a real estate agent, decides to ask their bosses for a raise in order to maintain his future wife. However, all he gets is to be fired. He then realizes that honesty is what has led him to unemployment and decides to change his life and live outside the law. He plots to steal the safe from his former company', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQqUwLA6hGWK8yutVrQZitkTw7a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117869'),
  ('831297840457087854', 'The Wicked Darling', 1919, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Tod Browning', 'Waldemar Young, Harvey Gates', 'Priscilla Dean, Wellington A. Playter, Lon Chaney, Spottiswoode Aitken, Gertrude Astor', null, 'A slum girl is forced to steal for a living. After she swipes a rich society''s matron''s necklace, she hides out at the home of a man who turns out to be the socialite''s former fiance.', 'A slum girl is forced to steal for a living. After she swipes a rich society''s matron''s necklace, she hides out at the home of a man who turns out to be the socialite''s former fiance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cx6tQ3gKZGkVmfgaKyOU93yaJAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152464'),
  ('400375970114398385', 'The Wicked Gift', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Stefano Pollastro, Roberto D''Antona, Alex D''Antona', 'Roberto D''Antona', 'Roberto D''Antona, Annamaria Lorusso, Francesco Emulo, Kateryna Korchynska, Andrea Milan, Mirko D''Antona, David White, Michael Segal', null, 'Ethan is a young, shy and rather reserved designer who has suffered from insomnia for many years due to his terrible nightmares. Believing he has a personality disorder he decides to see a therapist to solve his problem, but it will be thanks to the help of his best friend and a medium that he will face a long journey, a journey that will lead him to discover that his nightmares hide a shocking truth, something darker and more sinister than he ever imagined.', 'Ethan is a young, shy and rather reserved designer who has suffered from insomnia for many years due to his terrible nightmares. Believing he has a personality disorder he decides to see a therapist to solve his problem, but it will be thanks to the help of his best friend and a medium that he will face a long journey, a journey that will lead him to discover that his nightmares hide a shocking truth, something darker and more sinister than he ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwo0xq4dTQQDPLG97gev4Jt3f61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468904'),
  ('347057196680489593', 'The Wicked Lady', 1945, 'Drama, Adventure, History', 'Leslie Arliss, Jack E. Cox', 'Leslie Arliss', 'Margaret Lockwood, James Mason, Patricia Roc, Griffith Jones, Michael Rennie, Felix Aylmer, Enid Stamp-Taylor, Jean Kent', 'NR', 'A married woman finds new thrills as a masked robber on the highways.', 'A married woman finds new thrills as a masked robber on the highways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/732dptVJodpDo0t6VVzt8QstUVO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41073'),
  ('1025925569642283458', 'The Wicked Lady', 1983, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Michael Winner, Jack Cardiff', 'Michael Winner, Leslie Arliss', 'Faye Dunaway, Alan Bates, John Gielgud, Denholm Elliott, Prunella Scales, Oliver Tobias, Glynis Barber, Joan Hickson', 'R', 'Caroline is to be wed to Sir Ralph and invites her sister Barbara to be her bridesmaid. Barbara seduces Ralph, however, and she becomes the new Lady, but despite her new wealthy situation, she gets bored and turns to highway robbery for thrills. While on the road she meets a famous highwayman, and they continue as a team, but some people begin suspecting her identity, and she risks death if she continues her nefarious activities.', 'Caroline is to be wed to Sir Ralph and invites her sister Barbara to be her bridesmaid. Barbara seduces Ralph, however, and she becomes the new Lady, but despite her new wealthy situation, she gets bored and turns to highway robbery for thrills. While on the road she meets a famous highwayman, and they continue as a team, but some people begin suspecting her identity, and she risks death if she continues her nefarious activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpePR1PBAT3gQDsmDZQtB3q6ZLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110683'),
  ('504051187042246146', 'The Wicker Man', 1973, 'Horror', 'Robin Hardy, Harry Waxman, Peter Allwork', 'Anthony Shaffer', 'Edward Woodward, Christopher Lee, Britt Ekland, Diane Cilento, Ingrid Pitt, Roy Boyd, Lesley Mackie, Walter Carr', 'R', 'Police sergeant Neil Howie is called to an island village in search of a missing girl whom the locals claim never existed. The investigation is further complicated as Howie’s religious views clash with those of the island’s residents.', 'Police sergeant Neil Howie is called to an island village in search of a missing girl whom the locals claim never existed. The investigation is further complicated as Howie’s religious views clash with those of the island’s residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwtrXRL8SiOWxhwLEvw7iBgYh0g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16307'),
  ('1112183111541438594', 'The Wicker Man', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Neil LaBute, Paul Sarossy, Ian Seabrook', 'Anthony Shaffer', 'Nicolas Cage, Ellen Burstyn, Kate Beahan, Frances Conroy, Molly Parker, Leelee Sobieski, Diane Delano, Michael Wiseman', 'PG-13', 'A sheriff investigating the disappearance of a young girl from a small island discovers there''s a larger mystery to solve among the island''s secretive, neo-pagan community.', 'A sheriff investigating the disappearance of a young girl from a small island discovers there''s a larger mystery to solve among the island''s secretive, neo-pagan community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9G6TBckQUKdx3dnn55abUCmonRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9708'),
  ('972951677970661189', 'The Wicker Tree', 2011, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Robin Hardy, Jan Pester', 'Robin Hardy', 'Graham McTavish, Honeysuckle Weeks, Christopher Lee, Clive Russell, Callum Mitchell, Henry Garrett, Christopher Leveaux, Jacqueline Leonard', 'R', 'Gospel singer Beth and her cowboy boyfriend Steve leave Texas to preach door-to-door in Scotland. When, after initial abuse, they are welcomed with joy and elation to Tressock, the border fiefdom of Sir Lachlan Morrison, they''re about to learn the real meaning of sacrifice.', 'Gospel singer Beth and her cowboy boyfriend Steve leave Texas to preach door-to-door in Scotland. When, after initial abuse, they are welcomed with joy and elation to Tressock, the border fiefdom of Sir Lachlan Morrison, they''re about to learn the real meaning of sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAmjzxeMWKkQRo7Wz6mUupZ4vfN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79544'),
  ('1087753621437678902', 'The Wide Blue Road', 1957, 'Drama', 'Mario Montuori, Gillo Pontecorvo, Enzo Alfonsi', 'Gillo Pontecorvo, Ennio De Concini, Franco Solinas', 'Yves Montand, Alida Valli, Francisco Rabal, Peter Carsten, Federica Ranchi, Terence Hill, Josip Batistić, Stane Potokar', 'NR', 'Squarciò, a fisherman, lives with his family on a small island off the Dalmatian coast of Italy. Like his fellow villagers, Squarciò struggles against harsh living conditions, a scarcity of fish in nearby waters and exploitation by the local wholesaler. But while the other fishermen continue to use nets, he goes out to the open sea to fish illegally with bombs. But Squarciò borrows money, loses his boat, and in a moment of supreme desperation, has to bomb directly off-shore, causing the hatred and rejection of his fellow fishermen. Trying to save his family, Squarciò and his young sons sail their new boat out beyond the local waters and bomb-fish again. But this time, the sea exacts a terrible toll…', 'Squarciò, a fisherman, lives with his family on a small island off the Dalmatian coast of Italy. Like his fellow villagers, Squarciò struggles against harsh living conditions, a scarcity of fish in nearby waters and exploitation by the local wholesaler. But while the other fishermen continue to use nets, he goes out to the open sea to fish illegally with bombs. But Squarciò borrows money, loses his boat, and in a moment of supreme desperation, has to bomb directly off-shore, causing the hatred and rejection of his fellow fishermen. Trying to save his family, Squarciò and his young sons sail their new boat out beyond the local waters and bomb-fish again. But this time, the sea exacts a terrible toll…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMsVXoW72jZarVZZHEIFzeaEWZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114428'),
  ('992470510328512201', 'The Widow', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Maxim Mikhanyuk, Ivan Minin', 'Ivan Kapitonov, Svyatoslav Podgaevsky, Nataliya Dubovaya', 'Viktoriya Potemina, Anastasiya Gribova, Margarita Bychkova, Ilya Agapov, Alexey Aniskin, Konstantin Nesterenko, Oleg Chugunov', null, 'Based on real events. In a densely forested area north of St. Petersburg people have been going missing for three decades. The few corpses ever found were naked. On October 14, 2017 a team of volunteers went out into the woods in search of a missing teenager. Soon, all communication with them was lost. Locals believe they were taken by the same dark spirit that took the others. They call it the Limping Widow.', 'Based on real events. In a densely forested area north of St. Petersburg people have been going missing for three decades. The few corpses ever found were naked. On October 14, 2017 a team of volunteers went out into the woods in search of a missing teenager. Soon, all communication with them was lost. Locals believe they were taken by the same dark spirit that took the others. They call it the Limping Widow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjaOjS3QMiyUhU14LCnJGzORR22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579872'),
  ('1061084155751168535', 'The Widow Couderc', 1971, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Walter Wottitz, Philippe Lefebvre', null, 'Simone Signoret, Alain Delon, Ottavia Piccolo, Jean Tissier, Monique Chaumette, Boby Lapointe, Pierre Collet, Jean-Pierre Castaldi', null, 'The relationship between a middle-aged French widow and a young drifter takes a turn when her young niece pays a visit.', 'The relationship between a middle-aged French widow and a young drifter takes a turn when her young niece pays a visit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsQbfn2E250eaBki0vSkg5NTf7e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76871'),
  ('286688378173101030', 'The Widow of Montiel', 1979, 'Drama', 'Miguel Littín, Patricio Castilla, Jorge López Sotomayor', 'José Agustín, Miguel Littín', 'Geraldine Chaplin, Nelson Villagra, Katy Jurado, Pilar Romero, Eduardo Gil, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Reynaldo Miravalles, Alejandro Parodi', null, 'Mexican drama film directed by Miguel Littín. It is based on a short story of the same name by Gabriel García Marquez. It was entered into the 30th Berlin International Film Festival', 'Mexican drama film directed by Miguel Littín. It is based on a short story of the same name by Gabriel García Marquez. It was entered into the 30th Berlin International Film Festival', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7iJ0JlaIzJsaYX8dsRfLewQYWN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228427'),
  ('469273541149899690', 'The Widow of Saint-Pierre', 2000, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Patrice Leconte, Grégoire Barachin, Eduardo Serra', 'Patrice Leconte, Claude Faraldo', 'Daniel Auteuil, Emir Kusturica, Juliette Binoche, Michel Duchaussoy, Philippe Magnan, Christian Charmetant, Philippe du Janerand, Reynald Bouchard', null, 'In 1850, on the isolated French island of Saint-Pierre, a murder shocks the natives. Two fishermen are arrested. One of them, Louis Ollivier, dies in custody. The other, Neel Auguste, is sentenced to death by the guillotine. The island is so small that it has neither a guillotine nor an executioner. While those are sent for Auguste is placed under the supervision of an army Captain.', 'In 1850, on the isolated French island of Saint-Pierre, a murder shocks the natives. Two fishermen are arrested. One of them, Louis Ollivier, dies in custody. The other, Neel Auguste, is sentenced to death by the guillotine. The island is so small that it has neither a guillotine nor an executioner. While those are sent for Auguste is placed under the supervision of an army Captain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFQ2kQA9JlAIO0uL2KkrsmI4o2O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48217'),
  ('692939194106166425', 'The Widowed Witch', 2018, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Jiao Feng, Cai Chengjie', 'Cai Chengjie', 'Tian Tian, Han Jianling, Wen Xinyu, Wang Qilin', null, 'The tragic life of a widow who has buried three husbands. Cast out by her fellow villagers and in search of shelter for the winter, she pretends to have the mystical powers to ward off disease and exorcise evil spirits, thereby obtaining a residence. But then her fraudulent claims unexpectedly become real, and she becomes a true shaman...', 'The tragic life of a widow who has buried three husbands. Cast out by her fellow villagers and in search of shelter for the winter, she pretends to have the mystical powers to ward off disease and exorcise evil spirits, thereby obtaining a residence. But then her fraudulent claims unexpectedly become real, and she becomes a true shaman...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hsRqnJYeKQyBiAabb4842YQAX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494795'),
  ('112698235085453604', 'The Widower', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Luciano Trasatti, Lù Leone', 'Rodolfo Sonego, Dino Risi, Fabio Carpi', 'Alberto Sordi, Franca Valeri, Leonora Ruffo, Livio Lorenzon, Nando Bruno, Ruggero Marchi, Gigi Reder, Mario Passante', null, 'Alberto Nardi is a Roman businessman who fancies himself a man of great capabilities, but whose factory teeters perennially on the brink of catastrophe. Alberto is married to a rich and successful businesswoman from Milan, Elvira Almiraghi who has a no-nonsense attitude and barely tolerates the attempts of her husband to keep his factory afloat with her money.', 'Alberto Nardi is a Roman businessman who fancies himself a man of great capabilities, but whose factory teeters perennially on the brink of catastrophe. Alberto is married to a rich and successful businesswoman from Milan, Elvira Almiraghi who has a no-nonsense attitude and barely tolerates the attempts of her husband to keep his factory afloat with her money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkdpbh4lTTZXADnWLBGJLjC5lyC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56340'),
  ('582026950896858953', 'The Widows of Thursdays', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Marcelo Piñeyro, Alfredo Mayo, Agustina Figueras', 'Marcelo Figueras, Marcelo Piñeyro', 'Ernesto Alterio, Juan Diego Botto, Gloria Carrá, Ana Celentano, Camilo Cuello Vitale, Pablo Echarri, Adrián Navarro, Leonardo Sbaraglia', null, 'The closed community of a private neighborhood of high-priced houses, is moved by the discovery of three corpses that appear floating in a pool and rushes to frame it as an accident.', 'The closed community of a private neighborhood of high-priced houses, is moved by the discovery of three corpses that appear floating in a pool and rushes to frame it as an accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmxCVgA1Qlgx2sOVTJVdyDbo6l0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38238'),
