  ('881482316578803466', 'The Wife on Vacation... The Lover in Town', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Martino, Giancarlo Ferrando, Massimo Manasse', 'Ottavio Jemma, Sergio Martino, Giorgio Mariuzzo', 'Edwige Fenech, Barbara Bouchet, Renzo Montagnani, Lino Banfi, Tullio Solenghi, Marisa Merlini, Renzo Ozzano, Jacques Stany', null, 'Andrea Damiani sends his wife Valeria off on a skiing holiday so he can spend time with his demanding mistress, Giulia. Little does he suspect that Valeria is having a rendezvous with a Count she recently met. However, Valeria does not know that ''Count'' Giovanni is really just a manager''s assistant, namely, Andrea''s.', 'Andrea Damiani sends his wife Valeria off on a skiing holiday so he can spend time with his demanding mistress, Giulia. Little does he suspect that Valeria is having a rendezvous with a Count she recently met. However, Valeria does not know that ''Count'' Giovanni is really just a manager''s assistant, namely, Andrea''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qK4lM5WSo8Oj2yyHKwlDZXKZzkb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73620'),
  ('917483884644926396', 'The Wig', 2005, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Won Shin-yun', 'Sung-won Cho', 'Chae Min-seo, Yu Seon, Bang Moon-soo, Sa Hyeon-jin, Kim Soy, Lee Jung-sung, Kyeong-bin Rah', null, 'Su-hyeon, a patient with terminal cancer, gets a wig as a present from her sister, Ji-hyeon. Strange things happen as Su-hyeon wears the wig and horror starts to sweep over Ji-hyeon as she watches her sister getting slowly possessed.', 'Su-hyeon, a patient with terminal cancer, gets a wig as a present from her sister, Ji-hyeon. Strange things happen as Su-hyeon wears the wig and horror starts to sweep over Ji-hyeon as she watches her sister getting slowly possessed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkonX3gOXQ1KC7kr6ufITli4h3o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21797'),
  ('987234552511046451', 'The Wiggles Movie', 1997, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Music, Romance', 'Scott Preston, Dean Covell', 'Greg Truman', 'Murray Cook, Jeff Fatt, Anthony Field, Greg Page, Tony Harvey, Leeanne Ashley, Carolyn Ferrie, Joanne Samuel', 'G', 'As the Wiggles prepare a surprise party for their friend Dorothy the Dinosaur, she goes after a magician who has stolen Greg''s magic wand.', 'As the Wiggles prepare a surprise party for their friend Dorothy the Dinosaur, she goes after a magician who has stolen Greg''s magic wand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giMHw3IMSFLUX1QSbrX1rZDR6k5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40750'),
  ('452063509848412056', 'The Wilby Conspiracy', 1975, 'Adventure, Thriller', 'Ralph Nelson, John Coquillon, Ivo Nightingale', 'Harold Nebenzal, Rod Amateau', 'Sidney Poitier, Michael Caine, Nicol Williamson, Prunella Gee, Saeed Jaffrey, Persis Khambatta, Rijk de Gooyer, Rutger Hauer', 'PG', 'Having spent 10 years in prison for nationalist activities, Shack Twala is finally ordered released by the South African Supreme Court but he finds himself almost immediately on the run after a run-in with the police. Assisted by his lawyer Rina Van Niekirk and visiting British engineer Jim Keogh, he heads for Capetown where he hopes to recover a stash of diamonds, meant to finance revolutionary activities, that he had entrusted to a dentist before his incarceration. Along the way, they are followed by Major Horn of the South African State security bureau and it becomes apparent that he has no intention of arresting them until they reach their final destination', 'Having spent 10 years in prison for nationalist activities, Shack Twala is finally ordered released by the South African Supreme Court but he finds himself almost immediately on the run after a run-in with the police. Assisted by his lawyer Rina Van Niekirk and visiting British engineer Jim Keogh, he heads for Capetown where he hopes to recover a stash of diamonds, meant to finance revolutionary activities, that he had entrusted to a dentist before his incarceration. Along the way, they are followed by Major Horn of the South African State security bureau and it becomes apparent that he has no intention of arresting them until they reach their final destination', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BBXpqhBy18oGFkZW4zYqZgMKSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7008'),
  ('151500352977794896', 'The Wild', 2006, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Steve Williams, Matthew Daw', 'Mark Gibson, Philip Halprin, Ed Decter', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Jim Belushi, Eddie Izzard, Janeane Garofalo, William Shatner, Richard Kind, Greg Cipes, Colin Hay', 'G', 'An adolescent lion is accidentally shipped from the New York Zoo to Africa. Now running free, his zoo pals must put aside their differences to help bring him back.', 'An adolescent lion is accidentally shipped from the New York Zoo to Africa. Now running free, his zoo pals must put aside their differences to help bring him back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxqzaOto1qyUseSg6YpIP9Su5lp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9904'),
  ('721434038072707553', 'The Wild', 2023, 'Action, Crime', 'Kim Bong-han', 'Kim Joo-man', 'Park Sung-woong, Oh Dae-hwan, Oh Dal-su, Ju Seok-tae, Seo Ji-hye, Won Woo', null, 'Woo-chul used to be a successful boxer, but he had to go to prison because his opponent died in the middle of a match. Now that he’s been released, he intends to become a model citizen. Meanwhile, his friend Do-shik will do whatever it takes to get ahead. After choosing different paths, they will be forced to plot against and betray one another.', 'Woo-chul used to be a successful boxer, but he had to go to prison because his opponent died in the middle of a match. Now that he’s been released, he intends to become a model citizen. Meanwhile, his friend Do-shik will do whatever it takes to get ahead. After choosing different paths, they will be forced to plot against and betray one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9GEcmN1ihe4qsGmhIEGvHT9ywY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799710'),
  ('464278598198076398', 'The Wild and the Innocent', 1959, 'Western', 'Jack Sher, Harold Lipstein, William Holland', 'Jack Sher, Sy Gomberg', 'Audie Murphy, Joanne Dru, Gilbert Roland, Jim Backus, Sandra Dee, George Mitchell, Peter Breck, Strother Martin', 'NR', 'In Wyoming, mountain trapper Yancey goes to the nearest town to trade his pelts but gets into trouble when he tries to save runaway dance-hall girl Rosalie from her shameful job.', 'In Wyoming, mountain trapper Yancey goes to the nearest town to trade his pelts but gets into trouble when he tries to save runaway dance-hall girl Rosalie from her shameful job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TA3dpdpmJHxvs1BrYrwApIAENV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38666'),
  ('138567992873360782', 'The Wild and Wonderful Whites of West Virginia', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Julien Nitzberg, Mike Stryker', null, 'Jesco White', null, 'Produced by Johnny Knoxville and Jeff Tremaine for MTV and Dickhouse Productions, The Wild and Wonderful Whites of West Virginia is a documentary about the renowned West Virginia outlaw Jesco White and his eccentric backwoods family. In addition to getting in trouble with the law, the Whites, who live deep within Appalachia, uphold a time-honored dancing style, even as they contend with poverty, drugs and other issues. Alternately humorous and sad, the movie is an unflinching look at life on the criminal margins of rural mountain culture.', 'Produced by Johnny Knoxville and Jeff Tremaine for MTV and Dickhouse Productions, The Wild and Wonderful Whites of West Virginia is a documentary about the renowned West Virginia outlaw Jesco White and his eccentric backwoods family. In addition to getting in trouble with the law, the Whites, who live deep within Appalachia, uphold a time-honored dancing style, even as they contend with poverty, drugs and other issues. Alternately humorous and sad, the movie is an unflinching look at life on the criminal margins of rural mountain culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7EQQsuK1Hk1zcoBlNBKfU41aS39.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49637'),
  ('240860091429640851', 'The Wild Angels', 1966, 'Drama, Action', 'Roger Corman, Richard Moore, Paul Rapp', 'Charles B. Griffith', 'Peter Fonda, Nancy Sinatra, Bruce Dern, Diane Ladd, Buck Taylor, Norman Alden, Michael J. Pollard, Lou Procopio', 'R', 'A motorcycle gang arrives in a small town in search of a motorcycle that has been stolen by a rival gang; but, pursued by the police, one of its members is injured, an event that will cause an orgy of violence and destruction.', 'A motorcycle gang arrives in a small town in search of a motorcycle that has been stolen by a rival gang; but, pursued by the police, one of its members is injured, an event that will cause an orgy of violence and destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whWwL2xLQ1RZOSz2pEAwGEGjK3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42725'),
  ('789778750893378274', 'The Wild Blue Yonder', 2005, 'Science Fiction', 'Werner Herzog, Henry Kaiser, Klaus Scheurich', 'Werner Herzog', 'Brad Dourif, Donald Williams, Ellen Baker, Franklin Chang-Diaz, Shannon Lucid, Michael McCulley, Roger Diehl, Martin Lo', null, 'An alien narrates the story of his dying planet, his and his people''s visitations to Earth and Earth''s self-made demise, while human astronauts in space are attempting to find an alternate planet for surviving humans to live on.', 'An alien narrates the story of his dying planet, his and his people''s visitations to Earth and Earth''s self-made demise, while human astronauts in space are attempting to find an alternate planet for surviving humans to live on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEs4KhPaQ0F514PscPJDtp0YclB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8410'),
  ('950516532153852824', 'The Wild Boys', 2017, 'Drama, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Bertrand Mandico, Pascale Granel, Camille Servignat', 'Bertrand Mandico', 'Pauline Lorillard, Vimala Pons, Diane Rouxel, Anaël Snoek, Mathilde Warnier, Sam Louwyck, Elina Löwensohn, Nathalie Richard', 'NR', 'Island of La Réunion, in the beginning of the 20th century. Five teenagers commit a savage crime. As punishment, a Dutch captain takes them to a supernatural island with luxuriant vegetation and bewitching powers.', 'Island of La Réunion, in the beginning of the 20th century. Five teenagers commit a savage crime. As punishment, a Dutch captain takes them to a supernatural island with luxuriant vegetation and bewitching powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1W1JFnlNwtEr99SYclKYhORMXQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474444'),
  ('666252066290824674', 'The Wild Bunch', 1969, 'Western', 'Lucien Ballard, Sam Peckinpah, Clifford C. Coleman', 'Walon Green, Sam Peckinpah', 'William Holden, Ernest Borgnine, Robert Ryan, Jaime Sánchez, Warren Oates, Edmond O''Brien, Ben Johnson, Albert Dekker', 'R', 'An aging group of outlaws look for one last big score as the "traditional" American West is disappearing around them.', 'An aging group of outlaws look for one last big score as the "traditional" American West is disappearing around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8j9yEC3xjy1PJDSizIbaxcHaSph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576'),
