  ('17057892216819410', 'The Wild Chicks', 2006, 'Comedy, Family', 'Peter Döttling, Vivian Naefe', 'Güzin Kar, Uschi Reich', 'Michelle von Treuberg, Lucie Hollmann, Paula Riemann, Zsá Zsá Inci Bürkle, Jette Hering, Jeremy Mockridge, Philip Wiegratz, Martin Kurz', null, 'Twelve-year-old Sprotte has a ''gang'' with her three friends Frieda, Melanie, and Trude. Together, the girls care for Sprotte''s grandmother''s chickens. The new girl in school, Wilma, wishes to join the group, which Melanie is very unhappy about, and on top of all of that they have an ongoing revalisasion with a group of boys.', 'Twelve-year-old Sprotte has a ''gang'' with her three friends Frieda, Melanie, and Trude. Together, the girls care for Sprotte''s grandmother''s chickens. The new girl in school, Wilma, wishes to join the group, which Melanie is very unhappy about, and on top of all of that they have an ongoing revalisasion with a group of boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAC70LZDVyOhHGV35hckNgIaLIi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7009'),
  ('283499664910704880', 'The Wild Chicks and Life', 2009, 'Comedy, Family', 'Vivian Naefe, Peter Döttling', 'Vivian Naefe, Uschi Reich, Thomas Schmid', 'Michelle von Treuberg, Lucie Hollmann, Sonja Gerhardt, Jette Hering, Zsá Zsá Inci Bürkle, Jeremy Mockridge, Philip Wiegratz, Vincent Redetzki', null, 'The Wild Chicks are slowly growing out of their youthful gang years and have to face the worries of growing up on the sidelines of a big class trip before graduation.', 'The Wild Chicks are slowly growing out of their youthful gang years and have to face the worries of growing up on the sidelines of a big class trip before graduation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFa3FKt4wSoWxFooSMRO9PykPKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9579'),
  ('26235401459575465', 'The Wild Child', 1970, 'Drama, History', 'Néstor Almendros, François Truffaut, Suzanne Schiffman', 'François Truffaut, Jean Gruault', 'Jean-Pierre Cargol, François Truffaut, Françoise Seigner, Jean Dasté, Annie Miller, Claude Miller, Paul Villé, Nathan Miller', 'G', 'In a French forest circa 1798, a child–who cannot walk, speak, read or write–is found. A doctor becomes interested in the case and patiently attempts to civilise the boy.', 'In a French forest circa 1798, a child–who cannot walk, speak, read or write–is found. A doctor becomes interested in the case and patiently attempts to civilise the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivIyyc2VgefJK9LdAogl1BEgmeH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1627'),
  ('361573583809050410', 'The Wild Children', 2012, 'Drama', 'Patricia Ferreira, Sergi Gallardo, Àlex Vilà', 'Patricia Ferreira, Virginia Yagüe', 'Marina Comas, Àlex Monner, Albert Baró, Aina Clotet, José Luis García Pérez, Montse Germán, Francesc Orella, Marc Rodríguez', null, 'Alex,Gabi and Oki, three teenagers living in a big city, are completely unknown to their parents, to their teachers and for themselves. Their emotional isolation, led to the limit, will have unexpected and terrible consequences that will shake society.', 'Alex,Gabi and Oki, three teenagers living in a big city, are completely unknown to their parents, to their teachers and for themselves. Their emotional isolation, led to the limit, will have unexpected and terrible consequences that will shake society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUE9OJ5MRpQF4B7hZqyf1byjCE4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110198'),
  ('793531925882574391', 'The Wild Dog Dingo', 1962, 'Family, Romance, Drama', 'Yuli Karasik, Vyacheslav Fastovich, Isaak Menaker', 'Anatoli Grebnev', 'Galina Polskikh, Nikolai Timofeyev, Tamara Loginova, Vladimir Osobik, Talas Umurzakov, Anna Rodionova, Inna Kondratyeva, Irina Radchenko', null, 'Things take an interesting turn for Tanya and her mother when her father arrives with his foster son Kolya and new wife. This film is about Kolya and Tanya''s bright, pure and bitter first love.', 'Things take an interesting turn for Tanya and her mother when her father arrives with his foster son Kolya and new wife. This film is about Kolya and Tanya''s bright, pure and bitter first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzgjjjonOGSw74WkgjUedJ3vRR7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22187'),
  ('99777667947816833', 'The Wild Eye', 1967, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Paolo Cavara, Raffaele Masciocchi, Marcello Masciocchi', 'Alberto Moravia, Paolo Cavara, Tonino Guerra', 'Philippe Leroy, Delia Boccardo, Gabriele Tinti, Giorgio Gargiullo, Luciana Angiolillo, Lars Bloch, Gianni Bongioanni, Tullio Marini', null, 'A film documentarian stops at nothing to record unusual and supposedly true-to-life situations.', 'A film documentarian stops at nothing to record unusual and supposedly true-to-life situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Kt46fJkOyiQjqRhC4m9cKtlU4Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150946'),
  ('134928806575237637', 'The Wild Geese', 1953, 'Drama', 'Shirō Toyoda, Mitsuo Miura', 'Masashige Narusawa', 'Hideko Takamine, Hiroshi Akutagawa, Jūkichi Uno, Eijirō Tōno, Chōko Iida, Eizo Tanaka, Kumeko Urabe, Miki Odagiri', null, 'A young woman, who must support her father as a middle-aged man''s mistress, finds herself falling in love with a student closer to her age.', 'A young woman, who must support her father as a middle-aged man''s mistress, finds herself falling in love with a student closer to her age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAUhiZYE1QKRrkK0kDBgJwwTzPh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148513'),
  ('313803969909146578', 'The Wild Geese', 1978, 'Action', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, Jack Hildyard, John Glen', 'Reginald Rose', 'Richard Burton, Richard Harris, Roger Moore, Hardy Krüger, Stewart Granger, John Kani, Jack Watson, Frank Finlay', 'R', 'A British multinational company seeks to overthrow a vicious dictator in central Africa. It hires a band of (largely aged) mercenaries in London and sends them in to save the virtuous but imprisoned opposition leader who is also critically ill and due for execution. Just when the team has performed a perfect rescue, the multinational does a deal with the vicious dictator leaving the mercenary band to escape under their own steam and exact revenge.', 'A British multinational company seeks to overthrow a vicious dictator in central Africa. It hires a band of (largely aged) mercenaries in London and sends them in to save the virtuous but imprisoned opposition leader who is also critically ill and due for execution. Just when the team has performed a perfect rescue, the multinational does a deal with the vicious dictator leaving the mercenary band to escape under their own steam and exact revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUbbYSH0r5VQODUdgPXB8zjIKgz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7010'),
  ('415504049909329098', 'The Wild Goose Chase', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi, Henri Decaë, Jean-Jacques Beineix', 'Michel Fabre, Jean-Luc Voulfow', 'Pierre Richard, Jane Birkin, Michel Aumont, Marc Doelnitz, Amadeus August, Henri Déus, Luis Rego, Catherine Allégret', null, 'The whole intrigue is centered around carte-blanche documents kept in a vault. Whoever fills in the blank becomes the owner of a revue. Big money is involved. The nephew of the owner of the vault is trying to cheat his uncle and have his name in the documents. Everything is even more complicated because the manager of the bank has a finger in the pie, too. Who but a humble bank-teller (Pierre Richard) will ruin the scheme?', 'The whole intrigue is centered around carte-blanche documents kept in a vault. Whoever fills in the blank becomes the owner of a revue. Big money is involved. The nephew of the owner of the vault is trying to cheat his uncle and have his name in the documents. Everything is even more complicated because the manager of the bank has a finger in the pie, too. Who but a humble bank-teller (Pierre Richard) will ruin the scheme?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9fUXQ9GswK2uFUD7aaTda0tHUy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38090'),
  ('340905127563296273', 'The Wild Goose Lake', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Yang Xiao, Diao Yinan, Dong Jinsong', 'Diao Yinan', 'Hu Ge, Gwei Lun-mei, Liao Fan, Wan Qian, Qi Dao, Huang Jue, Chloe Maayan, Zhang Yicong', null, 'A gangster ends up making a mistake that causes every gun on both sides of the law to point at him. While on the run, he comes across a mysterious woman who might get him out of trouble or make things worse.', 'A gangster ends up making a mistake that causes every gun on both sides of the law to point at him. While on the run, he comes across a mysterious woman who might get him out of trouble or make things worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w49o4vmNFpCt4VFJp7ip6tjHh3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575428'),
  ('864548837092794671', 'The Wild Hunt', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alexandre Franchi', 'Alexandre Franchi', 'Kyle Gatehouse, Trevor Hayes, Kaniehtiio Horn, Claudia Jurt, Mark Antony Krupa, Ricky Mabe, Spiro Malandrakis, Kent McQuaid', null, 'A MODERN MEDIEVAL SAGA, The Wild Hunt tells the story of Erik Magnusson, a young man who decides to follow his estranged girlfriend Evelyn into a medieval re-enactment game when he discovers that she has been seduced by one of the players. As the down-to-earth Erik treks deeper into the game in search of his love, he inadvertently disrupts the delicate balance of the make believe fantasy-land. Passions are unleashed. Rules are broken. Reality and fantasy collide. The good-hearted game turns into a tragedy of mythic proportion... Capturing the culture of costume play and the potentially dangerous intersection of real and made-up worlds, The Wild Hunt is a timely and potent comment on the consuming nature of adopting another identity, even within a game, and the modern yearning for ritual.', 'A MODERN MEDIEVAL SAGA, The Wild Hunt tells the story of Erik Magnusson, a young man who decides to follow his estranged girlfriend Evelyn into a medieval re-enactment game when he discovers that she has been seduced by one of the players. As the down-to-earth Erik treks deeper into the game in search of his love, he inadvertently disrupts the delicate balance of the make believe fantasy-land. Passions are unleashed. Rules are broken. Reality and fantasy collide. The good-hearted game turns into a tragedy of mythic proportion... Capturing the culture of costume play and the potentially dangerous intersection of real and made-up worlds, The Wild Hunt is a timely and potent comment on the consuming nature of adopting another identity, even within a game, and the modern yearning for ritual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BS1fbMmYbNGgcZuCeT3OT0WVdi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44680'),
  ('792912850370203022', 'The Wild Life', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Art Linson, James Glennon', 'Cameron Crowe', 'Chris Penn, Lea Thompson, Eric Stoltz, Jenny Wright, Ilan Mitchell-Smith, Rick Moranis, Hart Bochner, Randy Quaid', 'R', 'Eighties teen romp involving Bill and his new apartment, Jim and his rebellious antics, Tom and his crazy self, and Anita with her older man David.', 'Eighties teen romp involving Bill and his new apartment, Jim and his rebellious antics, Tom and his crazy self, and Anita with her older man David.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7Iie9bFahDJVQ7AeKL6vMOz1VT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38980'),
  ('477531212277356337', 'The Wild Men of Kurdistan', 1965, 'Adventure', 'Franz Josef Gottlieb, Francisco Marín, Robert Ziller', 'Franz Josef Gottlieb', 'Lex Barker, Marie Versini, Ralf Wolter, Dieter Borsche, Chris Howland, Đorđe Nenadović, Gustavo Rojo, Werner Peters', null, 'After dealing with the Shut in the Balkans, Kara Ben-Nemsi (''Karl the German'') receives a firman (precious passport) from the padishah (Ottoman sultan) before he continues his travels through Kurdistan. Achmed El Corda, the son of Halef''s Hadedhin Beduin tribe''s sheik Mohammed Emin, has been captured by the machredsh (Turkish governor) of Mossul for resisting water seizure by his Turkish troops. Kara takes charge of the rescue.', 'After dealing with the Shut in the Balkans, Kara Ben-Nemsi (''Karl the German'') receives a firman (precious passport) from the padishah (Ottoman sultan) before he continues his travels through Kurdistan. Achmed El Corda, the son of Halef''s Hadedhin Beduin tribe''s sheik Mohammed Emin, has been captured by the machredsh (Turkish governor) of Mossul for resisting water seizure by his Turkish troops. Kara takes charge of the rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xg9r2SQGjNQPjme5O1UkwMhuXb4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19196'),
  ('321912981959661508', 'The Wild Oat', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Henri Verneuil, Charles Suin, Gérard Ducaux-Rupp', 'Yves Favier, Pierre Lozach', 'Fernandel, Georges Chamarat, Henri Vilbert, Edmond Ardisson, Leda Gloria, Pierrette Bruno, Jean Gaven, Madeleine Sylvain', null, 'A small village is torn apart by a quarrel between the baker and the italian grocery tenant, mother of a pregnant young girl. She accuses the baker''s son, doing his military service in Algeria, to be the father of the would be child. Offended, the baker refuses to deliver bread to the villagers standing on the mother''s side.', 'A small village is torn apart by a quarrel between the baker and the italian grocery tenant, mother of a pregnant young girl. She accuses the baker''s son, doing his military service in Algeria, to be the father of the would be child. Offended, the baker refuses to deliver bread to the villagers standing on the mother''s side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UePpNBO55U3rE1fCSRPE5U1ggp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67757'),
  ('856920763963927259', 'The Wild One', 1953, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'László Benedek, Paul Donnelly, Hal Mohr', 'John Paxton', 'Marlon Brando, Mary Murphy, Robert Keith, Lee Marvin, Jay C. Flippen, Peggy Maley, Hugh Sanders, Ray Teal', 'NR', 'The Black Rebels Motorcycle Club ride into the small California town of Wrightsville, eager to raise hell. Brooding gang leader Johnny Strabler takes a liking to Kathie, the daughter of the local lawman, as another club rolls into town.', 'The Black Rebels Motorcycle Club ride into the small California town of Wrightsville, eager to raise hell. Brooding gang leader Johnny Strabler takes a liking to Kathie, the daughter of the local lawman, as another club rolls into town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ne8nuvqjczy4xPMMpYwNLuSp0ka.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28696'),
  ('599479994974741804', 'The Wild Ones', 2012, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alejandro Fadel', 'Alejandro Fadel', 'Leonel Arancibia, Sofía Brito, Martín Cotari, Roberto Cowal, César Roldan, Ricardo Soulé', null, 'Five juvenile delinquents break out of jail and attempt to make their way to a house in the Mendoza foothills of Argentina.', 'Five juvenile delinquents break out of jail and attempt to make their way to a house in the Mendoza foothills of Argentina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GtYlreUBtJG13eTmqwiLKpaBHd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126883'),
  ('1087739219440674429', 'The Wild Parrots of Telegraph Hill', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Judy Irving', null, 'Mark Bittner', null, 'A homeless musician finds meaning in his life when he starts a friendship with dozens of parrots.', 'A homeless musician finds meaning in his life when he starts a friendship with dozens of parrots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBLgd1Ep3oUItLHj23s6vGHAO80.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17592'),
  ('1018229514830623310', 'The Wild Party', 1929, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Dorothy Arzner, Victor Milner', 'Samuel Hopkins Adams, E. Lloyd Sheldon', 'Clara Bow, Fredric March, Shirley O''Hara, Marceline Day, Adrienne Dore, Joyce Compton, Jack Oakie, Jack Luden', null, 'Wild girls at a college pay more attention to parties than their classes. But when one party girl, Stella Ames, goes too far at a local bar and gets in trouble, her professor has to rescue her. Gossip linking the two escalates until Stella proves she is decent by shielding an innocent girl and winning the professor''s respect.', 'Wild girls at a college pay more attention to parties than their classes. But when one party girl, Stella Ames, goes too far at a local bar and gets in trouble, her professor has to rescue her. Gossip linking the two escalates until Stella proves she is decent by shielding an innocent girl and winning the professor''s respect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjTWSA1z5djZMfDBtR4EZ2sELaT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80168'),
  ('442303655032681602', 'The Wild Party', 1975, 'Comedy, Drama', 'James Ivory, Walter Lassally, Edward Folger', 'Walter Marks', 'James Coco, Raquel Welch, Perry King, Tiffany Bolling, Royal Dano, David Dukes, Christina Ferra-Gilmore, Eddie Lawrence', 'R', 'An aging silent movie comic star throws a lavish party to try and save his failing career.', 'An aging silent movie comic star throws a lavish party to try and save his failing career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4d55VwxuADhAOIZYwsPRcV078xS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112087'),
  ('325178408976819062', 'The Wild Pear Tree', 2018, 'Drama', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Gökhan Tiryaki', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Ebru Ceylan', 'Doğu Demirkol, Murat Cemcir, Bennu Yıldırımlar, Hazar Ergüçlü, Serkan Keskin, Tamer Levent, Akın Aksu, Ahmet Rıfat Şungar', null, 'Fresh out of university, a Turkish young man with literary aspirations returns to his home village and starts scraping together money to publish his book. While trying to reconnect with his old friends and environment; his uncertainty, existential struggle and his father’s gambling addiction bring him grave difficulties.', 'Fresh out of university, a Turkish young man with literary aspirations returns to his home village and starts scraping together money to publish his book. While trying to reconnect with his old friends and environment; his uncertainty, existential struggle and his father’s gambling addiction bring him grave difficulties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7kGE1MChkHD5VX8sv7SOGabGMZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418472'),
  ('899194470244085706', 'The Wild Rebels', 1967, 'Drama, Crime', 'William Grefé', 'William Grefé', 'Steve Alaimo, Willie Pastrano, John Vella, Bobbie Byers, Jeff Gillen, Walter R. Philbin, Robert Freund, Seymour A. Eisenfeld', 'R', 'Former stock-car racer Rod Tillman is hired to serve as the getaway driver for a band of Nazi bikers and their shared girlfriend Linda, who intend to go on a crime spree for kicks. The police contact Rod and task him with becoming a stoolie so the bikers can be brought to justice.', 'Former stock-car racer Rod Tillman is hired to serve as the getaway driver for a band of Nazi bikers and their shared girlfriend Linda, who intend to go on a crime spree for kicks. The police contact Rod and task him with becoming a stoolie so the bikers can be brought to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dT9jWJGNtu2ylWHcdfYInBTV3i2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96334'),
  ('959682918422791075', 'The Wild Ride', 1960, 'Drama, Crime', 'Harvey Berman', 'Ann Porter, Marion Rothman', 'Jack Nicholson, Georgianna Carter, Robert Bean, Carol Bigby, John Bologni, Gary Espinosa, Judith Trezise, Wesley Marie Tackitt', 'PG-13', 'A rebellious punk of the beat generation spends his days as an amateur dirt track driver in between partying and troublemaking.', 'A rebellious punk of the beat generation spends his days as an amateur dirt track driver in between partying and troublemaking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amdiPg2V58lkZ07TumO9nxEmHCL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84210'),
  ('867758926956950607', 'The Wild Robot', 2024, 'Family, Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Chris Sanders', 'Chris Sanders', 'Lupita Nyong''o, Pedro Pascal, Kit Connor, Bill Nighy, Stephanie Hsu, Matt Berry, Ving Rhames, Mark Hamill', 'PG', 'After a shipwreck, an intelligent robot called Roz is stranded on an uninhabited island. To survive the harsh environment, Roz bonds with the island''s animals and cares for an orphaned baby goose.', 'After a shipwreck, an intelligent robot called Roz is stranded on an uninhabited island. To survive the harsh environment, Roz bonds with the island''s animals and cares for an orphaned baby goose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eG9lz41mJqsI4J6ubMtVqD26q2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1184918'),
  ('696337649760959907', 'The Wild Soccer Bunch', 2003, 'Comedy, Family', 'Joachim Masannek, Sonja Rom', 'Joachim Masannek', 'Jimi Blue Ochsenknecht, Raban Bieling, Sarah Kim Gries, Constantin Gastmann, Wilson Gonzalez Ochsenknecht, Jonathan Beck, Kevin Iannotta, Leon Wessel-Masannek', null, 'The school year is over and for a diverse group of carefree kids, soccer is king! These kids believe that they are the local gold team and there is nothing they like more than improving their game. "If you want to be cool, you should be wild." However, the relentless rain turns their field into a swamp, so they have to take an unexpected break. And when the sun finally comes, a gang of older, bigger and dumber boys has just taken over the field. They won''t give it back unless they lose a match against the kids.', 'The school year is over and for a diverse group of carefree kids, soccer is king! These kids believe that they are the local gold team and there is nothing they like more than improving their game. "If you want to be cool, you should be wild." However, the relentless rain turns their field into a swamp, so they have to take an unexpected break. And when the sun finally comes, a gang of older, bigger and dumber boys has just taken over the field. They won''t give it back unless they lose a match against the kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrYqdIOF1EOoBQSQbkIU88NJy9n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10755'),
  ('332967044647307992', 'The Wild Soccer Bunch 2', 2005, 'Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Joachim Masannek, Sonja Rom', 'Joachim Masannek', 'Jimi Blue Ochsenknecht, Raban Bieling, Sarah Kim Gries, Konrad Baumann, Leon Wessel-Masannek, Deniz Sarsilmaz, Wilson Gonzalez Ochsenknecht, Marlon Wessel', null, 'An unsupervised junior soccer team loses its ace player to the leader of a rival gang. Since only an entire team can win, they must have her back to be able to win the game against the national team. The existence of The Wild Soccer Bunch is at stake ...', 'An unsupervised junior soccer team loses its ace player to the leader of a rival gang. Since only an entire team can win, they must have her back to be able to win the game against the national team. The existence of The Wild Soccer Bunch is at stake ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXeD3tEC643rxlKizBT2MOQioUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8344'),
  ('884301902512533799', 'The Wild Soccer Bunch 3', 2006, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Joachim Masannek, Sonja Rom, Hellmut Fulss', 'Joachim Masannek', 'Jimi Blue Ochsenknecht, Sarah Kim Gries, Constantin Gastmann, Raban Bieling, Wilson Gonzalez Ochsenknecht, Nick Romeo Reimann, Marlon Wessel, Konrad Baumann', null, 'After Leon left his team in the historic 25-1 defeat against the national team, Die wilden Kerle broke up. Only the little Nerv still believes in his old heroes and tries to bring the grown-up guys back together with the help of his dreaded side puller. Leon''s former best friend Fabi has meanwhile founded his own team, the girls'' team, "The Beastly Beasts", and challenges "The Wild Soccer Bunch" to a duel in the Nattern Cave.', 'After Leon left his team in the historic 25-1 defeat against the national team, Die wilden Kerle broke up. Only the little Nerv still believes in his old heroes and tries to bring the grown-up guys back together with the help of his dreaded side puller. Leon''s former best friend Fabi has meanwhile founded his own team, the girls'' team, "The Beastly Beasts", and challenges "The Wild Soccer Bunch" to a duel in the Nattern Cave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPFoDW4AACzaaPjLmezHc2SPgiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51609'),
  ('380687616207649942', 'The Wild Soccer Bunch 4', 2007, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Joachim Masannek, Benjamin Dernbecher', 'Joachim Masannek', 'Jimi Blue Ochsenknecht, Wilson Gonzalez Ochsenknecht, Sarah Kim Gries, Nick Romeo Reimann, Marlon Wessel, Leon Wessel-Masannek, Kevin Iannotta, Raban Bieling', null, 'With the victory against "The Beastly Beasts", "The Wild Soccer Bunch" showed it to everyone and then won every single game. Only one victory now separates them from the "Pott", the Freestyle Soccer Cup. For this they have to compete against the "Wolves of Ragnarök". But the wolves are not normal opponents! They have a dark secret - and behind them lurks a power stronger than all of them: the girl Horizon and the "Silver Lights" from the fog...', 'With the victory against "The Beastly Beasts", "The Wild Soccer Bunch" showed it to everyone and then won every single game. Only one victory now separates them from the "Pott", the Freestyle Soccer Cup. For this they have to compete against the "Wolves of Ragnarök". But the wolves are not normal opponents! They have a dark secret - and behind them lurks a power stronger than all of them: the girl Horizon and the "Silver Lights" from the fog...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfTuyoAIE6KtrrwAW26NXBXVFJI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1264'),
  ('81729325138893342', 'The Wild Soccer Bunch 5', 2008, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Joachim Masannek, Benjamin Dernbecher', 'Joachim Masannek', 'Jimi Blue Ochsenknecht, Sarah Kim Gries, Marlon Wessel, Leon Wessel-Masannek, Raban Bieling, Nick Romeo Reimann, Kevin Iannotta, Janina Fautz', null, '"The Wild Soccer Bunch" celebrate their last victory against the "Silver Lights" - and set one record in volley-pass game after another in the forest. But they are not alone: Vampires target the team. To lure them into their bunker, they kidnap Leon. Will Vanessa ever see him again?', '"The Wild Soccer Bunch" celebrate their last victory against the "Silver Lights" - and set one record in volley-pass game after another in the forest. But they are not alone: Vampires target the team. To lure them into their bunker, they kidnap Leon. Will Vanessa ever see him again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9W0de9Pal6FKQGhfCTh8kzY5Q8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51610'),
  ('721713477771276251', 'The Wild Soccer Bunch 6', 2016, 'Adventure, Family, Action', 'Joachim Masannek, Benjamin Dernbecher', 'Joachim Masannek', 'Michael Sommerer, Jimi Blue Ochsenknecht, Wilson Gonzalez Ochsenknecht, Rufus Beck, Aaron Kissiov, Stella Pepper, Bennet Meyer, Ron Antony Renzenbrink', null, 'To this very day, kids believe that the stories of "The Wild Soccer Bunch" are the best in the world, and that''s why Leo, Elias, Finn, Joshua, Oskar and Matze, replay their heroes’ legendary games every spare minute. One day a darkly dressed young man hands them a mysterious map that leads the boys into unknown territory.', 'To this very day, kids believe that the stories of "The Wild Soccer Bunch" are the best in the world, and that''s why Leo, Elias, Finn, Joshua, Oskar and Matze, replay their heroes’ legendary games every spare minute. One day a darkly dressed young man hands them a mysterious map that leads the boys into unknown territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pl8uow0Z0eTueZfO6R3HF7I07Au.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370575'),
  ('633707037285237287', 'The Wild Stallion', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family, Western', 'Craig Clyde, Jason Brunner', 'Craig Clyde', 'Miranda Cosgrove, Connie Sellecca, Fred Ward, Danielle Chuchran, Corbin Allred, K.C. Clyde, Gib Gerard, Michael Lawson', 'G', 'C.J. and Hanna become the greatest of friends when the latter visits the former on the ranch where she lives, with the purpose of photographing the horses for her school project. The two unearth a secret plot which may put the mustangs in danger.', 'C.J. and Hanna become the greatest of friends when the latter visits the former on the ranch where she lives, with the purpose of photographing the horses for her school project. The two unearth a secret plot which may put the mustangs in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3dLLftw7sYmtKtHWbrgqepo5wL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38048'),
  ('745751609915990325', 'The Wild Swans', 1962, 'Animation, Fantasy, Drama', 'Lidiya Nikitina, Elena Petrova, Vera Tsekhanovskaya', 'Leonid Trauberg, Yevgeni Ryss', 'Erast Garin, Elena Ponsova, Viktor Sergachyov, Valentina Tumanova, Anatoliy Shchukin, Robert Chumak, Askold Besedin, Konstantin Ustyugov', null, 'When a witch transforms her brothers into swans, a young princess must find a way to change them back.', 'When a witch transforms her brothers into swans, a young princess must find a way to change them back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/R1fTSxCOp4u4PKkUkkgj8OXA1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198411'),
  ('180595374375650044', 'The Wild Swans', 1977, 'Drama, Family, Animation', 'Nobutaka Nishizawa, Takashi Abe, Yûji Endô', 'Yasuko Miyazaki', 'Eiko Masuyama, Yasuko Miyazaki, Kaneko Iwasaki, Yōsuke Kondō, Tokuko Sugiyama, Tarō Mochizuki, Yasuyuki Kachi, Shōshin Kobayashi', null, 'A young girl must spend six years making sweatshirts out of poison ivy in order to save her six brothers which have been turned into swans by an evil sorceress.', 'A young girl must spend six years making sweatshirts out of poison ivy in order to save her six brothers which have been turned into swans by an evil sorceress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fzJukE0egJgm96gEbDWEEL8v49.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46938'),
  ('263856290782692748', 'The Wild Thornberrys Movie', 2002, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Cathy Malkasian, Jeff McGrath', 'Kate Boutilier', 'Lacey Chabert, Tom Kane, Cree Summer, Tim Curry, Lynn Redgrave, Danielle Harris, Flea, Crystal Scales', 'PG', 'Eliza and Debbie are two sisters who don''t always get along. But their relationship is put to the test when Debbie''s life is in danger, and Eliza might have to give up her power to talk to animals....', 'Eliza and Debbie are two sisters who don''t always get along. But their relationship is put to the test when Debbie''s life is in danger, and Eliza might have to give up her power to talk to animals....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmWpcUQtWHC4kjVCygiFEDR1wCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14317'),
  ('405257841891484490', 'The Wild Wild West Revisited', 1979, 'Western, TV Movie', 'Burt Kennedy, Robert B. Hauser', 'William Bowers', 'Robert Conrad, Ross Martin, Paul Williams, Harry Morgan, René Auberjonois, Jo Ann Harris, Trisha Noble, Jeff MacKay', null, 'The intrepid team of Old West government intelligence agents are brought out of retirement after 10 years to hunt down a cunning new adversary, the son of their former archenemy, who is suspected of cloning imposters to be substituted for the crowned heads of Europe and perhaps even the President of the United States.', 'The intrepid team of Old West government intelligence agents are brought out of retirement after 10 years to hunt down a cunning new adversary, the son of their former archenemy, who is suspected of cloning imposters to be substituted for the crowned heads of Europe and perhaps even the President of the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOa5pqjNkvMwlp7mqje6orrsIZ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85341'),
  ('143677454470407754', 'The Wild Women of Wongo', 1959, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'James L. Wolcott, Harry Walsh', 'Cedric Rutherford', 'Jean Hawkshaw, Mary Ann Webb, Candé Gerrard, Adrienne Bourbeau, Johnny Walsh, Ed Fury, Rex Richards, Bert Williams', null, 'On the tropical island of Wongo, a tribe of beautiful women discover that the other side of the island is inhabited by a tribe of handsome men. They also discover that a tribe of evil ape men live on the island, too, and the ape men are planning a raid on the tribe in order to capture mates.', 'On the tropical island of Wongo, a tribe of beautiful women discover that the other side of the island is inhabited by a tribe of handsome men. They also discover that a tribe of evil ape men live on the island, too, and the ape men are planning a raid on the tribe in order to capture mates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izmk8lUpNvDpjqe01pc0ObZXIq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43144'),
  ('50936675479902525', 'The Wild World of Batwoman', 1966, 'Crime, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Jerry Warren, William G. Troiano', 'Jerry Warren', 'Katherine Victor, George Mitchell André, Steve Brodie, Richard Banks, Steve Conte, Mel Oshins, Bruno VeSota, Bob Arbogast', null, 'Batwoman and her bevy of Batmaidens fight evil and dance.', 'Batwoman and her bevy of Batmaidens fight evil and dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPhwk02vibVJt6vVQxM40TENvlF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31258'),
  ('1012272868905382500', 'The Wild, Wild Planet', 1966, 'Science Fiction', 'Antonio Margheriti, Riccardo Pallottini', 'Renato Moretti, Ivan Reiner', 'Tony Russel, Lisa Gastoni, Massimo Serato, Carlo Giustini, Franco Nero, Enzo Fiermonte, Umberto Raho, Vittorio Bonos', 'NR', 'A rogue cop must stop a scientist from taking over the world with his deadly female robots, who are shrinking the world leaders.', 'A rogue cop must stop a scientist from taking over the world with his deadly female robots, who are shrinking the world leaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eV5aRcljsF6Tmnz6UgmY7zrnxuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28912'),
  ('285264293577095752', 'The Wildcat', 1921, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Theodor Sparkuhl', 'Hanns Kräly, Ernst Lubitsch', 'Pola Negri, Victor Janson, Paul Heidemann, Wilhelm Diegelmann, Hermann Thimig, Edith Meller, Marga Köhler, Paul Graetz', 'NR', 'A charismatic lieutenant newly assigned to a remote fort is captured by a group of mountain bandits, thus setting in motion a madcap farce that is Lubitsch at his most unrestrained. A wonderfully anarchic and playfully subversive satire of military life from one of the great comedy filmmakers.', 'A charismatic lieutenant newly assigned to a remote fort is captured by a group of mountain bandits, thus setting in motion a madcap farce that is Lubitsch at his most unrestrained. A wonderfully anarchic and playfully subversive satire of military life from one of the great comedy filmmakers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YWjCN3B8vDKEsDyhOfUfn8XgSR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55648'),
  ('244005563578422699', 'The Wildcats of St Trinian''s', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Frank Launder', null, 'Sheila Hancock, Michael Hordern, Joe Melia, Thorley Walters, Rodney Bewes, Deborah Norton, Deborah Norton, Maureen Lipman', null, 'The girls of St Trinian''s decide they are being asked to do too much work so they go on strike.', 'The girls of St Trinian''s decide they are being asked to do too much work so they go on strike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucTA4b8CsNazrf2FwT5CI13Zmdq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40637'),
  ('700169362960640215', 'The Wilde Wedding', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Damian Harris, Paula Huidobro', 'Damian Harris', 'Glenn Close, John Malkovich, Patrick Stewart, Minnie Driver, Grace Van Patten, Jack Davenport, Noah Emmerich, Peter Facinelli', 'R', 'After a whirlwind courtship, retired movie star Eve Wilde prepares to marry her fourth husband, the renowned English writer Harold Alcott. Sparks soon begin to fly when Eve''s first ex and other guests arrive at her estate for a weekend get-together.', 'After a whirlwind courtship, retired movie star Eve Wilde prepares to marry her fourth husband, the renowned English writer Harold Alcott. Sparks soon begin to fly when Eve''s first ex and other guests arrive at her estate for a weekend get-together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wE9tcRTZ3OCTz2LjGaNxFHZnDLJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470472'),
  ('1055499697728733873', 'The Will', 1939, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kamal Selim, Salah Abu Seif, François Farkas', 'Kamal Selim', 'Fatma Roshdy, Hussein Sedki, Anwar Wagdi, Zaki Rostom, Abbas Fares, Abdel Aziz Khalil, Mary Moneib, ElSayed Bedir', null, 'The story of a young man from a lower-class family who falls in love with a wealthy girl. Despite the class difference and the obstacles they face, their love endures, and they must navigate the challenges posed by their families'' social disparity and the economic hardships of the time.', 'The story of a young man from a lower-class family who falls in love with a wealthy girl. Despite the class difference and the obstacles they face, their love endures, and they must navigate the challenges posed by their families'' social disparity and the economic hardships of the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUJZ1sVOWZUWeDPzigtwt8U3lf5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161257'),
  ('226862876173462766', 'The Willies', 1990, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Brian Peck, Tom Ingalls, Phil Robinson', 'Brian Peck', 'Sean Astin, Jason Horst, Joshua John Miller, James Karen, Marilyn Pitzer, Evan Arnold, Dana Ashbrook, Kathy MacQuarrie', 'PG-13', 'Two brothers camping with their cousin try to frighten each other by telling stories. They start with urban legends, but then there are two main narrations: one involves strange happenings at an elementary school; the other, a teenage boy with a peculiar interest.', 'Two brothers camping with their cousin try to frighten each other by telling stories. They start with urban legends, but then there are two main narrations: one involves strange happenings at an elementary school; the other, a teenage boy with a peculiar interest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWVE0ne2VeobovFFlw4I9NImIho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25088'),
  ('419821729389953456', 'The Willoughbys', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Sebastian Brodin, Rav Grewal, Kris Pearn', 'Kris Pearn', 'Will Forte, Maya Rudolph, Alessia Cara, Terry Crews, Martin Short, Jane Krakowski, Seán Cullen, Ricky Gervais', 'PG', 'When the four Willoughby children are abandoned by their selfish parents, they must learn how to adapt their Old-Fashioned values to the contemporary world in order to create something new: The Modern Family.', 'When the four Willoughby children are abandoned by their selfish parents, they must learn how to adapt their Old-Fashioned values to the contemporary world in order to create something new: The Modern Family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WrMmjdZvpxLQh1tCQ9tOd1asOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560044'),
  ('90146809731892500', 'The Willow Tree', 2005, 'Drama', 'Majid Majidi, Mahmoud Kalari', 'Nasser Hashemzadeh, Fouad Nahas', 'Parviz Parastouei, Roya Taymourian, Afarin Obeisi, Reza Naji, Melika Eslafi, Mahmoud Behraznia, Leila Otadi', null, 'Youssef, a blind university professor, is suddenly diagnosed with a fatal disease and must undergo treatment in France. Back home, will he find the life he had before?', 'Youssef, a blind university professor, is suddenly diagnosed with a fatal disease and must undergo treatment in France. Back home, will he find the life he had before?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqJwe4XpgmK2Wh84JQnvPXWQjHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43767'),
  ('517020832265500191', 'The Willows in Winter', 1996, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Dave Unwin', 'Ted Walker', 'Alan Bennett, Michael Gambon, Rik Mayall, Michael Palin, Vanessa Redgrave, Enn Reitel, Adrian Scarborough, Zoot Lynam', 'G', 'Hailed as the "rightful heir" to "The Wind in the Willows", William Horwood''s critically acclaimed sequel comes to magical life in this beautifully animated feature-length classic. Join four of the best-loved characters in children''s literature for their heart-warming and hilarious new adventure along the Riverbank, narrated by Academy Award-winner Vanessa Redgrave.', 'Hailed as the "rightful heir" to "The Wind in the Willows", William Horwood''s critically acclaimed sequel comes to magical life in this beautifully animated feature-length classic. Join four of the best-loved characters in children''s literature for their heart-warming and hilarious new adventure along the Riverbank, narrated by Academy Award-winner Vanessa Redgrave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApcDl7gBpUjDfc0rolP0sHPwSxo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59179'),
  ('620282444811207487', 'The Wind', 1928, 'Drama, Western, Romance, Thriller', 'Victor Sjöström, John Arnold, Harold S. Bucquet', 'Frances Marion', 'Lillian Gish, Lars Hanson, Montagu Love, Dorothy Cumming, Edward Earle, William Orlamond, Carmencita Johnson, Leon Janney', null, 'When Letty Mason relocates to West Texas, she finds herself unsettled by the ever-present wind and sand. Arriving at her new home at the ranch of her cousin, Beverly, she receives a surprisingly cold welcome from his wife, Cora. Soon tensions in the family and unwanted attention from a trio of suitors leave Letty increasingly disturbed.', 'When Letty Mason relocates to West Texas, she finds herself unsettled by the ever-present wind and sand. Arriving at her new home at the ranch of her cousin, Beverly, she receives a surprisingly cold welcome from his wife, Cora. Soon tensions in the family and unwanted attention from a trio of suitors leave Letty increasingly disturbed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11ySoycM3ARm66RLiYE9yRcrg5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31416'),
  ('584024807304580686', 'The Wind', 1983, 'Drama', 'Souleymane Cissé, Étienne Carton de Grammont', 'Souleymane Cissé', 'Fousseyni Sissoko, Goundo Guissé, Balla Moussa Keita, Ismaila Sarr, Omou Diarra, Ismaila Ciss, Massitan Ballo, Dioncounda Kone', null, 'Two Malian teenagers, Bah and Batrou, from different backgrounds, meet at secondary school. Bah is the descendent of a great tribal chieftain. Batrous father, a provincial military governor, represents the new ruling power. The two teenagers are part of a generation that rejects the established order and challenges the society in which they live.', 'Two Malian teenagers, Bah and Batrou, from different backgrounds, meet at secondary school. Bah is the descendent of a great tribal chieftain. Batrous father, a provincial military governor, represents the new ruling power. The two teenagers are part of a generation that rejects the established order and challenges the society in which they live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4LyL9DomGIcK9bcpynvT98il25.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136052'),
  ('408643531878938135', 'The Wind', 1986, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Nico Mastorakis, Andreas Bellis', 'Nico Mastorakis, Fred C. Perry', 'Meg Foster, Wings Hauser, David McCallum, Robert Morley, Steve Railsback, Mihalis Giannatos, Summer Thomas, John Michaels', null, 'Mystery writer Sian Anderson leaves her boyfriend John for three weeks of intense writing in the isolated Greek town of Monemvassia. Upon her arrival in the ancient, deserted, walled-in fortress, she is met by Elias Appleby, the round eccentric landlord who guides her through mysterious underground passageways to the house where she will work. He warns her to stay inside at night because of the killer winds that arrive after dark.', 'Mystery writer Sian Anderson leaves her boyfriend John for three weeks of intense writing in the isolated Greek town of Monemvassia. Upon her arrival in the ancient, deserted, walled-in fortress, she is met by Elias Appleby, the round eccentric landlord who guides her through mysterious underground passageways to the house where she will work. He warns her to stay inside at night because of the killer winds that arrive after dark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLlS3DqLwy7EuwHiKvptxQImmVR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30919'),
  ('558129116034086539', 'The Wind', 2005, 'Horror', 'Marcelo Camorino, Eduardo Mignogna', 'Eduardo Mignogna, Graciela Maglie', 'Federico Luppi, Antonella Costa, Pablo Cedrón, Ricardo Díaz Mourelle, Mariana Briski, Esteban Meloni, Hernán Jiménez, Florencia Sierra', null, 'After the funeral of his daughter Ema, Frank Osorio travels for the first time to Buenos Aires to tell his granddaughter Alina about her mother''s death. But Frank has to big secrets: the first one is about the identity of Alina''s father and the second one is related to a crime.', 'After the funeral of his daughter Ema, Frank Osorio travels for the first time to Buenos Aires to tell his granddaughter Alina about her mother''s death. But Frank has to big secrets: the first one is about the identity of Alina''s father and the second one is related to a crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qeguV1e28YfPKaJyqffaINjwP4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95098'),
  ('509019649480166692', 'The Wind', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery, Western', 'Emma Tammi, Lyn Moncrief', 'Teresa Sutherland', 'Caitlin Gerard, Ashley Zukerman, Julia Goldani Telles, Miles Anderson, Dylan McTee, Martin Patterson', null, 'Lizzy is a tough, resourceful frontierswoman settling a remote stretch of land on the 19th-century American frontier. Isolated from civilization in a desolate wilderness where the wind never stops howling, she begins to sense a sinister presence that seems to be borne of the land itself, and when a newlywed couple arrive at a nearby homestead, their presence amplifies Lizzy''s fears, setting into motion a shocking chain of events.', 'Lizzy is a tough, resourceful frontierswoman settling a remote stretch of land on the 19th-century American frontier. Isolated from civilization in a desolate wilderness where the wind never stops howling, she begins to sense a sinister presence that seems to be borne of the land itself, and when a newlywed couple arrive at a nearby homestead, their presence amplifies Lizzy''s fears, setting into motion a shocking chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcfPHZHSQODLCWdkUVLYATNyEVo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541560'),
  ('1003112504946479832', 'The Wind and the Lion', 1975, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History', 'John Milius, Billy Williams', 'John Milius', 'Sean Connery, Candice Bergen, Brian Keith, John Huston, Geoffrey Lewis, Steve Kanaly, Vladek Sheybal, Nadim Sawalha', 'PG', 'At the beginning of the 20th century an American woman is abducted in Morocco by Berbers, and the attempts to free her range from diplomatic pressure to military intervention.', 'At the beginning of the 20th century an American woman is abducted in Morocco by Berbers, and the attempts to free her range from diplomatic pressure to military intervention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QLqEZL1kBBfKjVz3nAm5vJruRZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14815'),
  ('968489441257922450', 'The Wind Blows Round', 2006, 'Drama', 'Giorgio Diritti, Roberto Cimatti, Massimo Tonti', 'Fredo Valla, Giorgio Diritti', 'Thierry Toscan, Alessandra Agosti, Dario Anghilante, Giovanni Foresti', null, 'The aging, conservative population of a small, sleepy village in the Italian Alps are surprised to see that a former French professor has settled there with his young wife and their three children to produce goat cheese, in order to escape the wrongs of civilization. At first they are suspicious of his unconventional ideas and lifestyle, then are conquered by the enthusiasm, kindness, helpfulness of the young family and start to see in them a possible rebirth of the place. But little by little misunderstandings, envy and conflicts take over.', 'The aging, conservative population of a small, sleepy village in the Italian Alps are surprised to see that a former French professor has settled there with his young wife and their three children to produce goat cheese, in order to escape the wrongs of civilization. At first they are suspicious of his unconventional ideas and lifestyle, then are conquered by the enthusiasm, kindness, helpfulness of the young family and start to see in them a possible rebirth of the place. But little by little misunderstandings, envy and conflicts take over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owmpPRk0ek3F7Omt67kVli7EC21.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55717'),
  ('1049028092107947074', 'The Wind Cannot Read', 1958, 'Romance, Drama, War', 'Ralph Thomas, Ernest Steward', null, 'Dirk Bogarde, Yoko Tani, John Fraser, Anthony Bushell, Marne Maitland, Michael Medwin, Richard Leech, Tony Wager', null, 'A British officer falls in love with his Japanese instructor at a military language school. They start a romance, but she is regarded as the enemy and is not accepted by his countrymen.', 'A British officer falls in love with his Japanese instructor at a military language school. They start a romance, but she is regarded as the enemy and is not accepted by his countrymen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qx1hXugveaSBoJt4JdM2l8mUc45.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47706'),
  ('1031340765037398851', 'The Wind Guardians', 2018, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Kuo Liu', 'Yu Ao, Yicheng Shu, Zhou Tienan', 'Lu Zhixing, Jun Chu, Shan Xin, Guo Zhengjian, Zhen Zhang, Zhuang Miao, Guannan Wang, Kai Wang', null, 'A young man who lives in Xiaoyanggang dreams of martyrdom, but he is blind and can only sneak into the market by swindling. One day, Rakshasa attacked Xiaoyanggang, and his mother, who was dependent on him, suddenly disappeared. Lang Ming had to embark on the road of finding the truth. After a wave of unrest, ancient gods and beasts are in danger, and the legendary chivalrous also appear before them. Lang Ming embarks on a journey of adventure that will change his life...', 'A young man who lives in Xiaoyanggang dreams of martyrdom, but he is blind and can only sneak into the market by swindling. One day, Rakshasa attacked Xiaoyanggang, and his mother, who was dependent on him, suddenly disappeared. Lang Ming had to embark on the road of finding the truth. After a wave of unrest, ancient gods and beasts are in danger, and the legendary chivalrous also appear before them. Lang Ming embarks on a journey of adventure that will change his life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3pYiazT21B35NZIdJSJPnATQHM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541057'),
  ('900179576355989461', 'The Wind in the Willows', 1949, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'James Algar', null, 'Basil Rathbone, Eric Blore, J. Pat O''Malley, Campbell Grant, Claud Allister, Colin Campbell, Oliver Wallace, John McLeish', null, 'This animated fairy tale for kids tells the classic story of a dapper, automobile loving fellow named Mr. Toad, whose passion becomes a problem when he''s framed for stealing cars by a band of rogue weasels.', 'This animated fairy tale for kids tells the classic story of a dapper, automobile loving fellow named Mr. Toad, whose passion becomes a problem when he''s framed for stealing cars by a band of rogue weasels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMRokrWAWccuqgDCNvQoKJEPHlS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125244'),
  ('382767541457793214', 'The Wind in the Willows', 1983, 'Fantasy, Animation, Family, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Chris Taylor, Mark Hall', 'Rosemary Anne Sisson', 'Richard Pearson, Michael Hordern, Ian Carmichael, David Jason, Beryl Reid, Una Stubbs, Jonathan Cecil, Brian Trueman', 'NR', 'One spring, Mole decides that he can ignore the spring cleaning for a little longer, and begins a series of adventures with his new friend Rat. They go for a picnic on the riverbank, on a caravan expedition with Toad, until Toad switches allegiance to his new car and his reckless driving makes Mole and Rat search out Badger for help in curbing Toad''s profligate habits. But Toad gets away from them and gets a 20-year sentence from the magistrate for theft, reckless driving, and Gross Impertinence. While Toad works his wiles on the jailer''s daughter and escapes jail dressed as a washer woman, Badger tries to guard Toad Hall from the machinations of the Weasels and is badly beaten. And it requires a plan of attack and all four comrades to regain Toad Hall.', 'One spring, Mole decides that he can ignore the spring cleaning for a little longer, and begins a series of adventures with his new friend Rat. They go for a picnic on the riverbank, on a caravan expedition with Toad, until Toad switches allegiance to his new car and his reckless driving makes Mole and Rat search out Badger for help in curbing Toad''s profligate habits. But Toad gets away from them and gets a 20-year sentence from the magistrate for theft, reckless driving, and Gross Impertinence. While Toad works his wiles on the jailer''s daughter and escapes jail dressed as a washer woman, Badger tries to guard Toad Hall from the machinations of the Weasels and is badly beaten. And it requires a plan of attack and all four comrades to regain Toad Hall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Dgg7N0bukwmVJU2c1UtgxpdpDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38782'),
  ('681554911594725940', 'The Wind in the Willows', 1995, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Dennis Abey, Dave Unwin', 'Ted Walker', 'Alan Bennett, Michael Palin, Michael Gambon, Rik Mayall, Vanessa Redgrave, James Villiers, Emma Chambers, Judy Cornwell', null, 'Jailed for his reckless driving, rambunctious Mr. Toad has to escape from prison when his beloved Toad Hall comes under threat from the wily weasels, who plan to build a dog food factory on the very meadow sold to them by Toad himself.', 'Jailed for his reckless driving, rambunctious Mr. Toad has to escape from prison when his beloved Toad Hall comes under threat from the wily weasels, who plan to build a dog food factory on the very meadow sold to them by Toad himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDXSed3TihGrQsNUbns5oIE8Urj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59178'),
  ('174331767580995979', 'The Wind in the Willows', 1996, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Terry Jones, David Tattersall, David Brown', 'Terry Jones', 'Terry Jones, Steve Coogan, Eric Idle, Nicol Williamson, Antony Sher, John Cleese, Stephen Fry, Bernard Hill', 'PG', 'Jailed for his reckless driving, rambunctious Mr. Toad has to escape from prison when his beloved Toad Hall comes under threat from the wily weasels, who plan to build a dog food factory on the very meadow sold to them by Toad himself.', 'Jailed for his reckless driving, rambunctious Mr. Toad has to escape from prison when his beloved Toad Hall comes under threat from the wily weasels, who plan to build a dog food factory on the very meadow sold to them by Toad himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nsOM52BsDeHzc0yI27bah2OWems.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47168'),
  ('732544701232968703', 'The Wind Journeys', 2009, 'Drama, Music, Adventure', 'Ciro Guerra, Iván Gaona, Paulo Andrés Pérez', 'Ciro Guerra', 'Marciano Martínez, Yull Núñez, Agustin Nieves, Jose Luis Torres, Carmen Molina, Erminia Martinez, Justo Valdez, Juan Batista Martinez', null, 'After his wife''s death, a vallenato singer from Majagual, Sucre, decides to quit music and return his allegedly cursed accordion to his master. He is joined by Fermín Morales, a teenage boy who admires him and wishes to follow his footsteps. Together, they start a journey throughout several towns in Northern Colombia to Taroa, in La Guajira desert, where the singer''s master supposedly lives.', 'After his wife''s death, a vallenato singer from Majagual, Sucre, decides to quit music and return his allegedly cursed accordion to his master. He is joined by Fermín Morales, a teenage boy who admires him and wishes to follow his footsteps. Together, they start a journey throughout several towns in Northern Colombia to Taroa, in La Guajira desert, where the singer''s master supposedly lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmdvtUbeNDyPIgytDepDcWpLlud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39378'),
  ('19658147101488969', 'The Wind of Fear', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Gustavo Moheno', 'Gustavo Moheno', 'Martha Higareda, Verónica Langer, Magali Boysselle, Danny Perea, Cassandra Ciangherotti, Mónica Dionne, Fernando Luján, María Fernanda Malo', null, 'Claudia is a troubled teen confined in a very particular support center ruled with roughness by renowned psychiatrist Bernarda Alquicira. Coexisting with girls who have experienced similar trances, Claudia confronts horrible visions of Andrea, a beautiful intern who committed suicide a year ago. Another strange patient -Josefina- and doctor Lucia Franyutti -the right arm of Bernarda- seem to know the key to the bizarre return of Andrea, but even they are disturbed by the supernatural events that take place when the wind starts to blow.', 'Claudia is a troubled teen confined in a very particular support center ruled with roughness by renowned psychiatrist Bernarda Alquicira. Coexisting with girls who have experienced similar trances, Claudia confronts horrible visions of Andrea, a beautiful intern who committed suicide a year ago. Another strange patient -Josefina- and doctor Lucia Franyutti -the right arm of Bernarda- seem to know the key to the bizarre return of Andrea, but even they are disturbed by the supernatural events that take place when the wind starts to blow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hERsprO7lr76EXHzK7vlwU9lbI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119308'),
  ('346480295681711164', 'The Wind of the Night', 1999, 'Drama', 'Philippe Garrel, Caroline Champetier', 'Philippe Garrel', 'Catherine Deneuve, Daniel Duval, Xavier Beauvois, Jacques Lassalle, Daniel Pommereulle, Marc Faure, Marie Vialle, Anita Blond', null, 'A wayward young man finds himself involved with two mysterious people of a previous generation. After an affair with the married Hélène, the young man tries to escape her obsessions on a road trip with Serge, a taciturn relic of the 60s.', 'A wayward young man finds himself involved with two mysterious people of a previous generation. After an affair with the married Hélène, the young man tries to escape her obsessions on a road trip with Serge, a taciturn relic of the 60s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Oo9okyEaCW9vwZEEoNAv1KjpQa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79435'),
  ('102888261754832047', 'The Wind Rises', 2013, 'Animation, Drama, History, Romance', 'Kitaro Kosaka, Hayao Miyazaki, Atsushi Okui', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Hideaki Anno, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Miori Takimoto, Masahiko Nishimura, Stephen Alpert, Mansai Nomura, Jun Kunimura, Mirai Shida', 'PG-13', 'A lifelong love of flight inspires Japanese aviation engineer Jiro Horikoshi, whose storied career includes the creation of the A-6M World War II fighter plane.', 'A lifelong love of flight inspires Japanese aviation engineer Jiro Horikoshi, whose storied career includes the creation of the A-6M World War II fighter plane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfwSexzlIzaOgxP9A8bTA6t8YYb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149870'),
  ('890879500088702279', 'The Wind That Shakes the Barley', 2006, 'Drama, War', 'Ken Loach, Barry Ackroyd', 'Paul Laverty', 'Cillian Murphy, Pádraic Delaney, Liam Cunningham, Orla Fitzgerald, Mary O''Riordan, Mary Murphy, Laurence Barry, Damien Kearney', 'NR', 'In 1920s Ireland young doctor Damien O''Donovan prepares to depart for a new job in a London hospital. As he says his goodbyes at a friend''s farm, British Black and Tans arrive, and a young man is killed. Damien joins his brother Teddy in the Irish Republican Army, but political events are soon set in motion that tear the brothers apart.', 'In 1920s Ireland young doctor Damien O''Donovan prepares to depart for a new job in a London hospital. As he says his goodbyes at a friend''s farm, British Black and Tans arrive, and a young man is killed. Damien joins his brother Teddy in the Irish Republican Army, but political events are soon set in motion that tear the brothers apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCb4LweL6U7KTgSda3Wb7vHiA9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1116'),
  ('863137809645761945', 'The Wind Will Carry Us', 1999, 'Drama', 'Abbas Kiarostami, Nasrin Askari, Bahman Ghobadi', 'Abbas Kiarostami', 'Behzad Dorani, Farzad Sohrabi, Noghre Asadi, Roushan Karam Elmi, Bahman Ghobadi, Shahpour Ghobadi, Reihan Heidari, Masood Mansouri', 'NR', 'Irreverent city engineer Behzad comes to a rural Kurdish village in Iran to keep vigil for a dying relative. In the meanwhile the film follows his efforts to fit in with the local community and how he changes his own attitudes as a result.', 'Irreverent city engineer Behzad comes to a rural Kurdish village in Iran to keep vigil for a dying relative. In the meanwhile the film follows his efforts to fit in with the local community and how he changes his own attitudes as a result.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzrqZungDYA3Djp61NWUm7DtxNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43423'),
  ('287409387845986668', 'The Windbag', 1971, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kostas Karagiannis', 'Lakis Mihailidis, Dinos Dimopoulos', 'Labros Konstadaras, Maro Kodou, Ketty Panou, Giorgos Moshidis, Rika Dialina, Giorgos Papazisis, Mitsi Konstadara, Giannis Fyrios', null, 'A pretentious lawyer, the scion of an aristocratic family, falls in love with a simple receptionist and rejects her, unaware that she is the daughter of a count.', 'A pretentious lawyer, the scion of an aristocratic family, falls in love with a simple receptionist and rejects her, unaware that she is the daughter of a count.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeH7qIQKKbrfJB4qJWtMn7QBk2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407134'),
