  ('611740540719456645', 'The Wings of Eagles', 1957, 'Drama, War', 'John Ford, Paul Vogel, Wingate Smith', 'Frank Wead', 'John Wayne, Dan Dailey, Maureen O''Hara, Ward Bond, Ken Curtis, Edmund Lowe, Kenneth Tobey, James Todd', 'NR', 'The story of Frank W. "Spig" Wead - a Navy-flyer turned screenwriter.', 'The story of Frank W. "Spig" Wead - a Navy-flyer turned screenwriter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNZZb39Tpe7zqXA8WGl6F9cvGtd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46189'),
  ('534218119280400816', 'The Wings of the Dove', 1981, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Benoît Jacquot, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Florence Delay, Benoît Jacquot', 'Isabelle Huppert, Dominique Sanda, Michele Placido, Jean Sorel, Françoise Christophe, Veronica Lazăr, Danilo Mattei, Loleh Bellon', null, 'A 20th-century prostitute (Dominique Sanda) arranges for her lover (Michele Placido) to wed a wealthy, dying millionairess (Isabelle Huppert) in Venice.', 'A 20th-century prostitute (Dominique Sanda) arranges for her lover (Michele Placido) to wed a wealthy, dying millionairess (Isabelle Huppert) in Venice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DEAGoLQqFSTt11mnugjXlL4Wbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63225'),
  ('733102357354850536', 'The Wings of the Dove', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Iain Softley, Ray Chan, Andrew Sanders', 'Hossein Amini', 'Helena Bonham Carter, Linus Roache, Alison Elliott, Elizabeth McGovern, Charlotte Rampling, Alex Jennings, Michael Gambon, Ben Miles', 'R', 'Kate is secretly betrothed to a struggling journalist, Merton Densher. But she knows her Aunt Maude will never approve of the match, since Kate''s deceased mother has lost all her money in a marriage to a degenerate opium addict. When Kate meets a terminally ill American heiress named Millie traveling through Europe, she comes up with a conniving plan to have both love and wealth.', 'Kate is secretly betrothed to a struggling journalist, Merton Densher. But she knows her Aunt Maude will never approve of the match, since Kate''s deceased mother has lost all her money in a marriage to a degenerate opium addict. When Kate meets a terminally ill American heiress named Millie traveling through Europe, she comes up with a conniving plan to have both love and wealth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eb1ZnIEC8LMmMgwD2fIAmQOkcd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45609'),
  ('113709769967812207', 'The Wings of the Kirin', 2012, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Nobuhiro Doi', 'Takeharu Sakurai', 'Hiroshi Abe, Yui Aragaki, Meisa Kuroki, Junpei Mizobata, Kiichi Nakai, Tori Matsuzaka, Rena Tanaka, Masaki Suda', null, 'A man''s body is found under the statue of a winged kirin in the Nihombashi area of Tokyo. A suspect named Yashima has a car accident and falls unconscious while he is attempting to run away. Yashima''s lover Kaori comes from Fukushima and tells detectives that he is absolutely not a criminal. Meanwhile, Detective Kyoichiro Kaga''s (Hiroshi Abe) investigates and uncovers a point of contact between the dead body and Yashima. A hidden fact of the victim is revealed which even his children did not know about...', 'A man''s body is found under the statue of a winged kirin in the Nihombashi area of Tokyo. A suspect named Yashima has a car accident and falls unconscious while he is attempting to run away. Yashima''s lover Kaori comes from Fukushima and tells detectives that he is absolutely not a criminal. Meanwhile, Detective Kyoichiro Kaga''s (Hiroshi Abe) investigates and uncovers a point of contact between the dead body and Yashima. A hidden fact of the victim is revealed which even his children did not know about...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5U7p8I2XDVXJKHoWpBrcNv8Hgh8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122734'),
  ('1111974670301724086', 'The Wingwalker', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alonso Alvarez', 'Alonso Alvarez, Max Arciniega', 'Omar Chaparro, Will Rothhaar, Max Arciniega, Héctor Jiménez, Jesús Ochoa, Gustavo Sánchez Parra, Leslie Garza, Ramses Jimenez', null, 'A young widower is deported as his daughter is scheduled for a heart transplant, this will lead him to orchestrate the boldest border crossing plan in history.', 'A young widower is deported as his daughter is scheduled for a heart transplant, this will lead him to orchestrate the boldest border crossing plan in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tROfq1PDlMAWAGKAdgaeweobsJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1183699'),
