  ('753250338433839495', 'The Winter of Three Hairs', 1949, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Zhao Ming, Gong Yan, Jinming Zhu', 'Hansheng Yang', 'Wang Longji, Mo Chou, Huang Chen, Guan Hongda, Lin Zhen, Gao Yiyun, Wang Yi, Ding Ran', null, 'San mao (3 hairs) was a very popular Chinese comic strip first published in 1935-37, continued from 1948 into the 1990s, about a young orphan boy struggling with life in Shanghai.', 'San mao (3 hairs) was a very popular Chinese comic strip first published in 1935-37, continued from 1948 into the 1990s, about a young orphan boy struggling with life in Shanghai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKeSiZvoElojbAh1ozg29XMk6W1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188324'),
  ('1082134694244039701', 'The Winter Palace', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'T.W. Peacocke, Jonathan Yapp', 'Gregg Rossen, Brian Sawyer', 'Danica McKellar, Neal Bledsoe, Jennifer Wigmore, Luke Marty, Zarrin Darnell-Martin, Tom Rooney, Jenni Burke, Glenn-Michael Jones', 'G', 'A novelist with a severe case of writer’s block is given the chance to finish her book at an empty winter chateau. She''s surprised when the property''s owner, a prince, decides to come stay as well.', 'A novelist with a severe case of writer’s block is given the chance to finish her book at an empty winter chateau. She''s surprised when the property''s owner, a prince, decides to come stay as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14iIpUh848qIxhIJ1V1tu2iobKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890233'),
  ('53198889105044728', 'The Winter War', 1989, 'Drama, War', 'Pekka Parikka, Kari Sohlberg, Veikko Aaltonen', 'Antti Tuuri, Pekka Parikka', 'Taneli Mäkelä, Vesa Vierikko, Timo Torikka, Heikki Paavilainen, Antti Raivio, Esko Kovero, Martti Suosalo, Markku Huhtamo', null, 'After Nazi Germany invades Poland in September 1939, Russia attacks Finland two months later. Finnish reservists leave home and go to war. Brothers Martti and Paavo Hakala, farmers from the municipality of Kauhava in the province of Pohjanmaa/Ostrobothnia, serve in a Finnish platoon.', 'After Nazi Germany invades Poland in September 1939, Russia attacks Finland two months later. Finnish reservists leave home and go to war. Brothers Martti and Paavo Hakala, farmers from the municipality of Kauhava in the province of Pohjanmaa/Ostrobothnia, serve in a Finnish platoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2sZm9bl4J0q2pIoSxXcDLX2U9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29383'),
