  ('1116608775345277542', 'The Wise Little Hen', 1934, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Music', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Florence Gill, Clarence Nash, Purv Pullen, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Join Donald Duck in his debut in the classic animated short The Wise Little Hen. The Little Hen is planting corn and would like to have help from Peter Pig and Donald Duck, but they refuse stating they each have a "tummy ache." When it comes time to harvest the corn, Peter Pig and Donald still refuse to help the Hen, so she and her chicks do the harvest by themselves. Finally, the hen cooks the corn and offers some to Donald and Peter Pig, but when they look more carefully they discover a surprise.', 'Join Donald Duck in his debut in the classic animated short The Wise Little Hen. The Little Hen is planting corn and would like to have help from Peter Pig and Donald Duck, but they refuse stating they each have a "tummy ache." When it comes time to harvest the corn, Peter Pig and Donald still refuse to help the Hen, so she and her chicks do the harvest by themselves. Finally, the hen cooks the corn and offers some to Donald and Peter Pig, but when they look more carefully they discover a surprise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMKqAHgr4aC194UKlLt4N8nbwtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91815'),
  ('54040637974387075', 'The Wise Quacking Duck', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc, Darrell Payne', 'NR', 'An exceedingly mild-mannered man is sent out to kill a duck for dinner by his wife. Unfortunately for him, he picks Daffy Duck as his victim. The two face off and do battle for the remainder of the cartoon.', 'An exceedingly mild-mannered man is sent out to kill a duck for dinner by his wife. Unfortunately for him, he picks Daffy Duck as his victim. The two face off and do battle for the remainder of the cartoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBku54rCpEX4VzHB0uTRDGJzuBE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188675'),
  ('415366629460421744', 'The Wisher', 2002, 'Horror', 'Gavin Wilding, Mark Dobrescu', 'Ellen Cook', 'Liane Balaban, Ron Silver, Drew Lachey, Siri Baruc, Billy Morton, Wendy Anderson, Iain MacLean, Ariel Bastian', null, 'Mary is a horror-movie junkie whose obsession is out of control, leading her over-protective father to ban her from seeing scary flicks. But when she and her friends sneak out to see a film called The Wisher, its creepy antagonist seems to escape into her life and make her darkest desires come true.', 'Mary is a horror-movie junkie whose obsession is out of control, leading her over-protective father to ban her from seeing scary flicks. But when she and her friends sneak out to see a film called The Wisher, its creepy antagonist seems to escape into her life and make her darkest desires come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSSl9aqlIhcl83Zsqca1HoHZhwa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55102'),
  ('580208209143745880', 'The Wishful Thinkers', 2013, 'Drama', 'Jonás Trueba, Santiago Racaj', null, 'Francesco Carril, Aura Garrido, Mikele Urroz, Vito Sanz, Isabelle Stoffel, Luis Miguel Madrid', null, 'What some filmmakers do when they are not making movies: they waste time; they eat and get drunk; they take a walk after watching a movie; they fall in love; they are alone or with friends, building future memories for a future movie.', 'What some filmmakers do when they are not making movies: they waste time; they eat and get drunk; they take a walk after watching a movie; they fall in love; they are alone or with friends, building future memories for a future movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2i4Mfo4GUQQ8eBaCvEkliZ55WWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178601'),
  ('153600398688692265', 'The Wishing Tree', 1976, 'Drama', 'Tengiz Abuladze, Vakhtang Kajirashvili, Neli Kutateladze', 'Tengiz Abuladze, Revaz Inanishvili', 'Lika Kavzharadze, Joseph (Soso) Jachvliani, Zaza Kolelishvili, Kote Daushvili, Sofiko Chiaureli, Erosi Mandjgaladze, Otar Megvinetukhutsesi, Ramaz Chkhikvadze', null, 'Marita arrives at a small village in Georgia to live with her aunt. She meets a poor young lad, Gedia, and falls in love with him. But her relatives are determined to marry the girl off to a local rich man…', 'Marita arrives at a small village in Georgia to live with her aunt. She meets a poor young lad, Gedia, and falls in love with him. But her relatives are determined to marry the girl off to a local rich man…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWt4grF2eztN53h1hs1fpiKZxBa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150223'),
  ('78030563996703432', 'The Wishmas Tree', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Action', 'Ricard Cussó', 'Peter Ivan', 'Miranda Tapsell, Ross Noble, Kate Murphy, Ricard Cussó, Ryan Renshaw, Ed Oxenbould, Brooke Boney, Patrick Cridland', 'G', 'A young possum''s misguided wish for a white Wishmas not only freezes her entire hometown of Sanctuary City, but also threatens the lives of all who live there. Before the magical Wishmas Tree dies, she must undertake a perilous journey into the WILD; battling self-doubt, ghostly predators and ultimately, Extinction itself, to reverse the damage she has caused and save her city.', 'A young possum''s misguided wish for a white Wishmas not only freezes her entire hometown of Sanctuary City, but also threatens the lives of all who live there. Before the magical Wishmas Tree dies, she must undertake a perilous journey into the WILD; battling self-doubt, ghostly predators and ultimately, Extinction itself, to reverse the damage she has caused and save her city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90eStEGcL7tb65UU6ptMaG2PtIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:657561'),
