  ('178348012563000843', 'The Witch', 1954, 'Horror', 'Chano Urueta, Víctor Herrera', null, 'Lilia del Valle, Ramón Gay, Julio Villarreal, Charles Rooner, Fernando Wagner, Luis Aceves Castañeda, José René Ruiz ''Tun-Tun'', Ángel Di Stefani', null, 'Thieves break into a scientist''s laboratory to steal a secret formula, and in the process they kill his daughter. Enraged, he develops a formula that will turn an extremely ugly woman into a spectacular beauty, and then uses the woman to take his revenge on those responsible for his daughter''s murder.', 'Thieves break into a scientist''s laboratory to steal a secret formula, and in the process they kill his daughter. Enraged, he develops a formula that will turn an extremely ugly woman into a spectacular beauty, and then uses the woman to take his revenge on those responsible for his daughter''s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWJFiYFYZLljLbCWIk5a5408AYm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250839'),
