  ('66724292967948099', 'The Witch', 2024, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Erman Bostan, Şafak Ildiz, Nimet Atasoy', 'Erman Bostan', 'Furkan Andıç, Buse Meral, Çağdaş Onur Öztürk, Süreyya Kilimci, Elif Ürse, Manolya Maya, Cengiz Orhonlu, Dilara Duman', null, 'During the period of the collapse of the Ottoman Empire, a woman who reluctantly went to a gloomy Istanbul mansion as a bride, and the mysterious owner of the mansion, will go on a journey to the dark secrets of the past together.', 'During the period of the collapse of the Ottoman Empire, a woman who reluctantly went to a gloomy Istanbul mansion as a bride, and the mysterious owner of the mansion, will go on a journey to the dark secrets of the past together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KeE7l8Lc0ma8ged6DjXaR8Geiz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1250999'),
  ('434048147236271619', 'The Witch Affair', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller', 'José David Gonzalo, José Miguel Juárez, Josetxo San Mateo', 'Agustín Póveda, Amalio Cuevas', 'José Sancho, Manuela Arcuri, Antonio Hortelano, Alberto San Juan, Pilar Bardem, Lidia San José, Jorge Sanz, Aitor Mazo', null, 'The night of San Juan, Miguel murders his associate. Two elderly people are witness to the crime and predict that all of his dreams will come true thereafter. He will know the price he has to pay when he sees a black cat with a moon shaped mark on its forehead. Twenty-two years later a messenger begins to see all his dreams come true...', 'The night of San Juan, Miguel murders his associate. Two elderly people are witness to the crime and predict that all of his dreams will come true thereafter. He will know the price he has to pay when he sees a black cat with a moon shaped mark on its forehead. Twenty-two years later a messenger begins to see all his dreams come true...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pW9lkkv0KEEfV8BRtwlPISAURlr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95980'),
  ('1043333756010744600', 'The Witch Game', 2024, 'Horror', 'Nicolás Gorla, Fabián Forte', 'Fabián Forte', 'Lourdes Mansilla, Ezequiel Rodríguez, Virginia Lombardo, Natalia Grinberg, Alexia Moyano, Martín Borisenko, Sebastián Sinnott, Denise Barbara', null, 'Mara is a teenager who deeply loves everything related to the esoteric arts. On her birthday, she receives a virtual game as a gift that will lead her to live a magical and dangerous experience. Now, after starting the game, Mara must save her sister from the clutches of Satan himself. Anything can happen within the rules of the game, and Mara will have to overcome several obstacles, her own convictions and beliefs, to get her family back.', 'Mara is a teenager who deeply loves everything related to the esoteric arts. On her birthday, she receives a virtual game as a gift that will lead her to live a magical and dangerous experience. Now, after starting the game, Mara must save her sister from the clutches of Satan himself. Anything can happen within the rules of the game, and Mara will have to overcome several obstacles, her own convictions and beliefs, to get her family back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9eOalWeLTQFY52olih7WENULYG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1067833'),
  ('641838234863064025', 'The Witch in the Window', 2018, 'Horror, Drama', 'Andy Mitton, Justin Kane', 'Andy Mitton', 'Arija Bareikis, Greg Naughton, Charlie Tacker, Alex Draper, Carol Stanzione, Zach Jette, Molly Slothower', 'NR', 'When Simon brings his twelve year-old son, Finn, to rural Vermont to help flip an old farmhouse, they encounter the malicious spirit of Lydia, a previous owner. And now with every repair they make – she''s getting stronger.', 'When Simon brings his twelve year-old son, Finn, to rural Vermont to help flip an old farmhouse, they encounter the malicious spirit of Lydia, a previous owner. And now with every repair they make – she''s getting stronger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4T3g4qZw5XDOZtRnjFIJ6ngjYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521934'),
  ('812096664318598140', 'The Witch Suckled Them', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Ezequiel Carrasco, Jaime Salvador', 'Pedro Galindo Aguilar, Pedro de Urdimalas', 'Gaspar Henaine, Marco Antonio Campos, Sonia Furió, Octávio Arias, Yerye Beirute, José Jasso, Armando Arriola, Lupe Carriles', null, 'Brothers Viruta and Capulina inherit, along with their distant cousin Reynaldo, an eerie mansion in which a hidden treasure is located.', 'Brothers Viruta and Capulina inherit, along with their distant cousin Reynaldo, an eerie mansion in which a hidden treasure is located.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99B2wNy4CFBDMl5jysm8wbP8QhO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360183'),
  ('1022205042111080317', 'The Witch Who Came from the Sea', 1976, 'Drama, Horror', 'Dean Cundey, Matt Cimber, Ken Gibb', 'Robert Thom', 'Millie Perkins, Lonny Chapman, Vanessa Brown, Peggy Feury, Jean Pierre Camps, Mark Livingston, Rick Jason, Stafford Morgan', 'R', 'Anger stemming from being abused as a child drives an alcoholic''s daughter to kill as an adult.', 'Anger stemming from being abused as a child drives an alcoholic''s daughter to kill as an adult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rW1ofAyTSnEh3yHzSHXPf7Icd4r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54109'),
  ('361592601121894643', 'The Witch with Flying Head', 1982, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Chang Jen-Chieh, Hsi-chieh Lai', null, 'Hsiu-chen Chen, Liu Shang-Chien, Ma Sha, Ma Chang', null, 'A young woman of considerable social standing receives a curse from a black magician that causes her her head to detach from her body and attack anyone in sight. A good wizard is able to limit the effects of the curse to effect her only on the 15th of each month, but when she falls in love, things get complicated.', 'A young woman of considerable social standing receives a curse from a black magician that causes her her head to detach from her body and attack anyone in sight. A good wizard is able to limit the effects of the curse to effect her only on the 15th of each month, but when she falls in love, things get complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie1XhyJouQltYvE6rJYqaM4QjM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200098'),
  ('443415278449426521', 'The Witch: Part 1. The Subversion', 2018, 'Action, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Teo Lee, Park Hoon-jung, Kim Yeong-ho', 'Park Hoon-jung', 'Kim Da-mi, Cho Min-soo, Park Hee-soon, Choi Woo-shik, Go Min-si, Choi Jung-woo, Oh Mi-hee, Lee Jung-hyoung', null, 'Ja-yoon is a high school student who struggles with memory loss after she endured some unknown trauma during her childhood. While trying to uncover the truth, she is unwittingly dragged into a world of crime and finds herself on a journey that will awaken many secrets hidden deep within.', 'Ja-yoon is a high school student who struggles with memory loss after she endured some unknown trauma during her childhood. While trying to uncover the truth, she is unwittingly dragged into a world of crime and finds herself on a journey that will awaken many secrets hidden deep within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4i2wo2ja5g2PmUxWa1a2eYIboZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530254'),
  ('1058635473794218728', 'The Witch: Part 2. The Other One', 2022, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Kim Yeong-ho, Kim Hong-mok, Jo Yong-Jun', 'Park Hoon-jung', 'Shin Sia, Park Eun-bin, Seo Eun-soo, Jin Goo, Sung Yoo-bin, Justin John Harvey, Cho Min-soo, Cha Soon-bae', null, 'A girl wakes up in a huge secret laboratory, then accidentally meets another girl who is trying to protect her house from a gang. The mystery girl overthrows the gang with her unexpected powers, and laboratory staff set out to find her.', 'A girl wakes up in a huge secret laboratory, then accidentally meets another girl who is trying to protect her house from a gang. The mystery girl overthrows the gang with her unexpected powers, and laboratory staff set out to find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YTuscJXmr9Iua62amCgGSU8PDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615173'),
  ('562782067026181070', 'The Witch. Revenge', 2024, 'Horror, Fantasy, War, Drama', 'Andrii Kolesnyk, Kostiantyn Ponomarov', 'Yaroslav Voytseshek', 'Tetiana Malkova, Taras Tsymbaliuk, Olena Khokhlatkina, Pavlo Vyshniakov, Serhii Sosnovtsev, Ivan Sharan, Artem Sahitov, Mykola Holovchak', null, 'The tale unfolds around an ancient witch from the Ukrainian town of Konotop, who long ago abandoned her extraordinary powers after falling in love with a mortal man. However, tragedy strikes when her beloved is brutally murdered by the russian soldiers as they occupy Konotop in February 2022. Fueled by grief and a thirst for revenge, she reclaims her supernatural abilities, embarking on a blood-soaked quest to mete out justice to her fiancé''s killers.', 'The tale unfolds around an ancient witch from the Ukrainian town of Konotop, who long ago abandoned her extraordinary powers after falling in love with a mortal man. However, tragedy strikes when her beloved is brutally murdered by the russian soldiers as they occupy Konotop in February 2022. Fueled by grief and a thirst for revenge, she reclaims her supernatural abilities, embarking on a blood-soaked quest to mete out justice to her fiancé''s killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Y9BXbNJ5vgIXhKpGpJXxTygngD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1231828'),
  ('20551143739361882', 'The Witch''s Curse', 1962, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Horror', 'Riccardo Freda, Riccardo Pallottini', 'Ennio De Concini, Piero Pierotti, Oreste Biancoli', 'Kirk Morris, Hélène Chanel, Vira Silenti, Andrea Bosic, Charles Fawcett, John Karlsen, Angelo Zanolli, Gina Mascetti', 'NR', 'Maciste travels to Hell to find a witch and make her undo a curse she put on the surface world.', 'Maciste travels to Hell to find a witch and make her undo a curse she put on the surface world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vF1WfNacUiovtiENFhF1YfPPxnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76833'),
  ('1100065759304728441', 'The Witch''s Mirror', 1962, 'Horror', 'Chano Urueta, Américo Fernández, Gustavo César Carrión', 'Alfredo Ruanova, Carlos Enrique Taboada', 'Rosita Arenas, Armando Calvo, Isabela Corona, Dina de Marco, Carlos Nieto, Alfredo Wally Barrón', null, 'A husband murders his wife, and years later her ghost emerges from a witch''s mirror to take her revenge.', 'A husband murders his wife, and years later her ghost emerges from a witch''s mirror to take her revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8y3BIIWCAubg98VD8B0exZTUrf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42993'),
  ('497216855820373930', 'The Witch''s Revenge', 1903, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'Two guards bring a sorcerer into the hall of a palace of the time of the Middle Ages. The king who follows them orders the sorcerer to be chained and to be condemned to death for his practice of witchcraft. He begs the king to permit him just one hour of liberty, assuring the king that he will create, thanks to his power, a charming woman, worthy of becoming the king''s consort. The king, after a moment of hesitation, agrees.', 'Two guards bring a sorcerer into the hall of a palace of the time of the Middle Ages. The king who follows them orders the sorcerer to be chained and to be condemned to death for his practice of witchcraft. He begs the king to permit him just one hour of liberty, assuring the king that he will create, thanks to his power, a charming woman, worthy of becoming the king''s consort. The king, after a moment of hesitation, agrees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eA4yz5hw8NlYLn1HMJhvDA3SfJN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195943'),
  ('855888676063194579', 'The Witcher Bestiary Season 1, Part 1', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The Kikimora’s nightmarish form. The Striga’s craving for human flesh. Delve into the mythologies of some of the many monsters stalking the Continent.', 'The Kikimora’s nightmarish form. The Striga’s craving for human flesh. Delve into the mythologies of some of the many monsters stalking the Continent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zH2qmtWkYoYLk3YXOYH300fcnCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:922154'),
  ('904455855720212067', 'The Witcher Bestiary Season 1, Part 2', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Basilisks, dragons and more beasts haunt the Continent. Explore the mythologies of the mysterious monsters Geralt hunts to earn the coins tossed his way.', 'Basilisks, dragons and more beasts haunt the Continent. Explore the mythologies of the mysterious monsters Geralt hunts to earn the coins tossed his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgzPkfW1osrh7VUMP4UurL5aEwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:922158'),
  ('613048756165864167', 'The Witcher: Nightmare of the Wolf', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Han Kwang Il', 'Beau DeMayo', 'Theo James, Mary McDonnell, Lara Pulver, Graham McTavish, Tom Canton, David Errigo Jr., Jennifer Hale, Kari Wahlgren', 'R', 'Escaping from poverty to become a witcher, Vesemir slays monsters for coin and glory, but when a new menace rises, he must face the demons of his past.', 'Escaping from poverty to become a witcher, Vesemir slays monsters for coin and glory, but when a new menace rises, he must face the demons of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sLz2yv6vBDWqBbd8rdnNeoJ2kJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:666243'),
  ('977326168728766639', 'The Witcher: Sirens of the Deep', 2025, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action', 'Kang Hei Chul', 'Mike Ostrowski, Rae Benjamin', 'Doug Cockle, Joey Batey, Christina Wren, Emily Carey, Camrus Johnson, Simon Templeman, Mallory Jansen, Anya Chalotra', 'R', 'When human sailors are attacked by mysterious creatures of the deep, only one person can stop the war between land and sea: the Witcher, Geralt of Rivia.', 'When human sailors are attacked by mysterious creatures of the deep, only one person can stop the war between land and sea: the Witcher, Geralt of Rivia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0pR5aBVvPn5uncaZjl94ZEnuEF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1203329'),
  ('697622674916408425', 'The Witches', 1966, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Cyril Frankel, Arthur Grant', 'Nigel Kneale', 'Joan Fontaine, Kay Walsh, Alec McCowen, Ann Bell, Ingrid Boulting, John Collin, Michele Dotrice, Gwen Ffrangcon Davies', null, 'Following a nervous breakdown, Gwen takes up the job of head teacher in the small village of Haddaby. There she can benefit from the tranquillity and peace, enabling her to recover fully. But under the facade of idyllic country life she slowly unearths the frightening reality of village life in which the inhabitants are followers of a menacing satanic cult with the power to inflict indiscriminate evil and death if crossed.', 'Following a nervous breakdown, Gwen takes up the job of head teacher in the small village of Haddaby. There she can benefit from the tranquillity and peace, enabling her to recover fully. But under the facade of idyllic country life she slowly unearths the frightening reality of village life in which the inhabitants are followers of a menacing satanic cult with the power to inflict indiscriminate evil and death if crossed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPfBd6Af21hVtSSFPrbfV4nWKCz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40244'),
  ('889478100400973016', 'The Witches', 1967, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Luchino Visconti, Mauro Bolognini, Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Giuseppe Patroni Griffi, Cesare Zavattini, Agenore Incrocci', 'Silvana Mangano, Annie Girardot, Francisco Rabal, Massimo Girotti, Véronique Vendell, Elsa Albani, Clara Calamai, Marilù Tolo', 'NR', 'Five short stories loosely dealing with the roles of women in society. A superstar actress travels to a mountain resort, only to evoke jealousy from women and lust from men. A woman offers to take an injured man to the hospital. A widowed father and his son seek for a new wife/mother. A man seeks revenge for a woman''s honor. A bored housewife tries to explain to her husband that he''s not as romantic as he used to be.', 'Five short stories loosely dealing with the roles of women in society. A superstar actress travels to a mountain resort, only to evoke jealousy from women and lust from men. A woman offers to take an injured man to the hospital. A widowed father and his son seek for a new wife/mother. A man seeks revenge for a woman''s honor. A bored housewife tries to explain to her husband that he''s not as romantic as he used to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ptxCzOW7aqvXKTWV0fxwnZMH8M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36236'),
  ('819597222427843322', 'The Witches', 1990, 'Fantasy, Family, Horror', 'Harvey Harrison, Nicolas Roeg, Callum McDougall', 'Allan Scott', 'Jasen Fisher, Mai Zetterling, Anjelica Huston, Charlie Potter, Rowan Atkinson, Bill Paterson, Brenda Blethyn, Jane Horrocks', 'PG', 'A young boy named Luke and his grandmother go on vacation only to discover their hotel is hosting an international witch convention, where the Grand High Witch is unveiling her master plan to turn all children into mice. Will Luke fall victim to the witches'' plot before he can stop them?', 'A young boy named Luke and his grandmother go on vacation only to discover their hotel is hosting an international witch convention, where the Grand High Witch is unveiling her master plan to turn all children into mice. Will Luke fall victim to the witches'' plot before he can stop them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPYBjVkeHakkPGY7WaKyyNU4RWm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10166'),
  ('1103551877239836339', 'The Witches Attack', 1968, 'Horror, Fantasy, Thriller', 'José Díaz Morales, Eduardo Valdés', 'Rafael García Travesí', 'El Santo, Lorena Velázquez, María Eugenia San Martín, Ramón Bugarini, Fernando Osés, Crox Alvarado, Edaena Ruiz, Guillermo Hernández', null, 'Santo must battle an evil witch and the demons and evil spirits she brings up from Hell.', 'Santo must battle an evil witch and the demons and evil spirits she brings up from Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNzKnRyF3dfLSzRcahXqcaGeXNQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160794'),
  ('222563012958391765', 'The Witches Cave', 1989, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Adventure, Romance', 'Aleksandr Krupnikov, Aleksandr Filatov, Yuriy Moroz', 'Kir Bulychyov', 'Sergey Zhigunov, Marina Levtova, Nikolai Karachentsov, Dmitriy Pevtsov, Igor Yasulovich, Zhanna Prokhorenko, Volodymyr Talashko, Andrey Leonov', null, 'An interstellar expedition is sent to study a strange planet. Despite the fact that creatures from various Earth time periods inhabit the world, the natives possess metal swords, even though they should have no knowledge of such weaponry.', 'An interstellar expedition is sent to study a strange planet. Despite the fact that creatures from various Earth time periods inhabit the world, the natives possess metal swords, even though they should have no knowledge of such weaponry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/705xfXyxpk6WsRsKGeGqROoLpc3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344797'),
  ('295148023876000108', 'The Witches of Breastwick', 2005, 'Fantasy, Romance', 'Jim Wynorski, Franco N. Ciccio, Alexander MacKaye', 'Jim Wynorski', 'Joe Souza, Monique Parent, John Henry Richardson, Glori-Anne Gilbert, Stormy Daniels, Julie K. Smith, Taimie Hannum, Antonia Dorian', null, 'A man and wife are sucked into a whirlpool (in the wife''s case, hot tub) of supernatural sex by a trio of randy, well-endowed witches.', 'A man and wife are sucked into a whirlpool (in the wife''s case, hot tub) of supernatural sex by a trio of randy, well-endowed witches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApQYPoflkVR2gUw9TQBlU1kNyn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28135'),
  ('202782676143196830', 'The Witches of Eastwick', 1987, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'George Miller, Vilmos Zsigmond, Chris Soldo', 'Michael Cristofer', 'Jack Nicholson, Cher, Susan Sarandon, Michelle Pfeiffer, Veronica Cartwright, Richard Jenkins, Keith Jochim, Carel Struycken', 'R', 'Three single women in a picturesque village have their wishes granted, at a cost, when a mysterious and flamboyant man arrives in their lives.', 'Three single women in a picturesque village have their wishes granted, at a cost, when a mysterious and flamboyant man arrives in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5OivnZuXfy5E3BKKFIeSidmwys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6069'),
  ('646970919265414766', 'The Witches of Salem', 1957, 'Drama, History', 'Raymond Rouleau, Claude Renoir', 'Jean-Paul Sartre', 'Simone Signoret, Yves Montand, Mylène Demongeot, Alfred Adam, Jean Debucourt, Raymond Rouleau, Pierre Larquey, Jean Gaven', null, 'Salem 1692. The young Abigail, seduced and abandoned by John Proctor, accuses John''s wife of being a witch in revenge. A series of tragic trials soon befall Salem as fear and suspicion blur the lines of reality.', 'Salem 1692. The young Abigail, seduced and abandoned by John Proctor, accuses John''s wife of being a witch in revenge. A series of tragic trials soon befall Salem as fear and suspicion blur the lines of reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCYBWWitF0pb5pDPUN8ZhR4FC3G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4300'),
  ('660027832107187587', 'The Witches of the Orient', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Julien Faraut, Yutaka Yamazaki', 'Julien Faraut', 'Kinuko Tanida, Yoko Shinozaki, Katsumi Matsumura, Yuriko Handa, Yoshiko Matsumura', null, 'The Japanese volleyball players called the “Oriental Witches” are now in their 70s. From the formation of the team at the factory until their victory at the Tokyo Olympics in 1964, memories and legends rise to the surface and blend inextricably.', 'The Japanese volleyball players called the “Oriental Witches” are now in their 70s. From the formation of the team at the factory until their victory at the Tokyo Olympics in 1964, memories and legends rise to the surface and blend inextricably.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1cEoPOUTPjyH1a5jDLX6ZDvAhG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778665'),
