  ('882386330323377190', 'The Witching of Ben Wagner', 1987, 'Adventure, Family, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Paul Annett, Gordon Lonsdale', 'Malcolm Marmorstein', 'Justin Gocke, Bettina Rae, Sam Bottoms, Harriet Hall, Sylvia Sidney, Elizabeth Shumway, Jamie Ballard, Craig Clyde', 'G', 'A new family moves into town and their son, Ben, meets a mysterious girl named Regina, who is rumoured to be a witch.', 'A new family moves into town and their son, Ben, meets a mysterious girl named Regina, who is rumoured to be a witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCHqpKVXc7LExDWfVKUFJqyWzQh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162934'),
  ('604794657325426426', 'The Witness', 1978, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sergio D''Offizi, Jean-Pierre Mocky', 'Augusto Caminito, Jacques Dreux, Rodolfo Sonego', 'Alberto Sordi, Philippe Noiret, Roland Dubillard, Gisèle Préville, Consuelo Ferrara, Paul Crauchet, Sandra Dobrigna, Gérard Hoffmann', null, 'An Italian painter, Antonio Berti, pays a visit to Reims to his friend Robert Maurisson, a banker with political views on the town hall, who hides, under an affable air and an irreproachable dignity, a libertine and cynical temperament. Charged by the notable with the restoration of paintings exhibited in the cathedral, the artist calls on Cathy, a young girl from the choir, to serve as his model. The young girl will be found dead a few hours after their interview, near one of Robert''s properties.', 'An Italian painter, Antonio Berti, pays a visit to Reims to his friend Robert Maurisson, a banker with political views on the town hall, who hides, under an affable air and an irreproachable dignity, a libertine and cynical temperament. Charged by the notable with the restoration of paintings exhibited in the cathedral, the artist calls on Cathy, a young girl from the choir, to serve as his model. The young girl will be found dead a few hours after their interview, near one of Robert''s properties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnZrUWB8f6tQc1uxjJPbCDJOsU8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81198'),
  ('324618855676916231', 'The Witness', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Péter Bacsó, Dezső Koza, János Zsombolyai', 'Péter Bacsó', 'Ferenc Kállai, Lajos Őze, Zoltán Fábri, Béla Both, Georgette Metzradt, Róbert Rátonyi, Károly Bicskey, Lili Monori', null, 'Hungary, 1950s. József Pelikán, who works as a dam keeper on the Danube, meets by chance Zoltán Dániel, an old friend whom he saved from death years before and who is now a powerful politician.', 'Hungary, 1950s. József Pelikán, who works as a dam keeper on the Danube, meets by chance Zoltán Dániel, an old friend whom he saved from death years before and who is now a powerful politician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1jQxQykZM8wL0OTQ4fYmT9vPyX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40987'),
  ('702482804597039619', 'The Witness', 2015, 'Documentary', 'James Solomon, Trish Govoni', 'William Genovese, Russell Greene, Gabriel Rhodes', 'William Genovese, Shannon Beeby, Kitty Genovese, Catherine Pelonero', null, 'A brother''s journey to unravel the truth about the mythic death and little known life of Kitty Genovese, who was reportedly murdered in front of 38 witnesses and has become the face of urban apathy.', 'A brother''s journey to unravel the truth about the mythic death and little known life of Kitty Genovese, who was reportedly murdered in front of 38 witnesses and has become the face of urban apathy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dtcCLAsIfQaqrjtLoO3qjF3sDK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356332'),
  ('365195364178730980', 'The Witness', 2018, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Cho Kyu-jang, Yu Eok, Kim Jung-woo', 'Cho Kyu-jang, Lee Young-jong', 'Lee Sung-min, Kim Sang-ho, Jin Kyung, Kwak Si-yang, Bae Jung-hwa, Shin Seung-hwan, Jung Yoo-min, Yeon Je-wook', 'R', 'An ordinary man witnesses a cruel murder and becomes entangled in circumstances out of his control.', 'An ordinary man witnesses a cruel murder and becomes entangled in circumstances out of his control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxLYTY9HsnZtscMrKwkSG5PDww4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529569'),
  ('614337450149365112', 'The Witness', 2019, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Junichi Mori', 'Kiyomi Fujii, Junichi Mori', 'Riho Yoshioka, Mahiro Takasugi, Koji Ohkura, Kodai Asaka, Yoshi Sakō, Koya Matsudai, Jun Kunimura, Daichi Watanabe', null, 'Natsume Hamanaka was a police rookie with a promising future until she was in a car crash that killed her brother and took her eyesight. Three years later, she gets around with her seeing-eye dog Pal, but she’s unable to get over her regret and devastation.', 'Natsume Hamanaka was a police rookie with a promising future until she was in a car crash that killed her brother and took her eyesight. Three years later, she gets around with her seeing-eye dog Pal, but she’s unable to get over her regret and devastation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZzoAlGIqVDYVtdoQfpxF59RskK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619173'),
  ('882109829696820815', 'The Witness', 2025, 'Drama', 'Nader Saeivar, Rouzbeh Rayga', 'Jafar Panahi, Nader Saeivar', 'Maryam Boubani, Nader Naderpour, Ghazal Shojaei, Hana Kamkar, Abbas Imani, Farid Eshaghi', null, 'In Iran, the retired dance teacher Tarlan witnesses her friend Rana''s murder by her husband, who is an important government figure. When the police refuse to investigate, Tarlan must decide whether to bow to political pressure or risk her reputation and livelihood in pursuit of justice.', 'In Iran, the retired dance teacher Tarlan witnesses her friend Rana''s murder by her husband, who is an important government figure. When the police refuse to investigate, Tarlan must decide whether to bow to political pressure or risk her reputation and livelihood in pursuit of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qN2bLEdTdYolig7W3tic8GU0Dx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1320414'),
  ('655084363987557372', 'The Witnesses', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'André Téchiné, Julien Hirsch', 'André Téchiné, Laurent Guyot, Viviane Zingg', 'Michel Blanc, Emmanuelle Béart, Sami Bouajila, Julie Depardieu, Johan Libéreau, Lorenzo Balducci, Alain Cauchi, Constance Dollé', null, 'Paris, 1984. A group of friends contend with the first outbreak of the AIDS epidemic.', 'Paris, 1984. A group of friends contend with the first outbreak of the AIDS epidemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QIFx2KuCcoHqzE2tN8lQD3jh3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38282'),
  ('345677475724442137', 'The Wiz', 1978, 'Music, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Sidney Lumet, Oswald Morris, Jack Priestley', 'Joel Schumacher', 'Diana Ross, Michael Jackson, Nipsey Russell, Ted Ross, Mabel King, Theresa Merritt, Thelma Carpenter, Lena Horne', 'G', 'Dorothy Gale, a shy kindergarten teacher, is swept away to the magic land of Oz where she embarks on a quest to return home.', 'Dorothy Gale, a shy kindergarten teacher, is swept away to the magic land of Oz where she embarks on a quest to return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgfB8hBRSwbEb0SK7pt9mW9jsyP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24961'),
  ('169816959474379272', 'The Wiz Live!', 2015, 'TV Movie, Music', 'Kenny Leon, Robin Abraham, Adam Mishler', 'Harvey Fierstein', 'Mary J. Blige, Uzo Aduba, Queen Latifah, Amber Riley, David Alan Grier, Ne-Yo, Common, Shanice Williams', null, 'Winner of 7 Tony Awards, including Best Musical, The Wiz was a massive Broadway hit which spawned a dismal feature film starring Diana Ross and Michael Jackson. Executive Producers Craig Zadan and Neil Meron have assembled a Tony-winning creative team, the imaginative Cirque du Soleil Theatrical and a diverse cast of showstoppers designed to create an eye-popping new take on the musical unlike anything ever seen.', 'Winner of 7 Tony Awards, including Best Musical, The Wiz was a massive Broadway hit which spawned a dismal feature film starring Diana Ross and Michael Jackson. Executive Producers Craig Zadan and Neil Meron have assembled a Tony-winning creative team, the imaginative Cirque du Soleil Theatrical and a diverse cast of showstoppers designed to create an eye-popping new take on the musical unlike anything ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZab0jSfiWpawjg6xqedbkwtFU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353311'),
  ('750483111850695416', 'The Wizard', 1989, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Todd Holland, James M. Halty, Jerry Ketcham', 'David Chisholm', 'Luke Edwards, Vince Trankina, Wendy Phillips, Dea McAllister, Sam McMurray, Beau Bridges, Fred Savage, Christian Slater', 'PG', 'A boy and his brother run away from home and hitch cross-country, with help from a girl they meet, to compete in the ultimate video-game championship.', 'A boy and his brother run away from home and hitch cross-country, with help from a girl they meet, to compete in the ultimate video-game championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtgNNq3TBbpBX6RXHLt5gAMdwPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183'),
  ('947445230882614291', 'The Wizard of Gore', 1970, 'Horror', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis, Allison Louise Downe', 'Allen Kahn', 'Ray Sager, Judy Cler, Wayne Ratay, Phil Laurenson, Jim Rau, Don Alexander, John Elliot, Karin Alexana', 'R', 'A talk show hostess and her boyfriend investigate a shady magician who has the ability to hypnotize and control people''s thoughts in order to stage gory onstage illusions using his powers of mindbending.', 'A talk show hostess and her boyfriend investigate a shady magician who has the ability to hypnotize and control people''s thoughts in order to stage gory onstage illusions using his powers of mindbending.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8zaRJb0e19jrniGoZoWzwCWTQk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23506'),
  ('861746196140225307', 'The Wizard of Gore', 2007, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Jeremy Kasten, Christopher Duddy, Jeff Smith', 'Zach Chassler', 'Kip Pardue, Bijou Phillips, Crispin Glover, Jeffrey Combs, Brad Dourif, Joshua John Miller, Garz Chan, Shannon Hart Cleary', 'R', 'In the darkly phantasmagorical world of the carnival magician and sideshow hypnotist, the gruesome "illusions" of Montag the Magnificent are unique in that they seem to become retroactive reality long after the the tricks are done. Is it coincidence, or circumstantial evidence of the world''s most diabolically ingenious murders? When an underground journalist begins to investigate the strange deaths, the truth proves to be far more bizarre and disturbing than anything he or his readers might have imagined.', 'In the darkly phantasmagorical world of the carnival magician and sideshow hypnotist, the gruesome "illusions" of Montag the Magnificent are unique in that they seem to become retroactive reality long after the the tricks are done. Is it coincidence, or circumstantial evidence of the world''s most diabolically ingenious murders? When an underground journalist begins to investigate the strange deaths, the truth proves to be far more bizarre and disturbing than anything he or his readers might have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qulo6qgqCWGmFcKCsSYc4d4APzF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13903'),
  ('53117176174773192', 'The Wizard of Lies', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Barry Levinson, Eigil Bryld', 'John Burnham Schwartz, Sam Levinson, Samuel Baum', 'Robert De Niro, Michelle Pfeiffer, Hank Azaria, Kristen Connolly, Lily Rabe, Alessandro Nivola, Kathrine Narducci, Nathan Darrow', 'R', 'A look behind the scenes at Bernie Madoff''s massive Ponzi scheme, how it was perpetrated on the public and the trail of destruction it left in its wake, both for the victims and Madoff''s family.', 'A look behind the scenes at Bernie Madoff''s massive Ponzi scheme, how it was perpetrated on the public and the trail of destruction it left in its wake, both for the victims and Madoff''s family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8k4lJ4e0hvDQtKpItXmmPdw69sO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363992'),
  ('897044140012689658', 'The Wizard of Mars', 1965, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'David L. Hewitt, Austin McKinney', 'David L. Hewitt', 'John Carradine, Roger Gentry, Vic McGee, Jerry Rannow, Eve Bernhardt', null, 'In 1974, four astronauts, silver shoe-clad Dorothy, overweight Doc, goofy Charlie, and wooden Steve, crash land on Mars when taking readings, with only four days of supplies. They must try to survive on the surface, which is barren except for some canals with huge maggots with fins. After embarking through a golden igneous cavern, braving a storm and finding an unmanned Earth vessel, they discover a golden road which leads them to the unchanging ruins of what was once a beautiful Martian city. The Martians are modeled on the Flatheads of Oz, and their collective consciousness, the "Wizard," forbids them to leave until they perform a very small task...', 'In 1974, four astronauts, silver shoe-clad Dorothy, overweight Doc, goofy Charlie, and wooden Steve, crash land on Mars when taking readings, with only four days of supplies. They must try to survive on the surface, which is barren except for some canals with huge maggots with fins. After embarking through a golden igneous cavern, braving a storm and finding an unmanned Earth vessel, they discover a golden road which leads them to the unchanging ruins of what was once a beautiful Martian city. The Martians are modeled on the Flatheads of Oz, and their collective consciousness, the "Wizard," forbids them to leave until they perform a very small task...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFIJWeFT9p5hc3BhAA0LwYF31Q4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53442'),
  ('409716240581858331', 'The Wizard of Oz', 1925, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Larry Semon, Leonard Smith, William King', 'Leon Lee, Larry Semon, Frank Joslyn Baum', 'Dorothy Dwan, Mary Carr, Charles Murray, Oliver Hardy, Larry Semon, Virginia Pearson, Bryant Washburn, Josef Swickard', 'NR', 'A farm girl learns she is a princess and is swept away by a tornado to the land of Oz.', 'A farm girl learns she is a princess and is swept away by a tornado to the land of Oz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7bVLGopGoTwmuirB0WZdUc47ns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47508'),
  ('1104944141270156812', 'The Wizard of Oz', 1933, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ted Eshbaugh', 'Frank Joslyn Baum', null, 'NR', 'A storybook opens to depict little Dorothy on the grey Kansas prairies, when suddenly a cyclone comes up, turns her world to color, and she lands on a Scarecrow, who promptly gets up and walks with her. Her dog Toto finds a woodcutter made of tin, so the Scarecrow oils him up and he accompanies them. They watch some animals reproduce before being ushered into the Emerald City by singing suits of armor and a lavish parade of overweight cops before meeting the Wizard, a devious little man who transforms eggs into uncontrollable forms, much to Billina''s dismay.', 'A storybook opens to depict little Dorothy on the grey Kansas prairies, when suddenly a cyclone comes up, turns her world to color, and she lands on a Scarecrow, who promptly gets up and walks with her. Her dog Toto finds a woodcutter made of tin, so the Scarecrow oils him up and he accompanies them. They watch some animals reproduce before being ushered into the Emerald City by singing suits of armor and a lavish parade of overweight cops before meeting the Wizard, a devious little man who transforms eggs into uncontrollable forms, much to Billina''s dismay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kI2VTnfiumP9Du9xoHTKP2c0OCu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62937'),
  ('968321532088282598', 'The Wizard of Oz', 1939, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Victor Fleming, Harold Rosson, Allen M. Davey', 'Florence Ryerson, Edgar Allan Woolf, Noel Langley', 'Judy Garland, Ray Bolger, Jack Haley, Bert Lahr, Frank Morgan, Margaret Hamilton, Billie Burke, Charley Grapewin', 'G', 'Young Dorothy finds herself in a magical world where she makes friends with a lion, a scarecrow and a tin man as they make their way along the yellow brick road to talk with the Wizard and ask for the things they miss most in their lives. The Wicked Witch of the West is the only thing that could stop them.', 'Young Dorothy finds herself in a magical world where she makes friends with a lion, a scarecrow and a tin man as they make their way along the yellow brick road to talk with the Wizard and ask for the things they miss most in their lives. The Wicked Witch of the West is the only thing that could stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCC3j4pV9eOZwzDUWp2ilbcTf1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630'),
  ('294049057529505682', 'The Wizard of Oz', 1982, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, Adventure', 'Fumihiko Takayama, Koji Kobayashi', 'Yoshimitsu Banno, Akira Miyazaki', 'Mari Okamoto, Kazuo Kumakura, Kotobuki Hizuru, Joji Yanami, Masashi Amenomori, Motomu Kiyokawa, Miyoko Aso, Kaori Kishi', 'NR', 'An animated version of the classic story of a young farm-girl who is transported to the magical land of Oz.', 'An animated version of the classic story of a young farm-girl who is transported to the magical land of Oz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2diOj0JNk8hyMh5t3lDwQaw3aDt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222960'),
  ('447665543429710636', 'The Wizard of Speed and Time', 1979, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Music', 'Mike Jittlov', 'Mike Jittlov', 'Mike Jittlov, Toni Handcock', null, 'In the original short film, a young man in a green wizard costume runs throughout America at super speed, much like the superhero The Flash. Along the way, he gives a pretty girl a swift lift to another city, gives golden stars to other women who want a trip themselves. He then slips on a banana peel and comically crashes into a film stage, which he then brings to life in magical ways.', 'In the original short film, a young man in a green wizard costume runs throughout America at super speed, much like the superhero The Flash. Along the way, he gives a pretty girl a swift lift to another city, gives golden stars to other women who want a trip themselves. He then slips on a banana peel and comically crashes into a film stage, which he then brings to life in magical ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niUZ91QDPjDvnyRIvKYJb6cEGUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86527'),
  ('437537678243028676', 'The Wizard of Speed and Time', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy, Adventure', 'Mike Jittlov, Chip Vucelich, Daryl Kass', 'Mike Jittlov', 'Mike Jittlov, Paige Moore, Richard Kaye, Deven Chierighino, John Massari, Philip Michael Thomas, Steve Brodie, Lynda Aldon', 'PG', 'A Hollywood filmmaker (Mike Jittlov) makes a short for an evil film studio. Unbeknownst to him, the producer has placed a bet of $25,000 that he won''t come up with anything with a use. Luckily, our film creator gets the help of his friends.', 'A Hollywood filmmaker (Mike Jittlov) makes a short for an evil film studio. Unbeknownst to him, the producer has placed a bet of $25,000 that he won''t come up with anything with a use. Luckily, our film creator gets the help of his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUEMNVVUJOA9qzbe7P3gbXVjlTR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44276'),
  ('1079573455217085151', 'The Wizard of the Emerald City, Part I', 2025, 'Fantasy, Family, Adventure', 'Mikhail Milashin, Igor Voloshin, Olga Dubovitskaya', 'Konstantin Larchenko', 'Ekaterina Chervova, Yuri Kolokolnikov, Artur Vakha, Svetlana Khodchenkova, Vasilina Makovtseva, Dmitry Chebotarev, Sergey Epishev, Denis Vlasenko', null, 'Ellie lives in a distant city. One day, the evil witch Gingema conjured a hurricane that took Ellie and her dog Totoshka to the country of the Munchkins. To return home, Ellie and her friends the Scarecrow, the Tin Woodman and the Cowardly Lion will set off along the yellow brick road to the Emerald City in search of the Wizard who will grant their cherished wishes.', 'Ellie lives in a distant city. One day, the evil witch Gingema conjured a hurricane that took Ellie and her dog Totoshka to the country of the Munchkins. To return home, Ellie and her friends the Scarecrow, the Tin Woodman and the Cowardly Lion will set off along the yellow brick road to the Emerald City in search of the Wizard who will grant their cherished wishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3aj5s4rOqjMrtYKoNfRy9uJy5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658224'),
  ('903456177350085753', 'The Wizard of the Kremlin', 2026, 'Drama', 'Olivier Assayas, Yorick Le Saux, Antoinette Boulat', 'Olivier Assayas, Emmanuel Carrère', 'Paul Dano, Jude Law, Alicia Vikander, Tom Sturridge, Will Keen, Jeffrey Wright, Andris Keišs, Magne-Håvard Brekke', null, 'Russia, early 1990s. Amid post-Soviet chaos, a brilliant young man, Vadim Baranov, charts his path. First an artist, then a reality TV producer, he becomes the spin doctor to a rising KGB agent: Vladimir Putin. At the heart of power, Baranov shapes the new Russia, blurring the boundaries between truth and lies, belief and manipulation. Only the magnetic Ksenia is beyond his control, tempting him away from this dangerous game. Years later, after retreating into silence and shrouded in mystery, Baranov finally opens up, revealing the dark secrets of the regime he helped build.', 'Russia, early 1990s. Amid post-Soviet chaos, a brilliant young man, Vadim Baranov, charts his path. First an artist, then a reality TV producer, he becomes the spin doctor to a rising KGB agent: Vladimir Putin. At the heart of power, Baranov shapes the new Russia, blurring the boundaries between truth and lies, belief and manipulation. Only the magnetic Ksenia is beyond his control, tempting him away from this dangerous game. Years later, after retreating into silence and shrouded in mystery, Baranov finally opens up, revealing the dark secrets of the regime he helped build.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2jCWxRVSycIJhZbf3XCN7ZrGTS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1291659'),
  ('636896913608061295', 'The Wizard, the Prince and the Good Fairy', 1900, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A prince gets the help of a fairy to aid in his conflict with a wizard.', 'A prince gets the help of a fairy to aid in his conflict with a wizard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyQYXDsRUL31K3J76Hor1qn58D6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106036'),
  ('990193116851226817', 'The Wog Boy', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Aleksi Vellis, Roger Lanser, Nanette Fox', null, 'Nick Giannopoulos, Lucy Bell, Vince Colosimo, Abi Tucker, Geraldine Turner, Stephen Curry, Tony Nikolakopoulos, Costas Kilias', null, 'Steve liked Celia from the moment they met. But following a clash with her boss, Raelene Beagle-Thorpe, Minister for Employment, he finds himself on national television branded as Australia''s biggest dole bludger. Now Steve has to prove to Celia, to himself, and to the whole country, that there''s more to him than meets the eye. With a little help from his friends, he might just do it.', 'Steve liked Celia from the moment they met. But following a clash with her boss, Raelene Beagle-Thorpe, Minister for Employment, he finds himself on national television branded as Australia''s biggest dole bludger. Now Steve has to prove to Celia, to himself, and to the whole country, that there''s more to him than meets the eye. With a little help from his friends, he might just do it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUAyxboNsMmw7crA5XHa3rWUXQ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16874'),
  ('1012222446242195440', 'The Wolberg Family', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Axelle Ropert, Céline Bozon, Julie Gouet', 'Axelle Ropert', 'François Damiens, Valérie Benguigui, Valentin Vigourt, Léopoldine Serre, Guillaume Verdier, Serge Bozon, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Jean-Luc Bideau', null, 'He can deliver a breathtaking speech on the American soul to flabbergasted schoolboys, get mixed up in the private lives of his citizens, and even get his 18-year-old daughter to swear that never, but never, would she leave home. Meet Simon Wolberg, mayor of a small provincial city, madly in love with his wife, an interfering father and provocative son. This man is driven by an obsession with his family. Which leads him to test the force and fragility of these bonds.', 'He can deliver a breathtaking speech on the American soul to flabbergasted schoolboys, get mixed up in the private lives of his citizens, and even get his 18-year-old daughter to swear that never, but never, would she leave home. Meet Simon Wolberg, mayor of a small provincial city, madly in love with his wife, an interfering father and provocative son. This man is driven by an obsession with his family. Which leads him to test the force and fragility of these bonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6n0rHuD1XSOjeQApvRqmyNTmPNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44021'),
  ('466957733697666746', 'The Wold-Shadow', 1972, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'A stand of birches. Sunlight brightens and dims, revealing more or less of the woods. A little grass is on the forest floor. Is there a shape in the shadows? Something green is out of focus. The light flashes, and the screen goes dark from time to time. We look up close at the bark of trees. Is the god of the forest to be seen?', 'A stand of birches. Sunlight brightens and dims, revealing more or less of the woods. A little grass is on the forest floor. Is there a shape in the shadows? Something green is out of focus. The light flashes, and the screen goes dark from time to time. We look up close at the bark of trees. Is the god of the forest to be seen?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xO8w2sur76jFVLcC9ohTEE6fzN0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97517'),
  ('866622612583079168', 'The Wolf and the Lion', 2021, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Gilles de Maistre, Serge Desrosiers', 'Prune de Maistre', 'Molly Kunz, Graham Greene, Charlie Carrick, Derek Johns, Rebecca Croll, Rhys Slack, Evan Buliung, Daniel Brochu', 'PG', 'After her grandfather''s death, 20-year-old Alma decides to go back to her childhood home - a little island in the heart of the majestic Canadian forest. Whilst there, she rescues two helpless cubs: a wolf and a lion. They forge an inseparable bond, but their world soon collapses as the forest ranger discovers the animals and takes them away. The two cub brothers must now embark on a treacherous journey across Canada to be reunited with one another and Alma once more.', 'After her grandfather''s death, 20-year-old Alma decides to go back to her childhood home - a little island in the heart of the majestic Canadian forest. Whilst there, she rescues two helpless cubs: a wolf and a lion. They forge an inseparable bond, but their world soon collapses as the forest ranger discovers the animals and takes them away. The two cub brothers must now embark on a treacherous journey across Canada to be reunited with one another and Alma once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3JsrunysUwsIV9XS7hQtZG4knm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:780382'),
  ('458277129196856052', 'The Wolf at the Door', 1986, 'Drama', 'Henning Carlsen, Mikael Salomon', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Henning Carlsen', 'Donald Sutherland, Max von Sydow, Jean Yanne, Sofie Gråbøl, Valeri Glandut, Ghita Nørby, Merete Voldstedlund, Solbjørg Højfeldt', 'R', 'Chronicling a period of time in Paul Gauguin''s life, this film follows him through his struggles in love and the financial problems caused by the inability to sell his artwork.', 'Chronicling a period of time in Paul Gauguin''s life, this film follows him through his struggles in love and the financial problems caused by the inability to sell his artwork.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzEoUXt33GlpFZyOgsjn7grK6lR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168777'),
  ('494357025366435091', 'The Wolf Hour', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Alistair Banks Griffin, Khalid Mohtaseb', 'Alistair Banks Griffin', 'Naomi Watts, Emory Cohen, Jennifer Ehle, Kelvin Harrison Jr., Jeremy Bobb, Brennan Brown, Justin Clarke, Maritza Veer', null, 'Once a known counterculture figure, June E. Leigh now lives in self-imposed exile in her South Bronx apartment during the incendiary ''77 Summer of Sam. When an unseen tormentor begins exploiting June''s weaknesses, her insular universe begins to unravel.', 'Once a known counterculture figure, June E. Leigh now lives in self-imposed exile in her South Bronx apartment during the incendiary ''77 Summer of Sam. When an unseen tormentor begins exploiting June''s weaknesses, her insular universe begins to unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5SyTpTdc2cWnqHECMvI5lBxuq2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483353'),
  ('677551178581098167', 'The Wolf House', 2018, 'Animation, Horror, Drama', 'Cristóbal León, Joaquín Cociña', 'Cristóbal León, Alejandra Moffat, Joaquín Cociña', 'Amalia Kassai, Rainer Krause, Karina Hyland, Carlos Cociña, Natalia Geisse, Javiera Ramirez', null, 'After escaping from a religious colony in Chile, Maria seeks shelter in a mansion where she’s taken in by two pigs, its only inhabitants. Like in a stop-motion dream, the universe of the house reacts to her feelings. The animals slowly morph into humans and the house into a dark, menacing world.', 'After escaping from a religious colony in Chile, Maria seeks shelter in a mansion where she’s taken in by two pigs, its only inhabitants. Like in a stop-motion dream, the universe of the house reacts to her feelings. The animals slowly morph into humans and the house into a dark, menacing world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvgch2e25cd6dWhRJ6G8BCJ1Wcq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499537'),
  ('1075275541523480718', 'The Wolf Man', 1941, 'Horror, Drama', 'George Waggner, Joseph A. Valentine, Vernon Keays', 'Curt Siodmak', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Claude Rains, Ralph Bellamy, Warren William, Patric Knowles, Bela Lugosi, Maria Ouspenskaya, Evelyn Ankers', 'NR', 'After his brother''s death, Larry Talbot returns home to his father and the family estate. Events soon take a turn for the worse when Larry is bitten by a werewolf.', 'After his brother''s death, Larry Talbot returns home to his father and the family estate. Events soon take a turn for the worse when Larry is bitten by a werewolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyEke5KSZa02l4MAAQsWu7clHrb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13666'),
  ('591172504252469612', 'The Wolf of Snow Hollow', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jim Cummings, Gene Michael Smith, Natalie Kingston', 'Jim Cummings', 'Jim Cummings, Riki Lindhome, Robert Forster, Chloe East, Jimmy Tatro, Marshall Allman, Laura Coover, Jessica Park', 'R', 'Terror grips a small mountain town as bodies are discovered after each full moon. Losing sleep, raising a teenage daughter, and caring for his ailing father, officer Marshall struggles to remind himself there''s no such thing as werewolves.', 'Terror grips a small mountain town as bodies are discovered after each full moon. Losing sleep, raising a teenage daughter, and caring for his ailing father, officer Marshall struggles to remind himself there''s no such thing as werewolves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXeTSXR5ryFwxrlpmD9hhXJTAuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:652004'),
  ('1148067355422473311', 'The Wolf of Wall Street', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Martin Scorsese, Rodrigo Prieto, Francisco Ortiz', 'Terence Winter', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Jonah Hill, Margot Robbie, Matthew McConaughey, Kyle Chandler, Rob Reiner, Jon Bernthal, Jon Favreau', 'R', 'A New York stockbroker refuses to cooperate in a large securities fraud case involving corruption on Wall Street, corporate banking world and mob infiltration. Based on Jordan Belfort''s autobiography.', 'A New York stockbroker refuses to cooperate in a large securities fraud case involving corruption on Wall Street, corporate banking world and mob infiltration. Based on Jordan Belfort''s autobiography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kW9LmvYHAaS9iA0tHmZVq8hQYoq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106646'),
  ('81105559586089003', 'The Wolf Pack', 2019, 'Action, War', 'Burak Akyol', 'Burak Akyol', 'Gökhan Mumcu, Serhan Çeliker, Temmuz Gürkan Karaca, Cem Okyay, Kerem Tanik, Mete Deran, Burak Akbulut, Nazim Atci', null, '"The Wolf Pack" are on a mission to reach Kafr Cenneh. On the way there the 9 commandos must face the enemy which outnumbers them by far.', '"The Wolf Pack" are on a mission to reach Kafr Cenneh. On the way there the 9 commandos must face the enemy which outnumbers them by far.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olDaLipBeKRoQBRqUZSyzpkzzbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662894'),
  ('411089743322980730', 'The Wolf''s Call', 2019, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'Antonin Baudry, Pierre Cottereau, Adrien Ernandez', 'Antonin Baudry', 'François Civil, Omar Sy, Mathieu Kassovitz, Reda Kateb, Paula Beer, Alexis Michalik, Jean-Yves Berteloot, Damien Bonnard', null, 'Shown from the perspective of a young submariner with unusually sensitive hearing and uncannily precise sound recognition. The fate of many often depends on his ability, and one time, whilst highly stressed, he makes a incorrect call which put his entire crew in mortal danger. Trying to regain the confidence of his comrades, he conducts an unauthorised investigation of an apparent plot which, it turns out, risks escalating into a nuclear apocalypse. Suddenly working under pressure with the fleet admiral, they must do whatever is necessary, even the unthinkable, to prevent a nuclear war, since a confirmed nuclear strike order cannot be countermanded.', 'Shown from the perspective of a young submariner with unusually sensitive hearing and uncannily precise sound recognition. The fate of many often depends on his ability, and one time, whilst highly stressed, he makes a incorrect call which put his entire crew in mortal danger. Trying to regain the confidence of his comrades, he conducts an unauthorised investigation of an apparent plot which, it turns out, risks escalating into a nuclear apocalypse. Suddenly working under pressure with the fleet admiral, they must do whatever is necessary, even the unthinkable, to prevent a nuclear war, since a confirmed nuclear strike order cannot be countermanded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bxIzp9w9l9ZzGVwNaIKOaem05A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484468'),
  ('1091207828539230524', 'The Wolfman', 1999, 'Animation, Horror', 'Tim Hope', 'Tim Hope', 'Wean Shepherd', null, 'In the middle of woods inhabited by wolves, an astrologist imagines what it would be like to be a werewolf, running and howling through the woods in a schizophrenic blur instead of sitting in his home watching videos. Then the moon calls to calls to him.', 'In the middle of woods inhabited by wolves, an astrologist imagines what it would be like to be a werewolf, running and howling through the woods in a schizophrenic blur instead of sitting in his home watching videos. Then the moon calls to calls to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92M1KV1fFUcUnlEsnKNJgL93ftS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431796'),
  ('254581057609769010', 'The Wolfman', 2010, 'Horror', 'Joe Johnston, Shelly Johnson, Andy Nicholson', 'Curt Siodmak', 'Benicio del Toro, Anthony Hopkins, Emily Blunt, Hugo Weaving, Geraldine Chaplin, Art Malik, Antony Sher, David Schofield', 'R', 'Lawrence Talbot, an American man on a visit to Victorian London to make amends with his estranged father, gets bitten by a werewolf and, after a moonlight transformation, leaves him with a savage hunger for flesh.', 'Lawrence Talbot, an American man on a visit to Victorian London to make amends with his estranged father, gets bitten by a werewolf and, after a moonlight transformation, leaves him with a savage hunger for flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQqPoAHvHicie1ttuiV2q0yv9V7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7978'),
  ('243617376372039738', 'The Wolfpack', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Crystal Moselle', null, 'Mukunda Angulo, Narayana Angulo, Susanne Angulo, Bhagavan Angulo, Jagadisa Angulo, Krsna Angulo, Oscar Angulo, Visnu Angulo', 'R', 'Locked away from society in an apartment on the Lower East Side of Manhattan, the Angulo brothers learn about the outside world through the films that they watch. Nicknamed ‘The Wolfpack’, the brothers spend their childhood reenacting their favorite films using elaborate home-made props and costumes. Their world is shaken up when one of the brothers escapes and everything changes.', 'Locked away from society in an apartment on the Lower East Side of Manhattan, the Angulo brothers learn about the outside world through the films that they watch. Nicknamed ‘The Wolfpack’, the brothers spend their childhood reenacting their favorite films using elaborate home-made props and costumes. Their world is shaken up when one of the brothers escapes and everything changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gr0hihtD5wxvsH8N4HB66XKfnAo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307931'),
  ('287704725452817331', 'The Wolverine', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Ross Emery, James Mangold, Tom Meade', 'Mark Bomback, Scott Frank', 'Hugh Jackman, Hiroyuki Sanada, Tao Okamoto, Rila Fukushima, Famke Janssen, Will Yun Lee, Svetlana Khodchenkova, Hal Yamanouchi', 'PG-13', 'Wolverine faces his ultimate nemesis - and tests of his physical, emotional, and mortal limits - in a life-changing voyage to modern-day Japan.', 'Wolverine faces his ultimate nemesis - and tests of his physical, emotional, and mortal limits - in a life-changing voyage to modern-day Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2wVAcoRlKvEIVSbiYDb8d0QqqS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76170'),
  ('219619482155416990', 'The Wolves', 1971, 'Crime, Drama', 'Hideo Gosha, Kōzō Okazaki', 'Hideo Gosha, Kei Tasaka', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Noboru Andō, Komaki Kurihara, Kyōko Enami, Toshio Kurosawa, Isao Natsuyagi, Kunie Tanaka, Hiroshi Tanaka', 'NR', 'After going to prison for killing the boss of the Kanno gang, Seji Iwahashi gets released early -- only to find that his former gang has merged with the Kannos. But with bitter resentments lingering on both sides, how long will it be before the bloodshed begins anew?', 'After going to prison for killing the boss of the Kanno gang, Seji Iwahashi gets released early -- only to find that his former gang has merged with the Kannos. But with bitter resentments lingering on both sides, how long will it be before the bloodshed begins anew?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLH0YA4BMOnDxtE9q1jfTHU8tbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40956'),
  ('370164402766792168', 'The Wolves', 2020, 'Drama, Family', 'Samuel Kishi, Octavio Arauz', 'Sofía Gómez Córdova, Luis Briones, Samuel Kishi', 'Martha Reyes Arias, Leonardo Nájar Márquez, Maximiliano Nájar Márquez, Cici Lau, Celine R. Lopez, Robert Louder, Kevin Medina, Johnson T. Lau', null, 'Max and Leo are 8 and 5 years old and have just immigrated to the US with their mother. Their days pass inside a tiny apartment, while they wait for their mother to come back, as they hold on to the hope of traveling to Disney.', 'Max and Leo are 8 and 5 years old and have just immigrated to the US with their mother. Their days pass inside a tiny apartment, while they wait for their mother to come back, as they hold on to the hope of traveling to Disney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XRbBZXuTHD01SkUqwM42KbLul4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586351'),
  ('636651914130839001', 'The Wolves of Kromer', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Will Gould, Laura Remacha, Matthew Read', 'Charles Lambert', 'James Layton, Lee Williams, Rita Davies, Margaret Towner, Kevin Moore, Rosemarie Dunham, David Prescott, Angharad Rees', null, 'Once upon a time in the village of Kromer lived two beautiful young wolves. Cocksure Gabriel takes newcomer Seth under his paw and helps reconcile him to the vilification associated with being a wolf. They fall head-over-heels in puppy love, playing together around picturesque waterfalls, secluded woodlands, and moonlit lakes. One day a wicked old crone and her goofy sidekick kill their mistress, frame the wolves, and incite a torch-bearing mob of religious zealots to seek vengeance on the hapless pair. But who will live happily ever after?', 'Once upon a time in the village of Kromer lived two beautiful young wolves. Cocksure Gabriel takes newcomer Seth under his paw and helps reconcile him to the vilification associated with being a wolf. They fall head-over-heels in puppy love, playing together around picturesque waterfalls, secluded woodlands, and moonlit lakes. One day a wicked old crone and her goofy sidekick kill their mistress, frame the wolves, and incite a torch-bearing mob of religious zealots to seek vengeance on the hapless pair. But who will live happily ever after?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqRAQlvt9t2sccFIbKmcl1QY0CR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44295'),
  ('153761037919951422', 'The Wolves of Willoughby Chase', 1989, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Stuart Orme, Mirek Lux, Ken Shane', 'William M. Akers', 'Stephanie Beacham, Mel Smith, Emily Hudson, Aleks Darowska, Geraldine James, Richard O''Brien, Jane Horrocks, Rebecca Callard', null, 'A Dickensian mock-Gothic tale of resourceful children, evil governesses, forged wills, cruel orphanages, and goodness triumphant set against an isolated country house, in an alternate 19th century where savage packs of wolves roam the snowbound countryside.', 'A Dickensian mock-Gothic tale of resourceful children, evil governesses, forged wills, cruel orphanages, and goodness triumphant set against an isolated country house, in an alternate 19th century where savage packs of wolves roam the snowbound countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKEQOo61su0vulEp7xlL2gMoKsc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70831'),
