  ('1042077869567504892', 'The Woman in the Line', 2025, 'Drama', 'Benjamín Ávila, Sergio Armstrong, María Laura Berch', 'Marcelo Müller, Benjamín Ávila', 'Natalia Oreiro, Amparo Noguera, Alberto Ammann, Federico Heinrich, Marcela Acuña, Juan Pedro Rodríguez Isturiz, Julieta Rodríguez Isturiz, Lide Uranga', null, 'Andrea visits her incarcerated son for the first time. Initially eyed with suspicion by other women in line, she gradually gains their trust — and emerges as a powerful advocate for justice reform.', 'Andrea visits her incarcerated son for the first time. Initially eyed with suspicion by other women in line, she gradually gains their trust — and emerges as a powerful advocate for justice reform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1PPU08b3ltuVhL7Dd5A8TMMR7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1193861'),
