  ('1119819963146389765', 'The Woman Who Drinks', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bernard Émond, Jean-Claude Labrecque', 'Bernard Émond', 'Élise Guilbault, Luc Picard, Michel Forget, Fanny Mallette, Laurent Lacoursière, Gilles Renaud, Lise Castonguay, Alexandrine Agostini', null, 'On the eve of her final moments, a woman recalls her alcoholic past. She revisits her entire youth, including a binge that, at 46, cost her everything she had: "Loneliness and aging are themes that impose themselves on me, in one form or another. As for alcoholism, it fascinates me because of the revolt it underpins, and revolts me because of the unhappiness it creates around itself.', 'On the eve of her final moments, a woman recalls her alcoholic past. She revisits her entire youth, including a binge that, at 46, cost her everything she had: "Loneliness and aging are themes that impose themselves on me, in one form or another. As for alcoholism, it fascinates me because of the revolt it underpins, and revolts me because of the unhappiness it creates around itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uplbdptCEi47rFOyzAYJnR1jAKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85883'),
  ('140100634214635276', 'The Woman Who Invented Love', 1980, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean Garrett, Carlos Reichenbach, Mário Vaz Filho', 'João Silvério Trevisan', 'Aldine Müller, Zécarlos de Andrade, Rodolfo Arena, Lola Brah, Osly Delano, Roberto Miranda, Jairo Ferreira, Paulo Leite', null, 'Doralice is a simple minded woman romantically fascinated by marriage. However, when she is raped by a butcher, a friend advises her to become a prostitute - and she does it. After that, all her wishes and longings will curl up into a fascinating vortex.', 'Doralice is a simple minded woman romantically fascinated by marriage. However, when she is raped by a butcher, a friend advises her to become a prostitute - and she does it. After that, all her wishes and longings will curl up into a fascinating vortex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVPk5dKItsccoNl106ZaXkWVfEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195015'),
