  ('531573980117726109', 'The Women of Niskavuori', 1938, 'Drama, Romance', 'Valentin Vaala, Armas Hirvonen', 'Jaakko Huttunen, Orvo Saarikivi', 'Olga Tainio, Sirkka Sari, Tauno Palo, Irja Elstelä, Aino Lohikoski, Elli Ylimaa, Anni Hämäläinen, Ossi Elstelä', null, 'Aarne marries Martta because his mother tells him it is his duty as the eldest son to marry a wealthy girl. However, the attractive school teacher Ilona arrives in the village and causes complications when Aarne falls in love with her.', 'Aarne marries Martta because his mother tells him it is his duty as the eldest son to marry a wealthy girl. However, the attractive school teacher Ilona arrives in the village and causes complications when Aarne falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7Ryq0uWG5fzKNK7SacfhF6AKpZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439270'),
  ('1148957674628255229', 'The Women of Quiet Country', 1980, 'Drama', 'Claudio Giorgi', 'Giancarlo Corsoni, Mario Sigmund, Nicola Fiore', 'Silvia Dionisio, Philippe Leroy, Serena Grandi, Rossana Podestà, Christian Borromeo, Carmen Scarpitta, Germana Savo, Silvano Tranquilli', null, 'In the late thirties of Italy, In the background of peaceful village landscapes, Guido requires unquestioning obedience to his will in his house. Alberto dreams of breaking free from the dictatorial care.', 'In the late thirties of Italy, In the background of peaceful village landscapes, Guido requires unquestioning obedience to his will in his house. Alberto dreams of breaking free from the dictatorial care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjrWIdw9F2sh2aznX92VgMvheXK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332291'),
  ('43878093889712437', 'The Women on the 6th Floor', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Le Guay, Jean-Claude Larrieu', 'Philippe Le Guay, Jérôme Tonnerre', 'Fabrice Luchini, Sandrine Kiberlain, Natalia Verbeke, Carmen Maura, Lola Dueñas, Berta Ojea, Concha Galán, Marie-Armelle Deguy', null, 'Paris, in the early 1960s. Jean-Louis Joubert is a serious but uptight stockbroker, married to Suzanne, a starchy class-conscious woman and father of two arrogant teenage boys, currently in a boarding school. The affluent man lives a steady yet boring life. At least until, due to fortuitous circumstances, Maria, the charming new maid at the service of Jean-Louis'' family, makes him discover the servants'' quarter on the sixth floor of the luxury building he owns and lives in. There live a crowd of lively Spanish maids who will help Jean-Louis to open to a new civilization and a new approach of life. In their company - and more precisely in the company of beautiful Maria - Jean-Louis will gradually become another man, a better man.', 'Paris, in the early 1960s. Jean-Louis Joubert is a serious but uptight stockbroker, married to Suzanne, a starchy class-conscious woman and father of two arrogant teenage boys, currently in a boarding school. The affluent man lives a steady yet boring life. At least until, due to fortuitous circumstances, Maria, the charming new maid at the service of Jean-Louis'' family, makes him discover the servants'' quarter on the sixth floor of the luxury building he owns and lives in. There live a crowd of lively Spanish maids who will help Jean-Louis to open to a new civilization and a new approach of life. In their company - and more precisely in the company of beautiful Maria - Jean-Louis will gradually become another man, a better man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88875SqNHpwslXXa5WtDA3VnOvn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57243'),
  ('864988655371772932', 'The Women on the Roof', 1989, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jörgen Persson, Ulf Brantås, Carl-Gustav Nykvist', 'Carl-Gustav Nykvist, Lasse Summanen', 'Amanda Ooms, Helena Bergström, Stellan Skarsgård, Percy Brandt, Lars Ori Bäckström, Katarina Olsson, Leif Andrée, Stig Ossian Ericson', null, 'An innocent and beautiful girl, Linnea rents an apartment in Stockholm just before WWI. As she works for an old man who owns a photography studio she meets Anna, a photographer with whom she develops a complex friendship. Anna’s circus-performer boyfriend and European politics complicate Linnea’s routine.', 'An innocent and beautiful girl, Linnea rents an apartment in Stockholm just before WWI. As she works for an old man who owns a photography studio she meets Anna, a photographer with whom she develops a complex friendship. Anna’s circus-performer boyfriend and European politics complicate Linnea’s routine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99947SQgPzQAd294DuQEleTeg5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162818'),
  ('470869882029277417', 'The Wonder', 1922, 'Animation', 'Walter Ruttmann', null, null, null, 'An advertisement for Kantorowicz-Liköre, wherein our protagonists suffer no ill effects whatsoever from consuming alcohol.', 'An advertisement for Kantorowicz-Liköre, wherein our protagonists suffer no ill effects whatsoever from consuming alcohol.', null, 'tmdb:movie:175513'),
  ('965281446469489299', 'The Wonder', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime', 'David Pagan Mariñez', 'José Ramón Alama', 'Julitza Berberena, Frank Perozo, Pio La Ditingancia, Fausto Mata, Brashell Santos, Cheddy García, Yasser Michelén, Angelique Burgos', null, 'Plunged into financial difficulties and in the midst of divorce, the Garibaldi family inherits the beautiful but dilapidated La Maravilla building, where not everything is as it seems.', 'Plunged into financial difficulties and in the midst of divorce, the Garibaldi family inherits the beautiful but dilapidated La Maravilla building, where not everything is as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIRia9ZqoGbzNRlJujsxnvg4mXW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626874'),
  ('371685816413316080', 'The Wonder', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Sebastián Lelio, Ari Wegner, Burschi Wojnar', 'Alice Birch, Sebastián Lelio, Emma Donoghue', 'Florence Pugh, Kíla Lord Cassidy, Tom Burke, Niamh Algar, Elaine Cassidy, Ruth Bradley, Toby Jones, Ciarán Hinds', 'R', 'Haunted by her past, a nurse travels from England to a remote Irish village in 1862 to investigate a young girl''s supposedly miraculous fast.', 'Haunted by her past, a nurse travels from England to a remote Irish village in 1862 to investigate a young girl''s supposedly miraculous fast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZvZgA7IkDX78UilzqBGh0QTQvC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823766'),
  ('171737835009463153', 'The Wonder Weeks', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Appie Boudellah, Aram van de Rest', 'Appie Boudellah, Mustafa Boudellah, Maikel Nijnuis', 'Sallie Harmsen, Yolanthe Cabau, Sarah Chronis, Louis Talpe, Soy Kroon, Iliass Ojja, Bertrie Wierenga', 'R', 'Three modern couples juggle relationships and demanding careers while navigating the unpredictable terrain of parenthood.', 'Three modern couples juggle relationships and demanding careers while navigating the unpredictable terrain of parenthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blGdfZPiv4CXViqbfXNcWiplABz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1126844'),
  ('11636927784078987', 'The Wonderers', 2025, 'Drama', 'Joséphine Japy, Damien Grégoire, Romain Carcanade', 'Joséphine Japy, Olivier Torres', 'Mélanie Laurent, Pierre-Yves Cardinal, Sarah Pachoud, Angelina Woreth, Félix Kysyl, Stéphane Varupenne, Anne Loiret, Thomas Gioria', null, 'Set against the backdrop of a summer on the French riviera, the Roussier family and its fragile equilibrium is shaped by the uncertain diagnosis of 13-year-old Bertille, who suffers from a severe disability. Her parents and older sister Marion live in constant fear of losing her. Disconnected from typical teenage dreams, Marion seeks escape in a relationship with an older boy. When a new diagnosis emerges, the family’s future is redefined, opening up unexpected possibilities. Bertille will live, and so will her family.', 'Set against the backdrop of a summer on the French riviera, the Roussier family and its fragile equilibrium is shaped by the uncertain diagnosis of 13-year-old Bertille, who suffers from a severe disability. Her parents and older sister Marion live in constant fear of losing her. Disconnected from typical teenage dreams, Marion seeks escape in a relationship with an older boy. When a new diagnosis emerges, the family’s future is redefined, opening up unexpected possibilities. Bertille will live, and so will her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huHLA5j9hd0cOSsTBQo8ti8FLQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1308618'),
  ('352924025275499238', 'The Wonderful Autumn of Mickey Mouse', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'William Reiss, Karl Hadrika, Eddie Trigueros', 'Jason Reicher, William Reiss, Karl Hadrika', 'Chris Diamantopoulos, Kaitlyn Robrock, Bill Farmer, Tony Anselmo, Tress MacNeille, Jeff Bennett, Paul Rudish, Fred Tatasciore', 'G', 'In a leafy hamlet, Mickey Mouse is determined to undo the failures of his family’s past after inheriting a rundown pumpkin farm from a distant relative, and the epic legend of its futility.', 'In a leafy hamlet, Mickey Mouse is determined to undo the failures of his family’s past after inheriting a rundown pumpkin farm from a distant relative, and the epic legend of its futility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrkEy57ZMm28MinRXoM93SI7CWq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1031827'),
  ('490230095633821318', 'The Wonderful Country', 1959, 'Western', 'Robert Parrish, Floyd Crosby, Alex Phillips', 'Walter Bernstein, Robert Ardrey', 'Robert Mitchum, Julie London, Gary Merrill, Albert Dekker, Pedro Armendáriz, Jack Oakie, Charles McGraw, Anthony Caruso', 'NR', 'Having fled to Mexico from the U.S. many years ago for killing his father''s murderer, Martin Brady travels to Texas to broker an arms deal for his Mexican boss, strongman Governor Cipriano Castro. Brady breaks a leg and while recuperating in Texas the gun shipment is stolen. Complicating matters further the wife of local army major Colton has designs on him, and the local Texas Ranger captain makes him a generous offer to come back to the states and join his outfit. After killing a man in self-defense, Brady slips back over the border and confronts Castro who is not only unhappy that Brady has lost his gun shipment but is about to join forces with Colton to battle the local raiding Apache Indians.', 'Having fled to Mexico from the U.S. many years ago for killing his father''s murderer, Martin Brady travels to Texas to broker an arms deal for his Mexican boss, strongman Governor Cipriano Castro. Brady breaks a leg and while recuperating in Texas the gun shipment is stolen. Complicating matters further the wife of local army major Colton has designs on him, and the local Texas Ranger captain makes him a generous offer to come back to the states and join his outfit. After killing a man in self-defense, Brady slips back over the border and confronts Castro who is not only unhappy that Brady has lost his gun shipment but is about to join forces with Colton to battle the local raiding Apache Indians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nS12kvSCEEp6SCi3TU6Hk5bRjo2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6610'),
  ('202553038297993302', 'The Wonderful Crook', 1975, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Renato Berta, Claude Goretta', 'Charlotte Dubreuil, Claude Goretta', 'Gérard Depardieu, Marlène Jobert, Dominique Labourier, Jacques Debary, Philippe Léotard, Michel Pilorgé, Roland Amstutz, Michel Robin', null, 'A manufacturer of furniture sees his business go down and decides to rob banks to pay his staff. Het gets romantically involved with one of his victims.', 'A manufacturer of furniture sees his business go down and decides to rob banks to pay his staff. Het gets romantically involved with one of his victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaXPGYFRb5bXB0LCRdjnoywStpb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4146'),
  ('297420755588032281', 'The Wonderful Horrible Life of Leni Riefenstahl', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Ray Müller', 'Ray Müller', 'Leni Riefenstahl, Walter Frentz, Horst Kettner, Ray Müller, Luis Trenker, Guzzi Lantschner', null, 'This documentary recounts the life and work of one of most famous, and yet reviled, German film directors in history, Leni Riefenstahl. The film recounts the rise of her career from a dancer, to a movie actor to the most important film director in Nazi Germany who directed such famous propaganda films as Triumph of the Will and Olympiad. The film also explores her later activities after Nazi Germany''s defeat in 1945 and her disgrace for being so associated with it which includes her amazingly active life over the age of 90.', 'This documentary recounts the life and work of one of most famous, and yet reviled, German film directors in history, Leni Riefenstahl. The film recounts the rise of her career from a dancer, to a movie actor to the most important film director in Nazi Germany who directed such famous propaganda films as Triumph of the Will and Olympiad. The film also explores her later activities after Nazi Germany''s defeat in 1945 and her disgrace for being so associated with it which includes her amazingly active life over the age of 90.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZnBH4ZJnHcVFgeuK81w2tcHvRD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41647'),
  ('988283227154709963', 'The Wonderful Ice Cream Suit', 1998, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Stuart Gordon, Mac Ahlberg', null, 'Edward James Olmos, Joe Mantegna, Esai Morales, Clifton Collins Jr., Gregory Sierra, Sid Caesar, Howard Morris, Liz Torres', 'PG', 'Gomez is a middle-aged man who dreams of buying a gorgeous white suit in a nearby store, but doesn''t have enough cash. He finds 4 more people of same size, who each give $20 and get to wear the suit for an hour each in return. But the suit is not just a suit - it makes wishes of the one wearing it come true.', 'Gomez is a middle-aged man who dreams of buying a gorgeous white suit in a nearby store, but doesn''t have enough cash. He finds 4 more people of same size, who each give $20 and get to wear the suit for an hour each in return. But the suit is not just a suit - it makes wishes of the one wearing it come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfK969gzWU0aAAgDgM4njohOz3D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101363'),
  ('84440076000047191', 'The Wonderful Land of Oz', 1969, 'Fantasy, Music, Family', 'Barry Mahon, Barry Mahon', 'Barry Mahon', 'Chan Mahon, Allen Joseph, George Wadsworth, Michael R. Thomas, Gil Fields, Zisca Baum, Caroline Berner, Hilary Lee Gaess', 'NR', 'After his witch guardian threatens to turn him into a statue, young Tip runs off to Emerald City with his newly-animated companion, Jack. Along the way, he meets up with Genral Jinjur, leader of the Army of Revolt, who takes Tip prisoner as she marches her troops to take over the Emerald City.', 'After his witch guardian threatens to turn him into a statue, young Tip runs off to Emerald City with his newly-animated companion, Jack. Along the way, he meets up with Genral Jinjur, leader of the Army of Revolt, who takes Tip prisoner as she marches her troops to take over the Emerald City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8jhwNP28cL5ayl11JIbsKBnHq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126488'),
  ('626135541014574917', 'The Wonderful Living Fan', 1904, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'As a conjurer awaits an audience, a procession announces the arrival of a royal representative, carried in a sedan chair, to see him. The conjurer then has a large box brought in. It is opened, revealing a very large folding fan. When the fan is spread out, the designs on it begin to change and move. And this is far from the last of the surprises that the conjurer has in store.', 'As a conjurer awaits an audience, a procession announces the arrival of a royal representative, carried in a sedan chair, to see him. The conjurer then has a large box brought in. It is opened, revealing a very large folding fan. When the fan is spread out, the designs on it begin to change and move. And this is far from the last of the surprises that the conjurer has in store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azdaOzxHy2dJsb7vO7mRI7JMXvX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188069'),
  ('1145863637720099906', 'The Wonderful Story of Henry Sugar', 2023, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Drama', 'Kevin Timon Hill, Adam Somner, Martin Scali', 'Roald Dahl, Wes Anderson', 'Ralph Fiennes, Benedict Cumberbatch, Dev Patel, Ben Kingsley, Richard Ayoade, Jarvis Cocker, Rebecca Cornford, David Gant', 'PG', 'A rich man learns about a guru who can see without using his eyes. He sets out to master the skill in order to cheat at gambling.', 'A rich man learns about a guru who can see without using his eyes. He sets out to master the skill in order to cheat at gambling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDUywEHwHh6nsLnVXAdPN9m4ZUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:923939'),
  ('586138829693877791', 'The Wonderful Summer of Mickey Mouse', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Eddie Trigueros, Jason Reicher, Karl Hadrika', 'Paul Rudish, Eddie Trigueros, Darrick Bachman', 'Chris Diamantopoulos, Kaitlyn Robrock, Bill Farmer, Tony Anselmo, Tress MacNeille, Corey Burton, John Kassir, Paul Rudish', 'G', 'Mickey Mouse and his friends each recall the wild events leading up to the Annual Summer Fireworks Spectacular from their point-of-view.', 'Mickey Mouse and his friends each recall the wild events leading up to the Annual Summer Fireworks Spectacular from their point-of-view.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sdmCWZlLwFF4GbohSQxlD24g6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987337'),
  ('488970183726664244', 'The Wonderful Winter of Mickey Mouse', 2022, 'Animation', 'Eddie Trigueros, Ryan Gillis, William Reiss', 'Darrick Bachman, Stevie Borbolla, Ryan Gillis', 'Chris Diamantopoulos, Kaitlyn Robrock, Bill Farmer, Tony Anselmo, Craig Robinson, Antonia Thomas', 'G', 'The wonder of the winter season takes Mickey Mouse and his friends on a journey through three magical stories.', 'The wonder of the winter season takes Mickey Mouse and his friends on a journey through three magical stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dspgMFx64kA8BqkGZQK6Hk1sCV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939336'),
  ('231420729599803904', 'The Wonderful Wizard of Oz', 1910, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Otis Turner', 'Otis Turner', 'Hobart Bosworth, Eugenie Besserer, Robert Z. Leonard, Bebe Daniels, Winifred Greenwood, Lillian Leighton, Olive Cox, Alvin Wyckoff', 'NR', 'An early version of the classic, based more on the 1902 stage musical than on the original novel.', 'An early version of the classic, based more on the 1902 stage musical than on the original novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axF2YapTvgJP5fRhdL1sFdSPPOh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53759'),
  ('829253754735006540', 'The Wonderful Wizard of Oz: The Making of a Movie Classic', 1990, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Jack Haley Jr.', 'Jack Haley Jr., Stanley Ralph Ross, Aljean Harmetz', 'Angela Lansbury, Judy Garland, Ray Bolger, Bert Lahr, Jack Haley, Margaret Hamilton, Frank Morgan, Billie Burke', null, 'Documentary about the making of the 1939 MGM classic film The Wizard of Oz. Includes interviews of cast and crew members, their families and fans of the film.', 'Documentary about the making of the 1939 MGM classic film The Wizard of Oz. Includes interviews of cast and crew members, their families and fans of the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hIxPbp9lg6RI9mdYsj3ikKPwst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334629'),
  ('32444876213919084', 'The Wonderful World of Mickey Mouse: Steamboat Silly', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Eddie Trigueros, Clint Eland, Tyler Platt', 'Paul Rudish, Eddie Trigueros, Darrick Bachman', 'Chris Diamantopoulos, Tony Anselmo, Jim Cummings, Bill Farmer, Tress MacNeille, Kaitlyn Robrock', 'G', 'Mickey and gang must stop hundreds of old film reel versions of Mickey from wreaking havoc all over town.', 'Mickey and gang must stop hundreds of old film reel versions of Mickey from wreaking havoc all over town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9VIIks5Mw3mjWStOj7FvIOGtmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1139979'),
  ('1078394009708080665', 'The Wonderful World of Puss ''n Boots', 1969, 'Family, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Animation', 'Kimio Yabuki, Yasuji Mori', 'Hisashi Inoue, Morihisa Yamamoto', 'Susumu Ishikawa, Toshiko Fujita, Rumi Sakakibara, Asao Koike, Kin''ya Aikawa, Isamu Tanonaka, Ado Mizumori, Kazuo Kumakura', null, 'His goal is to help the weak and defenseless, but his saving a mouse makes him the most wanted in all the land. On the run from incessant, dim-witted mice, Perro befriends a young miller''s boy, Pierre; together, they decide to seek fame and fortune. When they cross paths with the lovely Princess Rosa, Perro determines to get Pierre hitched to Her Royal Highness.', 'His goal is to help the weak and defenseless, but his saving a mouse makes him the most wanted in all the land. On the run from incessant, dim-witted mice, Perro befriends a young miller''s boy, Pierre; together, they decide to seek fame and fortune. When they cross paths with the lovely Princess Rosa, Perro determines to get Pierre hitched to Her Royal Highness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TM68raRJOgfdyrlmToIjh8lHRs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58704'),
  ('34927389679865257', 'The Wonderful World of the Brothers Grimm', 1962, 'Fantasy, Family, Music, Comedy', 'Al Jennings, George Pal, Henry Levin', 'David P. Harmon, Charles Beaumont, William Roberts', 'Laurence Harvey, Karlheinz Böhm, Claire Bloom, Walter Slezak, Barbara Eden, Oskar Homolka, Arnold Stang, Martita Hunt', 'G', 'The Grimm brothers Wilhelm and Jacob, known for their literary works in the nineteenth century, have their lives dramatized. Wilhelm fights to write something entertaining amongst the sea of dry, non-fiction books they write and he sets about collecting oral-tradition fairy tales to put into print. Their life story is countered with reenactments of three of their stories including "The Dancing Princess," "The Cobbler and the Elves" and "The Singing Bone."', 'The Grimm brothers Wilhelm and Jacob, known for their literary works in the nineteenth century, have their lives dramatized. Wilhelm fights to write something entertaining amongst the sea of dry, non-fiction books they write and he sets about collecting oral-tradition fairy tales to put into print. Their life story is countered with reenactments of three of their stories including "The Dancing Princess," "The Cobbler and the Elves" and "The Singing Bone."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zElwCWdMG7A6xThgesRxNrgD2MP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28367'),
  ('331502958869781829', 'The Wonderful Years That Sucked', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Petr Nikolaev, Hana Hanušová, Alice Kulhánková Ronovská', 'Jan Novák', 'Ondřej Vetchý, Libuše Šafránková, Vladimír Javorský, Jan Zahálka, Jakub Wehrenberg, Klára Botková, Jitka Ježková, Vladimír Dlouhý', null, 'Capturing the dark humor of Czech author Michal Viewegh''s chronicle of life after the Velvet Revolution, this black comedy chronicles three decades in the life of a small Czech family. While the original novel centered on the protagonist Kvido from his conception through his adulthood, first time director Petr Nikolaev and screenwriter Jan Novak changed the focus to his parents Milena, an extremely self-effacing lawyer who acts on stage in her spare time, and Ales, a rather aimless government worker who tends to drift wherever the wind takes him. The lives of Ales and Milena change dramatically following the Russian invasion of Prague in 1968.', 'Capturing the dark humor of Czech author Michal Viewegh''s chronicle of life after the Velvet Revolution, this black comedy chronicles three decades in the life of a small Czech family. While the original novel centered on the protagonist Kvido from his conception through his adulthood, first time director Petr Nikolaev and screenwriter Jan Novak changed the focus to his parents Milena, an extremely self-effacing lawyer who acts on stage in her spare time, and Ales, a rather aimless government worker who tends to drift wherever the wind takes him. The lives of Ales and Milena change dramatically following the Russian invasion of Prague in 1968.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qh5zZAWA1nxy9KLS3Ub4vBQ38xH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63588'),
  ('174410185571789352', 'The Wonderland', 2019, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Takayuki Uragami, Naoki Kobayashi, Tomohisa Shimoyama', 'Miho Maruo', 'Mayu Matsuoka, Anne Watanabe, Kumiko Aso, Nao Toyama, Keiji Fujiwara, Akiko Yajima, Masachika Ichimura', null, 'The story follows Akane, a girl with no self-confidence. On the day before her birthday, she meets a mysterious alchemist, Hippocrates, and his student, Pipo, who both tell her they''re on a mission to save the world. Together, they set out from the basement for "Wonderland," and Akane finds herself labelled Wonderland''s savior.', 'The story follows Akane, a girl with no self-confidence. On the day before her birthday, she meets a mysterious alchemist, Hippocrates, and his student, Pipo, who both tell her they''re on a mission to save the world. Together, they set out from the basement for "Wonderland," and Akane finds herself labelled Wonderland''s savior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psWXyFQfIvcKYx1tzJaqVlHXXzH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573683'),
  ('956898988906141512', 'The Wonders', 2014, 'Drama', 'Alice Rohrwacher, Hélène Louvart', 'Alice Rohrwacher', 'Maria Alexandra Lungu, Alba Rohrwacher, Sam Louwyck, Sabine Timoteo, Agnese Graziani, Monica Bellucci, André Hennicke, Luis Huilca', null, 'In the Tuscan countryside, a family of traditional honey farmers struggles to make ends meet. The household consists of only daughters—four of them—led by the eldest, Gelsomina, who takes on the responsibilities of the family. When a small boy is sent to stay with them for rehabilitation, their routine is disrupted. As financial troubles threaten their home, Gelsomina sees an opportunity in a reality TV contest searching for ''Italy’s Most Traditional Family.'' Willing to expose their secluded life for the prize money, she clashes with her father’s rigid ways in a bid to secure their future.', 'In the Tuscan countryside, a family of traditional honey farmers struggles to make ends meet. The household consists of only daughters—four of them—led by the eldest, Gelsomina, who takes on the responsibilities of the family. When a small boy is sent to stay with them for rehabilitation, their routine is disrupted. As financial troubles threaten their home, Gelsomina sees an opportunity in a reality TV contest searching for ''Italy’s Most Traditional Family.'' Willing to expose their secluded life for the prize money, she clashes with her father’s rigid ways in a bid to secure their future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5Z23Rt9OKhQc61wPPwrDs4psdi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265226'),
  ('506609702399355318', 'The Wonders of Aladdin', 1961, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Mario Bava, Henry Levin, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Luther Davis', 'Donald O''Connor, Noëlle Adam, Vittorio De Sica, Terence Hill, Michèle Mercier, Aldo Fabrizi, Fausto Tozzi, Raymond Bussières', 'NR', 'Young Aladdin has a series of wild adventures after he discovers a magic lamp containing a genie.', 'Young Aladdin has a series of wild adventures after he discovers a magic lamp containing a genie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8pUVNZUWGGf9sZTSnu2LXeWtN2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325439'),
  ('898437677341911723', 'The Wood', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Rick Famuyiwa, Steven Bernstein', 'Rick Famuyiwa', 'Omar Epps, Richard T. Jones, Taye Diggs, Sanaa Lathan, LisaRaye McCoy, De''Aundre Bonds, Antwon Tanner, Tamala Jones', 'R', 'In the panicky, uncertain hours before his wedding, a groom with prenuptial jitters and his two best friends reminisce about growing up together in the middle-class African-American neighborhood of Inglewood, California. Flashing back to the twenty-something trio''s childhood exploits, the memories capture the mood and nostalgia of the ''80s era.', 'In the panicky, uncertain hours before his wedding, a groom with prenuptial jitters and his two best friends reminisce about growing up together in the middle-class African-American neighborhood of Inglewood, California. Flashing back to the twenty-something trio''s childhood exploits, the memories capture the mood and nostalgia of the ''80s era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEWMSJHkzMLgsTgsvR5TxuP3lBt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16158'),
  ('291521785146096004', 'The Woodcutter Story', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Jolle Onnismaa, Olli Salmi, Mikko Myllylahti', 'Mikko Myllylahti', 'Jarkko Lahti, Iivo Tuuri, Hannu-Pekka Björkman, Ulla Tapaninen, Marc Gassot, Katja Küttner, Armi Toivanen, Matti Onnismaa', null, 'An open-pit mine is unearthed in an idyllic town in Northern Finland. A strange chain of dreadful events affect the life of Pepe, a kind and optimistic woodcutter. But no matter what happens, Pepe seems to be fine with it, as if he holds a secret of existence that is hard to grasp.', 'An open-pit mine is unearthed in an idyllic town in Northern Finland. A strange chain of dreadful events affect the life of Pepe, a kind and optimistic woodcutter. But no matter what happens, Pepe seems to be fine with it, as if he holds a secret of existence that is hard to grasp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhDlBxMmwOilEUtphJ7TeFf6nWV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716847'),
