  ('361429121495733484', 'The Woods Dreams Are Made of', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Claire Simon', 'Claire Simon', null, null, 'Le Bois de Vincennes is a safe harbour for many Parisians. Migrants and natives, prostitutes and stalkers, rich and poor, old and young, downshifters and loners come to this forest in search of themselves and find there an escape from the metropolis. A delicate and profound portrait of a contemporary man and his desperate search for an ''unknown homeland''.', 'Le Bois de Vincennes is a safe harbour for many Parisians. Migrants and natives, prostitutes and stalkers, rich and poor, old and young, downshifters and loners come to this forest in search of themselves and find there an escape from the metropolis. A delicate and profound portrait of a contemporary man and his desperate search for an ''unknown homeland''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGLAQYEQheaMsuji1sCvppUzB4u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378489'),
  ('567298364319502581', 'The Woods Movie: The Making of The Blair Witch Project', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Russ Gomm', null, 'Eduardo Sánchez, Daniel Myrick, Gregg Hale', null, 'A look back at the making of the seminal found footage horror film.', 'A look back at the making of the seminal found footage horror film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKf47Rq4pzXvxv3aqrxKOi3quYG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320505'),
  ('1029867970355710591', 'The Woodsman', 2004, 'Drama, Crime', 'Nicole Kassell, Xavier Grobet, Thomas Fatone', 'Steven Fechter, Nicole Kassell', 'Kevin Bacon, David Alan Grier, Kyra Sedgwick, Eve, Benjamin Bratt, Carlos Leon, Michael Shannon, Nicole Gibson', 'R', 'After twelve years in prison, Walter returns home. His family has abandoned him, save for his brother-in-law. Few know he''s a sex offender and pedophile. Walter finds an apartment and is regularly visited by his parole officer. He gets a job at a lumber mill and starts seeing a coworker. Then his new world begins to unravel; as his past becomes known, he strikes up a high-risk friendship with a young girl and realizes that a man loitering near a schoolyard is a child molester prowling for his next victim.', 'After twelve years in prison, Walter returns home. His family has abandoned him, save for his brother-in-law. Few know he''s a sex offender and pedophile. Walter finds an apartment and is regularly visited by his parole officer. He gets a job at a lumber mill and starts seeing a coworker. Then his new world begins to unravel; as his past becomes known, he strikes up a high-risk friendship with a young girl and realizes that a man loitering near a schoolyard is a child molester prowling for his next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fDgLcc35A0IpxhMyJMP33bSDXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9692'),
  ('513388959717367686', 'The Woodsman and the Rain', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shuichi Okita, Yuta Tsukinaga', 'Fumio Moriya, Shuichi Okita', 'Koji Yakusho, Shun Oguri, Kengo Kora, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Asami Usuda, Kanji Furutachi, Kyūsaku Shimada, Yoshiyuki Morishita', null, 'A widowed lumberjack''s life is turned upside down when a film crew shooting a zombie movie asks for his help and increasingly starts to rely on him.', 'A widowed lumberjack''s life is turned upside down when a film crew shooting a zombie movie asks for his help and increasingly starts to rely on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlIrRZQUWFt4C4g1tIQH8rCI6O0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122336'),
  ('507032017584528061', 'The Words', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Antonio Calvache, Brian Klugman, Lee Sternthal', 'Brian Klugman, Lee Sternthal', 'Bradley Cooper, Zoe Saldaña, Jeremy Irons, Dennis Quaid, Olivia Wilde, J.K. Simmons, John Hannah, Željko Ivanek', 'PG-13', 'The Words follows young writer Rory Jansen who finally achieves long sought after literary success after publishing the next great American novel. There''s only one catch - he didn''t write it. As the past comes back to haunt him and his literary star continues to rise, Jansen is forced to confront the steep price that must be paid for stealing another man''s work, and for placing ambition and success above life''s most fundamental three words.', 'The Words follows young writer Rory Jansen who finally achieves long sought after literary success after publishing the next great American novel. There''s only one catch - he didn''t write it. As the past comes back to haunt him and his literary star continues to rise, Jansen is forced to confront the steep price that must be paid for stealing another man''s work, and for placing ambition and success above life''s most fundamental three words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJtPLZS7tlpiQl6pEr8H42K565x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83686'),
  ('853386104998386509', 'The Worker', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Andrés Pajares, María Casanova, Jenny Llada, Tomás Zori, Beatriz Carvajal, Beatriz Escudero, María Adánez, Antonio Ozores', null, 'Manolo is an electrician, plumber, bricklayer ... a hard worker. To his friends Manolo strange fate that gives as much money wins. And when asked, he answers laconically Oh, if I told you! What counts is that Manolo has a daughter in one of the inner most expensive schools in Madrid, and that it believes that his father is a senior executive, as any parent of her companions. The problem begins when the school closed by economic crisis, and the girl has to come live with her father. But Manolo find the collaboration of his friends, who will make the eyes appear currante small as a great man of finance. Adaptation "Spanish" the American film "A Pocketful of Miracles".', 'Manolo is an electrician, plumber, bricklayer ... a hard worker. To his friends Manolo strange fate that gives as much money wins. And when asked, he answers laconically Oh, if I told you! What counts is that Manolo has a daughter in one of the inner most expensive schools in Madrid, and that it believes that his father is a senior executive, as any parent of her companions. The problem begins when the school closed by economic crisis, and the girl has to come live with her father. But Manolo find the collaboration of his friends, who will make the eyes appear currante small as a great man of finance. Adaptation "Spanish" the American film "A Pocketful of Miracles".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rR8f2Jqk33zi7BWgYEDemHiA79J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133351'),
  ('888957068724326201', 'The Worker and the Hairdresser in a Whirlwind of Sex and Politics', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Lina Wertmüller, Blasco Giurato', 'Piero De Bernardi, Lina Wertmüller, Leonardo Benvenuti', 'Tullio Solenghi, Veronica Pivetti, Piera Degli Esposti, Cinzia Leone, Gene Gnocchi, Cyrielle Clair, Mirella Falco, Rossy de Palma', null, 'During the general elections of 1994, Tunin, a mechanic with a firm belief in communism fears that his party is about to lose, so he journeys to a northern village to stir up trouble. He isn''t there long before he is arguing with a beautiful hairdresser. Their debate is fiery as is his growing and impossible-to-disguise passion for her. She too is intrigued with him, but their disparate ideologies threaten to keep them apart.', 'During the general elections of 1994, Tunin, a mechanic with a firm belief in communism fears that his party is about to lose, so he journeys to a northern village to stir up trouble. He isn''t there long before he is arguing with a beautiful hairdresser. Their debate is fiery as is his growing and impossible-to-disguise passion for her. She too is intrigued with him, but their disparate ideologies threaten to keep them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHgfWnzd0k0E55mKpSaBZNQd4Tp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64959'),
  ('1066772814730664646', 'The Working Girls', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Stephanie Rothman, Daniel Lacambre, Tom Bullock', 'Stephanie Rothman', 'Sarah Kennedy, Laurie Rose, Mark Thomas, Lynne Guthrie, Ken Del Conte, Solomon Sturges, Eugene Elman, Mary Beth Hughes', 'R', 'A groupie, an escort, and a strip club dancer get thrown into danger by the illegal activities of the men they love.', 'A groupie, an escort, and a strip club dancer get thrown into danger by the illegal activities of the men they love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6R8EfWoaO5W3Zj5T1SAHG0G8379.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62610'),
  ('762239934885162754', 'The Workshop', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Laurent Cantet, Pierre Milon', 'Laurent Cantet, Robin Campillo', 'Marina Foïs, Matthieu Lucci, Warda Rammach, Florian Beaujean, Julien Souve, Olivier Thouret, Issam Talbi, Doudou Masta', null, 'Antoine has agreed to follow a writing workshop where some young people in insertion must write a noir novel with the help of Olivia, a recognized novelist. The work of writing will bring to life the working-class past of the city. Its shipyard is closed for 25 years, a nostalgia that does not interest Antoine, influenced by the anxiety of the present world', 'Antoine has agreed to follow a writing workshop where some young people in insertion must write a noir novel with the help of Olivia, a recognized novelist. The work of writing will bring to life the working-class past of the city. Its shipyard is closed for 25 years, a nostalgia that does not interest Antoine, influenced by the anxiety of the present world', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiOfmz12ELxNhPzem69pD1Ng3Qq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444397'),
  ('664168344980052891', 'The World', 2004, 'Drama', 'Jia Zhangke, Nelson Yu Lik-wai', 'Jia Zhangke', 'Zhao Tao, Cheng Taishen, Jue Jing, Jiang Zhongwei, Wang Hongwei, Liang Jingdong, Huang Yiqun, Shuai Ji', null, 'At Beijing World Park, a bizarre cross-pollination of Las Vegas and Epcot Center where visitors can interact with famous international monuments without ever leaving the city’s suburbs, a security guard betrays his dancer girlfriend by pursuing another woman.', 'At Beijing World Park, a bizarre cross-pollination of Las Vegas and Epcot Center where visitors can interact with famous international monuments without ever leaving the city’s suburbs, a security guard betrays his dancer girlfriend by pursuing another woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opwNfPbhwQxJYEOI80xfdiOq5sh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41292'),
  ('225416774142172179', 'The World According to Garp', 1982, 'Drama, Comedy', 'George Roy Hill, Miroslav Ondříček', 'Steve Tesich', 'Robin Williams, Mary Beth Hurt, Glenn Close, John Lithgow, Hume Cronyn, Jessica Tandy, Swoosie Kurtz, Brenda Currin', 'R', 'A struggling young writer finds his life and work dominated by his unfaithful wife and his radical feminist mother, whose best-selling manifesto turns her into a cultural icon.', 'A struggling young writer finds his life and work dominated by his unfaithful wife and his radical feminist mother, whose best-selling manifesto turns her into a cultural icon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ItRFdSCb7Sz3AC9LRxAzbH73kG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11307'),
  ('751860792750510500', 'The World According to Monsanto', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Marie-Monique Robin', 'Marie-Monique Robin', null, null, 'Monsanto is the world leader in genetically modified organisms (GMOs), as well as one of the most controversial corporations in industrial history. This century-old empire has created some of the most toxic products ever sold, including polychlorinated biphenyls (PCBs) and the herbicide Agent Orange. Based on a painstaking investigation, The World According to Monsanto puts together the pieces of the company’s history, calling on hitherto unpublished documents and numerous first-hand accounts.', 'Monsanto is the world leader in genetically modified organisms (GMOs), as well as one of the most controversial corporations in industrial history. This century-old empire has created some of the most toxic products ever sold, including polychlorinated biphenyls (PCBs) and the herbicide Agent Orange. Based on a painstaking investigation, The World According to Monsanto puts together the pieces of the company’s history, calling on hitherto unpublished documents and numerous first-hand accounts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOv3zZWY1XS3SNIwJJ8AiqOTmRB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27865'),
  ('420942188435188311', 'The World According to Tippi', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Christian Crye', null, 'Tippi Degré', null, 'Tippi is no ordinary child. She believes that she has the gift of talking to animals and that they are like brothers to her. ''I speak to them with my mind, or through my eyes, my heart or my soul, and I see that they understand and answer me.'' Tippi is the daughter of French filmmakers and wildlife photographers, Alain Degre and Sylvie Robert, who have captured her on film with some of Africa''s most beautiful and dangerous animals. Tippi shares her thoughts and wisdom on Africa, its people and the animals she has come to know and love. Often her wisdom is beyond her years, and her innocence and obvious rapport with the animals is both fascinating and charming.', 'Tippi is no ordinary child. She believes that she has the gift of talking to animals and that they are like brothers to her. ''I speak to them with my mind, or through my eyes, my heart or my soul, and I see that they understand and answer me.'' Tippi is the daughter of French filmmakers and wildlife photographers, Alain Degre and Sylvie Robert, who have captured her on film with some of Africa''s most beautiful and dangerous animals. Tippi shares her thoughts and wisdom on Africa, its people and the animals she has come to know and love. Often her wisdom is beyond her years, and her innocence and obvious rapport with the animals is both fascinating and charming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9jgCpvq3YBXDXf14R1rj5iyZ0X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243468'),
  ('246003311551623575', 'The World After Us', 2021, 'Drama', 'Louda Ben Salah-Cazanas, Amine Berrada', 'Abdellah Taïa', 'Aurélien Gabrielli, Louise Chevillotte, Saadia Bentaïeb, Jacques Nolot, Léon Cunha da Costa, Mickaël Chirinian, Noémie Schmidt, Hyacinthe Blanc', null, 'When penniless young writer Labidi meets Elisa he knows she’s the one for him. But Paris is expensive. A captivating film that combines the classic themes of French New Wave cinema with questions about roots, familiarity and distance.', 'When penniless young writer Labidi meets Elisa he knows she’s the one for him. But Paris is expensive. A captivating film that combines the classic themes of French New Wave cinema with questions about roots, familiarity and distance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTbXAMKlCbWWXeFdZf66gBZGIh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795775'),
  ('877728614141125557', 'The World Champion', 2021, 'Drama', 'Alexandr Mikeladze, Ekaterina Molochnaya, Filipp Yuzhanin', 'Alexey Sidorov', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Ivan Yankovsky, Vladimir Vdovichenkov, Victor Dobronravov, Viktor Sukhorukov, Diana Pozharskaya, Anatoly Kot, Mikhail Troynik', null, 'Some sporting victories are about more than just claiming a title. Some of them go down in history. The film follows the most dramatic and legendary showdown in the history of chess – the match between Anatoly Karpov, then world champion, and Viktor Korchnoi, a recent emigrant from the USSR. In this battle between two outstanding chess players, a duel of personalities under immense psychological pressure, the stakes are incomprehensibly high.', 'Some sporting victories are about more than just claiming a title. Some of them go down in history. The film follows the most dramatic and legendary showdown in the history of chess – the match between Anatoly Karpov, then world champion, and Viktor Korchnoi, a recent emigrant from the USSR. In this battle between two outstanding chess players, a duel of personalities under immense psychological pressure, the stakes are incomprehensibly high.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iK8M0QU9HRchXcWm2YvskQRYhaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589752'),
  ('424249781300023862', 'The World Gone Mad', 1933, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Christy Cabanne, Ira H. Morgan', 'Edward T. Lowe Jr.', 'Pat O''Brien, Neil Hamilton, Mary Brian, Evelyn Brent, John St. Polis, J. Carrol Naish, Louis Calhern, Richard Tucker', 'NR', 'A district attorney and a reporter try to find the killer of a D.A. who uncovered a massive stock fraud.', 'A district attorney and a reporter try to find the killer of a D.A. who uncovered a massive stock fraud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKlmzAGQqVuF9onN3e24fv5qe8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111308'),
  ('839270744144093324', 'The World in His Arms', 1952, 'Adventure, Romance', 'Raoul Walsh, Russell Metty, Phil Bowles', 'Borden Chase', 'Gregory Peck, Ann Blyth, Anthony Quinn, John McIntire, Carl Esmond, Sig Ruman, Andrea King, Eugenie Leontovich', 'NR', 'A boisterous sea captain in the Pacific Coast, circa 1850, has a plan to buy Alaska from the Russians… if they don’t kill him first.', 'A boisterous sea captain in the Pacific Coast, circa 1850, has a plan to buy Alaska from the Russians… if they don’t kill him first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxqGT4lJ3wolbNAASncbtphbL5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74436'),
  ('1038048025755952435', 'The World Is Big and Salvation Lurks Around the Corner', 2008, 'Drama', 'Stephan Komandarev, Emil Christov, Neža Zinajić', 'Yurii Dachev, Stephan Komandarev, Dušan Milić', 'Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Carlo Ljubek, Hristo Mutafchiev, Ana Papadopulu, Lyudmila Cheshmedzhieva, Nikolai Urumov, Blagovest Mutafchiev, Vasil Vasilev-Zueka', null, 'The story of Alex, who, with the help of his charismatic grandfather, embarks on a journey in search of his real self.', 'The story of Alex, who, with the help of his charismatic grandfather, embarks on a journey in search of his real self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsaVc5UmB8RuoZzxNbnFMR88vU6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5871'),
  ('316009983490625429', 'The World Is Not Enough', 1999, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Michael Apted, Adrian Biddle', 'Bruce Feirstein', 'Pierce Brosnan, Sophie Marceau, Robert Carlyle, Denise Richards, Robbie Coltrane, Judi Dench, Desmond Llewelyn, John Cleese', 'PG-13', 'Greed, revenge, world dominance and high-tech terrorism – it''s all in a day''s work for Bond, who''s on a mission to protect a beautiful oil heiress from a notorious terrorist. In a race against time that culminates in a dramatic submarine showdown, Bond works to defuse the international power struggle that has the world''s oil supply hanging in the balance.', 'Greed, revenge, world dominance and high-tech terrorism – it''s all in a day''s work for Bond, who''s on a mission to protect a beautiful oil heiress from a notorious terrorist. In a race against time that culminates in a dramatic submarine showdown, Bond works to defuse the international power struggle that has the world''s oil supply hanging in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCb2msgoZPK01WIqry24M4xsM73.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36643'),
  ('649256048768949886', 'The World is Ours', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Alfonso Sánchez, Daniel Mauri, Carlos Crespo', 'Alfonso Sánchez', 'Alfonso Sánchez, Alberto López, Antonio Dechent, María Cabrera, Estrella Corrientes, Sergio Domínguez, Pepa Díaz Meco, Antonia Gómez', null, 'El Culebra and El Cabesa, a pair of criminals, decide to take a bank at gunpoint, dressed as penitents. The plan is simple: Get in, get the money, take off all the loot quickly and catch the first flight to Brazil. But things get complicated when a man on his fifties, victim of the economic crisis goes into the bank loaded with explosives, threatening suicide. What would be the easiest shot in history, becomes a nightmare carnival.', 'El Culebra and El Cabesa, a pair of criminals, decide to take a bank at gunpoint, dressed as penitents. The plan is simple: Get in, get the money, take off all the loot quickly and catch the first flight to Brazil. But things get complicated when a man on his fifties, victim of the economic crisis goes into the bank loaded with explosives, threatening suicide. What would be the easiest shot in history, becomes a nightmare carnival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owKEGvWvR3aq2oNOtAOvo1gvm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115655'),
  ('121697648971158059', 'The World is Theirs', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Alfonso Sánchez, Fran Fernández-Pardo, Carlos Crespo', 'Alfonso Sánchez, Ana Graciani, Sergio Rubio', 'Alfonso Sánchez, Alberto López, Carlos Olalla, Mar Saura, Scott Cleverdon, Carlos Urban, Manuel Gancedo, Eva Marciel', null, 'Rafi arrives at Fali''s house with his suitcase in tow because his wife has kicked him out of the house. It is not the first time this has happened, although this time everything will be different, since the mess Rafi has gotten himself into this time... He is one of the big ones. Fali would like to help her friend, but she is in a hurry: tomorrow will be her son''s First Communion and all she has to do as a father is take the child''s suit to the farm where the event will be held. During the next twenty-four hours, and with the clock counting down stalking them, the compadres will manage to get out of various messes to get into new entanglements.', 'Rafi arrives at Fali''s house with his suitcase in tow because his wife has kicked him out of the house. It is not the first time this has happened, although this time everything will be different, since the mess Rafi has gotten himself into this time... He is one of the big ones. Fali would like to help her friend, but she is in a hurry: tomorrow will be her son''s First Communion and all she has to do as a father is take the child''s suit to the farm where the event will be held. During the next twenty-four hours, and with the clock counting down stalking them, the compadres will manage to get out of various messes to get into new entanglements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEYMAYZjNe8XEZIKqAImbzjKqUY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516363'),
  ('966257805285728264', 'The World is Yours', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Alfonso Sánchez, Alejandro Espadero', 'Alfonso Sánchez', 'Alfonso Sánchez, Alberto López, Carmen Canivell, Carlos Olalla, Teresa Arbolí, Chacha Huang, José Chaves, Teresa Refojo', null, 'Rafi sneaks into the Marchioness''s hunt, which brings together all the Spanish high society, to sell them his business. He and Fali will discover that hunting is not what it seems, and that the future of Spain is being decided on the farm.', 'Rafi sneaks into the Marchioness''s hunt, which brings together all the Spanish high society, to sell them his business. He and Fali will discover that hunting is not what it seems, and that the future of Spain is being decided on the farm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htzdiCe0WBFxCCcRk45aD65SuRn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807200'),
  ('705185096655992358', 'The World Is Yours', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Pascale Jeanniard, Ángel Lafuente, Romain Gavras', 'Karim Boukercha, Romain Gavras, Noé Debré', 'Karim Leklou, Isabelle Adjani, Vincent Cassel, Oulaya Amamra, François Damiens, Philippe Katerine, Sam Spruell, Gabby Rose', 'R', 'To escape his life of crime, a Paris drug dealer takes on one last job involving Spain, unhinged gangsters, his longtime crush and his scheming mother.', 'To escape his life of crime, a Paris drug dealer takes on one last job involving Spain, unhinged gangsters, his longtime crush and his scheming mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8l0pdMuVgqIYXBvNUr4TXdpmFj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504603'),
  ('1041299633591855711', 'The World Moves On', 1934, 'Drama, History, Romance, War', 'John Ford', 'Reginald Berkeley', 'Madeleine Carroll, Franchot Tone, Reginald Denny, Sig Ruman, Louise Dresser, Raul Roulien, Stepin Fetchit, Lumsden Hare', 'NR', 'Two families, cotton merchants in England and America, with branches in France and Prussia swear to stand by each other in a belief that a great business firmly established in four countries will be able to withstand even such another calamity as the Napoleonic Wars from which Europe is slowly recovering. Then many years later, along comes World War One and the years that follow, to test the businesses.', 'Two families, cotton merchants in England and America, with branches in France and Prussia swear to stand by each other in a belief that a great business firmly established in four countries will be able to withstand even such another calamity as the Napoleonic Wars from which Europe is slowly recovering. Then many years later, along comes World War One and the years that follow, to test the businesses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ox2Vj3yE2Ig4KD7nLSuZkOu5574.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117044'),
  ('1040628402984875392', 'The World of Apu', 1959, 'Drama', 'Satyajit Ray, Subrata Mitra, Shailen Dutta', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Soumitra Chatterjee, Sharmila Tagore, Alok Chakravarty, Swapan Mukherjee, Sefalika Devi, Belarani Devi, Asha Devi, Dhiresh Majumdar', 'PG-13', 'Apu, now a jobless ex-student dreaming vaguely of a future as a writer, is invited to join an old college friend on a trip up-country to a village wedding.', 'Apu, now a jobless ex-student dreaming vaguely of a future as a writer, is invited to join an old college friend on a trip up-country to a village wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Tz1Q69o2n3Zwb0ZffzPL0nFt2T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:896'),
