  ('1056603096318809141', 'The World of Kanako', 2014, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Tetsuya Nakashima, Shôichi Atô, Seitaro Kai', 'Tetsuya Nakashima, Miako Tadano, Nobuhiro Monma', 'Koji Yakusho, Nana Komatsu, Hiroya Shimizu, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Joe Odagiri, Asuka Kurosawa, Jun Kunimura, Munetaka Aoki', 'NR', 'When Kanako, a model daughter and a brilliant student, disappears, her mother asks her ex-husband, a violent former policeman, to find her. As his investigation progresses, his idealized image of Kanako cracks: the girl hides a dark life that her father can not even imagine.', 'When Kanako, a model daughter and a brilliant student, disappears, her mother asks her ex-husband, a violent former policeman, to find her. As his investigation progresses, his idealized image of Kanako cracks: the girl hides a dark life that her father can not even imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7JSRcBg1Wm3ZoMI3xsRm6L6N0m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251981'),
