  ('552601317187688245', 'The World to Come', 2021, 'Romance, Drama, Western', 'Mona Fastvold, André Chemetoff, Emilie Balusson', 'Ron Hansen, Jim Shepard', 'Katherine Waterston, Casey Affleck, Vanessa Kirby, Christopher Abbott, Kim Ciobanu, Daniel Blumberg, Andreea Vasile, James Longshore', 'R', 'In 1856, two women forge a close connection despite their isolation on the American frontier.', 'In 1856, two women forge a close connection despite their isolation on the American frontier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GJQXJ96FUbXtB01VXAdp854qOt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506281'),
