  ('300505747755737349', 'The Wrong Girls', null, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Dylan Meyer, Todd Banhazl, Sarah M. Pott', 'Dylan Meyer', 'Kristen Stewart, Alia Shawkat, Seth Rogen, Kumail Nanjiani, LaKeith Stanfield, Tony Hale, Zack Fox, Taj Cross', null, 'Two aimless young women inadvertently gain telepathic abilities after ingesting an experimental drug, pitting them against dangerous rivals pursuing the same powerful substance.', 'Two aimless young women inadvertently gain telepathic abilities after ingesting an experimental drug, pitting them against dangerous rivals pursuing the same powerful substance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwLgmo32j1O91D2xPXOrGUcyzn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1226699'),
  ('756149508486609381', 'The Wrong Guy', 1997, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'David Steinberg, David A. Makin', 'Dave Foley, David Anthony Higgins, Jay Kogen', 'Dave Foley, David Anthony Higgins, Jennifer Tilly, Joe Flaherty, Dan Redican, Alan Scarfe, Kenneth Welsh, Enrico Colantoni', 'PG-13', 'Nelson Hibbert expects to become the new president of Nagel Industries, but Mr. Nagel gives the promotion to another employee. When Nelson barges into Nagel''s office to confront him, he finds Nagel''s been murdered. Fearing that he will be implicated, Nelson decides to run from the law...despite the fact that the police already know the killer''s identity.', 'Nelson Hibbert expects to become the new president of Nagel Industries, but Mr. Nagel gives the promotion to another employee. When Nelson barges into Nagel''s office to confront him, he finds Nagel''s been murdered. Fearing that he will be implicated, Nelson decides to run from the law...despite the fact that the police already know the killer''s identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9X22sqQI5UAwajmSNH293avRtFr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15313'),
  ('210541213856027088', 'The Wrong Guys', 1988, 'Comedy, Action', 'Frank Byers, Danny Bilson, Chip Vucelich', 'Danny Bilson, Paul De Meo', 'Louie Anderson, Richard Lewis, Richard Belzer, Franklyn Ajaye, Tim Thomerson, Brion James, Biff Manard, John Goodman', 'PG', 'Five former cub scouts have a reunion and go camping on the mountain they never conquered. High jinks ensue due to their childhood enemies and a group of escaped convicts who mistake them for an FBI unit.', 'Five former cub scouts have a reunion and go camping on the mountain they never conquered. High jinks ensue due to their childhood enemies and a group of escaped convicts who mistake them for an FBI unit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obmLtYUh2NIqdBmybb7x7zusPzx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5678'),
