  ('988342992387093700', 'The Wrung-Out Man', 1980, 'Drama', 'João Batista de Andrade', 'João Batista de Andrade', 'José Dumont, Célia Maracajá, Barros Freire, Aldo Bueno, Dominguinhos, Vital Farias, Renato Master, Luiz Alberto Pereira', null, 'Deraldo, a popular poet from Northeast Brazil, arrives in the capital of São Paulo, making a living only from his poetry and pamphlets. All is well until he is mistaken for a multinational worker who killed the boss at a party where he received the title of symbolic worker.', 'Deraldo, a popular poet from Northeast Brazil, arrives in the capital of São Paulo, making a living only from his poetry and pamphlets. All is well until he is mistaken for a multinational worker who killed the boss at a party where he received the title of symbolic worker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2drKnQ0C5yU5fBuFkY5jkL9ndYG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166184'),
  ('1060306798396142684', 'The X Files: I Want to Believe', 2008, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Chris Carter, Bill Roe, Jack Hardy', 'Chris Carter, Frank Spotnitz', 'David Duchovny, Gillian Anderson, Amanda Peet, Billy Connolly, Xzibit, Mitch Pileggi, Callum Keith Rennie, Adam Godley', 'PG-13', 'Mulder and Scully are called back to duty by the FBI when a former priest claims to be receiving psychic visions pertaining to a kidnapped agent.', 'Mulder and Scully are called back to duty by the FBI when a former priest claims to be receiving psychic visions pertaining to a kidnapped agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zQMhutUMJP6lK49x7i2YfsOHL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8836'),
  ('442557260115066647', 'The X from Outer Space', 1967, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Kazui Nihonmatsu, Shizuo Hirase, Chitora Okoshi', 'Eibi Motomochi, Kazui Nihonmatsu, Moriyoshi Ishida', 'Shunya Wazaki, Itoko Harada, Shinichi Yanagisawa, Keisuke Sonoi, Hiroshi Fujioka, Eiji Okada, Peggy Neal, Franz Gruber', 'PG', 'The spaceship AAB-Gamma is dispatched from FAFC headquarters in Japan to make a landing on the planet Mars and investigate reports of UFOs in the area. As they near the red planet, they encounter a mysterious UFO that coats the ship''s hull with unusual spores. Taking one of the specimens back to earth, it soon develops and grows into a giant chicken-lizard-alien monster that tramples Japan.', 'The spaceship AAB-Gamma is dispatched from FAFC headquarters in Japan to make a landing on the planet Mars and investigate reports of UFOs in the area. As they near the red planet, they encounter a mysterious UFO that coats the ship''s hull with unusual spores. Taking one of the specimens back to earth, it soon develops and grows into a giant chicken-lizard-alien monster that tramples Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fY4LR4Q04BjPbaZ79XTpSB9NnOv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42712'),
  ('89135675398327690', 'The X-Files', 1998, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Rob Bowman, Ward Russell, William H. Burton Sr.', 'Chris Carter', 'David Duchovny, Gillian Anderson, Mitch Pileggi, William B. Davis, John Neville, Martin Landau, Jeffrey DeMunn, Tom Braidwood', 'PG-13', 'Mulder and Scully, now taken off the FBI''s X Files cases, must find a way to fight the shadowy elements of the government to find out the truth about a conspiracy that might mean the alien colonization of Earth.', 'Mulder and Scully, now taken off the FBI''s X Files cases, must find a way to fight the shadowy elements of the government to find out the truth about a conspiracy that might mean the alien colonization of Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLIw6shz2WC3W3iI0jROsF4B2ha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846'),
  ('379312964796830615', 'The X-Ray Fiend', 1897, 'Comedy, Horror', 'George Albert Smith', 'George Albert Smith', 'Laura Bayley, Tom Green', null, 'A romantic couple are transformed into skeletons via X-Rays. The film combines two very recent innovations: Wilhelm Roentgen''s discovery of X-rays in 1895, and Georges Méliès'' accidental realisation of the special-effects potential of the jump-cut in 1896.', 'A romantic couple are transformed into skeletons via X-Rays. The film combines two very recent innovations: Wilhelm Roentgen''s discovery of X-rays in 1895, and Georges Méliès'' accidental realisation of the special-effects potential of the jump-cut in 1896.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9W5EcN51j8eNrxqUwbQfoS6HUgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105166'),
  ('1065780644005656126', 'The X-Treme Riders', 2023, 'Action, Crime', 'Sor Sangchai, Thanitsaphong Sasinmanop', null, 'Jirayu La-ongmanee, Wawaa Nichari Chokprajakchat, Chaleeda Gilbert, Assaree Wattanayakun, Ratchanont Suprakob, Saranyoo Prachankit, Pattanapon Kunchorn, Byron Bishop', null, 'A fast-paced action drama about siblings desperately needing money for their mother''s treatment. Then the brother, who is the stunt performer, inevitably needs to be involved with.', 'A fast-paced action drama about siblings desperately needing money for their mother''s treatment. Then the brother, who is the stunt performer, inevitably needs to be involved with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6vVnsWyESNpiamrfBvnxXYcWlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1188104'),
  ('359453054856643615', 'The Xango from Baker Street', 2001, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime, Horror', 'Lauro Escorel, Miguel Faria Jr., Kátia Lund', 'Patrícia Melo, Marcos Bernstein, Miguel Faria Jr.', 'Joaquim de Almeida, Anthony O''Donnell, Letícia Sabatella, Cláudia Abreu, Cláudio Marzo, Maria de Medeiros, Marco Nanini, Thalma de Freitas', null, 'Rio de Janeiro, 1886. A precious Stradivarius violin presented to Emperor Dom Pedro II is stolen. Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson are called to solve the case.', 'Rio de Janeiro, 1886. A precious Stradivarius violin presented to Emperor Dom Pedro II is stolen. Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson are called to solve the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6lA48IIzY0xNdPOiK85A4e4DsA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63712'),
  ('205470735744991613', 'The Xposé', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Ananth Narayan Mahadevan', 'Jainesh Ejardar, Himesh Reshammiya', 'Himesh Reshammiya, Sonali Raut, Zoya Afroz, Ananth Narayan Mahadevan, Yo Yo Honey Singh, Irrfan Khan, Rajesh Sharma, Adil Hussain', null, 'This is a dramatic chain of events in the most glamorous ,swinging era of Hindi films... the 1960s. It was a decade when film stars tasted success and carried their larger than life screen image on to real life with unbridled pomp and splendour. It was during this time that two ambitious films were made... Ujwal Nirmal Sheetal and Reena Mera Naam. The latter became a runaway hit while the former was struggling at the box office.', 'This is a dramatic chain of events in the most glamorous ,swinging era of Hindi films... the 1960s. It was a decade when film stars tasted success and carried their larger than life screen image on to real life with unbridled pomp and splendour. It was during this time that two ambitious films were made... Ujwal Nirmal Sheetal and Reena Mera Naam. The latter became a runaway hit while the former was struggling at the box office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/banahHkzFfTQlIriqTbmxw3xvRc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270417'),
  ('681665224488964012', 'The Yacoubian Building', 2006, 'Drama', 'Marwan Hamed, Sameh Selim', 'Alaa Al Aswany', 'Adel Emam, Nour El-Sherif, Hend Sabry, Mohamed Emam, Esaad Younes, Khaled El Sawy, Yousra, Ahmad Rateb', null, 'The lives of residents in an old Cairo building, "The Yacoubian Building," are affected by issues like corruption, extremism, class disparity, and sexuality. Through diverse characters, the film offers a critical examination of Egyptian society.', 'The lives of residents in an old Cairo building, "The Yacoubian Building," are affected by issues like corruption, extremism, class disparity, and sexuality. Through diverse characters, the film offers a critical examination of Egyptian society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iA0XY4w6Nn7mDVfal7tAgKHqfTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44085'),
  ('920857030859962108', 'The Yakuza', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Action', 'Sydney Pollack, Kōzō Okazaki, Michael D. Moore', 'Paul Schrader, Robert Towne', 'Robert Mitchum, Ken Takakura, Eiji Okada, Herb Edelman, Richard Jordan, James Shigeta, Keiko Kishi, Christina Kokubo', 'R', 'When George Tanner does business with high-ranking Yakuza Tono, Tono kidnaps his daughter, and George summons his old friend, private eye Harry Kilmer, to Japan to investigate.', 'When George Tanner does business with high-ranking Yakuza Tono, Tono kidnaps his daughter, and George summons his old friend, private eye Harry Kilmer, to Japan to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aj6JpRPswDR4eMO1OSnoTc2yrPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28415'),
  ('1012646715379325321', 'The Yankee Doodle Mouse', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'William Hanna, Bob Laztny, Jack Sabel', null, 'As Tom and Jerry stage their typical fight sequences, the patriotic soldier theme of the title is evidenced by such things as a carton of eggs labeled "Hen Grenades"; Jerry dropping light bulbs from an airplane like bombs; and Jerry sending a telegram with the message "Sighted Cat - Sank Same." Musical phrasings from various patriotic war songs are heard throughout.', 'As Tom and Jerry stage their typical fight sequences, the patriotic soldier theme of the title is evidenced by such things as a carton of eggs labeled "Hen Grenades"; Jerry dropping light bulbs from an airplane like bombs; and Jerry sending a telegram with the message "Sighted Cat - Sank Same." Musical phrasings from various patriotic war songs are heard throughout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xunQBzrIJkoxToACUVpPo0Neqzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39896'),
  ('257424443107661320', 'The Yards', 2000, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'James Gray, Harris Savides, John Nyomarkay', 'James Gray, Matt Reeves', 'Mark Wahlberg, Joaquin Phoenix, Charlize Theron, James Caan, Ellen Burstyn, Faye Dunaway, Steve Lawrence, Andy Davoli', 'R', 'In the rail yards of Queens, contractors repair and rebuild the city''s subway cars. These contracts are lucrative, so graft and corruption are rife. When Leo Handler gets out of prison, he finds his aunt married to Frank Olchin, one of the big contractors; he''s battling with a minority-owned firm for contracts.', 'In the rail yards of Queens, contractors repair and rebuild the city''s subway cars. These contracts are lucrative, so graft and corruption are rife. When Leo Handler gets out of prison, he finds his aunt married to Frank Olchin, one of the big contractors; he''s battling with a minority-owned firm for contracts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtwXtU8CDWvVADgOwRkOSRZFPWI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19457'),
  ('369740854229980673', 'The Year 01', 1973, 'Comedy, Action', 'Jean-Jacques Schakmundès, Alain Resnais, Jean Rouch', 'Gébé', 'Josiane Balasko, Christian Clavier, Coluche, Gérard Depardieu, Gébé, Gérard Jugnot, Thierry Lhermitte, Miou-Miou', null, 'The film narrates a utopian abandonment, consensual and festive of the market economy and high productivity. The population decides on a number of resolutions beginning with "We stop everything" and the second "After a total downtime will be revived-reluctantly-that the services and products including lack will prove intolerable. Probably: water to drink, electricity for reading at night, the TSF to say "This is not the end of the world, this is an 01, and now a page of Celestial Mechanics". The implementation of these resolutions is the first day of a new era, Year 01. The Year 01 is emblematic of the challenge of the 1970s and covers such diverse topics as ecology, negation of authority, free love, communal living, rejection of private property and labor.', 'The film narrates a utopian abandonment, consensual and festive of the market economy and high productivity. The population decides on a number of resolutions beginning with "We stop everything" and the second "After a total downtime will be revived-reluctantly-that the services and products including lack will prove intolerable. Probably: water to drink, electricity for reading at night, the TSF to say "This is not the end of the world, this is an 01, and now a page of Celestial Mechanics". The implementation of these resolutions is the first day of a new era, Year 01. The Year 01 is emblematic of the challenge of the 1970s and covers such diverse topics as ecology, negation of authority, free love, communal living, rejection of private property and labor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JadhjqHhSYbJV2gcxjLN2oxzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63172'),
  ('238683180203262321', 'The Year Earth Changed', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Tom Beard, Owen Bissell, Richard Hilton Szkiler', null, 'David Attenborough, Bhashkar Bara, Dulu Bora, Anshul Chopra, Christine Gabriele, Meghna Hazarika, Russell MacLaughlin, Salim Mandela', 'PG', 'Never-before-seen footage shows how our living in lockdown opened the door for nature to bounce back and thrive. Across the seas, skies, and lands, Earth found its rhythm when we came to a stop.', 'Never-before-seen footage shows how our living in lockdown opened the door for nature to bounce back and thrive. Across the seas, skies, and lands, Earth found its rhythm when we came to a stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLwQRXfzPjmpU6I78TCkoHazO0A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811703'),
  ('971992407443600049', 'The Year I Lost My Mind', 2017, 'Drama', 'Tor Iben', null, 'Alexander Tsypilev, Julien Lickert, Toni Kadrija, Christian Harting, Patrick G. Boll, Astrid Kohrs, Eva Nürnberg, Michael del Coco', null, 'Tom is a lonely young man. During a burglary with his best friend he becomes obsessed with the victim, Lars, a young history lecturer who lives in the apartment. Tom starts to observe Lars secretly and pursue him without revealing his existence or feelings for him. At the same time, Tom is developing a second obsession to a motorcyclist that he occasionally sees. More and more Tom gets lost in a labyrinth of passions. As Lars discovers him, the persecutor becomes the persecuted leading to a shocking confrontation.', 'Tom is a lonely young man. During a burglary with his best friend he becomes obsessed with the victim, Lars, a young history lecturer who lives in the apartment. Tom starts to observe Lars secretly and pursue him without revealing his existence or feelings for him. At the same time, Tom is developing a second obsession to a motorcyclist that he occasionally sees. More and more Tom gets lost in a labyrinth of passions. As Lars discovers him, the persecutor becomes the persecuted leading to a shocking confrontation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Af3TcSB7Gpuzi3M7T9PqxWhpHOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512082'),
  ('1023658475666106992', 'The Year I Started Masturbating', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Erika Wasserman, Anders Habenicht, Andreas Nygård', 'Erika Wasserman, Christin Magdu', 'Katia Winter, Jesper Zuschlag, Nour El Refai, Henrik Dorsin, Bahar Pars, Vera Carlbom, Hannes Fohlin, Siw Erixon', null, 'Ambitious overachiever Hanna just needs one more kid before her life is perfect. Instead, her baby daddy unexpectedly dumps her. Suddenly, she finds herself without a place to live, job or family. With every fiber of her being set for victory, Hanna refuses to give up and decides to win him back. But to get there means having to win something much more important, love and desire for herself and who she is.', 'Ambitious overachiever Hanna just needs one more kid before her life is perfect. Instead, her baby daddy unexpectedly dumps her. Suddenly, she finds herself without a place to live, job or family. With every fiber of her being set for victory, Hanna refuses to give up and decides to win him back. But to get there means having to win something much more important, love and desire for herself and who she is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckbnMAgX8PxShIYmK1LFByKNhEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983105'),
  ('919474124516715868', 'The Year My Parents Went on Vacation', 2006, 'Drama', 'Adriano Goldman, Cao Hamburger, André Montenegro', 'Adriana Falcão', 'Michel Joelsas, Germano Haiut, Paulo Autran, Simone Spoladore, Eduardo Moreira, Caio Blat, Daniela Piepszyk, Gabriel Eric Bursztein', null, 'A boy is left alone in a Jewish neighborhood in the year of 1970, where both world cup and dictatorship happen in Brazil.', 'A boy is left alone in a Jewish neighborhood in the year of 1970, where both world cup and dictatorship happen in Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwa1Xo1sldbiLIOfFWLvF3rgdKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14421'),
  ('935532605113166956', 'The Year My Voice Broke', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Duigan, Tom Blacket, Charles Rotherham', 'John Duigan', 'Noah Taylor, Loene Carmen, Ben Mendelsohn, Graeme Blundell, Lynette Curran, Malcolm Robertson, Judi Farr, Tim Robertson', 'PG-13', 'Set in 1962, a young prepubescent boy in rural Australia watches painfully as his best friend and first love blossoms into womanhood and falls for a thuggish rugby player, changing the lives of everyone involved.', 'Set in 1962, a young prepubescent boy in rural Australia watches painfully as his best friend and first love blossoms into womanhood and falls for a thuggish rugby player, changing the lives of everyone involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eThAKG78ypcpyZSysue7exgMuZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19958'),
  ('936205617332302458', 'The Year of Awakening', 1991, 'Drama', 'Gérard Corbiau, François Catonné', 'Michel Fessler, Andrée Corbiau, Gérard Corbiau', 'Chiara Caselli, Grégoire Colin, Laurent Grévill, Martin Lamotte, Roger Planchon, Claude Duneton, Christian Barbier, Vincent Grass', null, 'A sensitive, 14 year old orphan in a military school learns about life and love from his classmates and teachers.', 'A sensitive, 14 year old orphan in a military school learns about life and love from his classmates and teachers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/up9PSWl1kAhDehW241HgbM1wlLS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245520'),
  ('251050851996225515', 'The Year of Fury', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Daniel Aranyó, Rafa Russo', 'Rafa Russo', 'Joaquín Furriel, Alberto Ammann, Daniel Grao, Martina Gusmán, Maribel Verdú, Miguel Ángel Solá, Sara Sálamo, Paula Cancio', null, 'Uruguay (1972) unavoidably falls into a terrible dictatorship. Diego and Leonardo, two writers of a well-known TV comedy show, struggle to maintain their integrity under the pressure they receive to tone down their political satires against the military. On the side of the oppressors, Rojas, the lieutenant in charge of torturing subversive youth, finds emotional refuge in Susana, a prostitute. Slowly, the lives of all of them are deeply impacted by the yoke of the dictatorship that looms over them.', 'Uruguay (1972) unavoidably falls into a terrible dictatorship. Diego and Leonardo, two writers of a well-known TV comedy show, struggle to maintain their integrity under the pressure they receive to tone down their political satires against the military. On the side of the oppressors, Rojas, the lieutenant in charge of torturing subversive youth, finds emotional refuge in Susana, a prostitute. Slowly, the lives of all of them are deeply impacted by the yoke of the dictatorship that looms over them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sturEawXxucFQYoUDxdNTFTd7jt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717689'),
  ('726318234131867536', 'The Year of Getting to Know Us', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Patrick Sisam, Lisa Rinzler', 'Patrick Sisam', 'Sharon Stone, Jimmy Fallon, Illeana Douglas, Tom Arnold, Jordana Spiro, Susanne Kreitman Taylor, Lucy Liu, Tony Hale', 'R', 'A commitment-phobic man reunites with his estranged, ailing father and comes to terms with his own childhood.', 'A commitment-phobic man reunites with his estranged, ailing father and comes to terms with his own childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Odi5ghooo1SsGxM5UZ3sIr4fTn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4644'),
  ('45051020625820015', 'The Year of Living Dangerously', 1982, 'Romance, Drama', 'Peter Weir, Russell Boyd, John Seale', 'Peter Weir, C.J. Koch, David Williamson', 'Mel Gibson, Sigourney Weaver, Linda Hunt, Michael Murphy, Bill Kerr, Noel Ferrier, Bembol Roco, Paul Sonkkila', 'PG', 'A young Australian reporter tries to navigate the political turmoil of Indonesia during the rule of President Sukarno with the help of a diminutive photographer.', 'A young Australian reporter tries to navigate the political turmoil of Indonesia during the rule of President Sukarno with the help of a diminutive photographer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9GIM95xWWU4urqqu0kziby0Ykg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11541'),
  ('589082100112823627', 'The Year of the Cannibals', 1969, 'Drama', 'Liliana Cavani, Giulio Albonico, Gianni Amelio', 'Liliana Cavani', 'Britt Ekland, Pierre Clémenti, Tomas Milian, Delia Boccardo, Marino Masé, Francesco Leonetti, Alfredo Bianchini, Alessandro Cane', null, 'On the streets of a damp metropolis lie the corpses of hundreds and hundreds of boys and girls. No one can give them a resting place because of a law enacted by a repressive State. But the young Antigone, with the help of a foreigner, Tiresias, violates this rule in the name of pietas, undermining the established order.', 'On the streets of a damp metropolis lie the corpses of hundreds and hundreds of boys and girls. No one can give them a resting place because of a law enacted by a repressive State. But the young Antigone, with the help of a foreigner, Tiresias, violates this rule in the name of pietas, undermining the established order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfJiC6OHWuT9CtSCqjBNG0yk4Wp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250696'),
  ('76653753542737397', 'The Year of the Deer', 1995, 'Animation, Drama', 'Georges Schwizgebel', null, null, null, 'The story of a young deer deceived by appearances, or how a good deed in haste can be the cause of a tragedy.', 'The story of a young deer deceived by appearances, or how a good deed in haste can be the cause of a tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YFdKaRGdxNdENSNNu7bbEKXVji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256581'),
  ('133221221559681092', 'The Year of the Discovery', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Sara Gallego, Luis López Carrasco', 'Raúl Liarte, Luis López Carrasco', null, null, 'In 1992 – 500 years after the beginning of Spain''s global empire with the discovery of America – Spain proudly presented itself to the international community as a modern, developed, dynamic country through the Olympic Games in Barcelona and the Expo in Seville. But for filmmaker Luis López Carrasco (1981, Murcia), 1992 was also the year in which the regional parliament building in Cartagena was razed during furious protests against the threatened closure of various local industries. El año del descubrimiento revives this almost forgotten history in a typical Spanish bar in Cartagena, where different generations come together to drink, eat, smoke and talk. Stories from witnesses, demonstrators and strikers from back then and discussions among younger café visitors on themes such as class consciousness, the economic crisis and the role of unions percolate to the surface amidst talk of other life issues.', 'In 1992 – 500 years after the beginning of Spain''s global empire with the discovery of America – Spain proudly presented itself to the international community as a modern, developed, dynamic country through the Olympic Games in Barcelona and the Expo in Seville. But for filmmaker Luis López Carrasco (1981, Murcia), 1992 was also the year in which the regional parliament building in Cartagena was razed during furious protests against the threatened closure of various local industries. El año del descubrimiento revives this almost forgotten history in a typical Spanish bar in Cartagena, where different generations come together to drink, eat, smoke and talk. Stories from witnesses, demonstrators and strikers from back then and discussions among younger café visitors on themes such as class consciousness, the economic crisis and the role of unions percolate to the surface amidst talk of other life issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axBDtMngdYdEOOLNcnozM7l2WD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655720'),
  ('222603512231083607', 'The Year of the Hare', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Risto Jarva, Antti Peippo', 'Kullervo Kukkasjärvi, Arto Paasilinna, Risto Jarva', 'Antti Litja, Kauko Helovirta, Markku Huhtamo, Paavo Hukkinen, Juha Kandolin, Kosti Klemelä, Anna-Maija Kokkinen, Martti Kuningas', null, 'Young advertising executive Vatanen suddenly quits his job and his whole life in Helsinki, and decides to spend a while in the Finnish wilderness. A wounded hare hit by a car becomes his travel companion. Together they find reclusion in the Finnish Lapland, soon to be disturbed by a noisy group of foreign tourists and their pretentious Finnish hosts. When the hare gets ill and needs to see a vet, Vatanen must return to the city and finally face the choice between his new and former life', 'Young advertising executive Vatanen suddenly quits his job and his whole life in Helsinki, and decides to spend a while in the Finnish wilderness. A wounded hare hit by a car becomes his travel companion. Together they find reclusion in the Finnish Lapland, soon to be disturbed by a noisy group of foreign tourists and their pretentious Finnish hosts. When the hare gets ill and needs to see a vet, Vatanen must return to the city and finally face the choice between his new and former life', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0QUhDSy4g2jQ4juOTCtUV6V1am.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39008'),
  ('816676448716837390', 'The Year of the Mouse', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, null, null, 'Jerry, with the help of a mouse friend, is lowered on a fishing line, abuses the sleeping Tom in various ways, and is yanked away before Tom sees him. First, he hits Tom with a fireplace shovel and plants it in Tom''s hand; next, he puts a gun in Tom''s hand and pulls the trigger; he puts a noose around Tom''s neck; positions a ketchup-covered knife (complete with ketchup "wound"); and finally puts Tom into an archery bow. Tom finally gets his revenge,', 'Jerry, with the help of a mouse friend, is lowered on a fishing line, abuses the sleeping Tom in various ways, and is yanked away before Tom sees him. First, he hits Tom with a fireplace shovel and plants it in Tom''s hand; next, he puts a gun in Tom''s hand and pulls the trigger; he puts a noose around Tom''s neck; positions a ketchup-covered knife (complete with ketchup "wound"); and finally puts Tom into an archery bow. Tom finally gets his revenge,', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/416P4m0Mt7nI98NHbmMfayXpP3u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234393'),
  ('243998245964887574', 'The Year of the Plague', 1978, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Felipe Cazals', 'José Agustín', 'Alejandro Parodi, José Carlos Ruiz, Rebeca Silva, Tito Junco, Ignacio Retes, Eduardo Alcaraz, Héctor Godoy, Humberto Elizondo', null, 'A terrible disease is found in a Mexican town. A doctor tries to alert the authorities when he discovers its epidemic nature. No one listen to him and soon after the disease spreads. The government tries to control the information in order to prevent panic.', 'A terrible disease is found in a Mexican town. A doctor tries to alert the authorities when he discovers its epidemic nature. No one listen to him and soon after the disease spreads. The government tries to control the information in order to prevent panic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AaY2ol4oeRrAKcZ7tPstoUpTaRc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248138'),
  ('161104194761943657', 'The Year of the Plague', 2018, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'C. Martín Ferrera', 'Ángeles Hernández, Miguel Ibáñez Monroy, David Matamoros', 'Ivan Massagué, Ana Serradilla, Miriam Giovanelli, Brays Efe, Sue Flack, Juanra Bonet, Silvia Abril, Fermí Reixach', null, 'After the end of his relationship with Irene, friends and co-workers attempt to find Victor a new girlfriend, but even after he starts a relationship with Lola, he does not want to forget Irene. His existence is suddenly turned upside down when inexplicable things start to happen around him. Something is possessing people, causing their behaviour to change.', 'After the end of his relationship with Irene, friends and co-workers attempt to find Victor a new girlfriend, but even after he starts a relationship with Lola, he does not want to forget Irene. His existence is suddenly turned upside down when inexplicable things start to happen around him. Something is possessing people, causing their behaviour to change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4t7k11BnL666DOPqi32nwggq2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516856'),
  ('184399502327658088', 'The Year of the Shark', 2022, 'Comedy, Horror, Drama', 'Ludovic Boukherma, Zoran Boukherma, David Krespine', 'Zoran Boukherma, Ludovic Boukherma', 'Marina Foïs, Kad Merad, Jean-Pascal Zadi, Christine Gautier, Ludovic Torrent, Philippe Prévost, Jean Boronat, Jean-Jacques Bernede', null, 'A small coastal town in the south-west of France is on high alert after a surfer disappeared. Soon the incredible truth is revealed: a shark is prowling in the harbor.', 'A small coastal town in the south-west of France is on high alert after a surfer disappeared. Soon the incredible truth is revealed: a shark is prowling in the harbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DcNwh03WHYVnnA4GmI2pkWXh4I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833384'),
  ('1005833958356849511', 'The Year of the Tick', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Jorge Coira', 'Carlos Portela', 'Félix Gómez, Verónica Sánchez, Javier Veiga, María Vázquez, Víctor Clavijo, Camila Bossa, Luis Zahera', null, 'Follows Fran, a young man obsessed with Eurovision, and his eccentric bunch of friends who live the most crazy and bizarre situations.', 'Follows Fran, a young man obsessed with Eurovision, and his eccentric bunch of friends who live the most crazy and bizarre situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulaOhm65YA6J9oJUXfXvqzsjNZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24817'),
  ('442069078346053145', 'The Year Without a Santa Claus', 1974, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Arthur Rankin, Jr., Jules Bass, Maury Laws', 'William J. Keenan', 'Shirley Booth, Mickey Rooney, Dick Shawn, George S. Irving, Bob McFadden, Rhoda Mann, Bradley Bolke, Ron Marshall', 'G', 'Feeling forgotten by the children of the world, old St. Nick decides to skip his gift-giving journey and take a vacation. Mrs. Claus and two spunky little elves, Jingle and Jangle, set out to see to where all the season''s cheer has disappeared. Aided by a magical snowfall, they reawaken the spirit of Christmas in children''s hearts and put Santa back in action.', 'Feeling forgotten by the children of the world, old St. Nick decides to skip his gift-giving journey and take a vacation. Mrs. Claus and two spunky little elves, Jingle and Jangle, set out to see to where all the season''s cheer has disappeared. Aided by a magical snowfall, they reawaken the spirit of Christmas in children''s hearts and put Santa back in action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gc5vz1sZXk1DilIzkQLZ2ujuiWQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13397'),
  ('428065014531807181', 'The Yearling', 1946, 'Drama, Family, Western', 'Clarence Brown, Charles Rosher, Leonard Smith', 'Paul Osborn', 'Gregory Peck, Jane Wyman, Claude Jarman Jr., Chill Wills, Clem Bevans, Margaret Wycherly, Henry Travers, Forrest Tucker', null, 'Jody convinces his parents to allow him to adopt a young deer, but what will happen if the deer misbehaves?', 'Jody convinces his parents to allow him to adopt a young deer, but what will happen if the deer misbehaves?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4N8oYLpY82ev7waXz7zwu7Ph1o1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19049'),
  ('1081187351584572387', 'The Yearling', 1994, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Rod Hardy, David Connell', null, 'Peter Strauss, Jean Smart, Wil Horneff, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Jarred Blancard, Brad Greenquist, Nancy Moore Atchison, Mary Nell Santacroce', 'NR', 'Ma and Pa Baxter have battled bears, floods, rattlesnakes, hunger, disease, and ornery neighbors for years, but somehow they''ve prevailed during the toughest pioneer times. Now it''s their son, Jody, who will face his own set of challenges. Young Jody Baxter is growing up fast on his parents'' modest farm. With three brothers and sisters lost to illness, he''s had to work the land just as hard as his daddy. When his only real friend goes "to visit the angels," Jody gets lonely and longs for a pet to share his life. "Flag," an orphaned fawn is his new adopted playmate. With a rekindled spirit, Jody and Flag become an inseparable pair - playing, exploring, and discovering their youthful world. But the new-found joy is only temporary; Flag has become a powerful yearling. When he threatens the family''s survival, Jody is faced with the toughest choice of his young life.', 'Ma and Pa Baxter have battled bears, floods, rattlesnakes, hunger, disease, and ornery neighbors for years, but somehow they''ve prevailed during the toughest pioneer times. Now it''s their son, Jody, who will face his own set of challenges. Young Jody Baxter is growing up fast on his parents'' modest farm. With three brothers and sisters lost to illness, he''s had to work the land just as hard as his daddy. When his only real friend goes "to visit the angels," Jody gets lonely and longs for a pet to share his life. "Flag," an orphaned fawn is his new adopted playmate. With a rekindled spirit, Jody and Flag become an inseparable pair - playing, exploring, and discovering their youthful world. But the new-found joy is only temporary; Flag has become a powerful yearling. When he threatens the family''s survival, Jody is faced with the toughest choice of his young life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4McY7YQWMOqtOwvDNwURM3jLJnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324011'),
  ('435057772861824162', 'The Yellow Birds', 2018, 'War, Drama', 'Alexandre Moors, Daniel Landin', 'David Lowery, R.F.I. Porto', 'Tye Sheridan, Alden Ehrenreich, Jennifer Aniston, Jack Huston, Jason Patric, Toni Collette, Lee Tergesen, Aylin Tezel', 'R', 'Two young soldiers, Bartle and Murph, navigate the terrors of the Iraq war under the command of the older, troubled Sergeant Sterling. All the while, Bartle is tortured by a promise he made to Murph''s mother before their deployment.', 'Two young soldiers, Bartle and Murph, navigate the terrors of the Iraq war under the command of the older, troubled Sergeant Sterling. All the while, Bartle is tortured by a promise he made to Murph''s mother before their deployment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSeZHcgmiNs6s5vfuIKHcQm84eA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383585'),
  ('1069082000322985074', 'The Yellow Eyes of Crocodiles', 2014, 'Drama', 'Cécile Telerman, Pascal Ridao, Colin Houben', 'Charlotte De Champfleury, Cécile Telerman', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Julie Depardieu, Patrick Bruel, Alice Isaaz, Jacques Weber, Karole Rocher, Édith Scob, Samuel Le Bihan', null, 'Josephine and Iris, sisters with opposite personalities, have their relationship radically transformed while working on a book.', 'Josephine and Iris, sisters with opposite personalities, have their relationship radically transformed while working on a book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRhLaXepn0Bib67NLmHhvOnxQcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260312'),
  ('54491204451441292', 'The yellow gloves', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Vassilis Mariolis, Panagiotis Konstadinou', 'Christos Giannakopoulos, Alekos Sakellarios', 'Nikos Stavridis, Maro Kodou, Mimis Fotopoulos, Giannis Gionakis, Martha Vourtsi, Ivonni Vladimirou, Pantelis Zervos, Niki Linardou', null, 'When it comes to his wife, Orestis is suspicious of everything, be it a moustachioed chauffeur or a lost pair of bumblebee-yellow gloves. But, are his fears justified or is this case of the lost fashion accessories a big misunderstanding?', 'When it comes to his wife, Orestis is suspicious of everything, be it a moustachioed chauffeur or a lost pair of bumblebee-yellow gloves. But, are his fears justified or is this case of the lost fashion accessories a big misunderstanding?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnpfgfD2jCeT4QtxKbRaqy8B4Sa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296993'),
  ('1082899329928220536', 'The Yellow Handkerchief', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yoji Yamada, Tetsuo Takaha, Keiji Igarashi', 'Yoshitaka Asama, Yoji Yamada', 'Ken Takakura, Chieko Baisho, Tetsuya Takeda, Kaori Momoi, Kiyoshi Atsumi, Hisao Dazai, Mari Okamoto, Hachiro Tako', null, 'A convict, newly released from prison for murder, joins two strangers on a road trip through Hokkaido to visit his ex-wife, whom he hasn''t seen in four years, knowing that if she puts a yellow handkerchief on the window, it would mean that she wants him back at home.', 'A convict, newly released from prison for murder, joins two strangers on a road trip through Hokkaido to visit his ex-wife, whom he hasn''t seen in four years, knowing that if she puts a yellow handkerchief on the window, it would mean that she wants him back at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xj0J9fr0Utz48GqLgEx6JB643HN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22557'),
  ('434416817191145746', 'The Yellow Handkerchief', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Udayan Prasad, Chris Menges', 'Yoji Yamada, Yoshitaka Asama', 'William Hurt, Maria Bello, Kristen Stewart, Eddie Redmayne, Kaori Momoi, Emanuel Cohn, Nurith Cohn, Veronica Russell', 'PG-13', 'A road trip through Louisiana transforms three strangers who were originally brought together by their respective feelings of loneliness.', 'A road trip through Louisiana transforms three strangers who were originally brought together by their respective feelings of loneliness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYX4UmT6sIQFjPReliYFZ2IuGCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22556'),
  ('1151672699687073451', 'The Yellow Mercedes', 1993, 'Comedy, Action, Drama', 'Tunç Okan', 'Tunç Okan', 'İlyas Salman, Valérie Lemoine, Micky Sébastian, Alexander Gittinger, Savaş Yurttaş, Saadet Gürses, Menderes Samancılar, Serra Yılmaz', null, 'The film is based on ''Fikrimin Ince Gulu'', a novel by Adalet Agaoglu, which depicts a first generation gurbetci/guest-worker returning home. It covers his land journey in short bursts from Germany to the Turkey''s west border - and extensively from thereon to his village close to Ankara - capital of Turkey. He begins his journey purchasing a second hand yellow Mercedes - possibly his first car - using his meager savings working as a laborer. Offering deep insight into the mind of a manual laborer Bayram (Ilyas Salman) making his first trip back home, resorting to flashbacks in highlighting Bayram''s motivation and experiences from his childhood right up to the events leading to his first departure from Turkey to Germany.', 'The film is based on ''Fikrimin Ince Gulu'', a novel by Adalet Agaoglu, which depicts a first generation gurbetci/guest-worker returning home. It covers his land journey in short bursts from Germany to the Turkey''s west border - and extensively from thereon to his village close to Ankara - capital of Turkey. He begins his journey purchasing a second hand yellow Mercedes - possibly his first car - using his meager savings working as a laborer. Offering deep insight into the mind of a manual laborer Bayram (Ilyas Salman) making his first trip back home, resorting to flashbacks in highlighting Bayram''s motivation and experiences from his childhood right up to the events leading to his first departure from Turkey to Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bq0HI8RyqdqrVX31SDEmVD2vDw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300953'),
  ('181038811471435080', 'The Yellow Mountain', 1954, 'Western', 'Jesse Hibbs, Ronald R. Rondell, George Robinson', 'George Zuckerman, Russell S. Hughes', 'Lex Barker, Mala Powers, Howard Duff, William Demarest, John McIntire, Leo Gordon, Dayton Lummis, Hal K. Dawson', 'NR', 'A formula brawling-buddies western where one goes bad and then returns to the fold. Pete Menlo owns some gold claims in Nevada where he is joined by his old friend Andy Martin. Crooked mine-owner Bannon wants to merge their interests so they can create a monopoly but is turned down. Pete is interested in "Nevada" Wray, daughter of mine-owner "Jackpot" Wray, but she has eyes only for Andy. The rejected Pete joins forces with Bannon and they learn that, because of location, "Jackpot" Wray may be the owner of all the gold in the respective veins. Bannon and his men try to get rid of Andy.', 'A formula brawling-buddies western where one goes bad and then returns to the fold. Pete Menlo owns some gold claims in Nevada where he is joined by his old friend Andy Martin. Crooked mine-owner Bannon wants to merge their interests so they can create a monopoly but is turned down. Pete is interested in "Nevada" Wray, daughter of mine-owner "Jackpot" Wray, but she has eyes only for Andy. The rejected Pete joins forces with Bannon and they learn that, because of location, "Jackpot" Wray may be the owner of all the gold in the respective veins. Bannon and his men try to get rid of Andy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uj8VoHWReDUtV3a01R4xRKIHab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223611'),
  ('1033556660171126210', 'The Yellow Panther', 1982, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Giorgio Capitani, Marzio Casa, Giorgio Di Battista', 'Sergio Nasca, Franco Marotta, Laura Toscano', 'Lino Banfi, Agostina Belli, Nando Paone, Chris Avram, Aldo Massasso, Gordon Mitchell, Fabrizia Castagnoli, Luca Biagini', null, 'Pasquale Bellachioma, the unfortunate Police Commissioner, creates a "master stroke" that can finally put it to light before their superiors, but the results is continuous failure.', 'Pasquale Bellachioma, the unfortunate Police Commissioner, creates a "master stroke" that can finally put it to light before their superiors, but the results is continuous failure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDawkXHAzThKPV954FCvSk76BPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72981'),
  ('518241181923925197', 'The Yellow Rolls-Royce', 1964, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Anthony Asquith, Jack Hildyard, Kip Gowans', 'Terence Rattigan', 'Ingrid Bergman, Rex Harrison, Shirley MacLaine, Jeanne Moreau, George C. Scott, Omar Sharif, Alain Delon, Art Carney', 'NR', 'One Rolls-Royce belongs to three vastly different owners, starting with Lord Charles, who buys the car for his wife as an anniversary present. The next owner is Paolo Maltese, a mafioso who purchases the car during a trip to Italy and leaves it with his girlfriend while he returns to Chicago. Finally, the car is owned by American widow Gerda, who joins the Yugoslavian resistance against the invading Nazis.', 'One Rolls-Royce belongs to three vastly different owners, starting with Lord Charles, who buys the car for his wife as an anniversary present. The next owner is Paolo Maltese, a mafioso who purchases the car during a trip to Italy and leaves it with his girlfriend while he returns to Chicago. Finally, the car is owned by American widow Gerda, who joins the Yugoslavian resistance against the invading Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LgXARrIIafiBk0sImU83NUo4Sr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47616'),
  ('543378488114147024', 'The Yellow Rose of Texas', 1944, 'Western, Action', 'Joseph Kane, Jack A. Marta', 'Jack Townley', 'Roy Rogers, Dale Evans, Grant Withers, Harry Shannon, George Cleveland, Weldon Heyburn, Hal Taliaferro, Tom London', null, 'Insurance Investigator Roy is looking for Weston and the missing money he supposedly obtained in a robbery. When he catches him and listens to his story, he changes his mind about him. A freak accident locates the missing money box and they find the seal unbroken. Roy then announces the box will be opened at the showboat that evening.', 'Insurance Investigator Roy is looking for Weston and the missing money he supposedly obtained in a robbery. When he catches him and listens to his story, he changes his mind about him. A freak accident locates the missing money box and they find the seal unbroken. Roy then announces the box will be opened at the showboat that evening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMclPty4Q4kvdmjg9vo8CkenD6a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130956'),
  ('436563087493817123', 'The Yellow Scarf', 2000, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Janusz Morgenstern, Witold Adamek', null, 'Janusz Gajos, Danuta Szaflarska, Krystyna Janda, Joanna Sienkiewicz, Małgorzata Zajączkowska, Grażyna Wolszczak, Jerzy Schejbal, Czesław Nogacki', null, 'The main character - a man who suffers from alcoholism - wants to change his tumultuous life. The day before Christmas Eve he receives a gift from his son - a yellow scarf. A gift is a kind of talisman he receives from loved ones, and every time he loses it. When after another banquet he falls into delirium, his ex-wife and secretary bring him to his mother. She helps him to sober up and arranges holiday celebration for two of them. She gives her son another yellow scarf, in belief that it will help him break the pernicious habit.', 'The main character - a man who suffers from alcoholism - wants to change his tumultuous life. The day before Christmas Eve he receives a gift from his son - a yellow scarf. A gift is a kind of talisman he receives from loved ones, and every time he loses it. When after another banquet he falls into delirium, his ex-wife and secretary bring him to his mother. She helps him to sober up and arranges holiday celebration for two of them. She gives her son another yellow scarf, in belief that it will help him break the pernicious habit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFpE8zq73SiHGaR9JqFVFzInwWF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139201'),
  ('958095212989459419', 'The Yellow Sea', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Hwang Sun-wook, Lee Seong-je, Na Hong-jin', 'Na Hong-jin', 'Ha Jung-woo, Kim Yun-seok, Cho Seong-ha, Lee Cheol-min, Kwak Do-won, Im Ye-won, Tak Sung-eun, Lee El', 'R', 'A Korean man in China takes an assassination job in South Korea to make money and find his missing wife. But when the job is botched, he is forced to go on the run from the police and the gangsters who paid him.', 'A Korean man in China takes an assassination job in South Korea to make money and find his missing wife. But when the job is botched, he is forced to go on the run from the police and the gangsters who paid him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16Pkg2ChCdACbBKVIAPAZtLL6eb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57361'),
  ('607570757495315461', 'The Yellow Star: The Persecution of the Jews in Europe - 1933-1945', 1981, 'Documentary', 'Dieter Hildebrandt', null, 'Friedhelm Ptok, Alexander Scourby', null, 'This Oscar nominated documentary serves not only as a remembrance but a lesson and a warning for the future. It follows the plight of Europe''s Jews during the terrifying period from 1933 until the final defeat of the Third Reich in 1945. Never before had the world seen such contempt for human life on such a grand scale, the murder of an estimated 6 million Jews, with countless others persecuted. During the 1930s a wave of national fervor swept through a tumultuous Germany; people looked for answers, and the politicians were all too willing to point the finger of blame towards the Jewish population. Few, if any, could have foreseen how the views of one man would unfold…that man was Adolf Hitler.', 'This Oscar nominated documentary serves not only as a remembrance but a lesson and a warning for the future. It follows the plight of Europe''s Jews during the terrifying period from 1933 until the final defeat of the Third Reich in 1945. Never before had the world seen such contempt for human life on such a grand scale, the murder of an estimated 6 million Jews, with countless others persecuted. During the 1930s a wave of national fervor swept through a tumultuous Germany; people looked for answers, and the politicians were all too willing to point the finger of blame towards the Jewish population. Few, if any, could have foreseen how the views of one man would unfold…that man was Adolf Hitler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIXSoMfwTQGEpRtXv5uNjENUlml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136678'),
  ('1125394169775459566', 'The Yellow Ticket', 1931, 'Drama', 'Raoul Walsh, R.L. Hough, James Wong Howe', 'Jules Furthman, Guy Bolton', 'Elissa Landi, Lionel Barrymore, Laurence Olivier, Mischa Auer, Edwin Maxwell, Walter Byron, Arnold Korff, Rita La Roy', 'NR', 'A young Russian girl is forced into a life of prostitution in Czarist Russia, and she and a British journalist find their lives endangered when she reveals to him information regarding the social crimes rampant in her country.', 'A young Russian girl is forced into a life of prostitution in Czarist Russia, and she and a British journalist find their lives endangered when she reveals to him information regarding the social crimes rampant in her country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2vUmeDBZ6hrXW6CI4IHF7ie583.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120847'),
  ('347911125359194081', 'The Yes Man', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Riccardo Milani, Andrea Molaioli, Daniele Luchetti', 'Daniele Luchetti, Sandro Petraglia, Stefano Rulli', 'Silvio Orlando, Nanni Moretti, Giulio Brogi, Anne Roussel, Angela Finocchiaro, Graziano Giusti, Lucio Allocca, Dario Cantarelli', 'NR', 'Cesare Botero, an ambitious and corrupt young minister, hires a new spokesman, honest and polite high school professor Luciano Sandulli.', 'Cesare Botero, an ambitious and corrupt young minister, hires a new spokesman, honest and polite high school professor Luciano Sandulli.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TSJBG8fBaoQz6inumXsc3S5K22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57110'),
  ('762809679020710021', 'The Yes Men', 2003, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Dan Ollman, Sarah Price, Chris Smith', null, 'Mike Bonanno, Andy Bichlbaum, Michael Moore, Patrick Lichty, Sal Salamone, Phil Bayly, Andy Bichlbaum, Philip De Lorenzo', null, 'A comic, biting and revelatory documentary following a small group of prankster activists as they gain worldwide notoriety for impersonating the World Trade Organization (WTO) on television and at business conferences around the world.', 'A comic, biting and revelatory documentary following a small group of prankster activists as they gain worldwide notoriety for impersonating the World Trade Organization (WTO) on television and at business conferences around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbwXEMe4fz6hj3ySwgstRJx38Wz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3396'),
  ('1005653356951736048', 'The Yes Men Fix the World', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Andy Bichlbaum, Mike Bonanno, Kurt Engfehr', 'Mike Bonanno, Andy Bichlbaum', 'Andy Bichlbaum, Mike Bonanno, Reggie Watts', null, 'THE YES MEN FIX THE WORLD is a screwball true story about two gonzo political activists who, posing as top executives of giant corporations, lie their way into big business conferences and pull off the world''s most outrageous pranks.', 'THE YES MEN FIX THE WORLD is a screwball true story about two gonzo political activists who, posing as top executives of giant corporations, lie their way into big business conferences and pull off the world''s most outrageous pranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6eVleb6nkqjxUfLPRS5GwSKlA9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18489'),
  ('564600130154021326', 'The Yesterday Machine', 1965, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Russ Marker, Ralph K. Johnson', 'Russ Marker', 'Tim Holt, Jack Herman, James Britton, Ann Pellegrino, Robert Bob Kelly, Linda Jenkins, Carol Gilley, Olga Powel', 'NR', 'A Nazi scientist invents a time machine enabling him to go back to alter the events of WWII.', 'A Nazi scientist invents a time machine enabling him to go back to alter the events of WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztcJIy03cEoeQpWvs6uSd72WLHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93629'),
  ('250619920310553987', 'The Yin Yang Master', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Wang Boxue, Li Weiran', 'Even Jian, Zhang Jialu', 'Chen Kun, Zhou Xun, William Chan, Qu Chuxiao, Wang Likun, Shen Yue, Wang Zixuan, Wu Xinzun', 'NR', 'The world is on the verge of a devastating war with monsters who are coming to retrieve the Scaling Stone. Yin Yang Master Qingming''s life is in danger and he travels to different worlds to prepare for the upcoming assaults. On his journey, Qingming finds that the key to all the calamities is embracing his hybrid identity of both human and monster.', 'The world is on the verge of a devastating war with monsters who are coming to retrieve the Scaling Stone. Yin Yang Master Qingming''s life is in danger and he travels to different worlds to prepare for the upcoming assaults. On his journey, Qingming finds that the key to all the calamities is embracing his hybrid identity of both human and monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RJwhxEtEFZKC8ogLJ4eBwr42yc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758902'),
  ('1015719491511527606', 'The Yin Yang Master Zero', 2024, 'Fantasy, History, Mystery', 'Shimako Sato, Kensuke Sonomura, Akira Sako', 'Shimako Sato', 'Kento Yamazaki, Shota Sometani, Nao, Masanobu Ando, Nijiro Murakami, Rihito Itagaki, Jun Kunimura, Kazuki Kitamura', null, 'During the Heian period, Abe no Seimei trains in magic but lacks interest, until a collaboration with Minamoto no Hiromasa arises to solve a strange phenomenon.', 'During the Heian period, Abe no Seimei trains in magic but lacks interest, until a collaboration with Minamoto no Hiromasa arises to solve a strange phenomenon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPDepwJfcR5u4FBpRPaxi848nsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1201210'),
  ('205267416353832984', 'The Yin-Yang Master: Dream of Eternity', 2020, 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Randy Che, Edward Guo', 'Edward Guo', 'Mark Chao You-Ting, Deng Lun, Wang Ziwen, Wang Duo, Jessie Li, Xu Kaicheng, Sun Chenjun, Wang Qing', 'PG-13', 'Every few hundred years, the most powerful demon on earth—a snake demon—awakens, and the Yin-Yang Masters are summoned to the capital. Meanwhile, the Princess of the realm has her own plans, as she conspires to claim the demon’s power.', 'Every few hundred years, the most powerful demon on earth—a snake demon—awakens, and the Yin-Yang Masters are summoned to the capital. Meanwhile, the Princess of the realm has her own plans, as she conspires to claim the demon’s power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odgDN1po1j7cEVLeBhkVS0Oh4kC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:757860'),
  ('645254152556211114', 'The Young Americans', 1993, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Danny Cannon, Vernon Layton, Waldo Roeg', 'Danny Cannon, David Hilton', 'Harvey Keitel, Iain Glen, John Wood, Terence Rigby, Keith Allen, Craig Kelly, Thandiwe Newton, Viggo Mortensen', 'R', 'Experienced New York Police Detective John Harris is sent to London to help a local task force investigate a series of gangster killings organized by a new player in town, an American. With the help of a young teen wronged by gangsters, Harris navigates London''s seedy, drug-fuelled underworld in order to take down its new criminal empire.', 'Experienced New York Police Detective John Harris is sent to London to help a local task force investigate a series of gangster killings organized by a new player in town, an American. With the help of a young teen wronged by gangsters, Harris navigates London''s seedy, drug-fuelled underworld in order to take down its new criminal empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mCCxKnVew8tZJ9uDSc8TjbsOSp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24909'),
  ('980047044553338538', 'The Young and Prodigious T.S. Spivet', 2013, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Jean-Pierre Jeunet, Thomas Hardmeier, Jean-Andre Carriere', 'Jean-Pierre Jeunet', 'Kyle Catlett, Helena Bonham Carter, Judy Davis, Callum Keith Rennie, Niamh Wilson, Jakob Davies, Rick Mercer, Robert Maillet', 'PG', 'A 10-year-old child prodigy cartographer secretly leaves his family''s ranch in Montana where he lives with his cowboy father and scientist mother and travels across the country on board a freight train to receive an award at the Smithsonian Institute.', 'A 10-year-old child prodigy cartographer secretly leaves his family''s ranch in Montana where he lives with his cowboy father and scientist mother and travels across the country on board a freight train to receive an award at the Smithsonian Institute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmr4h0ZLguYsvxaVmjS0bguLcnB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157841'),
  ('653675653509534860', 'The Young Cannibals', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Scarlett Garland, Nigel Parkes-Davies, Liam Hejsak', 'Kris Carr, Sam Fowler', 'Megan Purvis, Samuel Freeman, Hannah Louise Howell, Benjamin Sarpong-Broni, Kim Spearman, Martin Thomas, David Patrick Stucky, Michael Haynes', null, 'Seven friends summon a monster when they are tricked into eating burgers made of human flesh.', 'Seven friends summon a monster when they are tricked into eating burgers made of human flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gfig9d2bSmoDkYyIia8fqZnBw2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517831'),
  ('406703989013155309', 'The Young Dragons', 1974, 'Action', 'John Woo', 'John Woo, Ni Kuang', 'Henry Yu Yang, Tanny Tien-Ni, Dean Shek Tin, Chiang Nan, Fung Hak-On, Ng Ming-Choi, Chin Yuet-Sang, Shing Fui-On', null, 'Powerful mobster Leung, protected by the dangerous Huan Fai, sells 200 Japanese weapons and ammo to a Chinese gang. He uses smuggler Luy Fu to bring the weapons but small-time thief Kim and his gang heist the shipment and dump the cargo into the sea. Meanwhile, Kim befriends Fan Ming, an undercover police office from Shanghai investigating Leung''s crimes.', 'Powerful mobster Leung, protected by the dangerous Huan Fai, sells 200 Japanese weapons and ammo to a Chinese gang. He uses smuggler Luy Fu to bring the weapons but small-time thief Kim and his gang heist the shipment and dump the cargo into the sea. Meanwhile, Kim befriends Fan Ming, an undercover police office from Shanghai investigating Leung''s crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QKr2yWGBXhxgqp91FmFiCx1tLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38040'),
  ('236101358652339741', 'The Young Fan', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Vanni Mastrantonio, Gian Alfonso Pacinotti, Renato Muro', 'Gian Alfonso Pacinotti, Gero Arnone', 'Gian Alfonso Pacinotti, Gero Arnone, Davide Barbafiera, Francesco Daniele, Chiara Palmeri, Domenico Procacci, Mauro Uzzeo, Giorgia Spinelli', null, 'In 1997, cartoonist Gipi was just starting his career when he received a letter from a fifteen-year-old fan who, expressing his love for his drawings and stories, asked only for a dedication that read "To Francesco." In 2017, Gipi discovered that this person had done the same thing to many other cartoonists over the course of twenty years, writing the same letter over and over again, always declaring his fifteenth birthday, expressing the same love for each recipient, and asking the same thing of each. With three friends, he then decided to search for the boy.', 'In 1997, cartoonist Gipi was just starting his career when he received a letter from a fifteen-year-old fan who, expressing his love for his drawings and stories, asked only for a dedication that read "To Francesco." In 2017, Gipi discovered that this person had done the same thing to many other cartoonists over the course of twenty years, writing the same letter over and over again, always declaring his fifteenth birthday, expressing the same love for each recipient, and asking the same thing of each. With three friends, he then decided to search for the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjVqZMs5QYzdUxFzAMDYtmfDUj4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538598'),
  ('207109772374991717', 'The Young Girls Turn 25', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, Agnès Varda', 'Agnès Varda', 'Catherine Deneuve, Agnès Varda, Michel Legrand, Jacques Perrin, Bertrand Tavernier, Mag Bodard, Bernard Evein, George Chakiris', null, 'Agnes Varda''s documentary of the celebrations arising from the 25th anniversary of her husband Jacques Demy''s film The Young Girls of Rochefort.', 'Agnes Varda''s documentary of the celebrations arising from the 25th anniversary of her husband Jacques Demy''s film The Young Girls of Rochefort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/moM5PJmIQ06dVqfmSwxzaDLyrmk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200381'),
  ('495602777088196036', 'The Young Guard', 1948, 'Drama, War', 'Sergei Gerasimov, Vladimir Rapoport, E. Volk', 'Sergei Gerasimov', 'Vladimir Ivanov, Inna Makarova, Nonna Mordyukova, Sergei Gurzo, Vyacheslav Tikhonov, Klara Luchko, Georgiy Yumatov, Tamara Makarova', null, 'In 1942, local teenagers are organizing the underground resistance in the city of Krasnodon during the Nazi occupation of Russia. The teens manage to outsmart the Nazis in their fight, and their activity lifts the spirits of the surviving citizens.', 'In 1942, local teenagers are organizing the underground resistance in the city of Krasnodon during the Nazi occupation of Russia. The teens manage to outsmart the Nazis in their fight, and their activity lifts the spirits of the surviving citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwp44V30Bx49fLFMkwyf6QhuCYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106248'),
  ('6870087953922115', 'The Young in Heart', 1938, 'Comedy', 'Richard Wallace, Leon Shamroy, Eric Stacey', 'Paul Osborn', 'Janet Gaynor, Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Roland Young, Billie Burke, Minnie Dupree, Paulette Goddard, Richard Carlson, Henry Stephenson', null, 'A family of confidence tricksters sets their sights on a very rich, very lonely old lady named Miss Fortune.', 'A family of confidence tricksters sets their sights on a very rich, very lonely old lady named Miss Fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecimQFwdSBQTNwdznb1d2EMuYLh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38023'),
  ('231015785418432246', 'The Young Karl Marx', 2017, 'History, Drama', 'Raoul Peck, Kolja Brandt', 'Raoul Peck, Pascal Bonitzer', 'August Diehl, Stefan Konarske, Vicky Krieps, Olivier Gourmet, Hannah Steele, Rolf Kanies, Niels-Bruno Schmidt, Alexander Scheer', null, '26 year-old Karl Marx embarks with his wife, Jenny, on the road to exile. In 1844 in Paris, he meets Friedrich Engels, an industrialist’s son, who has been investigating the sordid birth of the British working class. Engels, the dandy, provides the last piece of the puzzle to the young Karl Marx’s new vision of the world. Together, between censorship and the police’s repression, riots and political upheavals, they will lead the labor movement during its development into a modern era.', '26 year-old Karl Marx embarks with his wife, Jenny, on the road to exile. In 1844 in Paris, he meets Friedrich Engels, an industrialist’s son, who has been investigating the sordid birth of the British working class. Engels, the dandy, provides the last piece of the puzzle to the young Karl Marx’s new vision of the world. Together, between censorship and the police’s repression, riots and political upheavals, they will lead the labor movement during its development into a modern era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VwBXiCzXKJyHfRdVBb843m23dx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400020'),
  ('451061775894693000', 'The Young Lady and the Cellist', 1965, 'Animation', 'Jean-François Laguionie, Jean-François Laguionie', 'Jean-François Laguionie', null, null, 'A cellist attempts to rescue a woman swept out to sea, only to find he must battle a series of overly possesive sea creatures.', 'A cellist attempts to rescue a woman swept out to sea, only to find he must battle a series of overly possesive sea creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thVuYt7SKoRvSgVyyluJWQJN4VR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134762'),
  ('1100672420220093494', 'The Young Lieutenant', 2005, 'Drama, Crime', 'Caroline Champetier, Xavier Beauvois', 'Cédric Anger', 'Nathalie Baye, Jalil Lespert, Roschdy Zem, Antoine Chappey, Jacques Perrin, Xavier Beauvois, Patrick Chauvel, Jean-Charles Dumay', null, 'A rookie policeman from provincial Le Havre volunteers for the high pressure Parisian homicide bureau and is assigned to a middle-aged woman detective.', 'A rookie policeman from provincial Le Havre volunteers for the high pressure Parisian homicide bureau and is assigned to a middle-aged woman detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIjrRfBacqZ1XbGbwbHtYVauBHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12455'),
  ('1038471017801065553', 'The Young Lions', 1958, 'War, Drama, Action', 'Joseph MacDonald, Edward Dmytryk, Ad Schaumer', 'Edward Anhalt', 'Marlon Brando, Montgomery Clift, Dean Martin, Hope Lange, Barbara Rush, May Britt, Maximilian Schell, Dora Doll', null, 'The lives of three young men, a German and two Americans, during WWII.', 'The lives of three young men, a German and two Americans, during WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7o0UhkzH01DhAP3JsMLoNPQnoqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40739'),
  ('561984088446900836', 'The Young Lovers', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Carine Tardieu, Elin Kirschfink', 'Sólveig Anspach, Agnès de Sacy, Carine Tardieu', 'Fanny Ardant, Melvil Poupaud, Cécile de France, Florence Loiret Caille, Sharif Andoura, Sarah Henochsberg, Martin Laurent, Olenka Ilunga', null, 'Elegant, retired architect Shauna (70) crosses paths with Pierre, a happily married doctor in his 40s, who first made an impression on her in a brief meeting 15 years previously. Both are quite troubled to meet again and begin an affair. While Pierre’s family life is soon turned upside down, Shauna struggles with feelings she thought belonged to the past.', 'Elegant, retired architect Shauna (70) crosses paths with Pierre, a happily married doctor in his 40s, who first made an impression on her in a brief meeting 15 years previously. Both are quite troubled to meet again and begin an affair. While Pierre’s family life is soon turned upside down, Shauna struggles with feelings she thought belonged to the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tE0vxFfdhO4d67uYpaesVHZrajs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811211'),
  ('176612239617484840', 'The Young Magician', 1987, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Wit Dąbal, Tadeusz Proć, Witold Holtz', 'Waldemar Dziki', 'Rusty Jedwab, Edward Garson, Daria Trafankowska, Mariusz Benoit, Władysław Kowalski, Natasza Maraszek, Tomasz Klimasiewicz, Jan Machulski', null, 'A 12-year boy feels left out by his classmates because he has no interest in athletics. He finally discovers his calling when his parents take him to a magic show. Picked by the magician to be his helper during a trick he is drawn into the world of magic and wants to learn more. He becomes proficient in tricks and also discovers his telekinetic powers. Unfortunately that further alienates him from his peers and his parents are afraid of his powers. Things change when a national emergency arises and the government asks him to help. After success he becomes a hero and is accepted by all. Written by Polish Cinema Database.', 'A 12-year boy feels left out by his classmates because he has no interest in athletics. He finally discovers his calling when his parents take him to a magic show. Picked by the magician to be his helper during a trick he is drawn into the world of magic and wants to learn more. He becomes proficient in tricks and also discovers his telekinetic powers. Unfortunately that further alienates him from his peers and his parents are afraid of his powers. Things change when a national emergency arises and the government asks him to help. After success he becomes a hero and is accepted by all. Written by Polish Cinema Database.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycw7BMEHqjbEKB6l9PHm5MlWLj7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125069'),
  ('647818603421725658', 'The Young Master', 1980, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jackie Chan, Chen Chi-Hwa, Law Chi', 'Tung Lo, Edward Tang, Lau Tin-Chi', 'Jackie Chan, Yuen Biao, Wai Pak, Hwang In-shik, Lily Li, Sek Kin, Fung Hak-On, Lee Hoi-Sang', null, 'Youthful martial arts master Lung is searching for his missing brother, when he is mistaken for a criminal on the run. He must prove his innocence by solving the case himself, while local lawmen and merciless mercenaries are hot on his trail.', 'Youthful martial arts master Lung is searching for his missing brother, when he is mistaken for a criminal on the run. He must prove his innocence by solving the case himself, while local lawmen and merciless mercenaries are hot on his trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSZwTKQgY9pudxFOqxKCSf8r5qF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11563'),
  ('463359668900034999', 'The Young Messiah', 2016, 'Drama', 'Cyrus Nowrasteh, Joel Ransom', 'Betsy Giffen Nowrasteh, Cyrus Nowrasteh', 'Adam Greaves-Neal, Sara Lazzaro, Vincent Walsh, Sean Bean, Jonathan Bailey, Isabelle Adriani, Rory Keenan, Dorotea Mercuri', 'PG-13', 'Tells the story of Jesus Christ at age seven as he and his family depart Egypt to return home to Nazareth. Told from his childhood perspective, it follows young Jesus as he grows into his religious identity.', 'Tells the story of Jesus Christ at age seven as he and his family depart Egypt to return home to Nazareth. Told from his childhood perspective, it follows young Jesus as he grows into his religious identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubehK1ZnM0NQphchuaMeE4A1BZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318850'),
  ('462653894636498106', 'The Young Observant', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Davide Maldi, Davide Maldi', 'Micol Roubini, Davide Maldi', 'Luca Tufano, Mario Burlone, Lorenzo Carpani, Enrico Colombini, Cristian Dellamora, Damiano Oberoffer, Ernesto Alberti Violetti', null, 'In a prestigious hotel school, Luca learns the art of service. How much of his own freedom and adolescence must the young man give up to work at serving customers?', 'In a prestigious hotel school, Luca learns the art of service. How much of his own freedom and adolescence must the young man give up to work at serving customers?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGPWj6N7XXNfUhLOby0DkWXJZwr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616301'),
