  ('556865773376426138', 'The Young Victoria', 2009, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Jean-Marc Vallée, Hagen Bogdanski, Paul Inglis', 'Julian Fellowes', 'Emily Blunt, Rupert Friend, Paul Bettany, Miranda Richardson, Jim Broadbent, Thomas Kretschmann, Mark Strong, Jesper Christensen', 'PG', 'As the only legitimate heir of England''s King William, teenage Victoria gets caught up in the political machinations of her own family. Victoria''s mother wants her to sign a regency order, while her Belgian uncle schemes to arrange a marriage between the future monarch and Prince Albert, the man who will become the love of her life.', 'As the only legitimate heir of England''s King William, teenage Victoria gets caught up in the political machinations of her own family. Victoria''s mother wants her to sign a regency order, while her Belgian uncle schemes to arrange a marriage between the future monarch and Prince Albert, the man who will become the love of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGyuReyij3bPCtzJdSjTR8PR0pa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18320'),
  ('208701464303371547', 'The Younger Generation', 1929, 'Drama', 'Frank Capra, Tenny Wright', 'Sonya Levien', 'Jean Hersholt, Lina Basquette, Ricardo Cortez, Rex Lease, Rosa Rosanova, Syd Crossley, Martha Franklin, Joe Bordeaux', 'NR', 'Soap-opera about a social-climbing Jewish man and his old-world parents who are heartbroken by his rejection of them. Young Morris Goldfish follows his immigrant father into business. His ruthless business practices cause him to become a big success, and he moves the family to Park Avenue. They go, but were happier back on the East Side. Morris is ashamed of this parents and his humble origins, but learns in the end that there is more to life than money.', 'Soap-opera about a social-climbing Jewish man and his old-world parents who are heartbroken by his rejection of them. Young Morris Goldfish follows his immigrant father into business. His ruthless business practices cause him to become a big success, and he moves the family to Park Avenue. They go, but were happier back on the East Side. Morris is ashamed of this parents and his humble origins, but learns in the end that there is more to life than money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjdA2gKcL8CQAGLvnvNqDw3B39T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204643'),
  ('1091891810223137582', 'The Youngest Sister-in-law', 2019, 'Romance', 'Kye Jang-hyuk', null, 'Han Seo-ah, Kim Ji-ah, Min Do-yoon, Park Do-jin', null, 'One day, her family gathers for an offering and they worry that she''s the only one without a boyfriend. Her brother-in-law, Ho-seok, sets her up on a blind date with his colleague, Min-soo, who has always been nice to him. The more she talks to Min-soo, the more Seo-ri realizes she is interested in her brother-in-law, Ho-seok. She then tries to meet up with him frequently.', 'One day, her family gathers for an offering and they worry that she''s the only one without a boyfriend. Her brother-in-law, Ho-seok, sets her up on a blind date with his colleague, Min-soo, who has always been nice to him. The more she talks to Min-soo, the more Seo-ri realizes she is interested in her brother-in-law, Ho-seok. She then tries to meet up with him frequently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hC9yqXygRNVDz2B9NfZocqmhczM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654374'),
  ('491985748650968224', 'The Youth Killer', 1976, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Kazuhiko Hasegawa, Shinji Sōmai, Tatsuo Suzuki', 'Tsutomu Tamura', 'Yutaka Mizutani, Mieko Harada, Etsuko Ichihara, Ryōhei Uchida, Kazuko Shirakawa, Jun Etoh, Kaori Momoi, Takeo Chii', null, 'Though his parents help him run the family business, Jun still feels persecuted by their love; when they bar him from meeting with his girlfriend, tensions increase.', 'Though his parents help him run the family business, Jun still feels persecuted by their love; when they bar him from meeting with his girlfriend, tensions increase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pttf3JWlMZyP8bbvY2c5a015jJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96754'),
  ('208461567089393003', 'The Youth of Maxim', 1935, 'War, Drama, History', 'Grigori Kozintsev, Leonid Trauberg, Nadezhda Kosheverova', 'Leonid Trauberg, Grigori Kozintsev', 'Boris Chirkov, Valentina Kibardina, Mikhail Tarkhanov, Stepan Kayukov, Boris Blinov, Aleksandr Kulakov, Vladimir Sladkopevtsev, Pavel Volkov', null, 'A 1935 USA trade-paper reviewer called it... "an impressive and technically outstanding historical drama dealing with czarist terrorism and revolutionary boiling in the days of 1907. Picture is one of the Soviet prize winners and has particular merits in realistic performance, photography and movement, plus some musical touches in way of folk songs." Written by Les Adams', 'A 1935 USA trade-paper reviewer called it... "an impressive and technically outstanding historical drama dealing with czarist terrorism and revolutionary boiling in the days of 1907. Picture is one of the Soviet prize winners and has particular merits in realistic performance, photography and movement, plus some musical touches in way of folk songs." Written by Les Adams', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6CtXq8Hb3acOnk0r309xDgpK19.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173995'),
  ('578985205503862261', 'The Youth of Peter', 1981, 'History, Drama', 'Sergei Gerasimov, Sergey Filippov, Horst Hardt', 'Sergei Gerasimov, Yuriy Kavtaradze', 'Dmitriy Zolotukhin, Tamara Makarova, Natalya Bondarchuk, Nikolay Eryomenko, Oleg Strizhenov, Vadim Spiridonov, Mikhail Nozhkin, Peter Reusse', null, 'The years of the tsar’s adolescence and youth were permeated with deadly danger coming from some of the Boyars, the rebellious Streltsy and Tsarevna Sophia who aspired for power. But already at that early time Peter demonstrates a profound, bright intellect, a strong will and the sense of purpose, which help him disarm both his open and secret enemies.', 'The years of the tsar’s adolescence and youth were permeated with deadly danger coming from some of the Boyars, the rebellious Streltsy and Tsarevna Sophia who aspired for power. But already at that early time Peter demonstrates a profound, bright intellect, a strong will and the sense of purpose, which help him disarm both his open and secret enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7qZirBmr9ufxKCyyoFTLdqWW5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150285'),
  ('266293615712237077', 'The Zebra', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Martín Boege, Fernando Javier León Rodríguez', 'Fernando Javier León Rodríguez', 'Harold Torres, Jorge Adrián Espíndola, Leticia Huijara, Paulina Gaitán, Alejandra Ley, Jesús Ochoa, Raquel Pankowsky, Graciela Orozco', null, 'During the Mexican Revolution, Leandro and Odón, two war vultures, find a zebra. They mistakenly believe this to be an American horse and thus begin a journey in search of General Obregón, who they assume, will appoint them as colonels given their peculiar beast of burden. They partake in several adventures during their journey.', 'During the Mexican Revolution, Leandro and Odón, two war vultures, find a zebra. They mistakenly believe this to be an American horse and thus begin a journey in search of General Obregón, who they assume, will appoint them as colonels given their peculiar beast of burden. They partake in several adventures during their journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GGCqZkdHNGhU6X2cyQLD9CqZf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210588'),
  ('1106812859682401363', 'The Zen Diary', 2022, 'Drama', 'Yuji Nakae', 'Yuji Nakae', 'Kenji Sawada, Takako Matsu, Naomi Nishida, Toshinori Omi, Fumi Dan, Shōhei Hino, Tomoko Naraoka, Koihachi Takigawa', null, 'An essayist, he finds peace in his mountain life. His routine is pleasantly disturbed by occasional visits from Machiko, his editor and love interest, as he struggles to let go of his late wife''s ashes.', 'An essayist, he finds peace in his mountain life. His routine is pleasantly disturbed by occasional visits from Machiko, his editor and love interest, as he struggles to let go of his late wife''s ashes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sK72XkV6l0USVt2TqKrcZU3HN7I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024298'),
  ('24578145759786201', 'The Zero Boys', 1986, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Nico Mastorakis, Steven Shaw', 'Nico Mastorakis, Fred C. Perry', 'Daniel Hirsch, Kelli Maroney, Nicole Rio, Tom Shell, Jared Moses, Crystal Carson, Joe Estevez, Gary Jochimsen', null, 'A group of friends travel to a wilderness area to play a survival game. Soon they unexpectedly find themselves in a real-life survival situation.', 'A group of friends travel to a wilderness area to play a survival game. Soon they unexpectedly find themselves in a real-life survival situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYXu46nwTYsG5Uyp4ED3MVJemcB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109213'),
  ('747991667923002057', 'The Zero Hour', 2010, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Diego Velasco', 'Carolina Paiz, Diego Velasco', 'Zapata 666, Amanda Key, Erich Wildpret, Marisa Román, Albi De Abreu, Alejandro Furth, Steve Wilcox, Ana María Simón', 'R', 'The Zero Hour tells the story of the La Parca (Zapata 666), a fearsome assassin who is forced to kidnap a private clinic to save the love of his life, Ladydi (Amanda Key). They soonreached the police and a media circus with them, who make our character into a national hero.La Parca finds that saving the life of Ladydi be difficult, but escaped with his followers will be an almost impossible task. Time starts to run out, and what seemed like a perfect plan will end in a frantic ending where La Parca is forced to confront past mistakes, and discover that their worst enemies are closer than he imagined.', 'The Zero Hour tells the story of the La Parca (Zapata 666), a fearsome assassin who is forced to kidnap a private clinic to save the love of his life, Ladydi (Amanda Key). They soonreached the police and a media circus with them, who make our character into a national hero.La Parca finds that saving the life of Ladydi be difficult, but escaped with his followers will be an almost impossible task. Time starts to run out, and what seemed like a perfect plan will end in a frantic ending where La Parca is forced to confront past mistakes, and discover that their worst enemies are closer than he imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YTFACNWVGaJSevR5mPU2UyEwnQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89495'),
  ('285497323127854195', 'The Zero Theorem', 2013, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Terry Gilliam, Serban Rotariu, Ingo Putze', 'Pat Rushin', 'Christoph Waltz, David Thewlis, Mélanie Thierry, Lucas Hedges, Matt Damon, Ben Whishaw, Tilda Swinton, Sanjeev Bhaskar', 'R', 'A computer hacker''s goal to discover the reason for human existence continually finds his work interrupted thanks to the Management; this time, they send a teenager and lusty love interest to distract him.', 'A computer hacker''s goal to discover the reason for human existence continually finds his work interrupted thanks to the Management; this time, they send a teenager and lusty love interest to distract him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2sEI9FOaJszidVatzIaaMPdLsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157834'),
  ('55920424718755059', 'The Zodiac', 2005, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Alexander Bulkley, Denis Maloney', 'Kelly Bulkley, Alexander Bulkley', 'Justin Chambers, Robin Tunney, Rory Culkin, William Mapother, Philip Baker Hall, Kathryn Howell, Brad William Henke, Rex Linn', 'R', 'An elusive serial killer known as the Zodiac terrorizes the San Francisco Bay in the late 1960s, while detectives aim to stop him before he claims more victims. Based on a true story.', 'An elusive serial killer known as the Zodiac terrorizes the San Francisco Bay in the late 1960s, while detectives aim to stop him before he claims more victims. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwhF9vVc9tyiSOxRJSKCey67lXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11345'),
  ('227905210857739722', 'The Zodiac Killer', 1971, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Wilson S. Hong, Robert Birchall, Manny Cardoza', 'Manny Cardoza, Ray Cantrell', 'Hal Reed, Bob Jones, Ray Lynch, Mary Darrington, Frank Sanabek, Ed Quigley, Bertha Dahl, Dion Marinkovich', 'R', 'The San Francisco area is beset by a series of seemingly random murders without motive or pattern. The police are taunted by phone calls and letters. Could the maniac be the violent truck driver, or the seemingly mild-mannered mailman, or even a cop?', 'The San Francisco area is beset by a series of seemingly random murders without motive or pattern. The police are taunted by phone calls and letters. Could the maniac be the violent truck driver, or the seemingly mild-mannered mailman, or even a cop?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aB67ya2zQhRevhLS5OxuGZ9atr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63959'),
  ('166213764819182556', 'The Zombie Diaries', 2006, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Michael G. Bartlett, Kevin Gates', 'Kevin Gates, Michael G. Bartlett', 'Russell Jones, Craig Stovin, Jonnie Hurn, Imogen Church, James Fisher, Anna Blades, Kyle Sparks, Alison Mollon', 'R', 'In the early part of the 21st Century, an unknown virus began spreading among the populous. Within weeks it had engulfed the entire planet, from the smallest communities to the greatest cities. Upon the death of its host, the virus would reanimate the corpse until it was no longer able to support itself. Soon the planet was infested with a new threat - the undead. So begins our journey into the dystopian world of the zombie diaries.', 'In the early part of the 21st Century, an unknown virus began spreading among the populous. Within weeks it had engulfed the entire planet, from the smallest communities to the greatest cities. Upon the death of its host, the virus would reanimate the corpse until it was no longer able to support itself. Soon the planet was infested with a new threat - the undead. So begins our journey into the dystopian world of the zombie diaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhThzAHVjdK5VWdLwosbbHIO11N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25035'),
  ('310071874999422836', 'The Zombie Diaries 2', 2011, 'Horror, Action', 'Michael G. Bartlett, Kevin Gates', 'Kevin Gates', 'Philip Brodie, Alix Wilton Regan, Rob Oldfield, Vicky Araico, Toby Bowman', null, 'Three months have passed since a viral outbreak wiped out 99.9% of the world''s population, turning its victims into flesh-eating living dead. In the UK, a surviving band of soldiers and civilians have taken refuge at a rural military barracks. Life in this new world is tough and brutal, but hope appears when a high level communication is received from a military base on the coast, telling of sanctuary elsewhere in Europe... But just as salvation appears to be in reach, the base suffers an overwhelming defeat at the hands of the living dead! The surviving handful of troops and civilians must now make their way to the coast to uncover the truth behind the message. Their perilous journey takes them across a now treacherous, death-ravaged landscape, where the living dead are vast in number and wandering bandits impose their own malicious sense of law and order. What follows is a journey into hell and a desperate battle against all odds for the very survival of the human race', 'Three months have passed since a viral outbreak wiped out 99.9% of the world''s population, turning its victims into flesh-eating living dead. In the UK, a surviving band of soldiers and civilians have taken refuge at a rural military barracks. Life in this new world is tough and brutal, but hope appears when a high level communication is received from a military base on the coast, telling of sanctuary elsewhere in Europe... But just as salvation appears to be in reach, the base suffers an overwhelming defeat at the hands of the living dead! The surviving handful of troops and civilians must now make their way to the coast to uncover the truth behind the message. Their perilous journey takes them across a now treacherous, death-ravaged landscape, where the living dead are vast in number and wandering bandits impose their own malicious sense of law and order. What follows is a journey into hell and a desperate battle against all odds for the very survival of the human race', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4Td3qhcUpOTObAB2xuiJou1Pjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68878'),
  ('1132889689800766507', 'The Zombie Walks', 1968, 'Crime', 'Alfred Vohrer, Karl Löb', 'Ladislas Fodor', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Siw Mattson, Hubert von Meyerinck, Wolfgang Kieling, Pinkas Braun, Claude Farell, Peter Mosbacher, Siegfried Rauch', null, 'A serial killer who calls himself "The Laughing Corpse" dresses up in a skeleton costume and kills his victims with a poison-filled scorpion-shaped ring.', 'A serial killer who calls himself "The Laughing Corpse" dresses up in a skeleton costume and kills his victims with a poison-filled scorpion-shaped ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXdlXaaRvMkyZKnbAcPfJMPsG4g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70538'),
  ('449848393494482448', 'The Zone', 2007, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Rodrigo Plá, Emiliano Villanueva', 'Rodrigo Plá, Laura Santullo', 'Daniel Giménez Cacho, Daniel Tovar, Alan Chávez, Carlos Bardem, Mario Zaragoza, Marina de Tavira, Maribel Verdú, Fernando Becerril', 'R', 'Residents of an enclosed neighborhood in the middle of Mexico DF are shocked by a violent crime, and for one resident in particular, young Alejandro, the drama is ratcheted up when he encounters the lone kid who escaped the event and is hiding out within the neighborhood''s borders.', 'Residents of an enclosed neighborhood in the middle of Mexico DF are shocked by a violent crime, and for one resident in particular, young Alejandro, the drama is ratcheted up when he encounters the lone kid who escaped the event and is hiding out within the neighborhood''s borders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAnUU7OB6QdnmYEd0R9veXVCXBr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15865'),
  ('1007786260669956955', 'The Zone of Interest', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Łukasz Żal, Mieszko Falana, Dominik Watin', 'Jonathan Glazer', 'Christian Friedel, Sandra Hüller, Johann Karthaus, Luis Noah Witte, Nele Ahrensmeier, Lilli Falk, Anastazja Drobniak, Cecylia Pekala', 'PG-13', 'The commandant of Auschwitz, Rudolf Höss, and his wife Hedwig, strive to build a dream life for their family in a house and garden next to the camp.', 'The commandant of Auschwitz, Rudolf Höss, and his wife Hedwig, strive to build a dream life for their family in a house and garden next to the camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUu9zyZmDd8VZegKi1iK1Vk0RYS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467244'),
  ('981834326574435657', 'The Zookeeper''s Wife', 2017, 'Drama, History, War', 'Niki Caro, Andrij Parekh', 'Angela Workman', 'Jessica Chastain, Daniel Brühl, Johan Heldenbergh, Michael McElhatton, Timothy Radford, Efrat Dor, Iddo Goldberg, Shira Haas', 'PG-13', 'The account of keepers of the Warsaw Zoo, Jan and Antonina Zabinski, who helped save hundreds of people and animals during the Nazi invasion.', 'The account of keepers of the Warsaw Zoo, Jan and Antonina Zabinski, who helped save hundreds of people and animals during the Nazi invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50KGpMiIvSkF4WHOgp0gM6r6sMU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289222'),
  ('475450676301784864', 'The Zoot Cat', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'William Hanna, Sara Berner, Billy Bletcher, Jerry Mann', null, 'Tom''s advances on a young jive-talking girl cat get nowhere; nowhere, that is, until Tom gets a zoot suit. Armed with his miles of fabric and a new cool lingo, Tom still has to deal with the tricks of his nemesis, Jerry.', 'Tom''s advances on a young jive-talking girl cat get nowhere; nowhere, that is, until Tom gets a zoot suit. Armed with his miles of fabric and a new cool lingo, Tom still has to deal with the tricks of his nemesis, Jerry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXaUbigE1gKQQ81LWTa34Pp23nm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40457'),
  ('404896960727493419', 'The Zoya Factor', 2019, 'Romance', 'Abhishek Sharma, Kunal Gupta, Deepesh Mendon', 'Neha Sharma, Pradhuman Singh', 'Dulquer Salmaan, Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Sanjay Kapoor, Angad Bedi, Sikandar Kher, Saurabh Shukla, Rahul Khanna, Anil Kapoor', null, 'An advertising agency executive Zoya Singh Solanki meets the Indian cricket team and ends up becoming their lucky charm at the 2011 Cricket World Cup.', 'An advertising agency executive Zoya Singh Solanki meets the Indian cricket team and ends up becoming their lucky charm at the 2011 Cricket World Cup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytLpoqycSAhMo5W7eHJyCXn8E2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604195'),
  ('399066505624049321', 'The Zurich Engagement', 1957, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Helmut Käutner, Heinz Pehlke', 'Helmut Käutner, Heinz Pauck', 'Liselotte Pulver, Paul Hubschmid, Bernhard Wicki, Wolfgang Lukschy, Roland Kaiser, Rudolf Platte, Werner Finck, Maria Sebaldt', null, 'Juliane Thomas is an ambitious but unemployed young writer. After breaking up with her lover she works at a dentist friend to make ends meet. One day she instantly falls in love with one of the patients (Jean Berner) and promptly writes a movie script about the encounter in which she projects her own fantasies about how things will turn out eventually. By coincidence this movie script is picked up by a film director who happens to be Berner''s closest friend and from then on things become very complicated...', 'Juliane Thomas is an ambitious but unemployed young writer. After breaking up with her lover she works at a dentist friend to make ends meet. One day she instantly falls in love with one of the patients (Jean Berner) and promptly writes a movie script about the encounter in which she projects her own fantasies about how things will turn out eventually. By coincidence this movie script is picked up by a film director who happens to be Berner''s closest friend and from then on things become very complicated...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwkLc8g5ciPb84lLE8x6TOscEqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115392'),
  ('96633564634476202', 'Theater Camp', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Molly Gordon, Nick Lieberman, Nate Hurtsellers', 'Noah Galvin, Nick Lieberman, Molly Gordon', 'Ben Platt, Molly Gordon, Noah Galvin, Jimmy Tatro, Caroline Aaron, Ayo Edebiri, Nathan Lee Graham, Owen Thiele', 'PG-13', 'After the indomitable and beloved founder of a scrappy theater camp in upstate New York falls into a coma, the eccentric staff must band together with her clueless "crypto-bro" son to keep the thespian paradise afloat.', 'After the indomitable and beloved founder of a scrappy theater camp in upstate New York falls into a coma, the eccentric staff must band together with her clueless "crypto-bro" son to keep the thespian paradise afloat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2osbLk1MMt9qjXPKSB2hMcBUyrw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:986054'),
  ('322769159786834874', 'Theatre of Blood', 1973, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Douglas Hickox, Wolfgang Suschitzky, Dominic Fulford', 'Anthony Greville-Bell', 'Vincent Price, Diana Rigg, Ian Hendry, Harry Andrews, Coral Browne, Robert Coote, Jack Hawkins, Michael Hordern', null, 'A Shakespearean actor takes poetic revenge on the critics who denied him recognition.', 'A Shakespearean actor takes poetic revenge on the critics who denied him recognition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jh2AYlIAeWyqgTPSqBeO8DleR3J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28498'),
  ('318571969159617689', 'Theatre of Death', 1967, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Gilbert Taylor, Samuel Gallu, Eric Rattray', 'Ellis Kadison, Roger Marshall', 'Christopher Lee, Julian Glover, Lelia Goldoni, Jenny Till, Evelyn Laye, Ivor Dean, Joseph Fürst, Betty Woolfe', null, 'The Theatre of Death in Paris specialises in horror presentations. A police surgeon finds himself becoming involved in the place through his attraction to one of the performers. When bloodless bodies start showing up all over town he realises there could be links with the theatre.', 'The Theatre of Death in Paris specialises in horror presentations. A police surgeon finds himself becoming involved in the place through his attraction to one of the performers. When bloodless bodies start showing up all over town he realises there could be links with the theatre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXn6083ciHnSlww3iYyWRg2hbOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109089'),
  ('26571876829242142', 'Theatre of Mr. and Mrs. Kabal', 1967, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Guy Durban, Brigitte Duvergé', 'Walerian Borowczyk', 'Louisette Rousseau, Pierre Collet, Louis Jojot, Renata Astruc, Jacqueline Boivin, Edith Catry, Yvonne Landry, Kathy Luc', null, '"Theatre of Mr. and Mrs. Kabal" is Walerian Borowczyk’s first feature-length film and his last animated film. It consists of a sequence of loosely connected scenes, much like a vaudeville program, in which Mr. and Mrs. Kabal perform absurd, surreal, and sometimes cruel acts.', '"Theatre of Mr. and Mrs. Kabal" is Walerian Borowczyk’s first feature-length film and his last animated film. It consists of a sequence of loosely connected scenes, much like a vaudeville program, in which Mr. and Mrs. Kabal perform absurd, surreal, and sometimes cruel acts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFtdDoX47aFCGp8lncvnaeR0Imd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256661'),
  ('394667548811640268', 'Theatre of War', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Lola Arias, Manuel Abramovich', 'Lola Arias', 'Marcelo Vallejo, Lou Armour, Rubén Otero, David Jackson, Gabriel Sagastume, Sukrim Rai, José Luis Aparicio, Mathias Arosemena', null, 'Theatre of War is an essay on how to represent war, performed by former enemies. British and Argentinian veterans of the Falklands war come together to discuss, rehearse and re-enact their memories 35 years after the conflict.', 'Theatre of War is an essay on how to represent war, performed by former enemies. British and Argentinian veterans of the Falklands war come together to discuss, rehearse and re-enact their memories 35 years after the conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chPfX8agASGN1Bre6c4oKcGOP9v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499670'),
  ('953213215660248547', 'Theatre: A Love Story', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kenji Maki, Isao Yukisada, Tsuyoshi Sugino', 'Ryuta Horai', 'Kento Yamazaki, Mayu Matsuoka, Kanichiro Sato, Sairi Ito, Shusaku Kamikawa, Ritsu Otomo, Satoru Iguchi, Masaki Miura', 'PG-13', 'The director of a theatre company is in crisis and his actors have lost confidence in him. One day he meets a woman wearing the same shoes as him, immediately sparking chemistry between the two.', 'The director of a theatre company is in crisis and his actors have lost confidence in him. One day he meets a woman wearing the same shoes as him, immediately sparking chemistry between the two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbQwLYgzTui77gr0drYG3xA4d8S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617397'),
  ('924886802706816742', 'Theeb', 2014, 'Adventure, Thriller, Drama', 'Naji Abu Nowar, Wolfgang Thaler, Chris Armstrong', 'Bassel Ghandour, Naji Abu Nowar', 'Jacir Eid Al-Hwietat, Hassan Mutlag Al-Maraiyeh, Hussein Salameh Al-Sweilhiyeen, Marji Audeh, Jack Fox', null, 'Set in the Arabian Desert of 1916, the film follows Theeb, a young Bedouin boy, and his brother Hussein as they leave the safety of their tribe to venture on a treacherous journey at the dawn of the Great Revolt. If Theeb is to survive he must quickly learn about adulthood, trust and betrayal.', 'Set in the Arabian Desert of 1916, the film follows Theeb, a young Bedouin boy, and his brother Hussein as they leave the safety of their tribe to venture on a treacherous journey at the dawn of the Great Revolt. If Theeb is to survive he must quickly learn about adulthood, trust and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qixAor6q0GDPXcMEVgVi2fnWMb9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287628'),
  ('564923002102115823', 'Theeran Adhigaaram Ondru', 2017, 'Action, Thriller', 'H. Vinoth, Sathyan Sooryan', 'H. Vinoth', 'Karthi, Rakul Preet Singh, Abhimanyu Singh, Bose Venkat, Sonia Bose Venkat, Manobala, Sathyan Sivakumar, R. N. R. Manohar', null, 'A hardnosed cop goes after a gang of ruthless dacoits who have been terrorising residents along the highway for a decade.', 'A hardnosed cop goes after a gang of ruthless dacoits who have been terrorising residents along the highway for a decade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocRAXgjqCO8n4sVNxjKLqr1waMy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456218'),
  ('331712313548428148', 'Theertharoopa Thandeyavarige', 2026, null, 'Ramenahalli Jagannatha', 'Ramenahalli Jagannatha, Prashanth Rajappa', 'Swetanshu Bora, Ajit Hande, Ashwitha R Hegde', null, 'A popular travel vlogger, Prithvi, uncovers a dark secret about his own family. His search for the truth leads him to his estranged father, setting him on a journey of self-discovery. Does Prithvi Find Closure? Does Destination Meet Destiny?', 'A popular travel vlogger, Prithvi, uncovers a dark secret about his own family. His search for the truth leads him to his estranged father, setting him on a journey of self-discovery. Does Prithvi Find Closure? Does Destination Meet Destiny?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FmfwcUim9bRJDsGRRXotzvj43xFD.jpg', 'plex:movie:theertharoopa-thandeyavarige'),
  ('753702758237793030', 'Their Distance', 2016, 'Romance', 'Hiroshi Iwanaga, Rikiya Imaizumi, Wataru Hiranami', 'Rikiya Imaizumi', 'Ren, Fumiko Aoyagi, Hanae Kan, Minhyun, Tateto Serizawa, Haruka Kinami', null, 'Reon is a young Korean man. He avoids contact with other people and works as an apprentice shoemaker. One after, he sees a woman Sona passed out and sleeping on a bench in the park. Reon doesn''t know why, but he can''t get her out of his mind. Meanwhile, Kokaze works in the same shoe shop with Reon and has feelings for him.', 'Reon is a young Korean man. He avoids contact with other people and works as an apprentice shoemaker. One after, he sees a woman Sona passed out and sleeping on a bench in the park. Reon doesn''t know why, but he can''t get her out of his mind. Meanwhile, Kokaze works in the same shoe shop with Reon and has feelings for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jW1smO8ayRG2rKJJOrg8gBw1Jma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394713'),
  ('396105062625392686', 'Their Eyes Were Watching God', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Darnell Martin, Checco Varese', null, 'Halle Berry, Ruben Santiago-Hudson, Michael Ealy, Ruby Dee, Terrence Howard, Nicki Micheaux, Lorraine Toussaint, Gabriel Casseus', 'NR', 'A drama set in the 1920s, where free-spirited Janie Crawford''s search for happiness leads her through several different marriages, challenging the morals of her small town. Based on the novel by Zora Neale Hurston.', 'A drama set in the 1920s, where free-spirited Janie Crawford''s search for happiness leads her through several different marriages, challenging the morals of her small town. Based on the novel by Zora Neale Hurston.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVn2KohzehZMN40YmNM69HqXxWm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17364'),
  ('580147962907071989', 'Their Finest', 2017, 'Romance, War, Drama', 'Lone Scherfig, Jack Ravenscroft, James Manning', 'Gaby Chiappe', 'Gemma Arterton, Sam Claflin, Bill Nighy, Jack Huston, Helen McCrory, Eddie Marsan, Jake Lacy, Rachael Stirling', 'R', 'During the Blitz of World War II, a female screenwriter works on a film celebrating England''s resilience as a way to buoy a weary populace''s spirits. Her efforts to dramatise the true story of two sisters who undertook their own maritime mission to rescue wounded soldiers are met with mixed feelings by a dismissive all-male staff.', 'During the Blitz of World War II, a female screenwriter works on a film celebrating England''s resilience as a way to buoy a weary populace''s spirits. Her efforts to dramatise the true story of two sisters who undertook their own maritime mission to rescue wounded soldiers are met with mixed feelings by a dismissive all-male staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tF0dhJfxzOjvkybJVfNPuuj5ClH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340101'),
  ('899229919300299051', 'Their First Mistake', 1932, 'Comedy', 'George Marshall, Art Lloyd', 'Oliver Hardy, Charley Rogers, James Parrott', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Mae Busch, Billy Gilbert, Marjorie Campbell, George Marshall', 'NR', 'Mrs Hardy is annoyed that her husband Oliver seems to spend more time with his friend Stanley than with her. After a furious argument, Mrs Hardy says that she is through if Ollie goes out with Stan again. Stan suggests that Ollie adopts a baby, which he does. Unfortunately, his wife has left their apartment on returning, and a process server delivers a paper informing Ollie that she is suing him for divorce, naming Stan as correspondent. The boys are now left to look after the infant on their own.', 'Mrs Hardy is annoyed that her husband Oliver seems to spend more time with his friend Stanley than with her. After a furious argument, Mrs Hardy says that she is through if Ollie goes out with Stan again. Stan suggests that Ollie adopts a baby, which he does. Unfortunately, his wife has left their apartment on returning, and a process server delivers a paper informing Ollie that she is suing him for divorce, naming Stan as correspondent. The boys are now left to look after the infant on their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Lkj0LDJ4PfT4ZMRioR2ugumnFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50907'),
  ('137458847592968880', 'Their Own Desire', 1929, 'Drama, Romance', 'E. Mason Hopper, William H. Daniels', 'Frances Marion', 'Norma Shearer, Robert Montgomery, Lewis Stone, Belle Bennett, Helene Millard, Cecil Cunningham, Henry Hebert, Mary Doran', null, 'Lally is a rich girl whose father writes books and plays polo. After 23 years of marriage her father decides to divorce Lally''s mother and remarry to soon-to-be-divorced Beth Cheever. This sours Lally on all men. While on vacation with her mother she meets Jack, who succeeds in stealing her heart. Then Lally discovers that Jack is the son of Beth Cheever, the woman who is to marry her father.', 'Lally is a rich girl whose father writes books and plays polo. After 23 years of marriage her father decides to divorce Lally''s mother and remarry to soon-to-be-divorced Beth Cheever. This sours Lally on all men. While on vacation with her mother she meets Jack, who succeeds in stealing her heart. Then Lally discovers that Jack is the son of Beth Cheever, the woman who is to marry her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZBKzVhozA3zI4aAmAYlBsmdzh2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99767'),
  ('660047165331434692', 'Their Purple Moment', 1928, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott', 'H.M. Walker', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Anita Garvin, Kay Deslys, Fay Holderness, Tiny Sandford, Lyle Tayo, Leo Willis', null, 'The boys sneak out for a night on the town, unaware that Stan''s wife has switched her grocery coupons for Stan''s secret stash of mad money. The boys run up a huge tab treating a couple of girls to dinner at a snazzy nightclub and much trouble ensues.', 'The boys sneak out for a night on the town, unaware that Stan''s wife has switched her grocery coupons for Stan''s secret stash of mad money. The boys run up a huge tab treating a couple of girls to dinner at a snazzy nightclub and much trouble ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSVlRg17irmf3NTZOPMII8I5MK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49543'),
  ('797990774347573801', 'Theirs Is the Glory', 1946, 'War, Documentary', 'C.M. Pennington-Richards, Brian Desmond Hurst', 'Louis Golding, Terence Young', 'Stanley Maxted, Geoff van Rijssel, Allan Wood, Thomas Scullion, Leo Genn', null, 'Re-enactment of World War 2 Battle of Arnhem using the survivors from the battle.', 'Re-enactment of World War 2 Battle of Arnhem using the survivors from the battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8wFmkv2Iq6Nk2xLONO7nMcPUaD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101004'),
  ('888328766397542099', 'Thelma', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Joachim Trier, Jakob Ihre, Halfdan Ullmann Tøndel', 'Joachim Trier, Eskil Vogt', 'Eili Harboe, Kaya Wilkins, Henrik Rafaelsen, Ellen Dorrit Petersen, Grethe Eltervåg, Marte Magnusdotter Solem, Anders Mossling, Vanessa Borgli', 'NR', 'A college student starts to experience extreme seizures. She soon learns that the violent episodes are a symptom of inexplicable abilities.', 'A college student starts to experience extreme seizures. She soon learns that the violent episodes are a symptom of inexplicable abilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fN2Qq5riCrBiVLfKqgODHC0SwVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401898'),
  ('317441734672640268', 'Thelma', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure', 'Chelsea Tummolo, Justin Hogan, Jeremy Gerke', 'Josh Margolin', 'June Squibb, Fred Hechinger, Richard Roundtree, Parker Posey, Clark Gregg, Malcolm McDowell, Nicole Byer, Coral Peña', 'PG-13', 'When 93-year-old Thelma Post gets duped by a phone scammer pretending to be her grandson, she sets out on a treacherous quest across the city to reclaim what was taken from her.', 'When 93-year-old Thelma Post gets duped by a phone scammer pretending to be her grandson, she sets out on a treacherous quest across the city to reclaim what was taken from her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUcuageYgv9SsJoWuc0seRWG6JC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1051891'),
  ('1069871863790614247', 'Thelma & Louise', 1991, 'Drama, Crime, Adventure', 'Ridley Scott, Adrian Biddle, Bobby Bass', 'Callie Khouri', 'Susan Sarandon, Geena Davis, Harvey Keitel, Michael Madsen, Christopher McDonald, Stephen Tobolowsky, Brad Pitt, Timothy Carhart', 'R', 'Taking a break from their dreary lives, close friends Thelma and Louise embark on a short weekend trip that ends in unforeseen incriminating circumstances. As fugitives, both women rediscover the strength of their bond and their newfound resilience.', 'Taking a break from their dreary lives, close friends Thelma and Louise embark on a short weekend trip that ends in unforeseen incriminating circumstances. As fugitives, both women rediscover the strength of their bond and their newfound resilience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQSUVGR80RVHxJywtwXm2qa1ebi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1541'),
  ('996370817478782564', 'Thelma the Unicorn', 2024, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Lynn Wang, Jared Hess', 'Jerusha Hess, Jared Hess', 'Brittany Howard, Will Forte, Jemaine Clement, Edi Patterson, Maliaka Mitchell, Ally Dixon, Fred Armisen, Zach Galifianakis', 'PG', 'Thelma dreams of being a glamorous unicorn. Then in a rare pink and glitter-filled moment of fate, Thelma''s wish comes true. She rises to instant international stardom, but at an unexpected cost. After a while, Thelma realizes that she was happier as her ordinary, sparkle-free self. So she ditches her horn, scrubs off her sparkles, and returns home, where her best friend is waiting for her with a hug.', 'Thelma dreams of being a glamorous unicorn. Then in a rare pink and glitter-filled moment of fate, Thelma''s wish comes true. She rises to instant international stardom, but at an unexpected cost. After a while, Thelma realizes that she was happier as her ordinary, sparkle-free self. So she ditches her horn, scrubs off her sparkles, and returns home, where her best friend is waiting for her with a hug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yutiEZ7taGDNau2jGjKIdDwQpDw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739547'),
  ('323334963540859013', 'Thelma, Louise et Chantal', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Benoît Pétré, Stephan Massis', 'Benoît Pétré', 'Jane Birkin, Caroline Cellier, Catherine Jacob, Thierry Lhermitte, Benoît Pétré, Alysson Paradis, Sébastien Huberdeau, Arié Elmaleh', null, 'Chantal, Gabrielle and Nelly, three fiftyish women, decide to make the trip to the wedding of an ex together.', 'Chantal, Gabrielle and Nelly, three fiftyish women, decide to make the trip to the wedding of an ex together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qx7f2KqIQHOGll5eb8aEU1Cx60I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57311'),
  ('520189822841819051', 'Thelonious Monk: Straight, No Chaser', 1988, 'Documentary, Music', 'Charlotte Zwerin', null, 'Jimmy Cleveland, Thelonious Monk, John Coltrane, Nellie Monk, Samuel E. Wright, Harry Colomby, Nica De Koenigswarter', 'PG-13', 'A documentary film about the life of pianist and jazz great Thelonious Monk. Features live performances by Monk and his band, and interviews with friends and family about the offbeat genius.', 'A documentary film about the life of pianist and jazz great Thelonious Monk. Features live performances by Monk and his band, and interviews with friends and family about the offbeat genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8My1tlPk7Bz5Q6hzIpNZShDj37T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41973'),
  ('1095739972134595193', 'Them', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Xavier Palud, Axel Cosnefroy, David Moreau', 'David Moreau, Xavier Palud', 'Olivia Bonamy, Michaël Cohen, Adriana Mocca, Maria Roman, Camelia Maxim, Alexandru Boghiu, Emanuel Stefanuc, Horia Ioan', 'R', 'Lucas and Clementine live peacefully in their isolated country house, but one night they wake up to strange noise. They''re not alone... and a group of hooded assailants begin to terrorize them throughout the night.', 'Lucas and Clementine live peacefully in their isolated country house, but one night they wake up to strange noise. They''re not alone... and a group of hooded assailants begin to terrorize them throughout the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEO9nGyCRGLNIb5kPPjdYAqJ4bO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10832'),
  ('751072791957325423', 'Them and Us', 1976, 'Drama, Crime', 'Svend Wam, Paul René Roestad, Petter Vennerød', 'Svend Wam', 'Torgeir Schjerven, Lasse Tømte, Kjersti Døvigen, Jorunn Kjellsby, Thomas Robsahm, Knut Pettersen, Liv Thorsen, Gunnar Alme', null, 'Lasse &amp; Geir, two suburban boys in their late teens, kick up a row on the bus into town, making the driver call the police. They get arrested and have to spend the night in jail. The next morning they are sent home - Geir to his alcoholic mother, Lasse to his disillusioned and abusive father.', 'Lasse &amp; Geir, two suburban boys in their late teens, kick up a row on the bus into town, making the driver call the police. They get arrested and have to spend the night in jail. The next morning they are sent home - Geir to his alcoholic mother, Lasse to his disillusioned and abusive father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8G2Pwyd6ipkFdtdnntISSr1ZGg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138456'),
  ('799006542358157386', 'Them Thar Hills', 1934, 'Comedy', 'Charley Rogers, Art Lloyd, Don Sandstrom', 'H.M. Walker, Stan Laurel', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Mae Busch, Charlie Hall, Billy Gilbert, Bobby Dunn, Richard Alexander, Sam Lufkin', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie travel to the mountains for Ollie''s health, and park their caravan near a well into which a gang of moonshiners have earlier dumped their moonshine; and the boys proceed to quench their thirst thinking that it is iron-rich mountain water. The real trouble doesn''t begin, though, until a married motoring couple stop by to borrow some gasoline, and the already-cranky husband leaves his thirsty wife with the boys while he goes off to refill his car''s empty gas-tank. A sequel was made to this film: TIT FOR TAT, q.v.', 'Stan and Ollie travel to the mountains for Ollie''s health, and park their caravan near a well into which a gang of moonshiners have earlier dumped their moonshine; and the boys proceed to quench their thirst thinking that it is iron-rich mountain water. The real trouble doesn''t begin, though, until a married motoring couple stop by to borrow some gasoline, and the already-cranky husband leaves his thirsty wife with the boys while he goes off to refill his car''s empty gas-tank. A sequel was made to this film: TIT FOR TAT, q.v.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmcLSa4Mz7eA2VnS4PF0THob0jB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50908'),
  ('227546436993221534', 'Them That Follow', 2019, 'Thriller', 'David Feeney-Mosier, Grace Smith, Britt Poulton', 'Britt Poulton, Dan Madison Savage', 'Alice Englert, Walton Goggins, Thomas Mann, Olivia Colman, Kaitlyn Dever, Jim Gaffigan, Lewis Pullman, Annie Tedesco', 'R', 'A Pentecostal pastor, Lemuel Childs, and his believers handle venomous snakes to prove themselves before God. Lemuel’s daughter, Mara holds a secret that threatens to tear the church apart: her romantic past with a nonbeliever, Augie. As Mara’s wedding to a devoted follower looms, she must decide whether or not to trust the steely matriarch of their community, Hope, with her heart and life at stake.', 'A Pentecostal pastor, Lemuel Childs, and his believers handle venomous snakes to prove themselves before God. Lemuel’s daughter, Mara holds a secret that threatens to tear the church apart: her romantic past with a nonbeliever, Augie. As Mara’s wedding to a devoted follower looms, she must decide whether or not to trust the steely matriarch of their community, Hope, with her heart and life at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5pXzgds0pPOJevmunFkPFMaaGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486832'),
  ('495354987899784331', 'Them Who?', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Matteo Albano, Francesco Capone, Stefano Farina', 'Fabio Bonifacci', 'Marco Giallini, Edoardo Leo, Maurizio Casagrande, Ivano Marescotti, Catrinel Marlon, Lisa Bor, Christian Ginepro, Giampiero Judica', null, 'David loses his white collar job, his fiancée and his house after one night with con man Marcello. He tracks him down to exact revenge, but ends up becoming his disciple in order to win back everything.', 'David loses his white collar job, his fiancée and his house after one night with con man Marcello. He tracks him down to exact revenge, but ends up becoming his disciple in order to win back everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9XQYbmL3EEDDcQOx7e3hB2UjnE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369230'),
  ('1112143576204612229', 'Them!', 1954, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Gordon Douglas, Sidney Hickox', 'Ted Sherdeman', 'James Whitmore, James Arness, Joan Weldon, Edmund Gwenn, Onslow Stevens, Sean McClory, Sandy Descher, Chris Drake', 'NR', 'As a result of nuclear testing, gigantic, ferocious mutant ants appear in the American desert southwest, and a father-daughter team of entomologists join forces with the state police officer who first discovers their existence, an FBI agent and, eventually, the US Army to eradicate the menace, before it spreads across the continent — and the world.', 'As a result of nuclear testing, gigantic, ferocious mutant ants appear in the American desert southwest, and a father-daughter team of entomologists join forces with the state police officer who first discovers their existence, an FBI agent and, eventually, the US Army to eradicate the menace, before it spreads across the continent — and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tP352STF6BvSROi8K3CMM799TVo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11071'),
  ('381927734079189741', 'Themes and Variations', 1928, null, 'Germaine Dulac', null, 'Lilian Constantini', null, 'I evoke a dancing woman. A woman? No. A bouncing line with harmonious rhythm. I evoke a luminous projection on veils ! Precise matter! No. Fluid rhythms. Why should one disregard, on screen, the pleasure that movement brings us in the theatre? Harmony of lines. Harmony of light. Lines, surfaces, volumes evolving directly, without the artifice of evocation, in the logic of its forms, dispossessed of any overly human sense, allowing an elevation towards the abstract, thus giving more space to sensations and to dreams : integral cinema. —Germaine Dulac', 'I evoke a dancing woman. A woman? No. A bouncing line with harmonious rhythm. I evoke a luminous projection on veils ! Precise matter! No. Fluid rhythms. Why should one disregard, on screen, the pleasure that movement brings us in the theatre? Harmony of lines. Harmony of light. Lines, surfaces, volumes evolving directly, without the artifice of evocation, in the logic of its forms, dispossessed of any overly human sense, allowing an elevation towards the abstract, thus giving more space to sensations and to dreams : integral cinema. —Germaine Dulac', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16v3oaNOT1BVdJ46mHKfGzk5Pby.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184106'),
  ('571613266828955565', 'Themroc', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Claude Faraldo, Jean-Marc Ripert, Jean-Luc Millorit', null, 'Michel Piccoli, Miou-Miou, Béatrice Romand, Francesca Romana Coluzzi, Jeanne Herviale, Marilù Tolo, Romain Bouteille, Henri Guybet', null, 'Themroc, a bachelor house painter living at home with his mother, leads a sad and colorless life. One day, after a run-in with his boss, he rebels. He wrecks his apartment, rejects every facet of bourgeois life, and begins acting like an urban, modern-day Neanderthal.', 'Themroc, a bachelor house painter living at home with his mother, leads a sad and colorless life. One day, after a run-in with his boss, he rebels. He wrecks his apartment, rejects every facet of bourgeois life, and begins acting like an urban, modern-day Neanderthal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdfWdOiMWMwYQtVAWDyHpHvWifX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7014'),
  ('157070022375531967', 'Then Came You', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Hutchings, Andre Lascaris, Natasha Rivera', 'Fergal Rock', 'Maisie Williams, Asa Butterfield, Nina Dobrev, Tyler Hoechlin, David Koechner, Peyton List, Tituss Burgess, Sonya Walger', 'PG-13', 'An American hypochondriac who is working as a baggage handler is forced to confront his fears when a British teenager with a terminal illness enlists him to help her carry out her eccentric bucket list.', 'An American hypochondriac who is working as a baggage handler is forced to confront his fears when a British teenager with a terminal illness enlists him to help her carry out her eccentric bucket list.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/658QP5tmBRUlE5JvxOnnmITfG1F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375785'),
  ('335327095218183241', 'Then Came You', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Adriana Trigiani, Reynaldo Villalobos', 'Kathie Lee Gifford', 'Kathie Lee Gifford, Craig Ferguson, Elizabeth Hurley, Ford Kiernan, Phyllida Law, Katarina Demetriades, Brett James, Ruaraidh Murray', null, 'A lonely widow plans a trip around the world with her husband''s ashes, to visit the places they loved in the movies. During her first stop in Scotland at the beautiful estate she stays in, she meets the innkeeper who changes her life forever.', 'A lonely widow plans a trip around the world with her husband''s ashes, to visit the places they loved in the movies. During her first stop in Scotland at the beautiful estate she stays in, she meets the innkeeper who changes her life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxECW0qUol2pxI2ycRzIDPYO43t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743283'),
  ('581341448633268406', 'Then I Sentenced Them All to Death', 1972, 'War, Drama', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu, Adriana Dumitrescu, Alexandru David', 'Titus Popovici', 'Amza Pellea, Cristian Șofron, Ion Besoiu, Gheorghe Dinică, Ioana Bulcă, Octavian Cotescu, Iurie Darie, Ștefan Mihăilescu-Brăila', null, 'A young boy is adopted by a priest and his wife during the Nazi occupation of Romania during the Second World War. He befriends the village idiot, who''s despised by everyone else. When a German is killed in the last days of the war, the village is threatened with total destruction unless the murderer is handed over. The villagers decide to hand over the idiot.', 'A young boy is adopted by a priest and his wife during the Nazi occupation of Romania during the Second World War. He befriends the village idiot, who''s despised by everyone else. When a German is killed in the last days of the war, the village is threatened with total destruction unless the murderer is handed over. The villagers decide to hand over the idiot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5wOTKem2MdVJa7xAkArVfhv9oo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246882'),
  ('96328762263918969', 'Then She Found Me', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Helen Hunt, Peter Donahue', 'Alice Arlen, Victor Levin, Helen Hunt', 'Helen Hunt, Bette Midler, Colin Firth, Matthew Broderick, Ben Shenkman, Lynn Cohen, John Benjamin Hickey, Salman Rushdie', 'R', 'A New York schoolteacher experiences a midlife crisis when, in quick succession, her husband leaves, her adoptive mother dies, and her biological mother, an eccentric talk show host, materializes and turns her life upside down as she begins a courtship with the father of one of her students.', 'A New York schoolteacher experiences a midlife crisis when, in quick succession, her husband leaves, her adoptive mother dies, and her biological mother, an eccentric talk show host, materializes and turns her life upside down as she begins a courtship with the father of one of her students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCyOeJRiCFVo09T2Rb80pt4Fvgo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13196'),
  ('889273382357253851', 'Thenali', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'K. S. Ravikumar, Priyan', 'K. S. Ravikumar', 'Kamal Haasan, Jayaram, Devayani, Jyothika, Delhi Ganesh, Charle, Ramesh Khanna, Madhan Bob', null, 'Thenali suffers from panophobia and seeks doctor Kailash''s help but the latter denies his request. Later, when Kailash goes on a vacation with his family, Thenali joins them and charms his sister.', 'Thenali suffers from panophobia and seeks doctor Kailash''s help but the latter denies his request. Later, when Kailash goes on a vacation with his family, Thenali joins them and charms his sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4YrxXEx6IsriIRUj69WZVZ8cGh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69577'),
  ('539817848824392839', 'Thenmavin Kombath', 1994, 'Comedy, Family', 'Priyadarshan, K. V. Anand', 'Priyadarshan', 'Mohanlal, Nedumudi Venu, Shobana, Kaviyoor Ponnamma, KPAC Lalitha, Sukumari, Sreenivasan, Sankaradi', null, 'Sreekrishnan unknowingly falls in love with the woman his best friend, Manikyan, loves. Though Sreekrishnan tries his best to woo her, she resists, leading to a battle that ensues between the friends.', 'Sreekrishnan unknowingly falls in love with the woman his best friend, Manikyan, loves. Though Sreekrishnan tries his best to woo her, she resists, leading to a battle that ensues between the friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSWTrMUaAj08DAyhOGH3oLhXopx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247729'),
  ('877863298268070019', 'Theo Against the Rest of the World', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Peter F. Bringmann, Helge Weindler, Barbara Rieck', 'Matthias Seelig', 'Marius Müller-Westernhagen, Guido Gagliardi, Claudia Demarmels, Peter Berling, Marquard Bohm, Carlheinz Heitmann, Ursula Strätz, Horst Bergmann', null, 'Theo is having some bad luck. His barely paid-for truck has been stolen, and credit collectors are after him. The chase leads him across Europe.', 'Theo is having some bad luck. His barely paid-for truck has been stolen, and credit collectors are after him. The chase leads him across Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPvS4ppNXyyOzOE3RyHo8TuYjob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10746'),
  ('655190757277097236', 'Theodora Goes Wild', 1936, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Morris Stoloff, Richard Boleslawski, Joseph Walker', 'Sidney Buchman', 'Irene Dunne, Melvyn Douglas, Thomas Mitchell, Thurston Hall, Elisabeth Risdon, Margaret McWade, Spring Byington, Nana Bryant', 'NR', 'The small-town prudes of Lynnfield are up in arms over ''The Sinner,'' a sexy best-seller. They little suspect that author ''Caroline Adams'' is really Theodora Lynn, scion of the town''s leading family. Michael Grant, devil-may-care book jacket illustrator, penetrates Theodora''s incognito and sets out to ''free her'' from Lynnfield against her will. But Michael has a secret too, and gets a taste of his own medicine.', 'The small-town prudes of Lynnfield are up in arms over ''The Sinner,'' a sexy best-seller. They little suspect that author ''Caroline Adams'' is really Theodora Lynn, scion of the town''s leading family. Michael Grant, devil-may-care book jacket illustrator, penetrates Theodora''s incognito and sets out to ''free her'' from Lynnfield against her will. But Michael has a secret too, and gets a taste of his own medicine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCrLr32lMOeqKHrBuxAPYpDEDJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52429'),
  ('319675336374552551', 'Theodora, Slave Empress', 1954, 'History, Romance, Action', 'Riccardo Freda, Giuseppe Divita, Ranieri Cochetti', 'René Wheeler, Claude Accursi, Ranieri Cochetti', 'Gianna Maria Canale, Georges Marchal, Henri Guisol, Roger Pigaut, Renato Baldini, Irene Papas, Olga Solbelli, Alessandro Fersen', null, 'Teodora, a Roman courtesan and former slave girl, marries the Roman emperor Justinian and assumes the throne as Empress of Rome. But the divide between nobility and slave is too great. Teodora seeks justice for her people, and revolution and armed conflict erupt in both Byzantium and Rome.', 'Teodora, a Roman courtesan and former slave girl, marries the Roman emperor Justinian and assumes the throne as Empress of Rome. But the divide between nobility and slave is too great. Teodora seeks justice for her people, and revolution and armed conflict erupt in both Byzantium and Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tY84DpsGMkbQDZEqVH9OnyOeEZm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280957'),
  ('368836758202463219', 'Theodore and the gun', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Yiorgos Stamboulopoulos', 'Nikos Tsiforos, Polyvios Vasileiadis', 'Mimis Fotopoulos, Smaroula Giouli, Hristos Tsaganeas, Lavrentis Dianellos, Nitsa Tsaganea, Antigoni Koukouli, Kostas Voutsas, Dimitris Hoptiris', null, 'An anachronistic and paleolithic father tries to find a good, honest husband for his daughter.', 'An anachronistic and paleolithic father tries to find a good, honest husband for his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8ojPUe7fbXsVTmEABc9qruyjft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296991'),
  ('704137032735084769', 'Theodore Rex', 1995, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family, Comedy', 'Jonathan R. Betuel, Ernie F. Orsatti, David Tattersall', 'Jonathan R. Betuel', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Juliet Landau, Bud Cort, Stephen McHattie, George Newbern, Carol Kane, Richard Roundtree', 'PG', 'In an alternate futuristic society, a tough female police detective is paired with a talking dinosaur to find the killer of dinosaurs and other prehistoric animals leading them to a mad scientist bent on creating a new Armageddon.', 'In an alternate futuristic society, a tough female police detective is paired with a talking dinosaur to find the killer of dinosaurs and other prehistoric animals leading them to a mad scientist bent on creating a new Armageddon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUUbOE91SK4GCpiyftEY5USjCh1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36259'),
  ('770011278000009762', 'Theorem', 1968, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Sergio Citti', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Terence Stamp, Silvana Mangano, Massimo Girotti, Anne Wiazemsky, Andrés José Cruz Soublette, Laura Betti, Ninetto Davoli, Carlo De Mejo', 'NR', 'A wealthy Italian household is turned upside down when a handsome stranger arrives, seduces every family member and then disappears. Each has an epiphany of sorts, but none can figure out who the seductive visitor was or why he came.', 'A wealthy Italian household is turned upside down when a handsome stranger arrives, seduces every family member and then disappears. Each has an epiphany of sorts, but none can figure out who the seductive visitor was or why he came.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7rEBaYUTgdxVqYl9aZm5ZcoB41.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5335'),
  ('632332921955107507', 'Theory of Achievement', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hal Hartley, Michael Spiller', 'Hal Hartley', 'Bob Gosse, Jessica Sager, Jeffrey Howard, Elina Löwensohn, Bill Sage, Naledi Tshazibane, Mark Chandler Bailey, Nick Gomez', null, 'This short film was packaged on video with Hartley''s featurette "Surviving Desire." It affectionately examines the lives of a group of "young, middle-class, white, college-educated, unskilled, broke, drunk" Brooklynites who would love to make something of their lives -- assuming they can pay the rent first.', 'This short film was packaged on video with Hartley''s featurette "Surviving Desire." It affectionately examines the lives of a group of "young, middle-class, white, college-educated, unskilled, broke, drunk" Brooklynites who would love to make something of their lives -- assuming they can pay the rent first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSo4nBzXFFwnXy2pqHG8DLauJNK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145764'),
  ('679087922747785930', 'Therapy', 2016, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Nathan Ambrosioni', 'Nathan Ambrosioni', 'Nathalie Couturier, Rémy Jobert, Vanessa Azzopardi, Julien Croquet, Luna Belan, Nathan Ambrosioni, Tania Rieu, Thierry Azzopardi', null, 'Jane and Simon are two young police officers leading a routine investigation following the discovery of hidden video equipment in an abandoned house by a night watchman. But the first filmed images go way beyond a simple holiday movie. The two investigators realize that they have to move quickly if they are to find out what has become of Steven, Stephanie, Olivia, Sam, and Sebastien... before it''s too late.', 'Jane and Simon are two young police officers leading a routine investigation following the discovery of hidden video equipment in an abandoned house by a night watchman. But the first filmed images go way beyond a simple holiday movie. The two investigators realize that they have to move quickly if they are to find out what has become of Steven, Stephanie, Olivia, Sam, and Sebastien... before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLpUdqygMfTDzG47kZXy51F6F35.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402466'),
  ('544857604722503154', 'Therapy for a Vampire', 2014, 'Comedy, Horror', 'David Rühm, Martin Gschlacht', 'David Rühm', 'Tobias Moretti, Jeanette Hain, Cornelia Ivancan, Dominic Oley, Karl Fischer, David Bennent, Lars Rudolph, Erni Mangold', null, 'Horror comedy film following vampire count Geza von Kösznöm who''s visiting groundbreaking neurologist Sigund Freud because he''s bored of his life and frustrated of the "eternally long" relationship with his wife Elsa.', 'Horror comedy film following vampire count Geza von Kösznöm who''s visiting groundbreaking neurologist Sigund Freud because he''s bored of his life and frustrated of the "eternally long" relationship with his wife Elsa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHu53Je2zgP9ZwfKzI23x6UfpEB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335837'),
  ('571798247740498022', 'There Are No Saints', 2022, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mateo Londoño, Alfonso Pineda Ulloa', 'Paul Schrader', 'José María Yázpik, Shannyn Sossamon, Tommy Flanagan, Ron Perlman, Karla Souza, Tim Roth, Paz Vega, Neal McDonough', null, 'A man is imprisoned for a crime he didn''t commit. When his wife is murdered and his son kidnapped and taken to Mexico, he devises an elaborate and dangerous plan to rescue his son and avenge the murder.', 'A man is imprisoned for a crime he didn''t commit. When his wife is murdered and his son kidnapped and taken to Mexico, he devises an elaborate and dangerous plan to rescue his son and avenge the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcOTYArjKuAgufwHoTvx8w9UKCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267805'),
  ('792684695166097073', 'There Be Dragons', 2011, 'War, History, Drama', 'Roland Joffé, Gabriel Beristain', 'Roland Joffé', 'Charlie Cox, Dougray Scott, Wes Bentley, Olga Kurylenko, Rodrigo Santoro, Golshifteh Farahani, Jordi Mollà, Ana Torrent', 'PG-13', 'Arising out of the horror of the Spanish Civil War, a candidate for canonization is investigated by a journalist who discovers his own estranged father had a deep, dark and devastating connection to the saint''s life.While researching the life of Josemaria Escriva, the controversial founder of Opus Dei, the young journalist Robert uncovers hidden stories of his estranged father Manolo, and is taken on a journey through the dark, terrible secrets of his family’s past.', 'Arising out of the horror of the Spanish Civil War, a candidate for canonization is investigated by a journalist who discovers his own estranged father had a deep, dark and devastating connection to the saint''s life.While researching the life of Josemaria Escriva, the controversial founder of Opus Dei, the young journalist Robert uncovers hidden stories of his estranged father Manolo, and is taken on a journey through the dark, terrible secrets of his family’s past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7y6ehxTLB1ZJl3xFVFbhcnoJx1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45054'),
  ('472178936859369118', 'There Goes My Baby', 1994, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Floyd Mutrux, William A. Fraker', 'Floyd Mutrux', 'Dermot Mulroney, Rick Schroder, Kelli Williams, Noah Wyle, Lucy Deakins, Jill Schoelen, Kristin Minter, Kenneth Ransom', null, 'It''s the summer of 1965, and the members of the graduating class of upscale Westwood High are eager to reinvent themselves. Valedictorian Mary Beth wants to attend a liberal university. Surfer bum Stick plans to enlist to fight in Vietnam. Calvin lives in the poor Watts section of Los Angeles, which is slowly erupting in violence. As the summer nights grow long, they''ll all be forced to make decisions that will affect the rest of their lives.', 'It''s the summer of 1965, and the members of the graduating class of upscale Westwood High are eager to reinvent themselves. Valedictorian Mary Beth wants to attend a liberal university. Surfer bum Stick plans to enlist to fight in Vietnam. Calvin lives in the poor Watts section of Los Angeles, which is slowly erupting in violence. As the summer nights grow long, they''ll all be forced to make decisions that will affect the rest of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxvY6as28ykgbPEuvZ5T29am99L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88641'),
