  ('545859370747626455', 'There Was a Crooked Man...', 1970, 'Western', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Harry Stradling Jr., Don Kranze', 'Robert Benton, David Newman, Lee Adams', 'Kirk Douglas, Henry Fonda, Hume Cronyn, Warren Oates, Burgess Meredith, John Randolph, Lee Grant, Arthur O''Connell', 'R', 'A charming but ruthless criminal is sent to a remote Arizona prison, where he enlists the help of his cellmates in an escape attempt with the promise of sharing his hidden loot.', 'A charming but ruthless criminal is sent to a remote Arizona prison, where he enlists the help of his cellmates in an escape attempt with the promise of sharing his hidden loot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHGNCWJiOOnmbF8tfVXdkFmQZWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27172'),
  ('852575069448307710', 'There Was a Father', 1942, 'Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Yûharu Atsuta', 'Tadao Ikeda, Takao Yanai, Yasujirō Ozu', 'Chishū Ryū, Shūji Sano, Haruhiko Tsuda, Shin Saburi, Takeshi Sakamoto, Mitsuko Mito, Shinichi Himori, Seiji Nishimura', null, 'Shuhei Horikawa, a poor schoolteacher, struggles to raise his son Ryohei by himself, despite neither money nor prospects.', 'Shuhei Horikawa, a poor schoolteacher, struggles to raise his son Ryohei by himself, despite neither money nor prospects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJ2jVlhj60ofzFfXjfLkOD01rxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27372'),
  ('825111017819936175', 'There Were Days... and Moons', 1990, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-Yves Le Mener, Michel Quenneville, Claude Lelouch', 'Claude Lelouch, Marc Rosenbaum, Valérie Bonnier', 'Gérard Lanvin, Annie Girardot, Patrick Chesnais, Marie-Sophie L., Vincent Lindon, Salomé Lelouch, Philippe Léotard, Gérard Darmon', null, 'How can moon and time affect human mood and fate? In the manner of a Greek tragedy , this movie shows how the chaos of life ineluctably propels its characters towards violence and alienation.', 'How can moon and time affect human mood and fate? In the manner of a Greek tragedy , this movie shows how the chaos of life ineluctably propels its characters towards violence and alienation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmHjQpI4aFc3OXRcHBuJmbyhPHf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51329'),
  ('964908520389538079', 'There Will Be Blood', 2007, 'Drama', 'Paul Thomas Anderson, Robert Elswit, Eric Richard Lasko', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Daniel Day-Lewis, Paul Dano, Kevin J. O''Connor, Ciarán Hinds, Dillon Freasier, Hope Elizabeth Reeves, Colleen Foy, Barry Del Sherman', 'R', 'Ruthless silver miner, turned oil prospector, Daniel Plainview, moves to oil-rich California. Using his son to project a trustworthy, family-man image, Plainview cons local landowners into selling him their valuable properties for a pittance. However, local preacher Eli Sunday suspects Plainview''s motives and intentions, starting a slow-burning feud that threatens both their lives.', 'Ruthless silver miner, turned oil prospector, Daniel Plainview, moves to oil-rich California. Using his son to project a trustworthy, family-man image, Plainview cons local landowners into selling him their valuable properties for a pittance. However, local preacher Eli Sunday suspects Plainview''s motives and intentions, starting a slow-burning feud that threatens both their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fa0RDkAlCec0STeMNAhPaF89q6U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7345'),
  ('932800899560668443', 'There Will Be No Leave Today', 1959, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Andrei Tarkovsky, Ernst Yakovlev, Lev Bunin', 'Aleksandr Gordon, Irina Makhovaya, Andrei Tarkovsky', 'Oleg Borisov, Aleksei Alekseyev, Pyotr Lyubeshkin, Oleg Mokshantsev, Vladimir Marenkov, Igor Kosukhin, Leonid Kuravlyov, Stanislav Lyubshin', null, 'Soldiers undertake the perilous task of removing a stockpile of World War II bombshells discovered during roadworks under the ground of a small village.', 'Soldiers undertake the perilous task of removing a stockpile of World War II bombshells discovered during roadworks under the ground of a small village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojihzqLoTVjzUWHwYu1PkETP6Hs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45590'),
  ('25705173362178979', 'There Will Be No More Night', 2021, 'Documentary, War', 'Éléonore Weber', null, 'Nathalie Richard', null, 'Images from helicopters. Video recordings from the American and the French military forces in Afghanistan, Iraq and Syria. The intervention is taking place right before our eyes. How far can the desire to see lead to, when it has no limits?', 'Images from helicopters. Video recordings from the American and the French military forces in Afghanistan, Iraq and Syria. The intervention is taking place right before our eyes. How far can the desire to see lead to, when it has no limits?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXf80kTWiWth46lsh6uCSfteW6w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682454'),
  ('915478367678378348', 'There Will Come a Day', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Giorgio Diritti, Roberto Cimatti, Valentina Materiale', 'Tania Pedroni, Fredo Valla, Giorgio Diritti', 'Jasmine Trinca, Anne Alvaro, Pia Engleberth, Sonia Gessner, Federica Fracassi, Amanda Fonseca Galvao, Paulo De Souza', null, 'Painful family events lead Augusta to leave Italy. On a small boat, immersed in the Amazon Forest grandness, she begins a travel between Indios villages. From the favela to the isolation in the Forest, Augusta will go in search of herself.', 'Painful family events lead Augusta to leave Italy. On a small boat, immersed in the Amazon Forest grandness, she begins a travel between Indios villages. From the favela to the isolation in the Forest, Augusta will go in search of herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrev43dDMMmr1iLl69HoxHOHuas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158182'),
