  ('571929304965580535', 'There''s a Girl in My Soup', 1970, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Roy Boulting, Michael Stevenson', 'Terence Frisby', 'Peter Sellers, Goldie Hawn, Tony Britton, Nicky Henson, Diana Dors, Judy Campbell, Gabrielle Drake, Nicola Pagett', 'R', 'TV personality Robert Danvers, an exceedingly vain rotter, seduces young women daily, never staying long with one. He meets his match in Marion, an American, 19, who''s available but refuses any romantic illusions.', 'TV personality Robert Danvers, an exceedingly vain rotter, seduces young women daily, never staying long with one. He meets his match in Marion, an American, 19, who''s available but refuses any romantic illusions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/195ursANUsXrV5voVTkPGDtpueE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42599'),
  ('1016121111052250380', 'There''s Always a Price Tag', 1957, 'Drama', 'Denys de La Patellière, Pierre Montazel, André Cultet', 'Denys de La Patellière, Michel Audiard', 'Michèle Morgan, Daniel Gélin, Michèle Mercier, François Chaumette, Pierre Leproux, Hélène Roussel, Peter van Eyck, Bernard Blier', 'NR', 'A wealthy businessman''s wife tries to cover up his suicide to cash in his life insurance policy.', 'A wealthy businessman''s wife tries to cover up his suicide to cash in his life insurance policy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrLwb5gPq1wI21ZezA7uML9H6IS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260854'),
  ('366543776929602415', 'There''s Always a Woman', 1938, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Alexander Hall, Henry Freulich', 'Gladys Lehman', 'Melvyn Douglas, Joan Blondell, Mary Astor, Frances Drake, Jerome Cowan, Robert Paige, Thurston Hall, Pierre Watkin', 'NR', 'An investigator for the District Attorney''s office quits to open his own detective agency. However, business is so bad that he finally decides to give it up and go back to his old job. As his wife is at his office closing up, a wealthy society matron walks in with a case: she wants to know if her husband is having an affair with his ex-girlfriend, who is now married. The wife accepts what looks to be an easy case, figuring than she can then persuade her husband to re-start the agency. However, when the client''s husband is found murdered, she decides to investigate the murder herself. Her husband has also been assigned by the D.A. to investigate the murder, and he doesn''t know that his wife is also on the case. Complications ensue.', 'An investigator for the District Attorney''s office quits to open his own detective agency. However, business is so bad that he finally decides to give it up and go back to his old job. As his wife is at his office closing up, a wealthy society matron walks in with a case: she wants to know if her husband is having an affair with his ex-girlfriend, who is now married. The wife accepts what looks to be an easy case, figuring than she can then persuade her husband to re-start the agency. However, when the client''s husband is found murdered, she decides to investigate the murder herself. Her husband has also been assigned by the D.A. to investigate the murder, and he doesn''t know that his wife is also on the case. Complications ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcHTgCUNlYthjFHC6TNAqZfirTM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160254'),
  ('549331019471333395', 'There''s Always Tomorrow', 1956, 'Drama, Romance', 'Douglas Sirk, Russell Metty', 'Bernard C. Schoenfeld', 'Fred MacMurray, Barbara Stanwyck, Joan Bennett, William Reynolds, Pat Crowley, Gigi Perreau, Jane Darwell, Race Gentry', 'NR', 'When a toy manufacturer feels ignored and unappreciated by his wife and children, he begins to rekindle a past love when a former employee comes back into his life.', 'When a toy manufacturer feels ignored and unappreciated by his wife and children, he begins to rekindle a past love when a former employee comes back into his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWvyuCWFZSAIrDdqDOaT0m4J0Ue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37637'),
  ('133572082504810684', 'There''s Always Vanilla', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'George A. Romero, George A. Romero', 'Rudy Ricci', 'Judith Ridley, Raymond Laine, Johanna Lawrence, Richard Ricci, Roger McGovern, Ron Jaye, Bob Wilson, Louise Sahene', 'R', 'A young man returns home to Pittsburgh and moves in with an older woman, on whom he begins to rely on for emotional and financial support.', 'A young man returns home to Pittsburgh and moves in with an older woman, on whom he begins to rely on for emotional and financial support.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scO0p5Na3Hywc2LidDWhKOvJRST.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87734'),
  ('514131109196982718', 'There''s Good Weather in Deribasovskaya, Or It''s Raining Again in Brighton Beach', 1993, 'Crime, Comedy, Action', 'Yevgeni Pozdnyakov, Marina Volovich, Vladimir Shmyga', 'Leonid Gaidai, Arkadiy Inin, Yuriy Volovich', 'Dmitriy Kharatyan, Kelly McGrill, Andrey Myagkov, Mikhail Kokshenov, Yuri Volyntsev, Emmanuil Vitorgan, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Mamuka Kikaleishvili', null, 'When mysterious Russian bandit named Artist came in USA, brave Russian special agent Fyodor Sokolov runs to States for defeat evil master.', 'When mysterious Russian bandit named Artist came in USA, brave Russian special agent Fyodor Sokolov runs to States for defeat evil master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jj490LF9fyLrOHMJELIIJArw2xj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57776'),
  ('1145984051939394512', 'There''s No Business Like Show Business', 1954, 'Music, Comedy', 'Walter Lang, Leon Shamroy', 'Phoebe Ephron, Henry Ephron', 'Ethel Merman, Marilyn Monroe, Mitzi Gaynor, Dan Dailey, Donald O''Connor, Johnnie Ray, Richard Eastham, Hugh O''Brian', 'NR', 'Molly and Terry Donahue, plus their three children, are The Five Donahues. Youngest son Tim meets hat-check girl Vicky and the family act begins to fall apart.', 'Molly and Terry Donahue, plus their three children, are The Five Donahues. Youngest son Tim meets hat-check girl Vicky and the family act begins to fall apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zkiJMfkmhVXC439Z43ZScqUYQP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21468'),
  ('1065542756346175036', 'There''s No Place Like Home', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roy Bava, Sara Messina, Shane Hurlbut', 'Sabrina Impacciatore', 'Stefano Accorsi, Carolina Crescentini, Elena Cucci, Tea Falco, Pierfrancesco Favino, Claudia Gerini, Massimo Ghini, Sabrina Impacciatore', null, 'An extended family reunites on an idyllic island to celebrate their grandparents'' 50th wedding anniversary. However, a storm causes them to get stuck in there longer than expected, causing secrets and long-held grudges to break out.', 'An extended family reunites on an idyllic island to celebrate their grandparents'' 50th wedding anniversary. However, a storm causes them to get stuck in there longer than expected, causing secrets and long-held grudges to break out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j92GNi6ooPKEDj44VdrkVM6rV1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486101'),
  ('481769723352778841', 'There''s No Religion Anymore', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Ilaria Schipa, Chantal Toesca, Daniele Ciprì', 'Luca Miniero, Sandro Petraglia, Astutillo Smeriglia', 'Claudio Bisio, Alessandro Gassmann, Angela Finocchiaro, Nabiha Akkari, Giovanni Cacioppo, Laura Adriani, Mehdi Meskar, Paola Casella', null, 'Set on the small island of Porto Buio, the traditional live Christmas Nativity scene might not go ahead because the baby who’s always played Jesus has grown up and no new babies have been born on the island in years! With this fundamental tradition on the line, newly elected Mayor Cecco (Claudio Bisio) wants to ask the local Tunisian community to “borrow” one of their children, but there’s conflict between the two communities. Cecco enlists the help of local Islam convert Bilal (Alessandro Gassman) to cross the cultural divide… but both communities are not sure what to make of a baby Jesus that may need his nationality, and even his religion changed!', 'Set on the small island of Porto Buio, the traditional live Christmas Nativity scene might not go ahead because the baby who’s always played Jesus has grown up and no new babies have been born on the island in years! With this fundamental tradition on the line, newly elected Mayor Cecco (Claudio Bisio) wants to ask the local Tunisian community to “borrow” one of their children, but there’s conflict between the two communities. Cecco enlists the help of local Islam convert Bilal (Alessandro Gassman) to cross the cultural divide… but both communities are not sure what to make of a baby Jesus that may need his nationality, and even his religion changed!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQH5sSmieXLOmil1C6GbyNC1VAU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419504'),
  ('222008998677798149', 'There''s No Sex Like Snow Sex', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Alois Brummer, Hubertus Hagen', 'Alois Brummer', 'Judith Fritsch, Franz Muxeneder, Rosl Mayr, Horst Pasderski, Josef Moosholzer, Konstantin Wecker, Dorothea Rau, Gisela Schwartz', null, 'A load of excited female winter vacationers travel to the Bavarian mountains. It''s going to be a turbulent time for the funny little fat director from Berlin and the other passengers. The ladies have planned for this, traveling without husbands - in the hope of finding more than a full replacement among the local lads. And none of them are disappointed, although the innkeeper is keen to ensure that his establishment remains respectable.', 'A load of excited female winter vacationers travel to the Bavarian mountains. It''s going to be a turbulent time for the funny little fat director from Berlin and the other passengers. The ladies have planned for this, traveling without husbands - in the hope of finding more than a full replacement among the local lads. And none of them are disappointed, although the innkeeper is keen to ensure that his establishment remains respectable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88dVKqs4wKcAI1y6ASkwQ4Rqe5t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220700'),
  ('634906921722576698', 'There''s No Time for Love, Charlie Brown', 1973, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Chad Webber, Hilary Momberger-Powers, Robin Kohn, Stephen Shea, Jimmy Ahrens, Christopher DeFaria, Todd Barbee, Bill Melendez', 'G', 'Charlie Brown''s last chance to salvage his grades seems doomed when he confuses a supermarket for an art gallery he has to do a paper on.', 'Charlie Brown''s last chance to salvage his grades seems doomed when he confuses a supermarket for an art gallery he has to do a paper on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpR3FPqF4lqvlTJqUQmWo125yI8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54912'),
  ('837351417370035465', 'There''s No Tomorrow', 1940, 'Drama, Romance', 'Max Ophüls, Eugen Schüfftan, Paul Portier', 'Hans Wilhelm', 'Edwige Feuillère, George Rigaud, Daniel Lecourtois, Mady Berry, Michel François, Georges Lannes, André Gabriello, Pauline Carton', null, 'Evelyne, a woman of bourgeois origin, now reduced to dancing in a sleazy nightclub, is reunited with her first love, who has become a successful doctor.', 'Evelyne, a woman of bourgeois origin, now reduced to dancing in a sleazy nightclub, is reunited with her first love, who has become a successful doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrThsODrZmVqPsePBwCQ3EM6ACF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63766'),
  ('98340930250453888', 'There''s Nothing Out There', 1991, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Rolfe Kanefsky, Ed Hershberger', 'Rolfe Kanefsky', 'Craig Peck, Wendy Bednarz, Mark Collver, Bonnie Bowers, John Carhart III, Claudia Flores, Jeff Dachis, Lisa Grant', 'NR', 'Mike''s obsession with horror movies means he can''t help but expect to find a monster lurking around every corner. When he joins his friends for a weekend away at a remote lodge, Mike instantly senses that something isn''t right. Can Mike use his movie knowledge to save his pals from a bloody end?', 'Mike''s obsession with horror movies means he can''t help but expect to find a monster lurking around every corner. When he joins his friends for a weekend away at a remote lodge, Mike instantly senses that something isn''t right. Can Mike use his movie knowledge to save his pals from a bloody end?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jq1ixT05QZfmf4pSpxG0pXybP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41775'),
  ('737333564174992634', 'There''s Only One Jimmy Grimble', 2000, 'Comedy', 'John Hay, Stephen Woolfenden', 'Simon Mayle, John Hay, Rik Carmichael', 'Lewis McKenzie, Jane Lapotaire, Gina McKee, Robert Carlyle, Ben Miller, Wayne Galtrey, Ciarán Griffiths, Bobby Power', 'PG', 'Jimmy Grimble is a shy Manchester school boy. At school he is constantly being bullied by the other kids, and at home he has to face his mother''s new boyfriend. However, through football, and some special boots, he manages to gain the confidence to succeed and leads his school football team towards the final of the local schools cup.', 'Jimmy Grimble is a shy Manchester school boy. At school he is constantly being bullied by the other kids, and at home he has to face his mother''s new boyfriend. However, through football, and some special boots, he manages to gain the confidence to succeed and leads his school football team towards the final of the local schools cup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9v4RxdSMUkhkH9cceSVU4jH4BfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1609'),
  ('848602904636966099', 'There''s Someone Inside Your House', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Kacey McDougall, Brian Pearson, Tobias A. Schliessler', 'Henry Gayden', 'Sydney Park, Théodore Pellerin, Asjha Cooper, Dale Whibley, Jesse LaTourette, Diego Josef, Burkely Duffield, Sarah Dugdale', 'NR', 'As the countdown to graduation begins, students at Osborne High are being stalked by a maniac intent on exposing their darkest secrets to the entire town, terrorizing victims while wearing a life-like mask of their own face. With a mysterious past of her own, Makani and her friends must discover the killer''s identity before they become victims themselves.', 'As the countdown to graduation begins, students at Osborne High are being stalked by a maniac intent on exposing their darkest secrets to the entire town, terrorizing victims while wearing a life-like mask of their own face. With a mysterious past of her own, Makani and her friends must discover the killer''s identity before they become victims themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GaPJQscaH4MtYQTbJyWjCUIho8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512025'),
  ('808166774302684265', 'There''s Something About Mario', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Hsu Chien, Luca Macedo, Kika Cunha', 'Luiz Salém, Rafael Campos Rocha, Stella Miranda', 'Daniel Rocha, Letícia Lima, Felipe Abib, Nany People, Zé Victor Castiel, Rômulo Arantes Neto, Elisa Pinheiro, Marcos Breda', null, 'Mario decides to tell his family the truth about himself. But when he is finally ready to come out in front of the entire family, his older brother Vicente ruins his plans.', 'Mario decides to tell his family the truth about himself. But when he is finally ready to come out in front of the entire family, his older brother Vicente ruins his plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8grhLGhULwTpWbsCdXD8GQQUDN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:668780'),
  ('532720564398599716', 'There''s Something About Mary', 1998, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Peter Farrelly, Mark Irwin, Bobby Farrelly', 'John J. Strauss, Ed Decter, Peter Farrelly', 'Cameron Diaz, Matt Dillon, Ben Stiller, Lee Evans, Chris Elliott, Lin Shaye, Jeffrey Tambor, Markie Post', 'R', 'For Ted, prom night went about as bad as it’s possible for any night to go. Thirteen years later, he finally gets another chance with his old prom date, only to run up against other suitors including the sleazy detective he hired to find her.', 'For Ted, prom night went about as bad as it’s possible for any night to go. Thirteen years later, he finally gets another chance with his old prom date, only to run up against other suitors including the sleazy detective he hired to find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slJD1Dvnsf15LoeqhERsyzisAdn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544'),
  ('87947864514878433', 'There''s Something in the Barn', 2023, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Magnus Martens, Scotty Anderson, Elise Martin', 'Aleksander Kirkwood Brown', 'Martin Starr, Amrita Acharia, Kiran Shah, Townes Bunner, Zoe Winther-Hansen, Calle Hellevang Larsen, Henriette Steenstrup, Jeppe Beck Laursen', 'R', 'An American family fulfills their dream of moving back to their roots after inheriting a remote cabin in the mountains of Norway. But there''s a surprise waiting for them.', 'An American family fulfills their dream of moving back to their roots after inheriting a remote cabin in the mountains of Norway. But there''s a surprise waiting for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NdUPvCk8S493EyBGDoHn8RE4rw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:956920'),
  ('675471733567245870', 'There''s Something Wrong with Aunt Diane', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Liz Garbus, Michael Tucker', null, 'Jesse Temple, Brad Katinas, Diane Schuler, Jay Schuler, Michael Realmuto, Daniel Schuler, Jimmy Schuler, Warren Hance', null, 'Filmmaker Liz Garbus investigates the mysterious tragedy of Diane Schuler in an effort to understand what went wrong.', 'Filmmaker Liz Garbus investigates the mysterious tragedy of Diane Schuler in an effort to understand what went wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ir34Bp7bHz0aaxEmtBFoUgvq2X0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70845'),
  ('980877166493530422', 'There''s Something Wrong with the Children', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Roxanne Benjamin, Yaron Levy', 'T.J. Cimfel, David White', 'Zach Gilford, Alisha Wainwright, Amanda Crew, Carlos Santos, Briella Guiza, David Mattle', 'NR', 'Margaret and Ben take a weekend trip with longtime friends Ellie and Thomas and their two young children. Eventually, Ben begins to suspect something supernatural is occurring when the kids behave strangely after disappearing into the woods overnight.', 'Margaret and Ben take a weekend trip with longtime friends Ellie and Thomas and their two young children. Eventually, Ben begins to suspect something supernatural is occurring when the kids behave strangely after disappearing into the woods overnight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8bSJhypBS39d9z4XZLAfHMquKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899579'),
  ('671495463576042323', 'Theresa: The Body of Christ', 2007, 'Drama', 'Ray Loriga, José Luis Alcaine', 'Ray Loriga', 'Paz Vega, Leonor Watling, Geraldine Chaplin, José Luis Gómez, Eusebio Poncela, Amparo Valle, Manuel Morón, Francesc Garrido', 'PG-13', 'In the 16th century, the daughter of a Spanish nobleman joins a convent and becomes a spiritual leader.', 'In the 16th century, the daughter of a Spanish nobleman joins a convent and becomes a spiritual leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7nMnJLP8oO4edyJEHmJRXTLWXU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80540'),
  ('199389829651685835', 'Therese', 1962, 'Drama', 'Georges Franju, Raymond Heil, Christian Matras', 'Georges Franju, Claude Mauriac', 'Emmanuelle Riva, Philippe Noiret, Édith Scob, Sami Frey, Renée Devillers, Jeanne Pérez, Hélène Dieudonné, Richard Saint-Bris', null, 'Thérèse is living in a provincial town, unhappily married to Bernard, a dull, pompous man whose only interest is preserving his family name and property. They live in an isolated country mansion surrounded by servants. Early in her marriage her only comforts are her fondness for Bernard''s pine-tree forest, which was her primary reason for marrying him, and her love for her sister-in-law and Bernard''s half-sister, Anne. The movie recounts in flashback the circumstances that led to her being charged with poisoning her husband.', 'Thérèse is living in a provincial town, unhappily married to Bernard, a dull, pompous man whose only interest is preserving his family name and property. They live in an isolated country mansion surrounded by servants. Early in her marriage her only comforts are her fondness for Bernard''s pine-tree forest, which was her primary reason for marrying him, and her love for her sister-in-law and Bernard''s half-sister, Anne. The movie recounts in flashback the circumstances that led to her being charged with poisoning her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2t9L6Enl7yVmHepDeRfMMoy7tU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80476'),
  ('960993631397517547', 'Thérèse', 1986, 'Drama', 'Alain Cavalier, Philippe Rousselot', 'Camille de Casabianca, Alain Cavalier', 'Catherine Mouchet, Aurore Prieto, Hélène Alexandridis, Clémence Massart-Weit, Sylvie Habault, Nathalie Bernart, Mona Heftre, Jean Pélégri', null, 'The life of little St. Therese of Lisieux, depicted in minimalist vignettes. Therese and her sisters are all nuns in a Carmelite convent. Her devotion to Jesus and her concept of "the little way" to God are shown clearly, using plain modern language. A sense of angelic simplicity comes across without fancy lights, choirs, or showy miracles.', 'The life of little St. Therese of Lisieux, depicted in minimalist vignettes. Therese and her sisters are all nuns in a Carmelite convent. Her devotion to Jesus and her concept of "the little way" to God are shown clearly, using plain modern language. A sense of angelic simplicity comes across without fancy lights, choirs, or showy miracles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UL9IkMrkPSV2PysNya5MEguW8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42029'),
  ('260183833308686572', 'Thérèse', 2012, 'Drama', 'Claude Miller, Gérard de Battista', 'Claude Miller, Natalie Carter', 'Audrey Tautou, Gilles Lellouche, Anaïs Demoustier, Stanley Weber, Yves Jacques, Francis Perrin, Isabelle Sadoyan, Catherine Arditi', null, 'An unhappily married woman struggles to break free from social pressures and her boring suburban setting.', 'An unhappily married woman struggles to break free from social pressures and her boring suburban setting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEkaDeQLkslKcGStIWUPOTtEqP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110323'),
  ('571046307579784326', 'Therese and Isabelle', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Radley Metzger, Hans Jura', 'Jesse Vogel', 'Essy Persson, Anna Gaël, Barbara Laage, Anne Vernon, Simone Paris, Maurice Teynac, Rémy Longa, Nathalie Nort', null, 'Two young girls experience awakening sexuality in the heated atmosphere of a Swiss girls'' boarding school.', 'Two young girls experience awakening sexuality in the heated atmosphere of a Swiss girls'' boarding school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avL1YQZS4kWe8QU8rcGjqSsvL1D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54221'),
  ('1139020021827655443', 'Thérèse Raquin', 1953, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Marcel Carné, Roger Hubert', 'Charles Spaak', 'Simone Signoret, Raf Vallone, Jacques Duby, Maria Pia Casilio, Sylvie, Nerio Bernardi, Roland Lesaffre, Madeleine Barbulée', null, 'Star-crossed lovers Thérèse and Laurent think they''ve gotten away with murder after Thérèse''s weakling husband "falls" from a speeding train. But when forced to contend with a blackmailer''s demands and the mute accusations of Thérèse''s mother-in-law, it''s only a matter of time before the law, their passion or blind chance trips them up.', 'Star-crossed lovers Thérèse and Laurent think they''ve gotten away with murder after Thérèse''s weakling husband "falls" from a speeding train. But when forced to contend with a blackmailer''s demands and the mute accusations of Thérèse''s mother-in-law, it''s only a matter of time before the law, their passion or blind chance trips them up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efJr4u8UwDefCqAj4rZrJRyvlIN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67736'),
  ('757834835918525464', 'Theri', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'George C. Williams, T K Madhan Prasad, Atlee', 'Atlee', 'Vijay, Samantha Ruth Prabhu, Amy Jackson, Prabhu, Radikaa Sarathkumar, Nainika, Rajendran, Stun Siva', null, 'When an honest cop, Vijay Kumar''s family is ruthlessly slaughtered by a politician and his aides, he decides to change his identity and commits his life to bring his daughter up in a serene atmosphere. But some freak events end up compromising his identity and what he does to save his daughter and avenge the death of his family unfurls as Theri.', 'When an honest cop, Vijay Kumar''s family is ruthlessly slaughtered by a politician and his aides, he decides to change his identity and commits his life to bring his daughter up in a serene atmosphere. But some freak events end up compromising his identity and what he does to save his daughter and avenge the death of his family unfurls as Theri.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6BhexotEqO3GejXa3FopBNGL6M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370076'),
  ('435712181531784589', 'Therincha Kadhalinga', 2026, 'Romance, Drama', 'Gajendran Mayandithevar, Gold Chandru Maasilamani', 'Gajendran Mayandithevar', 'Kiran T Joseph, Vipin Aruchamy, Shadulpran Shaji', null, 'Three men with different views on love meet a woman with strong values. One seeks lifelong commitment, another prefers freedom, the third pursues spirituality. Their lives intertwine, testing whether they can stay true to their beliefs.', 'Three men with different views on love meet a woman with strong values. One seeks lifelong commitment, another prefers freedom, the third pursues spirituality. Their lives intertwine, testing whether they can stay true to their beliefs.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FviW3z1y9RABpkqNyeosLw3JskId.jpg', 'plex:movie:therincha-kadhalinga'),
  ('746158097750847488', 'Thermae Romae', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Hideki Takeuchi, Kazunari Kawagoe, Katsumi Nojiri', 'Shogo Muto', 'Hiroshi Abe, Aya Ueto, Masachika Ichimura, Kazuki Kitamura, Kai Shishido, Satoru Matsuo, Katsuya, Takashi Sasano', 'PG-13', 'The story follows a Roman architect named Lucius, who is having trouble coming up with ideas. One day, he discovers a hidden tunnel underneath a spa that leads him to a modern Japanese bath house. Inspired by the innovations found there, he creates his own spa, Roma Thermae, bringing in the modern ideas to his time.', 'The story follows a Roman architect named Lucius, who is having trouble coming up with ideas. One day, he discovers a hidden tunnel underneath a spa that leads him to a modern Japanese bath house. Inspired by the innovations found there, he creates his own spa, Roma Thermae, bringing in the modern ideas to his time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2twy4YjOw0l6mC47WezOIc0dwF7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105210'),
  ('609407822367009739', 'Thermae Romae II', 2014, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Hideki Takeuchi', 'Hiroshi Hashimoto', 'Hiroshi Abe, Aya Ueto, Kazuki Kitamura, Riki Takeuchi, Kai Shishido, Takashi Sasano, Masachika Ichimura, Midoriko Kimura', 'PG-13', 'In ancient Rome, bathhouse architect Lucius (Hiroshi Abe) becomes famous with designing the original "thermae" (bathhouse). He receives an order to build a thermae in the colosseum to help gladiators recover from their wounds, but faces difficulties. Thus, Lucius travels again to modern day Japan through the time slip. He meets Manami (Aya Ueto) again, who is now a reporter for a magazine which covers bathroom. With the help of the flat face Japanese tribe, Lucius again designs a new thermae. Meanwhile, Emperor Hadrian (Masachika Ichimura) wants to keep the peace with the thermae, but the Senate wants to extend the land by using force. Emperor Hadrian and the Senate now have a confrontation and Rome becomes divided.', 'In ancient Rome, bathhouse architect Lucius (Hiroshi Abe) becomes famous with designing the original "thermae" (bathhouse). He receives an order to build a thermae in the colosseum to help gladiators recover from their wounds, but faces difficulties. Thus, Lucius travels again to modern day Japan through the time slip. He meets Manami (Aya Ueto) again, who is now a reporter for a magazine which covers bathroom. With the help of the flat face Japanese tribe, Lucius again designs a new thermae. Meanwhile, Emperor Hadrian (Masachika Ichimura) wants to keep the peace with the thermae, but the Senate wants to extend the land by using force. Emperor Hadrian and the Senate now have a confrontation and Rome becomes divided.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1cXrsTfnCgwmo0zY0Htn7gwfXf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268002'),
  ('956159570606300028', 'Thermostat 6', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Maya Av-Ron, Mylène Cominotti, Marion Coudert', 'Maya Av-Ron, Mylène Cominotti, Marion Coudert', 'Camille Claris, Maxime d''Aboville, Bernard Métreaux, Céline Monsarrat, Alessia Gouhier', null, 'Diane can''t ignore the leak coming from the ceiling above the family dining room anymore.', 'Diane can''t ignore the leak coming from the ceiling above the family dining room anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4vE5xQ6KItJlwzlhqSr4en2Q5f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:557071'),
  ('1082566580427525442', 'These Amazing Shadows', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Kurt Norton, Paul Mariano, Frazer Bradshaw', 'Paul Mariano, Kurt Norton, Douglas Blush', 'Jeff Adachi, James H. Billington, Robin Blaetz, Brooks Boliek, Charles Burnett, Jay Carr, Martin Cohen, Arlene Damron', null, 'Tells the history and importance of The National Film Registry, a roll call of American cinema treasures that reflects the diversity of film, and indeed the American experience itself.', 'Tells the history and importance of The National Film Registry, a roll call of American cinema treasures that reflects the diversity of film, and indeed the American experience itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiby8Ilxlmbhv6elIf0qRMuaDdd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80337'),
