  ('109752117813283711', 'These Encounters of Theirs', 2006, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Danièle Huillet, Jean-Marie Straub, Renato Berta', 'Danièle Huillet, Jean-Marie Straub', 'Angela Nugara, Vittorio Vigneri, Grazia Orsi, Romano Guelfi, Angela Durantini, Enrico Achilli, Giovanna Daddi, Dario Marconcini', null, 'These Encounters Of Theirs divides 10 non-professional actors into couples, then has them take turns in declaiming the Dialogues With Leuco, Cesare Pavese''s abstract, philosophical work.', 'These Encounters Of Theirs divides 10 non-professional actors into couples, then has them take turns in declaiming the Dialogues With Leuco, Cesare Pavese''s abstract, philosophical work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBlaUyTfwzp0z62I5rK3mf4r32L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108772'),
  ('970498701644067278', 'These Final Hours', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Zak Hilditch, Bonnie Elliott', 'Zak Hilditch', 'Nathan Phillips, Angourie Rice, Daniel Henshall, Jessica De Gouw, David Field, Sarah Snook, Kathryn Beck, Lynette Curran', null, 'What would you do on the last day on Earth? With the end of the world only hours away, the self-absorbed James heads to the ultimate party-to-end-all-parties. On his way there, he saves the life of a young girl named Rose who is searching desperately for her missing father. This simple act sets James on a path to redemption.', 'What would you do on the last day on Earth? With the end of the world only hours away, the self-absorbed James heads to the ultimate party-to-end-all-parties. On his way there, he saves the life of a young girl named Rose who is searching desperately for her missing father. This simple act sets James on a path to redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmVgGpLdAUzCszbyQ4THY8eB0HL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199575'),
  ('442048574118758268', 'These Girls', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'John Hazlett, Alex Vendler', 'John Hazlett', 'David Boreanaz, Caroline Dhavernas, Amanda Walsh, Holly Lewis, Jacques Girard, Paul Spence, McKenzi Scott, Ian Lawrence', 'R', 'Before heading off to college, a teenager and her two friends try to seduce a married man.', 'Before heading off to college, a teenager and her two friends try to seduce a married man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzPPz5iHhbmyBvDCrGoKfDv8RlF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19676'),
  ('1139320132474581851', 'These Glamour Girls', 1939, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alfred Gilks, S. Sylvan Simon', 'Marion Parsonnet, Jane Hall', 'Lew Ayres, Lana Turner, Tom Brown, Richard Carlson, Jane Bryan, Anita Louise, Marsha Hunt, Ann Rutherford', 'NR', 'A drunken college student invites a dance hostess to the big college dance and then forgets he asked her. When she shows up at school, he tries to get rid of her, but she won''t leave. Instead, she stays and shows up both him and his classmates'' snooty dates.', 'A drunken college student invites a dance hostess to the big college dance and then forgets he asked her. When she shows up at school, he tries to get rid of her, but she won''t leave. Instead, she stays and shows up both him and his classmates'' snooty dates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMm5H703dBHMjPdnY5VwVeORevC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213493'),
  ('535535552206152073', 'These Kids Are Grown-Ups', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Joël Santoni, Walter Bal', 'Jean Jabely, Daniel Boulanger, Joël Santoni', 'Catherine Deneuve, Claude Brasseur, Claude Piéplu, Éva Darlan, Jean-Pierre Coffe, Mustapha Dali, Michel Such, Yves Robert', null, 'When a real-estate promoter attempts to take over the homes of two electronics whizzes and boot them out, they contrive ingenious ways to inconvenience and harass him. By pooling their knowledge, they are able to pull off a crucial robbery using a very special box of chocolates.', 'When a real-estate promoter attempts to take over the homes of two electronics whizzes and boot them out, they contrive ingenious ways to inconvenience and harass him. By pooling their knowledge, they are able to pull off a crucial robbery using a very special box of chocolates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/da8ZEtisLKHlO6eRLJWeRhkZRkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76389'),
  ('59456689000145270', 'These Peculiar Days', 2019, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Diego Cruz Cilveti, Chucho E. Quintero, Fabián León López', 'Chucho E. Quintero', 'Gerardo del Razo, Carlos Hendrick Huber, Sofía Sylwin, Axel Arenas, Christopher Aguilasocho, Carolina Lecuona, Max Thomsen, Ana Lourdes Zamarrón', 'NR', 'Eight friends travel to a cabin in the woods to celebrate their high school graduation.', 'Eight friends travel to a cabin in the woods to celebrate their high school graduation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbqn2Tcp8zgZFtvab59sQJfsVq3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512214'),
  ('231482435303111207', 'These Sorcerers Are Mad', 1978, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Lautner, Henri Decaë', 'Norbert Carbonnaux', 'Jean Lefebvre, Henri Guybet, Julien Guiomar, Renée Saint-Cyr, Catherine Lachens, Daniel Ceccaldi, Michel Peyrelon, Jean-Jacques Moreau', null, 'Julien est envoyé par son patron à l''île Maurice, où il fait la connaissance d''Henri, un chômeur professionnel. Un soir de beuverie, les deux hommes se soulagent au pied d''une statue sacrée. Offensés par ce sacrilège, les dieux les punissent en leur ôtant leur reflet et en les faisant léviter. Si cette situation leur paraît au début invivable, les deux hommes finissent cependant par tirer parti de ces désavantages pour régler leurs problèmes personnels.', 'Julien est envoyé par son patron à l''île Maurice, où il fait la connaissance d''Henri, un chômeur professionnel. Un soir de beuverie, les deux hommes se soulagent au pied d''une statue sacrée. Offensés par ce sacrilège, les dieux les punissent en leur ôtant leur reflet et en les faisant léviter. Si cette situation leur paraît au début invivable, les deux hommes finissent cependant par tirer parti de ces désavantages pour régler leurs problèmes personnels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGNd7KrP3aXp5vlSS5shrSKv0hr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53009'),
