  ('848599101822175820', 'Thesis', 1996, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Alejandro Amenábar, Hans Burmann, Mateo Gil', 'Alejandro Amenábar', 'Ana Torrent, Fele Martínez, Eduardo Noriega, Xabier Elorriaga, Miguel Picazo, Nieves Herranz, Rosa Campillo, Paco Hernández', null, 'While working on a thesis about audiovisual violence, film student Ángela finds a snuff video where a girl is tortured until death. Soon she discovers that she was a former student in her university, and that the authors of the video are not very far either.', 'While working on a thesis about audiovisual violence, film student Ángela finds a snuff video where a girl is tortured until death. Soon she discovers that she was a former student in her university, and that the authors of the video are not very far either.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPyONW7fyb3iQ5s4WieNaHSX2id.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9299'),
  ('475052153459780430', 'Thesis on a Homicide', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Hernán Goldfrid, Rolo Pulpeiro', 'Patricio Vega', 'Ricardo Darín, Alberto Ammann, Calu Rivero, Arturo Puig, Fabián Arenillas, Mara Bestelli, Antonio Ugo, José Luis Mazza', null, 'Roberto is a Law professor whose life is thrown into chaos when he becomes convinced that one of his best students has committed a brutal murder. Determined to uncover the truth, he begins a personal investigation…', 'Roberto is a Law professor whose life is thrown into chaos when he becomes convinced that one of his best students has committed a brutal murder. Determined to uncover the truth, he begins a personal investigation…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJr8TqZ1EhX5705U8SUPSfOqftJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167963'),
