  ('189379055874034328', 'They Call Me Trinity', 1970, 'Action, Comedy, Western', 'Aldo Giordani, Enzo Barboni, Giorgio Ubaldi', 'Enzo Barboni', 'Terence Hill, Bud Spencer, Steffen Zacharias, Dan Sturkie, Gisela Hahn, Elena Pedemonte, Farley Granger, Ezio Marano', 'G', 'The simple story has the pair coming to the rescue of peace-loving Mormons when land-hungry Major Harriman sends his bullies to harass them into giving up their fertile valley. Trinity and Bambino manage to save the Mormons and send the bad guys packing with slapstick humor instead of excessive violence, saving the day.', 'The simple story has the pair coming to the rescue of peace-loving Mormons when land-hungry Major Harriman sends his bullies to harass them into giving up their fertile valley. Trinity and Bambino manage to save the Mormons and send the bad guys packing with slapstick humor instead of excessive violence, saving the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qY7iV4BJD5IXJU4iXlcZxKN8s9w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9394'),
  ('584138187746186078', 'They Call Us Misfits', 1968, 'Documentary', 'Jan Lindkvist, Stefan Jarl, Jan Lindkvist', 'Stefan Jarl, Jan Lindkvist', 'Kenneth ''Kenta'' Gustafsson, Gustav ''Stoffe'' Svensson, Jan ''Jajje'' Klingryd, Stefan Jarl', null, 'A documentary film depicting a group of young boys from Stockholm which live on the outskirts of society. The film is the first part of a trilogy.', 'A documentary film depicting a group of young boys from Stockholm which live on the outskirts of society. The film is the first part of a trilogy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/430znVHk45xX5ze9w6FEPfhw01a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56500'),
  ('1067200428047606226', 'They Called Him Bulldozer', 1978, 'Action, Comedy', 'Michele Lupo, Fabrizio Sergenti Castellani, Paolo Fondato', 'Rainer Brandt', 'Bud Spencer, Raimund Harmstorf, Ottaviano Dell''Acqua, Nando Paone, Enzo Santaniello, Marco Stefanelli, Giovanni Vettorazzo, Reinhard Kolldehoff', null, 'The "Bulldozer", a former football star, is now working as a fisherman. As a group of street-people arranges a football match against the local Armybase, he is asked to be their trainer. His boat was damaged by a submarine and he currently has no work, so he agrees.', 'The "Bulldozer", a former football star, is now working as a fisherman. As a group of street-people arranges a football match against the local Armybase, he is asked to be their trainer. His boat was damaged by a submarine and he currently has no work, so he agrees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVaw72xh9ViQ5GHoegAbzcmBQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11144'),
  ('736973327304732443', 'They Called Him Mostly Harmless', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime, Mystery', 'Patricia E. Gillespie', null, null, null, 'When an unidentified hiker is found deceased in the Florida wilderness, authorities release a sketch. Multiple hikers call in claiming to have met the man. There''s only one problem – he never told them his name. It would take two years, thousands of devoted internet sleuths, and a miracle of science to identify him, and that''s when the trouble really starts.', 'When an unidentified hiker is found deceased in the Florida wilderness, authorities release a sketch. Multiple hikers call in claiming to have met the man. There''s only one problem – he never told them his name. It would take two years, thousands of devoted internet sleuths, and a miracle of science to identify him, and that''s when the trouble really starts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3Ngi39RT9kxTPyGN5CwK2XEZrk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1105868'),
  ('155201078147873001', 'They Called Him Spencer', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Karl-Martin Pold, Serafin Spitzer, Christopher Dillig', 'Michael Gizicki, Karl-Martin Pold', 'Marcus Zölch, Jorgo Papasoglou, Bud Spencer, Terence Hill, Riccardo Pizzuti, Mario Pilar, Marco Barboni, Giulio Base', null, 'SIE NANNTEN IHN SPENCER follows two of Bud Spencer''s biggest fans on a road trip through Europe in search for their idol, who captured the hearts of millions and had so much more to offer than his legendary hammer-like fist blow.', 'SIE NANNTEN IHN SPENCER follows two of Bud Spencer''s biggest fans on a road trip through Europe in search for their idol, who captured the hearts of millions and had so much more to offer than his legendary hammer-like fist blow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBrqxiZOJYNBw9qNsYYZFPNIPVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458171'),
  ('567405040935583011', 'They Came from Beyond Space', 1967, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Freddie Francis, Norman Warwick, Ray Corbett', 'Milton Subotsky', 'Robert Hutton, Jennifer Jayne, Bernard Kay, Zia Mohyeddin, Geoffrey Wallace, Maurice Good, Michael Gough, Luanshya Greer', null, 'When meteors in a curious V-formation crash on a Cornwall field, an alien force possesses several scientists and infects bystanders with a deadly disease. Shielded from the meteor''s influence by a metal plate in his head, Dr Curtis Temple discovers that an alien race on the moon seeks to use the manipulated geniuses for seemingly nefarious purposes. But, as he learns more about the invaders, they may not be as evil as initially thought.', 'When meteors in a curious V-formation crash on a Cornwall field, an alien force possesses several scientists and infects bystanders with a deadly disease. Shielded from the meteor''s influence by a metal plate in his head, Dr Curtis Temple discovers that an alien race on the moon seeks to use the manipulated geniuses for seemingly nefarious purposes. But, as he learns more about the invaders, they may not be as evil as initially thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJURpYgHWtsxNpIUOi9syHSoEgF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35668'),
