  ('1038758553833906631', 'They Died with Their Boots On', 1941, 'Western, War, Drama, Romance', 'Raoul Walsh, Claude Archer, Arthur Lueker', 'Wally Kline, Æneas MacKenzie', 'Errol Flynn, Olivia de Havilland, Arthur Kennedy, Charley Grapewin, Gene Lockhart, Anthony Quinn, Stanley Ridges, John Litel', 'NR', 'The story follows General George Armstrong Custer''s adventures from his West Point days to his death. He defies orders during the Civil War, trains the 7th Cavalry, appeases Chief Crazy Horse and later engages in bloody battle with the Sioux nation.', 'The story follows General George Armstrong Custer''s adventures from his West Point days to his death. He defies orders during the Civil War, trains the 7th Cavalry, appeases Chief Crazy Horse and later engages in bloody battle with the Sioux nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gx8jknFwZRuQwTPooe14Dsx5uTO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17382'),
  ('148172057657405603', 'They Don''t Wear Black Tie', 1981, 'Drama', 'Lauro Escorel, Leon Hirszman, Radamés Gnattali', 'Leon Hirszman, Gianfrancesco Guarnieri', 'Carlos Alberto Riccelli, Bete Mendes, Fernanda Montenegro, Gianfrancesco Guarnieri, Anselmo Vasconcelos, Cristina Rodrigues, Fernando Peixoto, Fernando Bezerra', null, 'Otavio is an idealistic union leader trying to organize workers at a factory to resist the company''s exploitative practices. His son, Tião, one of the employees, is more of a realist and doesn''t want to risk losing his job by striking. This clash of perspectives puts the father and son at odds. Fortunately, Tião''s mother, Romana, is on hand to act as a moderator between the two opinionated men.', 'Otavio is an idealistic union leader trying to organize workers at a factory to resist the company''s exploitative practices. His son, Tião, one of the employees, is more of a realist and doesn''t want to risk losing his job by striking. This clash of perspectives puts the father and son at odds. Fortunately, Tião''s mother, Romana, is on hand to act as a moderator between the two opinionated men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPXqqIKolmahbRE8EluwGtO7ggD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203158'),
  ('556234171437932136', 'They Drive by Night', 1938, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Arthur B. Woods, Basil Emmott, Bretton Byrd', 'Paul Gangelin, Derek N. Twist', 'Emlyn Williams, Ernest Thesiger, Anna Konstam, Allan Jeayes, Anthony Holles, Ronald Shiner, William Hartnell, Joe Cunningham', null, '“Shorty” Matthews having recently been released from prison visits his girlfriend in London only to discover her murdered. Fearing he will be wrongly accused of being the culprit he disappears amongst the long-distance lorry driving community. Meanwhile, the real killer, unassuming ex-schoolteacher Walter Hoover, continues to prey on London women. As Shorty had feared he has become the main suspect. He returns to London with old flame Molly to prove his innocence.', '“Shorty” Matthews having recently been released from prison visits his girlfriend in London only to discover her murdered. Fearing he will be wrongly accused of being the culprit he disappears amongst the long-distance lorry driving community. Meanwhile, the real killer, unassuming ex-schoolteacher Walter Hoover, continues to prey on London women. As Shorty had feared he has become the main suspect. He returns to London with old flame Molly to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rU73sPD3I7L0yALbt1QW42LVpJ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26292'),
  ('72044909786774693', 'They Drive by Night', 1940, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Raoul Walsh, Arthur Edeson, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Richard Macaulay, Jerry Wald', 'George Raft, Ann Sheridan, Ida Lupino, Humphrey Bogart, Gale Page, Alan Hale, Roscoe Karns, Joyce Compton', 'NR', 'Joe and Paul Fabrini are Wildcat, or independent, truck drivers who have their own small one-truck business. The Fabrini boys constantly battle distributors, rivals and loan collectors, while trying to make a success of their transport company.', 'Joe and Paul Fabrini are Wildcat, or independent, truck drivers who have their own small one-truck business. The Fabrini boys constantly battle distributors, rivals and loan collectors, while trying to make a success of their transport company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uF0X3IMhPIFgbwzlbayUsj4I6Tc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16933'),
  ('662251191215855620', 'They Fought for Their Motherland', 1975, 'War, History, Drama', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Vadim Yusov, Anatoli Chemodurov', 'Sergey Bondarchuk', 'Vasiliy Shukshin, Vyacheslav Tikhonov, Sergey Bondarchuk, Georgi Burkov, Yuriy Nikulin, Ivan Lapikov, Nikolai Gubenko, Andrei Rostotsky', null, 'In July 1942, in the Second World War, the rearguard of the Russian army protects the bridgehead of the Don River against the German army while the retreating Russian troops cross the bridge. While they move back to the Russian territory through the countryside, the soldiers show their companionship, sentiments, fears and heroism to defend their motherland.', 'In July 1942, in the Second World War, the rearguard of the Russian army protects the bridgehead of the Don River against the German army while the retreating Russian troops cross the bridge. While they move back to the Russian territory through the countryside, the soldiers show their companionship, sentiments, fears and heroism to defend their motherland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TI2mup2pB37qbo5aa75FI84h3E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86382'),
