  ('83277123650731046', 'They Met in the Dark', 1943, 'Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Karel Lamač', 'Miles Malleson', 'James Mason, Joyce Howard, Tom Walls, Phyllis Stanley, Edward Rigby, Ronald Ward, David Farrar, Karl Stepanek', 'NR', 'A Royal navy Commander is tricked by a pretty girl who is working for the Nazis. She tricks him into revealing some military secrets and he is court martial. He vows to track her and her accomplices down.', 'A Royal navy Commander is tricked by a pretty girl who is working for the Nazis. She tricks him into revealing some military secrets and he is court martial. He vows to track her and her accomplices down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjN8FWzyKr0BCOkqRbgBVASqNq5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54946'),
  ('174040343311178280', 'They Might Be Giants', 1971, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Anthony Harvey, Victor J. Kemper, Norman I. Cohen', 'James Goldman', 'George C. Scott, Joanne Woodward, Jack Gilford, Lester Rawlins, Al Lewis, Rue McClanahan, Theresa Merritt, James Tolkan', 'G', 'After the death of his wife, retired judge Justin Playfair creates a fantasy world for himself in which he is the legendary detective Sherlock Holmes, even dressing like the character. Out of concern for Justin''s money more than his health, his brother Blevins puts him under the care of psychiatrist Dr. Mildred Watson. As Dr. Watson grows fond of Justin, she begins to play along with his theories, eventually becoming an assistant in his investigations.', 'After the death of his wife, retired judge Justin Playfair creates a fantasy world for himself in which he is the legendary detective Sherlock Holmes, even dressing like the character. Out of concern for Justin''s money more than his health, his brother Blevins puts him under the care of psychiatrist Dr. Mildred Watson. As Dr. Watson grows fond of Justin, she begins to play along with his theories, eventually becoming an assistant in his investigations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzv8J2Vu63AQyEw5D9ckyBgn9Fo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27841'),
  ('298938674090230477', 'They Nest', 2000, 'Science Fiction, Horror, TV Movie', 'Ellory Elkayem, Paul Mitchnick, Philip Linzey', 'John Claflin, Daniel Zelman', 'Thomas Calabro, Dean Stockwell, John Savage, Kristen Dalton, Tom McBeath, Mark Schooley, Travis MacDonald, Dean Wray', 'PG-13', 'After freezing up under pressure in the emergency room, Dr. Cahill decides to spend a few months unwinding on a little Maine island where he immediately gets off on the wrong foot with the locals. Meanwhile, a body has washed up on shore infested with a strange type of carnivorous cockroach. But when Dr. Cahill tries to warn the townsfolk of the danger, they are naturally skeptical. Will they realize the truth before it''s too late?', 'After freezing up under pressure in the emergency room, Dr. Cahill decides to spend a few months unwinding on a little Maine island where he immediately gets off on the wrong foot with the locals. Meanwhile, a body has washed up on shore infested with a strange type of carnivorous cockroach. But when Dr. Cahill tries to warn the townsfolk of the danger, they are naturally skeptical. Will they realize the truth before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCSSGMXLPKcPHZF3QlwkRxQtlis.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40249'),
  ('56582081314211668', 'They Only Kill Their Masters', 1972, 'Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Michel Hugo, Scott U. Adam, Wes McAfee', 'Lane Slate', 'James Garner, Katharine Ross, Hal Holbrook, Harry Guardino, June Allyson, Christopher Connelly, Tom Ewell, Peter Lawford', 'PG', 'An enigmatic young woman has been murdered in a small California coast town. The investigation by the local sheriff uncovers a complex web of relationships centering on the victim; the scattered trail of evidence ranges from a mysterious photograph to the victim''s own dog. During the investigation, the sheriff meets and becomes romantically involved with a woman whose connection to the murder is ambiguous.', 'An enigmatic young woman has been murdered in a small California coast town. The investigation by the local sheriff uncovers a complex web of relationships centering on the victim; the scattered trail of evidence ranges from a mysterious photograph to the victim''s own dog. During the investigation, the sheriff meets and becomes romantically involved with a woman whose connection to the murder is ambiguous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRv91nooES0CwfQbamGl45Nv0rW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62996'),
  ('110911378895314283', 'They Raid by Night', 1942, 'Drama, War', 'Spencer Gordon Bennet', 'Jack Natteford', 'Lyle Talbot, June Duprez, Victor Varconi, George N. Neise, Charley Rogers, Paul Baratoff, Leslie Denison, Crane Whitley', 'NR', 'The British Commandos send Bob Owen to Norway to prepare for a raid. His mission also includes freeing General Heden who is being held by the Nazis. His aides include Eric Falken and Harry. Inga, a Norwegian girl to whom Falken was once engaged but who has become the sweetheart of Oberst Von Ritter, betrays their hiding place.', 'The British Commandos send Bob Owen to Norway to prepare for a raid. His mission also includes freeing General Heden who is being held by the Nazis. His aides include Eric Falken and Harry. Inga, a Norwegian girl to whom Falken was once engaged but who has become the sweetheart of Oberst Von Ritter, betrays their hiding place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xCg6XGw1bxcNDX5isCrxtZUByc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98237'),
  ('1075953695677245555', 'They Reach', 2020, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Sylas Dall', 'Sylas Dall', 'Mary Madaline Roe, Morgan Chandler, Eden Campbell, Kyan Zielinski, Elizabeth Rhoades, Ash Calder, Frederick Floyd, Taylor Bartle', null, 'In 1979, a young girl stumbles upon a possessed tape player. She unknowingly unleashes a demonic entity that haunts her family while slowly dragging the small town of Clarkston to Hell.', 'In 1979, a young girl stumbles upon a possessed tape player. She unknowingly unleashes a demonic entity that haunts her family while slowly dragging the small town of Clarkston to Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wX1t2sPKN2JGzp0rcg4sVx8fyid.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:711705'),
  ('909072386984112516', 'They Returned', 2015, 'Crime, Horror, Drama', 'Iván Noel, Marcos Rostagno, Iván Noel', 'Iván Noel', 'Valentina Sartorelli, Juan Ignacio Molina, Lauro Veron, Camila Cruz, Julio Mendez, Rosana Rossotti, Germán de Goycoechea, Edmee Aran', null, 'They Returned is a beautifully touching and unnerving story about the unexplained disappearance of three children, two boys and one girl, and their reappearance three days later in a semi-autistic state. Not even the children themselves are able to help anyone understand what happened.', 'They Returned is a beautifully touching and unnerving story about the unexplained disappearance of three children, two boys and one girl, and their reappearance three days later in a semi-autistic state. Not even the children themselves are able to help anyone understand what happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sj6fKYljxp9WxSF5HLAIqWdTitx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308831'),
  ('290426546221110255', 'They Rode West', 1954, 'Western', 'Phil Karlson, Charles Lawton Jr., Sam Nelson', 'DeVallon Scott, Frank S. Nugent', 'Robert Francis, Donna Reed, May Wynn, Philip Carey, Onslow Stevens, Peggy Converse, Roy Roberts, Jack Kelly', 'NR', 'A young cavalry doctor treats very sick Indians against orders, whom are forced to stay on unhealthy land, which could lead to a war.', 'A young cavalry doctor treats very sick Indians against orders, whom are forced to stay on unhealthy land, which could lead to a war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gug1gIK5mypDr0KlvXfrFYR7ZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141978'),
  ('633277608593633236', 'They Saved Hitler''s Brain', 1968, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Stanley Cortez, Harry M. Slott, David Bradley', 'Richard Miles', 'Walter Stocker, Audrey Caire, Carlos Rivas, John Holland, Marshall Reed, Scott Peters, Keith Dahle, Dani Lynn', null, 'At the end of WWII, Nazi officials spirited the living head of Adolf Hitler out of Germany to a hiding place in the South American country of Mandoras, in order to revive the Third Reich at a later date. By the 1960s, the time has come, so a top scientist is kidnapped in order to help keep Hitler alive. This film is a re-edit of The Madmen of Mandoras released in theaters in 1963.', 'At the end of WWII, Nazi officials spirited the living head of Adolf Hitler out of Germany to a hiding place in the South American country of Mandoras, in order to revive the Third Reich at a later date. By the 1960s, the time has come, so a top scientist is kidnapped in order to help keep Hitler alive. This film is a re-edit of The Madmen of Mandoras released in theaters in 1963.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpZeXWUxvrUuHE7Wtjyl4VOvhHF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222258'),
  ('13604239850259052', 'They Shall Have Music', 1939, 'Family, Music, Drama', 'Archie Mayo, Walter Mayo, Gregg Toland', 'Irma von Cube, John Howard Lawson', 'Jascha Heifetz, Joel McCrea, Andrea Leeds, Gene Reynolds, Walter Brennan, Terry Kilburn, Tommy Kelly, Porter Hall', 'NR', 'The future is bleak for a troubled boy from a broken home in the slums. He runs away when his step father breaks his violin, ending up sleeping in the basement of a music school for poor children.', 'The future is bleak for a troubled boy from a broken home in the slums. He runs away when his step father breaks his violin, ending up sleeping in the basement of a music school for poor children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ym3TEIM0FrsnCmtX4KHgkFn9wWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130841'),
  ('510189021074239081', 'They Shall Not Grow Old', 2018, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Peter Jackson, Thomas Haley-Hermiz, Andrew Kennedy', 'Peter Jackson', 'Thomas Adlam, William Argent, John Ashby, Attwood, Walter Aust, Donald Bain, Thomas Baker, George Banton', 'R', 'A documentary about World War I with never-before-seen footage to commemorate the centennial of Armistice Day, and the end of the war.', 'A documentary about World War I with never-before-seen footage to commemorate the centennial of Armistice Day, and the end of the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMGfJeTXUdIjOqjS0jJfjgYEuYC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543580'),
  ('265887078310226260', 'They Shoot Horses, Don''t They?', 1969, 'Drama', 'Sydney Pollack, Philip H. Lathrop', 'James Poe, Robert E. Thompson', 'Jane Fonda, Michael Sarrazin, Susannah York, Gig Young, Red Buttons, Bonnie Bedelia, Michael Conrad, Bruce Dern', 'PG', 'In the midst of the Great Depression, manipulative emcee Rocky enlists contestants for a dance marathon offering a $1,500 cash prize. Among them are a failed actress, a middle-aged sailor, a delusional blonde and a pregnant girl.', 'In the midst of the Great Depression, manipulative emcee Rocky enlists contestants for a dance marathon offering a $1,500 cash prize. Among them are a failed actress, a middle-aged sailor, a delusional blonde and a pregnant girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wVLBgriOQpT5RrufAFCdCSUp7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28145'),
  ('96627355679380170', 'They Shot the Piano Player', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, History', 'Carlos León Sancha, Fernando Trueba, Javier Mariscal', 'Fernando Trueba', 'Jeff Goldblum, Tony Ramos, Abel Ayala, Roberta Wallach, Vinicius de Moraes, João Gilberto, Gilberto Gil, Milton Nascimento', 'PG-13', 'New York, 2010. Jeff Harris, a music journalist, sets out to uncover the truth about Francisco Tenório Júnior, a young Brazilian samba-jazz pianist who disappeared in Buenos Aires on March 18, 1976.', 'New York, 2010. Jeff Harris, a music journalist, sets out to uncover the truth about Francisco Tenório Júnior, a young Brazilian samba-jazz pianist who disappeared in Buenos Aires on March 18, 1976.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m91id99MIA0iHxFIO6WBLXmJHrk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646265'),
  ('638001520617986234', 'They Swapped My Baby', 2018, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Agnès Obadia, Benoît Chamaillard', 'Solen Roy-Pagenault', 'Julie de Bona, Agustín Galiana, Stéphan Guérin-Tillié, Sonia Rolland, Charline Balu-Emane, Maïa Quesemand, Patrick Descamps, César Méric', null, 'The true story of Sophie Serrano, a single mother whose ex protests paternity of the eldest. The DNA tests will reveal the unthinkable: Manon isn''t theirs. Her biological child has been exchanged at birth to the maternity ward''s error.', 'The true story of Sophie Serrano, a single mother whose ex protests paternity of the eldest. The DNA tests will reveal the unthinkable: Manon isn''t theirs. Her biological child has been exchanged at birth to the maternity ward''s error.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4gsVmPcwy41RFXAIdS5PJcpyGE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551342'),
  ('343887640515803522', 'They Talk', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Rocco Marra, Giorgio Bruno, Alessandra Cartanese', 'Stefano Ceccarelli, Vinicio Canton', 'Jonathan Tufvesson, Margaux Billard, Sydney White, Aciel Martinez Pol, Hal Yamanouchi, Rocío Muñoz Morales, Aaron Stielstra, Stefania Montesolaro', null, 'Alex, a sound engineer, accidentally records mysterious voices: disturbing messages from the afterlife who warn him against an imminent and terrifying danger. Amanda, with whom he shares a terrible secret, re-emerges from his past. The appearance of the young woman triggers chilling paranormal phenomena that leave behind a trail of corpses. Is she the danger the voices of the dead speak about?', 'Alex, a sound engineer, accidentally records mysterious voices: disturbing messages from the afterlife who warn him against an imminent and terrifying danger. Amanda, with whom he shares a terrible secret, re-emerges from his past. The appearance of the young woman triggers chilling paranormal phenomena that leave behind a trail of corpses. Is she the danger the voices of the dead speak about?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4f0PbmE6hSJdT52VM6DiUhXzcp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:831028'),
  ('876284540429184014', 'They Wait', 2007, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ernie Barbarash, Gregory Middleton', null, 'Jaime King, Terry Chen, Cheng Pei-Pei, Henry O, Michael Biehn, Stephen Chang', 'R', 'Jason and his wife, Sarah, leave their adopted home of Shanghai and travel to Vancouver, British Columbia, for his uncle''s funeral, staying with his Aunt Mei. Already disoriented, Jason and Sarah are unnerved when their son, Sam, begins seeing ghosts and violent deaths. After Sam is hospitalized, Sarah consults with a pharmacist who''s well-informed about Chinese mythology and who tells her that supernatural forces threaten her son.', 'Jason and his wife, Sarah, leave their adopted home of Shanghai and travel to Vancouver, British Columbia, for his uncle''s funeral, staying with his Aunt Mei. Already disoriented, Jason and Sarah are unnerved when their son, Sam, begins seeing ghosts and violent deaths. After Sam is hospitalized, Sarah consults with a pharmacist who''s well-informed about Chinese mythology and who tells her that supernatural forces threaten her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25qmTS29waISYV2KynNcTfx6KfA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17158'),
  ('984885183366527199', 'They Wait in the Dark', 2022, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Patrick Rea', 'Patrick Rea', 'Sarah McGuire, Laurie Catherine Winkel, Paige Maria, Patrick McGee, Chris Bylsma, Meagan Flynn, Dan Daly, Chad Crenshaw', null, 'Amy, a young woman is on the run with her young son Adrian from her abusive ex-girlfriend. When the past rises up to haunt them, they must confront the forces threatening them from both outside and in.', 'Amy, a young woman is on the run with her young son Adrian from her abusive ex-girlfriend. When the past rises up to haunt them, they must confront the forces threatening them from both outside and in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDpZXwEjxma0zeS4QRcraRpOsoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999681'),
  ('128680594644237559', 'They Were Eleven', 1986, 'Animation, Romance, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Satoshi Dezaki, Tsuneo Tominaga, Nobuo Koyama', 'Toshiaki Imaizumi, Kazumi Koide', 'Akira Kamiya, Michiko Kawai, Hideyuki Tanaka, Toshio Furukawa, Tessyo Genda, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Norio Wakamoto, Michihiro Ikemizu', 'NR', 'A group of students from the Cosmo Academy are about to take their final exam: surviving for over fifty days in a derelict ship. But when they arrive, they discover that instead of ten students, there are eleven. One of them doesn''t belong there...', 'A group of students from the Cosmo Academy are about to take their final exam: surviving for over fifty days in a derelict ship. But when they arrive, they discover that instead of ten students, there are eleven. One of them doesn''t belong there...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvjfW8ugP3Z3jjr4F8ANieuNBZg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28214'),
  ('965331296481679304', 'They Were Expendable', 1945, 'Drama, War', 'John Ford, Joseph H. August, Edward O''Fearna', 'Frank Wead, Christina Stead', 'Robert Montgomery, John Wayne, Donna Reed, Jack Holt, Ward Bond, Marshall Thompson, Paul Langton, Leon Ames', 'NR', 'After a demonstration of new PT boats, navy brass are still unconvinced of their viability in combat, leaving Lt. "Rusty" Ryan frustrated. After the attack on Pearl Harbor, however, Ryan and his buddy Lt. Brickley are told they can finally take their squadron into battle. The PT boats quickly prove their worth, successfully shooting down Japanese planes, relaying messages between islands, and picking off a multitude of enemy ships.', 'After a demonstration of new PT boats, navy brass are still unconvinced of their viability in combat, leaving Lt. "Rusty" Ryan frustrated. After the attack on Pearl Harbor, however, Ryan and his buddy Lt. Brickley are told they can finally take their squadron into battle. The PT boats quickly prove their worth, successfully shooting down Japanese planes, relaying messages between islands, and picking off a multitude of enemy ships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejzJHdvEtUVbiLrDE55DRQskYyf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18771'),
  ('865198259718000536', 'They Were So Young', 1954, 'Crime', 'Ekkehard Kyrath, Kurt Neumann', 'Kurt Neumann, Felix Lützkendorf', 'Scott Brady, Johanna Matz, Raymond Burr, Ingrid Stenn, Gisela Fackeldey, Kurt Meisel, Katharina Mayberg, Gert Fröbe', null, 'A model agency in Rio de Janeiro is actually a front for a white-slavery ring that kidnaps European women and sells them on the South American sex market.', 'A model agency in Rio de Janeiro is actually a front for a white-slavery ring that kidnaps European women and sells them on the South American sex market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJGB3gR314jLIQrBy8wQt6VUn9Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61089'),
  ('349534300506047664', 'They Who Dare', 1954, 'War', 'Lewis Milestone, Wilkie Cooper', 'Robert Westerby', 'Dirk Bogarde, Denholm Elliott, Eric Pohlmann, Akim Tamiroff, Harold Siddons, William Russell, Sam Kydd, Gérard Oury', null, 'In Greece during the war a small group of British commandoes and patriots land on an island with orders to attack two airfields from which the Luftwaffe is threatening allied forces in Egypt. The island is crawling with troops, and even moving by night the men soon run into trouble.', 'In Greece during the war a small group of British commandoes and patriots land on an island with orders to attack two airfields from which the Luftwaffe is threatening allied forces in Egypt. The island is crawling with troops, and even moving by night the men soon run into trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCEPdHG7DCBDVWfswHThQl11PPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114746'),
  ('62357324869561682', 'They Will Be Dust', 2024, 'Drama, Music, Comedy', 'Carlos Marques-Marcet, Mireia Juárez, Mayca Sanz', 'Coral Cruz, Carlos Marques-Marcet, Clara Roquet', 'Ángela Molina, Alfredo Castro, Mònica Almirall, Manuela Biedermann, Oriol Genís, Mont Plans, Valeria Scheilen, Alván Prado', null, 'After receiving the diagnosis of an incurable brain tumor, Claudia decides to undertake her last trip to Switzerland. There she can decide how and when to end her life thanks to the help of an assisted suicide association.', 'After receiving the diagnosis of an incurable brain tumor, Claudia decides to undertake her last trip to Switzerland. There she can decide how and when to end her life thanks to the help of an assisted suicide association.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m500s6Lif7ZUFPiriOD1Rovw75y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1224666'),
  ('449851017970762776', 'They Will Kill You', 2026, 'Action, Horror, Comedy', 'Kirill Sokolov, Kirk Doman, Isaac Bauman', 'Kirill Sokolov, Alex Litvak', 'Zazie Beetz, Patricia Arquette, Myha''la, Paterson Joseph, Tom Felton, Heather Graham, Willie Ludik, David Viviers', 'R', 'A woman answers a help wanted ad to be a housekeeper in a mysterious New York City high-rise, unaware that she is entering a community that has seen a number of disappearances over the years and may be under the grip of a Satanic cult.', 'A woman answers a help wanted ad to be a housekeeper in a mysterious New York City high-rise, unaware that she is entering a community that has seen a number of disappearances over the years and may be under the grip of a Satanic cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oI4oQKTWMVUlr8Ivqydp28Ruu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1292695'),
  ('233187710633914748', 'They Won''t Believe Me', 1947, 'Drama, Romance', 'Harry J. Wild, Irving Pichel, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Jonathan Latimer', 'Robert Young, Susan Hayward, Jane Greer, Rita Johnson, Tom Powers, George Tyne, Don Beddoe, Frank Ferguson', 'NR', 'On trial for murdering his girlfriend, philandering stockbroker Larry Ballentine takes the stand to claim his innocence and describe the actual, but improbable sounding, sequence of events that led to her death.', 'On trial for murdering his girlfriend, philandering stockbroker Larry Ballentine takes the stand to claim his innocence and describe the actual, but improbable sounding, sequence of events that led to her death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUMZpKU2GRUKjeufdJKfbPhBzva.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27203'),
  ('144455549120000009', 'They Won''t Forget', 1937, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Arthur Edeson', 'Robert Rossen, Aben Kandel', 'Claude Rains, Gloria Dickson, Edward Norris, Otto Kruger, Allyn Joslyn, Lana Turner, Linda Perry, Elisha Cook Jr.', 'NR', 'A southern town is rocked by scandal when teenager Mary Clay is murdered on Confederate Decoration Day. Andrew Griffin, a small-time lawyer with political ambitions, sees the crime as his ticket to the Senate if he can find the right victim to finger for the crime. He sets out to convict Robert Hale, a transplanted northerner who was Mary''s teacher at the business school where she was killed. Despite the fact that all the evidence against Hale is circumstantial, Griffin works with a ruthless reporter to create a media frenzy of prejudice and hate against the teacher.', 'A southern town is rocked by scandal when teenager Mary Clay is murdered on Confederate Decoration Day. Andrew Griffin, a small-time lawyer with political ambitions, sees the crime as his ticket to the Senate if he can find the right victim to finger for the crime. He sets out to convict Robert Hale, a transplanted northerner who was Mary''s teacher at the business school where she was killed. Despite the fact that all the evidence against Hale is circumstantial, Griffin works with a ruthless reporter to create a media frenzy of prejudice and hate against the teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7IHtsZyrGreRTUyIV6Mi2pKpl7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80639'),
  ('654913103186128551', 'They''ll Love Me When I''m Dead', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Morgan Neville, Danny Grunes', null, 'Alan Cumming, Peter Bogdanovich, Oja Kodar, Orson Welles, Steve Ecclesine, R. Michael Stringer, Peter Jason, Larry Jackson', null, 'As his life comes to its end, famous Hollywood director Orson Welles puts it all on the line at the chance for renewed success with the film The Other Side of the Wind.', 'As his life comes to its end, famous Hollywood director Orson Welles puts it all on the line at the chance for renewed success with the film The Other Side of the Wind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7YHg3BOEjlZSCJ41FBHyeQkoUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538002'),
  ('813143808518906372', 'They''re a Weird Mob', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Michael Powell, Arthur Grant', 'Emeric Pressburger', 'Walter Chiari, Claire Dunne, Chips Rafferty, Alida Chelli, Ed Devereaux, Slim DeGrey, John Meillon, Charles Little', null, 'An Italian sports journalist arrives in Australia but finds no work. The only employment he can find is as a builder''s labourer. At first, he cannot comprehend the culture, but eventually he finds mateship and romance.', 'An Italian sports journalist arrives in Australia but finds no work. The only employment he can find is as a builder''s labourer. At first, he cannot comprehend the culture, but eventually he finds mateship and romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DkpOKOHc4gSA1wjS7NDfKZW8TU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31486'),
  ('737048844075763594', 'They''re Off', 1948, 'Animation', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Harlow Wilcox, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'At the race track, various spectators (all Goofy lookalikes) are playing the ponies. A posh rich Goofy bets on the equally posh Snapshot III while another more common looking Goofy bets on the bedraggled Old Moe. When the race begins, Snapshot and the rider are so overconfident they wait a few minutes after the race has begun to start running. When they finally do get going, Snapshot is not above stooping to dirty tricks such as tripping and biting the other horses. Sadly, Snapshot''s vanity is what costs him winning the race (he stops to pose for the photo finish) and Old Moe is declared the winner.', 'At the race track, various spectators (all Goofy lookalikes) are playing the ponies. A posh rich Goofy bets on the equally posh Snapshot III while another more common looking Goofy bets on the bedraggled Old Moe. When the race begins, Snapshot and the rider are so overconfident they wait a few minutes after the race has begun to start running. When they finally do get going, Snapshot is not above stooping to dirty tricks such as tripping and biting the other horses. Sadly, Snapshot''s vanity is what costs him winning the race (he stops to pose for the photo finish) and Old Moe is declared the winner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udIM1qb2wc5ufIXDJa7KYqjYqSY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67608'),
  ('904274949326429505', 'They''re Playing with Fire', 1984, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Howard Avedis, Gary Graver', 'Howard Avedis, Marlene Schmidt', 'Sybil Danning, Eric Brown, Andrew Prine, Paul Clemens, K.T. Stevens, Gene Bicknell, Curt Ayers, Dominick Brascia', 'R', 'A married college professor decides to seduce her student, whom she hired as a handyman for her yacht. The hesitant student succumbs to his buxom professor, but their romance is interrupted by her corrupt husband and a masked murderer.', 'A married college professor decides to seduce her student, whom she hired as a handyman for her yacht. The hesitant student succumbs to his buxom professor, but their romance is interrupted by her corrupt husband and a masked murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvsWF6BWsPbm9p9dQz4pu9mkrW8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84997'),
  ('471433582893747054', 'They''re Watching', 2016, 'Thriller, Comedy, Horror', 'Micah Wright, Jay Lender', 'Micah Wright, Jay Lender', 'Brigid Brannagh, Carrie Genzel, David Alpay, Kris Lemche, Dimitri Diatchenko, Mia Marcon, Tatiana Dumitru', null, 'An American TV crew gets trapped in a centuries-old web of revenge, horror, and blood, when their home improvement show is attacked by angry Eastern European villagers out to kill the show''s star.', 'An American TV crew gets trapped in a centuries-old web of revenge, horror, and blood, when their home improvement show is attacked by angry Eastern European villagers out to kill the show''s star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPLi2PlEEbetgUkaFPESBAMG9Qw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383535'),
  ('407973643016892619', 'They''re Watching Us', 2002, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Norberto López Amado', 'Javier García Sánchez, Jorge Guerricaechevarría', 'Icíar Bollaín, Massimo Ghini, Manuel Lozano, Carmelo Gómez, Kevin Estiz', null, 'Norberto Lopez Amado''s They''re Watching Us is about a cop who becomes obsessed with a case. Juan (Carmelo Gomez) is ordered to head up an investigation concerning a businessman who has been missing for almost three years. The officer who worled on the case previously now resides in a mental institution and is unable to say anything other than, "They''re watching us." A priest (Roberto Alvarez) explains how a series of disappearances in the area have supernatural underpinnings. As Juan is absorbed deeper and deeper into the case, his mother is concerned for him.', 'Norberto Lopez Amado''s They''re Watching Us is about a cop who becomes obsessed with a case. Juan (Carmelo Gomez) is ordered to head up an investigation concerning a businessman who has been missing for almost three years. The officer who worled on the case previously now resides in a mental institution and is unable to say anything other than, "They''re watching us." A priest (Roberto Alvarez) explains how a series of disappearances in the area have supernatural underpinnings. As Juan is absorbed deeper and deeper into the case, his mother is concerned for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUX7ACsKaOZZMxDajoLIsUZwXaL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84955'),
  ('125849173067322903', 'They/Them', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery', 'John Logan, Lyn Moncrief', 'John Logan', 'Theo Germaine, Kevin Bacon, Quei Tann, Austin Crute, Monique Kim, Anna Lore, Cooper Koch, Darwin del Fabo', null, 'Campers at an LGBTQ+ conversion camp endure unsettling psychological techniques while the campsite is stalked by a mysterious killer.', 'Campers at an LGBTQ+ conversion camp endure unsettling psychological techniques while the campsite is stalked by a mysterious killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85TJ4udfUOwFIlvQL6EMFvvbvN5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816977'),
  ('209133044090088932', 'Thi Baan x BNK48', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Boonchok Sikham, Thiti Srinuan, Surasak Pongsorn', 'Surasak Pongsorn, Suphanat Namwong, Boonchok Sikham', 'Natthawut Saenyabut, Siriamol Onkoon, Thanadon Buarabat, Thanwaporn Nasombat, Akkharadech Yodjampa, Kanteera Wadcharathadsanakul, Natruja Chutiwansopon, Warattaya Deesomlert', null, 'In order to come up with new music, a girl music group has to go to live in the countryside. By putting aside their city lives, perhaps life in the countryside can prove inspirational and help the girl band to produce a fresh, new sound.', 'In order to come up with new music, a girl music group has to go to live in the countryside. By putting aside their city lives, perhaps life in the countryside can prove inspirational and help the girl band to produce a fresh, new sound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fCnjHfBAUGE7oVXyDoMFOOu1TC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628012'),
  ('551972969239048225', 'Thi Mai', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Patricia Ferreira', 'Marta Sánchez', 'Carmen Machi, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Adriana Ozores, Dani Rovira, Pedro Casablanc, Eric Nguyen, José Troncoso, Cecilia Solaguren', 'G', 'After losing her daughter in an accident, Carmen loses all incentive to keep going, until she receives an unexpected letter from the adoption agency: her daughter was finally granted the Vietnamese girl she had asked for adoption and whose name is Thi Mai.', 'After losing her daughter in an accident, Carmen loses all incentive to keep going, until she receives an unexpected letter from the adoption agency: her daughter was finally granted the Vietnamese girl she had asked for adoption and whose name is Thi Mai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gG1riXv2FAkjz8hxpmT6gml8PMq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437294'),
  ('926731662146843341', 'Thiago Ventura: POKAS', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Joana Mazzucchelli, Fabio Ock', 'Thiago Ventura', 'Thiago Ventura', null, 'In a rollicking special, Thiago Ventura jokes about life in the hood, politics and more, explaining how actions speak louder then words.', 'In a rollicking special, Thiago Ventura jokes about life in the hood, politics and more, explaining how actions speak louder then words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAc2hBnkqpssxzTDVP4P3Hcmucj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716978'),
  ('637786569975899708', 'Thick as Thieves', 1999, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Scott Sanders, Christopher Walling', 'Scott Sanders, Arthur Krystal', 'Alec Baldwin, Andre Braugher, Michael Jai White, Rebecca De Mornay, Mark Adair-Rios, Khandi Alexander, Cecil "Shuckey Duckey" Armstrong, Tom Babuscio', 'R', 'Two master thieves go at odds with one another as one sets the other up for a crime. The first, a suave pro who does his job and then hides in his own privacy, listening to old jazz records and caring for his ailing dog, Wally. The other is a local gangster with a taste for the finer life, who decides to eliminate the competition. This ignites a war between the two men and their aides. An angry mob boss and a female police officer try to sort the mess before things get too out of hand.', 'Two master thieves go at odds with one another as one sets the other up for a crime. The first, a suave pro who does his job and then hides in his own privacy, listening to old jazz records and caring for his ailing dog, Wally. The other is a local gangster with a taste for the finer life, who decides to eliminate the competition. This ignites a war between the two men and their aides. An angry mob boss and a female police officer try to sort the mess before things get too out of hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9Qi1B8cMUiRg5ouFV3lqX67eRJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67899'),
  ('841940379286417309', 'Thick as Thieves', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Julio Macat, Mimi Leder, Serban Rotariu', 'Ted Humphrey', 'Morgan Freeman, Antonio Banderas, Robert Forster, Radha Mitchell, Tom Hardy, Corey Johnson, Rade Šerbedžija, Michael Hayden', 'R', 'A master thief recruits a notorious thief to help him steal two famous Faberge eggs from an impenetrable vault in an effort to pull off one final job and repay his debt to the Russian mob.', 'A master thief recruits a notorious thief to help him steal two famous Faberge eggs from an impenetrable vault in an effort to pull off one final job and repay his debt to the Russian mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TOJiqayrIZQGtmmGjM3d7lp5gM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14979'),
  ('380093870741305959', 'Thick Skinned', 1989, 'Drama', 'Raoul Coutard, Patricia Mazuy', 'Patricia Mazuy', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Jean-François Stévenin, Jacques Spiesser, Salomé Stévenin, Laure Duthilleul, Jean-François Gallotte, Pierre Forget, Yann Dedet', null, 'Two brothers set fire to a barn while drunk, inadvertently causing the death of a sleeping wanderer. One of them takes all the blame for the incident and spends ten years in prison.', 'Two brothers set fire to a barn while drunk, inadvertently causing the death of a sleeping wanderer. One of them takes all the blame for the incident and spends ten years in prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQ7sqr5JX5NsQh7PSqLlWa2pXUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267100'),
  ('61510636745133297', 'Thicker than Water', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Keisuke Yoshida, Tsuyoshi Sugino', 'Keisuke Yoshida', 'Masataka Kubota, Hirofumi Arai, Keiko Enoue, Miwako Kakei, Kentaro Ito, Aisa Takeuchi, Ryohei Abe, Kazue Tsunogae', null, 'Hard-working Yuria runs a small printing company. Despite her best efforts, she can’t seem to attract the attention of Kazunari, a polite yet aloof client who is more interested in flirting with Mako, Yuria’s ditzy younger sister and employee. Meanwhile, Kazunari has his hands full with Takuji, his rough-hewn brother who was recently released from prison and is crashing at his apartment.', 'Hard-working Yuria runs a small printing company. Despite her best efforts, she can’t seem to attract the attention of Kazunari, a polite yet aloof client who is more interested in flirting with Mako, Yuria’s ditzy younger sister and employee. Meanwhile, Kazunari has his hands full with Takuji, his rough-hewn brother who was recently released from prison and is crashing at his apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8T79DKyyEvxw84ARmt3ztQr10Wg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529866'),
  ('880638751595985806', 'Thicker Than Water', 1935, 'Comedy', 'James W. Horne', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Daphne Pollard, James Finlayson, Bess Flowers, Charlie Hall', 'NR', 'Oliver''s in trouble with his wife after missing a payment on their furniture, having given the money to Stanley, who used it instead to pay Mrs. Hardy for his room and board. At Stan''s suggestion Ollie then withdraws the couple''s savings from the bank to pay for the furniture and inadvertently pays virtually the whole amount at an auction for a grandfather clock which is soon crushed under a passing truck. Mrs Hardy then unintentionally causes serious injuries to Ollie requiring him to be rushed to hospital for a blood transfusion. The doctor conscripts Stan to be the unwilling blood donor. Problems occur with the transfusion and when Stan and Ollie leave the hospital they appear to have morphed into each other.', 'Oliver''s in trouble with his wife after missing a payment on their furniture, having given the money to Stanley, who used it instead to pay Mrs. Hardy for his room and board. At Stan''s suggestion Ollie then withdraws the couple''s savings from the bank to pay for the furniture and inadvertently pays virtually the whole amount at an auction for a grandfather clock which is soon crushed under a passing truck. Mrs Hardy then unintentionally causes serious injuries to Ollie requiring him to be rushed to hospital for a blood transfusion. The doctor conscripts Stan to be the unwilling blood donor. Problems occur with the transfusion and when Stan and Ollie leave the hospital they appear to have morphed into each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9nqM7kwxKq0XHeWOpa8nIe91r6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50910'),
  ('167194895790957578', 'Thief', 1981, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Donald E. Thorin, Michael Mann, Michael Molly', 'Michael Mann', 'James Caan, Tuesday Weld, Robert Prosky, Willie Nelson, Jim Belushi, Tom Signorelli, Dennis Farina, Nick Nickeas', 'R', 'Frank is an expert professional safecracker, specialized in high-profile diamond heists. He plans to use his ill-gotten income to retire from crime and build a nice life for himself complete with a home, wife and kids. To accelerate the process, he signs on with a top gangster for a big score.', 'Frank is an expert professional safecracker, specialized in high-profile diamond heists. He plans to use his ill-gotten income to retire from crime and build a nice life for himself complete with a home, wife and kids. To accelerate the process, he signs on with a top gangster for a big score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpjRGwfYJ71bU0hNhLIz7g3t6Oy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11524'),
  ('708440142277301148', 'Thief of Hearts', 1984, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Douglas Day Stewart, Andrew Laszlo', 'Douglas Day Stewart', 'Steven Bauer, Barbara Williams, John Getz, David Caruso, Christine Ebersole, George Wendt, Alan North, Romy Walthall', 'R', 'A woman trapped in a boring marriage begins an affair with a handsome man who seems able to read her mind. She doesn''t know that he has broken into her house and read her diaries, where she has recorded her deepest thoughts and fantasies.', 'A woman trapped in a boring marriage begins an affair with a handsome man who seems able to read her mind. She doesn''t know that he has broken into her house and read her diaries, where she has recorded her deepest thoughts and fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/be08f4q9Doq5HvHgBCS5NzQ6jja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48482'),
  ('688434902521823445', 'Thieves', 1996, 'Romance, Crime, Drama', 'André Téchiné, Jean-Jacques Albert, Michel Nasri', 'Gilles Taurand, André Téchiné', 'Catherine Deneuve, Daniel Auteuil, Laurence Côte, Benoît Magimel, Fabienne Babe, Didier Bezace, Julien Rivière, Ivan Desny', 'R', 'In the middle of the night, someone brings Ivan''s body home to his wife and his young son. Flashbacks reveal the relationships among Ivan and his brother Alex, a cop with a cleanliness fetish; siblings Juliette and Jimmy, Ivan''s partners in a seedy nightclub; the love triangle of Alex, Juliette, and Marie, a professor of philosophy; and of Alex and his nephew, Ivan''s dour, stoic son. Ivan''s death changes every relationship.', 'In the middle of the night, someone brings Ivan''s body home to his wife and his young son. Flashbacks reveal the relationships among Ivan and his brother Alex, a cop with a cleanliness fetish; siblings Juliette and Jimmy, Ivan''s partners in a seedy nightclub; the love triangle of Alex, Juliette, and Marie, a professor of philosophy; and of Alex and his nephew, Ivan''s dour, stoic son. Ivan''s death changes every relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meeBmnlkMP8UhrPvZKv83jjhd2E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49935'),
  ('474951149890426483', 'Thieves', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Jaime Marques', 'Juan Ibáñez, Jaime Marques', 'Juan José Ballesta, María Valverde, Patrick Bauchau, Carlos Kaniowsky, Christian Sampedro, Álex Cansinos, María Ballesteros, Erik Probanza', null, 'The main character is a nameless boy (Juan Jose Ballesta) who was taught to steal wallets by his absent mother. He is able to do the trick effortlessly, using his "earnings" to survive while he looks for his mom. As he runs into an antique store owner, he might have found a trace that will lead to her. First, however, he will have to pull off a few "jobs" for the store owner, and he can''t do it alone: enter a nameless girl (Maria Valverde) who gets to learn all the secret techniques the young boy has been using all his life.', 'The main character is a nameless boy (Juan Jose Ballesta) who was taught to steal wallets by his absent mother. He is able to do the trick effortlessly, using his "earnings" to survive while he looks for his mom. As he runs into an antique store owner, he might have found a trace that will lead to her. First, however, he will have to pull off a few "jobs" for the store owner, and he can''t do it alone: enter a nameless girl (Maria Valverde) who gets to learn all the secret techniques the young boy has been using all his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awzpixQV8RaS7pJUpjlAfcbx2zX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25795'),
  ('141354988327461414', 'Thieves and Robbers', 1983, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Ben McDermott, Bruno Corbucci, Silvano Ippoliti', 'Mario Amendola, Bruno Corbucci', 'Bud Spencer, Tomas Milian, Marc Lawrence, Margherita Fumero, Don Sebastian, Billy Garrigues, Joan Call, Christine Troples', null, 'A Lothario, in trouble for fooling around with a Senator''s wife, becomes an unwitting witness to a mob murder. Police Lieutenant Parker tries to solve the case in enough time to take his long-suffering family on vacation.', 'A Lothario, in trouble for fooling around with a Senator''s wife, becomes an unwitting witness to a mob murder. Police Lieutenant Parker tries to solve the case in enough time to take his long-suffering family on vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zs81YnizFSwcNZHxUyCY7CCjSH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11613'),
  ('397637942865646603', 'Thieves Like Us', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Altman, Michael Kusley, Tommy Thompson', 'Joan Tewkesbury, Calder Willingham, Robert Altman', 'Keith Carradine, Shelley Duvall, John Schuck, Bert Remsen, Louise Fletcher, Ann Latham, Tom Skerritt, Al Scott', null, 'Three criminals escape from prison and embark on a robbery spree across USA. Along the way, one of them falls in love while they plan a final heist before going their separate ways.', 'Three criminals escape from prison and embark on a robbery spree across USA. Along the way, one of them falls in love while they plan a final heist before going their separate ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tENE8l8PHPX8S2bEMIb4WhpDKAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31656'),
  ('250092037830202808', 'Thieves'' Highway', 1949, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Jules Dassin, Lionel Newman, Norbert Brodine', 'A.I. Bezzerides', 'Richard Conte, Valentina Cortese, Lee J. Cobb, Barbara Lawrence, Jack Oakie, Millard Mitchell, Joseph Pevney, Morris Carnovsky', null, 'Nick Garcos comes back from his tour of duty in World War II planning to settle down with his girlfriend, Polly Faber. He learns, however, that his father was recently beaten and burglarized by mob-connected trucker Mike Figlia, and Nick resolves to get even. He partners with prostitute Rica, and together they go after Mike, all the while getting pulled further into the local crime underworld.', 'Nick Garcos comes back from his tour of duty in World War II planning to settle down with his girlfriend, Polly Faber. He learns, however, that his father was recently beaten and burglarized by mob-connected trucker Mike Figlia, and Nick resolves to get even. He partners with prostitute Rica, and together they go after Mike, all the while getting pulled further into the local crime underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljnFEsYQXeoW03Jagw159xVDP0J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20025'),
  ('263536352003121504', 'Thigh Line Lyre Triangular', 1961, 'Documentary', 'Stan Brakhage', null, 'Jane Wodening', null, 'Only at a crisis do I see both the scene as I''ve been trained to see it ( that is, with Renaissance perspective, three-dimensional logic–colors as we''ve been trained to call a color a color, as so forth) and patterns that move straight out from the inside of the mind through the optic nerves... spots before my eyes, so to speak... and it''s very intensive, disturbing, but joyful experience. I''ve seen that every time a child was born... Now none of that was in WINDOW WATER BABY MOVING; and I wanted a childbirth film which expressed all of my seeing at such a time.', 'Only at a crisis do I see both the scene as I''ve been trained to see it ( that is, with Renaissance perspective, three-dimensional logic–colors as we''ve been trained to call a color a color, as so forth) and patterns that move straight out from the inside of the mind through the optic nerves... spots before my eyes, so to speak... and it''s very intensive, disturbing, but joyful experience. I''ve seen that every time a child was born... Now none of that was in WINDOW WATER BABY MOVING; and I wanted a childbirth film which expressed all of my seeing at such a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpgKQoApccwIJPnUKKjsVJLlLhW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145971'),
  ('589581209978759429', 'Thillu Mullu', 1981, 'Comedy, Romance', 'K. Balachander, B. S. Lokanath', 'Visu', 'Rajinikanth, Madhavi, Sowcar Janaki, Poornam Viswanathan, Viji Chandrasekhar, Thengai Srinivasan, Nagesh, Visu', null, 'Chandran lies to his boss that his mother is unwell to get a leave but gets caught. In order to save his job, he is forced to pretend to his boss that he has a good-for-nothing twin brother.', 'Chandran lies to his boss that his mother is unwell to get a leave but gets caught. In order to save his job, he is forced to pretend to his boss that he has a good-for-nothing twin brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ECMeSTG2Qdi2PpjgGcvlgLpP8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66402'),
  ('856279205198786013', 'Thimble Theater', 1938, 'Animation, Documentary, Comedy', 'Joseph Cornell', null, null, null, 'One of Joseph Cornell’s funniest films, Thimble Theater is structured like a vaudeville variety show about nature.', 'One of Joseph Cornell’s funniest films, Thimble Theater is structured like a vaudeville variety show about nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heLuxNeqCHZM789uWZqmWU1lurS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294345'),
  ('323392802900310441', 'Thin Blood', 2020, 'Drama', 'Mehrdad Taheri', null, 'Simon Licht, Mehrdad Taheri, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Jenny Eichin, Burak Yiğit, Antonio Wannek, Imad Mardnli', null, 'For Detective Inspector Alexander Bischoff, a functioning family is something he''s never known. He grew up without parents and hasn''t started a family of his own. He works in a special investigations unit at the police department. Although he initially chose his profession because he wanted to do good, after 25 years he''s come down to earth and is completely disillusioned. He''s eventually assigned to investigate the case of a large Arab family – but after that, nothing will ever be the same again. For Alexander, the lines between good and evil, between right and wrong, become blurred...', 'For Detective Inspector Alexander Bischoff, a functioning family is something he''s never known. He grew up without parents and hasn''t started a family of his own. He works in a special investigations unit at the police department. Although he initially chose his profession because he wanted to do good, after 25 years he''s come down to earth and is completely disillusioned. He''s eventually assigned to investigate the case of a large Arab family – but after that, nothing will ever be the same again. For Alexander, the lines between good and evil, between right and wrong, become blurred...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdWK50opKYeaOsTKZMt9QFAeXfK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566924'),
  ('246865196547701968', 'Thin Ice', 2012, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Jill Sprecher, Dick Pope', 'Karen Sprecher, Jill Sprecher', 'Greg Kinnear, Alan Arkin, Billy Crudup, David Harbour, Michelle Arthur, Peter Thoemke, James Michael Detmar, Lea Thompson', 'R', 'A dishonest insurance salesman''s life quickly disintegrates during a Wisconsin winter when he teams up with a psychopath to steal a rare violin at the home of a reclusive farmer.', 'A dishonest insurance salesman''s life quickly disintegrates during a Wisconsin winter when he teams up with a psychopath to steal a rare violin at the home of a reclusive farmer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15KTuJlR8GclVrgX0g58oACqiqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51996'),
  ('320228950082858891', 'Things', 1989, 'Horror', 'Andrew Jordan, Dan Riggs', 'Andrew Jordan, Barry J. Gillis', 'Amber Lynn, Barry J. Gillis, Bruce Roach, Doug Bunston, Jan W. Pachul, Patricia Sadler', null, 'An impotent husband with a fanatical desire to father children, forces his wife to undergo a dangerous experiment. This results in the birth of a multitude of monstrous THINGS.', 'An impotent husband with a fanatical desire to father children, forces his wife to undergo a dangerous experiment. This results in the birth of a multitude of monstrous THINGS.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuJhTarmDIhYh2KxP0hWn6azo33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82126'),
  ('767235547405899191', 'Things', 1993, 'Horror', 'Dennis Devine, Jay Woelfel, Eugene James', 'Dennis Devine, Jay Woelfel, Mike Bowler', 'Courtney Lercara, Owen Rutledge, Neil Delama, Kelly-Jean Dammeyer, Debra Stevens, Jeff Burr, Kathleen O''Donnel', null, 'A woman kidnaps her husband''s mistress and tells the mistress two horror stories involving evil things.', 'A woman kidnaps her husband''s mistress and tells the mistress two horror stories involving evil things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkTpMuHbQd4tuiaBvysTKEycDaf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110163'),
  ('1086289419563703579', 'Things Are Tough All Over', 1982, 'Action, Comedy', 'Bobby Byrne, Thomas K. Avildsen, William Birch', 'Cheech Marin, Tommy Chong', 'Cheech Marin, Tommy Chong, Shelby Chong, Rikki Marin, Evelyn Guerrero, John Steadman, Rip Taylor, Toni Attell', 'R', 'Everybody has problems these days, and Cheech and Chong are no exceptions. They''re hired by Slyman and Habib to drive a limousine to Las Vegas with $5 million secretly stashed in the front seat. In order to get there, the pair sells off the car piece by piece, including the seven-figure front seat. Cheech and Chong then have a much bigger problem - Slyman and Habib are after them, swearing to kill them after the appropriate torture.', 'Everybody has problems these days, and Cheech and Chong are no exceptions. They''re hired by Slyman and Habib to drive a limousine to Las Vegas with $5 million secretly stashed in the front seat. In order to get there, the pair sells off the car piece by piece, including the seven-figure front seat. Cheech and Chong then have a much bigger problem - Slyman and Habib are after them, swearing to kill them after the appropriate torture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dxvPRZkTuYyZVUK0JwtvORlW1W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20197'),
  ('962251987842992413', 'Things Beauty Burn', 2019, null, 'Skinner Myers', null, 'Eugene Alper, Melanie Neilan, Samantha Beckey, Liana Giniatullina', null, 'An Afro-Russian teenager must make a life or death decision after having his first sexual encounter with a white Russian pastor''s daughter.', 'An Afro-Russian teenager must make a life or death decision after having his first sexual encounter with a white Russian pastor''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c99OrRGAiSR3zw8hE6gMczUEiT5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714133'),
  ('573063354629936934', 'Things Behind the Sun', 2001, 'Drama, Music', 'Allison Anders, Terry Stacey', 'Allison Anders, Kurt Voss', 'Kim Dickens, Gabriel Mann, Alison Folland, Elizabeth Peña, Patsy Kensit, CCH Pounder, Brittany Finamore, Owen Butler', null, 'A young music journalist''s dark memories are awakened when he goes to interview a female rock singer, and both are forced to confront troubling secrets from their pasts.', 'A young music journalist''s dark memories are awakened when he goes to interview a female rock singer, and both are forced to confront troubling secrets from their pasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7x1OE6QsxlLQfCz5D1q4olCkb5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102933'),
  ('523125559400972686', 'Things Change', 1988, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'David Mamet, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'David Mamet, Shel Silverstein', 'Don Ameche, Joe Mantegna, Robert Prosky, J.J. Johnston, Ricky Jay, Mike Nussbaum, Jack Wallace, Dan Conway', 'PG', 'Jerry, a misfit Mafia henchman, is assigned the low-level job of keeping an eye on Gino, a shoe repairman fingered by the Mob to confess to a murder he didn''t commit. But Gino''s mistaken for a Mafia boss, and the two are suddenly catapulted to the highest levels of mobster status. Only friendship will see them through this dangerous adventure alive!', 'Jerry, a misfit Mafia henchman, is assigned the low-level job of keeping an eye on Gino, a shoe repairman fingered by the Mob to confess to a murder he didn''t commit. But Gino''s mistaken for a Mafia boss, and the two are suddenly catapulted to the highest levels of mobster status. Only friendship will see them through this dangerous adventure alive!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKjGI2AAg5UHaBvVVR7oI865Zth.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52770'),
  ('371256480733657276', 'Things from Another World', 2011, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Mauro Marchetti, Francesco Patierno', 'Diego De Silva, Francesco Patierno, Giovanna Koch', 'Diego Abatantuono, Valerio Mastandrea, Valentina Lodovini, Maurizio Donadoni, Sandra Collodel, Grazia Schiavo, Ramiro Besa, Fulvio Molena', null, 'Maroso Golfetto, a firm manager from Veneto, is known for his frequent yelling at his employees, who are either immigrants or Southern Italians. He regularly appears on the local TV channel to denounce the evils of immigration, and his popularity extends to children. His speeches resonate more deeply with people than those of Lucia, their anti-racist schoolmistress. One morning, a miracle occurs: by invoking the help of God to rid Veneto of its immigrants, all the immigrants disappear. However, is this truly a blessing?', 'Maroso Golfetto, a firm manager from Veneto, is known for his frequent yelling at his employees, who are either immigrants or Southern Italians. He regularly appears on the local TV channel to denounce the evils of immigration, and his popularity extends to children. His speeches resonate more deeply with people than those of Lucia, their anti-racist schoolmistress. One morning, a miracle occurs: by invoking the help of God to rid Veneto of its immigrants, all the immigrants disappear. However, is this truly a blessing?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHP2RTgy6OjSyxkVMsy7fiXew7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73077'),
  ('1041696851254311214', 'Things Heard & Seen', 2021, 'Horror', 'Larry Smith, Brad Robinson, Timothy Bird', 'Shari Springer Berman, Robert Pulcini', 'Amanda Seyfried, James Norton, Natalia Dyer, Alex Neustaedter, Rhea Seehorn, Michael O''Keefe, Karen Allen, Jack Gore', 'NR', 'A young woman discovers that both her husband and their new home harbor sinister secrets after they leave Manhattan for small-town life.', 'A young woman discovers that both her husband and their new home harbor sinister secrets after they leave Manhattan for small-town life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tSkNmGt1K5Lgf0L0BTHHYJNz0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631060'),
  ('623153471377985865', 'Things I Like, Things I Don''t Like', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Pierre Jeunet, Jean Poisson', 'Bruno Delbonnel, Jean-Pierre Jeunet', 'Dominique Pinon', null, 'Dominique Pinon takes the viewer through various examples of what he "likes and dislikes."', 'Dominique Pinon takes the viewer through various examples of what he "likes and dislikes."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doC6qIaKqJvmi9IQP91MG7m50CG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47860'),
  ('1140328459856512345', 'Things I Never Told You', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Isabel Coixet, Teresa Medina, Sholto J. Roeg', 'Isabel Coixet', 'Lili Taylor, Andrew McCarthy, Debi Mazar, Alexis Arquette, Leslie Mann, Richard Edson, Seymour Cassel, Peggy West', 'NR', 'Don is a real estate salesman who volunteers at a "hotline for hope". Ann, who works in a photo store, has been told by her boyfriend that he doesn''t love her anymore and wants to break up. To try to win him back, she records a videotape where she tells him things she never told him. When Don and Ann cross paths, their lives change fundamentally.', 'Don is a real estate salesman who volunteers at a "hotline for hope". Ann, who works in a photo store, has been told by her boyfriend that he doesn''t love her anymore and wants to break up. To try to win him back, she records a videotape where she tells him things she never told him. When Don and Ann cross paths, their lives change fundamentally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NjS3gRyeJZT9mnHgQ1FTwkvSlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110909'),
  ('147466035368517776', 'Things to Come', 1936, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'William Cameron Menzies, Georges Périnal, Muir Mathieson', 'H. G. Wells', 'Raymond Massey, Edward Chapman, Ralph Richardson, Margaretta Scott, Cedric Hardwicke, Maurice Braddell, Sophie Stewart, Derrick De Marney', 'NR', 'The story of a century: a decades-long second World War leaves plague and anarchy, then a rational state rebuilds civilization and attempts space travel.', 'The story of a century: a decades-long second World War leaves plague and anarchy, then a rational state rebuilds civilization and attempts space travel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mjLuKluuMzBiCKTA28Qa8TR1wc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3596'),
  ('877137403392373933', 'Things to Come', 1976, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Derek Todd, James Bogard', 'Michael Greenwood', 'Jim Curtis, Barbara Fisk, Neil Fletcher, Scarlet Huey, Byron Lord, Teresa Smith, Roscoe Young', 'R', 'Julie leaves her marriage to investigate a mysterious sci-fi cult on behalf of frustrated women everywhere.', 'Julie leaves her marriage to investigate a mysterious sci-fi cult on behalf of frustrated women everywhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BVluIHooruqiy1MfsV4vcUsOGe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306542'),
  ('545671118291325827', 'Things to Come', 2016, 'Drama', 'Mia Hansen-Løve, Denis Lenoir, Thibault Lejeune', 'Mia Hansen-Løve', 'Isabelle Huppert, André Marcon, Roman Kolinka, Édith Scob, Sarah Le Picard, Solal Forte, Élise Lhomeau, Lionel Dray', 'PG-13', 'Nathalie teaches philosophy at a high school in Paris. She is passionate about her job and particularly enjoys passing on the pleasure of thinking. Married with two children, she divides her time between her family, former students and her very possessive mother. One day, Nathalie’s husband announces he is leaving her for another woman. With freedom thrust upon her, Nathalie must reinvent her life.', 'Nathalie teaches philosophy at a high school in Paris. She is passionate about her job and particularly enjoys passing on the pleasure of thinking. Married with two children, she divides her time between her family, former students and her very possessive mother. One day, Nathalie’s husband announces he is leaving her for another woman. With freedom thrust upon her, Nathalie must reinvent her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MAAJJ51y2RUa1gvvVje4s0FB7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374465'),
  ('977337535668105392', 'Things to Do in Denver When You''re Dead', 1995, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gary Fleder, Elliot Davis, Josh King', 'Scott Rosenberg', 'Andy Garcia, Christopher Lloyd, William Forsythe, Bill Nunn, Treat Williams, Jack Warden, Steve Buscemi, Fairuza Balk', 'R', 'Five different criminals face imminent death after botching a job quite badly.', 'Five different criminals face imminent death after botching a job quite badly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LxYzYybOVpnw0juCSlNL5cj8NK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400'),
  ('501556013159433248', 'Things Unspoken', 2026, 'Drama', 'Gabriele Muccino, Fabio Zamarion', 'Gabriele Muccino, Delia Ephron', 'Stefano Accorsi, Carolina Crescentini, Miriam Leone, Claudio Santamaria, Beatrice Savignani, Ahmed Boulane, Margherita Pantaleo, Alessandra Carrillo', null, 'Carlo and Elisa are a successful couple. He’s a university professor and writer facing a creative block; she’s a brilliant, sharp-witted journalist, known for her internationally published editorials. They live in Rome, moving between accomplishments and routine, affection and something that might be fading. In search of new energy, they travel to Morocco with their lifelong friends, Anna and Paolo, and their thirteen-year-old daughter Vittoria—bright, curious, a little eccentric. Tensions soon rise.', 'Carlo and Elisa are a successful couple. He’s a university professor and writer facing a creative block; she’s a brilliant, sharp-witted journalist, known for her internationally published editorials. They live in Rome, moving between accomplishments and routine, affection and something that might be fading. In search of new energy, they travel to Morocco with their lifelong friends, Anna and Paolo, and their thirteen-year-old daughter Vittoria—bright, curious, a little eccentric. Tensions soon rise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sK4MZKEzQk5ajgLKI8QnU129UdY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1473635'),
  ('396119253860521082', 'Things We Lost in the Fire', 2007, 'Drama', 'Susanne Bier, Tom Stern, Jennifer Donaldson', 'Allan Loeb', 'Halle Berry, Benicio del Toro, David Duchovny, Alison Lohman, Omar Benson Miller, John Carroll Lynch, Alexis Llewellyn, Micah Berry', 'R', 'A recent widow invites her husband''s troubled best friend to live with her and her two children. As he gradually turns his life around, he helps the family cope and confront their loss.', 'A recent widow invites her husband''s troubled best friend to live with her and her two children. As he gradually turns his life around, he helps the family cope and confront their loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyMziX8tPzPSguUgOpKWkKK322S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3877'),
  ('205379701173312933', 'Things Will Be Different', 2024, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Michael Felker, Carissa Dorson, Shane Spiegel', 'Michael Felker', 'Adam David Thompson, Riley Dandy, Chloe Skoczen, Justin Benson, Sarah Bolger, Jori Lynn Felker, Aaron Moorhead, David Lawson Jr.', null, 'In order to escape the police after a robbery, two estranged siblings lay low in a metaphysical farmhouse that hides them away in a different time. There they reckon with a mysterious force that pushes their familial bonds to unnatural breaking points.', 'In order to escape the police after a robbery, two estranged siblings lay low in a metaphysical farmhouse that hides them away in a different time. There they reckon with a mysterious force that pushes their familial bonds to unnatural breaking points.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vpYPns2SjbmgqkE72e69knRMGY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1226840'),
  ('825209889491717432', 'Things You Can Tell Just by Looking at Her', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rodrigo García, Emmanuel Lubezki', 'Rodrigo García', 'Glenn Close, Cameron Diaz, Calista Flockhart, Kathy Baker, Amy Brenneman, Valeria Golino, Holly Hunter, Matt Craven', 'PG-13', 'In California, a group of women struggle with personal problems as their paths intertwine in unexpected ways. Dr. Elaine Keener, the sole caretaker for her aging mother, turns to tarot card reader Christine for spiritual aid. Christine grapples with her own angst due to her lover''s debilitating illness. Meanwhile, a bank manager deals with an unwanted pregnancy, two sisters pursue romantic interests and a housewife gets back into the dating game.', 'In California, a group of women struggle with personal problems as their paths intertwine in unexpected ways. Dr. Elaine Keener, the sole caretaker for her aging mother, turns to tarot card reader Christine for spiritual aid. Christine grapples with her own angst due to her lover''s debilitating illness. Meanwhile, a bank manager deals with an unwanted pregnancy, two sisters pursue romantic interests and a housewife gets back into the dating game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTeEzAj0Uv8ySwdh894tEGvSh4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20067'),
  ('284143368337729715', 'Think Big', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Jon Turteltaub, Mark Morris, Sarah Addington', 'Jon Turteltaub, Edward Kovach, David Tausik', 'Peter Paul, David Paul, Martin Mull, Ari Meyers, Claudia Christian, Richard Kiel, Michael Winslow, Thomas Gottschalk', 'PG-13', 'Two truckers hired to transport toxic waste across the country get caught up with a teen genius who stows away on their truck.', 'Two truckers hired to transport toxic waste across the country get caught up with a teen genius who stows away on their truck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gqcb4nZ8kfBOzLBhRyaITuntdv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61640'),
  ('111346960841389427', 'Think Fast, Mr. Moto', 1937, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Norman Foster', 'Howard Ellis Smith, Norman Foster', 'Peter Lorre, Virginia Field, Thomas Beck, Sig Ruman, Murray Kinnell, John Rogers, Lotus Long, George Cooper', 'NR', 'When his import/export business infiltrated by international diamond smugglers, Mr. Moto must follow a trail of clues littered with beautiful women, glittering gems and deadly assassins. Making his way from the mysterious streets of San Francisco''s Chinatown to the dark and dangerous alleys of Shanghai, Mr. Moto will stop at nothing to bring the culprits to justice...even if it means making the ultimate sacrifice!', 'When his import/export business infiltrated by international diamond smugglers, Mr. Moto must follow a trail of clues littered with beautiful women, glittering gems and deadly assassins. Making his way from the mysterious streets of San Francisco''s Chinatown to the dark and dangerous alleys of Shanghai, Mr. Moto will stop at nothing to bring the culprits to justice...even if it means making the ultimate sacrifice!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZsuHYgc3U4qpY1rCdEPfbLaQBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59566'),
