  ('255933317040107963', 'Think Like a Dog', 2020, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Giles Nuttgens, Tim Bellen, Joseph Gravier', 'Gil Junger, John J. Strauss', 'Gabriel Bateman, Todd Stashwick, Josh Duhamel, Megan Fox, Kunal Nayyar, Madison Horcher, Hou Minghao, Izaac Wang', 'PG', 'A 12-year-old tech prodigy, whose science experiment goes awry, forges a telepathic connection with his best friend, Henry-his dog! The duo join forces and use their unique perspectives on life to comically overcome complications of family and school.', 'A 12-year-old tech prodigy, whose science experiment goes awry, forges a telepathic connection with his best friend, Henry-his dog! The duo join forces and use their unique perspectives on life to comically overcome complications of family and school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDbOrc2RtIA37nLm0CzVpFLrdaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513584'),
  ('763539583022411240', 'Think Like a Man', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tim Story, Larry Blanford, Janell Sammelman', 'Keith Merryman, David A. Newman', 'Michael Ealy, Jerry Ferrara, Meagan Good, Regina Hall, Kevin Hart, Taraji P. Henson, Terrence J, Romany Malco', 'PG-13', 'The balance of power in four couples’ relationships is upset when the women start using the advice in Steve Harvey’s book, Act Like A Lady, Think Like A Man, to get more of what they want from their men. When the men realize that the women have gotten a hold of their relationship “playbook,” they decide that the best defense is a good offense and come up with a plan to use this information to their advantage.', 'The balance of power in four couples’ relationships is upset when the women start using the advice in Steve Harvey’s book, Act Like A Lady, Think Like A Man, to get more of what they want from their men. When the men realize that the women have gotten a hold of their relationship “playbook,” they decide that the best defense is a good offense and come up with a plan to use this information to their advantage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfIrKVPDzXJDBzPnFEuoatlaZPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67660'),
  ('167006500195870907', 'Think Like a Man Too', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tim Story, Christopher Duskin', 'Keith Merryman, David A. Newman', 'Adam Brody, Michael Ealy, Jerry Ferrara, Meagan Good, Regina Hall, Kevin Hart, Dennis Haysbert, Taraji P. Henson', 'PG-13', 'All the couples are back for a wedding in Las Vegas, but plans for a romantic weekend go awry when their various misadventures get them into some compromising situations that threaten to derail the big event.', 'All the couples are back for a wedding in Las Vegas, but plans for a romantic weekend go awry when their various misadventures get them into some compromising situations that threaten to derail the big event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsKfhf0y9Zx7h4j5GHu1JANpKwl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184098'),
  ('496786747841388998', 'Think of Me First as a Person', 1975, 'Documentary', 'George Ingmire', null, null, null, 'Documentary film and home movie about Dwight Core, Jr., a boy with Down syndrome. The footage was originally shot throughout the 1960s and 1970s by Core''s father, Dwight Core, Sr. The footage was later discovered and completed by the filmmaker''s grandson, George Ingmire.', 'Documentary film and home movie about Dwight Core, Jr., a boy with Down syndrome. The footage was originally shot throughout the 1960s and 1970s by Core''s father, Dwight Core, Sr. The footage was later discovered and completed by the filmmaker''s grandson, George Ingmire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWPKscqgy2ni5hRc6uVwxr2Tfj6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162756'),
  ('863377661374828306', 'Thinking XXX', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Timothy Greenfield-Sanders', null, 'Jenna Jameson, Ron Jeremy, Tera Patrick, Belladonna, Sunrise Adams, Briana Banks, Christy Canyon, Seymore Butts', 'NR', 'For a book project, photographer Timothy Greenfield-Sanders took photographs of 30 stars of adult movies, each pair of photographs in the same pose, clothed and nude. This film records the photo shoots and includes interviews with the performers and commentary from eight writers (and John Waters). The actors and writers discuss economics, nudity and exhibitionism, careers, and private lives.', 'For a book project, photographer Timothy Greenfield-Sanders took photographs of 30 stars of adult movies, each pair of photographs in the same pose, clothed and nude. This film records the photo shoots and includes interviews with the performers and commentary from eight writers (and John Waters). The actors and writers discuss economics, nudity and exhibitionism, careers, and private lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqB0fF7VlODmw1exH4iDZHGUiVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24593'),
  ('204566048484265730', 'Thinner', 1996, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Tom Holland, Kees Van Oostrum, Michael Green', 'Tom Holland, Michael McDowell', 'Robert John Burke, Michael Constantine, Lucinda Jenney, Kari Wührer, John Horton, Sam Freed, Daniel von Bargen, Joe Mantegna', 'R', 'An obese lawyer finds himself growing "Thinner" when an old Romani man places a hex on him. Now the lawyer must call upon his friends in organized crime to help him persuade the old man to lift the curse. Time is running out for the desperate lawyer as he draws closer to his own death, and grows ever thinner.', 'An obese lawyer finds himself growing "Thinner" when an old Romani man places a hex on him. Now the lawyer must call upon his friends in organized crime to help him persuade the old man to lift the curse. Time is running out for the desperate lawyer as he draws closer to his own death, and grows ever thinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXqHqsQXA0jJpCaUsyre1Yw18oV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10280'),
  ('236798051040699998', 'Thir13en Ghosts', 2001, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Steve Beck, Gale Tattersall, Geoff Wallace', 'Richard D''Ovidio, Neal Marshall Stevens, Todd Alcott', 'Tony Shalhoub, Embeth Davidtz, Matthew Lillard, Shannon Elizabeth, Alec Roberts, JR Bourne, Rah Digga, F. Murray Abraham', 'R', 'Arthur and his two children inherit his uncle''s estate: a glass house that serves as a prison to twelve ghosts. When the family, accompanied by a nanny and an attorney, enter the house they find themselves trapped inside an evil machine ''designed by the Devil and powered by the dead'' to open the Eye of Hell. Aided by a ghost hunter and his rival, a ghost rights activist out to set the ghosts free, the group must do what they can to get out of the house alive.', 'Arthur and his two children inherit his uncle''s estate: a glass house that serves as a prison to twelve ghosts. When the family, accompanied by a nanny and an attorney, enter the house they find themselves trapped inside an evil machine ''designed by the Devil and powered by the dead'' to open the Eye of Hell. Aided by a ghost hunter and his rival, a ghost rights activist out to set the ghosts free, the group must do what they can to get out of the house alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yrrddjIjx0ElCRZp5pTZeqrj3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9378'),
  ('847777924070004447', 'Third Finger, Left Hand', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Robert Z. Leonard, George J. Folsey, Robert A. Golden', 'Lionel Houser', 'Myrna Loy, Melvyn Douglas, Raymond Walburn, Lee Bowman, Bonita Granville, Felix Bressart, Donald Meek, Ann Morriss', 'NR', 'Magazine editor Margot Merrick pretends to be married in order to avoid advances from male colleagues. Unfortunately, things don''t go to plan when Jeff Thompson, a potential suitor, uncovers the deception and decides to show up at Margot''s family home posing as her husband!', 'Magazine editor Margot Merrick pretends to be married in order to avoid advances from male colleagues. Unfortunately, things don''t go to plan when Jeff Thompson, a potential suitor, uncovers the deception and decides to show up at Margot''s family home posing as her husband!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nj2sNIvSVEKvrcAlA61sYlNPHfe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67368'),
  ('545679931863501540', 'Third Man on the Mountain', 1959, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Ken Annakin, Harry Waxman, Gaston Rébuffat', 'Eleanore Griffin', 'Michael Rennie, James MacArthur, Janet Munro, James Donald, Herbert Lom, Laurence Naismith, Lee Patterson, Helen Hayes', 'NR', 'Famous British mountaineer Winter wants to climb a difficult summit, the Citadel. He goes to a small village but no guide wants to accompany him. A young man from the village, Rudi Matt, whose father died fifteen years earlier during an attempt to climb the Citadel, is determined to accompany him, with the help of his uncle. Winter also manages to hire a guide from a neighboring village and competitor, Emil Saxo. The roped party of four men then begins the ascent of the still untouched summit.', 'Famous British mountaineer Winter wants to climb a difficult summit, the Citadel. He goes to a small village but no guide wants to accompany him. A young man from the village, Rudi Matt, whose father died fifteen years earlier during an attempt to climb the Citadel, is determined to accompany him, with the help of his uncle. Winter also manages to hire a guide from a neighboring village and competitor, Emil Saxo. The roped party of four men then begins the ascent of the still untouched summit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rktn8yDe4yqTUiVObuePK89epmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64867'),
  ('570117378909714130', 'Third Man Out: A Donald Strachey Mystery', 2005, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Ron Oliver, C. Kim Miles, Norm Li', 'Mark Saltzman', 'Chad Allen, Sebastian Spence, Jack Wetherall, Woody Jeffreys, Sean Young, April Telek, John Moore, Alf Humphreys', 'R', 'Gay detective Donald Strachey is commissioned to protect gay activist John Rutka, known for "outing" prominent citizens.', 'Gay detective Donald Strachey is commissioned to protect gay activist John Rutka, known for "outing" prominent citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6pMRG2QYQXt0ZGuruOrehsMtYM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47619'),
  ('1057563841061161889', 'Third Person', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paul Haggis, Gianpaolo Rifino, Gian Filippo Corticelli', 'Paul Haggis', 'Liam Neeson, Mila Kunis, Adrien Brody, James Franco, Olivia Wilde, Maria Bello, Kim Basinger, Moran Atias', 'R', 'An acclaimed novelist struggles to write an analysis of love in one of three stories, each set in a different city, that detail the beginning, middle and end of a relationship.', 'An acclaimed novelist struggles to write an analysis of love in one of three stories, each set in a different city, that detail the beginning, middle and end of a relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HfxGEbQnPvIzaYAHMvu947r8sQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192145'),
  ('136910251959345130', 'Third Star', 2010, 'Drama', 'Hattie Dalton, Carlos Catalán, Matthew Hanson', 'Vaughan Sivell', 'Tom Burke, Benedict Cumberbatch, JJ Feild, Hugh Bonneville, Eros Vlahos, Adam Robertson, Rupert Frazer, Helen Griffin', null, 'James and his three closest lifelong friends go on an ill-advised trip to the stunning coastal area of Barafundle Bay in West Wales. What follows is a touching and comical adventure dealing with friendship, heroism and love.', 'James and his three closest lifelong friends go on an ill-advised trip to the stunning coastal area of Barafundle Bay in West Wales. What follows is a touching and comical adventure dealing with friendship, heroism and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNYtDMqT74sizQkpHtg1heyzFCl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75170'),
  ('603145797147753742', 'Thirst', 1949, 'Drama', 'Ingmar Bergman, Gunnar Fischer, Eskil Eckert-Lundin', 'Herbert Grevenius', 'Eva Henning, Birger Malmsten, Birgit Tengroth, Hasse Ekman, Mimi Nelson, Bengt Eklund, Gaby Stenberg, Naima Wifstrand', null, 'A fractured portrait of desire and isolation, following a failing marriage and parallel stories of emotional entrapment as memories surface during a train journey through postwar Europe. Told through flashbacks and multiple narrative threads, the film signals Ingmar Bergman’s emerging mature style.', 'A fractured portrait of desire and isolation, following a failing marriage and parallel stories of emotional entrapment as memories surface during a train journey through postwar Europe. Told through flashbacks and multiple narrative threads, the film signals Ingmar Bergman’s emerging mature style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NZMjTeIHRimCPr5BQV34iKKWep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51143'),
  ('926848206704554281', 'Thirst', 1979, 'Horror, Romance, Thriller', 'Rod Hardy, Vincent Monton', 'John Pinkney', 'Chantal Contouri, Max Phipps, David Hemmings, Henry Silva, Robert Thompson, Rod Mullinar, Rosie Sturgess, Walter Pym', 'R', 'The descendant of Elizabeth Bathory is abducted by a cult of self-proclaimed supermen who achieve this state of superiority by drinking from the "blood cows" kept at the "dairy farm", and they try to get her to join them.', 'The descendant of Elizabeth Bathory is abducted by a cult of self-proclaimed supermen who achieve this state of superiority by drinking from the "blood cows" kept at the "dairy farm", and they try to get her to join them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYB9ms0DxhQ9GCTV2jpICSnLgo8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61689'),
  ('180921438391309842', 'Thirst', 2009, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Park Chan-wook, Chung Chung-hoon, Ryu Jae-hwan', 'Park Chan-wook, Chung Seo-kyung', 'Song Kang-ho, Kim Ok-bin, Kim Hae-sook, Shin Ha-kyun, Park In-hwan, Song Young-chang, Oh Dal-su, Ériq Ebouaney', 'R', 'A respected priest volunteers for an experimental procedure that may lead to a cure for a deadly virus. He gets infected and dies, but a blood transfusion of unknown origin brings him back to life. Now, he’s torn between faith and bloodlust, and has a newfound desire for the wife of a childhood friend.', 'A respected priest volunteers for an experimental procedure that may lead to a cure for a deadly virus. He gets infected and dies, but a blood transfusion of unknown origin brings him back to life. Now, he’s torn between faith and bloodlust, and has a newfound desire for the wife of a childhood friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBnFQwOcmL3dAIYfiQ9nLvLSW7B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22536'),
  ('715325297696243207', 'Thirst for Love', 1967, 'Drama', 'Koreyoshi Kurahara, Yoshio Mamiya, Toshiya Fujita', 'Toshiya Fujita, Koreyoshi Kurahara', 'Ruriko Asaoka, Nobuo Nakamura, Tetsuo Ishidate, Akira Yamanouchi, Yūko Kusunoki, Yōko Kozono, Chitose Kurenai, Akio Fujii', null, 'A young wealthy widow becomes sexually involved with her father-in-law, while harboring a destructive obsession with the family gardener.', 'A young wealthy widow becomes sexually involved with her father-in-law, while harboring a destructive obsession with the family gardener.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eC2M8ASYMbT5MhnOZOT5rVYwnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95503'),
  ('79727338819504147', 'Thirteen', 2003, 'Drama', 'Catherine Hardwicke, Elliot Davis, John O''Rourke', 'Catherine Hardwicke, Nikki Reed', 'Evan Rachel Wood, Nikki Reed, Holly Hunter, Brady Corbet, Jeremy Sisto, Vanessa Hudgens, Sarah Clarke, Cynthia Ettinger', 'R', 'When 13-year-old Tracy befriends Evie, the most popular girl in school, her life is turned upside down as Evie introduces her to a world of sex, drugs, and money. But it isn’t long before Tracy’s new lifestyle begins to take a heavy toll on her and her family.', 'When 13-year-old Tracy befriends Evie, the most popular girl in school, her life is turned upside down as Evie introduces her to a world of sex, drugs, and money. But it isn’t long before Tracy’s new lifestyle begins to take a heavy toll on her and her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzTLlZrNF6rMPBh5mUQu6vLnTtX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11023'),
  ('7349946204332286', 'Thirteen at Dinner', 1985, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Curtis Clark, Lou Antonio, Michael Stevenson', 'Rod Browning', 'Peter Ustinov, Faye Dunaway, David Suchet, Jonathan Cecil, Bill Nighy, Diane Keen, John Stride, Benedict Taylor', null, 'Actress Jane Wilkinson wants a divorce, but her husband, Lord Edgware, refuses. She convinces Hercule Poirot to use his famed tact and logic to make her case. Lord Edgware turns up murdered, a well-placed knife wound at the base of his neck. It will take the precise Poirot to sort out the lies from the alibis - and find the criminal before another victim dies.', 'Actress Jane Wilkinson wants a divorce, but her husband, Lord Edgware, refuses. She convinces Hercule Poirot to use his famed tact and logic to make her case. Lord Edgware turns up murdered, a well-placed knife wound at the base of his neck. It will take the precise Poirot to sort out the lies from the alibis - and find the criminal before another victim dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klIFNF78wpVI4IAcntk3mGYJ9gs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6103'),
  ('678031556716341865', 'Thirteen Conversations About One Thing', 2001, 'Drama', 'Jill Sprecher, Dick Pope', 'Karen Sprecher, Jill Sprecher', 'Matthew McConaughey, John Turturro, Clea DuVall, Amy Irving, Alan Arkin, David Connolly, Joseph Siravo, A.D. Miles', 'R', 'In New York City, the lives of a lawyer, an actuary, a house-cleaner, a professor, and the people around them intersect as they ponder order and happiness in the face of life''s cold unpredictability.', 'In New York City, the lives of a lawyer, an actuary, a house-cleaner, a professor, and the people around them intersect as they ponder order and happiness in the face of life''s cold unpredictability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mb3mEfzAudrPpQIxRzpLM12aiMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17734'),
  ('757311364951375652', 'Thirteen Days', 2000, 'History, Thriller', 'Andrzej Bartkowiak, Roger Donaldson', 'David Self', 'Kevin Costner, Bruce Greenwood, Steven Culp, Dylan Baker, Michael Fairman, Henry Strozier, Frank Wood, Kevin Conway', 'PG-13', 'The story of the Cuban Missile Crisis in 1962—the nuclear standoff with the USSR sparked by the discovery by the Americans of missile bases established on the Soviet-allied island of Cuba.', 'The story of the Cuban Missile Crisis in 1962—the nuclear standoff with the USSR sparked by the discovery by the Americans of missile bases established on the Soviet-allied island of Cuba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLx9UXH9fK2v6NDMvMyW4X88K3u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11973'),
  ('1099305156290230425', 'Thirteen or So Minutes...', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'William Branden Blinn', 'William Branden Blinn', 'Nick Soper, Carlos Salas', null, 'Lawrence Jefferies and Hugh Greerey are two straight men who have just met. Thirteen or so minutes later, things have changed for both of them as they open themselves to one another.', 'Lawrence Jefferies and Hugh Greerey are two straight men who have just met. Thirteen or so minutes later, things have changed for both of them as they open themselves to one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAdfvTP4UpzhW8nN5CMblQjFxeq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160368'),
  ('623990913811761664', 'Thirteen Women', 1932, 'Drama, Mystery', 'George Archainbaud, Leo Tover, Thomas Atkins', 'Bartlett Cormack, Samuel Ornitz', 'Irene Dunne, Ricardo Cortez, Jill Esmond, Myrna Loy, Mary Duncan, Kay Johnson, Florence Eldridge, C. Henry Gordon', 'NR', 'Thirteen women who were schoolmates ask a swami to cast their horoscopes. The news they receive is not good for any of them.', 'Thirteen women who were schoolmates ask a swami to cast their horoscopes. The news they receive is not good for any of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLNBQpb3X3UtWWr6qw7q3WD4X2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91181'),
  ('323697079588659223', 'Thirty Day Princess', 1934, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Marion Gering, Arthur Jacobson, Leon Shamroy', 'Frank Partos, Preston Sturges', 'Sylvia Sidney, Cary Grant, Edward Arnold, Henry Stephenson, Vince Barnett, Edgar Norton, Ray Walker, Lucien Littlefield', null, 'A European princess arrives in New York City to secure a much-needed loan for her country. She contracts the mumps, and an actress who looks exactly like her is hired to impersonate her.', 'A European princess arrives in New York City to secure a much-needed loan for her country. She contracts the mumps, and an actress who looks exactly like her is hired to impersonate her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGEjDGrgVkn5EaNuoiP8cX3rSGs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81113'),
  ('1034994217901352481', 'Thirty Seconds Over Tokyo', 1944, 'War, Drama', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Harold Rosson, Robert Surtees', 'Dalton Trumbo', 'Van Johnson, Robert Walker, Spencer Tracy, Tim Murdock, Don DeFore, Herbert Gunn, Phyllis Thaxter, Stephen McNally', 'NR', 'In the wake of Pearl Harbor, a young lieutenant leaves his expectant wife to volunteer for a secret bombing mission which will take the war to the Japanese homeland.', 'In the wake of Pearl Harbor, a young lieutenant leaves his expectant wife to volunteer for a secret bombing mission which will take the war to the Japanese homeland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvvgU0TwstTtZofAzBA5syt5on7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18770'),
  ('86894040575926975', 'Thirty Something, Single and Fabulous', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Chava Cartas', 'Angélica Gudiño, Juan Carlos Garzón', 'Bárbara Mori, Jordi Mollà, Marimar Vega, Angélica Aragón, Juan Pablo Medina, Natasha Dupeyrón, Héctor Bonilla, Andrés Almeida', null, 'A woman in her mid-30s breaks up with her boyfriend of seven years and goes on a journey of self-discovery.', 'A woman in her mid-30s breaks up with her boyfriend of seven years and goes on a journey of self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2EdAE2Zwt2HNxFMK8DoOIbCoV5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375788'),
  ('519531515564909544', 'Thirty Two Short Films About Glenn Gould', 1993, 'Drama, Music', 'François Girard, Alain Dostie', 'François Girard, Don McKellar', 'Colm Feore, Derek Keurvorst, Katya Ladan, Devon Anderson, Joshua Greenblatt, Sean Ryan, Kate Hennig, Sean Doyle', null, 'A collection of vignettes highlighting different aspects of the life, work, and character of the acclaimed Canadian classical pianist.', 'A collection of vignettes highlighting different aspects of the life, work, and character of the acclaimed Canadian classical pianist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GTmkUpCb1uL7psLYqAHyIyld51.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20967'),
  ('1037921377173526881', 'Thirty Years of Adonis', 2017, 'Drama', 'Nathan Wong, Haze Leung, Calvin Mak', 'Scud', 'Adonis He, Susan Shaw Yam-Yam, Nora Miao, Eric East, Amanda Lee Wai-Man, Daniel Benjamin, Ting Yu Sheng, Alan Tang', 'NR', 'Yang Ke, a Beijing Opera actor, is fatefully driven into the underworld of masculine sex workers, and becomes a class of his own. He finds himself on a roller coaster between heavenly love with both men and women, and a living hell ensnared by devious villains and hypocrites. Despite his faith, endeavor and willingness to give, he remains a prisoner to his karma. Hell awaits when heaven seems near, and the ultimate truth is revealed only in a heartbreaking moment from which there is no return.', 'Yang Ke, a Beijing Opera actor, is fatefully driven into the underworld of masculine sex workers, and becomes a class of his own. He finds himself on a roller coaster between heavenly love with both men and women, and a living hell ensnared by devious villains and hypocrites. Despite his faith, endeavor and willingness to give, he remains a prisoner to his karma. Hell awaits when heaven seems near, and the ultimate truth is revealed only in a heartbreaking moment from which there is no return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tB2yvuKrAZ3kMs09VkuAwvmsgDi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550059'),
  ('417325034672744294', 'Thirty-Five Something', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Cécile Telerman, Matthieu Poirot-Delpech', 'Jérôme Soubeyrand, Cécile Telerman', 'Anne Parillaud, Judith Godrèche, Mathilde Seigner, Mathias Mlekuz, Thierry Neuvic, Pascal Elbé, Pierre Cassignard, Pascal Elso', null, 'Three women in their late thirties, one with marital problems, one trying to be perfect, and a spinster, discuss their relationship to men.', 'Three women in their late thirties, one with marital problems, one trying to be perfect, and a spinster, discuss their relationship to men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krZnF5f0KXJ639jMAgVNkTUntbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13746'),
  ('386837802878096952', 'Thirty-Something Stepmother: Dripping with Immorality', 2012, null, 'Tetsuya Takehora, Yûsuke Okumura', 'Machiko Ebara', 'Misa Yuki, Ayumi Kuroki, Azumi Nakama, Setsuhiko Kobayashi, Kenji Iwatani, Koji Makimura, Riri Kouda', null, 'Kimi is married to Tatsuro, who has a son, Kengo, who is the same age as her. Every night, Kengo can hear Kimi''s moans coming from the bedroom, but he somehow manages to keep his sanity. Meanwhile, Kimi''s childhood friend, Kaori, runs away from home after a marital quarrel and comes to stay with her. Kaori realizes Kengo''s feelings... The director is Takehora Tetsuya, whose style is often light and erotic comedy. Yuki Misa, who exudes a sparkling and seductive charm, plays a stepmother who wants to cherish her family. The agony of a single man in his 30s is entertaining.', 'Kimi is married to Tatsuro, who has a son, Kengo, who is the same age as her. Every night, Kengo can hear Kimi''s moans coming from the bedroom, but he somehow manages to keep his sanity. Meanwhile, Kimi''s childhood friend, Kaori, runs away from home after a marital quarrel and comes to stay with her. Kaori realizes Kengo''s feelings... The director is Takehora Tetsuya, whose style is often light and erotic comedy. Yuki Misa, who exudes a sparkling and seductive charm, plays a stepmother who wants to cherish her family. The agony of a single man in his 30s is entertaining.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uKhmafLgJ4Ixm9ons7C7i5j5tP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1457836'),
  ('152242444388400481', 'Thirty-three', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Sergey Vronsky', 'Viktor Konetsky, Valentin Ezhov, Georgiy Daneliya', 'Evgeni Leonov, Nonna Mordyukova, Inna Churikova, Lyubov Sokolova, Rita Gladunko, Viktor Avdyushko, Gennadiy Yalovich, Nikolai Parfyonov', null, 'The dentist of the provincial town of Upper Yamki made an unexpected scientific discovery by finding the thirty-third tooth in the patient’s oral cavity, Ivan Sergeyevich Travkin. Travkin, exhausted from pain, was taken to Moscow. Ivan Sergeyevich first becomes a patient of a madhouse (thanks to envious persons), and then — a hero of a scientific international conference and, finally, a patient of a dentist professor Bruk.', 'The dentist of the provincial town of Upper Yamki made an unexpected scientific discovery by finding the thirty-third tooth in the patient’s oral cavity, Ivan Sergeyevich Travkin. Travkin, exhausted from pain, was taken to Moscow. Ivan Sergeyevich first becomes a patient of a madhouse (thanks to envious persons), and then — a hero of a scientific international conference and, finally, a patient of a dentist professor Bruk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqmohO66pssBcVbpXiIgciA5Tr0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27863'),
  ('469366102708743262', 'Thiruchitrambalam', 2022, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Mithran Jawahar, Om Prakash, Ken Karunaas', null, 'Dhanush, Nithya Menen, Bharathiraja, Prakash Raj, Raashii Khanna, Priya Bhavani Shankar, Munishkanth, Aranthangi Nisha', null, 'A guy-next-door tries to find romance in his life while also dealing with his personal problems. How long will it be before he realises what he is looking for is right next to him?', 'A guy-next-door tries to find romance in his life while also dealing with his personal problems. How long will it be before he realises what he is looking for is right next to him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBRkO5GHJqDB9D0fbumL5235JfJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858067'),
  ('734909834262469527', 'Thiruda Thiruda', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Mani Ratnam, P. C. Sreeram', 'Sujatha Rangarajan', 'Prashanth, Anand, Heera Rajgopal, Anu Aggarwal, Salim Ghouse, S. P. Balasubramaniam, Ajay Rathnam, Malaysia Vasudevan', null, 'An Inspector is assigned to track down a large sum of stolen money. His investigations lead him to a couple of small time crooks, a village belle, a murder, an absconding suspect, and an international drug dealer.', 'An Inspector is assigned to track down a large sum of stolen money. His investigations lead him to a couple of small time crooks, a village belle, a murder, an absconding suspect, and an international drug dealer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qnecMIRerHdKkuFTeCZXNNVU9z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112306'),
  ('513162675643444403', 'This Above All', 1942, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Anatole Litvak, Arthur C. Miller, Aaron Rosenberg', 'R.C. Sherriff', 'Tyrone Power, Joan Fontaine, Thomas Mitchell, Henry Stephenson, Nigel Bruce, Gladys Cooper, Philip Merivale, Sara Allgood', 'NR', 'In 1940 England, aristocratic Prudence Cathaway alarms her snobbish parents by joining the WAF service branch. She soon meets and falls in love with the brooding Clive Briggs, despite his prejudice against the upper classes, and agrees to spend a week with him at a Dover hotel. When Clive''s soldier friend, Monty, arrives to retrieve him, Prudence learns that Clive went AWOL after Dunkirk, and urges him to recall why England must fight the war.', 'In 1940 England, aristocratic Prudence Cathaway alarms her snobbish parents by joining the WAF service branch. She soon meets and falls in love with the brooding Clive Briggs, despite his prejudice against the upper classes, and agrees to spend a week with him at a Dover hotel. When Clive''s soldier friend, Monty, arrives to retrieve him, Prudence learns that Clive went AWOL after Dunkirk, and urges him to recall why England must fight the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNtMvh4DeuszFSQ5An6muJDDuIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110628'),
  ('299621891537039876', 'This Ain''t California', 2012, 'Documentary, History, Animation', 'Marten Persiel, Manuel Siebert, Felix Leiberg', 'Ira Wedel', 'Kai Hillebrand, David Nathan, Nora Decker, Lea Wolfram, Titus Dittmann, Erich Honecker, Katarina Witt, Helmut Kohl', 'NR', 'A retrospective look at the youth cultures born in the German Democratic Republic. A celebration of the lust for life, a contemporary trip into the world of skate, a tale on three heroes and their boards, from their childhood in the seventies, through their teenage rebellion in the eighties and the summer of 1989, when their life changed forever, to 2011.', 'A retrospective look at the youth cultures born in the German Democratic Republic. A celebration of the lust for life, a contemporary trip into the world of skate, a tale on three heroes and their boards, from their childhood in the seventies, through their teenage rebellion in the eighties and the summer of 1989, when their life changed forever, to 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XCTalp0mlFLlR3o6lY5xPjZ7Ch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91030'),
  ('796797855580419766', 'This and That', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Mimmola Girosi, Sergio Corbucci, Alessandro D''Eva', 'Bernardino Zapponi, Nino Manfredi, Renato Pozzetto', 'Renato Pozzetto, Nino Manfredi, Sylva Koscina, Janet Ågren, Michela Miti, Désirée Nosbusch, Franco Scandurra, Nanda Primavera', null, 'Two episodes. The 1st is ''Amore impossibile'' (Impossible love). Giulio is a comic book draftsman. He is passing through a creativity depressed period. One day his editor makes him meet a blond nice girl. Immediately Giulio fall in love and starts to draw his impossible love story into a new comic book. The 2nd is ''Quello dal basco rosso'' (the one with the red beret). Sandro, a mature man, meets one of his former girlfriend and her daughter Daniela. Daniela couldn''t have sex with her boyfriend because of a childhood remembrance. In fact she always remember her mother having sex with a man wearing a red beret. She discovers that man is Sandro, makes love with him and soon recovers from her obsession.', 'Two episodes. The 1st is ''Amore impossibile'' (Impossible love). Giulio is a comic book draftsman. He is passing through a creativity depressed period. One day his editor makes him meet a blond nice girl. Immediately Giulio fall in love and starts to draw his impossible love story into a new comic book. The 2nd is ''Quello dal basco rosso'' (the one with the red beret). Sandro, a mature man, meets one of his former girlfriend and her daughter Daniela. Daniela couldn''t have sex with her boyfriend because of a childhood remembrance. In fact she always remember her mother having sex with a man wearing a red beret. She discovers that man is Sandro, makes love with him and soon recovers from her obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rv6KhB7Co8hRodcdOBNSFQi5DH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58614'),
  ('783781223567506565', 'This Beautiful Fantastic', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Simon Aboud, Mike Eley, Dixie Chassay', 'Simon Aboud', 'Jessica Brown Findlay, Tom Wilkinson, Andrew Scott, Jeremy Irvine, Anna Chancellor, Mia Farkasovska, Eileen Davies, Natalie Nasseraldeen', 'PG', 'Set against the backdrop of a beautiful garden in the heart of London, this contemporary fairy tale revolves around the unlikely friendship between a reclusive young woman and a cantankerous old widower. Bella Brown is a beautifully quirky young woman who dreams of writing and illustrating a successful children’s book. After she is forced by her landlord to deal with her neglected garden or face eviction, she meets her match, nemesis, and unlikely mentor in Alfie Stephenson, a grumpy, loveless, old man who lives next door who happens to be an amazing horticulturalist.', 'Set against the backdrop of a beautiful garden in the heart of London, this contemporary fairy tale revolves around the unlikely friendship between a reclusive young woman and a cantankerous old widower. Bella Brown is a beautifully quirky young woman who dreams of writing and illustrating a successful children’s book. After she is forced by her landlord to deal with her neglected garden or face eviction, she meets her match, nemesis, and unlikely mentor in Alfie Stephenson, a grumpy, loveless, old man who lives next door who happens to be an amazing horticulturalist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22b9jLGJ8OVzlEnWzqF0yRy5Na3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352490'),
  ('121579046160649838', 'This Boy Caught a Merman', 2012, 'Fantasy, Animation, Romance', 'Soubi Yamamoto, Haru Yamada', 'Soubi Yamamoto', 'Hikaru Midorikawa, Yuki Kaji', null, 'When Shima nearly drowns trying to retrieve a picture, he’s saved by a merman named Isaki. Despite their differences, they begin to bond, but love across species isn’t simple.', 'When Shima nearly drowns trying to retrieve a picture, he’s saved by a merman named Isaki. Despite their differences, they begin to bond, but love across species isn’t simple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/si448uMJw8KX5meXw3XBvKVGCTf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454891'),
  ('623278451670585436', 'This Boy''s Life', 1993, 'Drama', 'David Watkin, Michael Caton-Jones', 'Robert Getchell', 'Robert De Niro, Ellen Barkin, Leonardo DiCaprio, Jonah Blechman, Eliza Dushku, Chris Cooper, Carla Gugino, Zachary Ansley', 'R', 'When a son and mother move to Seattle in hopes for a better life, the mother meets a seemingly polite man. Things go south when the man turns out to be abusive, endangering their lives. As the mother struggles to maintain hope in an impossible situation, the son has plans to escape.', 'When a son and mother move to Seattle in hopes for a better life, the mother meets a seemingly polite man. Things go south when the man turns out to be abusive, endangering their lives. As the mother struggles to maintain hope in an impossible situation, the son has plans to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRMSZfen1Cv1eqwDbtxCBpBqxnU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8092'),
  ('16991456382500055', 'This Can''t Happen Here', 1950, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Ingmar Bergman, Gunnar Fischer, Hugo Bolander', 'Herbert Grevenius', 'Signe Hasso, Alf Kjellin, Ulf Palme, Gösta Cederlund, Yngve Nordwall, Stig Olin, Ragnar Klange, Hugo Bolander', null, 'A story of two married refugees from the dictatorship; their quiet life in a new free country is impossible due to the husband''s dark secret.', 'A story of two married refugees from the dictatorship; their quiet life in a new free country is impossible due to the husband''s dark secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeaLshpofGyoHixX6YbTMG5ZaIh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45941'),
  ('100798352951754442', 'This Charming Girl', 2005, 'Drama', 'Lee Yoon-ki, Lee Chol-o, Choi Jin-woong', 'Lee Yoon-ki', 'Kim Ji-soo, Hwang Jung-min, Kim Hye-ok, Lee Dae-yeon, Seo Dong-won, Park Sung-woong, Kim Kkob-bi, Kim Mi-seong', null, 'Jeong-hye, a woman in her 30s, works at the post office and lives a quite monotonous life alone in an apartment with her cat. Apart from having lunch with the girls at work, she is all by herself, until an aspiring writer is attracted by her.', 'Jeong-hye, a woman in her 30s, works at the post office and lives a quite monotonous life alone in an apartment with her cat. Apart from having lunch with the girls at work, she is all by herself, until an aspiring writer is attracted by her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZUihpclpBrypCPcVpSLWVlAy6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68442'),
  ('232985307224441964', 'This Christmas', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Preston A. Whitmore II, Alexander Gruszynski', 'Preston A. Whitmore II', 'Delroy Lindo, Idris Elba, Loretta Devine, Chris Brown, Keith D. Robinson, Laz Alonso, Columbus Short, Sharon Leal', 'PG-13', 'This year Christmas with the Whitfields promises to be one they will never forget. All the siblings have come home for the first time in years and they''ve brought plenty of baggage with them. As the Christmas tree is trimmed and the lights are hung, secrets are revealed and family bonds are tested. As their lives converge, they join together and help each other discover the true meaning of family.', 'This year Christmas with the Whitfields promises to be one they will never forget. All the siblings have come home for the first time in years and they''ve brought plenty of baggage with them. As the Christmas tree is trimmed and the lights are hung, secrets are revealed and family bonds are tested. As their lives converge, they join together and help each other discover the true meaning of family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBuLAw4mRlO83LPA2s4zOlVesUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15250'),
  ('965398133080946084', 'This Closeness', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Emily Cohn, Kit Zauhar, Kayla Hoff', 'Kit Zauhar', 'Kit Zauhar, Zane Pais, Ian Edlund, Jessie Pinnick, Kate Williams, Lisa Emery', 'NR', 'In Philadelphia for the weekend, Tessa and Ben, a couple on the rocks, rent a room in the apartment of Adam, a reclusive stranger who quickly becomes an unwilling voyeur to the most private parts of the couple’s life. Tensions rise as the three enter an intimate battle to gain and reclaim territory.', 'In Philadelphia for the weekend, Tessa and Ben, a couple on the rocks, rent a room in the apartment of Adam, a reclusive stranger who quickly becomes an unwilling voyeur to the most private parts of the couple’s life. Tensions rise as the three enter an intimate battle to gain and reclaim territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRFgKeDUYVfWFEES6jP7KdOK9Lv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1079482'),
  ('452069983115106599', 'This Could Be the Night', 1957, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ridgeway Callow, Robert Wise, Russell Harlan', 'Isobel Lennart', 'Jean Simmons, Paul Douglas, Anthony Franciosa, Julie Wilson, Neile Adams, Joan Blondell, J. Carrol Naish, Rafael Campos', 'NR', 'To earn extra money, a prim schoolteacher takes a second job as secretary to the uncouth owner of a boisterous nightclub.', 'To earn extra money, a prim schoolteacher takes a second job as secretary to the uncouth owner of a boisterous nightclub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5e7j8m3hxlV49vR8inIm7O9cna4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95359'),
  ('72431383946236125', 'This Crazy Heart', 2017, 'Drama', 'Marc Rothemund, Christof Wahl', 'Andi Rogenhagen, Maggie Peren', 'Philip Noah Schwarz, Elyas M''Barek, Nadine Wrietz, Uwe Preuss, Karin Thaler, Jürgen Tonkel, Sebastian Gerold, Lena Meckel', null, 'When 30-ish rich kid Lenny has to take care of 15-year-old David, who’s suffering from heart disease, it’s the beginning of a wild adventure. Lenny fearlessly breaks all the rules to fulfill his young friend’s every wish.', 'When 30-ish rich kid Lenny has to take care of 15-year-old David, who’s suffering from heart disease, it’s the beginning of a wild adventure. Lenny fearlessly breaks all the rules to fulfill his young friend’s every wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5URz6UQ9ZjKc0rEQsckcsMjO1jK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427033'),
  ('724703258333207331', 'This Film Is Not Yet Rated', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Kirby Dick, Kirsten Johnson, Shana Hagan', 'Kirby Dick, Eddie Schmidt, Matt Patterson', 'Kimberly Peirce, Jon Lewis, David Ansen, Martin Garbus, Wayne Kramer, Paul Dergarabedian, Kevin Smith, John Waters', 'NR', 'Kirby Dick''s provocative documentary investigates the secretive and inconsistent process by which the Motion Picture Association of America rates films, revealing the organization''s underhanded efforts to control culture. Dick questions whether certain studios get preferential treatment and exposes the discrepancies in how the MPAA views sex and violence.', 'Kirby Dick''s provocative documentary investigates the secretive and inconsistent process by which the Motion Picture Association of America rates films, revealing the organization''s underhanded efforts to control culture. Dick questions whether certain studios get preferential treatment and exposes the discrepancies in how the MPAA views sex and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXo26FkBBdiEaEDzOPkrSFZC7zO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16070'),
  ('1115959888916015978', 'This Filthy World', 2006, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Jeff Garlin, Daniel Shulman, Rob Naylor', 'John Waters', 'John Waters', 'NR', 'In this filmed version of cult film director John Waters'' popular one-man show, the Pink Flamingos and A Dirty Shame director takes the stage to discuss everything from his early influences, fondest career memories, and notorious struggles against the MPAA rating system. Part endearing memoir and part hilarious lecture, This Filthy World touches on everything from the insanity of contemporary pop culture to the director''s unforgettable early collaborations with inimitable Pink Flamingos star Divine.', 'In this filmed version of cult film director John Waters'' popular one-man show, the Pink Flamingos and A Dirty Shame director takes the stage to discuss everything from his early influences, fondest career memories, and notorious struggles against the MPAA rating system. Part endearing memoir and part hilarious lecture, This Filthy World touches on everything from the insanity of contemporary pop culture to the director''s unforgettable early collaborations with inimitable Pink Flamingos star Divine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQS4FYQ5ba5urrcLGUEyP7P6ljB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47658'),
  ('176905593363556568', 'This Girl Is Bad Ass', 2011, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Petchtai Wongkamlao, Jiradech Samniangsanor, Bordeekorn Lohachala', 'Petchtai Wongkamlao, Pipat Jomkoh', 'Petchtai Wongkamlao, JeeJa Yanin, Akom Preedakul, Boriboon Junreurng, Chalermsak Yamchamang, Anake Inthajun, Udom Songsaeng, Chookiat Iamsook', null, 'A bike messenger, hired by competing mob bosses to smuggle goods, finds that her only way out is a confrontation erupting into a battle of bullets, blows and kicks to the face.', 'A bike messenger, hired by competing mob bosses to smuggle goods, finds that her only way out is a confrontation erupting into a battle of bullets, blows and kicks to the face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvlXvC8wUYIgKC33bXp41MquXut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201619'),
