  ('327935942009839229', 'This Gun for Hire', 1942, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'John F. Seitz, Frank Tuttle, George Templeton', 'W.R. Burnett, Albert Maltz', 'Alan Ladd, Veronica Lake, Robert Preston, Laird Cregar, Tully Marshall, Marc Lawrence, Olin Howland, Roger Imhof', 'NR', 'Sadistic killer-for-hire Philip Raven becomes enraged when his latest job is paid off in marked bills. Vowing to track down his double-crossing boss, nightclub executive Gates, Raven sits beside Gates'' lovely new employee, Ellen, on a train out of town. Although Ellen is engaged to marry the police lieutenant who''s hunting down Raven, she decides to try and set the misguided hit man straight as he hides from the cops and plots his revenge.', 'Sadistic killer-for-hire Philip Raven becomes enraged when his latest job is paid off in marked bills. Vowing to track down his double-crossing boss, nightclub executive Gates, Raven sits beside Gates'' lovely new employee, Ellen, on a train out of town. Although Ellen is engaged to marry the police lieutenant who''s hunting down Raven, she decides to try and set the misguided hit man straight as he hides from the cops and plots his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfbRnfY1PQTRlDxZ0XEAw5zSeKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16703'),
  ('677729594927092005', 'This Happy Breed', 1944, 'Drama', 'David Lean, Ronald Neame, Muir Mathieson', 'David Lean, Ronald Neame, Anthony Havelock-Allan', 'Robert Newton, Celia Johnson, Amy Veness, Alison Leggatt, Stanley Holloway, John Mills, Kay Walsh, Eileen Erskine', 'PG', 'A chronicle of the lives of the Gibbons family, from shortly after the end of the First World War to the beginning of the Second.', 'A chronicle of the lives of the Gibbons family, from shortly after the end of the First World War to the beginning of the Second.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3E4BiVMUAHJqT0VEZ6LUFD0P9J9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51617'),
  ('306046618177570185', 'This House Has People in It', 2016, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Alan Resnick, Ben O''Brien, Robby Rackleff', 'Dina Kelberman, Robby Rackleff, Alan Resnick', 'Robby Rackleff, Rory Ogden, Jackson Manning, Ben O''Brien, Alan Resnick, Cricket Arrison, Naomi Kline, Sharyn Kmieciak', 'NR', 'AB Surveillance Solutions, a security company seems to be keeping logs and watching a family as they live a seemingly average life. However it seems that there is something darker going on under the facade.', 'AB Surveillance Solutions, a security company seems to be keeping logs and watching a family as they live a seemingly average life. However it seems that there is something darker going on under the facade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7AftT1WO5vBOgRuWWQbeyCxkrG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387929'),
  ('900915182200549751', 'This House Possessed', 1981, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'William Wiard, Thomas Del Ruth', 'David Levinson', 'Parker Stevenson, Lisa Eilbacher, Joan Bennett, Slim Pickens, Shelley Smith, Bill Morey, Jan Shutan, David Paymer', null, 'A sinister force permeating a secluded mountain estate convinces the nurse/companion of rock star Parker Stevenson, who has had a nervous collapse, that the house is alive and determined to keep her prisoner.', 'A sinister force permeating a secluded mountain estate convinces the nurse/companion of rock star Parker Stevenson, who has had a nervous collapse, that the house is alive and determined to keep her prisoner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3YwRdy7kyif98VGFZLxUaULHe8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109120'),
  ('507013382801954323', 'This Is 40', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Judd Apatow, Phedon Papamichael, Matt Rebenkoff', 'Judd Apatow', 'Paul Rudd, Leslie Mann, John Lithgow, Megan Fox, Maude Apatow, Iris Apatow, Chris O''Dowd, Jason Segel', 'R', 'Pete and Debbie are both about to turn 40, their kids hate each other, both of their businesses are failing, they''re on the verge of losing their house, and their relationship is threatening to fall apart.', 'Pete and Debbie are both about to turn 40, their kids hate each other, both of their businesses are failing, they''re on the verge of losing their house, and their relationship is threatening to fall apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzUuOIFoVkRTHACRb58vm6mkbBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89492'),
  ('469629050551036096', 'This Is a Life?', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan, June Foray', 'NR', 'Parody of "This is Your Life," with Elmer Fudd as the host and Bugs Bunny as the guest of honor, much to the disgust of Daffy Duck. On several occassions, Granny has to whack Daffy over the head to get him to be quiet. Meanwhile, Bugs reminisces with Elmer and Yosemite Sam about their previous encounters (reviewed via footage from past Bugs Bunny cartoons).', 'Parody of "This is Your Life," with Elmer Fudd as the host and Bugs Bunny as the guest of honor, much to the disgust of Daffy Duck. On several occassions, Granny has to whack Daffy over the head to get him to be quiet. Meanwhile, Bugs reminisces with Elmer and Yosemite Sam about their previous encounters (reviewed via footage from past Bugs Bunny cartoons).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iA42fffz6IJW4jNIY7OOndpRI0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235567'),
  ('482811234486086701', 'This Is America', 1977, 'Documentary', 'Romano Vanderbes, Stephen Harris, Patricia Baum', 'Romano Vanderbes', 'Norman Rose, Anibal O. Lleras, Fanne Foxe, Ulli Lommel, Don Imus, Ron Jeremy, Holly Woodlawn, Arnold Schwarzenegger', 'R', 'Inspired by shock-documentaries like Mondo Cane, this film looks at the wilder side of life in America. Starting off with the bloodier side of the American car culture by showing a series of crashes at race events, the film then goes on to lesser-known sexual practices. Included among these is a porno movie award show, a nude beauty contest, a sex therapy session, and a detailed explanation of where dildos come from.', 'Inspired by shock-documentaries like Mondo Cane, this film looks at the wilder side of life in America. Starting off with the bloodier side of the American car culture by showing a series of crashes at race events, the film then goes on to lesser-known sexual practices. Included among these is a porno movie award show, a nude beauty contest, a sex therapy session, and a detailed explanation of where dildos come from.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBAno9GEzTa9fJ8r4V8mu4NhwEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76154'),
  ('840946178553276347', 'This Is Christmas', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Chris Foggin, David Mackie, Liam Egan', 'Alastair Galbraith', 'Alfred Enoch, Kaya Scodelario, Timothy Spall, Jack Donoghue, Steve Oram, Alexandra Roach, Robert Emms, Rebecca Root', null, 'Follow Adam and Emma on their daily commute from the village of Langton to London, where they meet the same passengers every day. One morning, Adam breaks the unspoken taboo of talking to strangers on a train and invites the entire carriage to hold their own Christmas party together.', 'Follow Adam and Emma on their daily commute from the village of Langton to London, where they meet the same passengers every day. One morning, Adam breaks the unspoken taboo of talking to strangers on a train and invites the entire carriage to hold their own Christmas party together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCbmauk51911Sd5aSkDCYivhwDy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029208'),
  ('1008648172726851423', 'This Is Cinerama', 1952, 'Documentary', 'Merian C. Cooper, Gunther von Fritsch', null, 'Lowell Thomas', 'NR', 'Designed to introduce the then-new widescreen process Cinerama, audiences experience the roller coaster at Rockaways'' Playland, the temple dance from Aida, Niagara Falls, a Viennese choir, the canals of Venice, a military tattoo in Edinburgh, a bullfight, and more. The film concludes with a view from the nose of a low-flying B-25 while America the Beautiful plays.', 'Designed to introduce the then-new widescreen process Cinerama, audiences experience the roller coaster at Rockaways'' Playland, the temple dance from Aida, Niagara Falls, a Viennese choir, the canals of Venice, a military tattoo in Edinburgh, a bullfight, and more. The film concludes with a view from the nose of a low-flying B-25 while America the Beautiful plays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSrLKt2xRsD6p91orxv2TFlpXhM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98017'),
  ('982697345482586078', 'This Is Elvis', 1981, 'Drama, Music, Documentary', 'Malcolm Leo, Andrew Solt', 'Andrew Solt, Malcolm Leo', 'Elvis Presley, Joe Esposito, Linda Thompson, David Scott, Paul Boensch III, Dana MacKay, Johnny Harra, Lawrence Koller', 'PG', 'Though several actors portray Elvis Presley at different stages of his life, this documentary is comprised mostly of actual performance footage and interviews with Elvis, his fans and those close to him. This biographical docu-drama features rare footage of Elvis and dramatically recreated scenes from Elvis'' life.', 'Though several actors portray Elvis Presley at different stages of his life, this documentary is comprised mostly of actual performance footage and interviews with Elvis, his fans and those close to him. This biographical docu-drama features rare footage of Elvis and dramatically recreated scenes from Elvis'' life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pJGeuZVtc9NSOpLude7Ce9tid3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109264'),
  ('549320840478526251', 'This Is England', 2007, 'Drama, Crime', 'Shane Meadows, Danny Cohen, Griffin', 'Shane Meadows', 'Thomas Turgoose, Stephen Graham, Jo Hartley, Andrew Shim, Vicky McClure, Joseph Gilgun, Rosamund Hanson, Andrew Ellis', 'NR', 'A story about a troubled boy growing up in England, set in 1983. He comes across a few skinheads on his way home from school, after a fight. They become his new best friends, even like family. Based on experiences of director Shane Meadows.', 'A story about a troubled boy growing up in England, set in 1983. He comes across a few skinheads on his way home from school, after a fight. They become his new best friends, even like family. Based on experiences of director Shane Meadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZVx7wLrlgSKxkYC2CRg6Zek0fG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11798'),
