  ('708610167665409617', 'This Is My Father', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paul Quinn, Lesley Oakley, Declan Quinn', 'Paul Quinn', 'Aidan Quinn, James Caan, Stephen Rea, John Cusack, Jacob Tierney, Colm Meaney, Donal Donnelly, Brendan Gleeson', 'R', 'When schoolteacher Kieran Johnson discovers that his father was not a French sailor (as he had been led to believe) but rather an Irish farmer, he looks to his mother for answers. When she refuses to provide any, Kieran travels to Ireland.', 'When schoolteacher Kieran Johnson discovers that his father was not a French sailor (as he had been led to believe) but rather an Irish farmer, he looks to his mother for answers. When she refuses to provide any, Kieran travels to Ireland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKOdv0qSUFLcMpHftpk19M0G5DA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25232'),
  ('869648224791011207', 'This Is My Life', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nora Ephron, Bobby Byrne', 'Nora Ephron, Delia Ephron', 'Julie Kavner, Samantha Mathis, Gaby Hoffmann, Carrie Fisher, Dan Aykroyd, Bob Nelson, Marita Geraghty, Welker White', 'R', 'Single mom Dottie Ingels sells cosmetics in a department store while dreaming of becoming a comedian. After she inherits some money, she decides to move to New York with her children Erica and Opal in order to begin a stand-up career in small bars. Dottie soon rises to stardom, but while she travels all over the USA, her daughters stay home lonely.', 'Single mom Dottie Ingels sells cosmetics in a department store while dreaming of becoming a comedian. After she inherits some money, she decides to move to New York with her children Erica and Opal in order to begin a stand-up career in small bars. Dottie soon rises to stardom, but while she travels all over the USA, her daughters stay home lonely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cAUlDEAjHCx9Tr1VH8iUro4VXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41776'),
  ('533106251203734199', 'This is My Mother', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Martin De Chabaneix, Julien Carpentier, Aurélie Avram', 'Benjamin Garnier, Julien Carpentier', 'Agnès Jaoui, William Lebghil, Salif Cissé, Alison Wheeler, Rosita Dadoun Fernandez, Maxence Tual, Patrick Robine, Hortense Gelinet', null, 'Pierre, a successful 33-year-old florist, has his life turned upside down by the sudden arrival of his mother Judith, whom he hasn’t seen for two years. Mercurial and extravagant, she suffers from bipolar disorder and has recently escaped from a clinic. Pierre has only one idea in mind: bring her back as quickly as possible so his life can get back on track. But nothing happens as he hoped for. Their unexpected reunion, as funny and explosive as it is heart-wrenching, will transform Pierre and Judith forever.', 'Pierre, a successful 33-year-old florist, has his life turned upside down by the sudden arrival of his mother Judith, whom he hasn’t seen for two years. Mercurial and extravagant, she suffers from bipolar disorder and has recently escaped from a clinic. Pierre has only one idea in mind: bring her back as quickly as possible so his life can get back on track. But nothing happens as he hoped for. Their unexpected reunion, as funny and explosive as it is heart-wrenching, will transform Pierre and Judith forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmQCgF12UhvkZ8LCk6zDdNUCiRJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1045842'),
  ('1066417584416152947', 'This Is Not a Burial, It''s a Resurrection', 2020, 'Drama', 'Pierre De Villiers, Lemohang Jeremiah Mosese', 'Lemohang Jeremiah Mosese', 'Mary Twala, Jerry Mofokeng, Makhaola Ndebele, Tseko Monaheng, Siphiwe Nzima, Thabiso Makoto, Thabo Letsie, Silas Monyatse', null, 'Amongst the mountains of Lesotho, an 80-year-old widow winds up her affairs and makes arrangements for her burial. But when her village is threatened with resettlement due to the construction of a reservoir, she finds a new will to live and ignites a spirit of resistance within her community.', 'Amongst the mountains of Lesotho, an 80-year-old widow winds up her affairs and makes arrangements for her burial. But when her village is threatened with resettlement due to the construction of a reservoir, she finds a new will to live and ignites a spirit of resistance within her community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9crWLzqUrFEoJHj8kbrUaRulKM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618208'),
  ('330392242844922218', 'This Is Not a Comedy', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Gabriel Nuncio, Rodrigo Guardiola, María Secco', 'Gabriel Nuncio, Alo Valenzuela', 'Gabriel Nuncio, Cassandra Ciangherotti, Adriana Paz, Cecilia Suárez, Manolo Caro, Alejandro Saevich, Renata Vaca, Tamara Vallarta', null, 'A comedian finds new meaning in his life when his best friend asks him to be her sperm donor, and he meets a girl who connects with the cosmos.', 'A comedian finds new meaning in his life when his best friend asks him to be her sperm donor, and he meets a girl who connects with the cosmos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IEMKTCbD5euj7De0S0cB4FsMp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881594'),
  ('1027803190082064260', 'This Is Not a Film', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Mojtaba Mirtahmasb, Jafar Panahi, Mojtaba Mirtahmasb', 'Jafar Panahi', 'Jafar Panahi, Igi, Mrs. Gheirat, Mojtaba Mirtahmasb, Rakhsan, Sima, Micky, Hasan', null, 'Renowned Iranian director Jafar Panahi received a 6-year prison sentence and a 20-year ban from filmmaking and conducting interviews with foreign press due to his open support for the opposition party in Iran''s 2009 election. In this film, which was shot secretly by Panahi''s close friend Mojtaba Mirtahmasb and smuggled into France on a USB stick concealed inside a cake for a last-minute submission to Cannes, Panahi documents his daily life under house arrest as he awaits a decision on his appeal.', 'Renowned Iranian director Jafar Panahi received a 6-year prison sentence and a 20-year ban from filmmaking and conducting interviews with foreign press due to his open support for the opposition party in Iran''s 2009 election. In this film, which was shot secretly by Panahi''s close friend Mojtaba Mirtahmasb and smuggled into France on a USB stick concealed inside a cake for a last-minute submission to Cannes, Panahi documents his daily life under house arrest as he awaits a decision on his appeal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRkxx6lIOUei4PxbFWH6UfWfUib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83552'),
  ('703097189695973399', 'This Is Not a Test', 1962, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Brick Marquard, Fredric Gadette', 'Peter Abenheim, Betty Laskey, Fredric Gadette', 'Seamon Glass, Thayer Roberts, Aubrey Martin, Mary Morlas, Michael Greene, Alan Austin, Carol Kent, Norman Winston', null, 'Late one night on a rural road in the western US, a policeman sets up a roadblock and begins stopping all traffic. When several cars and a big truck have stopped, he tells everyone why: a nuclear attack on the US appears to be underway, and since they have the truck there, their best chance at survival is to use it as a bomb shelter. Time is short and tensions in the small group quickly rise.', 'Late one night on a rural road in the western US, a policeman sets up a roadblock and begins stopping all traffic. When several cars and a big truck have stopped, he tells everyone why: a nuclear attack on the US appears to be underway, and since they have the truck there, their best chance at survival is to use it as a bomb shelter. Time is short and tensions in the small group quickly rise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxvRhRdLEghXoe766BieTtRYX50.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109757'),
  ('394361072956794455', 'This Is Not a Test', 2025, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Adam MacDonald, Christian Bielz', 'Adam MacDonald', 'Olivia Holt, Froy Gutierrez, Carson MacCormac, Corteon Moore, Chloe Avakian, Luke Macfarlane, Krista Bridges, Joelle Farrow', 'R', 'Sloane and four classmates take cover in Cortege High to escape a world plagued by the infected. As danger relentlessly pounds on the doors, Sloane begins to see the world through the eyes of those who actually want to live and takes matters into her own hands.', 'Sloane and four classmates take cover in Cortege High to escape a world plagued by the infected. As danger relentlessly pounds on the doors, Sloane begins to see the world through the eyes of those who actually want to live and takes matters into her own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZqxDDByIei1UVDgw7ZBXJCHHtI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1428990'),
  ('168565806062174464', 'This Is Not Berlin', 2019, 'Drama', 'Alfredo Altamirano, Hari Sama', 'Hari Sama, Max Zunino, Rodrigo Ordoñez', 'Marina de Tavira, Lumi Cavazos, Ximena Romo, Xabiani Ponce de León, David Montalvo, José Antonio Toledano, Fernando Álvarez Rebeil, Dalia Xiuhcoatl', null, 'Seventeen-year-old Carlos doesn''t fit in anywhere, not in his family nor with the friends he has chosen in school. But everything changes when he is invited to a mythical nightclub where he discovers the underground LGBTQ nightlife scene: punk, sexual liberty and drugs.', 'Seventeen-year-old Carlos doesn''t fit in anywhere, not in his family nor with the friends he has chosen in school. But everything changes when he is invited to a mythical nightclub where he discovers the underground LGBTQ nightlife scene: punk, sexual liberty and drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aWD6w5VCUOeYx4iYRr0HCE4mxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555795'),
  ('17230782101890611', 'This Is Not What I Expected', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Derek Hui Wang-Yu, Yu Jing-pin, Zhao Xiaoshi', 'Joyce Chan Ka-Yi, Li Yuan, Xu Yimeng', 'Takeshi Kaneshiro, Zhou Dongyu, Xi Mengyao, Tony Yang, Sun Yizhou, Chang Kuo-Chu, Lin Chi-ling, Gao Xiaosong', null, 'Lu Jin is a handsome, wealthy hotel executive whose drive for perfection is matched only by his taste for fine cuisine. When he checks into the Rosebud, he''s dissatisfied with everything he sees and is ready to take action... until flamboyant female sous chef Gu Shengnan creates the perfectionist what may be a perfect meal. Now, these bitter rivals find themselves brought together in the kitchen in this light-hearted romantic comedy, infused with fun and flavors to create a delicious dish that foodies around the world wouldn''t dare to miss.', 'Lu Jin is a handsome, wealthy hotel executive whose drive for perfection is matched only by his taste for fine cuisine. When he checks into the Rosebud, he''s dissatisfied with everything he sees and is ready to take action... until flamboyant female sous chef Gu Shengnan creates the perfectionist what may be a perfect meal. Now, these bitter rivals find themselves brought together in the kitchen in this light-hearted romantic comedy, infused with fun and flavors to create a delicious dish that foodies around the world wouldn''t dare to miss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jO6lZr0i65zOAjqSj6sy8khD6G4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452413'),
  ('371563481810833213', 'This Is Our Land', 2017, 'Drama', 'Lucas Belvaux, Pierric Gantelmi d''Ille', 'Jérôme Leroy, Lucas Belvaux', 'Émilie Dequenne, André Dussollier, Guillaume Gouix, Catherine Jacob, Anne Marivin, Patrick Descamps, Michel Ferracci, Jean-Louis Sbille', null, 'Pauline, a devoted and generous home help nurse, raises her two children alone, while also looking after her father, a former steelworker. Taking advantage of her popularity, the directors of an extremist political party suggest she become their candidate at the mayoral elections.', 'Pauline, a devoted and generous home help nurse, raises her two children alone, while also looking after her father, a former steelworker. Taking advantage of her popularity, the directors of an extremist political party suggest she become their candidate at the mayoral elections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIkWIuzubpNGv98uwuarltTF7rJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430172'),
  ('443351873229521038', 'This Is Paris', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Alexandra Dean, Arlene Nelson', 'Alexandra Dean', 'Paris Hilton, Nicky Hilton, Kathy Hilton, Kim Kardashian, Kyle Richards, Kris Jenner, Brandi Glanville, Jennifer Rovero', 'NR', 'Meet the real Paris Hilton for the very first time as she embarks on a journey of healing and reflection, reclaiming her true identity along the way.', 'Meet the real Paris Hilton for the very first time as she embarks on a journey of healing and reflection, reclaiming her true identity along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44nWhN7Zkyi86K2waw7beJW8l9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665052'),
  ('709000156749461759', 'This Is Spinal Tap', 1984, 'Comedy, Music', 'Rob Reiner, Peter Smokler, Donald Newman', 'Rob Reiner, Christopher Guest, Michael McKean', 'Christopher Guest, Michael McKean, Harry Shearer, Rob Reiner, June Chadwick, Tony Hendra, Bruno Kirby, Ed Begley Jr.', 'R', '"This Is Spinal Tap" shines a light on the self-contained universe of a metal band struggling to get back on the charts, including everything from its complicated history of ups and downs, gold albums, name changes and undersold concert dates, along with the full host of requisite groupies, promoters, hangers-on and historians, sessions, release events and those special behind-the-scenes moments that keep it all real.', '"This Is Spinal Tap" shines a light on the self-contained universe of a metal band struggling to get back on the charts, including everything from its complicated history of ups and downs, gold albums, name changes and undersold concert dates, along with the full host of requisite groupies, promoters, hangers-on and historians, sessions, release events and those special behind-the-scenes moments that keep it all real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3lllDltoBws5uKZzBYVSjpjjJx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11031'),
  ('835480403850727564', 'This Is the Army', 1943, 'Comedy, Music, Romance, War', 'Michael Curtiz, Sol Polito, Bert Glennon', 'Claude Binyon, Casey Robinson', 'George Murphy, Joan Leslie, George Tobias, Alan Hale, Charles Butterworth, Dolores Costello, Una Merkel, Stanley Ridges', null, 'In WW I dancer Jerry Jones stages an all-soldier show on Broadway, called Yip Yip Yaphank. Wounded in the War, he becomes a producer. In WW II his son Johnny Jones, who was before his fathers assistant, gets the order to stage a knew all-soldier show, called THIS IS THE ARMY. But in his pesonal life he has problems, because he refuses to marry his fiancée until the war is over.', 'In WW I dancer Jerry Jones stages an all-soldier show on Broadway, called Yip Yip Yaphank. Wounded in the War, he becomes a producer. In WW II his son Johnny Jones, who was before his fathers assistant, gets the order to stage a knew all-soldier show, called THIS IS THE ARMY. But in his pesonal life he has problems, because he refuses to marry his fiancée until the war is over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zBY2WMlhQDd1t24RHvEBz055qT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43517'),
  ('938130735525326088', 'This Is the End', 2013, 'Action, Comedy', 'Brandon Trost, Evan Goldberg, Seth Rogen', 'Seth Rogen, Evan Goldberg', 'James Franco, Jonah Hill, Seth Rogen, Jay Baruchel, Danny McBride, Craig Robinson, Michael Cera, Emma Watson', 'R', 'While attending a party at James Franco''s house, Seth Rogen, Jay Baruchel and many other celebrities are faced with the apocalypse.', 'While attending a party at James Franco''s house, Seth Rogen, Jay Baruchel and many other celebrities are faced with the apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNIW0NhX1hKvUsy6PQ80DOKUhkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109414'),
  ('758360775604808243', 'This Is the Goat!', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Charles Zemer, Fred Cavayé, Michaël Laguens', 'Matthieu Rumani, Sarah Kaminsky, Nicolas Slomka', 'Dany Boon, Jérôme Commandeur, Claire Chust, Alexandre Desrousseaux, Fatsah Bouyahmed, Gaëlle Lebert, Grégory Gadebois, Marie-Anne Chazel', null, 'France, 1640. Lawyer Maitre Pompignac has never won a case: all his clients are dead, either drawn and quartered, impaled or scalded... One day, a young woman comes to him and asks him to defend an inno- cent girl: 11-year-old Roxane, wrongly accused of killing a Marshal of France. Pompignac accepts, with- out realising that Roxane is in fact not an 11-year-old child, but a goat...', 'France, 1640. Lawyer Maitre Pompignac has never won a case: all his clients are dead, either drawn and quartered, impaled or scalded... One day, a young woman comes to him and asks him to defend an inno- cent girl: 11-year-old Roxane, wrongly accused of killing a Marshal of France. Pompignac accepts, with- out realising that Roxane is in fact not an 11-year-old child, but a goat...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/laAady5rFuq9znkMxkMd3rf39nO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1047227'),
  ('763555504068687485', 'This Is the Night', 1932, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Tuttle, Victor Milner', 'Benjamin Glazer, George Marion Jr.', 'Lili Damita, Charles Ruggles, Roland Young, Thelma Todd, Cary Grant, Irving Bacon, Claire Dodd, Davison Clark', 'NR', 'When Stephen, the husband of Gerald’s mistress, Claire, discovers a pair of tickets for their planned trip to Venice, Gerald must invent a wife to cover their tracks. He is then forced to hire a woman to play “his wife” when Stephen insists he and Claire accompany them to Venice.', 'When Stephen, the husband of Gerald’s mistress, Claire, discovers a pair of tickets for their planned trip to Venice, Gerald must invent a wife to cover their tracks. He is then forced to hire a woman to play “his wife” when Stephen insists he and Claire accompany them to Venice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIQchTDdKyukCVE6IxBxHtr8rRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81038'),
  ('187645911419015650', 'This Is the Night', 2021, 'Drama', 'Anastas N. Michos, James DeMonaco', 'James DeMonaco', 'Jonah Hauer-King, Naomi Watts, Frank Grillo, Lucius Hoyos, Method Man, Bobby Cannavale, River Alexander, Chase Vacnin', 'R', 'In the summer of 1982, as all of Staten Island anticipates the opening of a blockbuster boxing movie, an Italian-American family must confront its greatest challenges.', 'In the summer of 1982, as all of Staten Island anticipates the opening of a blockbuster boxing movie, an Italian-American family must confront its greatest challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZPyZ22kzcmfyt1dQapaSiQenvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524417'),
  ('1098395731387314043', 'This Is the Story of an Italian Rock Star', 2011, 'Drama, Documentary, Music', 'Sibylle Righetti, Alessandro Paris', null, 'Vasco Rossi, Gaetano Curreri, Stef Burns, Marco Gherardi, Ivana Lenzi, Saverio Principini, Novella Rossi', null, 'Using unedited archive footage Questa storia qua recounts Vasco Rossi''s exceptional career as an artist and a man. Twenty-five million albums sold in his thirty year-long career, unfading success and a unique story: Vasco Rossi talks about himself in this documentary and for the first time presents us with an intimate self portrait. A new, authentic picture is created of this rockstar from Emilia Romagna thanks to super 8 footage, family photographs and amateur videos. Vasco accompanies us along the path which took him from Zocca, in the province of Modena, to success. He describes his personal history without ever taking himself too seriously, while his words conjure up recollections of an era and a generation. He is accompanied by friends, his loved ones and musicians who have always followed him and who help us to discover that special mix of memories, nostalgia, rebellion, freedom and talent which have inspired his songs.', 'Using unedited archive footage Questa storia qua recounts Vasco Rossi''s exceptional career as an artist and a man. Twenty-five million albums sold in his thirty year-long career, unfading success and a unique story: Vasco Rossi talks about himself in this documentary and for the first time presents us with an intimate self portrait. A new, authentic picture is created of this rockstar from Emilia Romagna thanks to super 8 footage, family photographs and amateur videos. Vasco accompanies us along the path which took him from Zocca, in the province of Modena, to success. He describes his personal history without ever taking himself too seriously, while his words conjure up recollections of an era and a generation. He is accompanied by friends, his loved ones and musicians who have always followed him and who help us to discover that special mix of memories, nostalgia, rebellion, freedom and talent which have inspired his songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3bT9ZsxgxDZHIOUXYqW8U2whoS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85253'),
  ('16159503475982583', 'This Is the Year', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Nathanael Vorce, David Henrie', 'Sienna Aquilini, David Henrie, Bug Hall', 'Vanessa Marano, David Henrie, Gregg Sulkin, Jeff Garlin, Bug Hall, Jake Short, Alyssa Jirrels, Lorenzo James Henrie', 'PG-13', 'A nebbish high school senior and his best friends embarks on a road trip to attend the greatest music festival of the year in a last-ditch effort to win over the girl of his dreams.', 'A nebbish high school senior and his best friends embarks on a road trip to attend the greatest music festival of the year in a last-ditch effort to win over the girl of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwmvdgpCT7obPNF5ZaQKmPuo9Uq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532204'),
  ('293775640620484998', 'This Is Tomas', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'María Torres', 'Enrique Vázquez, María Torres', 'Hoze Meléndez, Leonardo Ortizgris, Marcela Guirado, Alan Estrada, Pamela Almanza, María Evoli, Martha Claudia Moreno, Juan Pablo Medina', null, 'Leo and his band decide to bring Thomas to play in a wedding. They have no idea how complex it is to spend a day with someone with autism.', 'Leo and his band decide to bring Thomas to play in a wedding. They have no idea how complex it is to spend a day with someone with autism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OfdMLI6eQvwGuuc3lBJo5a2nTV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554572'),
  ('1016384339742625675', 'This Is Where I Leave You', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shawn Levy, Erika McGowan, Greg Staley', 'Jonathan Tropper', 'Jason Bateman, Tina Fey, Jane Fonda, Adam Driver, Rose Byrne, Corey Stoll, Kathryn Hahn, Connie Britton', 'R', 'When their father passes away, four grown, world-weary siblings return to their childhood home and are requested -- with an admonition -- to stay there together for a week, along with their free-speaking mother and a collection of spouses, exes and might-have-beens. As the brothers and sisters re-examine their shared history and the status of each tattered relationship among those who know and love them best, they reconnect in hysterically funny and emotionally significant ways.', 'When their father passes away, four grown, world-weary siblings return to their childhood home and are requested -- with an admonition -- to stay there together for a week, along with their free-speaking mother and a collection of spouses, exes and might-have-beens. As the brothers and sisters re-examine their shared history and the status of each tattered relationship among those who know and love them best, they reconnect in hysterically funny and emotionally significant ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVUI2267FdetVWz9UBQbqTmRVhQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239678'),
  ('37993620491950375', 'This Is Your Life Donald Duck', 1960, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols, Jack Hannah, Jack Kinney', null, 'Walt Disney, Clarence Nash, James MacDonald, June Foray, Cliff Edwards, Dessie Flynn, Billy Bletcher', null, 'Jiminy Cricket is all set to give a testimonial to Donald Duck. But alas, Donald is relaxing at home, with no plans to leave any time soon. Literally dragged to the Disney Studio by his nephews, an outraged Donald relaxes a bit when he realizes that he''s the guest of honor. Donald''s life is recounted by such colleagues as Daisy Duck (who explains why she and Donald never married), Chip ''n'' Dale, Mickey Mouse, Pluto, and even a few guest stars who never made a picture with the duck, including the Three Little Pigs, Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs and Lady and the Tramp.', 'Jiminy Cricket is all set to give a testimonial to Donald Duck. But alas, Donald is relaxing at home, with no plans to leave any time soon. Literally dragged to the Disney Studio by his nephews, an outraged Donald relaxes a bit when he realizes that he''s the guest of honor. Donald''s life is recounted by such colleagues as Daisy Duck (who explains why she and Donald never married), Chip ''n'' Dale, Mickey Mouse, Pluto, and even a few guest stars who never made a picture with the duck, including the Three Little Pigs, Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs and Lady and the Tramp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lokRpFpLgL3Jk7xZPL0VsOzxWzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427768'),
  ('467613825740525211', 'This Island Earth', 1955, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Horror', 'Joseph M. Newman, Clifford Stine, Jack Arnold', 'Franklin Coen, George Callahan', 'Rex Reason, Faith Domergue, Jeff Morrow, Lance Fuller, Robert Nichols, Russell Johnson, Douglas Spencer, Richard Deacon', null, 'Aliens have landed and are hiding on Earth, but need Earth’s scientists to help them fight an inter-planetary war.', 'Aliens have landed and are hiding on Earth, but need Earth’s scientists to help them fight an inter-planetary war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2viRDpHmhzQoreZok2auLjkVbSE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:831'),
  ('576922987494755352', 'This Land Is Mine', 1943, 'Drama, War', 'Frank Redman, Jean Renoir, Edward Donahue', 'Dudley Nichols, Jean Renoir', 'Charles Laughton, Maureen O''Hara, George Sanders, Walter Slezak, Kent Smith, Una O''Connor, Philip Merivale, Thurston Hall', null, 'Somewhere in Europe, in a city occupied by the Nazis, a gentle school teacher finds himself torn between collaboration and resistance, cowardice and courage.', 'Somewhere in Europe, in a city occupied by the Nazis, a gentle school teacher finds himself torn between collaboration and resistance, cowardice and courage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrzTlL50vFQhq9cvsuZvCYLPOcq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45220'),
  ('1032001740966516675', 'This Life of Mine', 1950, 'Drama, War, Crime', 'Shi Hui, Ge Weiqing, Ye Ming', 'Liuqing Yang', 'Shi Hui, Wei Heling, Cui Chaoming, Shen Yang, Li Wei, Cheng Zhi, Liang Ming, Yu Zhongying', null, 'Fifty years of modern Chinese history (1900-1950), including wars, revolutions and corrupt politics, as seen through the life and times of a simple Beijing policeman and his family.', 'Fifty years of modern Chinese history (1900-1950), including wars, revolutions and corrupt politics, as seen through the life and times of a simple Beijing policeman and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJxGU1NZC9V2FI9QGwfCJ0eodjm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176228'),
  ('159141446809514454', 'This Life of Mine', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Benoit Seiller, Sophie Fillières, Constance Demontoy', 'Sophie Fillières', 'Agnès Jaoui, Philippe Katerine, Édouard Sulpice, Angelina Woreth, Valérie Donzelli, Emmanuel Salinger, Laurent Capelluto, Maxence Tual', null, 'Barbie, once an attractive, devoted mother and partner, faces newfound challenges as she turns 55, descending into darkness, violence, and absurdity while grappling with her identity, relationships, and life''s complexities.', 'Barbie, once an attractive, devoted mother and partner, faces newfound challenges as she turns 55, descending into darkness, violence, and absurdity while grappling with her identity, relationships, and life''s complexities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HvF1s0vvXw305kReDobAvYhaGQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001434'),
  ('393993061385032225', 'This Little Love of Mine', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Christine Luby, Simon Harding, Peter McLennan', 'Georgia Harrison', 'Saskia Hampele, Liam McIntyre, Lynn Gilmartin, Craig Horner, Rajan Velu, Lawrence Ola, Tiriel Mora, Jessi Robertson', 'G', 'Laura Price is a successful San Francisco lawyer on the cusp of promotion – a far cry from her childhood growing up on a tropical island with best friends Chip and Gem. When the firm’s biggest client – Chip’s grandfather – asks Laura to travel to the island and deliver a contract to make Chip his heir, she leaves behind her practice and fiancé Owen to convince her childhood friend to sign a contract that will make him a billionaire.', 'Laura Price is a successful San Francisco lawyer on the cusp of promotion – a far cry from her childhood growing up on a tropical island with best friends Chip and Gem. When the firm’s biggest client – Chip’s grandfather – asks Laura to travel to the island and deliver a contract to make Chip his heir, she leaves behind her practice and fiancé Owen to convince her childhood friend to sign a contract that will make him a billionaire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8i1MN7DiqHWVGLluRUaPqEOyhb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:806643'),
  ('1057292984713025141', 'This Magnificent Cake!', 2018, 'Animation, History, Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Marc James Roels, Emma De Swaef, Marc James Roels', 'Marc James Roels, Emma De Swaef', 'Jan Decleir, Bruno Levie, Paul Huvenne, Gaston Motambo, Alexander Rolies, August Rolies, Jamal Tahri, Michel Kossi', null, 'In 1885, Africa is a succulent cake destined to be wildly divided and everyone wants a piece. A disturbed European king, a Pygmy working in a luxury hotel, a successful but lonely businessman, an enslaved porter, a young army deserter, a ghostly clarinetist. Some benefit from colonialism and greed. Others suffer racism and violence.', 'In 1885, Africa is a succulent cake destined to be wildly divided and everyone wants a piece. A disturbed European king, a Pygmy working in a luxury hotel, a successful but lonely businessman, an enslaved porter, a young army deserter, a ghostly clarinetist. Some benefit from colonialism and greed. Others suffer racism and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zc7VOgCFKjZrwDtoVtF4Hx0e2r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518747'),
  ('625982569400917559', 'This Man Can''t Die', 1968, 'Western, Crime', 'Gianfranco Baldanello, Claudio Cirillo, Mario Bianchi', 'Gino Mangini, Gianfranco Baldanello, Luigi Emmanuele', 'Guy Madison, Lucienne Bridou, Rik Battaglia, Rosalba Neri, Steve Merrick, Anna Liotti, Alberto Dell''Acqua, Pietro Martellanza', null, 'An undercover government agent sets out for revenge upon those responsible for the murder of his parents and the assault of his sister.', 'An undercover government agent sets out for revenge upon those responsible for the murder of his parents and the assault of his sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6WN3zmC5t264lgqeg049jcPBk0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91268'),
  ('225568953135313996', 'This Man Must Die', 1969, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier, Michel Dupuy', 'Claude Chabrol, Paul Gégauff', 'Michel Duchaussoy, Caroline Cellier, Jean Yanne, Marc Di Napoli, Anouk Ferjac, Louise Chevalier, Guy Marly, Lorraine Rainer', null, 'When his young son is killed in a hit and run accident, Charles Thenier resolves to hunt down and murder the killer. By chance, Thenier makes the acquaintance of an actress, Helène Lanson, who was in the car at the time of the accident. He then meets Helène’s brother-in-law, Paul Decourt, a truly horrible individual.', 'When his young son is killed in a hit and run accident, Charles Thenier resolves to hunt down and murder the killer. By chance, Thenier makes the acquaintance of an actress, Helène Lanson, who was in the car at the time of the accident. He then meets Helène’s brother-in-law, Paul Decourt, a truly horrible individual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QEL8tsDBZkBq54AzpTyFE4yY50.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2527'),
  ('688934061533886685', 'This Means War', 2012, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'McG, Russell Carpenter, Brian Smrz', 'Timothy Dowling, Simon Kinberg', 'Reese Witherspoon, Chris Pine, Tom Hardy, Til Schweiger, Chelsea Handler, John Paul Ruttan, Abigail Spencer, Angela Bassett', 'PG-13', 'Two top CIA operatives wage an epic battle against one another after they discover they are dating the same woman.', 'Two top CIA operatives wage an epic battle against one another after they discover they are dating the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7d1hwECRc1NZlGfAeYE42ki7Fem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59962'),
  ('826938361468801982', 'This Merry Planet', 1973, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Yuri Saakov, Yuri Tsvetkov', 'Dmitri Ivanov, Vladimir Trifonov, Yuri Saakov', 'Leonid Kuravlyov, Viktor Sergachyov, Yekaterina Vasilyeva, Vladimir Nosik, Savely Kramarov, Aleksandr Vokach, Natalya Krachkovskaya, Larisa Barabanova', null, 'Three cynical and emotionally detached aliens arrive on earth on New Year''s eve with the mission of exploring and studying human behaviour but inevitably get pulled into a hillarious, nonsensical plot which makes them realize just how wonderful earth life can be with all its quirks, drama and humour.', 'Three cynical and emotionally detached aliens arrive on earth on New Year''s eve with the mission of exploring and studying human behaviour but inevitably get pulled into a hillarious, nonsensical plot which makes them realize just how wonderful earth life can be with all its quirks, drama and humour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9E5xhcvA0vJT1Q3w7C1EasTu04H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65080'),
  ('514332205589564823', 'This Modern Age', 1931, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Nick Grindé, Douglas Shearer, Charles Rosher', null, 'Joan Crawford, Pauline Frederick, Neil Hamilton, Monroe Owsley, Albert Conti, Hobart Bosworth, Emma Dunn, Adrienne D''Ambricourt', 'NR', 'A Harvard football star disobeys his upper class parents and runs off with his true love.', 'A Harvard football star disobeys his upper class parents and runs off with his true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxUE4I6bFfL0wVIfy5SWlK6Fi7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199030'),
  ('865794325987757185', 'This Much I Know to Be True', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'Robbie Ryan, Andrew Dominik', null, 'Nick Cave, Warren Ellis, Marianne Faithfull, Earl Cave, Andrew Dominik', 'NR', 'Like all musicians in 2021, Nick Cave was unable to connect with his audience in person. He uses this concert film to break the vocal and instrumental silence, talk about himself and perform songs from “Ghosteen” and “Carnage”, with help from Warren Ellis.', 'Like all musicians in 2021, Nick Cave was unable to connect with his audience in person. He uses this concert film to break the vocal and instrumental silence, talk about himself and perform songs from “Ghosteen” and “Carnage”, with help from Warren Ellis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amYrP5cL5Q2uKJP5RM027ZUzFyQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927025'),
  ('401643056049239131', 'This Must Be the Place', 2011, 'Drama', 'Paolo Sorrentino, Luca Bigazzi', 'Paolo Sorrentino, Umberto Contarello', 'Sean Penn, Olwen Fouéré, Eve Hewson, Johnny Ward, Sam Keeley, Danielle O''Brien, Margaret O''Reilly, Frances McDormand', 'R', 'A bored, retired rock star living in Ireland sets out to find his dead father''s tormentor, an ex-Nazi war criminal who is a refugee in the U.S.', 'A bored, retired rock star living in Ireland sets out to find his dead father''s tormentor, an ex-Nazi war criminal who is a refugee in the U.S.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WSD4SAMGVP6BHSOzDGL9Acunxd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53487'),
  ('462493175687254803', 'This Night', 2009, 'Drama', 'Werner Schroeter, Thomas Plenert', 'Juan Carlos Onetti', 'Pascal Greggory, Bruno Todeschini, Amira Casar, Éric Caravaca, Nathalie Delon, Jean-François Stévenin, Laura Soveral, Filipe Duarte', null, 'Werner Schroeter directed this dark and surreal tale of a man determined to save a lost lover from a grim fate at the hands of a violent mob. The city of Santa Maria is falling into chaos as an armed military faction is poised to take power in a coup d''etat. Ossorio used to call Santa Maria home, and he has returned in its darkest hour to find the woman he loves, hoping to rescue her from the violence that is lurks around the corner. As Ossorio searches for his love, he meets Victoria in a shabby hotel, who in turn introduces him to her father Barcala, who for the right price is willing to take Ossorio and another passenger away on his boat. While Ossorio is willing to pay Barcala what he wants, can he find the mysterious woman before the ship sets sail?', 'Werner Schroeter directed this dark and surreal tale of a man determined to save a lost lover from a grim fate at the hands of a violent mob. The city of Santa Maria is falling into chaos as an armed military faction is poised to take power in a coup d''etat. Ossorio used to call Santa Maria home, and he has returned in its darkest hour to find the woman he loves, hoping to rescue her from the violence that is lurks around the corner. As Ossorio searches for his love, he meets Victoria in a shabby hotel, who in turn introduces him to her father Barcala, who for the right price is willing to take Ossorio and another passenger away on his boat. While Ossorio is willing to pay Barcala what he wants, can he find the mysterious woman before the ship sets sail?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnQDbM43plFrMo19aq8NFbxW35.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12422'),
  ('200360353028102958', 'This Night I''ll Possess Your Corpse', 1967, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'José Mojica Marins, Jean Garrett', 'José Mojica Marins, Aldenora De Sa Porto', 'José Mojica Marins, Roque Rodrigues, Nadia Freitas, William Morgan, Tina Wohlers, Nivaldo Lima, Tania Mendonça, Oswaldo De Souza', null, 'Coffin Joe, the unholy undertaker, is back in town to continue his quest for the perfect woman, embarking on an even more brutal campaign of terror, aided and abetted by his hunchbacked assistant.', 'Coffin Joe, the unholy undertaker, is back in town to continue his quest for the perfect woman, embarking on an even more brutal campaign of terror, aided and abetted by his hunchbacked assistant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLqPb9nRw1mAoXfA4RvrnR0vf9j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30914'),
  ('681188265556619151', 'This One Summer', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eric Lartigau, Jacques Girault', 'Eric Lartigau, Delphine Gleize', 'Rose Pou Pellicer, Juliette Havelange, Marina Foïs, Gael García Bernal, Chiara Mastroianni, Ángela Molina, Adèle Wismes, Hugo Fernandes', null, 'Every summer, 10-year-old Dune goes with her parents to the south-west coast of France, where she meets her best friend Mathilde. Together, they explore pine forests, contemplate the shape of clouds, follow teenagers and crash their parties, and secretly watch horror films. But this one summer is special for Dune – last year, the family skipped their usual holiday without her knowing why. She feels that something has changed. As childhood becomes a little more distant, she begins to see adults and teenagers differently and understand their secrets.', 'Every summer, 10-year-old Dune goes with her parents to the south-west coast of France, where she meets her best friend Mathilde. Together, they explore pine forests, contemplate the shape of clouds, follow teenagers and crash their parties, and secretly watch horror films. But this one summer is special for Dune – last year, the family skipped their usual holiday without her knowing why. She feels that something has changed. As childhood becomes a little more distant, she begins to see adults and teenagers differently and understand their secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmPEH2BrAk1Txvk8eii5WZb987W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958635'),
  ('379815281799119045', 'This Place Rules', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Andrew Callaghan', null, 'Andrew Callaghan, Alex E. Jones, Mike Busey, Edward X. Young, Forgiato Blow, Enrique Tarrio, Dave Todeschini', null, 'Acclaimed for his unfiltered reporting and deadpan humor, Andrew Callaghan brings his gonzo style reporting to the undercurrents that led to the January 6 Capitol Riot. As one of the best-known and hardest working journalists of his generation, the 25-year-old ventures on a wild RV journey through America to take the pulse of a divided nation.', 'Acclaimed for his unfiltered reporting and deadpan humor, Andrew Callaghan brings his gonzo style reporting to the undercurrents that led to the January 6 Capitol Riot. As one of the best-known and hardest working journalists of his generation, the 25-year-old ventures on a wild RV journey through America to take the pulse of a divided nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Kml8c7L1IySs1g8Q9v8l1EPS1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024433'),
  ('309165190840350763', 'This Property Is Condemned', 1966, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sydney Pollack, James Wong Howe, Eddie Saeta', 'Fred Coe, Edith R. Sommer, Francis Ford Coppola', 'Natalie Wood, Robert Redford, Charles Bronson, Kate Reid, Mary Badham, Alan Baxter, Robert Blake, Dabney Coleman', null, 'Owen Legate, a railroad official, comes to Dodson, Mississippi to shut down the local railway - the town''s main income. But Owen unexpectedly finds love with Dodson''s flirt and main attraction, Alva Starr.', 'Owen Legate, a railroad official, comes to Dodson, Mississippi to shut down the local railway - the town''s main income. But Owen unexpectedly finds love with Dodson''s flirt and main attraction, Alva Starr.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWeUgrZ3YMIWfU8IGqPguWw3EyG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65012'),
  ('419503879602959804', 'This Side of the Law', 1950, 'Crime', 'Carl E. Guthrie, Richard L. Bare, Elmer Decker', 'Russell S. Hughes', 'Viveca Lindfors, Kent Smith, Janis Paige, Robert Douglas, John Alvin, Monte Blue, Frances Morris, Nita Talbot', 'NR', 'A man - trapped in a cistern - reflects on the dark events that lead to his lonely entrapment. Told in flashback, we witness his chance encounter with a nefarious lawyer who persuades him to impersonate a wealthy man who went missing 7 years ago.', 'A man - trapped in a cistern - reflects on the dark events that lead to his lonely entrapment. Told in flashback, we witness his chance encounter with a nefarious lawyer who persuades him to impersonate a wealthy man who went missing 7 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rn9u9XzDNagh1KFmWjWhAGt69IW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45627'),
  ('1093601978876870155', 'This Special Friendship', 1964, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean Delannoy, Christian Matras', 'Jean Aurenche', 'Francis Lacombrade, Didier Haudepin, François Leccia, Dominique Maurin, Louis Seigner, Michel Bouquet, Lucien Nat, Gérard Chambre', null, 'A tale of the tender relationship between a twelve-year-old boy and the fourteen-year-old upperclassman who is the object of his desire, all set within the rigid atmosphere of a Jesuit-run school.', 'A tale of the tender relationship between a twelve-year-old boy and the fourteen-year-old upperclassman who is the object of his desire, all set within the rigid atmosphere of a Jesuit-run school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c46p1ZHudea0jJ0Fl1BlsUKbME4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66956'),
  ('260459480143501138', 'This Sporting Life', 1963, 'Drama', 'Lindsay Anderson, Ted Sturgis, Denys N. Coop', 'David Storey', 'Richard Harris, Rachel Roberts, Alan Badel, William Hartnell, Colin Blakely, Vanda Godsell, Anne Cunningham, Jack Watson', null, 'In Northern England in the early 1960s, Frank Machin is mean, tough and ambitious enough to become an immediate star in the rugby league team run by local employer Weaver.', 'In Northern England in the early 1960s, Frank Machin is mean, tough and ambitious enough to become an immediate star in the rugby league team run by local employer Weaver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOxaN1ziYdOJgAQouWO1pGEBU7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18774'),
  ('706007310548558537', 'This Summer Feeling', 2015, 'Drama', 'Mikhaël Hers, Sébastien Buchmann, Marion Touitou', 'Mariette Désert, Mikhaël Hers', 'Anders Danielsen Lie, Judith Chemla, Marie Rivière, Féodor Atkine, Dounia Sichov, Stéphanie Daub-Laurent, Lana Cooper, Thibault Vinçon', null, 'In high summer, Sasha suddenly dies. Her death brings two virtual strangers, her boyfriend Lawrence and sister Zoé, closer together, sharing their grief and the burden of their loss in Berlin, Paris and New York.', 'In high summer, Sasha suddenly dies. Her death brings two virtual strangers, her boyfriend Lawrence and sister Zoé, closer together, sharing their grief and the burden of their loss in Berlin, Paris and New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePcZpeqs02Gs6fdDI96UiUyEaau.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369594'),
  ('475304417814079967', 'This Time Around', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Douglas Barr, Derick V. Underschultz', null, 'Carly Pope, Brian Austin Green, Sara Rue, Gina Tognoni, Sherry Miller, David Lipper, Adam Greydon Reid, Matthew Edison', null, 'We all wish we could change the past. For Mel that day has come. In junior high, Mel and Gabby (Sara Rue) were the biggest geeks. Of course, Mel had a crush on the most popular guy, Drew Hesler (Brian A. Green). When word spreads of Mel’s crush, he plays a cruel joke on her pretending to be interested, only to turn her down in front of the entire school. Eleven years later, our ugly ducklings are now swans and Mel is a PR executive. When Mel is assigned to handle the publicity for a new restaurant, she is shocked to discover that the owner is a handsome young entrepreneur named Drew Hesler.', 'We all wish we could change the past. For Mel that day has come. In junior high, Mel and Gabby (Sara Rue) were the biggest geeks. Of course, Mel had a crush on the most popular guy, Drew Hesler (Brian A. Green). When word spreads of Mel’s crush, he plays a cruel joke on her pretending to be interested, only to turn her down in front of the entire school. Eleven years later, our ugly ducklings are now swans and Mel is a PR executive. When Mel is assigned to handle the publicity for a new restaurant, she is shocked to discover that the owner is a handsome young entrepreneur named Drew Hesler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54N1fl5QjkBih0AP2oKtL8No243.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57343'),
  ('219873904175786945', 'This Time Next Year', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Nick Moore, Luca Ciuti', 'Sophie Cousens', 'Sophie Cookson, Lucien Laviscount, John Hannah, Golda Rosheuvel, Monica Dolan, Mandip Gill, Charlie Oscar, Will Hislop', null, 'Minnie and Quinn were both born in London on New Year’s Day, in the same hospital, one minute apart. Thirty years later — and very different people — they find themselves thrown together again in the same city on New Year’s Eve.', 'Minnie and Quinn were both born in London on New Year’s Day, in the same hospital, one minute apart. Thirty years later — and very different people — they find themselves thrown together again in the same city on New Year’s Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckLPzRl9ZDHzNt4tDjkTGUyCYg7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1122418'),
  ('503263664670561688', 'This Transient Life', 1970, 'Drama', 'Akio Jissoji, Masao Nakabori, Kazumi Oneda', 'Toshirō Ishidō', 'Michiko Tsukasa, Ryo Tamura, Eiji Okada, Isao Sasaki, Mitsuko Tanaka, Haruhiko Okamura, Kozo Yamamura, Kin Sugai', null, 'Near a remote Buddhist monastery, a young man falls in love with his sister and gets her pregnant. After a monk finds out, the young man becomes an assistant to a master sculptor, only to proceed to complicate matters with his affairs.', 'Near a remote Buddhist monastery, a young man falls in love with his sister and gets her pregnant. After a monk finds out, the young man becomes an assistant to a master sculptor, only to proceed to complicate matters with his affairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9UJitBSy1DE9zZfOjWJuqn8Abg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104452'),
