  ('300980537672106148', 'This Was Pancho Villa: First chapter', 1957, 'Comedy, War, History', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Rosalío Solano', 'Rafael A. Pérez, José Luis de Celis, Ricardo Garibay', 'Pedro Armendáriz, María Elena Marqués, Carlos López Moctezuma, Humberto Almazán, Evita Muñoz ''Chachita'', Miguel Manzano, Eduardo Noriega, Martha Elena Cervantes', null, 'The disembodied head of Pancho Villa, kept in a glass jar in a research institute, is the narrator of several short stories from his own life, stories that might or might not have happened but are the stuff of legend.', 'The disembodied head of Pancho Villa, kept in a glass jar in a research institute, is the narrator of several short stories from his own life, stories that might or might not have happened but are the stuff of legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yn5TTJoMHrcLXozM3WjUjgxBaCz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330079'),
  ('733776895395144037', 'This Way Up', 2008, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Adam Foulkes, Alan Smith', 'Alan Smith, Adam Foulkes, Christopher O''Reilly', null, 'NR', 'A.T Shank &amp; Son have a bad day at the parlor when a falling boulder flattens their hearse. Emotional and literal pitfalls lie in wait for the odd couple as they make their way cross country with just a coffin for company. This short animated caper puts the fun back into funeral as their journey and relationship unravel on an epic scale.', 'A.T Shank &amp; Son have a bad day at the parlor when a falling boulder flattens their hearse. Emotional and literal pitfalls lie in wait for the odd couple as they make their way cross country with just a coffin for company. This short animated caper puts the fun back into funeral as their journey and relationship unravel on an epic scale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpUuHk883WDXYKUJSVHlseurkI8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86118'),
  ('608327898786984325', 'This Woman Is Dangerous', 1952, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ted D. McCord, Russell Saunders, Felix E. Feist', 'George Worthing Yates, Daniel Mainwaring', 'Joan Crawford, Dennis Morgan, David Brian, Richard Webb, Mari Aldon, Philip Carey, Ian MacDonald, Katherine Warren', 'NR', 'A crime gang leader is losing her sight, so while her lover goes into hiding, she checks in to the hospital for extensive surgery to recover her eyesight. There she is treated by a handsome young doctor. As expected not only does the doctor successfully open her eyes, he also opens her heart for him.', 'A crime gang leader is losing her sight, so while her lover goes into hiding, she checks in to the hospital for extensive surgery to recover her eyesight. There she is treated by a handsome young doctor. As expected not only does the doctor successfully open her eyes, he also opens her heart for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6epl5Bq3PcaC0YbJWVMk9JKjuXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78265'),
  ('748446609992798622', 'This World of Ours', 2007, 'Drama', 'Ryô Nakajima', 'Ryô Nakajima', 'Shinmon Akaho, Arisa Hata, Natsu Kasyu, Ren Murakami, Taketomo Ogawa, Satoshi Okutsu, Yoshihiko Tanigugchi', null, 'Ryo is a boy broken on an emotional level, doesn''t go to school anymore and locks himself inside at home. Hiroki is a student constantly talking about changing the world, but struggles to keep up with his friends. Ami, an isolated girl, comes into the life of both boys. The three of them get alienated from society and slowly, but surely, from each other and themselves.', 'Ryo is a boy broken on an emotional level, doesn''t go to school anymore and locks himself inside at home. Hiroki is a student constantly talking about changing the world, but struggles to keep up with his friends. Ami, an isolated girl, comes into the life of both boys. The three of them get alienated from society and slowly, but surely, from each other and themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9MBLTiIlWBiEumiAZb8xRJNTZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115416'),
  ('928733283590352791', 'This World, Then the Fireworks', 1997, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Tom Priestley Jr., Michael Oblowitz, Michael F. Barrow', 'Larry Gross', 'Billy Zane, Gina Gershon, Sheryl Lee, Philip Locke, Elis Imboden, Christian Durango, Sloan Cobb, Roberta Hanley', 'R', 'In 1950s, two incestuous lovers, a depraved suave journalist and his equally depraved prostitute sister, plan to get rich through seduction and murder.', 'In 1950s, two incestuous lovers, a depraved suave journalist and his equally depraved prostitute sister, plan to get rich through seduction and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXO9T4rbJFVRF6BbABHe7VKJdj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60033'),
  ('542740074693800181', 'This Year''s Love', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'David Kane, Robert Alazraki', 'David Kane', 'Kathy Burke, Jennifer Ehle, Ian Hart, Douglas Henshall, Catherine McCormack, Dougray Scott, Emily Woof, Sophie Okonedo', null, 'The big-screen debut from Scottish stage director David Kane, This Year''s Love is a comedy about the romantic misadventures of six young people in Camden, North London. The marriage of tattoo artist Danny (Douglas Hanshall) and dressmaker Hannah (Catherine McCormack) gets off to a less-than-inspiring start when Danny finds out Hannah has already been fooling around with a friend''s husband, so Danny takes a walk and Hannah splits with a friend to get drunk. At the airport, where the newly-weds were supposed to leave for a honeymoon, Danny meets a cleaning woman named Mary (Kathy Burke) and is immediately infatuated, while Hannah is picked up by a scruffy artist named Cameron (Dougray Scott). Elsewhere, Liam (Ian Hart), a geeky comic-art enthusiast who shares an apartment with Cameron, finds romance with Sophie (Jennifer Ehle), a single mother and full-time neurotic.', 'The big-screen debut from Scottish stage director David Kane, This Year''s Love is a comedy about the romantic misadventures of six young people in Camden, North London. The marriage of tattoo artist Danny (Douglas Hanshall) and dressmaker Hannah (Catherine McCormack) gets off to a less-than-inspiring start when Danny finds out Hannah has already been fooling around with a friend''s husband, so Danny takes a walk and Hannah splits with a friend to get drunk. At the airport, where the newly-weds were supposed to leave for a honeymoon, Danny meets a cleaning woman named Mary (Kathy Burke) and is immediately infatuated, while Hannah is picked up by a scruffy artist named Cameron (Dougray Scott). Elsewhere, Liam (Ian Hart), a geeky comic-art enthusiast who shares an apartment with Cameron, finds romance with Sophie (Jennifer Ehle), a single mother and full-time neurotic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atEvEcTytE2mnlhjPvxVHmIz77I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38647'),
  ('1079031574457824705', 'Thoda Pyaar Thoda Magic', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kunal Kohli', 'Rohena Gera', 'Rani Mukerji, Saif Ali Khan, Ameesha Patel, Rishi Kapoor, Shriya Sharma', null, 'One day they pray to God for help and he does help them. He sends his most mischievous, childlike, lovable angel to the rescue, with a mission to bring Ranbeer and the kids together. Geeta (Rani Mukerji) comes bicycling down a rainbow… and bursts into Ranbeer''s house as the selfproclaimed new nanny. And then starts the roller coaster ride of fun, emotions, magic and love.', 'One day they pray to God for help and he does help them. He sends his most mischievous, childlike, lovable angel to the rescue, with a mission to bring Ranbeer and the kids together. Geeta (Rani Mukerji) comes bicycling down a rainbow… and bursts into Ranbeer''s house as the selfproclaimed new nanny. And then starts the roller coaster ride of fun, emotions, magic and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sILNLbwCDFHsQhCzLfxU89R1dni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14214'),
  ('1028691849483139304', 'Tholi Prema', 1998, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'A. Karunakaran', null, 'Pawan Kalyan, Keerthi Reddy, Vasuki Anand, Ali Basha, Venu Madhav, Achyuth, Narra Venkateswara Rao, Sangeeta', null, 'Balu falls in love with Anu who has come to her grandfather''s house from the US. He even saves her life during an accident, but he is still not able to express his love to her.', 'Balu falls in love with Anu who has come to her grandfather''s house from the US. He even saves her life during an accident, but he is still not able to express his love to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkgp35nyquBbMPb0ICJUF188vPG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112846'),
  ('1022124239738892486', 'Thomas & Friends: The Great Discovery', 2008, 'Family', 'Steve Asquith, Terry Permane', 'Sharon Miller', 'Pierce Brosnan', 'G', 'Thomas the Tank Engine™ stars in an all-new movie guest starring Pierce Brosnan as the narrator! Sodor Day is coming and all the engines are busy preparing. When Thomas gets lost in the mountains, he discovers the old town of Great Waterton! Soon the whole island is buzzing with the news of Thomas'' discovery and restoring the town in time for the big day. Join the fun and meet a new engine friend named Stanley!', 'Thomas the Tank Engine™ stars in an all-new movie guest starring Pierce Brosnan as the narrator! Sodor Day is coming and all the engines are busy preparing. When Thomas gets lost in the mountains, he discovers the old town of Great Waterton! Soon the whole island is buzzing with the news of Thomas'' discovery and restoring the town in time for the big day. Join the fun and meet a new engine friend named Stanley!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ThzDIhr8PnjS6aOFH9LycgXbdr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93458'),
  ('759190123627396918', 'Thomas and the Magic Railroad', 2000, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Britt Allcroft, Terry Permane, Paul Ryan', 'Britt Allcroft', 'Alec Baldwin, Peter Fonda, Mara Wilson, Edward Glen, Neil Crone, Michael E. Rodgers, Britt Allcroft, Kevin Frank', 'G', 'Mr. Conductor''s supply of magic gold dust, which allows him to travel between Shining Time and Thomas''s island, is critically low. Unfortunately, he doesn''t know how to get more. Meanwhile, Thomas is fending off attacks by the nasty diesel engines. Getting more gold dust will require help from Mr. C''s slacker cousin, his new friend Lily and her morose grandfather, plus the secret engine.', 'Mr. Conductor''s supply of magic gold dust, which allows him to travel between Shining Time and Thomas''s island, is critically low. Unfortunately, he doesn''t know how to get more. Meanwhile, Thomas is fending off attacks by the nasty diesel engines. Getting more gold dust will require help from Mr. C''s slacker cousin, his new friend Lily and her morose grandfather, plus the secret engine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPEJ36e8a7gLu28KVfsGDQdmruk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16110'),
  ('396304072013353190', 'Thomas in Love', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Pierre-Paul Renders, Virginie Saint-Martin', 'Philippe Blasband', 'Benoît Verhaert, Aylin Yay, Magali Pinglaut, Micheline Hardy, Frédéric Topart, Alexandre von Sivers, Serge Larivière, Jacqueline Bollen', null, 'Thomas Thomas is agoraphobic, has a computer-generated girlfriend, and hasn''t left his home in years. Can a prostitute convince him to leave cyberspace and his home for the real world?', 'Thomas Thomas is agoraphobic, has a computer-generated girlfriend, and hasn''t left his home in years. Can a prostitute convince him to leave cyberspace and his home for the real world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a31nJ0grVzwO8666xH14UTAJJ5F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21596'),
