  ('669268759325466270', 'Thomas Pesquet: The Makings of a Hero', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Jürgen Hansen, Pierre-Emmanuel Le Goff', null, 'Thomas Pesquet', null, 'At 38, Thomas Pesquet is the youngest French astronaut to be selected for a 180 days mission in the ISS. Oleg Novitskiy, the Russian pilot and the American Peggy Whitson, the most experienced astronaut in the world, train alongside him.', 'At 38, Thomas Pesquet is the youngest French astronaut to be selected for a 180 days mission in the ISS. Oleg Novitskiy, the Russian pilot and the American Peggy Whitson, the most experienced astronaut in the world, train alongside him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCNZeviEYlUwMsk7Ot5g0fqcY1j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615988'),
  ('867832757843952571', 'Thomas the Impostor', 1965, 'Drama, War', 'Georges Franju, Marcel Fradetal', 'Jean Cocteau, Georges Franju, Michel Worms', 'Fabrice Rouleau, Emmanuelle Riva, Jean Servais, Sophie Darès, Michel Vitold, Rosy Varte, Hélène Dieudonné, Gabrielle Dorziat', null, 'In the First World War, when Paris is expected to fall to the Germans, the attractive widow, Princesse de Bormes, organises a convoy of cars to evacuate the wounded from the front, and bring them back to her villa in Paris to recuperate. The authorities will not give them passes until an innocent 16-year-old boy, Guillaume Thomas de Fontenoy, joins them and is mistaken as the nephew of the popular General de Fontenoy. The Princess is enraptured by Thomas and her daughter, Henriette, falls in love with him. However Thomas feels impelled to see more of the action of the war.', 'In the First World War, when Paris is expected to fall to the Germans, the attractive widow, Princesse de Bormes, organises a convoy of cars to evacuate the wounded from the front, and bring them back to her villa in Paris to recuperate. The authorities will not give them passes until an innocent 16-year-old boy, Guillaume Thomas de Fontenoy, joins them and is mistaken as the nephew of the popular General de Fontenoy. The Princess is enraptured by Thomas and her daughter, Henriette, falls in love with him. However Thomas feels impelled to see more of the action of the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqanMmzG042Eka9jx1h9s9l55rh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102569'),
