  ('618000163479369992', 'Thondimuthalum Driksakshiyum', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Unnimaya Prasad, Rajesh Madhavan, Dileesh Pothan', 'Sajeev Pazhoor', 'Suraj Venjaramoodu, Fahadh Faasil, Nimisha Sajayan, Alencier Ley Lopez, Vettukili Prakash, Sivadas Kannur, Sibi Thomas, Srikant Murali', null, 'Prasad and Sreeja are a couple planning to set up a new life in Kasargod. On a bus journey they end up being robbed by a thief also named Prasad and this lands them up in a police station.', 'Prasad and Sreeja are a couple planning to set up a new life in Kasargod. On a bus journey they end up being robbed by a thief also named Prasad and this lands them up in a police station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ki1EguwPuXM1t4UTDuaBqD8BLJi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459719'),
  ('572547222034889564', 'Thong Girls', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Lina Romay, Jesús Franco, Juan Soler', 'Jesús Franco', 'Lina Romay, Antonio Mayans, Eva León, Analía Ivars, Juan Soler, Agustín Gil, José Llamas, Muriel Montossé', null, 'A comedy set mostly on the beach, where countless men are trying to impress various women.', 'A comedy set mostly on the beach, where countless men are trying to impress various women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAYlBsDm9nM4xOYKrN0eAum3JYZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300492'),
  ('74325797996526309', 'Thoovanathumbikal', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'P. Padmarajan, Blessy, Jayanan Vincent', 'P. Padmarajan', 'Mohanlal, Sumalatha, Parvathi, Ashokan, Babu Namboothiri, Sreenath, Sukumari, Jagathy Sreekumar', null, 'Jayakrishnan falls in love with two girls, Radha (a villager) and Clara (a sex-worker), and fights his confusion about whom he should marry and spend his life with.', 'Jayakrishnan falls in love with two girls, Radha (a villager) and Clara (a sex-worker), and fights his confusion about whom he should marry and spend his life with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwqLT616LooEvFRzh4efz2TyXGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210492'),
  ('373755082399340512', 'Thor', 2011, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Vic Armstrong, Greg Hale, Luc Etienne', 'Don Payne, Ashley Miller, Zack Stentz', 'Chris Hemsworth, Natalie Portman, Tom Hiddleston, Anthony Hopkins, Stellan Skarsgård, Kat Dennings, Clark Gregg, Colm Feore', 'PG-13', 'Against his father Odin''s will, The Mighty Thor - a powerful but arrogant warrior god - recklessly reignites an ancient war. Thor is cast down to Earth and forced to live among humans as punishment. Once here, Thor learns what it takes to be a true hero when the most dangerous villain of his world sends the darkest forces of Asgard to invade Earth.', 'Against his father Odin''s will, The Mighty Thor - a powerful but arrogant warrior god - recklessly reignites an ancient war. Thor is cast down to Earth and forced to live among humans as punishment. Once here, Thor learns what it takes to be a true hero when the most dangerous villain of his world sends the darkest forces of Asgard to invade Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prSfAi1xGrhLQNxVSUFh61xQ4Qy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10195'),
  ('57612448861022611', 'Thor - Hammer of the Gods', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Rafael Jordan, Ivo Peitchev, Todor Chapkanov', 'Rafael Jordan', 'Zachery Ty Bryan, Mac Brandt, Daz Crawford, Nicole Ennemoser, Rafael Jordan, John Laskowski, Melissa Osborne, Maxim Genchev', null, 'Thor, along with his friends, travel to a mysterious island seeking glory and fame. On arriving, they encounter strange creatures and visions, so they start searching the island for answers. Meanwhile Thor''s friend Freyja tells him that his visions of a mighty hammer are clues, so they also search for the hammer.', 'Thor, along with his friends, travel to a mysterious island seeking glory and fame. On arriving, they encounter strange creatures and visions, so they start searching the island for answers. Meanwhile Thor''s friend Freyja tells him that his visions of a mighty hammer are clues, so they also search for the hammer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/P83jWKzaFREjkCiSZRedRJPD6g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31533'),
  ('479602088030608200', 'Thor and the Amazon Women', 1963, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Antonio Leonviola, Tonino Ricci, Sofia Scandurra', 'Antonio Leonviola, Fabio Piccioni', 'Susy Andersen, Joe Robinson, Harry Baird, Janine Hendy, Maria Fiore, Alberto Cevenini, Claudia Capone, Carla Foscari', null, 'A race of Amazon warriors is enslaving the men of a country, and the mighty Thor is called upon to help them regain their freedom.', 'A race of Amazon warriors is enslaving the men of a country, and the mighty Thor is called upon to help them regain their freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auUEEBfq58tiVRDQ0siB4vppV0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151704'),
  ('397720871998140104', 'Thor the Conqueror', 1983, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Tonino Ricci', 'Tito Carpi', 'Bruno Minniti, Maria Romano, Malisa Longo, Rosalba Ciofalo, Elena Wiedermann, Luigi Mezzanotte, Raf Baldassarre, Angelo Ragusa', null, 'After both his parents are brutally murdered by his fathers rival Gnut and his men the new born Thor is placed in hiding by the physical embodiment of the god Teisha. Raised in secret under the guidance of Teisha, Thor comes to maturity and goes on a quest to avenge the death of his parents and return peace to his lands, in the process he discovers a woman to take as his wife, finds and uncovers his fathers sword and masters the art of combat, all under the ever watchful eye of the amorphous Teisha.', 'After both his parents are brutally murdered by his fathers rival Gnut and his men the new born Thor is placed in hiding by the physical embodiment of the god Teisha. Raised in secret under the guidance of Teisha, Thor comes to maturity and goes on a quest to avenge the death of his parents and return peace to his lands, in the process he discovers a woman to take as his wife, finds and uncovers his fathers sword and masters the art of combat, all under the ever watchful eye of the amorphous Teisha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGvDzNyBJxaK99snuHoDEOqh5hg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183154'),
  ('1001585981049185296', 'Thor: God of Thunder', 2022, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Noah Luke, Noah Luke', 'Steve Doucette', 'Myrom Kingery, Vernon Wells, Daniel O''Reilly, Vaune Suitt, Tyler Christopher, Neli Sabour, Ashford J. Thomas, Robert Christopher Smith', null, 'Thor’s villainous brother Loki has escaped Asgard to search for Yggdrasil — The Tree of the Nine Realms. The tree holds the power of the Universe, and is secreted away on Earth. With the help of giant wolf god Fenrir, Loki plans to destroy the tree and replant it in his image, giving him dominion over all. Now Thor must follow Loki to Earth to wage an epic battle that will hold the two worlds in its balance.', 'Thor’s villainous brother Loki has escaped Asgard to search for Yggdrasil — The Tree of the Nine Realms. The tree holds the power of the Universe, and is secreted away on Earth. With the help of giant wolf god Fenrir, Loki plans to destroy the tree and replant it in his image, giving him dominion over all. Now Thor must follow Loki to Earth to wage an epic battle that will hold the two worlds in its balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e48IJ1KGR0beGD6B5np74OyqcpU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:990593'),
  ('130198289837839145', 'Thor: Love and Thunder', 2022, 'Fantasy, Action, Comedy', 'Barry Idoine, Jake Morrison, Lee Cleary', 'Taika Waititi, Jennifer Kaytin Robinson', 'Chris Hemsworth, Natalie Portman, Christian Bale, Tessa Thompson, Taika Waititi, Russell Crowe, Jaimie Alexander, Idris Elba', 'PG-13', 'After his retirement is interrupted by Gorr the God Butcher, a galactic killer who seeks the extinction of the gods, Thor Odinson enlists the help of King Valkyrie, Korg, and ex-girlfriend Jane Foster, who now wields Mjolnir as the Mighty Thor. Together they embark upon a harrowing cosmic adventure to uncover the mystery of the God Butcher’s vengeance and stop him before it’s too late.', 'After his retirement is interrupted by Gorr the God Butcher, a galactic killer who seeks the extinction of the gods, Thor Odinson enlists the help of King Valkyrie, Korg, and ex-girlfriend Jane Foster, who now wields Mjolnir as the Mighty Thor. Together they embark upon a harrowing cosmic adventure to uncover the mystery of the God Butcher’s vengeance and stop him before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIkRyD18kl4FhoCNQuWxWu5cBLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616037'),
  ('214002848964632441', 'Thor: Ragnarok', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Taika Waititi, Javier Aguirresarobe, Vincent Lascoumes', 'Craig Kyle, Christopher L. Yost, Eric Pearson', 'Chris Hemsworth, Mark Ruffalo, Tom Hiddleston, Cate Blanchett, Idris Elba, Jeff Goldblum, Tessa Thompson, Karl Urban', 'PG-13', 'Thor is imprisoned on the other side of the universe and finds himself in a race against time to get back to Asgard to stop Ragnarok, the destruction of his home-world and the end of Asgardian civilization, at the hands of a powerful new threat, the ruthless Hela.', 'Thor is imprisoned on the other side of the universe and finds himself in a race against time to get back to Asgard to stop Ragnarok, the destruction of his home-world and the end of Asgardian civilization, at the hands of a powerful new threat, the ruthless Hela.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzRwTcFvttcN1ZpX2xv4j3tSdJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284053'),
  ('454987974927580345', 'Thor: Tales of Asgard', 2011, 'Adventure, Animation, Action', 'Sam Liu, Kirk Tingblad', 'Greg Johnson', 'Matthew Wolf, Rick Gomez, Alistair Abell, Tara Strong, Paul Dobson, Chris Britton, Clancy Brown, Jay Brazeau', 'PG', 'Hungry for adventure, Thor secretly embarks on the journey of a lifetime, joined by his loyal brother Loki, whose budding sorcery equips him with just enough magic to conjure up trouble, along with the Warriors Three - a band of boastful travelers reluctant to set sail on any adventure that might actually be dangerous. But what starts out as a harmless treasure hunt quickly turns deadly, and Thor must now prove himself worthy of the destiny he covets by saving Asgard itself.', 'Hungry for adventure, Thor secretly embarks on the journey of a lifetime, joined by his loyal brother Loki, whose budding sorcery equips him with just enough magic to conjure up trouble, along with the Warriors Three - a band of boastful travelers reluctant to set sail on any adventure that might actually be dangerous. But what starts out as a harmless treasure hunt quickly turns deadly, and Thor must now prove himself worthy of the destiny he covets by saving Asgard itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nM2rBqEMrAFiNFHXKWOhUgdKK45.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63686'),
  ('415269958423591410', 'Thor: The Dark World', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Anup Kulkarni, Alan Taylor, Kramer Morgenthau', 'Christopher Markus, Stephen McFeely, Christopher L. Yost', 'Chris Hemsworth, Natalie Portman, Tom Hiddleston, Christopher Eccleston, Anthony Hopkins, Jaimie Alexander, Zachary Levi, Ray Stevenson', 'PG-13', 'Thor fights to restore order across the cosmos… but an ancient race led by the vengeful Malekith returns to plunge the universe back into darkness. Faced with an enemy that even Odin and Asgard cannot withstand, Thor must embark on his most perilous and personal journey yet, one that will reunite him with Jane Foster and force him to sacrifice everything to save us all.', 'Thor fights to restore order across the cosmos… but an ancient race led by the vengeful Malekith returns to plunge the universe back into darkness. Faced with an enemy that even Odin and Asgard cannot withstand, Thor must embark on his most perilous and personal journey yet, one that will reunite him with Jane Foster and force him to sacrifice everything to save us all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wp6OxE4poJ4G7c0U2ZIXasTSMR7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76338'),
  ('495404960712845940', 'Thorium, the Far Side of Nuclear Power', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Myriam Tonelotto, Jérôme Jouvray', null, 'Gilbert Johnston, Michel Prud''Homme, Friedhelm Ptok', null, 'Ever heard of the Thorium molten salt reactor? That''s hardly surprising, as for 70 years, it has been inexplicably kept under wraps by the nuclear industry, despite the fact it could revolutionise energy production. It offers the promise of nuclear energy without waste and without danger. The "green atom": fact or fiction? Research that was dropped without explanation in 1973, has now become a topic of lively discussion...', 'Ever heard of the Thorium molten salt reactor? That''s hardly surprising, as for 70 years, it has been inexplicably kept under wraps by the nuclear industry, despite the fact it could revolutionise energy production. It offers the promise of nuclear energy without waste and without danger. The "green atom": fact or fiction? Research that was dropped without explanation in 1973, has now become a topic of lively discussion...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/au7jArj4PqADbx2mypWibuMf0Yo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422535'),
  ('280193907115247634', 'Thorn of War', 2021, 'Action, War', 'Brahim Chkiri', 'Brahim Chkiri', 'Aziz Dhiouer, Noufissa Benchehida', null, 'A son gets radicalized by an extremist group online. One night he decides to leave for Syria to join the rebels fight against the regime. To bring him back, his mother takes the most dangerous trip of her life. Disguises as a journalist, she joins a convoy to get into the combat zone; and ends up surrounded by a patrol of Kurdish fighters. Being ambushed by the militia and surviving, she witnesses the devastations of war and a world in agony. But her unconditional love for her child and determination, allows her the courage to overcome ever obstacle and survive. All she wants is to bring her son home alive.', 'A son gets radicalized by an extremist group online. One night he decides to leave for Syria to join the rebels fight against the regime. To bring him back, his mother takes the most dangerous trip of her life. Disguises as a journalist, she joins a convoy to get into the combat zone; and ends up surrounded by a patrol of Kurdish fighters. Being ambushed by the militia and surviving, she witnesses the devastations of war and a world in agony. But her unconditional love for her child and determination, allows her the courage to overcome ever obstacle and survive. All she wants is to bring her son home alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/da7rz7K2X8BDfFEIgJCYtwJhFnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785853'),
  ('993109020555756337', 'Thoroughbred', 2016, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Noé Santillán-López, Mario Gallegos', 'Francesco Papini', 'Hernán Mendoza, Joaquín Cosío, Mauricio Argüelles, Luis Roberto Guzmán, Silverio Palacios, Ruy Senderos, Fernando Becerril, Rocío Verdejo', null, '5 professionals rob a Horce Racetrack and a Casino Complex but when one of them makes too many mistakes, the police starts a deadliest manhunt to recover the money.', '5 professionals rob a Horce Racetrack and a Casino Complex but when one of them makes too many mistakes, the police starts a deadliest manhunt to recover the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqfygFHifnvtwaybbfxWPmO3eyz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387840'),
  ('546464277208202716', 'Thoroughbreds', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Cory Finley, Lyle Vincent, Michael T. Meador', 'Cory Finley', 'Olivia Cooke, Anya Taylor-Joy, Anton Yelchin, Paul Sparks, Francie Swift, Kaili Vernoff, Alyssa Fishenden, Jackson Damon', 'R', 'Lily and Amanda, two high school students living in suburban Connecticut, rekindle their unlikely friendship after years of drifting apart. Together, they devise a plan to kill Lily''s abusive stepfather by hiring a lowlife drug dealer.', 'Lily and Amanda, two high school students living in suburban Connecticut, rekindle their unlikely friendship after years of drifting apart. Together, they devise a plan to kill Lily''s abusive stepfather by hiring a lowlife drug dealer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBhskn3zQZu1DKy1ZjjmJRxJUxm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397722'),
  ('102540492115053658', 'Thoroughly Modern Millie', 1967, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'George Roy Hill, Russell Metty', 'Richard Morris', 'Julie Andrews, James Fox, Mary Tyler Moore, Carol Channing, John Gavin, Jack Soo, Pat Morita, Philip Ahn', 'G', 'Millie Dillmount, a fearless young lady fresh from Salina, Kansas, determined to experience Life, sets out to see the world in the rip-roaring Twenties. With high spirits and wearing one of those new high hemlines, she arrives in New York to test the "modern" ideas she had been reading about back in Kansas: "I''ve taken the girl out of Kansas. Now I have to take Kansas out of the girl!"', 'Millie Dillmount, a fearless young lady fresh from Salina, Kansas, determined to experience Life, sets out to see the world in the rip-roaring Twenties. With high spirits and wearing one of those new high hemlines, she arrives in New York to test the "modern" ideas she had been reading about back in Kansas: "I''ve taken the girl out of Kansas. Now I have to take Kansas out of the girl!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ce8rBGFR0naGsp6mKy9CNKn9iSa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32489'),
  ('1011217027599808234', 'Thorvaldsen', 1949, 'Documentary', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer, Preben Frank', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer', 'Ib Koch-Olsen', null, 'Documentary short film about the work of Bertel Thorvaldsen (1770-1844), one of the most famous Danish sculptors, who spent a good part of his life in Italy.', 'Documentary short film about the work of Bertel Thorvaldsen (1770-1844), one of the most famous Danish sculptors, who spent a good part of his life in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXpvgFTA0Ojl2bRNwMIvEpVxJqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163107'),
  ('745472717894343694', 'Those Calloways', 1964, 'Drama, Family', 'Norman Tokar, Edward Colman, Tom Leetch', 'Louise Pelletier', 'Brian Keith, Vera Miles, Brandon De Wilde, Walter Brennan, Ed Wynn, Linda Evans, Philip Abbott, John Larkin', 'PG', 'Story of Cam Calloway and his family, who live in a densely wooded area in New England. Cam dreams of building a sanctuary for the geese that fly over the area each year, and he tries several schemes to buy a nearby lake for this santuary. He is thwarted at every attempt, it seems; he and his son try to get enough furs from their trapping venture to get the money, but the bottom falls out of the fur market. He uses the little money they get for a down payment on the lake, thereby losing their house when he can''t make the mortgage payment. They move to the lake, where their friends help them build a cabin. A salesman stops in town, and tries to get the people to sell their land for a tourist venture; Cam is outraged at his tactics and takes desperate measures after he himself is tricked.', 'Story of Cam Calloway and his family, who live in a densely wooded area in New England. Cam dreams of building a sanctuary for the geese that fly over the area each year, and he tries several schemes to buy a nearby lake for this santuary. He is thwarted at every attempt, it seems; he and his son try to get enough furs from their trapping venture to get the money, but the bottom falls out of the fur market. He uses the little money they get for a down payment on the lake, thereby losing their house when he can''t make the mortgage payment. They move to the lake, where their friends help them build a cabin. A salesman stops in town, and tries to get the people to sell their land for a tourist venture; Cam is outraged at his tactics and takes desperate measures after he himself is tricked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bXyO4tmktrmqnkntcXw1bJpafP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42779'),
  ('920274244803604210', 'Those Happy Days', 2006, 'Comedy, Family', 'Rémy Chevrin, Olivier Nakache, Éric Toledano', 'Olivier Nakache, Éric Toledano', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Marilou Berry, Omar Sy, Lannick Gautry, Julie Fournier, Guillaume Cyr, Joséphine de Meaux, Jacques Boudet', null, 'Set in 1992, a manager Vincent has to run a children''s holiday camp for three weeks and to face the unexpected concerning the place, his colleagues, various problems linked to children about the rooms, trips, their belongings...', 'Set in 1992, a manager Vincent has to run a children''s holiday camp for three weeks and to face the unexpected concerning the place, his colleagues, various problems linked to children about the rooms, trips, their belongings...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/507mUw7mtYpmjwJncOggw9gBZcG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19100'),
  ('742604456409582352', 'Those Happy Years', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Gianni Costantino, Claudio Collepiccolo, Daniele Luchetti', 'Sandro Petraglia, Caterina Venturini, Daniele Luchetti', 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Micaela Ramazzotti, Martina Gedeck, Samuel Garofalo, Niccolò Calvagna, Benedetta Buccellato, Pia Engleberth, Enzo Ardone', null, 'A narcissistic artist''s world turns upside down after his wife''s affair and a disastrous exhibition of his work.', 'A narcissistic artist''s world turns upside down after his wife''s affair and a disastrous exhibition of his work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2encifWUTBDGDB0iOFO9WzYBBf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209353'),
  ('342798144446970750', 'Those Magnificent Men in Their Flying Machines or How I Flew from London to Paris in 25 Hours 11 Minutes', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Ken Annakin, Christopher Challis', 'Ken Annakin, Jack Davies', 'Stuart Whitman, Sarah Miles, James Fox, Alberto Sordi, Robert Morley, Gert Fröbe, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Eric Sykes', 'G', 'In order to boost circulation of his newspaper, Lord Rawnsley announces an air race and offers £10,000 to the first person who can fly across the English Channel. But one of the participants, Percy, plots to sabotage his competitor''s planes. Will Percy triumph?', 'In order to boost circulation of his newspaper, Lord Rawnsley announces an air race and offers £10,000 to the first person who can fly across the English Channel. But one of the participants, Percy, plots to sabotage his competitor''s planes. Will Percy triumph?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcGELNaQ8TbiMUpAnkKLl5g09OO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10338'),
  ('530134167526023142', 'Those People', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joey Kuhn, Leonardo D''Antoni', 'Joey Kuhn', 'Jonathan Gordon, Jason Ralph, Haaz Sleiman, Britt Lower, Meghann Fahy, Chris Conroy, Allison Mackie, Daniel Gerroll', null, 'On Manhattan''s gilded Upper East Side, a young gay painter is torn between an obsession with his infamous best friend and a promising new romance with an older foreign pianist.', 'On Manhattan''s gilded Upper East Side, a young gay painter is torn between an obsession with his infamous best friend and a promising new romance with an older foreign pianist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3OXph1b1QZ9IUvLrd9yjgRqBPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340684'),
  ('962137415798512625', 'Those Redheads from Seattle', 1953, 'Western', 'Lewis R. Foster, Lionel Lindon, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Lewis R. Foster, George Worthing Yates, Daniel Mainwaring', 'Rhonda Fleming, Gene Barry, Agnes Moorehead, Teresa Brewer, Jean Parker, Guy Mitchell, Roscoe Ates, John Kellogg', 'NR', 'A woman takes her four beautiful daughters to Alaska during the Gold Rush to find their fortune.', 'A woman takes her four beautiful daughters to Alaska during the Gold Rush to find their fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WFua07nTj3kof65Wpb9nsnDL1v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163999'),
  ('994032248689437495', 'Those Science Freaks', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance, Fantasy', 'Hiraku Kaneko, Masaya Nozaki', 'Hideaki Yoshikawa', 'Natsumi Takamori, Kumi Sakuma, Kana Akutsu, Junji Majima, Takashiro Mitsu, Miyazawa Yuana', null, 'Haruki spends most of his time with friends and fellow classmates Airi and Ayana. All seems well, that is until Airi and Ayana form separate clubs, the Mechanical Science Club and the Chemical Science Club. The two vie for Haruki''s attention and hilarious chaos usually follows all attempts to make him join.', 'Haruki spends most of his time with friends and fellow classmates Airi and Ayana. All seems well, that is until Airi and Ayana form separate clubs, the Mechanical Science Club and the Chemical Science Club. The two vie for Haruki''s attention and hilarious chaos usually follows all attempts to make him join.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHoOTTmWCf5CRKzB7YBIg0p2orm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403039'),
  ('372017262543655241', 'Those Two in the Legion', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Lucio Fulci, Adolfo Dragone, Stefano Rolla', 'Roberto Bianchi Montero, Arnaldo Marrosu, Giovanni Grimaldi', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Alighiero Noschese, Rosalba Neri, Maria Teresa Vianello, Aldo Giuffrè, Aldo Bufi Landi, Nino Terzo', null, 'Ciccio and Franco flee Naples because they are wrongly accused of having murdered a local camorra boss and enlist in the Foreign Legion. They are inept but are mistaken for brave people by their commander and sent to break a weapon smuggling ring.', 'Ciccio and Franco flee Naples because they are wrongly accused of having murdered a local camorra boss and enlist in the Foreign Legion. They are inept but are mistaken for brave people by their commander and sent to break a weapon smuggling ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIPg8tRofCAD0V7ApvE653mYsMr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107081'),
  ('750128394870939968', 'Those Were the Days', 1995, 'Drama', 'Didier Haudepin, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Claire Mercier, Didier Haudepin', 'Élodie Bouchez, Melvil Poupaud, Sophie Aubry, Gaël Morel, Blandine Lenoir, Myriam Boyer, Sylvie Testud, Marcel Bozonnet', null, 'The grueling, emotionally torturous world of French preparatory schools provides the framework for this mystery. The deliberately rigorous courses are designed to prepare students to take the brutal examinations for entry into the elite Grand Ecoles, where a select few will gain the skills and education needed to insure a bright, prosperous future for themselves. The story centers on Delphine, a girl from the lower classes, and the upper class Claude. Both young women aspire to attend the Ecole Normale Superieure on the Rue d''Ulm. Delphine lives in humble public housing with her dull mother and two young brothers while Claude, who considers herself a Communist, lives in luxury with her own servant; she is sexually involved with fellow- student, Axel, who thinks himself a fascist.', 'The grueling, emotionally torturous world of French preparatory schools provides the framework for this mystery. The deliberately rigorous courses are designed to prepare students to take the brutal examinations for entry into the elite Grand Ecoles, where a select few will gain the skills and education needed to insure a bright, prosperous future for themselves. The story centers on Delphine, a girl from the lower classes, and the upper class Claude. Both young women aspire to attend the Ecole Normale Superieure on the Rue d''Ulm. Delphine lives in humble public housing with her dull mother and two young brothers while Claude, who considers herself a Communist, lives in luxury with her own servant; she is sexually involved with fellow- student, Axel, who thinks himself a fascist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/og7b9LrDxuBL0e2JXx8PqWlu16A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66972'),
  ('1069171101801479547', 'Those Who Are Fine', 2018, 'Drama', 'Cyril Schäublin, Silvan Hillmann', 'Cyril Schäublin', 'Sarah Stauffer, Fidel Morf, Belgouidoum Chihanez, Toni Majdaladi, Mohamed Aghrabi, Margot Gödrös, Liliane Amuat, Nikolai Bosshardt', null, 'Using her skills of selling Internet and insurance deals, young call center employee Alice calls up elderly strangers and pretends to be their granddaughter in urgent need of money. As this trick quickly makes her rich, the film observes people and places in Zurich, all mysteriously connected to Alice’s business.', 'Using her skills of selling Internet and insurance deals, young call center employee Alice calls up elderly strangers and pretends to be their granddaughter in urgent need of money. As this trick quickly makes her rich, the film observes people and places in Zurich, all mysteriously connected to Alice’s business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiUVOb3N5LUhvZXOh1aEK94Rqk0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467384'),
  ('745848721272899015', 'Those Who Care', 2021, 'Documentary', 'François Ruffin, Gilles Perret', 'Gilles Perret, François Ruffin', 'François Ruffin, Gilles Perret, Bruno Bonnell, Armel Briend', null, 'Since the cult success of Merci Patron!, activist/journalist/filmmaker François Ruffin has become an MP. Here, he attempts to table a law aimed at upholding the rights of what in Quebec are known as caregivers, and shows us in passing how a law whose need seems patently obvious is put together, debated, voted on and . . . dies on the battleground of French politics. A stirring documentary about social injustice that somehow manages to make us bust a gut laughing as we rage with indignation. And also cry at the beauty of it all, thanks to the director’s humanist sensibility and a deft play between reality and fiction.', 'Since the cult success of Merci Patron!, activist/journalist/filmmaker François Ruffin has become an MP. Here, he attempts to table a law aimed at upholding the rights of what in Quebec are known as caregivers, and shows us in passing how a law whose need seems patently obvious is put together, debated, voted on and . . . dies on the battleground of French politics. A stirring documentary about social injustice that somehow manages to make us bust a gut laughing as we rage with indignation. And also cry at the beauty of it all, thanks to the director’s humanist sensibility and a deft play between reality and fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXBqgBMWq3IbpSIrUtwq9chI7tG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818608'),
  ('233790222378930068', 'Those Who Love', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Isabel Coixet, Paco Femenía', 'Isabel Coixet, Joan Potau', 'Julio Núñez, Patxi Freytez, Olalla Moreno, Monica Bellucci, Christopher Thompson, Albert Pla, Amanda García, Gary Piquer', null, 'A secret and deep passion marks the life of a young doctor, and threatens the existence of those around him.', 'A secret and deep passion marks the life of a young doctor, and threatens the existence of those around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klPdZNwFLoeXsnZKv2MQlrInitn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103704'),
  ('87971045771656830', 'Those Who Love Me Can Take the Train', 1998, 'Romance, Drama', 'Patrice Chéreau, Éric Gautier', 'Pierre Trividic, Danièle Thompson, Patrice Chéreau', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Charles Berling, Pascal Greggory, Bruno Todeschini, Sylvain Jacques, Vincent Perez, Roschdy Zem', null, 'A group of mourners travels by train to bury a recently deceased artist in Limoges. As they journey, secrets and desires unfold, with relationships shifting, past loves resurfacing, and personal connections revealed. At the funeral and afterward, tensions rise among the group, leading to further emotional complexities at the artist’s family home.', 'A group of mourners travels by train to bury a recently deceased artist in Limoges. As they journey, secrets and desires unfold, with relationships shifting, past loves resurfacing, and personal connections revealed. At the funeral and afterward, tensions rise among the group, leading to further emotional complexities at the artist’s family home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwATSa886QDamfkTG3nHXkCoXPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31353'),
  ('300834666982952819', 'Those Who Love, Hate', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Alejandro Maci, Julián Apezteguia, Ana Laura Urriza', 'Esther Feldman, Alejandro Maci', 'Guillermo Francella, Luisana Lopilato, Justina Bustos, Juan Minujín, Marilú Marini, Carlos Portaluppi, Mario Alarcón', null, 'Enrique Hubermann, homeopathic physician, travels in flight from a love. By a joke of fate, in that distant place he meets the woman he wants to forget, a beautiful young woman like a demon who manipulates men and triggers dangerous passions.', 'Enrique Hubermann, homeopathic physician, travels in flight from a love. By a joke of fate, in that distant place he meets the woman he wants to forget, a beautiful young woman like a demon who manipulates men and triggers dangerous passions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWCaOzGDNQKvP22Tew9rgVJEC37.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475293'),
  ('1000917674199723595', 'Those Who Remain', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anne Le Ny, Patrick Blossier', 'Anne Le Ny', 'Vincent Lindon, Emmanuelle Devos, Yeelem Jappain, Anne Le Ny, Grégoire Oestermann, Christine Murillo, Ophélia Kolb, Apolline Bouissières', null, 'Bertrand dutifully visits his terminally ill wife every day, braving the long train and bus ride to and from the hospital. Lorraine not so willingly visits her boyfriend who was diagnosed with colon cancer. They bump into each other during one of their visits and begin to meet for coffee. Coffee turns into Lorraine offering to drive Bertrand to the train station and the two turn to each other in their time of grief and confusion.', 'Bertrand dutifully visits his terminally ill wife every day, braving the long train and bus ride to and from the hospital. Lorraine not so willingly visits her boyfriend who was diagnosed with colon cancer. They bump into each other during one of their visits and begin to meet for coffee. Coffee turns into Lorraine offering to drive Bertrand to the train station and the two turn to each other in their time of grief and confusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmvtJpTawV37m4CxdXudpSlISVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71577'),
  ('351935094911882649', 'Those Who Walk Away', 2022, 'Horror, Drama', 'Robert Rippberger', 'Robert Rippberger, Spencer Moleda', 'Booboo Stewart, Scarlett Sperduto, Grant Morningstar, Bryson JonSteele, Devin Keaton, Nils Allen Stewart, Connor McKinley Griffin', null, 'Max and Avery go on their first date after meeting on a social media app. Their evening takes a perilous turn when they end up at a local haunted house, the home of ‘Rotcreep’, a sinister creature that rots your body and soul with one touch.', 'Max and Avery go on their first date after meeting on a social media app. Their evening takes a perilous turn when they end up at a local haunted house, the home of ‘Rotcreep’, a sinister creature that rots your body and soul with one touch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSjATBxhVo2MXrPkvhRFW99df3o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796353'),
  ('717356880817348753', 'Those Who Wish Me Dead', 2021, 'Thriller, Action', 'Dawn Swiderski, Ryan Hosking, Craig O''Brien', 'Charles Leavitt, Michael Koryta, Taylor Sheridan', 'Angelina Jolie, Finn Little, Jon Bernthal, Nicholas Hoult, Aidan Gillen, Jake Weber, Medina Senghore, Tyler Perry', 'R', 'A young boy finds himself pursued by two assassins in the Montana wilderness, with a survival expert determined to protect him, and a forest fire threatening to consume them all.', 'A young boy finds himself pursued by two assassins in the Montana wilderness, with a survival expert determined to protect him, and a forest fire threatening to consume them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCEg6KowNISWvMh8GvPSxtdf9TO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:578701'),
  ('755727278959470738', 'Those Who Work', 2018, 'Drama', 'Elena Avdija, Antoine Russbach, Denis Jutzeler', 'Emmanuel Marre, Antoine Russbach', 'Olivier Gourmet, Adèle Bochatay, Delphine Bibet, Michel Voïta, Pauline Schneider, Louka Minnella, Lalia Bron, Pierre-Isaie Duc', null, 'Frank, a man of action who worked his way up all by himself, dedicates his life to work. No matter the place or the circumstances, be it day or night, he’s on the phone, handling the cargo ships he charters for major companies. But when he has to deal with a crisis situation, Frank makes a brutal decision and gets fired. Profoundly shaken, betrayed by a system to which he gave his all, he has to progressively question himself to save the one connection that still matters to him: the bond he’s managed to maintain with his youngest daughter, Mathilde.', 'Frank, a man of action who worked his way up all by himself, dedicates his life to work. No matter the place or the circumstances, be it day or night, he’s on the phone, handling the cargo ships he charters for major companies. But when he has to deal with a crisis situation, Frank makes a brutal decision and gets fired. Profoundly shaken, betrayed by a system to which he gave his all, he has to progressively question himself to save the one connection that still matters to him: the bond he’s managed to maintain with his youngest daughter, Mathilde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tM4qXipwgHeiw8mN2JyWPBCSvk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537965'),
  ('157266518585162382', 'Those Who Worry', 1930, 'Music, Drama', 'Germaine Dulac, Marie-Anne Malleville, Jean Jouannetaud', null, 'Lilian Constantini, Georges Vallée', null, 'A destitute, drunk woman appears to yearn for the life of a streetwalker.', 'A destitute, drunk woman appears to yearn for the life of a streetwalker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRA4vkb9XgzaOp48s3YknBe4uI6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162751'),
  ('458419580422271045', 'Those Wonderful Movie Cranks', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Jiří Menzel, Dobroslav Zborník, Jaromír Šofr', 'Jiří Menzel, Oldřich Vlček', 'Rudolf Hrušínský, Vladimír Menšík, Jiří Menzel, Vlasta Fabianová, Blažena Holišová, Hana Burešová, Jaromíra Mílová, Josef Kemr', null, 'Returning home to Prague, the magician Pasparte, an owner of a circus caravan, meets his dying colleague who entrusts his beautiful daughter Aloisie to his care. In Prague they all take up their lodgings at the house At Blue Fish in which they intend to arrange the programs. The firm is owned by widow Evzenie with whom Pasparte shares flat and bed. Evzenie is jealous of Aloisie therefore Pasparte sends Aloisie as a housewife to the single man Jakub Kolenatý who earns his living by photographing and wants to record the revived pictures of Prague. Pasparte wants to found in Prague the first permanent Czech movie theatre in which there would be projected also the original Czech films.', 'Returning home to Prague, the magician Pasparte, an owner of a circus caravan, meets his dying colleague who entrusts his beautiful daughter Aloisie to his care. In Prague they all take up their lodgings at the house At Blue Fish in which they intend to arrange the programs. The firm is owned by widow Evzenie with whom Pasparte shares flat and bed. Evzenie is jealous of Aloisie therefore Pasparte sends Aloisie as a housewife to the single man Jakub Kolenatý who earns his living by photographing and wants to record the revived pictures of Prague. Pasparte wants to found in Prague the first permanent Czech movie theatre in which there would be projected also the original Czech films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbAm0OTnagkjSxRNehVdCtPaQ8G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56406'),
  ('65338130635974667', 'Thou Gild''st the Even', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Onur Ünlü', 'Onur Ünlü', 'Ali Atay, Demet Evgar, Damla Sönmez, Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Ercan Kesal, Ezgi Mola, Serkan Keskin, Nadir Sarıbacak', null, 'In a small town in Anatolia, whose inhabitants possess various supernatural powers but still have to deal with ordinary problems, Cemal helps out in his father’s barbershop and, in his free time, acts as a football referee.', 'In a small town in Anatolia, whose inhabitants possess various supernatural powers but still have to deal with ordinary problems, Cemal helps out in his father’s barbershop and, in his free time, acts as a football referee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgQkEMe7rLvwYRA7dVL9ipCYdYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193544'),
  ('802737947212585520', 'Thou Shalt Not Covet Thy Fifth Floor Neighbour', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Ramón Fernández, Giorgio Ubaldi, Hans Burmann', 'Juan José Alonso Millán', 'Alfredo Landa, Jean Sorel, Ira von Fürstenberg, Isabel Garcés, Margot Cottens, Adrián Ortega, Licia Calderón, Guadalupe Muñoz Sampedro', null, 'Pedro, a handsome gynecologist who lives in Toledo (Spain), does not have just a clientele due to the jealousy that his sex appeal causes in the husbands and boyfriends of his patients. To make matters worse, his mother still treats him like a child and the traditionalist members of his girlfriend''s family don''t look kindly upon Pedro. But on a trip to Madrid to attend a conference on medicine he meets Antón, his effeminate neighbor of the fifth floor, whose fashion boutique for women thrives thanks to the complicity he knows to establish with his customers.', 'Pedro, a handsome gynecologist who lives in Toledo (Spain), does not have just a clientele due to the jealousy that his sex appeal causes in the husbands and boyfriends of his patients. To make matters worse, his mother still treats him like a child and the traditionalist members of his girlfriend''s family don''t look kindly upon Pedro. But on a trip to Madrid to attend a conference on medicine he meets Antón, his effeminate neighbor of the fifth floor, whose fashion boutique for women thrives thanks to the complicity he knows to establish with his customers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5LMpDD5DvFXqJjhZcjkYGC6mVG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192792'),
  ('943611236939154234', 'Thou Shalt Not Hate', 2020, 'Drama', 'Mauro Mancini, Mike Stern Sterzyński', 'Davide Lisino, Mauro Mancini', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Sara Serraiocco, Luka Zunic, Lorenzo Buonora, Lorenzo Acquaviva, Gabriele Sangrigoli, Paolo Giovannucci, Cosimo Fusco', null, 'Simone Segre, a renowned surgeon of Jewish origins, lives in a city in the north-east of Italy. A quiet life, an elegant apartment and no connection with his past. One day he finds himself assisting a man victim of a hit and run accident. But when he discovers a nazi tattoo on his chest, Simone abandons him to his destiny. Filled with guilt, he ends up tracing the man’s family: Marica, the eldest daughter; Marcello, a teenager plagued with racial hate; and little Paolo. The night will come when Marica knocks at Simone’s door and unknowingly asks for payback.', 'Simone Segre, a renowned surgeon of Jewish origins, lives in a city in the north-east of Italy. A quiet life, an elegant apartment and no connection with his past. One day he finds himself assisting a man victim of a hit and run accident. But when he discovers a nazi tattoo on his chest, Simone abandons him to his destiny. Filled with guilt, he ends up tracing the man’s family: Marica, the eldest daughter; Marcello, a teenager plagued with racial hate; and little Paolo. The night will come when Marica knocks at Simone’s door and unknowingly asks for payback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agx5LdOJF3ngiumZlxTrKG7bgdC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665139'),
  ('746142344715585894', 'Thou Shalt Not Kill', 1961, 'Drama', 'Claude Autant-Lara, Jacques Natteau, Sonia Perovic', 'Jean Aurenche', 'Laurent Terzieff, Horst Frank, Suzanne Flon, Miloje ''Mića'' Orlović, Marijan Lovrić, Vladeta Dragutinović, Petar Banićević, Jovan Gec', null, 'At the end of World War II, a French pacifist is arrested for refusing to fight. In prison, he befriends a German priest arrested for murder of a French Resistance fighter. They discuss morality, obedience, and religion.', 'At the end of World War II, a French pacifist is arrested for refusing to fight. In prison, he befriends a German priest arrested for murder of a French Resistance fighter. They discuss morality, obedience, and religion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PNilgtjhHeKf17nNy1hyNcRGNH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204198'),
  ('766079193852248861', 'Thou Shalt Not Kill... Except', 1985, 'Crime, Action, Thriller, Adventure, Horror', 'Josh Becker, Josh Becker', 'Josh Becker, Scott Spiegel', 'Brian Schulz, Robert Rickman, John Manfredi, Timothy Patrick Quill, Sam Raimi, Cheryl Hausen, Perry Mallette, Ted Raimi', 'NR', 'Jack Stryker took two bullets in the leg in Vietnam and was carried back by one of his men. When he returns, he tries to live a quiet life in his cabin and go back out with his girlfriend, Sally.', 'Jack Stryker took two bullets in the leg in Vietnam and was carried back by one of his men. When he returns, he tries to live a quiet life in his cabin and go back out with his girlfriend, Sally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzkTf6IAzbIOFVJF8C95EbRpfaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40042'),
  ('331090226854169569', 'Thou-Vou Bald Agent, Operation: Havoc', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Thanasis Veggos, Dimitris Papakonstadis, Pavlos Filippou', 'Giorgos Lazaridis', 'Thanasis Veggos, Antonis Papadopoulos, Vasilis Andreopoulos, Sassa Kazeli, Zannino, Dimitri Karystinos, Kia Bozou, Kostas Mendis', null, 'Thou-Vou and his new partner, MAP31, accept three imaginary tasks from a cunning director who is only interested in filming the unsuspecting duo for his upcoming movie feature. Will the agents manage to squeeze success out of failure?', 'Thou-Vou and his new partner, MAP31, accept three imaginary tasks from a cunning director who is only interested in filming the unsuspecting duo for his upcoming movie feature. Will the agents manage to squeeze success out of failure?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0Q0nzrD9ioTSogwfS01KMcWzXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185111'),
  ('217249274955209611', 'Thoughtcrimes', 2003, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Breck Eisner, Christopher Manley', 'Thomas Dean Donnelly, Joshua Oppenheimer', 'Navi Rawat, Joe Flanigan, Peter Horton, Joe Morton, Jocelyn Seagrave, Joanne Vannicola', null, 'Freya McAllister suddenly starts hearing voices in her head on the night of her High School Prom. One night Dr Michael Welles arrives telling Freya that she isn''t crazy but that her voices are the thoughts of everyone around her. He teaches her to turn her telepathic powers into a powerful gift. What he doesn''t say is that he works for the National Security Agency...', 'Freya McAllister suddenly starts hearing voices in her head on the night of her High School Prom. One night Dr Michael Welles arrives telling Freya that she isn''t crazy but that her voices are the thoughts of everyone around her. He teaches her to turn her telepathic powers into a powerful gift. What he doesn''t say is that he works for the National Security Agency...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcVeILmiYwsEdIuxkqo5CxhvOf0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14942'),
  ('314045591526775642', 'Thousand Cuts', 2017, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Jean-François Hensgens, Eric Valette', 'Hervé Albertazzi', 'Tomer Sisley, Terence Yin Chi-Wai, Erika Sainte, Pascal Greggory, Carlos Cabra, Stéphane Debac, Cédric Ido, Jean-Jacques Lelté', null, 'Omar Petit would be able to live a perfectly happy life with his wife and daughter if it weren’t for a number of farmers from the vineyard who have decided to make life miserable for them because of where Omar comes from. One night, one of them happens to be in the middle of sabotaging their vineyard when he witnesses the murder of three South American drug smugglers. The killer, an injured biker who’s nevertheless as hard as nails, must take refuge on the Petits’ farm and takes the family hostage...', 'Omar Petit would be able to live a perfectly happy life with his wife and daughter if it weren’t for a number of farmers from the vineyard who have decided to make life miserable for them because of where Omar comes from. One night, one of them happens to be in the middle of sabotaging their vineyard when he witnesses the murder of three South American drug smugglers. The killer, an injured biker who’s nevertheless as hard as nails, must take refuge on the Petits’ farm and takes the family hostage...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bDokCTKOIirS1XnMg3qkduV0rY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432792'),
  ('1060988802866094281', 'Thousand Pieces of Gold', 1991, 'Drama, Romance, Western', 'Nancy Kelly, Gregory Jacobs, Bobby Bukowski', 'Anne Makepeace', 'Beth Broderick, Michael Paul Chan, Rosalind Chao, Chris Cooper, Dennis Dun, Will Oldham, Kim Chan, Jimmie F. Skaggs', 'PG-13', 'In 1880s China, young Lalu is sold into marriage by her impoverished father. Rather than becoming a bride, Lalu ends up in an Idaho gold-mining town, the property of a saloon owner who renames her, China Polly, and plans to sell her as entertainment for the locals. Refusing to become a whore, Lalu ultimately finds her own way in this strange country filled with white demons.', 'In 1880s China, young Lalu is sold into marriage by her impoverished father. Rather than becoming a bride, Lalu ends up in an Idaho gold-mining town, the property of a saloon owner who renames her, China Polly, and plans to sell her as entertainment for the locals. Refusing to become a whore, Lalu ultimately finds her own way in this strange country filled with white demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytF97uZbMYxo5a0geKp2d2p2y5F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123938'),
  ('1027235050709821582', 'Thousands Cheer', 1943, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'George Sidney, George J. Folsey', 'Richard Collins, Paul Jarrico', 'Kathryn Grayson, Gene Kelly, Mary Astor, John Boles, Ben Blue, Frances Rafferty, Mary Elliott, Frank Jenks', 'NR', 'Acrobat Eddie Marsh is in the army now. His first act is to become friendly with Kathryn Jones, the colonel''s pretty daughter. Their romance hits a few snags, including disapproval from her father. Eddie''s also plagued by fear of having an accident during his family''s trapeze act in the army variety show, which also features a gallery of MGM stars.', 'Acrobat Eddie Marsh is in the army now. His first act is to become friendly with Kathryn Jones, the colonel''s pretty daughter. Their romance hits a few snags, including disapproval from her father. Eddie''s also plagued by fear of having an accident during his family''s trapeze act in the army variety show, which also features a gallery of MGM stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YFjle5GLmpU7xajOVH25TH8ljU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43518'),
  ('752381199860998804', 'Thr3e', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Robby Henson', 'Alan B. McElroy', 'Marc Blucas, Justine Waddell, Bill Moseley, Priscilla Barnes, Jack Ryan, Kevin Downes, Alanna Bale, Laura Jordan', 'PG-13', 'Innocent lives hang on the whim of an elusive psychopathic murderer whose strange riddles and impossible timelines force three people into a mission to end the game before one or all of them die.', 'Innocent lives hang on the whim of an elusive psychopathic murderer whose strange riddles and impossible timelines force three people into a mission to end the game before one or all of them die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKKz1aipcivA3JFKUw6e2ygD9D6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13569'),
  ('204400551982605601', 'Thrash', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tommy Wirkola, Denson Baker, Phil Jones', 'Tommy Wirkola', 'Phoebe Dynevor, Whitney Peak, Djimon Hounsou, Gemma Dart, Alyla Browne, Amy Mathews, Elijah Ungvary, Sami Afuni', 'R', 'When a Category 5 hurricane decimates a coastal town, the storm surge brings devastation, chaos and something far more frightening: hungry sharks.', 'When a Category 5 hurricane decimates a coastal town, the storm surge brings devastation, chaos and something far more frightening: hungry sharks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adk8weka3O5648g3de4z3y4aE7G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290417'),
  ('585407149449261589', 'Thrashin''', 1986, 'Action, Drama', 'David Winters, Chuck Colwell', 'Alan Sacks, Paul Brown', 'Josh Brolin, Robert Rusler, Pamela Gidley, Brooke McCarter, Josh Richman, Brett Marx, David Wagner, Chuck McCann', 'PG-13', 'Corey and his band of skater buddies sometimes make mischief, but they''re more interested in girls and having fun on their boards than in getting into any real trouble. Notorious enemy crew the Daggers, led by Tommy Hook, get their kicks terrorizing the locals at Venice Beach. When Corey starts dating Tommy''s kid sister Chrissy, the Daggers are furious. The boys then take their beef to the "L.A. Massacre," a deadly skate race down a canyon road.', 'Corey and his band of skater buddies sometimes make mischief, but they''re more interested in girls and having fun on their boards than in getting into any real trouble. Notorious enemy crew the Daggers, led by Tommy Hook, get their kicks terrorizing the locals at Venice Beach. When Corey starts dating Tommy''s kid sister Chrissy, the Daggers are furious. The boys then take their beef to the "L.A. Massacre," a deadly skate race down a canyon road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yq7P9bqtbMGkWoikQDegyepuDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35371'),
  ('1144400083752433880', 'Thread of Lies', 2014, 'Drama', 'Lee Han, Jang Tae-hyeon', 'Lee Suk-yeon', 'Kim Hee-ae, Ko A-sung, Kim Yoo-jung, Kim Hyang-gi, Yoo Ah-in, Sung Dong-il, Chun Woo-hee, Yoo Yeon-mi', null, 'A seemingly happy family gets rocked by the suicide of the 14-year-old daughter.', 'A seemingly happy family gets rocked by the suicide of the 14-year-old daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIjjIOZJl4fc61uDjtbRRIDSIRM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257331'),
  ('193724138516233467', 'Threads - Our Tapestry of Love', 2020, 'Romance', 'Takahisa Zeze', 'Tamio Hayashi', 'Masaki Suda, Nana Komatsu, Takumi Saitoh, Nana Eikura, Mizuki Yamamoto, Mitsuko Baisho, Mahiro Takasugi, Fumika Baba', null, 'Ren Takahashi and Aoi Sonoda were both born in 1989. They met for the first time at the age of 13 and became each other''s first love, but they separated. At the age of 21, they met again. They were unable to undo their past. Now, they are 31 years old.', 'Ren Takahashi and Aoi Sonoda were both born in 1989. They met for the first time at the age of 13 and became each other''s first love, but they separated. At the age of 21, they met again. They were unable to undo their past. Now, they are 31 years old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtlQqvw2VKGE3fuxtpczL6wfUNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612511'),
  ('979936044992667359', 'Three', 1965, 'War, Drama', 'Aleksandar Petrović, Tomislav Pinter', 'Aleksandar Petrović', 'Velimir Živojinović, Ali Raner, Slobodan ''Cica'' Perović, Branislav ''Ciga'' Jerinić, Senka Veletanlić, Vojislav Mirić, Milivoje ''Mića'' Tomić, Gizela Vuković', null, 'Episodic WWII drama that follows a Yugoslav man through the war as he goes from witness to victim to aggressor.', 'Episodic WWII drama that follows a Yugoslav man through the war as he goes from witness to victim to aggressor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llAYnQ0F7gact7MozgpA6TM6DbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202768'),
