  ('140095000614659607', 'Three', 2002, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Peter Chan Ho-Sun, Nonzee Nimibutr, Christopher Doyle', 'Jojo Hui Yuet-Chun, Matt Chow Hoi-Kwong, Nitas Singhamat', 'Kim Hye-soo, Jung Bo-seog, Suwinit Panjamawat, Leon Lai Ming, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, John Shum Kin-Fun, Eugenia Yuan, Ting-Fung Li', null, 'An anthology consisting of three horror shorts from different Asian directors: Memories by Kim Jee-woon, The Wheel by Nonzee Nimibutr, and Going Home by Peter Chan.', 'An anthology consisting of three horror shorts from different Asian directors: Memories by Kim Jee-woon, The Wheel by Nonzee Nimibutr, and Going Home by Peter Chan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhi6iI4CqQwWI97GKmYdpRg4HGq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54117'),
  ('70774323560255792', 'Three', 2005, 'Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Tony Imi, Stewart Raffill, Gareth Unwin', 'Stewart Raffill', 'Billy Zane, Kelly Brook, Juan Pablo Di Pace, Todd Collins, Gabrielle Jourdan, Gary Brockette, Isabelle Constantini, Roy Rivera', 'R', 'After a yachting accident, a millionaire and his wife are shipwrecked on a desert island along with their former deckhand, Manuel.', 'After a yachting accident, a millionaire and his wife are shipwrecked on a desert island along with their former deckhand, Manuel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v45dAZ1vI4NUqcYcLUmGVXHGYFj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9753'),
  ('444051310809703385', 'Three', 2010, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Tom Tykwer, Frank Griebe', 'Tom Tykwer', 'Sophie Rois, Sebastian Schipper, Devid Striesow, Annedore Kleist, Alexander Hörbe, Winnie Böwe, Hans-Uwe Bauer, Peter Benedict', null, 'Hanna and Simon are in a 20 year marriage with an unexciting relationship. By chance, they both meet and start separate affairs with Adam. Adam has no idea that his two lovers are married, until they are all found out when Hanna becomes pregnant, with the natural doubts stemming from their situation.', 'Hanna and Simon are in a 20 year marriage with an unexciting relationship. By chance, they both meet and start separate affairs with Adam. Adam has no idea that his two lovers are married, until they are all found out when Hanna becomes pregnant, with the natural doubts stemming from their situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t21QP3eQGLmPsaCLyxiMyxpFfYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53256'),
  ('800856457540085393', 'Three', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'To Hung-Mo, Johnnie To, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Lau Ho-Leung, Mak Tin-Shu, Yau Nai-Hoi', 'Vicky Zhao, Louis Koo, Wallace Chung, Lo Hoi-Pang, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Lam Suet, Mimi Kung, Timmy Hung Tin-Ming', null, 'Realising that he will be defeated in no time during a police showdown, a thug shoots himself to force the cops to cease fire and take him to the hospital. In the hospital, he claims human rights to refuse immediate treatment in order to buy time for his underlings to rescue him. The detective in charge sees through his scheme but decides to play along so as to capture his whole gang once and for all.', 'Realising that he will be defeated in no time during a police showdown, a thug shoots himself to force the cops to cease fire and take him to the hospital. In the hospital, he claims human rights to refuse immediate treatment in order to buy time for his underlings to rescue him. The detective in charge sees through his scheme but decides to play along so as to capture his whole gang once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cncPvHcSLCxMqUiQ31kqEk0n10i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373922'),
  ('526052897963097229', 'Three Ages', 1923, 'Comedy', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline, Robert Ives', 'Jean C. Havez, Joseph A. Mitchell, Clyde Bruckman', 'Buster Keaton, Margaret Leahy, Wallace Beery, Joe Roberts, Lillian Lawrence, Kewpie Morgan, Lionel Belmore, George Davis', null, 'The rituals of courtship, romantic rivalry, and love play out three times as a man vies with a villain for the girl. In the Stone Age, the rivalry is set off by dinosaurs, a turtle used as a ouija board, and a round of golf with stones. In ancient Rome, the men display their brawn through a chariot race, using dogs instead of horses. In contemporary times, the man finds himself overcome by modernity, including a very fragile car.', 'The rituals of courtship, romantic rivalry, and love play out three times as a man vies with a villain for the girl. In the Stone Age, the rivalry is set off by dinosaurs, a turtle used as a ouija board, and a round of golf with stones. In ancient Rome, the men display their brawn through a chariot race, using dogs instead of horses. In contemporary times, the man finds himself overcome by modernity, including a very fragile car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khadgoKp9eLBY4t0KcST5gzddk3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32628'),
  ('911090654245283520', 'Three and Out', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jonathan Gershfield, Richard Greatrex, Jo Lea', 'Steve Lewis, Tony Owen', 'Mackenzie Crook, Colm Meaney, Gemma Arterton, Imelda Staunton, Antony Sher, Gary Lewis, Annette Badland, Mark Benton', 'R', 'A London tube driver considers pursuing a third fatal accident to collect a huge payout.', 'A London tube driver considers pursuing a third fatal accident to collect a huge payout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXpNfBlpfKapNg9i5fgtHPabABX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14921'),
  ('1032104078534075636', 'Three Bedrooms, One Corpse: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery', 2016, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Crime, Drama', 'Dave T. Nall, Mandi Egilsson, Jason Sober', 'Teena Booth', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Lexa Doig, Marilu Henner, Peter Benson, Yannick Bisson, Miranda Frigon, Bruce Dawson, Nicole Oliver', 'PG', 'While Aurora "Roe" Teagarden searches for her piece of the American dream, she decides to test the waters of the family business - real estate sales. Only thing is there''s a dead body in the first house she shows. When a second body shows up in another home, Roe realizes there''s more to real estate than she thought.', 'While Aurora "Roe" Teagarden searches for her piece of the American dream, she decides to test the waters of the family business - real estate sales. Only thing is there''s a dead body in the first house she shows. When a second body shows up in another home, Roe realizes there''s more to real estate than she thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRkZigA3uI3iqlTo1E024doHOps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393737'),
  ('855256700310626744', 'Three Bewildered People in the Night', 1987, 'Drama', 'Gregg Araki, Gregg Araki', 'Gregg Araki', 'Mark Howell, John Lacques, Darcy Marta, Garrett Cassell', null, 'David, Craig and Alicia are a triangle of young lovers who find angst and despair as they sort out their feelings and sexuality in a late-night coffee shop.', 'David, Craig and Alicia are a triangle of young lovers who find angst and despair as they sort out their feelings and sexuality in a late-night coffee shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kb7CQQyIs7Z3b6zklH47WAs3CT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200998'),
  ('683442686106860289', 'Three Billboards Outside Ebbing, Missouri', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Martin McDonagh, Ben Davis, Peter Kohn', 'Martin McDonagh', 'Frances McDormand, Woody Harrelson, Sam Rockwell, Abbie Cornish, Lucas Hedges, Željko Ivanek, Caleb Landry Jones, Clarke Peters', 'R', 'After seven months have passed without a culprit in her daughter''s murder case, Mildred Hayes makes a bold move, painting three signs leading into her town with a controversial message directed at Bill Willoughby, the town''s revered chief of police. When his second-in-command Officer Jason Dixon, an immature mother''s boy with a penchant for violence, gets involved, the battle between Mildred and Ebbing''s law enforcement is only exacerbated.', 'After seven months have passed without a culprit in her daughter''s murder case, Mildred Hayes makes a bold move, painting three signs leading into her town with a controversial message directed at Bill Willoughby, the town''s revered chief of police. When his second-in-command Officer Jason Dixon, an immature mother''s boy with a penchant for violence, gets involved, the battle between Mildred and Ebbing''s law enforcement is only exacerbated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRYLt8fV82tdVoDppSFTZIcJiLN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359940'),
  ('968994424340643122', 'Three Blind Mice', 2003, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Mathias Ledoux, Humphrey Bangham, Stéphane Le Parc', 'Mikael Ollivier', 'Edward Furlong, Emilia Fox, Elsa Zylberstein, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Sara Stewart, Peter Wight, Gary Connery, Valérie Decobert-Koretzky', null, 'Thomas is a talented computer programmer living in a vibrant, urban metropolis. Lonely and unsure about life, he finds solitude in the world of internet chat rooms, webcam sites and virtual communication. One evening, Thomas witnesses the brutal murder of a webcam friend and in a vain attempt to protect her he becomes the prime suspect in the homicide. Determined to prove his innocence, Thomas teams up with Claire, a specialist in internet crimes to uncover the truth. To expose the murderer, Claire and Thomas decide to set up their own webcam site using Claire as the cyber bait. Somewhere down the line the truth becomes blurred and Thomas no longer knows where to turn or who to trust. As his life starts to spiral out of control, he has to face the terrifying reality that he could be the next victim.........the virtual nightmare has only just begun.', 'Thomas is a talented computer programmer living in a vibrant, urban metropolis. Lonely and unsure about life, he finds solitude in the world of internet chat rooms, webcam sites and virtual communication. One evening, Thomas witnesses the brutal murder of a webcam friend and in a vain attempt to protect her he becomes the prime suspect in the homicide. Determined to prove his innocence, Thomas teams up with Claire, a specialist in internet crimes to uncover the truth. To expose the murderer, Claire and Thomas decide to set up their own webcam site using Claire as the cyber bait. Somewhere down the line the truth becomes blurred and Thomas no longer knows where to turn or who to trust. As his life starts to spiral out of control, he has to face the terrifying reality that he could be the next victim.........the virtual nightmare has only just begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSOPRKn9eqMIlU222NX5WNmJDeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49481'),
  ('986504395070134648', 'Three Blind Mouseketeers', 1936, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Jack Cutting, David Hand', 'Webb Smith', 'Billy Bletcher, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'As the title implies, the three blind mice are musketeers. The cat sets a number of traps for them, which they all evade (apparently without realizing it) while he sleeps. The cat eventually wakes up and begins chasing them unsuccessfully, thanks to their teamwork.', 'As the title implies, the three blind mice are musketeers. The cat sets a number of traps for them, which they all evade (apparently without realizing it) while he sleeps. The cat eventually wakes up and begins chasing them unsuccessfully, thanks to their teamwork.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqh31E3VVFUVRZiUdoxajWj57qT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67609'),
  ('317611441434897180', 'Three Brothers', 1981, 'Drama', 'Francesco Rosi, Pasqualino De Santis, Gianni Arduini', 'Tonino Guerra, Francesco Rosi', 'Philippe Noiret, Michele Placido, Vittorio Mezzogiorno, Andréa Ferréol, Maddalena Crippa, Rosaria Tafuri, Marta Zoffoli, Tino Schirinzi', null, 'In a farmhouse in southern Italy, an old woman dies. Her husband summons their sons: from Rome, Raffaele, a judge facing a political case for which he risks assassination; from Naples, the religious and ideological Rocco, a counselor at a correctional institute for boys; from Turin, Nicola, a factory worker involved in labor disputes. Once home, each encounters the past and engages in reveries of what may come.', 'In a farmhouse in southern Italy, an old woman dies. Her husband summons their sons: from Rome, Raffaele, a judge facing a political case for which he risks assassination; from Naples, the religious and ideological Rocco, a counselor at a correctional institute for boys; from Turin, Nicola, a factory worker involved in labor disputes. Once home, each encounters the past and engages in reveries of what may come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sSuFTKNvno73Gn1CII5PuAgTWU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42150'),
  ('879142554639236774', 'Three Came Home', 1950, 'War, Drama', 'Jean Negulesco, Milton Krasner, Saul Wurtzel', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Claudette Colbert, Patric Knowles, Florence Desmond, Sessue Hayakawa, Sylvia Andrew, Mark Keuning, Phyllis Morris, Howard Chuman', 'NR', 'Borneo, 1941, during World War II. When the Japanese occupy the island, American writer Agnes Newton Keith is separated from her husband and imprisoned with her son in a prison camp run by the enigmatic Colonel Suga.', 'Borneo, 1941, during World War II. When the Japanese occupy the island, American writer Agnes Newton Keith is separated from her husband and imprisoned with her son in a prison camp run by the enigmatic Colonel Suga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZczNjqrzjYiyuzhuKyPEcDwul2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96255'),
  ('635362813749431966', 'Three Cases of Murder', 1955, 'Mystery, Horror', 'David Eady, George More O''Ferrall, Wendy Toye', 'Ian Dalrymple, Sidney Carroll, Donald B. Wilson', 'Orson Welles, John Gregson, Elizabeth Sellars, Emrys Jones, Alan Badel, André Morell, Hugh Pryse, Leueen MacGrath', null, 'An atmospheric British omnibus film presenting three tales of murder and the supernatural. In “In the Picture,” a museum attendant is drawn into the eerie world within a painting. In “You Killed Elizabeth,” two lifelong friends become suspects when the woman they both love is murdered. In “Lord Mountdrago,” a disgraced politician seeks revenge on a powerful statesman by exploiting his dreams. Linked by a recurring figure, the film blends psychological horror, mystery, and fantasy across its three interconnected stories.', 'An atmospheric British omnibus film presenting three tales of murder and the supernatural. In “In the Picture,” a museum attendant is drawn into the eerie world within a painting. In “You Killed Elizabeth,” two lifelong friends become suspects when the woman they both love is murdered. In “Lord Mountdrago,” a disgraced politician seeks revenge on a powerful statesman by exploiting his dreams. Linked by a recurring figure, the film blends psychological horror, mystery, and fantasy across its three interconnected stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4XHdfPCG21hpRohwdh6vhjr7iM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45577'),
  ('723603037526980408', 'Three Cheers for the Whale', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Chris Marker, Mario Ruspoli, Germaine Chiaselotti', 'Chris Marker', 'Casamayor, Valérie Mayoux, Lalan', null, 'Co-directed by Chris Marker and Mario Ruspoli, Three Cheers for the Whale traces humanity’s complex relationship with whales—from reverence to exploitation—culminating in a stark depiction of industrial whaling. Combining archival imagery, commentary, and documentary footage, the film offers both a historical reflection and a call for ecological awareness.', 'Co-directed by Chris Marker and Mario Ruspoli, Three Cheers for the Whale traces humanity’s complex relationship with whales—from reverence to exploitation—culminating in a stark depiction of industrial whaling. Combining archival imagery, commentary, and documentary footage, the film offers both a historical reflection and a call for ecological awareness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtGvUrgGZmMPlSqcEHw6VKWDNKb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270008'),
  ('437711467695346163', 'Three Christs', 2017, 'Drama', 'Denis Lenoir, Jon Avnet', 'Jon Avnet, Eric Nazarian', 'Richard Gere, Peter Dinklage, Walton Goggins, Bradley Whitford, Charlotte Hope, Julianna Margulies, Kevin Pollak, James Monroe Iglehart', 'R', 'Dr. Alan Stone breaks new ground for treatment of the mentally ill through an experiment on three paranoid schizophrenic patients who believe they are Jesus Christ.', 'Dr. Alan Stone breaks new ground for treatment of the mentally ill through an experiment on three paranoid schizophrenic patients who believe they are Jesus Christ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FuSQ9klymXIppnfNUTBg9rOEPf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418533'),
  ('157361133501113396', 'Three Coins in the Fountain', 1954, 'Drama, Romance', 'Milton Krasner, Jean Negulesco', 'John Patrick', 'Clifton Webb, Dorothy McGuire, Jean Peters, Louis Jourdan, Maggie McNamara, Rossano Brazzi, Howard St. John, Kathryn Givney', 'G', 'Three American roommates working in Italy wish for the man of their dreams after throwing coins into Rome''s magnificent Trevi Fountain. Frances, a secretary at a government agency, sets out to win the heart of her smooth-talking novelist employer; Anita, her coworker, defies office regulations by romancing an Italian who works at the agency; and office newcomer Maria meets a real Italian Prince Charming and falls madly in love. The only thing the three hopeful ladies need to do is seal their fate.', 'Three American roommates working in Italy wish for the man of their dreams after throwing coins into Rome''s magnificent Trevi Fountain. Frances, a secretary at a government agency, sets out to win the heart of her smooth-talking novelist employer; Anita, her coworker, defies office regulations by romancing an Italian who works at the agency; and office newcomer Maria meets a real Italian Prince Charming and falls madly in love. The only thing the three hopeful ladies need to do is seal their fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3y6aNrQd8K2bQjI2gRpmmDJGr99.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41503'),
  ('3612021156718243', 'Three Colors: White', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Edward Kłosiński, Stan Latek', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Krzysztof Piesiewicz', 'Zbigniew Zamachowski, Julie Delpy, Janusz Gajos, Jerzy Stuhr, Grzegorz Warchoł, Jerzy Nowak, Aleksander Bardini, Cezary Harasimowicz', 'R', 'Polish immigrant Karol Karol finds himself out of a marriage, a job and a country when his French wife, Dominique, divorces him after six months due to his impotence. Forced to leave France after losing the business they jointly owned, Karol enlists fellow Polish expatriate Mikołaj to smuggle him back to their homeland.', 'Polish immigrant Karol Karol finds himself out of a marriage, a job and a country when his French wife, Dominique, divorces him after six months due to his impotence. Forced to leave France after losing the business they jointly owned, Karol enlists fellow Polish expatriate Mikołaj to smuggle him back to their homeland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdIet3NSa27gobMbaUml66oCQNT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109'),
  ('775602889058682473', 'Three Comrades', 1938, 'Drama, Romance', 'Frank Borzage, Karl Freund, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'F. Scott Fitzgerald, Edward E. Paramore Jr.', 'Robert Taylor, Margaret Sullavan, Franchot Tone, Robert Young, Guy Kibbee, Lionel Atwill, Henry Hull, Charley Grapewin', 'NR', 'A love story centered on the lives of three young German soldiers in the years following World War I. Their close friendship is strengthened by their shared love for the same woman who is dying of tuberculosis.', 'A love story centered on the lives of three young German soldiers in the years following World War I. Their close friendship is strengthened by their shared love for the same woman who is dying of tuberculosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTLmTBNa2UesT8Sa3cYEE6P8qJd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109970'),
  ('520183622864957391', 'Three Crazy Jerks', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Franz Josef Gottlieb, Klaus Werner', 'Thomas Gottschalk', 'Thomas Gottschalk, Helmut Fischer, Michael Winslow, Dey Young, Pierre Brice, Ottfried Fischer, Ludwig Haas, Jean-Marie Pfaff', null, 'Ricky, Walter and Edmund, 3 not very successful and chaotic Daydreamer, meet after all of them get fired from the set of the new Winnetou production. On their way to the next town they meet Rosi and all 3 of them fall immediately in love with her. After an intimate party with just the four of them Rosi finds out that she''s pregnant and every one of them could be the father. Till they can be sure who the father is the three of them try to help Rosa out in any way they can and to get the necessary money for the baby, the three of them will try anything, regardless how chaotic the outcome will be.', 'Ricky, Walter and Edmund, 3 not very successful and chaotic Daydreamer, meet after all of them get fired from the set of the new Winnetou production. On their way to the next town they meet Rosi and all 3 of them fall immediately in love with her. After an intimate party with just the four of them Rosi finds out that she''s pregnant and every one of them could be the father. Till they can be sure who the father is the three of them try to help Rosa out in any way they can and to get the necessary money for the baby, the three of them will try anything, regardless how chaotic the outcome will be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0lr6083nv4P5icwHGXmp5Mwv01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4813'),
  ('940101174651402877', 'Three Crazy Jerks II', 1988, 'Romance, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Holm Dressler, Atze Glanert', 'Thomas Gottschalk', 'Thomas Gottschalk, Helmut Fischer, Michael Winslow, Deborah Shelton, Georg Marischka, Janis Kiriakidis, Margit Geissler, David Hasselhoff', null, 'In 2043, Frank and Xaver have only one big problem with their jobs at a patent office, their boss Dr. Kneitz who''s mission it is to make their life miserable. But then an unique opportunity presents itself when an inventor shows up to patent a time machine and they come up with a plan to travel back in time to stop the conceiving of their boss. Accidently Ronny, a night watchman, happens to be in the room with them when they use the time machine and so, in part unwillingly, the 3 of them travel to the year 1988 in Gran Canaria and they only have a couple of days to stop every interaction with potential fathers for the mother to be.', 'In 2043, Frank and Xaver have only one big problem with their jobs at a patent office, their boss Dr. Kneitz who''s mission it is to make their life miserable. But then an unique opportunity presents itself when an inventor shows up to patent a time machine and they come up with a plan to travel back in time to stop the conceiving of their boss. Accidently Ronny, a night watchman, happens to be in the room with them when they use the time machine and so, in part unwillingly, the 3 of them travel to the year 1988 in Gran Canaria and they only have a couple of days to stop every interaction with potential fathers for the mother to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZKNrjy8VpD1zZetaJVbZMX2SnE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4814'),
  ('968267352755253218', 'Three Crowns of the Sailor', 1991, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'François Ede, Raúl Ruiz, Sacha Vierny', 'Raúl Ruiz', 'Jean-Bernard Guillard, Philippe Deplanche, Nadège Clair, Lisa Lyon, Jean Badin, Pauline Brunet, José de Carvalho, Claude Dereppe', null, 'Shortly after murdering his professor, a young man encounters a sailor who offers him a position on his ship in exchange for 3 Danish crowns and his attention as he recounts his life story.', 'Shortly after murdering his professor, a young man encounters a sailor who offers him a position on his ship in exchange for 3 Danish crowns and his attention as he recounts his life story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJNAPehs3uz1dkVmzALNhqZC3NM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64441'),
  ('130514758192001246', 'Three Dancing Slaves', 2004, 'Drama', 'Jean-Max Bernard, Gaël Morel', 'Christophe Honoré, Gaël Morel', 'Nicolas Cazalé, Stéphane Rideau, Thomas Dumerchez, Salim Kéchiouche, Bruno Lochet, Vincent Martinez, Olivier Perez, Jackie Berroyer', 'NR', 'Annecy is no tourist destination for three working-class Algerian brothers and their father, in the months after their mother has died. Marc is deeply troubled: he tries to stiff drug dealers and then plots revenge. Christophe is released from jail, lands a job, and must overcome various temptations in order to keep it. Olivier, nearing 18, may be falling in love with Hicham...', 'Annecy is no tourist destination for three working-class Algerian brothers and their father, in the months after their mother has died. Marc is deeply troubled: he tries to stiff drug dealers and then plots revenge. Christophe is released from jail, lands a job, and must overcome various temptations in order to keep it. Olivier, nearing 18, may be falling in love with Hicham...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiuZvPhIrtAkwB4SR5y1YQNmH1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36423'),
  ('192623037155336945', 'Three Daughters', 1961, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Satyajit Ray, Durgadas Mitra, Nityananda Datta', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Anil Chatterjee, Chandana Banerjee, Nripati Chatterjee, Khagen Pathak, Gopay Roy, Kali Bannerjee, Kanika Majumdar, Kumar Roy', null, 'Three stories with three central female characters linking the stories together. The first one concerns an orphan girl who grows attached to the postmaster she is caring for after he teaches her to read and write. The second one is a supernatural tale about a woman obsessed with the jewels her husband buys for her. The final one follows a young man who falls for an unconventional girl from his new village instead of his arranged bride, the daughter of a respectable family.', 'Three stories with three central female characters linking the stories together. The first one concerns an orphan girl who grows attached to the postmaster she is caring for after he teaches her to read and write. The second one is a supernatural tale about a woman obsessed with the jewels her husband buys for her. The final one follows a young man who falls for an unconventional girl from his new village instead of his arranged bride, the daughter of a respectable family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLGz80EeHTI5WC0lq9wfYT2FfgU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43027'),
  ('816910360626284901', 'Three Days', 1992, 'Drama', 'Šarūnas Bartas, Vladas Naudžius', 'Šarūnas Bartas', 'Yekaterina Golubeva, Rimma Latypova, Arūnas Sakalauskas, Audrius Stonys', null, 'Two young men leave a neglected but cozy native nook for a strange seaport town Kenigsberg. There they meet two girls the outsiders like themselves. Any attempt to find a normal human contact leads to misunderstanding. Or perhaps they are also lonely and unhappy. The realities, provoking a forced individualism melt in the atmosphere of the town, on which there lies a seal of historical and human cataclysms.', 'Two young men leave a neglected but cozy native nook for a strange seaport town Kenigsberg. There they meet two girls the outsiders like themselves. Any attempt to find a normal human contact leads to misunderstanding. Or perhaps they are also lonely and unhappy. The realities, provoking a forced individualism melt in the atmosphere of the town, on which there lies a seal of historical and human cataclysms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6JDSNcsTccSFqROVLJV5Px1XQt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88860'),
  ('403354771410859196', 'Three Days', 2001, 'Family, Fantasy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Michael Switzer, Eric Van Haren Noman', 'Robert Tate Miller, Eric Tuchman', 'Kristin Davis, Reed Diamond, Tim Meadows, Danielle Brett, Alexa Gilmour, Andrew Bush', null, 'Ten years ago, Andrew married his childhood sweetheart, Beth. Now Andrew''s a high-powered literary agent, but his relationship with his wife has not fared as well. When Beth is tragically killed just days before Christmas, an angel gives Andrew the chance to relive the last three days his wife was alive. But he can''t change fate and Beth will still lose her life. However, Andrew can still discover the gift Beth needs most from him.', 'Ten years ago, Andrew married his childhood sweetheart, Beth. Now Andrew''s a high-powered literary agent, but his relationship with his wife has not fared as well. When Beth is tragically killed just days before Christmas, an angel gives Andrew the chance to relive the last three days his wife was alive. But he can''t change fate and Beth will still lose her life. However, Andrew can still discover the gift Beth needs most from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAxVMBz3mueFJqbxISwJ7ejN5u6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63809'),
  ('383489234816012025', 'Three Days and a Life', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Manuel Dacosse, Thomas Tréfouel, Nicolas Boukhrief', 'Perrine Margaine, Pierre Lemaitre', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Charles Berling, Pablo Pauly, Margot Bancilhon, Philippe Torreton, Dimitri Storoge, Jérémie Senez, Yoann Blanc', null, 'Christmas 1999, in a peaceful little village in the Ardennes. The life of a young boy named Antoine will soon be devastated by three tragic events : the death of a dog, the vanishing of a child, and a big ravaging storm.', 'Christmas 1999, in a peaceful little village in the Ardennes. The life of a young boy named Antoine will soon be devastated by three tragic events : the death of a dog, the vanishing of a child, and a big ravaging storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdBLfn0oTOa56828eTMaXnhOZSx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617986'),
  ('94745336088892855', 'Three Days of the Condor', 1975, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Owen Roizman, Sydney Pollack, Michael Haley', 'Lorenzo Semple Jr., David Rayfiel', 'Robert Redford, Faye Dunaway, Cliff Robertson, Max von Sydow, John Houseman, Addison Powell, Walter McGinn, Tina Chen', 'R', 'When bookish CIA researcher Joe Turner finds all his co-workers dead, he, together with a woman he has kidnapped, must work together to outwit those responsible until he determines who he can really trust.', 'When bookish CIA researcher Joe Turner finds all his co-workers dead, he, together with a woman he has kidnapped, must work together to outwit those responsible until he determines who he can really trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zinwtZqdb7gnc4zMu8dfkK1fMN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11963'),
  ('306362544842995624', 'Three Days to Live', 1958, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Gilles Grangier, Jacques Deray, Armand Thirard', 'Guy Bertret, Gilles Grangier, Michel Audiard', 'Daniel Gélin, Jeanne Moreau, Lino Ventura, Georges Flamant, Albert Augier, Aimé Clariond, Roland Armontel, Moustache', null, 'Struggling actor Simon witnesses a murder; he didn''t see the killer, but that doesn''t stop him from claiming that he did in order to get his name into the papers. Sure enough, the murderer targets him as his next victim. Our hero is temporarily rescued by Jeanne, a fellow aspiring actress who has always had a crush on him.', 'Struggling actor Simon witnesses a murder; he didn''t see the killer, but that doesn''t stop him from claiming that he did in order to get his name into the papers. Sure enough, the murderer targets him as his next victim. Our hero is temporarily rescued by Jeanne, a fellow aspiring actress who has always had a crush on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEMmZLqADVE0q9EVO2F7luHaA2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87832'),
  ('925612699735543819', 'Three Faces West', 1940, 'Drama, Romance, Western', 'Bernard Vorhaus, John Alton, Kenneth Holmes', 'F. Hugh Herbert, Joseph Moncure March, Samuel Ornitz', 'John Wayne, Sigrid Gurie, Charles Coburn, Spencer Charters, Helen MacKellar, Roland Varno, Sonny Bupp, Wade Boteler', 'NR', 'Viennese surgeon Dr. Braun and his daughter Leni come to a small town in North Dakota as refugees from Hitler. When the winds of the Dust Bowl threaten the town, John Phillips leads the townsfolk in moving to greener pastures in Oregon. He falls for Leni, but she is betrothed to the man who helped her and her father escape from the Third Reich. She must decide between the two men.', 'Viennese surgeon Dr. Braun and his daughter Leni come to a small town in North Dakota as refugees from Hitler. When the winds of the Dust Bowl threaten the town, John Phillips leads the townsfolk in moving to greener pastures in Oregon. He falls for Leni, but she is betrothed to the man who helped her and her father escape from the Third Reich. She must decide between the two men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiBzU5yB4zOAA0bvclPM4xZJOu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40717'),
  ('239923156490227934', 'Three Fat Men', 1966, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Aleksey Batalov, Iosif Shapiro, Suren Shakhbazyan', 'Mikhail Olshevsky, Aleksey Batalov', 'Lina Braknyte, Pyotr Artemyev, Aleksey Batalov, Valentin Nikulin, Rina Zelyonaya, Roman Filippov, Sergey Kulagin, Yevgeni Morgunov', null, 'Based on a famous fairytale by Yuri Olesha. A fairy tale film about the clever tightrope walker Tibule, who fights alongside the armorer Prospero and all the working people against the tyrants, the three Fat Men, who rule the state until the young heir Tutti comes of age. The freedom fighters are aided by the kind Dr. Gaspar and the brave acrobat girl Suok, who has to pretend to be a doll to sneak into the palace and free Prospero.', 'Based on a famous fairytale by Yuri Olesha. A fairy tale film about the clever tightrope walker Tibule, who fights alongside the armorer Prospero and all the working people against the tyrants, the three Fat Men, who rule the state until the young heir Tutti comes of age. The freedom fighters are aided by the kind Dr. Gaspar and the brave acrobat girl Suok, who has to pretend to be a doll to sneak into the palace and free Prospero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hmlqSuhYAG3MQLP2rU3FhRt6Sa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64759'),
  ('1027310295830911247', 'Three Floors', 2021, 'Drama', 'Michele D''Attanasio, Ciro Scognamiglio, Natalia Fago', 'Nanni Moretti, Federica Pontremoli, Valia Santella', 'Margherita Buy, Riccardo Scamarcio, Alba Rohrwacher, Adriano Giannini, Elena Lietti, Alessandro Sperduti, Denise Tantucci, Nanni Moretti', null, 'Follows the lives of three families who live in a three-story building in a Roman neighbourhood.', 'Follows the lives of three families who live in a three-story building in a Roman neighbourhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59kVQe8wrHp845gBR9TDHzNwfeQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608980'),
  ('91752789832139694', 'Three for Breakfast', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, James MacDonald, Dessie Flynn', 'NR', 'Donald Duck gets into a lot of trouble while he''s cooking pancakes for breakfast - Chip and Dale are up to their mischief. Donald tries a number of plans to get rid of them, but they repeatedly foil Donald''s plans.', 'Donald Duck gets into a lot of trouble while he''s cooking pancakes for breakfast - Chip and Dale are up to their mischief. Donald tries a number of plans to get rid of them, but they repeatedly foil Donald''s plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0M5fvFSxcBGyoW2PA9X7GXiLVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92164'),
  ('552282175717490175', 'Three for the Road', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stephen L. Posey, Bill L. Norton', 'Richard Martini, Miguel Tejada-Flores, Tim Metcalfe', 'Charlie Sheen, Kerri Green, Alan Ruck, Sally Kellerman, Bert Remsen, James Avery, Raymond J. Barry, Elizabeth Gracen', 'PG', 'A crafty political aide and his soft-spoken pal are assigned the job of delivering a senator''s out-of-control teenage daughter to an institution.', 'A crafty political aide and his soft-spoken pal are assigned the job of delivering a senator''s out-of-control teenage daughter to an institution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nimPeNINKgYaUtiXv7veOzoPiYL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116064'),
  ('24740784350438219', 'Three Friends', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Memduh Ün', 'Memduh Ün, Aydın Arakon, Metin Erksan', 'Muhterem Nur, Fikret Hakan, Salih Tozan, Semih Sezerli, Mehmet Ali Akpınar, Faal Evgin, Hüseyin Güler, Selahattin Yazgan', null, 'Three men live in an abandoned building and try to eke out a living by pooling their meagre resources. They come upon a lonely blind girl one night, befriend her, and take her in as their guest, pretending they are rich. They learn that 800 lira will cure her blindness. One of the three decides to get the money by any means necessary, because he has fallen in love with her.', 'Three men live in an abandoned building and try to eke out a living by pooling their meagre resources. They come upon a lonely blind girl one night, befriend her, and take her in as their guest, pretending they are rich. They learn that 800 lira will cure her blindness. One of the three decides to get the money by any means necessary, because he has fallen in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ir11rgInVC1QN36J9vDiBsrMw1U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270555'),
  ('834524874496591381', 'Three Friends', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Laurent Desmet, Juliette Maillard, Constance Demontoy', 'Emmanuel Mouret, Carmen Leroi', 'India Hair, Camille Cottin, Sara Forestier, Damien Bonnard, Grégoire Ludig, Vincent Macaigne, Éric Caravaca, Mathieu Métral', null, 'Joan is no longer in love with Victor, but it pains her to feel she is being dishonest with him. Alice, her best friend, reassures her: She herself doesn’t feel passionate about her partner Eric and yet their relationship is smooth sailing. She has no idea he is having an affair with Rebecca, their mutual friend. When Joan finally decides to leave Victor and he disappears, the lives of the three friends and their relationships are turned upside down.', 'Joan is no longer in love with Victor, but it pains her to feel she is being dishonest with him. Alice, her best friend, reassures her: She herself doesn’t feel passionate about her partner Eric and yet their relationship is smooth sailing. She has no idea he is having an affair with Rebecca, their mutual friend. When Joan finally decides to leave Victor and he disappears, the lives of the three friends and their relationships are turned upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2mk1ElcP9xBhd4QHtUvXYMH8qs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1137245'),
  ('346921145774598003', 'Three from Prostokvashino', 1978, 'Animation', 'Vladimir Popov, Kabul Rasulov, Boris Filchikov', 'Eduard Uspensky', 'Mariya Vinogradova, Oleg Tabakov, Lev Durov, Valentina Talyzina, Boris Novikov, German Kachin, Zinaida Naryshkina', null, 'Little Fedor brings a cat to home despite his mother''s distaste for cats. He runs away with his talking cat, to make more friends on the way.', 'Little Fedor brings a cat to home despite his mother''s distaste for cats. He runs away with his talking cat, to make more friends on the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wA46TGkU7lz7QvkiemrwvpN0A29.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77294'),
  ('1018432788572870095', 'Three Fugitives', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Francis Veber, Haskell Wexler, Princess O''Mahoney', 'Francis Veber', 'Nick Nolte, Martin Short, Sarah Rowland Doroff, James Earl Jones, Alan Ruck, Kenneth McMillan, David Arnott, Bruce McGill', 'PG-13', 'On his first day after being released from jail for 14 armed bank robberies, Lucas finds himself caught up in someone else''s robbery. Perry has decided to hold up the local bank to raise money so that he can keep his daughter, Meg, and get her the treatment she needs. Dugan, a detective, assumes Lucas helped plan the robbery, and hence Lucas, Perry and Meg become three fugitives.', 'On his first day after being released from jail for 14 armed bank robberies, Lucas finds himself caught up in someone else''s robbery. Perry has decided to hold up the local bank to raise money so that he can keep his daughter, Meg, and get her the treatment she needs. Dugan, a detective, assumes Lucas helped plan the robbery, and hence Lucas, Perry and Meg become three fugitives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUNgtb0LEkRcHGanKHO0B3JWsw9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31608'),
  ('874645201713110326', 'Three Giant Men', 1973, 'Action', 'Orhan Kapkı, Tevfik Fikret Uçak, Mehmet Özdemir', 'Doğan Tamer, Aytekin Akkaya', 'Aytekin Akkaya, Tevfik Şen, İsmail Yavuz Selekman, Deniz Erkanat, Mine Sun, Altan Günbay, Ersun Kazançel, Hasan Ceylan', null, 'Istanbul is being terrorized by a crime wave, and the police call in American superhero Captain America and Mexican wrestler Santo to put a stop to it.', 'Istanbul is being terrorized by a crime wave, and the police call in American superhero Captain America and Mexican wrestler Santo to put a stop to it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAwzuwe5BGglw4WEdSViSKx02wZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58447'),
  ('364024165425600202', 'Three Girls from Rome', 1952, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Luciano Emmer, Francesco Maselli, Virgilio Sabel', 'Fausto Tozzi, Karin Valde', 'Lucia Bosè, Cosetta Greco, Liliana Bonfatti, Ave Ninchi, Renato Salvatori, Marcello Mastroianni, Eduardo De Filippo, Leda Gloria', null, 'Three gorgeous seamstresses meet on the historic steps of the Piazza de Spagna in Rome to discuss one another''s love lives.', 'Three gorgeous seamstresses meet on the historic steps of the Piazza de Spagna in Rome to discuss one another''s love lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4NyFjfoW5NKZw7XUksHXRgRsxa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56437'),
  ('1142851126950307701', 'Three Godfathers', 1936, 'Action, Drama, Western', 'Richard Boleslawski, Joseph Ruttenberg, Dolph Zimmer', 'Ainsworth Morgan, Joseph L. Mankiewicz', 'Chester Morris, Lewis Stone, Walter Brennan, Irene Hervey, Sidney Toler, Dorothy Tree, Roger Imhof, Willard Robertson', 'NR', 'In a town called New Jerusalem, three bandits hold up a bank. After a gun battle with the townspeople, the three robbers retreat into the scorching Arizona desert. There, they happen upon an ill woman stranded with her child. As the mother dies, she begs the men to take care of her infant. The fugitives want to save the baby -- but to do so, they''ll have to travel back to New Jerusalem, where they are wanted men. Remade as 3 Godfathers (1949).', 'In a town called New Jerusalem, three bandits hold up a bank. After a gun battle with the townspeople, the three robbers retreat into the scorching Arizona desert. There, they happen upon an ill woman stranded with her child. As the mother dies, she begs the men to take care of her infant. The fugitives want to save the baby -- but to do so, they''ll have to travel back to New Jerusalem, where they are wanted men. Remade as 3 Godfathers (1949).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wz1YPPbZVLV1OJJfh5a3oTJtdW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149955'),
  ('109015090422008731', 'Three Goodbyes', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Isabel Coixet, Guido Michelotti, Mariafrancesca Melara', 'Enrico Audenino, Isabel Coixet', 'Alba Rohrwacher, Elio Germano, Francesco Carril, Silvia D''Amico, Sarita Choudhury, Pietro Sparvoli, Matteo Carlomagno, Giuseppe Pestillo', null, 'Follows a couple, Marta and Antonio, who split up after what seems like an trivial argument.', 'Follows a couple, Marta and Antonio, who split up after what seems like an trivial argument.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ciJmoQ2OY9IJvEFSqr2xc5sWn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1433339'),
  ('99352445312152310', 'Three Guys Named Mike', 1951, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Charles Walters, Paul Vogel', 'Sidney Sheldon', 'Jane Wyman, Van Johnson, Howard Keel, Barry Sullivan, Phyllis Kirk, Anne Sargent, Jeff Donnell, Herbert Heyes', 'NR', 'A stewardess becomes romantically involved with an airline pilot, a college professor, and a successful businessman...all of whom are named Mike. When the three find out about each other, she has to decide which one she loves the most.', 'A stewardess becomes romantically involved with an airline pilot, a college professor, and a successful businessman...all of whom are named Mike. When the three find out about each other, she has to decide which one she loves the most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4ZTfjRnxmnxLo8Px2q2jVMBm58.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113823'),
  ('529145712468958536', 'Three Heroes and Julius Caesar', 2015, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Konstantin Feoktistov', 'Aleksandr Boyarsky, Svetlana Sachenko', 'Sergey Makovetskiy, Dmitry Vysotsky, Dmitriy Nagiev, Gosha Kutsenko, Aleksandr Boyarsky, Oleg Kulikovich, Anatoli Petrov, Valeri Solovyev', null, 'The court horse Gaius Julius Caesar to his misfortune overhears boyars and learns about a conspiracy against the prince. What to do? Protect a prince no one! Heroes away - catch a robber Potanyu, Dragon on vacation, the army on maneuvers ... But if the bad guys are going to take over the world, to someone it is necessary to save him? Who is he, a hero who will come to the rescue? Of course, the horse Julius! This Strategy and the "grand strategist". He would save all, but if you do not save, then at least try. Most importantly, to the rescue of the world did not turn a complete disaster.', 'The court horse Gaius Julius Caesar to his misfortune overhears boyars and learns about a conspiracy against the prince. What to do? Protect a prince no one! Heroes away - catch a robber Potanyu, Dragon on vacation, the army on maneuvers ... But if the bad guys are going to take over the world, to someone it is necessary to save him? Who is he, a hero who will come to the rescue? Of course, the horse Julius! This Strategy and the "grand strategist". He would save all, but if you do not save, then at least try. Most importantly, to the rescue of the world did not turn a complete disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pW7OIlDn4sWTg4h5pH9Znz6Fs2V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314946'),
  ('290249181439672618', 'Three Heroes and the Shamakhan Queen', 2010, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Sergey Glezin', 'Aleksandr Boyarsky', 'Valeri Solovyev, Anna Geller, Oleg Kulikovich, Liya Medvedeva, Sergey Makovetskiy, Dmitriy Bykovskiy-Romashov, Dmitry Vysotsky, Konstantin Bronzit', null, 'A bogatyr is an epic warrior from ancient Kievan Rus. Most are directed in the traditional bylinas, traditional Russian epic poems, as being endowed with enormous strength and cunning, although often not completely immune to human weaknesses. Here, our three heroes gather together once more to rescue the ruler of the land from the attempts of an evil foreign queen. She plans to make him fall in love with her so her youth and beauty can be renewed, but in exchange will destroy his kingdom.', 'A bogatyr is an epic warrior from ancient Kievan Rus. Most are directed in the traditional bylinas, traditional Russian epic poems, as being endowed with enormous strength and cunning, although often not completely immune to human weaknesses. Here, our three heroes gather together once more to rescue the ruler of the land from the attempts of an evil foreign queen. She plans to make him fall in love with her so her youth and beauty can be renewed, but in exchange will destroy his kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nc8d2RZ08H2Oo0E6pguo2ob9uns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52939'),
  ('266569895178306743', 'Three Heroes on Distant Shores', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Konstantin Feoktistov', 'Aleksandr Boyarsky', 'Fyodor Bondarchuk, Elizaveta Boyarskaya, Sergey Makovetskiy, Oleg Kulikovich, Liya Medvedeva, Natalya Danilova, Valeri Solovyev, Dmitry Vysotsky', null, 'This time, Alyosha Popovich Dobrinya and Ilya Muromets, thanks insidious wiles of Baba Yaga, are the seven seas on the island where the natives live and terrible Gomuma. In their absence, the merchant Kolyvan decide together with Baba-Yaga take the kingdom, and the power to take away from the prince of Kiev. To help the hapless governor comes horse Julius and wife heroes and their extended family. In short, the heroes and the audience for adventures on distant shores, ordinary and extraordinary.', 'This time, Alyosha Popovich Dobrinya and Ilya Muromets, thanks insidious wiles of Baba Yaga, are the seven seas on the island where the natives live and terrible Gomuma. In their absence, the merchant Kolyvan decide together with Baba-Yaga take the kingdom, and the power to take away from the prince of Kiev. To help the hapless governor comes horse Julius and wife heroes and their extended family. In short, the heroes and the audience for adventures on distant shores, ordinary and extraordinary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR8xkuGuURfRZDS8j9d4yBpGPDn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154922'),
  ('762813910721729852', 'Three Hours to Kill', 1954, 'Western, Mystery', 'Alfred L. Werker, Sam Nelson, Charles Lawton Jr.', 'Richard Alan Simmons, Roy Huggins', 'Dana Andrews, Donna Reed, Dianne Foster, Stephen Elliott, Richard Coogan, Laurence Hugo, James Westerfield, Richard Webb', 'NR', 'After three years on the run, Jim Guthrie returns with the scar of a rope burn on his neck. In a flashback, we learn how he was framed for murder but then escaped from the lynch mob just as he was about to be hung. Tired of running, he has returned to find the real killer and the Sheriff has given him just three hours to do it.', 'After three years on the run, Jim Guthrie returns with the scar of a rope burn on his neck. In a flashback, we learn how he was framed for murder but then escaped from the lynch mob just as he was about to be hung. Tired of running, he has returned to find the real killer and the Sheriff has given him just three hours to do it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kmLDghG1KKtN9waX73PfEPhY1u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233795'),
  ('1074790801855826927', 'Three Husbands', 1950, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Franz Planer, Irving Reis', 'Vera Caspary, Edward Eliscu', 'Eve Arden, Ruth Warrick, Vanessa Brown, Howard Da Silva, Shepperd Strudwick, Robert Karnes, Emlyn Williams, Billie Burke', 'NR', 'When a recently deceased playboy gets to heaven and is granted one wish--granted to all newcomers--he requests that he be able to see the reactions of three husbands, with whom he regularly played poker, to a letter he left each of them claiming to have had an affair with each''s wife.', 'When a recently deceased playboy gets to heaven and is granted one wish--granted to all newcomers--he requests that he be able to see the reactions of three husbands, with whom he regularly played poker, to a letter he left each of them claiming to have had an affair with each''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rw8KxBqc7SCRkzNMQg6lYeOzCr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79524'),
  ('1095798078026610581', 'Three Identical Strangers', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Tim Cragg, Tim Wardle', null, 'David Kellman, Robert Shafran, Lawrence Wright', 'PG-13', 'New York, 1980. Three complete strangers accidentally discover that they''re identical triplets, separated at birth. The 19-year-olds'' joyous reunion catapults them to international fame, but also unlocks an extraordinary and disturbing secret that goes beyond their own lives – and could transform our understanding of human nature forever.', 'New York, 1980. Three complete strangers accidentally discover that they''re identical triplets, separated at birth. The 19-year-olds'' joyous reunion catapults them to international fame, but also unlocks an extraordinary and disturbing secret that goes beyond their own lives – and could transform our understanding of human nature forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esPoJNMBsgWXahv8gILIl5K6sFk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489988'),
  ('281394841137136032', 'Three in the Attic', 1968, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Richard Wilson', 'Stephen Yafa', 'Christopher Jones, Yvette Mimieux, Judy Pace, Maggie Thrett, Nan Martin, Reva Rose, John Beck, Richard Derr', 'R', 'In the swinging sixties three girls discover they have the same boyfriend who has been playing around with them all while vowing fidelity to each. To teach him a lesson he won''t forget, the trio contrive to lock him up and continually favour him with their attentions in turn.', 'In the swinging sixties three girls discover they have the same boyfriend who has been playing around with them all while vowing fidelity to each. To teach him a lesson he won''t forget, the trio contrive to lock him up and continually favour him with their attentions in turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mvYb1gcJsvENm5iIIv5AaWY7T0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42686'),
  ('839823560620436159', 'Three Kilometres to the End of the World', 2024, 'Drama', 'Emanuel Pârvu, Silviu Stavilã, Tiberiu Toth', 'Emanuel Pârvu, Miruna Berescu', 'Bogdan Dumitrache, Laura Vasiliu, Ciprian Chiujdea, Valeriu Andriuță, Adrian Titieni, Ingrid Micu-Berescu, Richard Bovnoczki, Vlad Brumaru', null, 'Adi, a gay teenager, is spending the summer in his home village in the Danube Delta. One night he is brutally attacked on the street, the next day his world is turned upside-down. His parents no longer look at him as they did, and the seeming tranquility of the village starts to crack.', 'Adi, a gay teenager, is spending the summer in his home village in the Danube Delta. One night he is brutally attacked on the street, the next day his world is turned upside-down. His parents no longer look at him as they did, and the seeming tranquility of the village starts to crack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gg8gyJ7LvQQVjojmStwBWitQOQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1278338'),
  ('1090094965079635262', 'Three Kingdoms: Resurrection of the Dragon', 2008, 'Action, History, Drama', 'Daniel Lee, Tony Cheung Tung-Leung, Kang Tae-Hyoung', 'Lau Ho-Leung, Daniel Lee, Andrew Fung Chih-Chiang', 'Andy Lau, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Maggie Q, Pu Cunxin, Andy On Chi-Kit, Yu Rongguang, Elliot Ngok Wah, Ti Lung', 'R', 'The aging Zhao embarks on his final and greatest campaign, a road to adventure that will crown his name in glory for all time.', 'The aging Zhao embarks on his final and greatest campaign, a road to adventure that will crown his name in glory for all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOouWlgSMxlAQow8YdxyssywPJN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14538'),
  ('638229759932870387', 'Three Kings', 1999, 'Action, Comedy, War', 'David O. Russell, Newton Thomas Sigel, Dan Bradley', 'David O. Russell', 'George Clooney, Mark Wahlberg, Ice Cube, Spike Jonze, Cliff Curtis, Nora Dunn, Jamie Kennedy, Saïd Taghmaoui', 'R', 'A group of American soldiers stationed in Iraq at the end of the Gulf War find a map they believe will take them to a huge cache of stolen Kuwaiti gold hidden near their base, and they embark on a secret mission that''s destined to change everything.', 'A group of American soldiers stationed in Iraq at the end of the Gulf War find a map they believe will take them to a huge cache of stolen Kuwaiti gold hidden near their base, and they embark on a secret mission that''s destined to change everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fClJQW8xn8wHOFqoA4jUn0PZh1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6415'),
  ('916731557944846893', 'Three Letters 3: Black Magic', 2016, 'Horror', 'Alper Mestçi, Hakan Yoruk', 'Alper Mestçi', 'Metin Yıldırım, Merve Ateş, Özay Fecht, Sedat Develik, Seda Oguz, Deniz Gündogdu, Fatma Nilgün İslamoğlu, Yücel Tunca', null, 'After losing his parents, he gives this house to the rent to avoid staying in the house of the Alev family, who is living a great destruction. But there is a lot that he does not know about the new couple who rents the house. And these mysteries will turn the Alev into a very difficult situation.', 'After losing his parents, he gives this house to the rent to avoid staying in the house of the Alev family, who is living a great destruction. But there is a lot that he does not know about the new couple who rents the house. And these mysteries will turn the Alev into a very difficult situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7emt2viUwRFqYmINPoYv2n0ryUu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438739'),
