  ('983186738591045871', 'Three Little Beers', 1935, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Bud Jamison, Jack ''Tiny'' Lipson, George Magrill, William Irving, Frank Mills', 'NR', 'The stooges are inept deliverymen at a brewery. When they learn about a company golf tournament, they sneak onto a golf course to get some practice. They quickly proceed to bother the other golfers and destroy the course. Forced to escape in their beer truck, more havoc ensues when the load of beer barrels are spilled out down a steep hill.', 'The stooges are inept deliverymen at a brewery. When they learn about a company golf tournament, they sneak onto a golf course to get some practice. They quickly proceed to bother the other golfers and destroy the course. Forced to escape in their beer truck, more havoc ensues when the load of beer barrels are spilled out down a steep hill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjmk38sbpJwLYal4wDm3qdBap24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115781'),
  ('72797534124880134', 'Three Little Bops', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Stan Freberg', 'NR', 'Three hip, Little Pigs are travelling entertainers, moving from straw to wood, to brick nightclubs, playing swinging tunes for high-class, "with it" crowds, but an uncool Big Bad Wolf keeps intruding on their act with with his "corny horn" and uses it to blow their nightclubs down when they throw him out- until they are playing in their brick club and the Wolf tries a more drastic, explosive method for destroying the "House of Bricks".', 'Three hip, Little Pigs are travelling entertainers, moving from straw to wood, to brick nightclubs, playing swinging tunes for high-class, "with it" crowds, but an uncool Big Bad Wolf keeps intruding on their act with with his "corny horn" and uses it to blow their nightclubs down when they throw him out- until they are playing in their brick club and the Wolf tries a more drastic, explosive method for destroying the "House of Bricks".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEO5QSmGG5iHnRwqqTpMaOUdC00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91204'),
  ('326593653090692895', 'Three Little Pigs', 1933, 'Music, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Burt Gillett', 'Pinto Colvig, Boris V. Morkovin, Ted Sears', 'Billy Bletcher, Pinto Colvig, Dorothy Compton, Mary Moder', 'NR', 'The two pigs building houses of hay and sticks scoff at their brother, building the brick house. But when the wolf comes around and blows their houses down (after trickery like dressing as a foundling sheep fails), they run to their brother''s house. And throughout, they sing the classic song, "Who''s Afraid of the Big Bad Wolf?".', 'The two pigs building houses of hay and sticks scoff at their brother, building the brick house. But when the wolf comes around and blows their houses down (after trickery like dressing as a foundling sheep fails), they run to their brother''s house. And throughout, they sing the classic song, "Who''s Afraid of the Big Bad Wolf?".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKIjJa7N58Wx2MqXZZkiyRzdL1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34463'),
  ('248615620233228314', 'Three Little Pigskins', 1934, 'Comedy', 'Ray McCarey, Henry Freulich', 'Felix Adler, Griffin Jay', 'Moe Howard, Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Lucille Ball, Gertie Green, Phyllis Crane, Jack ''Tiny'' Lipson, Walter Long', 'NR', 'The stooges are mistaken by a gangster for the "Three Horsemen of Boulder Dam", famous football players. Hired to play for his team, they blow the big game and get it in the end. Lucille Ball has a nice part as a gun moll.', 'The stooges are mistaken by a gangster for the "Three Horsemen of Boulder Dam", famous football players. Hired to play for his team, they blow the big game and get it in the end. Lucille Ball has a nice part as a gun moll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TdsFRoQJTOaNVigN290z7fdL3P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115801'),
  ('498460972938396223', 'Three Little Pirates', 1946, 'Comedy', 'Edward Bernds, Philip Tannura', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Christine McIntyre, Robert Kellard, Vernon Dent, Dorothy DeHaven, Joe Palma', null, 'The stooges are castaways from a garbage scow who land on Dead Man''s Island where everyone is living in olden times. To escape from the governor, they disguise Curly as a Maharaja and win permission to journey to their own country to fetch presents. The governor is fooled, but the boys run into more trouble in the den of Black Louie the pirate where Curly is forced into a knife throwing contest with Larry as the target. Things look bad until a mis-thrown knife cuts the rope that holds the chandelier and it crashes down on Black Louie''s men. With the pirates defeated, Moe decides to take over as ruler of the island.', 'The stooges are castaways from a garbage scow who land on Dead Man''s Island where everyone is living in olden times. To escape from the governor, they disguise Curly as a Maharaja and win permission to journey to their own country to fetch presents. The governor is fooled, but the boys run into more trouble in the den of Black Louie the pirate where Curly is forced into a knife throwing contest with Larry as the target. Things look bad until a mis-thrown knife cuts the rope that holds the chandelier and it crashes down on Black Louie''s men. With the pirates defeated, Moe decides to take over as ruler of the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wizncZGxYcostwra1tb7dIJK7zH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116109'),
  ('159843815264870019', 'Three Little Sew and Sews', 1939, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Ewart Adamson', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Phyllis Barry, Harry Semels, Vernon Dent, Charles Dorety, Ned Glass', 'NR', 'The stooges are sailors working in a ships'' tailor shop. When they can''t get passes to go ashore, they steal officers uniforms and go to a party with Curly passing himself off as Admiral Taylor and Moe and Larry as his aides. Two spies, one of them a beautiful woman, trick the stooges into stealing a new submarine. The boys turn the table on the spies and capture them. When the real Admiral shows up, Curly''s reenacts the capture and accidentally detonates a bomb, blowing them all to kingdom come.', 'The stooges are sailors working in a ships'' tailor shop. When they can''t get passes to go ashore, they steal officers uniforms and go to a party with Curly passing himself off as Admiral Taylor and Moe and Larry as his aides. Two spies, one of them a beautiful woman, trick the stooges into stealing a new submarine. The boys turn the table on the spies and capture them. When the real Admiral shows up, Curly''s reenacts the capture and accidentally detonates a bomb, blowing them all to kingdom come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yW58wMIdKxTSydVTBSqb1ZV0UEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115934'),
  ('150615518059254223', 'Three Little Wolves', 1936, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'David Hand, Jack Cutting, Burt Gillett', 'William Cottrell, Joe Grant, Bob Kuwahara', 'Billy Bletcher, Pinto Colvig, Mary Moder, Dorothy Compton, Alyce Ardell, Leone LeDoux, Bonnie Poe', 'NR', 'Two little pigs cry wolf on their brother and then an actual wolf comes.', 'Two little pigs cry wolf on their brother and then an actual wolf comes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsoHl5o6ewvrlL5y38gQLNHj46A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109329'),
  ('921102417405613114', 'Three Little Words', 1950, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Thorpe, Harry Jackson, André Previn', 'George Wells', 'Fred Astaire, Red Skelton, Vera-Ellen, Arlene Dahl, Keenan Wynn, Gale Robbins, Gloria DeHaven, Phil Regan', 'NR', 'Song-and-dance man Bert Kalmar can''t continue his stage career after an injury, so he has to earn his money as a lyricist. By chance, he meets composer Harry Ruby and their first song is a hit. Ruby gets Kalmar to marry his former partner Jessie Brown, and Kalmar and Jessie prevent Ruby from getting married to the wrong girls. But due to the fact that Ruby has caused a backer''s withdrawal for a Kalmar play, they end their professional relationship.', 'Song-and-dance man Bert Kalmar can''t continue his stage career after an injury, so he has to earn his money as a lyricist. By chance, he meets composer Harry Ruby and their first song is a hit. Ruby gets Kalmar to marry his former partner Jessie Brown, and Kalmar and Jessie prevent Ruby from getting married to the wrong girls. But due to the fact that Ruby has caused a backer''s withdrawal for a Kalmar play, they end their professional relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7O9keBF6bcKKAAD05LqT382z837.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42767'),
  ('909432988398563250', 'Three Lives and Only One Death', 1996, 'Comedy, Crime, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Raúl Ruiz, Laurent Machuel', 'Raúl Ruiz, Pascal Bonitzer', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Anna Galiena, Marisa Paredes, Chiara Mastroianni, Arielle Dombasle, Jean-Yves Gautier, Melvil Poupaud, Féodor Atkine', null, 'Four intertwining stories of bizarre occurrences in Paris featuring a man who was stolen away by fairies, a professor who becomes a tramp, the lovers who inherit a chateau – and the last tale that connects all that has gone before.', 'Four intertwining stories of bizarre occurrences in Paris featuring a man who was stolen away by fairies, a professor who becomes a tramp, the lovers who inherit a chateau – and the last tale that connects all that has gone before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5zPLrTdFWox2AO7aTytgVhmdoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55049'),
  ('279378425575722797', 'Three Man And A Ghost', 2022, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Francesco Prisco, Roberto Ostuni', 'Francesco Prisco, Mimmo Manfredi, Raffaele Ferrante', 'Francesco De Fraia, Mimmo Manfredi, Raffaele Ferrante, Artemisia Levita, Roberta Spagnuolo, Pasqualina Sanna, Vincenzo De Lucia, Maurizio Carbone', null, 'Three men have been friends since childhood. To win a prize, they steal something from a girl. The girl is not what she seems. Things go downhill for the friends. On a weekend get-away, secrets are revealed, and people end up dead.', 'Three men have been friends since childhood. To win a prize, they steal something from a girl. The girl is not what she seems. Things go downhill for the friends. On a weekend get-away, secrets are revealed, and people end up dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RYg7i3sOmx0dGllFDOjJzi7heJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1050746'),
  ('308350083468038349', 'Three Many Weddings', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Arnau Valls Colomer, Javier Ruiz Caldera, Ana Hernando', 'Pablo Alén, Breixo Corral', 'Inma Cuesta, Martiño Rivas, Quim Gutiérrez, Paco León, Rossy de Palma, María Botto, Laura Sánchez, Bárbara Santa-Cruz', null, 'Ruth, a young researcher at a college, is invited to the weddings of three of her exes. She enlists the help of her assistant to find a companion for each wedding; will one of them turn out to be her soulmate?', 'Ruth, a young researcher at a college, is invited to the weddings of three of her exes. She enlists the help of her assistant to find a companion for each wedding; will one of them turn out to be her soulmate?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvNWifzv9rQC7NVsw3MJotrBdBu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201765'),
  ('121954752625344835', 'Three Men and a Cradle', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Yves Escoffier, Jean-Jacques Bouhon, Coline Serreau', 'Coline Serreau', 'Roland Giraud, Michel Boujenah, André Dussollier, Philippine Leroy-Beaulieu, Dominique Lavanant, Marthe Villalonga, Annick Alane, Josine Comellas', 'PG-13', 'Three young men - Jacques, Pierre, and Michel - share an apartment in Paris, and have many girlfriends and parties. Once, during a party, a friend of Jacques'' tells him he has a quite compromising package to deliver, and asks him if he can leave it discreetly at their place. Jacques agrees and, as he works as a steward, flies away for a one-month trip in Japan, telling Pierre and Michel about the package. Then, one of Jacques'' former girlfriends drops a baby before their door, making Pierre and Michel believing it is the package they are waiting for. Their lives are then completely changed.', 'Three young men - Jacques, Pierre, and Michel - share an apartment in Paris, and have many girlfriends and parties. Once, during a party, a friend of Jacques'' tells him he has a quite compromising package to deliver, and asks him if he can leave it discreetly at their place. Jacques agrees and, as he works as a steward, flies away for a one-month trip in Japan, telling Pierre and Michel about the package. Then, one of Jacques'' former girlfriends drops a baby before their door, making Pierre and Michel believing it is the package they are waiting for. Their lives are then completely changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TfJL5jbyWFUOe1NB81iI8w7Gct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4180'),
  ('780329707906326514', 'Three Men and a Cradle - 18 Years Later', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Coline Serreau, Jean-François Robin', 'Coline Serreau', 'Roland Giraud, Michel Boujenah, André Dussollier, Madeleine Besson, Line Renaud, Philippine Leroy-Beaulieu, Annick Alane, Evelyne Buyle', null, 'Marie (and her three fathers) are taking A-levels. Marie passes. She spends the summer in the country with her mother, Sylvia, who has returned from America with her Californian husband who has two sons. Marie falls in and out of love for the first time in front of her alarmed fathers, who see Marie''s innocence slipping away at frightening speed, and their relationships with the two women become even more complicated.', 'Marie (and her three fathers) are taking A-levels. Marie passes. She spends the summer in the country with her mother, Sylvia, who has returned from America with her Californian husband who has two sons. Marie falls in and out of love for the first time in front of her alarmed fathers, who see Marie''s innocence slipping away at frightening speed, and their relationships with the two women become even more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40b0OXQb7HZWBON4rnCA9Mwde1p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38210'),
  ('18473642244141853', 'Three Men in a Boat', 1975, 'Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Stephen Frears, Brian Tufano', 'Tom Stoppard', 'Michael Palin, Tim Curry, Stephen Moore, Bill Stewart, Michael Elphick, George Innes, Russell Dixon, Mary MacLeod', null, 'One hot June day, three friends decide there is nothing they would like to do more than to get away from London. A boating holiday with lots of fresh air and exercise would be just the very thing, or so their doctors tell them. So, after debating the merits of hotel or camp beds and what to pack, they set off on their voyage - a trip up the Thames from Henley to Oxford - but very quickly find themselves ill-equipped for the trials of riverbank life.', 'One hot June day, three friends decide there is nothing they would like to do more than to get away from London. A boating holiday with lots of fresh air and exercise would be just the very thing, or so their doctors tell them. So, after debating the merits of hotel or camp beds and what to pack, they set off on their voyage - a trip up the Thames from Henley to Oxford - but very quickly find themselves ill-equipped for the trials of riverbank life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oG7Yawt8Gnz8fksOtdbcEgkuqsI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78329'),
  ('985639862159394865', 'Three Men in a Boat', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Naum Birman, Genrikh Marandzhyan, Igor Vigdorchik', 'Semyon Lungin', 'Andrey Mironov, Aleksandr Shirvindt, Mikhail Derzhavin, Larisa Golubkina, Alina Pokrovskaya, Irina Mazurkevich, Zinoviy Gerdt, Tatyana Pelttser', null, 'Three London gentlemen take vacation rowing down the Thames, encountering various mishaps and misadventures along the way.', 'Three London gentlemen take vacation rowing down the Thames, encountering various mishaps and misadventures along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rA6gt4YXpP2Tr2IDQJGEwiLyMMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65123'),
  ('1137802940792951461', 'Three Men in the Snow', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Kurt Hoffmann, Richard Angst, Alfred Solm', 'Erich Kästner', 'Paul Dahlke, Günther Lüders, Claus Biederstaedt, Nicole Heesters, Margarete Haagen, Alma Seidler, Eva Maria Meineke, Franz Muxeneder', null, 'The multi-millionaire Eduard Schlüter takes part under the name Schulze in a raffle of his own Schlüter works and wins a stay at the Grand Hotel. Disguised as a poor swallower, he would like to study the reactions of the hotel staff and guests. As an assistant, he takes his reliable servant Johann with him. Once there, he makes friends and also has cause for annoyance when his daughter and the housekeeper arrive.', 'The multi-millionaire Eduard Schlüter takes part under the name Schulze in a raffle of his own Schlüter works and wins a stay at the Grand Hotel. Disguised as a poor swallower, he would like to study the reactions of the hotel staff and guests. As an assistant, he takes his reliable servant Johann with him. Once there, he makes friends and also has cause for annoyance when his daughter and the housekeeper arrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dBCxkwzHLgDu005lwV15lsfDET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54769'),
  ('399202577211460710', 'Three Men to Kill', 1980, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Jacques Deray, Jean Tournier', 'Alain Delon, Jacques Deray, Christopher Frank', 'Alain Delon, Dalila Di Lazzaro, Michel Auclair, Pascale Roberts, Lyne Chardonnet, Jean-Pierre Darras, Bernard Le Coq, François Perrot', null, 'A man helps the victim of an auto accident, not realizing that the man has actually been shot. The men who shot him are now after the man who helped him, in order to eliminate him as a potential witness. Soon they are killing everyone he even comes in contact with in order to get him.', 'A man helps the victim of an auto accident, not realizing that the man has actually been shot. The men who shot him are now after the man who helped him, in order to eliminate him as a potential witness. Soon they are killing everyone he even comes in contact with in order to get him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUJ7dd85UC7JBpDTT0IVYgALZww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56497'),
  ('1069756651490411723', 'Three Missing Links', 1938, 'Comedy', 'Jules White', 'Searle Kramer', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Jane Hamilton, John Lester Johnson, James C. Morton, Ray Corrigan, Monte Collins', 'NR', 'The stooges are janitors working in a movie studio. After wrecking the bosses office, they get jobs as actors in an African movie. Curly plays a gorilla and Moe and Larry are primitive natives. On location in Africa, the stooges have a confrontation with a witch doctor from whom Curly buys some "love candy" with hopes of attracting the films leading lady. When a female gorilla disrupts the movie set, Curly eats some of the candy and chases after her.', 'The stooges are janitors working in a movie studio. After wrecking the bosses office, they get jobs as actors in an African movie. Curly plays a gorilla and Moe and Larry are primitive natives. On location in Africa, the stooges have a confrontation with a witch doctor from whom Curly buys some "love candy" with hopes of attracting the films leading lady. When a female gorilla disrupts the movie set, Curly eats some of the candy and chases after her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8av3E9F4AzRC5VDM9OwMfXzmDsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115920'),
  ('697529861910468756', 'Three Monkeys', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Gökhan Tiryaki', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Ercan Kesal, Ebru Ceylan', 'Yavuz Bingöl, Hatice Aslan, Ahmet Rıfat Şungar, Ercan Kesal, Cafer Köse, Gürkan Aydin', null, 'A family battles against the odds to stay together when small lies grow into an extravagant cover-up. In order to avoid hardship and responsibilities that would otherwise be impossible to endure, the family chooses to ignore the truth, not to see, hear or talk about it. But does playing “Three Monkeys” invalidate the truth of its existence?', 'A family battles against the odds to stay together when small lies grow into an extravagant cover-up. In order to avoid hardship and responsibilities that would otherwise be impossible to endure, the family chooses to ignore the truth, not to see, hear or talk about it. But does playing “Three Monkeys” invalidate the truth of its existence?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyIKP8SSTkw9xEXAG9lj5jEnIfW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8905'),
  ('521115687725333242', 'Three Monks', 1981, 'Animation', 'A Da', 'Bao Lei', 'Bao Lei, A Da', null, 'Adaptation of the Chinese folk tale that gave rise to the proverb “One monk will shoulder two buckets of water, two monks will share the load, but add a third and no one will want to fetch water”.', 'Adaptation of the Chinese folk tale that gave rise to the proverb “One monk will shoulder two buckets of water, two monks will share the load, but add a third and no one will want to fetch water”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfNZYnS3jpkbrN3f15brqlHRla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90861'),
  ('821161959918094662', 'Three Months', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chananun Chotrungroj, Daniel Dubiecki, Jared Frieder', 'Jared Frieder', 'Troye Sivan, Viveik Kalra, Brianne Tju, Ellen Burstyn, Louis Gossett Jr., Judy Greer, Amy Landecker, Javier Muñoz', 'R', 'Caleb, a South Florida teen, loves his camera, his weed and his grandmother. On the eve of his high school graduation, everything changes when he''s exposed to HIV. While he waits three months for his results, Caleb finds love in the most unlikely of places.', 'Caleb, a South Florida teen, loves his camera, his weed and his grandmother. On the eve of his high school graduation, everything changes when he''s exposed to HIV. While he waits three months for his results, Caleb finds love in the most unlikely of places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTD5TXjNbQ9c0BawMquBCO667yE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793992'),
  ('345424030399698386', 'Three Nerds', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Buk-gu', 'Buk-gu', 'Sae Bom, Yoon Yool, Yoo Ji-hyun, Min Do-yoon, Kang Min-woo, Si Woo, Kang Seo', null, 'They lose their jobs and being late on their monthly rent ends up leaving them on the street in no time. In this emergency situation they find a good paying part-time job! They gladly go to the new job but... you want me to take my clothes of right now... ?! With nothing working out and everything going wrong the three brothers desperately try to maintain their livelihood.', 'They lose their jobs and being late on their monthly rent ends up leaving them on the street in no time. In this emergency situation they find a good paying part-time job! They gladly go to the new job but... you want me to take my clothes of right now... ?! With nothing working out and everything going wrong the three brothers desperately try to maintain their livelihood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DTZbFvs6QFCkukILnjTcERnIb2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1234966'),
  ('948234461515394190', 'Three Night Stand', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Pat Kiely, Robert Vroom', 'Pat Kiely', 'Sam Huntington, Meaghan Rath, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Reagan Pasternak, Jonathan Cherry, Dan Beirne, Anne-Marie Cadieux, Aliocha Schneider', null, 'A man''s plans for a romantic weekend go awry when he learns that his ex-girlfriend, whom he still secretly loves, manages the ski lodge where he and his wife are staying.', 'A man''s plans for a romantic weekend go awry when he learns that his ex-girlfriend, whom he still secretly loves, manages the ski lodge where he and his wife are staying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ME166MZiPlqOhN2N3CyKxfqUqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245169'),
  ('557345571311358542', 'Three Nights a Week', 2022, 'Drama', 'Florent Gouëlou, Basile Jullien, Vadim Alsayed', 'Raphaëlle Valbrune', 'Pablo Pauly, Hafsia Herzi, Cookie Kunty, Harald Marlot, Mathias Jamain Houngnikpo, Holy Fatma, Jean-Marie Gouëlou, Calypso Baquey', null, 'When young Baptiste meets Cookie Kunty, a young Parisian drag queen, he feels compelled to start a new photographic project.', 'When young Baptiste meets Cookie Kunty, a young Parisian drag queen, he feels compelled to start a new photographic project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJcjmFnj0N2hDDFhNBCDgQp5R5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:849755'),
  ('908682335108925839', 'Three O''Clock High', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Phil Joanou, Barry Sonnenfeld, Martha Elcan', 'Tom Szollosi, Richard Christian Matheson', 'Casey Siemaszko, Annie Ryan, Richard Tyson, Stacey Glick, Jonathan Wise, Jeffrey Tambor, Philip Baker Hall, John P. Ryan', 'PG-13', 'Nerdy high schooler Jerry Mitchell is assigned to write an article for the school paper about the infamous new delinquent transfer student, Buddy Revell. When Jerry accidentally invades Buddy''s personal space and touches him, Buddy challenges Jerry to an afterschool fight in the parking lot, which Jerry tries to avoid at all costs.', 'Nerdy high schooler Jerry Mitchell is assigned to write an article for the school paper about the infamous new delinquent transfer student, Buddy Revell. When Jerry accidentally invades Buddy''s personal space and touches him, Buddy challenges Jerry to an afterschool fight in the parking lot, which Jerry tries to avoid at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IKEBJdaFWVBxPmsmUx5eICRwKf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13339'),
  ('326414493852930515', 'Three of Hearts', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Andrzej Sekula, Yurek Bogayevicz, Lars P. Winther', 'Mitch Glazer, Adam Greenman', 'William Baldwin, Kelly Lynch, Sherilyn Fenn, Joe Pantoliano, Gail Strickland, Cec Verrell, Claire Callaway, Marek Johnson', null, 'A lesbian hires a male escort to break the heart of the bisexual woman who has just dumped her.', 'A lesbian hires a male escort to break the heart of the bisexual woman who has just dumped her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBzAb9odo7xszFTLfuYziP714kf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5187'),
  ('189296257728851594', 'Three of Us', 2023, 'Drama', 'Avinash Arun, Avinash Arun', 'Arpita Chatterjee, Omkar Achyut Barve, Avinash Arun', 'Shefali Shah, Jaideep Ahlawat, Swanand Kirkire, Kadambari Kadam, Rasika Agashe, Ojasvi Berde, Radha Dharane, Sharvari Lohokare', null, 'Shailaja embarks on a confrontational journey with her husband and childhood-love as she finds herself at the cusp of her past, present and future. Stitched with a very delicate thread of emotions, this film is about love, loss, healing, awareness and liberation.', 'Shailaja embarks on a confrontational journey with her husband and childhood-love as she finds herself at the cusp of her past, present and future. Stitched with a very delicate thread of emotions, this film is about love, loss, healing, awareness and liberation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KQTxjyfhbSrsjkgG1oKFWIIaKN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1052873'),
  ('106843974669074943', 'Three on a Couch', 1966, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jerry Lewis, Hal Bell, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Samuel A. Taylor, Bob Ross', 'Jerry Lewis, Janet Leigh, Mary Ann Mobley, Gila Golan, Leslie Parrish, James Best, Kathleen Freeman, Jesslyn Fax', 'NR', 'An artist has an opportunity to go to Paris and wants to bring his fiancee along. However, she''s a psychiatrist who currently has three female patients who don''t like men. So, he guises himself as three different men to gauge their trust and hopefully cure them so that his fiancee can go with him.', 'An artist has an opportunity to go to Paris and wants to bring his fiancee along. However, she''s a psychiatrist who currently has three female patients who don''t like men. So, he guises himself as three different men to gauge their trust and hopefully cure them so that his fiancee can go with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccmeNZoCVtaI45ztDeGYsvbioWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38773'),
  ('682547462814049722', 'Three on a Match', 1932, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Sol Polito', 'Lucien Hubbard', 'Joan Blondell, Ann Dvorak, Bette Davis, Virginia Davis, Anne Shirley, Betty Carse, Warren William, Lyle Talbot', null, 'Although Vivian Revere is seemingly the most successful of a trio of reunited schoolmates, she throws it away by descending into a life of debauchery and drugs.', 'Although Vivian Revere is seemingly the most successful of a trio of reunited schoolmates, she throws it away by descending into a life of debauchery and drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgx6zwUzi4jZyXaB0Hg8dKx47Qp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42914'),
  ('193554486869159325', 'Three on a Meathook', 1972, 'Horror', 'William L. Asman, William Girdler, Charles Kissinger', 'William Girdler', 'Charles Kissinger, James Carroll Pickett , Sherry Steiner, Madelyn Buzzard, Linda Thompson, Smith Haynie', 'R', 'Four girls go on a romping weekend at a lake, and have car problems on the way home. A nice local boy takes them back to his farm, where he lives with his father. Something ghastly happens, but the father helps his son as he has in the past. When the boy meets a girl and begins falling in love, the father worries about a repeat performance.', 'Four girls go on a romping weekend at a lake, and have car problems on the way home. A nice local boy takes them back to his farm, where he lives with his father. Something ghastly happens, but the father helps his son as he has in the past. When the boy meets a girl and begins falling in love, the father worries about a repeat performance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2aWVnaKVhW1haq1QiQXuHLhrg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86271'),
  ('162541500220765286', 'Three Orphan Kittens', 1935, 'Animation', 'David Hand, Jack Cutting', null, 'Clarence Nash, Margaret Wright, Lillian Randolph', 'NR', 'Three orphan kittens are entering a society house in winter and ruin the furniture. But when they''re caught by the maid, the young daughter of the house "rescues" them from the cold outside.', 'Three orphan kittens are entering a society house in winter and ruin the furniture. But when they''re caught by the maid, the young daughter of the house "rescues" them from the cold outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHRyzTsWb3mQ4iB0HhilUkSWUSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67626'),
  ('884402763687178211', 'Three Outlaw Samurai', 1964, 'Action, Drama', 'Hideo Gosha, Tadashi Sakai, Akira Masuda', 'Hideo Gosha, Keiichi Abe, Eizaburo Shiba', 'Tetsuro Tamba, Isamu Nagato, Mikijiro Hira, Miyuki Kuwano, Yoshiko Kayama, Yōko Mihara, Kyoko Aoi, Kamatari Fujiwara', null, 'Shiba, a wandering ronin, encounters a band of peasants who have kidnapped the daughter of their dictatorial magistrate, in hopes of coercing from him a reduction in taxes. Shiba takes up their fight, joined by two renegades from the magistrate''s guard, Sakura and Kikyo. The three outlaws find themselves in a battle to the death.', 'Shiba, a wandering ronin, encounters a band of peasants who have kidnapped the daughter of their dictatorial magistrate, in hopes of coercing from him a reduction in taxes. Shiba takes up their fight, joined by two renegades from the magistrate''s guard, Sakura and Kikyo. The three outlaws find themselves in a battle to the death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gHucIqPYxKzOhQxyEshbDtuU4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58878'),
  ('192845323877423862', 'Three Palms for Two Punks and a Babe', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Radivoje ''Raša'' Andrić, Miloš Spasojević', 'Milan V. Puzić', 'Dubravka Mijatović, Srđan ''Žika'' Todorović, Goran Radaković, Milorad Mandić, Mirjana Karanović, Gorica Popović, Marko Janketić, Steve Agnew', null, 'The story takes place in 1993 Serbia, torn by hyperinflation and economic disaster. Milan, an avid fan of FC Partizan, lives with his friend, a painter, and makes money by selling his paintings to the "new elite". He meets a nice girl who works a phone sex hot line and the two eventually fall in love. An another friend so his is a treasury guard in a bank governed by a shady lady known as "Serbian mother", notorious for cheating the thousands of creditors. The couple is planning to rob the bank and run away to a remote sunny island with palms.', 'The story takes place in 1993 Serbia, torn by hyperinflation and economic disaster. Milan, an avid fan of FC Partizan, lives with his friend, a painter, and makes money by selling his paintings to the "new elite". He meets a nice girl who works a phone sex hot line and the two eventually fall in love. An another friend so his is a treasury guard in a bank governed by a shady lady known as "Serbian mother", notorious for cheating the thousands of creditors. The couple is planning to rob the bank and run away to a remote sunny island with palms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sCpXrc2PDLYZ0lijdxhuyAdHq3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109576'),
  ('902433232759293363', 'Three Peaks', 2017, 'Drama', 'Axel Schneppat, Jan Zabeil', 'Jan Zabeil', 'Alexander Fehling, Bérénice Bejo, Arian Montgomery', null, 'Aaron invites his girlfriend Lea and her 8-year-old son Tristan on a trip to the mountains. What could be a starting point of a new life together, slowly turns into difficult territory as the three fight for their positions within the new family.', 'Aaron invites his girlfriend Lea and her 8-year-old son Tristan on a trip to the mountains. What could be a starting point of a new life together, slowly turns into difficult territory as the three fight for their positions within the new family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxsFU6dKqA8uZhmUb7TsIV2g6IK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467542'),
  ('788131427571913178', 'Three Perfect Daughters', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Leopoldo Pescatore, Claudio Aloia, Fabrizio Lucci', 'Josep Gatell, Manuel Burque', 'Marco Giallini, Isabella Ferrari, Giuseppe Battiston, Claudia Pandolfi, Vincenzo Salemme, Valentina Lodovini, Matilde Gioli, Lorena Cesarini', null, 'Three families go into crisis when their daughters get engaged because they are convinced that their young daughters have all chosen a wrong partner.', 'Three families go into crisis when their daughters get engaged because they are convinced that their young daughters have all chosen a wrong partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cK33UaL11OcrRPlyhTaEmQERfRd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614427'),
