  ('968892250919966122', 'Three Rooms in Manhattan', 1965, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marcel Carné, Eugen Schüfftan', 'Jacques Sigurd, Marcel Carné', 'Annie Girardot, Roland Lesaffre, O.E. Hasse, Gabriele Ferzetti, Margaret Nolan, Virginia Vee, Maurice Ronet, Geneviève Page', null, 'When his wife leaves him, a young French actor, François Combe, moves to New York to work for a television company. One evening, he meets an attractive young woman, Kay Larsi, in a bar.', 'When his wife leaves him, a young French actor, François Combe, moves to New York to work for a television company. One evening, he meets an attractive young woman, Kay Larsi, in a bar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBRcYkM0ZwovBZ3tr8wypEwlf1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147581'),
  ('17813931134758000', 'Three Sad Tigers', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Raúl Ruiz, Roberto Chignoli, Diego Bonacina', 'Raúl Ruiz', 'Shenda Román, Nelson Villagra, Luis Alarcón, Jaime Vadell, Delfina Guzmán, Fernando Colina, Belén Allasio, Alonso Venegas', null, 'A glimpse at the few days and nights in the lives of a brother and sister, Amanda and Tito, in Santiago’s semi-criminal underworld. A rambling portrait of Chilean society.', 'A glimpse at the few days and nights in the lives of a brother and sister, Amanda and Tito, in Santiago’s semi-criminal underworld. A rambling portrait of Chilean society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QiPIg5SyXdHvIpaZMQOFMhMcPR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122097'),
  ('1041236211824840171', 'Three Sappy People', 1939, 'Comedy', 'Jules White', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Lorna Gray, Don Beddoe, Bud Jamison, Gloria Blondell, Ann Doran', 'NR', 'The stooges are phone repairmen who are mistaken for the psychiatrists in whose office they are working. A rich man hires them to treat his impetuous young wife who is always running of for submarine rides and the like. The boys ruin a dinner party at their clients mansion but their antics so amuse his wife the she is cured and the stooges are paid off handsomely.', 'The stooges are phone repairmen who are mistaken for the psychiatrists in whose office they are working. A rich man hires them to treat his impetuous young wife who is always running of for submarine rides and the like. The boys ruin a dinner party at their clients mansion but their antics so amuse his wife the she is cured and the stooges are paid off handsomely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eS6MUMtzPlgcPQ6YJVFAkKiLYvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115931'),
  ('826049470921045312', 'Three Seasons', 1999, 'Drama', 'Tony Bui, Lisa Rinzler', 'Tony Bui', 'Đơn Dương, Nguyễn Thị Ngọc Hiệp, Diep Bui, Huu Duoc Nguyen, Diễm Kiều, Harvey Keitel, Lola Guimond, Phát Triệu', 'PG-13', 'The residents of Ho Chi Minh City face modernization amid widespread poverty. A retired American Marine arrives on a search for his daughter, whom he abandoned at the end of the Vietnam War. Elsewhere, a cyclo driver falls for a troubled prostitute and schemes to raise money so he can spend time with her. Additionally, a young women begins harvesting lotuses for a writer suffering from leprosy, and a child trinket seller loses his traveling case.', 'The residents of Ho Chi Minh City face modernization amid widespread poverty. A retired American Marine arrives on a search for his daughter, whom he abandoned at the end of the Vietnam War. Elsewhere, a cyclo driver falls for a troubled prostitute and schemes to raise money so he can spend time with her. Additionally, a young women begins harvesting lotuses for a writer suffering from leprosy, and a child trinket seller loses his traveling case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BRzgNVCrb40TsEUKZt2ODXgWMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4154'),
  ('895475974252237740', 'Three Seats for the 26th', 1988, 'Music, Drama', 'Jacques Demy, Jean Penzer', 'Jacques Demy', 'Yves Montand, Mathilda May, Patrick Fierry, Françoise Fabian, Antoine Bourseiller, Christophe Bourseiller, Geoffrey Carey, Jean-Claude Bouillaud', null, 'Yves Montand, playing himself, returns to his hometown of Marseilles to appear in an autobiographical musical. Once there, he searches for the barmaid he once loved and also encounters young hopeful Marion, giving her the chance of a lifetime.', 'Yves Montand, playing himself, returns to his hometown of Marseilles to appear in an autobiographical musical. Once there, he searches for the barmaid he once loved and also encounters young hopeful Marion, giving her the chance of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKSHv654ordqzk14qyVhwiE4Ite.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105572'),
  ('1001249783315311459', 'Three Seconds', 2017, 'Drama', 'Anton Megerdichev, Igor Grinyakin', 'Andrey Kureychik', 'Vladimir Mashkov, Ivan Kolesnikov, Viktoriya Tolstoganova, Marat Basharov, Andrey Smolyakov, Sergey Garmash, John Savage, Andrius Paulavičius', null, 'The story is set at the 1972 Munich Olympics where the U.S. team lost the basketball championship for the first time in 36 years. The final moments of the final game have become one of the most controversial events in Olympic history. With play tied, the score table horn sounded during a second free throw attempt that put the U.S. ahead by one. But the Soviets claimed they had called for a time out before the basket and confusion ensued. The clock was set back by three seconds twice in a row and the Russians finally prevailed at the very last. The U.S. protested, but a jury decided in the USSR’s favor and Team USA voted unanimously to refuse its silver medals. The Soviet players have been treated as heroes at home.', 'The story is set at the 1972 Munich Olympics where the U.S. team lost the basketball championship for the first time in 36 years. The final moments of the final game have become one of the most controversial events in Olympic history. With play tied, the score table horn sounded during a second free throw attempt that put the U.S. ahead by one. But the Soviets claimed they had called for a time out before the basket and confusion ensued. The clock was set back by three seconds twice in a row and the Russians finally prevailed at the very last. The U.S. protested, but a jury decided in the USSR’s favor and Team USA voted unanimously to refuse its silver medals. The Soviet players have been treated as heroes at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIDGJ3fxbwhmqSQ1qbBVWKdQrvy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444218'),
  ('809305100086157462', 'Three Secrets', 1950, 'Drama', 'Robert Wise, Sidney Hickox', 'Gina Kaus, Martin Rackin', 'Eleanor Parker, Patricia Neal, Ruth Roman, Frank Lovejoy, Leif Erickson, Ted de Corsia, Edmon Ryan, Larry Keating', 'NR', 'A five-year-old boy is the sole survivor of a devastating plane crash in the mountains of California. When the newspapers reveal the boy was adopted and that the crash occurred on his birthday, three women begin to ponder if it''s the son each gave up for adoption. As the three await news of his rescue at a mountain cabin, they recall incidents from five years earlier and why they were forced to give up their son.', 'A five-year-old boy is the sole survivor of a devastating plane crash in the mountains of California. When the newspapers reveal the boy was adopted and that the crash occurred on his birthday, three women begin to ponder if it''s the son each gave up for adoption. As the three await news of his rescue at a mountain cabin, they recall incidents from five years earlier and why they were forced to give up their son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KtDxzQ1MUKlCCfcNP9UcS4MHId.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43394'),
  ('443184474110276759', 'Three Sexy Meals', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Choi Woo-seong', null, 'Do Mo-se, Park Joo-bin, Lee Eun-mi, Sang Woo', null, 'Yong-hwa (Sang-woo), Marshall (Lee Eun-mi-I), Ddeok-bae (Do Mo-se) and Bang-wool (Park Joo-bin) steal from Chairman Kang and hide out in a pension in the country. They depend on each other and enjoy every day until Ddeok-bae accidentally loses their bag of money and Bang-wool falls ill. Chairman Kang is closing in on them and the four of them use their specific ''techniques'' to start a 12 hour adult program. Will they succeed?', 'Yong-hwa (Sang-woo), Marshall (Lee Eun-mi-I), Ddeok-bae (Do Mo-se) and Bang-wool (Park Joo-bin) steal from Chairman Kang and hide out in a pension in the country. They depend on each other and enjoy every day until Ddeok-bae accidentally loses their bag of money and Bang-wool falls ill. Chairman Kang is closing in on them and the four of them use their specific ''techniques'' to start a 12 hour adult program. Will they succeed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzFWahwgDB9EWFvwdC1XTvOo9Sa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425652'),
  ('171140554515055766', 'Three Sinners', 1950, 'Drama', 'André Germain, Richard Pottier, Jean Valère', 'Charles Plisnier, Maurice Barry', 'Fernandel, Mireille Perrey, Jeanne Moreau, Jacques Varennes, Colette Mareuil, Philippe Nicaud, Georges Chamarat, Line Noro', null, 'A man assists his gravely ill wife to die and wants to face justice for this, but his brothers try everything to keep the family''s name clean.', 'A man assists his gravely ill wife to die and wants to face justice for this, but his brothers try everything to keep the family''s name clean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64TNRJDkAtWSBJOeAUQlcsiGgfm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95312'),
  ('801601042626265020', 'Three Sisters', 1970, 'Drama', 'Laurence Olivier, Geoffrey Unsworth, Timothy Bryan', null, 'Jeanne Watts, Joan Plowright, Louise Purnell, Derek Jacobi, Laurence Olivier, Alan Bates, Sheila Reid, Kenneth MacKintosh', 'G', 'Nearly a thousand miles away from their beloved Moscow, Chekhov''s Three Sisters live in virtual exile. Olga , a schoolmistress, attempts to support her siblings and the home that is the sole legacy of their late father.', 'Nearly a thousand miles away from their beloved Moscow, Chekhov''s Three Sisters live in virtual exile. Olga , a schoolmistress, attempts to support her siblings and the home that is the sole legacy of their late father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quSYDoWth0qVTHafPdARrQN8MZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277396'),
  ('522003574192591541', 'Three Sisters', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Wang Bing, Wang Bing, Li Peifeng', 'Wang Bing', null, null, 'The masterful new documentary from Wang Bing is an intimate, observational portrait of a peasant family who eke out a humble existence in a small village set against the stunning mountain landscapes of China''s Yunnan province.', 'The masterful new documentary from Wang Bing is an intimate, observational portrait of a peasant family who eke out a humble existence in a small village set against the stunning mountain landscapes of China''s Yunnan province.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHW0O9Is55QMziI85b6ImzUIXWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128230'),
  ('1044346559063720872', 'Three Sisters', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kiyoshi Sasabe, Masaaki Sakae', 'Ryuji Mizutani', 'Kazue Fukiishi, Yoh Yoshida, Eri Tokunaga, Yoshie Ichige, Seishiro Nishida, Kanji Tsuda', null, 'As a family-run confectionery shop in Kagoshima struggles to stay in business with increasing competition from local supermarkets, the family''s three daughters experience various troubles in their private lives.', 'As a family-run confectionery shop in Kagoshima struggles to stay in business with increasing competition from local supermarkets, the family''s three daughters experience various troubles in their private lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Auu1stLMNogXsQ4leQo7qcPsQH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369696'),
  ('310859748364842252', 'Three Sisters', 2015, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Simon Beaufils', null, 'Laurent Stocker, Michel Vuillermoz, Coraly Zahonero, Elsa Lepoivre, Eric Ruf, Bruno Raffaelli, Florence Viala, Georgia Scalliet', null, 'For her latest project, commissioned by Arte and starring members of the Comédie-Française, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi (A Castle in Italy, Rendez-Vous 2014) shot an idiosyncratic, half-modernized adaptation of one of Chekhov’s greatest, most expansively melancholy plays.', 'For her latest project, commissioned by Arte and starring members of the Comédie-Française, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi (A Castle in Italy, Rendez-Vous 2014) shot an idiosyncratic, half-modernized adaptation of one of Chekhov’s greatest, most expansively melancholy plays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVu5C3g9tcU6F8KhPwvab9cQcNs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356631'),
  ('431950352890556898', 'Three Sisters', 2021, 'Drama', 'Lee Seung-won, Cho Young-chun, Cho Dae-yeon', 'Lee Seung-won', 'Moon So-ri, Kim Sun-young, Jang Yoon-ju, Cho Han-cheul, Hyun Bong-sik, Kim Ga-hee, Kim Ji-an, Im Hye-young', null, 'The awkward, distant, and wounded three sisters gather at their hometown for their father''s birthday. However, on the day of the party, there is a big mess because of their little brother Jin-seob''s abnormal behavior, and the past of the three sisters slowly reveals.', 'The awkward, distant, and wounded three sisters gather at their hometown for their father''s birthday. However, on the day of the party, there is a big mess because of their little brother Jin-seob''s abnormal behavior, and the past of the three sisters slowly reveals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUEwJTmbfjI4ZSPhWXw8wqbV2XJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:705950'),
  ('522719324386312370', 'Three Smart Girls', 1936, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Henry Koster, Joseph A. Valentine', 'Adele Comandini', 'Deanna Durbin, Barbara Read, Nan Grey, Charles Winninger, Binnie Barnes, Ray Milland, Nella Walker, Hobart Cavanaugh', 'NR', 'The three Craig sisters – Penny, Kay, and Joan – go to New York to stop their divorced father from marrying gold digger Donna Lyons and reunite him with their mother.', 'The three Craig sisters – Penny, Kay, and Joan – go to New York to stop their divorced father from marrying gold digger Donna Lyons and reunite him with their mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zae2mPsb621u2U4vLa2KkDGG7el.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64142'),
  ('164989732940955695', 'Three Songs About Lenin', 1934, 'Documentary', 'Dziga Vertov, Elizaveta Svilova, Ilya Kopalin', 'Dziga Vertov', 'Dolores Ibárruri, Nadezhda Krupskaya, Joseph Stalin, Vladimir Lenin', null, 'This documentary, made up of 3 episodes, is based on three songs sung by anonymous people in Soviet Russia about Vladimir Ilyich Lenin.', 'This documentary, made up of 3 episodes, is based on three songs sung by anonymous people in Soviet Russia about Vladimir Ilyich Lenin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYjdTAAvAtUyLAfrtDgRYO7bmPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92475'),
  ('392287500833793845', 'Three Songs for Benazir', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Gulistan Mirzaei, Elizabeth Mirzaei, Elizabeth Mirzaei', null, null, null, 'The story of Shaista, a young man who—newly married to Benazir and living in a camp for displaced persons in Kabul—struggles to balance his dreams of being the first from his tribe to join the Afghan National Army with the responsibilities of starting a family. Even as Shaista’s love for Benazir is palpable, the choices he must make to build a life with her have profound consequences.', 'The story of Shaista, a young man who—newly married to Benazir and living in a camp for displaced persons in Kabul—struggles to balance his dreams of being the first from his tribe to join the Afghan National Army with the responsibilities of starting a family. Even as Shaista’s love for Benazir is palpable, the choices he must make to build a life with her have profound consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Q1P44IPm9FyxBH4vmxM7pRgopP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826740'),
  ('1068163182259358744', 'Three Steps Above Heaven', 2010, 'Romance, Drama', 'Fernando González Molina, Daniel Aranyó', 'Ramón Salazar', 'María Valverde, Mario Casas, Álvaro Cervantes, Marina Salas, Luis Fernández, Nerea Camacho, Cristina Plazas, Jordi Bosch', 'PG-13', 'Babi, a sheltered upper-class girl, and Hache, a reckless rebel obsessed with illegal motorcycle races, fall into a forbidden love that pulls them deeper into passion and risk.', 'Babi, a sheltered upper-class girl, and Hache, a reckless rebel obsessed with illegal motorcycle races, fall into a forbidden love that pulls them deeper into passion and risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeWyY2s13dRlKOLk4E3TkXgM4sS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61979'),
  ('982133839500437803', 'Three Steps Over Heaven', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Luca Lucini, Umberto Riccioni Carteni, Adriana Sabbatini', 'Teresa Ciabatti, Federico Moccia', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Katy Louise Saunders, Mauro Meconi, Maria Chiara Augenti, Giulia Elettra Gorietti, Ivan Bacchi, Carmela Vincenti, Gianna Paola Scaffidi', null, 'A bad boy and a socialite girl hook-up.', 'A bad boy and a socialite girl hook-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvpElD8429AyA3SS9AQBx0gyYnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56903'),
  ('1141192167978157176', 'Three Stories', 1997, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Kira Muratova, Gennady Karyuk, Valery Makhnev', 'Renata Litvinova, Vera Storozheva, Sergei Chetvertkov', 'Sergey Makovetskiy, Leonid Kushnir, Zhan Daniel, Renata Litvinova, Ivan Okhlobystin, Oleg Tabakov, Liliya Murlykina, Natalya Buzko', null, 'A man goes to see his former schoolmate working at a boiler house and persuades him to burn in the furnace the corpse of his communal flat neighbor whom he has just murdered after a quarrel. An orphaned girl gets a job in the archives of the maternity home to find out the identity of her mother who abandoned her years earlier. She finds her, befriends her and takes the first opportunity to throw her into the sea. An old intellectual tries to explain to the neighbor’s five-year-old daughter “all the abomination of her lumpen existence”. The girl feeling hurt for her mother decides to poison the old man with arsenic.', 'A man goes to see his former schoolmate working at a boiler house and persuades him to burn in the furnace the corpse of his communal flat neighbor whom he has just murdered after a quarrel. An orphaned girl gets a job in the archives of the maternity home to find out the identity of her mother who abandoned her years earlier. She finds her, befriends her and takes the first opportunity to throw her into the sea. An old intellectual tries to explain to the neighbor’s five-year-old daughter “all the abomination of her lumpen existence”. The girl feeling hurt for her mother decides to poison the old man with arsenic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWI3iVxRN12Fdqf9yaWxqcPU1BK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149937'),
  ('998598584270202004', 'Three Stories of Love', 2015, 'Drama', 'Ryosuke Hashiguchi, Shogo Ueno', 'Ryosuke Hashiguchi', 'Atsushi Shinohara, Ryo Ikeda, Ken Mitsuishi, Tamae Ando, Hana Kino, Daisuke Kuroda, So Yamanaka, Chika Uchida', null, 'A depressed widower, a bored housewife, and a gay lawyer all intersect in this triptych of love lost.', 'A depressed widower, a bored housewife, and a gay lawyer all intersect in this triptych of love lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZjq4N4JIMlji3sdok5mQCcK6ym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362366'),
  ('821943889575364596', 'Three Strangers', 1946, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Arthur Edeson, Jean Negulesco, Max Parker', 'Howard Koch, John Huston', 'Sydney Greenstreet, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Peter Lorre, Joan Lorring, Robert Shayne, Marjorie Riordan, Arthur Shields, Rosalind Ivan', 'NR', 'On the eve of the Chinese New Year, three strangers, Crystal Shackleford, married to a wealthy philanderer; Jerome Artbutny, an outwardly respectable judge; and Johnny West, a seedy sneak thief, make a pact before a small statue of the Chinese goddess of Destiny. The threesome agree to purchase a sweepstakes ticket and share whatever winnings might accrue.', 'On the eve of the Chinese New Year, three strangers, Crystal Shackleford, married to a wealthy philanderer; Jerome Artbutny, an outwardly respectable judge; and Johnny West, a seedy sneak thief, make a pact before a small statue of the Chinese goddess of Destiny. The threesome agree to purchase a sweepstakes ticket and share whatever winnings might accrue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aK4CHMMTkwZqrdzbKgZQYmrqfU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35077'),
  ('903044036839934156', 'Three Summers', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ivo Lopes Araújo, Sandra Kogut', 'Iana Cossoy Paro, Sandra Kogut', 'Regina Casé, Rogério Fróes, Otávio Müller, Gisele Fróes, Carla Ribas, Daniel Rangel, Jéssica Ellen, Vilma Melo', null, 'Over a trio of summers, a caretaker for luxury condominiums relies on her resourcefulness and her eye for opportunity to take advantage of whatever comes her way.', 'Over a trio of summers, a caretaker for luxury condominiums relies on her resourcefulness and her eye for opportunity to take advantage of whatever comes her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wodAkfXveWidjTT2r6XEjPNu5P1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:622971'),
  ('271252008014807732', 'Three Swedes on the Reeperbahn', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Walter Boos, Olaf R. Benold', 'George Elmer', 'Uta Koepke, Tanja Scholl, Biggi Ludwig, Tobias Meister, Mick Werup, Frank Lang, Bea Fiedler, Carlos Stafford', null, 'Three Swedish girls are at boarding school and a bit bored with their lessons, so they travel to Hamburg to have a few adventures. Lil tries to get her teacher, who is staying with his girlfriend, around and the others have fun in the city''s red light district. They want to spend the night with their sister, one of the Swedes, who supposedly works there as a secretary. Soon everything ends in turbulent entanglements...', 'Three Swedish girls are at boarding school and a bit bored with their lessons, so they travel to Hamburg to have a few adventures. Lil tries to get her teacher, who is staying with his girlfriend, around and the others have fun in the city''s red light district. They want to spend the night with their sister, one of the Swedes, who supposedly works there as a secretary. Soon everything ends in turbulent entanglements...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2m59LKmn3i8J0hmwjUCtVQIhde.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240438'),
  ('33594513969098713', 'Three Swedish Girls in Upper Bavaria', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Sigi Rothemund, Franz Xaver Lederle', 'Sigi Rothemund, Erich Tomek', 'Gianni Garko, Alexander Grill, Beate Hasenau, Inge Fock, Ann Lündell, Anika Egger, Herbert Fux, Rosl Mayr', null, 'Otto runs a hotel for tourists in Tyrol but has troubles both with the economy and with his wife Olga. After a trip to Stockholm he imports three Swedish blondes who eventually save Otto from disaster, both marital and financial.', 'Otto runs a hotel for tourists in Tyrol but has troubles both with the economy and with his wife Olga. After a trip to Stockholm he imports three Swedish blondes who eventually save Otto from disaster, both marital and financial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcpDptH2QOYVEpMrZpnPEudKpH9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197640'),
  ('1003038262806965357', 'Three Texas Steers', 1939, 'Western', 'George Sherman, Ernest Miller', 'Stanley Roberts, Betty Burbridge', 'John Wayne, Ray Corrigan, Max Terhune, Carole Landis, Ralph Graves, Roscoe Ates, Collette Lyons, Billy Curtis', 'NR', 'Nancy Evans, lovely circus owner, has a ranch that she''s never visited, but for sentimental reasons won''t sell to Mike Abbott. Her partners, secretly in league with Abbott, sabotage the circus to force Nancy to sell the ranch; instead, she goes there to live. Will her neighbors, the Three Mesquiteers, be a match for the secret swindlers? And what''s so valuable about that run-down ranch anyway?', 'Nancy Evans, lovely circus owner, has a ranch that she''s never visited, but for sentimental reasons won''t sell to Mike Abbott. Her partners, secretly in league with Abbott, sabotage the circus to force Nancy to sell the ranch; instead, she goes there to live. Will her neighbors, the Three Mesquiteers, be a match for the secret swindlers? And what''s so valuable about that run-down ranch anyway?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aodTCergLgDfhPRbTISDN8abpdD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140908'),
  ('680774623650050546', 'Three the Hard Way', 1974, 'Action, Thriller', 'Gordon Parks Jr., Lucien Ballard, Gene Anderson Jr.', 'Eric Bercovici, Jerrold L. Ludwig', 'Jim Brown, Fred Williamson, Jim Kelly, Sheila Frazier, Jay Robinson, Marian Collier, Alex Rocco, Corbin Bernsen', 'R', 'After his wife is kidnapped by a group of White supremacists, a record producer teams up with a PR man and a martial artist to get her back and put a stop to their plot to poison the water supply with a toxin that only kills Black people.', 'After his wife is kidnapped by a group of White supremacists, a record producer teams up with a PR man and a martial artist to get her back and put a stop to their plot to poison the water supply with a toxin that only kills Black people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cQiPL80qZuIjHgzQYNVEfkGbFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63340'),
  ('675783628111898153', 'Three Thousand Years of Longing', 2022, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Guy Norris, Sophie Nash, Guy Norris', 'George Miller, Augusta Miller', 'Tilda Swinton, Idris Elba, Erdil Yaşaroğlu, Sabrina Elba, Sarah Houbolt, Seyithan Özdemir, Aamito Lagum, Nicolas Mouawad', 'R', 'A solitary scholar discovers an ancient bottle while on a trip to Istanbul and unleashes a djinn who offers her three wishes. Filled with reluctance, she is unable to come up with one, so the djinn tries to inspire her with his stories.', 'A solitary scholar discovers an ancient bottle while on a trip to Istanbul and unleashes a djinn who offers her three wishes. Filled with reluctance, she is unable to come up with one, so the djinn tries to inspire her with his stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nS7DNl4A7XnDncZX70UJ8ALAihF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:556694'),
  ('323770182228388661', 'Three Tickets to Hollywood', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Božidar ''Bota'' Nikolić', 'Željko Mijanović', 'Branislav Lečić, Bogdan Diklić, Ljubiša Samardžić, Vesna Stanojević, Neda Arnerić, Velimir Živojinović, Branislav ''Ciga'' Jerinić, Slobodan Ćustić', null, 'The story of three boys who, fascinated with seventh art magic, decide to escape from their remote village straight to Hollywood. In the same time, a local policeman frantically organizes a reception for the president of the state. His "strictly controlled" citizens, under the influence of events in Cuba, in 1962. start dividing in two parties, resolved to succeed where Khruschev and J.F.K. have failed.', 'The story of three boys who, fascinated with seventh art magic, decide to escape from their remote village straight to Hollywood. In the same time, a local policeman frantically organizes a reception for the president of the state. His "strictly controlled" citizens, under the influence of events in Cuba, in 1962. start dividing in two parties, resolved to succeed where Khruschev and J.F.K. have failed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8Iicvqq1sqeyQU8jlU9rfQ3yRI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17913'),
  ('715398584886105544', 'Three Tigers Against Three Tigers', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Sergio Corbucci, Giovanni Manganelli', 'Mario Amendola, Castellano, Cochi Ponzoni', 'Renato Pozzetto, Cochi Ponzoni, Enrico Montesano, Dalila Di Lazzaro, Paolo Villaggio, Giuseppe Anatrelli, Corinne Cléry, Kirsten Gille', null, 'Don Cimbolano - a priest in a small town. Oscar - a offender escaped from prison. Philip - attorney loser. They don''t lose heart and find ways out of the most incredible situations.', 'Don Cimbolano - a priest in a small town. Oscar - a offender escaped from prison. Philip - attorney loser. They don''t lose heart and find ways out of the most incredible situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3P0JJ8UNT5tCSEXBXFTwKYWvtIV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44252'),
  ('1048704537760696183', 'Three Times', 2005, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Chu Tien-Wen, Hou Hsiao-hsien', 'Shu Qi, Chang Chen, Su-jen Liao, Mei Di, Chen Shi-Zheng, Lee Pei-Hsuan, Mei Fang, Lawrence Ko Yu-Luen', null, 'In three separate segments, set respectively in 1966, 1911, and 2005, three love stories unfold between three sets of characters, under three different periods of Taiwanese history and governance.', 'In three separate segments, set respectively in 1966, 1911, and 2005, three love stories unfold between three sets of characters, under three different periods of Taiwanese history and governance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ajd6uUZchc9AR2PHDaAiI79fFUl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11554'),
  ('783166354576545373', 'Three Times Nothing', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Julien Meurice, Justinien Schricke, Nadège Loiseau', 'Niels Rahou, Nadège Loiseau', 'Antoine Bertrand, Philippe Rebbot, Côme Levin, Émilie Caen, Nadège Beausson-Diagne, Yves Yan, Yilin Yang, Hubert Myon', null, 'Twig, Cap and Rusty live however they can in the Bois de Vincennes, east of Paris. This may completely change the day they learn they are the national lottery winner – though it is less than expected! Yet, they still need to collect the money and share it in equal parts. The hardest part of all will be to resume a “normal” life, filled with surprises and contradictions.', 'Twig, Cap and Rusty live however they can in the Bois de Vincennes, east of Paris. This may completely change the day they learn they are the national lottery winner – though it is less than expected! Yet, they still need to collect the money and share it in equal parts. The hardest part of all will be to resume a “normal” life, filled with surprises and contradictions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IK57F1Ucp6lU1qJcBs5O3xSYf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783573'),
  ('1075102380766451952', 'Three to Tango', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Damon Santostefano, William Spahic, Walt Lloyd', 'Rodney Patrick Vaccaro, Aline Brosh McKenna', 'Matthew Perry, Neve Campbell, Dylan McDermott, Oliver Platt, Cylk Cozart, John C. McGinley, Bob Balaban, Deborah Rush', 'PG-13', 'Oscar and Peter land a career-making opportunity when a Chicago tycoon chooses them to compete for the design of a cultural center. The tycoon mistakenly believes that Oscar is gay and has him spy on his mistress Amy. Oscar goes along with it and ends up falling in love with Amy.', 'Oscar and Peter land a career-making opportunity when a Chicago tycoon chooses them to compete for the design of a cultural center. The tycoon mistakenly believes that Oscar is gay and has him spy on his mistress Amy. Oscar goes along with it and ends up falling in love with Amy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2EhRgWvzNa2NgoX0uModV6mEb2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10563'),
  ('478729160803526771', 'Three Touches', 2014, 'Drama', 'Marco Risi, Andrea Busiri Vici', 'Marco Risi, Francesco Frangipane, Riccardo De Torrebruna', 'Massimiliano Benvenuto, Leandro Amato, Emiliano Ragno, Antonio Folletto, Vincenzo De Michele, Gilles Rocca, Gianfranco Gallo, Valentina Lodovini', null, 'Several actors are members of a amateur soccer team. They followed in their preparations for a particular audition and in their personal life. With about 6 actors this delivers a broad picture of Italian life in which the question what it means to be a man is posed in the challenging circumstances of familily life, sex relationships, sport, cross gender roles and mafia.', 'Several actors are members of a amateur soccer team. They followed in their preparations for a particular audition and in their personal life. With about 6 actors this delivers a broad picture of Italian life in which the question what it means to be a man is posed in the challenging circumstances of familily life, sex relationships, sport, cross gender roles and mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89keDg3jpco3QUlTDHwqjSDv6jI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302802'),
  ('923614072204259950', 'Three Tough Guys', 1974, 'Crime, Action', 'Duccio Tessari, Aldo Tonti', 'Luciano Vincenzoni, Nicola Badalucco', 'Lino Ventura, Isaac Hayes, Fred Williamson, Paula Kelly, William Berger, Vittorio Sanipoli, Lorella De Luca, Mario Erpichini', 'PG', 'Isaac Hayes plays as Lee in his feature film debut, as Father Charlie and himself solve a bank robbery mystery that stretches across the city. After Lee is removed from the force due to $1,000,000 being stolen from the bank Father Charlie helps him to gain revenge for the loss of one of his friends.', 'Isaac Hayes plays as Lee in his feature film debut, as Father Charlie and himself solve a bank robbery mystery that stretches across the city. After Lee is removed from the force due to $1,000,000 being stolen from the bank Father Charlie helps him to gain revenge for the loss of one of his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loEk43YlQNvfGvuylgLDOpwo4wA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96132'),
  ('587117691714869156', 'Three Violent People', 1956, 'Western', 'Rudolph Maté, Loyal Griggs', 'James Edward Grant', 'Charlton Heston, Anne Baxter, Gilbert Roland, Tom Tryon, Forrest Tucker, Bruce Bennett, Elaine Stritch, Barton MacLane', 'NR', 'A rancher, his shady bride and his one-armed brother fight amid carpetbaggers in Texas.', 'A rancher, his shady bride and his one-armed brother fight amid carpetbaggers in Texas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osjexM9Yol8UwdTr5fce5zJkyvy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75012'),
  ('1128686586674229999', 'Three Way', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Scott Ziehl, Antonio Calvache, Jasmine Marie Alhambra', 'Russell P. Marleau', 'Dominic Purcell, Joy Bryant, Ali Larter, Desmond Harrington, Dwight Yoakam, Gina Gershon, Roxana Zal, Dan Martin', 'R', 'Lew is a small time loser with a troubled past and a very big secret. Overhearing a couple plan a kidnapping, Lew is tempted to come up with a scheme of his own. He decides to get to the victim first and then blackmail the real criminals. His plan soon spins out of control.', 'Lew is a small time loser with a troubled past and a very big secret. Overhearing a couple plan a kidnapping, Lew is tempted to come up with a scheme of his own. He decides to get to the victim first and then blackmail the real criminals. His plan soon spins out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sDNvHPwnCy6dQBU4FjSawNhrow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34601'),
  ('1015082597211952778', 'Three Wise Girls', 1932, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'William Beaudine, Ted Tetzlaff, Gene Anderson', 'Robert Riskin, Agnes Christine Johnston', 'Jean Harlow, Mae Clarke, Walter Byron, Marie Prevost, Andy Devine, Natalie Moorhead, Jameson Thomas, Lucy Beaumont', null, 'Fed up with her tiny hometown, Cassie Barnes moves to New York City to find a job. She and her two friends, Dot and Gladys, soon have romantic troubles.', 'Fed up with her tiny hometown, Cassie Barnes moves to New York City to find a job. She and her two friends, Dot and Gladys, soon have romantic troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRZ234nHQwnUaPMmFEy34Zv6dZa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227402'),
  ('220737869093347136', 'Three Wise Men and a Baby', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama', 'Terry Ingram, Graham Talbot, Nelson Talbot', 'Paul Campbell, Kimberley Sustad', 'Paul Campbell, Tyler Hynes, Andrew W. Walker, Margaret Colin, Ali Liebert, Fiona Vroom, Matt Hamilton, Paul Almeida', 'G', 'Three brothers get the surprise of their lives when they are forced to work together to care for a baby over the holidays. As they slowly get the hang of things, they find themselves on unexpected journeys of self-discovery and begin to rebuild their relationships as brothers, as well as the damaged romantic and professional relationships in their respective lives…all while rediscovering their love of Christmas.', 'Three brothers get the surprise of their lives when they are forced to work together to care for a baby over the holidays. As they slowly get the hang of things, they find themselves on unexpected journeys of self-discovery and begin to rebuild their relationships as brothers, as well as the damaged romantic and professional relationships in their respective lives…all while rediscovering their love of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yR3hrMFIiczybGN7Y8wXMjmnPfz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028541'),
  ('48159118605984834', 'Three Wiser Men And A Boy', 2024, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama', 'Terry Ingram, Nelson Talbot, Graham Talbot', 'Kimberley Sustad, Paul Campbell, Russell Hainline', 'Paul Campbell, Tyler Hynes, Andrew W. Walker, Margaret Colin, Miles Marthaller, Christopher Shyer, Erin Karpluk, Fiona Vroom', 'G', 'Five years after the events of the first film, Christmas is once again just around the corner. In a crazy turn of events, possibly brought on accidently by the brothers themselves, the director of Luke’s son Thomas’ school holiday musical steps down. Luke, desperate to make his son’s stage dreams come true, enlists the help of his brothers Taylor and Stephan. The trio also find themselves meeting their mother''s new boyfriend and the brothers grapple with their own feelings about this relationship. In true Brenner brother fashion, they are all in for a Christmas they will never forget.', 'Five years after the events of the first film, Christmas is once again just around the corner. In a crazy turn of events, possibly brought on accidently by the brothers themselves, the director of Luke’s son Thomas’ school holiday musical steps down. Luke, desperate to make his son’s stage dreams come true, enlists the help of his brothers Taylor and Stephan. The trio also find themselves meeting their mother''s new boyfriend and the brothers grapple with their own feelings about this relationship. In true Brenner brother fashion, they are all in for a Christmas they will never forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dis4s7NxEFigKawVNgQvkd48c1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1293279'),
  ('828823302532237449', 'Three Wishes', 1995, 'Fantasy, Family, Drama', 'Martha Coolidge, Johnny E. Jensen', 'Elizabeth Anderson', 'Patrick Swayze, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, Joseph Mazzello, Seth Mumy, David Marshall Grant, Jay O. Sanders, Michael O''Keefe, John Diehl', 'PG', 'While Jane Holman is driving with her two sons, she accidentally runs into a drifter, Jack McCloud, who breaks his leg. Being responsible, Jane invites Jack, and his dog, to stay at her home until his leg has healed. Jack struggles to adapt their lifestyle, and finds himself loved by the family.', 'While Jane Holman is driving with her two sons, she accidentally runs into a drifter, Jack McCloud, who breaks his leg. Being responsible, Jane invites Jack, and his dog, to stay at her home until his leg has healed. Jack struggles to adapt their lifestyle, and finds himself loved by the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qY1Mz8bPGKYmrb4kY1zm7s4480V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47939'),
  ('156961458953922730', 'Three Wishes for Cinderella', 1973, 'Fantasy, Family, Romance', 'Josef Illík, Václav Vorlíček, Michael Englberger', 'Václav Vorlíček, František Pavlíček', 'Libuše Šafránková, Pavel Trávníček, Carola Braunbock, Rolf Hoppe, Karin Lesch, Dana Hlaváčová, Jan Libíček, Vítězslav Jandák', null, 'Popelka, a resourceful and independent young girl, is a servant in her stepmother''s house and confides in her closest friend the owl. When she comes across three magical acorns, she''s granted a single wish for each one of them.', 'Popelka, a resourceful and independent young girl, is a servant in her stepmother''s house and confides in her closest friend the owl. When she comes across three magical acorns, she''s granted a single wish for each one of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WlY1JSRoDJkbPg53kxyKlHJu0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8703'),
  ('826132364558695288', 'Three Wishes for Cinderella', 2021, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Trond Tønder, Cecilie A. Mosli', 'Siv Rajendram Eliassen, Anna Bache-Wiig, Václav Vorlíček', 'Astrid S, Cengiz Al, Ellen Dorrit Petersen, Ingrid Unnur Giæver, Thorbjørn Harr, Nasrin Khusrawi, Nils Jørgen Kaalstad, Bjørn Sundquist', null, 'Cinderella, a resourceful and independent young girl, is a servant in her stepmother''s house and confides in her closest friend the owl. When she comes across three magical acorns, she''s granted a single wish for each one of them.', 'Cinderella, a resourceful and independent young girl, is a servant in her stepmother''s house and confides in her closest friend the owl. When she comes across three magical acorns, she''s granted a single wish for each one of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kqH4d9FBQv5Sel39Ns7TMd13RT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660262'),
  ('504627157419945187', 'Three Wives', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Marco Risi, Italo Petriccione', 'Silvia Napolitano, Marco Risi', 'Francesca D''Aloja, Iaia Forte, Silke, Claudio Gregori, Juan Palomino, Patricia Echegoyen, Loles León, Giuseppe Fiorello', null, 'After being abandoned on New Year''s Eve and discovering that their husbands have committed a robbery, three very different women choose to go to Argentina in search of their spouses.', 'After being abandoned on New Year''s Eve and discovering that their husbands have committed a robbery, three very different women choose to go to Argentina in search of their spouses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nT9TNNW9uF2gjK4dayiAjhwvBqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142634'),
  ('270457605382216680', 'Three Women in a Bonfire', 1979, 'Drama', 'Abel Salazar, José Ortiz Ramos', null, 'Maricruz Olivier, Pilar Pellicer, Maritza Olivares, Rogelio Guerra, Enrique Muñoz, Daniela Romo, Carlos Bravo y Fernández ''Carlhillos''', null, 'Alex, a real estate businessman, has no concerns in giving her wife every kind of freedom. They invite Gloria, an old friend of both, to spend the summer break in their countryside house next to the beach. Gloria doesn''t come alone: she comes with young Susy, her lover. Alex will use all of his charms and luxury to manipulate his new guests; meanwhile, his wife and Gloria will gang up to murder him.', 'Alex, a real estate businessman, has no concerns in giving her wife every kind of freedom. They invite Gloria, an old friend of both, to spend the summer break in their countryside house next to the beach. Gloria doesn''t come alone: she comes with young Susy, her lover. Alex will use all of his charms and luxury to manipulate his new guests; meanwhile, his wife and Gloria will gang up to murder him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apjOUtzlmV1a6GRVxzMheIHdVD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504719'),
  ('486136751858294462', 'Three Worlds', 2012, 'Drama', 'Catherine Corsini, Claire Mathon', 'Catherine Corsini, Benoît Graffin, Antoine Jaccoud', 'Raphaël Personnaz, Clotilde Hesme, Arta Dobroshi, Reda Kateb, Alban Aumard, Adèle Haenel, Jean-Pierre Malo, Laurent Capelluto', null, 'Al, a young man from a modest background is about to marry his boss’ daughter, along with succeeding him as the head of a car dealership. One night, while coming back from his bachelor party, he is guilty of a hit-and-run accident, urged by his two childhood friends present in the car. The next day, gnawed with guilt, Al decides to inquire about his victim. What he does not know is that Juliette, a young woman, has witnessed the entire accident from her balcony.', 'Al, a young man from a modest background is about to marry his boss’ daughter, along with succeeding him as the head of a car dealership. One night, while coming back from his bachelor party, he is guilty of a hit-and-run accident, urged by his two childhood friends present in the car. The next day, gnawed with guilt, Al decides to inquire about his victim. What he does not know is that Juliette, a young woman, has witnessed the entire accident from her balcony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLTISWu9tOsiPrZ6l3eEZuF2YNO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126321'),
  ('916381352150662512', 'Three Years Without God', 1976, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Mario O''Hara, Conrado Baltazar', 'Mario O''Hara', 'Nora Aunor, Christopher de Leon, Bembol Roco, Orlando Nadres, Peque Gallaga, Mario Escudero, Yolanda Luna, Edwin O''Hara', null, 'Set during World War II, Rosario, a school teacher, enters a forbidden relationship with a Japanese soldier, Masugi.', 'Set during World War II, Rosario, a school teacher, enters a forbidden relationship with a Japanese soldier, Masugi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1hba8ZgaaqSaLIqxC2sV7NoJBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253038'),
  ('652637560170194974', 'Three-60', 2013, 'Drama', 'Alejandro Ezcurdia, Johnny Yebra', 'Luiso Berdejo', 'Raúl Mérida, Sara Sálamo, Geraldine Chaplin, Joaquim de Almeida, Marta Martín, Guillermo Estrella, Adam Jezierski, Manuel Morón', null, 'Guillermo (Raúl Mérida) is a passionate young college surf casually discovering an old photographic film. In the photographs are enigmatic images and a familiar face, leading Guillermo to embark on a perilous investigation with the help of Daniela, a student from Fine Arts, and his brother, a computer expert. None of them is aware that such research can change their lives forever.', 'Guillermo (Raúl Mérida) is a passionate young college surf casually discovering an old photographic film. In the photographs are enigmatic images and a familiar face, leading Guillermo to embark on a perilous investigation with the help of Daniela, a student from Fine Arts, and his brother, a computer expert. None of them is aware that such research can change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHcHLU30pJecI8c9P2wsBUzNNql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184680'),
  ('552980079941058305', 'Three-Step Dance', 2003, 'Drama', 'Salvatore Mereu, Tommaso Borgstrom, Renato Berta', 'Salvatore Mereu', 'Yaël Abecassis, Michele Carboni, Caroline Ducey', null, 'Four separate-but-interconnected stories - one for each season - about life in Sardinia.', 'Four separate-but-interconnected stories - one for each season - about life in Sardinia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmh59PyHsBRduw2KQYNDhOdMYV4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3168'),
  ('667443094751490936', 'Three... Extremes', 2004, 'Horror', 'Park Hyun-won, Fruit Chan, Takashi Miike', 'Haruko Fukushima, Lilian Lee Bik-Wah, Park Chan-wook', 'Kyoko Hasegawa, Atsuro Watabe, Mai Suzuki, Yuu Suzuki, Mitsuru Akaboshi, Bai Ling, Pauline Lau, Tony Leung Ka-fai', null, 'Features an anthology centred on the experiences of a witch doctor, a film-maker and a disgruntled extra determined to take revenge on him, and a novelist as well as her twin sister.', 'Features an anthology centred on the experiences of a witch doctor, a film-maker and a disgruntled extra determined to take revenge on him, and a novelist as well as her twin sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0UzUF15suxLatzvNK3TQKxp10h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33908'),
  ('180696355141022802', 'Three''s a Crowd', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Rudolf Ising', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Bernice Hansen, Jack Mercer', null, 'An old man is reading a book by the fire. The clock strikes 8, and he heads off to bed. From his book, Alice in Wonderland, out crawls Alice, who turns the radio to the title tune. This wakes up Rip Van Winkle; Alice then rouses the Three Musketeers, who sing a bit. Next tune: Nero fiddles, Rome burns, and Cleopatra sizzles in a slinky dance. Uncle Tom sings a spiritual as Mr. Hyde sneaks up and abducts Alice. Tarzan to the rescue, along with several other characters who mount a spirited attack using such office supplies as pen points, matches, and a fountain pen. They box him up and carry him off.', 'An old man is reading a book by the fire. The clock strikes 8, and he heads off to bed. From his book, Alice in Wonderland, out crawls Alice, who turns the radio to the title tune. This wakes up Rip Van Winkle; Alice then rouses the Three Musketeers, who sing a bit. Next tune: Nero fiddles, Rome burns, and Cleopatra sizzles in a slinky dance. Uncle Tom sings a spiritual as Mr. Hyde sneaks up and abducts Alice. Tarzan to the rescue, along with several other characters who mount a spirited attack using such office supplies as pen points, matches, and a fountain pen. They box him up and carry him off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cCHzHbfIdJCb6JB4JVJkGcSj75.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156476'),
  ('448589239504078276', 'Threesome', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alexander Gruszynski, Andrew Fleming, Phil Robinson', 'Andrew Fleming', 'Lara Flynn Boyle, Stephen Baldwin, Josh Charles, Alexis Arquette, Martha Gehman, Mark Arnold, Michele Matheson, Joanne Baron', 'R', 'At a sizable public college, high-minded student Eddy is forced to room with the slovenly Stuart, but the pair strike up a surprising friendship. When attractive co-ed Alex is assigned to live with the two male students because of her gender-neutral name, a roundabout love triangle ensues. Eddy secretly yearns for Stuart, who wants Alex, but she prefers Eddy. The complex situation leads to sexual experimentation and strained relationships.', 'At a sizable public college, high-minded student Eddy is forced to room with the slovenly Stuart, but the pair strike up a surprising friendship. When attractive co-ed Alex is assigned to live with the two male students because of her gender-neutral name, a roundabout love triangle ensues. Eddy secretly yearns for Stuart, who wants Alex, but she prefers Eddy. The complex situation leads to sexual experimentation and strained relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vR6qwjChOV4Z9940VA9chucNpne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10635'),
  ('271819822338161904', 'Threesome', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Nicolas Monette, Tobie Marier Robitaille', 'Benoît Pelletier', 'Mélissa Désormeaux-Poulin, Martin Matte, Bénédicte Décary, Geneviève Schmidt, Anne-Élisabeth Bossé, Karine Gonthier-Hyndman, Rémi-Pierre Paquin, Julianne Côté', null, 'Estelle, 34, wife and mother of the family without history, sinks into a tidy, predictable life. But a series of events puts her identity in question. Worse, she realizes that the crux of the crisis is sexual. She decides to organize a "threesome". Challenge away from his comfort zone. She plunges into this mad quest, resulting with her spouse who feels just as incompetent.', 'Estelle, 34, wife and mother of the family without history, sinks into a tidy, predictable life. But a series of events puts her identity in question. Worse, she realizes that the crux of the crisis is sexual. She decides to organize a "threesome". Challenge away from his comfort zone. She plunges into this mad quest, resulting with her spouse who feels just as incompetent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLAwreMkJIaaChVdGZ9qmdtxzU5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465260'),
  ('332187646486286680', 'Threshold', 1981, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Richard Pearce, Michel Brault', 'James Salter', 'Donald Sutherland, John Marley, Sharon Acker, Mare Winningham, Jeff Goldblum, Michael Lerner, Richard Blackburn, Michael C. Gwynne', 'PG', 'Celebrated heart surgeon Thomas Vrain supports the research of an offbeat scientist who has invented an artificial heart. Against the advice of the Ethics Committee, Dr. Vrain decides to perform the first artificial heart transplant.', 'Celebrated heart surgeon Thomas Vrain supports the research of an offbeat scientist who has invented an artificial heart. Against the advice of the Ethics Committee, Dr. Vrain decides to perform the first artificial heart transplant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPsU7FtLgKnfNS7IdKmS5upa8AF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241939'),
  ('1073040228664442128', 'Threshold', 2003, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Chuck Bowman', 'Kim LeMasters', 'Nicholas Lea, Jamie Luner, Steve Bacic, David Lipper, Teryl Rothery, Karl Pruner, Anthony Sherwood, Marie Ward', null, 'Alien seeds hitch a ride to earth in a space shuttle crew and begin to grow. When their numbers reach the Threshold amount they will be an unstoppable swarm.', 'Alien seeds hitch a ride to earth in a space shuttle crew and begin to grow. When their numbers reach the Threshold amount they will be an unstoppable swarm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JzNAa8uqEcIbYMTNE0ZMCypoe7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33064'),
  ('12340704304189255', 'Thrill of the Hills', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Richard Roy, Yves Bélanger', 'Michel Michaud, Richard Roy', 'Antoine Olivier Pilon, Guillaume Lemay-Thivierge, Antoine Bertrand, Evelyne Brochu, Anick Lemay, Patrice Robitaille, Paul Doucet, Geneviève Brouillette', null, 'In order to to see his idol, Jimi Hendrix, a twelve year old boy attempts a journey from his Quebec village to Woodstock.', 'In order to to see his idol, Jimi Hendrix, a twelve year old boy attempts a journey from his Quebec village to Woodstock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kNqBGEBdiazxU4VHEP72wXv11u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75590'),
  ('858006301048016286', 'Thriller 40', 2023, 'Documentary, Music', 'Nelson George, Justin Kane', null, 'Michael Jackson, Quincy Jones, Paul McCartney, Usher, Mary J. Blige, Mark Ronson, Ed Eckstine, John Branca', 'NR', 'Forty years after the release of Michael Jackson’s ‘Thriller,’ the best-selling album of all-time, director Nelson George takes fans back in time to the making of a pop masterpiece, featuring never-before-seen footage and candid interviews.', 'Forty years after the release of Michael Jackson’s ‘Thriller,’ the best-selling album of all-time, director Nelson George takes fans back in time to the making of a pop masterpiece, featuring never-before-seen footage and candid interviews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LOKk1Ca1YaCb3EjTEMDJdPbQxN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1031774'),
