  ('525671298833223586', 'Through the Fields', 2015, 'Drama', 'Fabien Cavacas, Camille Melvil, Denis Gaubert', 'Fabien Cavacas, Camille Melvil', 'Pierre Prieur, Maxime Taffanel, Théo Pittaluga, Philippe Frécon, Claire Semet, Stéphane Bernard', null, 'Lucas is 22. He plays soccer with his local club, lives with his parents with his younger brother Théo, 17. Théo is attracted to boys, and has only confided in his brother. Théo''s difference from others forces him to live a secret life. One evening, spurred on by his need for affection he decides to meet up with an older man at a local hotel.', 'Lucas is 22. He plays soccer with his local club, lives with his parents with his younger brother Théo, 17. Théo is attracted to boys, and has only confided in his brother. Théo''s difference from others forces him to live a secret life. One evening, spurred on by his need for affection he decides to meet up with an older man at a local hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kselRrsZBMtaEyAzU0QeNVyM9fb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552277'),
