  ('178636534505050803', 'Throw Away Your Books, Rally in the Streets', 1971, 'Drama', 'Shūji Terayama, Takase Usui', 'Shūji Terayama', 'Hideaki Sasaki, Masahiro Saito, Yukiko Kobayashi, Fudeko Tanaka, Sei Hiraizumi, Keiko Niitaka, Akihiro Miwa, J.A. Seazer', null, 'An experimental, psychedelic odyssey through Japanese subculture experienced via the eyes of a disillusioned young man, who must contend with intense familial dysfunction, psychosexual alienation, and existentialist malaise.', 'An experimental, psychedelic odyssey through Japanese subculture experienced via the eyes of a disillusioned young man, who must contend with intense familial dysfunction, psychosexual alienation, and existentialist malaise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TW1nVMOKzly6q1eoAldfZ3HsP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104549'),
  ('679767294859603290', 'Throw Down', 2004, 'Drama, Action', 'Johnnie To, Cheng Siu-Keung, Pad Chan Wai-Hung', 'Yau Nai-Hoi, Yip Tin-Shing, Au Kin-Yee', 'Louis Koo, Aaron Kwok, Cherrie Ying Choi-Yi, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Lo Hoi-Pang, Calvin Choi Yat-Chi', null, 'A former Judo champion is given the chance to redeem himself after he befriends a competitor and an aspiring singer.', 'A former Judo champion is given the chance to redeem himself after he befriends a competitor and an aspiring singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17pG3CUE1kAgKglQRB4qZYWGNsw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25664'),
  ('247662206221559457', 'Throw Momma from the Train', 1987, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Danny DeVito, Barry Sonnenfeld, Joe Napolitano', 'Stu Silver', 'Danny DeVito, Billy Crystal, Kim Greist, Anne Ramsey, Kate Mulgrew, Branford Marsalis, Rob Reiner, Bruce Kirby', 'PG-13', 'Larry Donner, an author with a cruel ex-wife, teaches a writing workshop in which one of his students, Owen, is fed up with his domineering mother. When Owen watches a Hitchcock classic that seems to mirror his own life, he decides to put the movie''s plot into action and offers to kill Larry''s ex-wife, if Larry promises to murder his mom. Before Larry gets a chance to react to the plan, it seems that Owen has already set things in motion.', 'Larry Donner, an author with a cruel ex-wife, teaches a writing workshop in which one of his students, Owen, is fed up with his domineering mother. When Owen watches a Hitchcock classic that seems to mirror his own life, he decides to put the movie''s plot into action and offers to kill Larry''s ex-wife, if Larry promises to murder his mom. Before Larry gets a chance to react to the plan, it seems that Owen has already set things in motion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ap0Wo7hNS6WW1wdPOKYM3SNpewY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11896'),
  ('301707259727488898', 'Thru the Mirror', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'David Hand', null, 'Walt Disney, Billy Bletcher, Pinto Colvig, James MacDonald, Clarence Nash, Bill Thompson', null, 'Mickey has been reading Alice in Wonderland, and falls asleep. He finds himself on the other side of the mirror, where the furniture is alive.', 'Mickey has been reading Alice in Wonderland, and falls asleep. He finds himself on the other side of the mirror, where the furniture is alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykONqQgAnLDySxbXHwmFzmueWO3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67661'),
  ('323663687466543312', 'Thudarum', 2025, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Tharun Moorthy, Shaji Kumar, Binu Pappu', 'Tharun Moorthy, KR Sunil', 'Mohanlal, Shobana, Prakash Varma, Maniyanpilla Raju, Farhaan Faasil, Binu Pappu, Arsha Baiju, Irshad', 'R', 'A taxi driver finds himself embroiled in a dangerous conspiracy after his car is confiscated by a corrupt police officer.', 'A taxi driver finds himself embroiled in a dangerous conspiracy after his car is confiscated by a corrupt police officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOTDBabtxHA6szYKQNQe9Y7rFlv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1261125'),
  ('268892605707668366', 'Thug Life', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Ravi K. Chandran, Mani Ratnam, Sanjana Krishnamoorthy', 'Mani Ratnam', 'Kamal Haasan, Silambarasan, Trisha Krishnan, Ashok Selvan, Abhirami, Nassar, Joju George, Ali Fazal', 'NR', 'In a world ruled by crime and betrayal, mafia kingpin Sakthivel and his brother Manikkam rescue a young boy, Amaran, during a violent police shootout and raise him as their own. Years later, when an assassination attempt shakes Sakthivel''s empire, suspicion turns inward. Consumed by vengeance, Sakthivel sets out to destroy the very family he once built.', 'In a world ruled by crime and betrayal, mafia kingpin Sakthivel and his brother Manikkam rescue a young boy, Amaran, during a violent police shootout and raise him as their own. Years later, when an assassination attempt shakes Sakthivel''s empire, suspicion turns inward. Consumed by vengeance, Sakthivel sets out to destroy the very family he once built.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DmBbUtbA3T9sdVXDgIJ8bsIDw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1045021'),
  ('843270106800643557', 'Thugocratie', 2018, 'Thriller', 'FGKO, Blaise Basdevant', 'Fabrice Garçon', 'Salim Kéchiouche, Abel Jafri, Hichem Yacoubi, Jo Prestia, Azedine Kasri, Hedi Bouchenafa, Pierre Abbou, Adrien Vannec', null, 'Voyoucratie is FGKO’s new film project. It’s a dramatic fiction about a young gangster’s chaotic path into life crushed by a criminal universe that he can’t escape from. It’s also about a frozen portrait of a youth trapped by a system that leads you to delinquency as the only way to exist. The pitch: Sam, a little bandit, finds himself trapped by a corrupted police officer who forces him to get information about Ali, one of the high crime boss known to be very dangerous.', 'Voyoucratie is FGKO’s new film project. It’s a dramatic fiction about a young gangster’s chaotic path into life crushed by a criminal universe that he can’t escape from. It’s also about a frozen portrait of a youth trapped by a system that leads you to delinquency as the only way to exist. The pitch: Sam, a little bandit, finds himself trapped by a corrupted police officer who forces him to get information about Ali, one of the high crime boss known to be very dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjZyUy9Oes68p5NB796wsqSX09z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208628'),
  ('720192889648462727', 'Thugs of Hindostan', 2018, 'Adventure, Action', 'Manush Nandan, Vijay Krishna Acharya, Edward Said', 'Vijay Krishna Acharya', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Aamir Khan, Katrina Kaif, Fatima Sana Shaikh, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Lloyd Owen, Surendra Pal, Shane John Kruger', null, 'After the British company’s officer Clive takes over the kingdom of Mirza, Princess Zafira and Khudabaksh aka Azaad form a band of rebel pirates who swear to defeat the English officer and win their freedom back. The British Company in return, hire the wily thug Firangi track Azaad’s gang and thwart his plans.', 'After the British company’s officer Clive takes over the kingdom of Mirza, Princess Zafira and Khudabaksh aka Azaad form a band of rebel pirates who swear to defeat the English officer and win their freedom back. The British Company in return, hire the wily thug Firangi track Azaad’s gang and thwart his plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eonEvymAPpXvWvbBu21HYJx8VdS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472138'),
  ('311755216383954195', 'Thugs with Dirty Mugs', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Tex Avery', 'Dave Monahan', 'Tex Avery, Mel Blanc, John Deering', 'NR', 'Killer Diller and his gang are robbing every bank in town in numerical order (except the 13th National Bank, which they skip out of superstition). Despite their predictable actions, the police are unable to catch them...until they get a tip from an unlikely source.', 'Killer Diller and his gang are robbing every bank in town in numerical order (except the 13th National Bank, which they skip out of superstition). Despite their predictable actions, the police are unable to catch them...until they get a tip from an unlikely source.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWC6p7DB4qO3DTrR8DspXVV52N3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100373'),
  ('755133387691724470', 'Thulladha Manamum Thullum', 1999, 'Romance', 'Ezhil', 'Ezhil', 'Vijay, Simran, Manivannan, Dhamu, Maayi Sundar', null, 'A struggling singer feels guilty about a girl losing her eyesight; to meet the cost of her eye transplant surgery, he offers his kidney to a rich man.', 'A struggling singer feels guilty about a girl losing her eyesight; to meet the cost of her eye transplant surgery, he offers his kidney to a rich man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTCPdMsrntsDDezIBVcB6pNQMwJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78644'),
  ('667065999614743207', 'Thumb Fun', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Robert McKimson, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky Pig regrets picking up a hitchhiking Daffy Duck, whose anarchic driving habits forced on Porky result in the two being apprehended.', 'Porky Pig regrets picking up a hitchhiking Daffy Duck, whose anarchic driving habits forced on Porky result in the two being apprehended.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UMP1qmHj7wR3DFkki2Z7ia31ec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235942'),
  ('198986003996083845', 'Thumb Wars: The Phantom Cuticle', 1999, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Action', 'Steve Oedekerk', 'Steve Oedekerk', 'Steve Oedekerk, Andrea Fears, Ross Shafer, Rob Paulsen, Paul Greenberg, Jim Jackman, Mark DeCarlo, Jim Hope', 'NR', 'The hilarious story of a restless young farm-thumb, Loke Groundrunner, and his tasty companion, Princess Bunhead, who go on an quest to combat Black Helmet Man and the Evil Thumbpire. This is the first film of the hilarious ''Thumbs!'' franchise.', 'The hilarious story of a restless young farm-thumb, Loke Groundrunner, and his tasty companion, Princess Bunhead, who go on an quest to combat Black Helmet Man and the Evil Thumbpire. This is the first film of the hilarious ''Thumbs!'' franchise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yI2W1hFCMqiv8Zv0r9619wk2QKk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14962'),
  ('373985646418636766', 'Thumbelina', 1964, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Romance', 'Leonid Amalrik, Mikhail Druyan', 'Nikolay Erdman', 'Erast Garin, Sergei Martinson, Georgiy Vitsin, Mikhail Yanshin, Igor Vlasov', null, 'A story based on the popular Hans Christian Anderson fairy tale "Thumbelina".', 'A story based on the popular Hans Christian Anderson fairy tale "Thumbelina".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQ6MtvrcSp43cPnKbYLSEkGolVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85035'),
  ('766041708886452108', 'Thumbelina', 1978, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Yugo Serikawa', 'Ikuko Ōyabu', 'Kazuko Sugiyama, Mariko Miyagi, Kyôko Kishida, Masako Nozawa, Kosei Tomita, Ichiro Nagai, Kazue Takahashi, Noriko Ohara', null, 'A tiny girl, only as long as a man''s thumb, is born to a childless woman, abducted by frogs who want her to marry their son, but escaping instead (with the help of a bumblebee) to find a real prince without having to kiss the frog first.', 'A tiny girl, only as long as a man''s thumb, is born to a childless woman, abducted by frogs who want her to marry their son, but escaping instead (with the help of a bumblebee) to find a real prince without having to kiss the frog first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggviBpwVhM9eEs3oiPaTmD6lMgR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86646'),
  ('832014641231954210', 'Thumbelina', 1992, 'Family, Adventure, Animation', 'Masakazu Higuchi, Chinami Namba', 'Jack Olesker', 'Susan Blu', 'G', 'The dam where Thumbelina and her father live is breaking due to the rising waters in the nearby pond. Father worries that when spring comes, the melting snows will rise the water higher than ever causing the dam to crack and water to flow over the meadow, thus drowning the little people who live there. Father believes he is too old to take on the journey to find the prince and warn him and his people, so he asks his daughter to go instead. Thumbelina agrees, but in her journey she mets a great deal of characters, both good and evil. To someone not bigger than a human''s thumb, dealing with the evil intentions of Mona, a greedy mouse, will prove to be a big challenge.', 'The dam where Thumbelina and her father live is breaking due to the rising waters in the nearby pond. Father worries that when spring comes, the melting snows will rise the water higher than ever causing the dam to crack and water to flow over the meadow, thus drowning the little people who live there. Father believes he is too old to take on the journey to find the prince and warn him and his people, so he asks his daughter to go instead. Thumbelina agrees, but in her journey she mets a great deal of characters, both good and evil. To someone not bigger than a human''s thumb, dealing with the evil intentions of Mona, a greedy mouse, will prove to be a big challenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUvD88TzKCYs8a2kLAVyvS17hD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228539'),
  ('84368375638710311', 'Thumbelina', 1994, 'Animation, Fantasy, Romance, Family', 'Don Bluth, Gary Goldman, Dave Kupczyk', 'Don Bluth', 'Jodi Benson, Gino Conforti, Barbara Cook, Will Ryan, June Foray, Kenneth Mars, Gary Imhoff, Joe Lynch', 'G', 'Born of a flower and growing to only a couple of inches tall, poor Thumbelina is worried she''ll never meet someone her own size, until she happens to catch the eye of Prince Cornelius of the Fairies. Just as soon as she finds love, however, it''s torn away when she''s kidnapped by Ms. Toad. Now Thumbelina has to escape Ms. Toad''s grasp and search for Prince Cornelius. Luckily, there''s a whole city of animals willing to help.', 'Born of a flower and growing to only a couple of inches tall, poor Thumbelina is worried she''ll never meet someone her own size, until she happens to catch the eye of Prince Cornelius of the Fairies. Just as soon as she finds love, however, it''s torn away when she''s kidnapped by Ms. Toad. Now Thumbelina has to escape Ms. Toad''s grasp and search for Prince Cornelius. Luckily, there''s a whole city of animals willing to help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBvSSfwAKgcjF4eyaeNSzTCpfaF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28032'),
  ('592142577612715074', 'Thumbsucker', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joaquín Baca-Asay, Mike Mills', 'Mike Mills', 'Lou Taylor Pucci, Tilda Swinton, Vincent D''Onofrio, Keanu Reeves, Benjamin Bratt, Kelli Garner, Chase Offerle, Vince Vaughn', 'R', 'Justin Cobb, a teenager in suburban Oregon, copes with his thumb-sucking problem, romance, and his diagnosis with ADHD and subsequent experience using Ritalin.', 'Justin Cobb, a teenager in suburban Oregon, copes with his thumb-sucking problem, romance, and his diagnosis with ADHD and subsequent experience using Ritalin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXC029FtR06qkT8S6zBQ26uJczu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1546'),
  ('709304067238498423', 'Thumper', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jordan Ross, Doug Emmett', 'Jordan Ross', 'Eliza Taylor, Pablo Schreiber, Lena Headey, Ben Feldman, Daniel Webber, Brigitte Kali Canales, Jazzy De Lisser, Grant Harvey', 'NR', 'In a town of low-income and fractured families, a group of teens are lured into working for a dangerous drug dealer. A new girl arrives who hides a dangerous secret that will impact everybody and change their lives forever.', 'In a town of low-income and fractured families, a group of teens are lured into working for a dangerous drug dealer. A new girl arrives who hides a dangerous secret that will impact everybody and change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98aGP5j9vF51UwIusxq6OX947Rf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426260'),
  ('413750531940092947', 'Thunder', 1982, 'Fantasy, Mystery, Animation', 'Takashi Ito', null, 'Seiko Nakano', null, 'A woman’s face disappearing behind, and emerging from, a pair of hands. Flashing lights. An empty building full of dark hallways. Designs drawn in the air with light and long-exposure cinematography.', 'A woman’s face disappearing behind, and emerging from, a pair of hands. Flashing lights. An empty building full of dark hallways. Designs drawn in the air with light and long-exposure cinematography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSTRMPQRQruzN2Fp4kOHiACh1K5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279608'),
  ('919407789596699218', 'Thunder', 1983, 'Action', 'Fabrizio De Angelis, Goffredo Unger', 'Dardano Sacchetti', 'Bo Svenson, Mark Gregory, Raimund Harmstorf, Valeria Ross, Paolo Malco, Bruno Corazzari, Antonio Sabàto, Michele Mirabella', null, 'A native America named Thunder returns home only to find that his ancestral burial ground is being destroyed by construction workers. He tries to put a stop to it, but the law is not only not on his side, but he is banished from town, beaten up, and left for dead. Now he wants his revenge...', 'A native America named Thunder returns home only to find that his ancestral burial ground is being destroyed by construction workers. He tries to put a stop to it, but the law is not only not on his side, but he is banished from town, beaten up, and left for dead. Now he wants his revenge...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDRE9gDaYZc84DQLR7CaOB8Pxyo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109104'),
  ('417998897913990054', 'Thunder', 2022, 'History, Drama', 'Carmen Jaquier, Caroline Ronzon, Natalia Ducrey', 'Carmen Jaquier', 'Lilith Grasmug, Mermoz Melchior, Benjamin Python, Noah Watzlawick, Léa Gigon, Diana Gervalla, Lou Iff, Sabine Timoteo', null, 'Summer 1900, Switzerland. Elisabeth, 17, is about to take her vows when the sudden death of her older sister forces her to leave the convent and return to the family farm. Stifled by the suffocating and strict rules of the village, walking in her sister’s step to uncover the mystery of her death, Elisabeth is slowly driven to rebel against the local order and for her right to live her life.', 'Summer 1900, Switzerland. Elisabeth, 17, is about to take her vows when the sudden death of her older sister forces her to leave the convent and return to the family farm. Stifled by the suffocating and strict rules of the village, walking in her sister’s step to uncover the mystery of her death, Elisabeth is slowly driven to rebel against the local order and for her right to live her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kLez8pXPbddtiIYUluDbBrDYXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000548'),
  ('104280039480522129', 'Thunder 2', 1987, 'Action, Drama', 'Fabrizio De Angelis, Rita Agostini, Sergio D''Offizi', 'Fabrizio De Angelis', 'Mark Gregory, Raimund Harmstorf, Karen Reel, Bo Svenson, William Rice, Vic Roych, Clayton Tevis, Darla Procter', null, 'Indian sheriff Thunder is transferred to a small town in the desert. He learns that the corrupt deputy is paid by the drug mob. To protect himself, the deputy sets a trap for Thunder and gets him convicted as dealer. Thunder manages to break out of the brutal prison camp and takes bloody revenge. However he cannot sufficiently protect his pregnant wife.', 'Indian sheriff Thunder is transferred to a small town in the desert. He learns that the corrupt deputy is paid by the drug mob. To protect himself, the deputy sets a trap for Thunder and gets him convicted as dealer. Thunder manages to break out of the brutal prison camp and takes bloody revenge. However he cannot sufficiently protect his pregnant wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIUmuLfDgzdFkhjOgeRcutIfwTn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148278'),
  ('283397110910809459', 'Thunder 3', 1988, 'Drama, Action', 'Federico Del Zoppo, Sergio D''Offizi, Fabrizio De Angelis', 'Fabrizio De Angelis', 'Mark Gregory, John Phillip Law, Horst Schön, Werner Pochath, Ingrid Lawrence, Jeffrey Domo, Bruce Miles', null, 'They took his wife... but he''s still Walking Tall, they drew First Blood, but he''s gonna fight back like Billy Jack.', 'They took his wife... but he''s still Walking Tall, they drew First Blood, but he''s gonna fight back like Billy Jack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6s0ERWof5gEPlhviwjJrJNRdmsj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148280'),
  ('820537321405006035', 'Thunder Among the Leaves', 1958, 'Drama', 'Enrique Wallfisch, Armando Bó, Carlos E. López', 'Augusto Roa Bastos', 'Armando Bó, Isabel Sarli, Ernesto Báez, Andrés Laszlo, Victorino Baez Irala, Raul Valentino Benítez, Ernesto Báez, Félix Ribero', null, 'Deep in the jungle, a drifter attempts to inspire revolt against his cruel boss’s slave labor practices, made more difficult by the arrival of the boss’s beautiful wife.', 'Deep in the jungle, a drifter attempts to inspire revolt against his cruel boss’s slave labor practices, made more difficult by the arrival of the boss’s beautiful wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fu2sc2zxpRNyq1ghMJAzrEGJ5lt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398365'),
  ('629769496255348288', 'Thunder and Lightning', 1977, 'Action, Comedy', 'Corey Allen, James Pergola, Lewis Teague', 'William Hjortsberg', 'David Carradine, Kate Jackson, Roger C. Carmel, Sterling Holloway, Eddie Barth, Ron Feinberg, George Murdock, Patrick Cranshaw', 'PG', 'A young man who hauls liquor for moonshiners comes up against a competing gang of moonshiners who intend to get rid of him and take over his operation.', 'A young man who hauls liquor for moonshiners comes up against a competing gang of moonshiners who intend to get rid of him and take over his operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaUHoy2TPK75ZLda0veH6OWSFuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84080'),
  ('694139106280004030', 'Thunder at the Border', 1966, 'Adventure, Western, Action', 'Alfred Vohrer, Karl Löb', 'C.B. Taylor, David DeReszke, Harald G. Petersson', 'Rod Cameron, Pierre Brice, Marie Versini, Todd Armstrong, Harald Leipnitz, Viktor de Kowa, Rik Battaglia, Jörg Marquardt', 'NR', 'Firehand and his Apache friend Winnetou are determined to get justice for the murder of four young braves. They set off to track down the gang responsible for the horrendous act.', 'Firehand and his Apache friend Winnetou are determined to get justice for the murder of four young braves. They set off to track down the gang responsible for the horrendous act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sitZXB3DjPSpkJwu7DrUlqcTvm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9629'),
  ('1013762046981690655', 'Thunder Bay', 1953, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Anthony Mann, William H. Daniels, John Sherwood', 'Gil Doud, John Michael Hayes', 'James Stewart, Joanne Dru, Gilbert Roland, Dan Duryea, Jay C. Flippen, Marcia Henderson, Robert Monet, Antonio Moreno', null, 'Shrimpers and oilmen clash when an ambitious wildcatter begins constructing an off-shore oilrig.', 'Shrimpers and oilmen clash when an ambitious wildcatter begins constructing an off-shore oilrig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLGtRDeGvojKjUFhsCPX15VbhSv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37380'),
  ('615594752081884302', 'Thunder Chase', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Zhang Yingli, Chen Hao-nan', 'Fang Lan', 'Liu Mu, Elaija Chekhov, Liang Ye Wen, Xiao Xiao, Zhao Qihang', null, 'Thunder, a veteran who used to be a private bodyguard abroad, learned that his son Leo was lured by foreign gangs to use it as a bargaining chip in a hunting game for living people. Thunder and two friends brought equipment into the jungle of a foreign country and fought several times. Save the son, but the brother becomes a hostage. At the scene of the strangulation, Thunder was willing to change her life. At this time, a woman he had saved appeared. It turned out that she was the boss of the hunting and killing organization. Was she acquainted or not saved? Or, in the face of the red-eye bad guy, can she turn the tide?', 'Thunder, a veteran who used to be a private bodyguard abroad, learned that his son Leo was lured by foreign gangs to use it as a bargaining chip in a hunting game for living people. Thunder and two friends brought equipment into the jungle of a foreign country and fought several times. Save the son, but the brother becomes a hostage. At the scene of the strangulation, Thunder was willing to change her life. At this time, a woman he had saved appeared. It turned out that she was the boss of the hunting and killing organization. Was she acquainted or not saved? Or, in the face of the red-eye bad guy, can she turn the tide?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjk9OLSRSMhXWNqOn0XlgtBTQNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:797501'),
  ('1007174692047889885', 'Thunder Force', 2021, 'Comedy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Max Cahn, Ben Falcone, Barry Peterson', 'Ben Falcone', 'Melissa McCarthy, Octavia Spencer, Jason Bateman, Bobby Cannavale, Pom Klementieff, Melissa Leo, Taylor Mosby, Marcella Lowery', 'PG-13', 'In a world where supervillains are commonplace, two estranged childhood best friends reunite after one devises a treatment that gives them powers to protect their city.', 'In a world where supervillains are commonplace, two estranged childhood best friends reunite after one devises a treatment that gives them powers to protect their city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mKMWP5OokB7QpcOMA1yl8BXFAF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615678'),
  ('677050386251311785', 'Thunder in Paradise', 1993, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Douglas Schwartz, James Pergola, Gregory J. Barnett', 'Michael Berk', 'Hulk Hogan, Chris Lemmon, Carol Alt, Sam J. Jones, Charlotte Rae, Michael Edwards, Felicity Waterman, Robin Weisman', 'PG', 'Terry "Hulk" Hogan stars as R. J. "Hurricane" Spencer who is an ex-Navy S. E. A. L. and confirmed bachelor struggling to make ends meet. In order to save his superboat THUNDER (and ultimately, his business) Spencer is forced into a marriage of convenience with the snobby Megan Whitaker. When Megan gets kidnapped it''s up to Spencer and his partner Bru to save the day or risk losing everything.', 'Terry "Hulk" Hogan stars as R. J. "Hurricane" Spencer who is an ex-Navy S. E. A. L. and confirmed bachelor struggling to make ends meet. In order to save his superboat THUNDER (and ultimately, his business) Spencer is forced into a marriage of convenience with the snobby Megan Whitaker. When Megan gets kidnapped it''s up to Spencer and his partner Bru to save the day or risk losing everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j03odMissX5tvccOAngY1Hxamnc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204912'),
  ('389482764782025209', 'Thunder in Paradise 2', 1994, 'Action, Adventure', 'Douglas Schwartz, Gary Capo, James Pergola', 'Tom Greene', 'Hulk Hogan, Chris Lemmon, Carol Alt, Carlos Lauchu, Patrick Macnee, Gerald Martin, Ashley Gorrell, Jorge González', 'PG', 'Kelly is whisked off into Prince Aramour''s harem and given to his enemy as tribute in this romantic tale of capture and rescue.', 'Kelly is whisked off into Prince Aramour''s harem and given to his enemy as tribute in this romantic tale of capture and rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMw79xukO3HMgwPeZu5JtmISvcZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207390'),
  ('1040914988194432116', 'Thunder in Paradise 3', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Family', 'Douglas Schwartz', 'Deborah Schwartz', 'Hulk Hogan, Chris Lemmon, Carol Alt, Patrick Macnee, Heidi Mark, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Ashley Gorrell, James Ray Hart', 'PG-13', 'Spencer and Bru capture notorious drug lord Manuel Santiago. Santiago''s angered assistant, Mason Lee, takes the school hostage where Kelly is teaching and Jessica is one of the students in attendance in retaliation to Santiago''s capture.', 'Spencer and Bru capture notorious drug lord Manuel Santiago. Santiago''s angered assistant, Mason Lee, takes the school hostage where Kelly is teaching and Jessica is one of the students in attendance in retaliation to Santiago''s capture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCZU7WFjiKIf4d7PMCj94x7Z84r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207376'),
  ('963954290563080170', 'Thunder in the Sun', 1959, 'History, Western, Action, Adventure', 'Russell Rouse, Stanley Cortez, Winston Jones', 'Stewart Stern, Russell Rouse', 'Susan Hayward, Jeff Chandler, Jacques Bergerac, Blanche Yurka, Carl Esmond, Fortunio Bonanova, Bertrand Castelli, Albert Carrier', 'NR', 'A band of Basque immigrants treks through the Old West toward California, where they hope to put down roots and open wineries. When the group''s leader dies, his widow Gabrielle marries his brother in accordance with Basque tradition. But it''s a loveless union; Gabrielle is smitten with Lon Bennett, the scout who''s been hired to guide them on their journey.', 'A band of Basque immigrants treks through the Old West toward California, where they hope to put down roots and open wineries. When the group''s leader dies, his widow Gabrielle marries his brother in accordance with Basque tradition. But it''s a loveless union; Gabrielle is smitten with Lon Bennett, the scout who''s been hired to guide them on their journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/376haybvkbbLxUsKGaXfA4sq8IA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158450'),
  ('1097977501114500581', 'Thunder on the Hill', 1951, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Douglas Sirk, William H. Daniels', 'Oscar Saul, Andrew Solt', 'Claudette Colbert, Ann Blyth, Robert Douglas, Anne Crawford, Philip Friend, Gladys Cooper, Michael Pate, John Abbott', 'NR', 'Sister Mary presides over a convent where a convicted murderess, who is being escorted to Death Row, is stranded by bad weather. She is slowly becoming convinced that Valerie is innocent so Sister Mary sets about to clear the girl and bring the real killer to justice.', 'Sister Mary presides over a convent where a convicted murderess, who is being escorted to Death Row, is stranded by bad weather. She is slowly becoming convinced that Valerie is innocent so Sister Mary sets about to clear the girl and bring the real killer to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfIMctcB4BrkpUQ17ZEhnZSlt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77066'),
  ('525994866527730848', 'Thunder Over the Plains', 1953, 'Western', 'André de Toth, Bert Glennon, Al Alleborn', 'Russell S. Hughes', 'Randolph Scott, Lex Barker, Phyllis Kirk, Charles McGraw, Henry Hull, Elisha Cook Jr., Hugh Sanders, Lane Chandler', 'NR', 'Set in 1869, after the Civil War, Texas had not yet been readmitted to the Union and carpetbaggers, hiding behind the legal protection of the Union Army of occupation, had taken over the state. Federal Captain Porter, a Texan, has to carry out orders against his own people. He brings in the rebel leader Ben Westman whom he knows is innocent of a murder that he is accused of. In trying to prove his innocence, Porter himself becomes a wanted man.', 'Set in 1869, after the Civil War, Texas had not yet been readmitted to the Union and carpetbaggers, hiding behind the legal protection of the Union Army of occupation, had taken over the state. Federal Captain Porter, a Texan, has to carry out orders against his own people. He brings in the rebel leader Ben Westman whom he knows is innocent of a murder that he is accused of. In trying to prove his innocence, Porter himself becomes a wanted man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3jOhhHO9WAZSCVZzeRAIJ5sqww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72471'),
  ('1144105089283157338', 'Thunder Road', 1958, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Arthur Ripley, David Ettenson, Alan Stensvold', 'James Atlee Phillips, Walter Wise', 'Robert Mitchum, Gene Barry, Jacques Aubuchon, Keely Smith, Trevor Bardette, Sandra Knight, James Mitchum, Betsy Holt', 'NR', 'Unrepentant Tennessee moonshine runner Luke Doolin makes dangerous high-speed deliveries for his liquor-producing father, Vernon, but won''t let his younger brother Robin join the family business. Under pressure from both out-of-town gangster Kogan, who wants a piece of the local action, and Treasury agent Barrett, who wants to destroy the moonshine business, Luke fights for his fast-fading way of life.', 'Unrepentant Tennessee moonshine runner Luke Doolin makes dangerous high-speed deliveries for his liquor-producing father, Vernon, but won''t let his younger brother Robin join the family business. Under pressure from both out-of-town gangster Kogan, who wants a piece of the local action, and Treasury agent Barrett, who wants to destroy the moonshine business, Luke fights for his fast-fading way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EzKXYEfTsZjGZIUHM3vmlZMewk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19368'),
  ('109060758077505788', 'Thunder Road', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Danny Madden, Jim Cummings, Lowell A. Meyer', 'Jim Cummings', 'Jim Cummings, Kendal Farr, Nican Robinson, Jocelyn DeBoer, Chelsea Edmundson, Macon Blair, Bill Wise, Jordan Ray Fox', 'NR', 'A police officer faces a personal meltdown following a divorce and the death of his mother.', 'A police officer faces a personal meltdown following a divorce and the death of his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynljTdiGVUCJJ6THSZi22SBoQAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502422'),
  ('270675942912446461', 'Thunder Rock', 1942, 'Drama, Fantasy, War', 'Roy Boulting, Mutz Greenbaum, Elliot Scott', 'Jeffrey Dell, Bernard Miles', 'Michael Redgrave, Barbara Mullen, James Mason, Lilli Palmer, Finlay Currie, Frederick Valk, Sybille Binder, Frederick Cooper', 'NR', 'David Charleston, once a world renowned journalist, now lives alone maintaining the Thunder Rock lighthouse in Lake Michigan. He doesn''t cash his paychecks and has no contact other than the monthly inspector''s visit. When alone, he imagines conversations with those who died when a 19th century packet ship with some 60 passengers sank. He imagines their lives, their problems, their fears and their hopes. In one of these conversations, he recalls his own efforts in the 1930s when he desperately tried to convince first his editors, and later the public, of the dangers of fascism and the inevitability of war. Few would listen. One of the passengers, a spinster, tells her story of seeking independence from a world dominated by men. There''s also the case of a doctor who is banished for using unacceptable methods. David has given up on life, but the imaginary passengers give him hope for the future.', 'David Charleston, once a world renowned journalist, now lives alone maintaining the Thunder Rock lighthouse in Lake Michigan. He doesn''t cash his paychecks and has no contact other than the monthly inspector''s visit. When alone, he imagines conversations with those who died when a 19th century packet ship with some 60 passengers sank. He imagines their lives, their problems, their fears and their hopes. In one of these conversations, he recalls his own efforts in the 1930s when he desperately tried to convince first his editors, and later the public, of the dangers of fascism and the inevitability of war. Few would listen. One of the passengers, a spinster, tells her story of seeking independence from a world dominated by men. There''s also the case of a doctor who is banished for using unacceptable methods. David has given up on life, but the imaginary passengers give him hope for the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCLeo6GZXFgjhoFduwdAz3D8Qdi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100526'),
  ('192407350515285850', 'Thunder Run', 1985, 'Thriller, Action', 'Gary Hudson, Harvey Genkins', 'Charles Davis, Carol Heyer', 'Forrest Tucker, John Ireland, John Shepherd, Jill Whitlow, Wallace Langham, Graham Ludlow, Cheryl M. Lynn, Marilyn O''Connor', 'PG-13', 'A vicious band of nuclear terrorists is threatening America''s atomic weapons research. Truck jockey Charlie Morrison volunteers for a last-ditch, suicide scheme to lure them into a trap, baited with a vital shipment of bomb-grade plutonium. Soon, Charlie''s high-balling it down a remote desert road with a small army of lethally equipped bandits zeroing in on him. Charlie''s secret weapon? "Big Thunder", a 65-foot, 18-wheeled war wagon of merciless high-tech destruction!', 'A vicious band of nuclear terrorists is threatening America''s atomic weapons research. Truck jockey Charlie Morrison volunteers for a last-ditch, suicide scheme to lure them into a trap, baited with a vital shipment of bomb-grade plutonium. Soon, Charlie''s high-balling it down a remote desert road with a small army of lethally equipped bandits zeroing in on him. Charlie''s secret weapon? "Big Thunder", a 65-foot, 18-wheeled war wagon of merciless high-tech destruction!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mgayUJnS5ui8JuBtUwzB7W5kkG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71838'),
  ('300417983217538010', 'Thunderball', 1965, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Terence Young, Ted Moore, Robert Watts', 'Richard Maibaum, John Hopkins, Jack Whittingham', 'Sean Connery, Claudine Auger, Adolfo Celi, Luciana Paluzzi, Rik Van Nutter, Guy Doleman, Molly Peters, Martine Beswick', 'PG', 'A criminal organization has obtained two nuclear bombs and are asking for a 100 million pound ransom in the form of diamonds in seven days or they will use the weapons. The secret service sends James Bond to the Bahamas to once again save the world.', 'A criminal organization has obtained two nuclear bombs and are asking for a 100 million pound ransom in the form of diamonds in seven days or they will use the weapons. The secret service sends James Bond to the Bahamas to once again save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCc4qllaTDsQN8zgGkAgQrKO6N9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660'),
  ('977072400093936375', 'Thunderbird 6', 1968, 'Adventure, Family, Science Fiction, Animation', 'David Lane, Harry Oakes, Derek Meddings', 'Sylvia Anderson, Gerry Anderson', 'Peter Dyneley, Sylvia Anderson, Shane Rimmer, Jeremy Wilkin, Matt Zimmerman, David Graham, Keith Alexander, Gary Files', 'G', 'The International Rescue team is faced with one of its toughest challenges yet, as the revolutionary lighter-than-air craft Skyship One is hijacked while on her maiden voyage around the world. Against backdrops including the Statue of Liberty and the Sphinx, Lady Penelope, Parker, Alan and Tin-Tin fight the hijackers from on-board, while the rest of the team tries to stop the airship crashing.', 'The International Rescue team is faced with one of its toughest challenges yet, as the revolutionary lighter-than-air craft Skyship One is hijacked while on her maiden voyage around the world. Against backdrops including the Statue of Liberty and the Sphinx, Lady Penelope, Parker, Alan and Tin-Tin fight the hijackers from on-board, while the rest of the team tries to stop the airship crashing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zxO00ycylxZ8lFET5uXNOtBCcE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25361'),
  ('630419601720816822', 'Thunderbirds', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Jonathan Frakes, Brendan Galvin, William Dodds', 'Michael McCullers, William Osborne', 'Brady Corbet, Bill Paxton, Anthony Edwards, Ben Kingsley, Sophia Myles, Vanessa Hudgens, Philip Winchester, Soren Fulton', 'PG', 'Dangerous missions are the bread and butter of the Thunderbirds, a high-tech secret force employed by the government. Led by Jeff Tracy (Bill Paxton), the Thunderbirds are at the top of their game, but their nemesis, The Hood (Ben Kingsley), has landed on their island and is attempting a coup by using the team''s rescue vehicles. He''ll soon discover that the Thunderbirds won''t go down.', 'Dangerous missions are the bread and butter of the Thunderbirds, a high-tech secret force employed by the government. Led by Jeff Tracy (Bill Paxton), the Thunderbirds are at the top of their game, but their nemesis, The Hood (Ben Kingsley), has landed on their island and is attempting a coup by using the team''s rescue vehicles. He''ll soon discover that the Thunderbirds won''t go down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jH0vADEIvuRlkvJzLUW5nVO96d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14623'),
  ('52613405268175593', 'Thunderbirds Are GO', 1966, 'Animation, Family, Action, Science Fiction', 'David Lane, Harry Ledger, Derek Meddings', 'Sylvia Anderson, Gerry Anderson', 'Sylvia Anderson, Ray Barrett, Alexander Davion, Peter Dyneley, Christine Finn, David Graham, Paul Maxwell, Neil McCallum', 'G', 'When the launch of a mission to Mars goes awry due to sabotage, International Rescue is requested to assist in the mission''s second attempt.', 'When the launch of a mission to Mars goes awry due to sabotage, International Rescue is requested to assist in the mission''s second attempt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYzxKzIX2gznr3E20w5HgkJBr6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35780'),
  ('1024303667942290195', 'Thunderbolt', 1929, 'Crime, Drama', 'Josef von Sternberg, Henry W. Gerrard', 'Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'George Bancroft, Fay Wray, Richard Arlen, Tully Marshall, Eugenie Besserer, James Spottswood, Fred Kohler, Robert Elliott', 'NR', 'A criminal known as Thunderbolt is imprisoned and facing execution. Into the next cell is placed Bob Moran, an innocent man who has been framed and who is in love with Thunderbolt''s girl, without knowing of their relationship. Thunderbolt hopes to stave off the execution long enough to kill young Moran for romancing his girl.', 'A criminal known as Thunderbolt is imprisoned and facing execution. Into the next cell is placed Bob Moran, an innocent man who has been framed and who is in love with Thunderbolt''s girl, without knowing of their relationship. Thunderbolt hopes to stave off the execution long enough to kill young Moran for romancing his girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eFNGOZn5c7lUyObcR8tdH9SbOW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27456'),
  ('280232529859498070', 'Thunderbolt', 1947, 'War, Documentary, History', 'William Wyler, John Sturges', 'Lester Koenig', 'James Stewart, Robert Lowery, Lloyd Bridges, Eugene Kern', null, 'Documentary about the U.S. Air Force''s P-47 Thunderbolt bomber''s role in the Italian Campaign during WW2.', 'Documentary about the U.S. Air Force''s P-47 Thunderbolt bomber''s role in the Italian Campaign during WW2.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7bJCzGC4LHX0ptxjcP9KkaxcUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86114'),
  ('261123361961213680', 'Thunderbolt', 1995, 'Action, Thriller', 'Gordon Chan, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Chan Hing-Kai', 'Jackie Chan, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Michael Wong, Dayo Wong Chi-Wah, Thorsten Nickel, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Kenya Sawada, Chor Yuen', 'R', 'In order to release his kidnapped sister, sports car mechanic, Chan Foh To, has to defeat a super-criminal street racer.', 'In order to release his kidnapped sister, sports car mechanic, Chan Foh To, has to defeat a super-criminal street racer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81D5xBlnTAdJs19dbkfw8eK0oWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10348'),
  ('840949353791664738', 'Thunderbolt and Lightfoot', 1974, 'Comedy, Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Michael Cimino, Frank Stanley, Charles Okun', 'Michael Cimino', 'Clint Eastwood, Jeff Bridges, George Kennedy, Geoffrey Lewis, Catherine Bach, Gary Busey, Roy Jenson, Burton Gilliam', 'R', 'With the help of an irreverent young sidekick, a bank robber gets his old gang back together to organise a daring new heist.', 'With the help of an irreverent young sidekick, a bank robber gets his old gang back together to organise a daring new heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/530RZ2HsxAgKVO4joNFjAgucbri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8348'),
  ('816702776788879583', 'Thunderbolts*', 2025, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Jake Schreier, Andrew Droz Palermo, George Cottle', 'Eric Pearson, Joanna Calo', 'Florence Pugh, Sebastian Stan, Julia Louis-Dreyfus, Lewis Pullman, David Harbour, Wyatt Russell, Hannah John-Kamen, Olga Kurylenko', 'PG-13', 'After finding themselves ensnared in a death trap, seven disillusioned castoffs must embark on a dangerous mission that will force them to confront the darkest corners of their pasts.', 'After finding themselves ensnared in a death trap, seven disillusioned castoffs must embark on a dangerous mission that will force them to confront the darkest corners of their pasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqcexYHbiTBfDIdDWxrxPtVndBX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:986056'),
  ('163342921795290205', 'Thunderheart', 1992, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Roger Deakins, Michael Apted, Jeff Okabayashi', 'John Fusco', 'Val Kilmer, Sam Shepard, Graham Greene, Fred Ward, Fred Thompson, Sheila Tousey, Ted Thin Elk, John Trudell', 'R', 'A young mixed-blood FBI agent is assigned to work with a cynical veteran investigator on a murder on a poverty-stricken Sioux reservation.', 'A young mixed-blood FBI agent is assigned to work with a cynical veteran investigator on a murder on a poverty-stricken Sioux reservation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGbVd9gzRHk70E8WQPZcjiv6ZLk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12395'),
  ('1104976879915903513', 'Thunderpants', 2002, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Peter Hewitt, Andy Collins', 'Peter Hewitt, Phil Hughes', 'Simon Callow, Stephen Fry, Celia Imrie, Paul Giamatti, Ned Beatty, Bruce Cook, Rupert Grint, Bronagh Gallagher', null, 'An 11-year-old boy''s amazing ability to break wind leads him first to fame and then to death row, before it helps him to fulfill his ambition of becoming an astronaut.', 'An 11-year-old boy''s amazing ability to break wind leads him first to fame and then to death row, before it helps him to fulfill his ambition of becoming an astronaut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbN8UbXlCWbAFVmn8FdUsqSYWoe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21605'),
  ('1086123644861793398', 'Thunderstruck', 2012, 'Comedy, Family', 'John Whitesell, Shawn Maurer', 'Eric Champnella, Jeff Farley', 'Kevin Durant, Taylor Gray, Jim Belushi, Brandon T. Jackson, Doc Shaw, Tristin Mays, Robert Belushi, William Ragsdale', 'PG', 'After NBA star Kevin Durant switches talent with 16 year old Brian, the teenager becomes the star of his high school team, but Durant starts struggling and eventually learns an important lesson.', 'After NBA star Kevin Durant switches talent with 16 year old Brian, the teenager becomes the star of his high school team, but Durant starts struggling and eventually learns an important lesson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lR1ssqRzslQx9WtTOKnfgqbNB1y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119738'),
  ('72688170891065866', 'Thunivu', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 'H. Vinoth, Nirav Shah', 'H. Vinoth', 'Ajith Kumar, Manju Warrier, Samuthirakani, John Kokken, Veera Bahu, Prem, Ajay, G. M. Sundar', null, 'A gang goes to rob a bank only to find that there''s already a criminal mastermind holding it for ransom, but his identities and motives behind the heist remains mysterious. As they plan to collect the bounty and disappear without a trace, their crimes and their past slowly catches up with them.', 'A gang goes to rob a bank only to find that there''s already a criminal mastermind holding it for ransom, but his identities and motives behind the heist remains mysterious. As they plan to collect the bounty and disappear without a trace, their crimes and their past slowly catches up with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Cdi9MFxEGsfphvDxV4TyY4znP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:904557'),
  ('289192770553722009', 'Thuppakki', 2012, 'Action, Thriller', 'A. R. Murugadoss, Rajkumar Periasamy, Santosh Sivan', 'A. R. Murugadoss', 'Vijay, Kajal Aggarwal, Vidyut Jammwal, Sathyan Sivakumar, Jayaram, Zakir Hussain, Deepthi Nambiar, Manobala', null, 'Captain Jagadish, an intelligence officer in the Indian Army, returns to Mumbai for a vacation but soon finds himself in a deadly mission. After witnessing a bus bombing, he uncovers a network of sleeper cells planning multiple attacks across the city. With no official backing, he embarks on a personal mission with his trusted comrades to eliminate the mastermind, ensuring the sleeper cells remain leaderless and trapped in silence, waiting for orders that will never come. Ready to sacrifice his own life, he sets out on his final mission—but does he succeed, and at what cost?', 'Captain Jagadish, an intelligence officer in the Indian Army, returns to Mumbai for a vacation but soon finds himself in a deadly mission. After witnessing a bus bombing, he uncovers a network of sleeper cells planning multiple attacks across the city. With no official backing, he embarks on a personal mission with his trusted comrades to eliminate the mastermind, ensuring the sleeper cells remain leaderless and trapped in silence, waiting for orders that will never come. Ready to sacrifice his own life, he sets out on his final mission—but does he succeed, and at what cost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18Hvx5MDIVnoexyehnGmMQE1lod.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143010'),
  ('28055883579477234', 'Thupparivaalan', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Mysskin, Karthik Venkatraman', 'Mysskin', 'Vishal Krishna, Prasanna, Vinay Rai, Andrea Jeremiah, Anu Emmanuel, Shaji Chen, John Vijay, K. Bhagyaraj', null, 'Detective Kaniyan Poonkundran is hungry for a challenging case to investigate and the mystery of a murdered dog leads to a rival who could be the match for him.', 'Detective Kaniyan Poonkundran is hungry for a challenging case to investigate and the mystery of a murdered dog leads to a rival who could be the match for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jG10W7dT4tHb4dqJ9sB2miClGP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410481'),
  ('459412875151205850', 'Thursday', 1998, 'Thriller, Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Denis Lenoir, Skip Woods', 'Skip Woods', 'Thomas Jane, Paula Marshall, Aaron Eckhart, James Le Gros, Paulina Porizkova, Michael Jeter, Glenn Plummer, Mickey Rourke', 'R', 'A former Los Angeles drug dealer moves far away to Texas, making a new life for himself as a married architect in the suburbs. His old crime partner unexpectedly shows up with heroin and gangster business, attracting a slew of violent unsavory characters.', 'A former Los Angeles drug dealer moves far away to Texas, making a new life for himself as a married architect in the suburbs. His old crime partner unexpectedly shows up with heroin and gangster business, attracting a slew of violent unsavory characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbfBCMSzmKlAHZUDwsrtmG7GZP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9812'),
  ('1078807334083723242', 'Thursday Till Sunday', 2012, 'Drama', 'Dominga Sotomayor, Bárbara Álvarez, Gabriela Sobarzo', 'Dominga Sotomayor', 'Santi Ahumada, Emiliano Freifeld, Francisco Pérez-Bannen, Paola Giannini, Axel Dupré, Jorge Becker, Francisca Castillo, Damián Hassler', 'NR', 'As she and her family embark on a short vacation, a young Chilean girl slowly comes to the realization that her parents might be splitting up.', 'As she and her family embark on a short vacation, a young Chilean girl slowly comes to the realization that her parents might be splitting up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9caATFHoIxkbxuVkxLz5lMLNzDi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121929'),
  ('154639974893661854', 'Thursday''s Children', 1954, 'Documentary', 'Lindsay Anderson, Guy Brenton, Walter Lassally', 'Guy Brenton, Lindsay Anderson', 'Richard Burton', null, 'Won the Academy Award for the Best Documentary Short of 1954. The subject deals with the children at The Royal School for the Deaf in Margate, Kent. The hearing-handicapped children are shown painstakingly learning what words are through exercises and games, practicing lip-reading and finally speech. Richard Burton''s calm and sometimes-poetic narration adds to the heartwarming cheerfulness and courage of the children. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with British Film Institute in 2005.', 'Won the Academy Award for the Best Documentary Short of 1954. The subject deals with the children at The Royal School for the Deaf in Margate, Kent. The hearing-handicapped children are shown painstakingly learning what words are through exercises and games, practicing lip-reading and finally speech. Richard Burton''s calm and sometimes-poetic narration adds to the heartwarming cheerfulness and courage of the children. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with British Film Institute in 2005.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3c74Bn54lpp7Tiv5gZPBQDpg8pe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243023'),
  ('1081100811670132190', 'Thus Spoke Bellavista', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Luciano De Crescenzo, Dante Spinotti, Renzo Girolami', 'Luciano De Crescenzo, Riccardo Pazzaglia', 'Luciano De Crescenzo, Renato Scarpa, Tommaso Bianco, Giovanni Attanasio, Isa Danieli, Luigi Uzzo, Salvatore La Rotonda, Benedetto Casillo', null, 'In Naples, Professor Bellavista is a retired man, passionate about the philosophy and thought of Ancient Greece. Every day, in his luxurious apartment, he teaches his lessons of life to the poor-nothing (his friends), who are dazzled by his reasoning. One day, however, the quiet life of the building of Bellavista will be disturbed by the arrival of a director of Milan. Between Naples and Milan there contrast, because the Neapolitans are accustomed to enjoy a quiet life, always based on the "philosophy of pleasure and delay", while the northern Italians are very strict and punctual.', 'In Naples, Professor Bellavista is a retired man, passionate about the philosophy and thought of Ancient Greece. Every day, in his luxurious apartment, he teaches his lessons of life to the poor-nothing (his friends), who are dazzled by his reasoning. One day, however, the quiet life of the building of Bellavista will be disturbed by the arrival of a director of Milan. Between Naples and Milan there contrast, because the Neapolitans are accustomed to enjoy a quiet life, always based on the "philosophy of pleasure and delay", while the northern Italians are very strict and punctual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55eyCgkvCsEQ5xn3kj2gaPNPr7m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57922'),
  ('61902879919333998', 'Thus Spoke De Crescenzo', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Antonio Napoli, Manolo Cinti, Serena Corvaglia', 'Antonio Napoli, Serena Corvaglia', 'Luciano De Crescenzo, Renzo Arbore, Benedetto Casillo, Marina Confalone, Marisa Laurito, Isabella Rossellini, Renato Scarpa, Bud Spencer', null, 'Tracing the journey of a free thinker, engineer, writer, scriptwriter, actor and director through his life and work, Così Parlo De Crescenzo harnesses the energy of a man determined to transform the lives and culture of those around him. Born in Naples, Luciano De Crescenzo graduated in engineering and worked as a programmer for IBM until 1976, when he escaped the routine of his ''corporate prison'' and published his first book.', 'Tracing the journey of a free thinker, engineer, writer, scriptwriter, actor and director through his life and work, Così Parlo De Crescenzo harnesses the energy of a man determined to transform the lives and culture of those around him. Born in Naples, Luciano De Crescenzo graduated in engineering and worked as a programmer for IBM until 1976, when he escaped the routine of his ''corporate prison'' and published his first book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1g5AceHNu29O57yBmmHc3Ehhw72.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483501'),
  ('1123852251360085093', 'THX 1138', 1971, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'David Myers, Albert Kihn, George Lucas', 'George Lucas, Walter Murch', 'Robert Duvall, Donald Pleasence, Don Pedro Colley, Maggie McOmie, Ian Wolfe, Marshall Efron, Sid Haig, John Pearce', 'R', 'People in the future live in a totalitarian society. A technician named THX 1138 lives a mundane life between work and taking a controlled consumption of drugs that the government uses to make puppets out of people. As THX is without drugs for the first time he has feelings for a woman and they start a secret relationship.', 'People in the future live in a totalitarian society. A technician named THX 1138 lives a mundane life between work and taking a controlled consumption of drugs that the government uses to make puppets out of people. As THX is without drugs for the first time he has feelings for a woman and they start a secret relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPyEXW7h2SJRjTsHZqrIlXxOgW9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636'),
  ('846585343487253197', 'Ti 30... ti 40... ti 50...', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Kostas Karagiannis, Pantelis Filippides', 'Asimakis Gialamas, Costas Pretederis', 'Labros Konstadaras, Rika Dialina, Giorgos Moshidis, Elia Kalligeraki, Mitsi Konstadara, Nelli Gini, Nikos Verlekis, Panos Vellias', null, 'Zahos Fokianos is a businessman who flirts with various women. Teta, the daughter of one of the women that Zahos chases, has fallen in love with him but is hesitant to confess her feelings. But when Zahos realizes what is going on, he will feel twenty years younger, travel with her in Europe, and on return he will find that he and the girl are not the only couple who enjoys happiness.', 'Zahos Fokianos is a businessman who flirts with various women. Teta, the daughter of one of the women that Zahos chases, has fallen in love with him but is hesitant to confess her feelings. But when Zahos realizes what is going on, he will feel twenty years younger, travel with her in Europe, and on return he will find that he and the girl are not the only couple who enjoys happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dVKbV6CrMSG12Th83cL0GCsN7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407127'),
  ('208086356423640091', 'Ti lascio perché ti amo troppo', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Ranieri Martinotti, Mario Amura', 'Alessandro Siani, Francesco Ranieri Martinotti, Francesco Albanese', 'Alessandro Siani, Francesco Albanese, Mariana Braga, Maria Mazza, Nunzia Schiano, Caterina De Santis, Lello Musella, Gennaro Piccirillo', null, 'When a love story ends and ones does not know how to say goodbye, here comes the classic excuse: "I''m leaving you because I love you too much." With this exact sentence Daniela says goodbye to Mariano and disappears from his life. His friends try to help him, but Daniela is always in his thoughts. Finally seems to portend the nail that will drive the nail in the guise of a beautiful Brazilian. But winning does not show up at all easy.', 'When a love story ends and ones does not know how to say goodbye, here comes the classic excuse: "I''m leaving you because I love you too much." With this exact sentence Daniela says goodbye to Mariano and disappears from his life. His friends try to help him, but Daniela is always in his thoughts. Finally seems to portend the nail that will drive the nail in the guise of a beautiful Brazilian. But winning does not show up at all easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJcCYTMp0pLTZjFF96FDCMgvYcC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61575'),
  ('233935885323020337', 'Ti ricordi di me?', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Rolando Ravello, Valeria Miranda, Valerio Palusci', 'Paolo Genovese, Edoardo Falcone, Edoardo Leo', 'Ambra Angiolini, Edoardo Leo, Paolo Calabresi, Susy Laude, Pia Engleberth, Lorenzo Gioielli, Ennio Fantastichini, Alessandro Coccoli', null, 'Sharing the same psychologist, kleptomaniac Roberto, who writes stories a bit too realistic and scary for kids, and a narcoleptic Beatrice, who documents everything in her life, begin to think that love could be the cure for their problems. But nothing comes easy to either of them, and, just like in one of Roberto''s stories, the happy ending really needs to be sought after. Will they find their own?', 'Sharing the same psychologist, kleptomaniac Roberto, who writes stories a bit too realistic and scary for kids, and a narcoleptic Beatrice, who documents everything in her life, begin to think that love could be the cure for their problems. But nothing comes easy to either of them, and, just like in one of Roberto''s stories, the happy ending really needs to be sought after. Will they find their own?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orh376dzcysjMyDcTFswYs5a03J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262789'),
