  ('105637766976991119', 'Ti stramo - Ho voglia di un''ultima notte da manuale prima di tre baci sopra il cielo', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Pino Insegno, Massimiliano Trevis, Gianluca Sodaro', 'Francesca Draghetti', 'Carlotta Tesconi, Marco Rulli, Stefano Pinto, Ughetta D’Onorascenzo, Emanuela Aurizi, Matteo Ripaldi, Aglaia Mora, Alessandro Bardani', null, 'Friedberg/Seltzer-like spoof about popular Italian teen romance movies of the aughts (such as Tre metri sopra il cielo, Come tu mi vuoi, Ho voglia di te, Notte prima degli esami, Melissa P., etc).', 'Friedberg/Seltzer-like spoof about popular Italian teen romance movies of the aughts (such as Tre metri sopra il cielo, Come tu mi vuoi, Ho voglia di te, Notte prima degli esami, Melissa P., etc).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tepFFBPfcZHOG9ha3YfsLgSdxew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38696'),
  ('1116970556888968924', 'Tibetan Dog', 2011, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama', 'Masayuki Kojima, Yuki Kawashita, Atsushi Takahashi', 'Naoto Inoue', 'Tatsuomi Hamada, Hiroshi Iwasaki, Norio Wakamoto, Toshio Kakei, Kaori Yamagata, Houko Kuwashima, Yoshisada Sakaguchi, Toru Okawa', null, 'After his mother dies, Jiantan has to leave Xi''an to live with his father on the Tibetan steppe, where he meets a golden dog that helps him cope with the new challenges ahead.', 'After his mother dies, Jiantan has to leave Xi''an to live with his father on the Tibetan steppe, where he meets a golden dog that helps him cope with the new challenges ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DIlI874KB9MhK3Jr3UC4wEhwsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80079'),
  ('944062304708254366', 'Tic Tac', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Daniel Alfredson', 'Hans Renhäll', 'Oliver Loftéen, Tuva Novotny, Jacob Nordenson, Tintin Anderzon, Emil Forselius, Mats Helin, Claudio Salgado, Nadja Weiss', null, 'During one single day a number of life destinies cross one another. It becomes a night for the involved they will never forget, a night when the coincidences are going to change their lives forever.', 'During one single day a number of life destinies cross one another. It becomes a night for the involved they will never forget, a night when the coincidences are going to change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjcFsrF2p1FDlIE7qRazPraSzGV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76864'),
  ('1001314839714149210', 'Tichá bolest', 1991, 'Drama', 'Martin Hollý, František Uldrich, Milena Kropáčková', 'Jiří Křižan', 'Rudolf Hrušínský, Ivan Jiřík, Jakub Vrabec, Vítězslav Jandák, Miroslav Táborský, Jiří Sedláček, Martin Dejdar, Tomáš Juřička', null, 'A young man has led his whole life with his grandfather. When he was in school, he was the only one who was refused to join the Youth Brigade, since his father was sentenced to death for spying. When it is time for him to do the compulsory military service, he has to do it in a platoon for "unreliable" persons.', 'A young man has led his whole life with his grandfather. When he was in school, he was the only one who was refused to join the Youth Brigade, since his father was sentenced to death for spying. When it is time for him to do the compulsory military service, he has to do it in a platoon for "unreliable" persons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLHpOPkDgktQy8Orc3pLTl5x0aH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116081'),
  ('350326066893829290', 'Tick Tock Tale', 2015, 'Animation', 'Dean Wellins', null, 'Dean Wellins', 'G', 'Amidst an old London clock shop, a small, quirky mantle clock comes to the aide of the store''s more expensive clocks when a thief breaks in and threatens to steal them away.', 'Amidst an old London clock shop, a small, quirky mantle clock comes to the aide of the store''s more expensive clocks when a thief breaks in and threatens to steal them away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adx0vSGKAwSd9rydH6vUJXMkh7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352812'),
  ('873016828786693181', 'Tick Tock Tuckered', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky and Daffy are workers at an aircraft company and are chronically late. Why? Because they have a great deal of trouble getting to sleep, between the noisy cats, the full moon shining insistently, and the sudden rain shower (and leak in the roof).', 'Porky and Daffy are workers at an aircraft company and are chronically late. Why? Because they have a great deal of trouble getting to sleep, between the noisy cats, the full moon shining insistently, and the sudden rain shower (and leak in the roof).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70ecUFgg5d5vwQfVhhar5gJrf6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201659'),
  ('828720536020670054', 'tick, tick... BOOM!', 2021, 'Drama, Music', 'Alice Brooks, Jonathan Mosca, Josh Muzaffer', 'Steven Levenson', 'Andrew Garfield, Alexandra Shipp, Robin de Jesús, Michaela Jaé Rodriguez, Ben Levi Ross, Jonathan Marc Sherman, Vanessa Hudgens, Joshua Henry', 'PG-13', 'On the brink of turning 30, a promising theater composer navigates love, friendship and the pressure to create something great before time runs out.', 'On the brink of turning 30, a promising theater composer navigates love, friendship and the pressure to create something great before time runs out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DPmfcuR8fh8ROYXgdjrAjSGA0o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537116'),
  ('534822620339231668', 'Ticker', 2001, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Albert Pyun, Philip Alan Waters, Sazzy Lee Calhoun', 'Paul B. Margolis', 'Tom Sizemore, Steven Seagal, Dennis Hopper, Jaime Pressly, Nas, Rozonda Thomas, Peter Greene, Kevin Gage', 'R', 'Ray Nettles, a detective of San Francisco, and his partner Fuzzy must take up to one of the most dangerous terrorist gangs of the city. When one of the terrorists, the beautiful scientist Claire Manning is arrested, Swan, the leader of the terrorists, claims he will detonate bombs throughout the city if she is not released. Because of the possible bloodshed, Nettles calls for the help of explosive expert Frank Glass...', 'Ray Nettles, a detective of San Francisco, and his partner Fuzzy must take up to one of the most dangerous terrorist gangs of the city. When one of the terrorists, the beautiful scientist Claire Manning is arrested, Swan, the leader of the terrorists, claims he will detonate bombs throughout the city if she is not released. Because of the possible bloodshed, Nettles calls for the help of explosive expert Frank Glass...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHuAAGikw2bTaam7K5B8btwUECM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31002'),
  ('318162498721933791', 'Ticker', 2002, 'Action, Adventure', 'Joe Carnahan, Eddie Nichols, Bryan Altham', 'Joe Carnahan', 'Clive Owen, Don Cheadle, F. Murray Abraham, Eli Danker, Dennis Haysbert, Ray Liotta, Robert Patrick, Clifton Powell', null, 'The Driver drives a wounded diplomat, who carries a mysterious briefcase, while under helicopter attack. During the attack the briefcase is struck by a bullet, causing a display on it to begin counting down, and it to leak an unknown fluid from the bullet hole. The Driver manages to destroy his pursuers, but refuses to proceed without knowing the contents of the damaged briefcase. It is revealed that the diplomat guards a human heart for a peacekeeper, whose life is needed for the continued freedom of the people. The case is delivered, and the tyrant is forced to give up his attempt to take the country by force. The Driver leaves for another mission.', 'The Driver drives a wounded diplomat, who carries a mysterious briefcase, while under helicopter attack. During the attack the briefcase is struck by a bullet, causing a display on it to begin counting down, and it to leak an unknown fluid from the bullet hole. The Driver manages to destroy his pursuers, but refuses to proceed without knowing the contents of the damaged briefcase. It is revealed that the diplomat guards a human heart for a peacekeeper, whose life is needed for the continued freedom of the people. The case is delivered, and the tyrant is forced to give up his attempt to take the country by force. The Driver leaves for another mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHhGquZLHdm8cFKzJpgXq8HdQk0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38190'),
  ('142053337049182364', 'Ticket of No Return', 1979, 'Drama', 'Ulrike Ottinger, Ila von Hasperg, Ulrike Ottinger', 'Ulrike Ottinger', 'Tabea Blumenschein, Lutze , Magdalena Montezuma, Orpha Termin , Monika von Cube, Paul Glauer, Nina Hagen, Günter Meisner', null, 'A sartorially resplendent woman of few words arrives in Berlin with plans to live out the rest of her days as a drunkard.', 'A sartorially resplendent woman of few words arrives in Berlin with plans to live out the rest of her days as a drunkard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUaKxViJa9Uvy0EKBGpJtN3SMN1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106219'),
  ('1087088963226418177', 'Ticket to Heaven', 1981, 'Drama', 'Ralph L. Thomas, Richard Leiterman, Bill Corcoran', 'Anne Cameron, Ralph L. Thomas', 'Nick Mancuso, Saul Rubinek, Meg Foster, Kim Cattrall, R.H. Thomson, Chris Britton, Jennifer Dale, Guy Boyd', 'PG', 'David is a young man seduced by a religious cult that uses starvation, exhaustion, and brainwashing to mold recruits into money hustling disciples of a messiah-like leader. Chronicles David''s chilling transformation into a gaunt, mindless shadow of his former self...and his ultimate salvation when friends and family launch a plan to kidnap and deprogram him.', 'David is a young man seduced by a religious cult that uses starvation, exhaustion, and brainwashing to mold recruits into money hustling disciples of a messiah-like leader. Chronicles David''s chilling transformation into a gaunt, mindless shadow of his former self...and his ultimate salvation when friends and family launch a plan to kidnap and deprogram him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20LOMNnU79xflqJ7VOU4cTuTApG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128741'),
  ('895893069804701128', 'Ticket to Paradise', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Ole Bratt Birkeland, Rachel van Baarle, Richard Hobbs', 'Ol Parker, Daniel Pipski', 'Julia Roberts, George Clooney, Kaitlyn Dever, Billie Lourd, Maxime Bouttier, Lucas Bravo, Cintya Dharmayanti, Geneviève Lemon', 'PG-13', 'Divorced couple Georgia and David find themselves on a shared mission: they team up and travel to Bali to stop their daughter Lily from making the same mistake they once made 25 years ago.', 'Divorced couple Georgia and David find themselves on a shared mission: they team up and travel to Bali to stop their daughter Lily from making the same mistake they once made 25 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tzERH50P5c2mFWtLbgixzLZS1L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800939'),
  ('1062012062720265734', 'Tickets', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Abbas Kiarostami, Ken Loach, Ermanno Olmi', 'Paul Laverty, Abbas Kiarostami, Ermanno Olmi', 'Carlo Delle Piane, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Silvana De Santis, Filippo Trojano, Martin Compston, Gary Maitland, William Ruane, Blerta Cahani', null, 'A train travels across Italy toward Rome. On board is a professor who daydreams a conversation with a love that never was, a family of Albanian refugees who switch trains and steal a ticket, three brash Scottish soccer fans en route to a match, and a complaining widow traveling to a memorial service for her late husband who''s accompanied by a community-service volunteer who''s assisting her. Interactions among these Europeans turn on class and nationalism, courtesy and rudeness, and opportunities for kindness.', 'A train travels across Italy toward Rome. On board is a professor who daydreams a conversation with a love that never was, a family of Albanian refugees who switch trains and steal a ticket, three brash Scottish soccer fans en route to a match, and a complaining widow traveling to a memorial service for her late husband who''s accompanied by a community-service volunteer who''s assisting her. Interactions among these Europeans turn on class and nationalism, courtesy and rudeness, and opportunities for kindness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJENjmJmISO5AV2Ogu9wGy62Ldq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57251'),
  ('138780567656843919', 'Ticking Clock', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Ernie Barbarash, Phil Parmet, James Currier', 'John Turman', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Neal McDonough, Austin Abrams, Yancey Arias, Danielle Nicolet, Veronica Berry, Dane Rhodes, Angelena Swords', 'R', 'A reporter stumbles upon the journal of a murderer with plans to butcher specific girls, and he begins to investigates on his own, and finding that every trail leads to a 9-year-old orphan living in a group home.', 'A reporter stumbles upon the journal of a murderer with plans to butcher specific girls, and he begins to investigates on his own, and finding that every trail leads to a 9-year-old orphan living in a group home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHBeLWuTLozNLAXFnbeG0P89h0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50765'),
  ('24873858382405182', 'Tickle Me', 1965, 'Comedy, Music, Romance, Western', 'Norman Taurog, Arthur Jacobson, Loyal Griggs', 'Edward Bernds, Elwood Ullman', 'Elvis Presley, Julie Adams, Jocelyn Lane, Jack Mullaney, Merry Anders, Bill Williams, Edward Faulkner, Connie Gilchrist', 'NR', 'A singing rodeo rider hires on at an expensive all-women dude ranch and beauty spa. He falls for a pretty fitness trainer who is constantly threatened by a gang who wants her late grandfather''s cache of gold hidden in a ghost town.', 'A singing rodeo rider hires on at an expensive all-women dude ranch and beauty spa. He falls for a pretty fitness trainer who is constantly threatened by a gang who wants her late grandfather''s cache of gold hidden in a ghost town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zj4wfziY4bUjGNvu8s08juSXtmD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18645'),
  ('948600609592096204', 'Tickled', 2016, 'Documentary', 'David Farrier, Dylan Reeve, Dominic Fryer', null, 'David Farrier, Dylan Reeve, David Starr, Hal Karp, Marko Realmonte, Kevin Clarke, T.J. Gretzner, Richard Ivey', 'R', 'Journalist David Farrier stumbles upon a mysterious tickling competition online. As he delves deeper he comes up against fierce resistance, but that doesn’t stop him getting to the bottom of a story stranger than fiction.', 'Journalist David Farrier stumbles upon a mysterious tickling competition online. As he delves deeper he comes up against fierce resistance, but that doesn’t stop him getting to the bottom of a story stranger than fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxUbPwyhzNEyUZYOZm6t8yYSQf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373072'),
  ('636897422826708003', 'Ticks', 1993, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Tony Randel, Steve Grass', 'Brent V. Friedman', 'Rosalind Allen, Ami Dolenz, Seth Green, Virginya Keehne, Ray Oriel, Alfonso Ribeiro, Peter Scolari, Dina Dayrit', 'R', 'Teens camping in a northern California retreat are terrorized by mutant insects created by evil, polluting pot farmers.', 'Teens camping in a northern California retreat are terrorized by mutant insects created by evil, polluting pot farmers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tfMPBgpfwu2V403u9gST5ReWl9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34098'),
  ('748549144921139810', 'Tidal Wave', 2009, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Hwang Sun-wook, JK Youn, Kim Yeong-ho', 'Kim Hwi, JK Youn', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Ha Ji-won, Park Joong-hoon, Uhm Jung-hwa, Lee Min-ki, Kang Ye-won, Kim In-kwon, Song Jae-ho', null, 'On Haeundae Beach, a guilt-ridden fisherman takes care of a woman whose father accidentally got killed. A scientist reunites with his ex-wife and a daughter who doesn''t even remember his face. And a poor rescue worker falls in love with a rich city girl. When they all find out a gigantic tsunami will hit the beach, they realize they only have 10 minutes to escape.', 'On Haeundae Beach, a guilt-ridden fisherman takes care of a woman whose father accidentally got killed. A scientist reunites with his ex-wife and a daughter who doesn''t even remember his face. And a poor rescue worker falls in love with a rich city girl. When they all find out a gigantic tsunami will hit the beach, they realize they only have 10 minutes to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mE5jde5SJqUnZ58MAweW9GuhzK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33196'),
  ('578630987198221102', 'Tidal Wave: No Escape', 1997, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'George T. Miller, Mark Irwin', null, 'Corbin Bernsen, Julianne Phillips, Gregg Henry, Lawrence Hilton-Jacobs, Harve Presnell, Lance Wilson-White, Larry Brandenburg', null, 'A retired and disgruntled scientist is brought out of retirement to explain why tidal waves are wiping out coastal communities. But is he part of the problem?', 'A retired and disgruntled scientist is brought out of retirement to explain why tidal waves are wiping out coastal communities. But is he part of the problem?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGdsAeTe1q5CNW2h8HPbcxB2Ezf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38108'),
