  ('253822474663510638', 'Tides of War', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, TV Movie', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, Paul Atkins', 'Mark Sanderson', 'Adrian Paul, Catherine Dent, Kent McCord, Mike Doyle, Matt Battaglia, Mark Deklin, Eitan Kramer, Eyal Podell', 'PG-13', 'In the cold, dark waters off North Korea a U.S. Navy fast attack submarine meets with a mysterious disaster - it''s attacked and nearly sunk by an ominous stealth submarine resulting in the deaths of the Executive Officer and the Engineering Officer.', 'In the cold, dark waters off North Korea a U.S. Navy fast attack submarine meets with a mysterious disaster - it''s attacked and nearly sunk by an ominous stealth submarine resulting in the deaths of the Executive Officer and the Engineering Officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYAroHRpZAVSMkTSepNkZiRHqNX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41818'),
  ('889826625916252401', 'Tie Xi Qu: West of the Tracks', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Wang Bing, Wang Bing', null, null, null, 'A detailed look at the gradual decline of Shenyang’s industrial Tiexi district, an area that was once a vibrant example of China’s socialist economy. But industry is changing, and the factories of Tiexi are closing. Director Wang Bing introduces us to some of the workers affected by the closures, and to their families.', 'A detailed look at the gradual decline of Shenyang’s industrial Tiexi district, an area that was once a vibrant example of China’s socialist economy. But industry is changing, and the factories of Tiexi are closing. Director Wang Bing introduces us to some of the workers affected by the closures, and to their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4x3Hy0XX2iuGglEznKEMGHUyG7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86282'),
  ('609758414959702735', 'Tied', 2013, 'Drama', 'Hélène Fillières, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Hélène Fillières', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Laetitia Casta, Richard Bohringer, Reda Kateb, Hervé Sogne, Jean-François Stévenin, Philippe Nahon, Vicky Krieps', null, 'A banker strikes up a sadomasochistic relationship with a mistress.', 'A banker strikes up a sadomasochistic relationship with a mistress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0xXJXh8dlay4uZZIOMLK4NNsFl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155890'),
  ('1119068515891611643', 'Tiempo de silencio', 1986, 'Drama', 'Vicente Aranda', 'Vicente Aranda, Antonio Rabinad', 'Imanol Arias, Victoria Abril, Charo López, Francisco Rabal, Joaquín Hinojosa, Juan Echanove', null, 'Pedro Martín, a young and ambitious doctor, is studying the effect of cancerous cells on mice, but he has run out of mice in his laboratory, since they do not breed there, and he has no funds to purchase more of these expensive laboratory animals from the United States. Nevertheless, his assistant, Amador, informs him that he gave some of the mice to an old trapper, nicknamed “el Muecas”, who lives in precarious conditions in a shanty town outside Madrid, and that this poor man has successfully bred them with the help of the natural heat of his daughters. The incredulous scientist goes to the shanty town to obtain the mice. There, Pedro meets Muecas, Muecas''s wife Ricarda and their two daughters Florita and Conchi. With the warmth of the women’s breasts, as the flirtatious Florita shows Pedro, the mice are able to reproduce.', 'Pedro Martín, a young and ambitious doctor, is studying the effect of cancerous cells on mice, but he has run out of mice in his laboratory, since they do not breed there, and he has no funds to purchase more of these expensive laboratory animals from the United States. Nevertheless, his assistant, Amador, informs him that he gave some of the mice to an old trapper, nicknamed “el Muecas”, who lives in precarious conditions in a shanty town outside Madrid, and that this poor man has successfully bred them with the help of the natural heat of his daughters. The incredulous scientist goes to the shanty town to obtain the mice. There, Pedro meets Muecas, Muecas''s wife Ricarda and their two daughters Florita and Conchi. With the warmth of the women’s breasts, as the flirtatious Florita shows Pedro, the mice are able to reproduce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66gWTnOyoVk5X4KszuCC8ScAcYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115687'),
  ('599171660205614863', 'Tieta of Agreste', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Diegues, Edgar Moura, Isabel Diegues', 'Carlos Diegues, Antônio Calmon, João Ubaldo Ribeiro', 'Sonia Braga, Marília Pêra, Chico Anysio, Cláudia Abreu, Zezé Motta, Jece Valadão, Leon Góes, Patrícia França', null, 'After being exiled for 26 years, Tieta returns to her native village in Bahia, bringing chaos and upheaving the local order.', 'After being exiled for 26 years, Tieta returns to her native village in Bahia, bringing chaos and upheaving the local order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1b8H5UZy7k6igDxxPwp03rs08C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65140'),
  ('876231630826253974', 'Tiffany Jones', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Pete Walker, Peter Jessop', 'Alfred Shaughnessy', 'Anouska Hempel, Ray Brooks, Damien Thomas, Eric Pohlmann, Susan Sheers, Richard Marner, Martin Benson, Alan Curtis', null, 'Light-hearted and occasionally unclothed adaptation of a British comic strip in the over-the-top, on-beyond-Bond spy fantasy vein. Based on the Daily Mail comic strip.', 'Light-hearted and occasionally unclothed adaptation of a British comic strip in the over-the-top, on-beyond-Bond spy fantasy vein. Based on the Daily Mail comic strip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbJ1zerEhyg6ShLW3EU0ioHC2yV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163997'),
  ('537373480426286593', 'Tifosi', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Germano Tarricone', 'Enrico Vanzina, Fausto Brizzi, Marco Martani', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Boldi, Diego Abatantuono, Enzo Iacchetti, Maurizio Mattioli, Nino D''Angelo, Diego Maradona, Angelo Bernabucci', null, 'Four different stories about italian football team’s supporter.', 'Four different stories about italian football team’s supporter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSrdSXkqBgTUBLBVICnIGeg8ksL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42441'),
  ('526511015669674538', 'Tig', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Ashley York, Kristina Goolsby, Huy Truong', 'Jennifer Arnold', 'Tig Notaro, Stephanie Allynne, Zach Galifianakis, Sarah Silverman, Bill Burr, Kyle Dunnigan', null, 'An intimate documentary that follows Tig Notaro, a Los Angeles based comedian, who just days after being diagnosed with invasive stage II breast cancer changed the course of her career with a poignant stand-up set that became legendary overnight. It explores Tig''s extraordinary journey as her career ignites and as her life unfolds in grand and unexpected ways, all the while continuing to battle a life-threatening illness and falling in love.', 'An intimate documentary that follows Tig Notaro, a Los Angeles based comedian, who just days after being diagnosed with invasive stage II breast cancer changed the course of her career with a poignant stand-up set that became legendary overnight. It explores Tig''s extraordinary journey as her career ignites and as her life unfolds in grand and unexpected ways, all the while continuing to battle a life-threatening illness and falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40KabvxAhRc0ZAIWTduRYvgl0iH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318225'),
  ('867642392914320014', 'TIGER & BUNNY: The Beginning', 2012, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Yoshitomo Yonetani, Masaki Kitamura, Yui Tanaka', 'Masafumi Nishida', 'Hiroaki Hirata, Masakazu Morita, Taiten Kusunoki, Go Inoue, Kenjiro Tsuda, Mariya Ise, Shinichiro Ohta, Yuhko Kaida', null, 'Set on an alternative Earth, Superheroes are celebrities and a high rating TV show rates their achievements, awarding them points until an annual King of Heroes is crowned. Old-school hero Wild Tiger is assigned a new partner with very different views on the heroes role in society but soon a vigilante criminal presents them with a serious problem.', 'Set on an alternative Earth, Superheroes are celebrities and a high rating TV show rates their achievements, awarding them points until an annual King of Heroes is crowned. Old-school hero Wild Tiger is assigned a new partner with very different views on the heroes role in society but soon a vigilante criminal presents them with a serious problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZ4vRNIlXwXwEJTsHgy6j29DCU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178592'),
  ('34826195266046362', 'TIGER & BUNNY: The Rising', 2014, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshitomo Yonetani, Haruhi Goto, Keisuke Sasagawa', 'Masafumi Nishida', 'Hiroaki Hirata, Masakazu Morita, Yuichi Nakamura, Hochu Otsuka, Kenjiro Tsuda, Minako Kotobuki, Taiten Kusunoki, Go Inoue', null, 'The heroes of ''Tiger & Bunny'' are back in an all-new feature-length film! Picking up after the events of the Maverick incident, Kotetsu T. Kaburagi, a.k.k Wild Tiger, and Barnaby Brooks Jr. resume their careers as heroes fighting crime in Hero TV''s Second League. Their partnership comes to a sudden end when Apollon Media''s new owner Mark Schneider fires Kotetsu and moves Barnaby back into the First League, pairing him up with Golden Ryan, a new hero with awesome powers and a huge ego to match. When the heroes are sent to investigate a string of strange incidents tied closely to the city''s Goddess Legend, they discover three super powered NEXTs plotting to bring terror and destruction to Stern Bild. With the lives of millions hanging in the balance, Barnaby and Goden Ryan must overcome their differences to contain the approaching doom, while a jobless Kotetsu''s resolve as a hero is put to the test as he struggles to help his fellow heroes from the sidelines.', 'The heroes of ''Tiger & Bunny'' are back in an all-new feature-length film! Picking up after the events of the Maverick incident, Kotetsu T. Kaburagi, a.k.k Wild Tiger, and Barnaby Brooks Jr. resume their careers as heroes fighting crime in Hero TV''s Second League. Their partnership comes to a sudden end when Apollon Media''s new owner Mark Schneider fires Kotetsu and moves Barnaby back into the First League, pairing him up with Golden Ryan, a new hero with awesome powers and a huge ego to match. When the heroes are sent to investigate a string of strange incidents tied closely to the city''s Goddess Legend, they discover three super powered NEXTs plotting to bring terror and destruction to Stern Bild. With the lives of millions hanging in the balance, Barnaby and Goden Ryan must overcome their differences to contain the approaching doom, while a jobless Kotetsu''s resolve as a hero is put to the test as he struggles to help his fellow heroes from the sidelines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlaFtzuEm9OGQQMnDgMVbhQph3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258807'),
  ('750711486968253265', 'Tiger 3', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Shanoo Sharma, Maneesh Sharma, Sahil Bhardwaj', 'Shridhar Raghavan', 'Salman Khan, Katrina Kaif, Emraan Hashmi, Simran, Revathi, Sartaaj Kakkar, Kumud Mishra, Anant Vidhaat Sharma', null, 'Following the events of Tiger Zinda Hai, War, and Pathaan, Avinash Singh Rathore returns as Tiger but this time the battle is within. He has to choose between his country or family as an old enemy is after his life, who claims that his family was killed by Tiger. He holds Tiger captive in Pakistan as the Indian agent''s loyalty towards his country faces its biggest test.', 'Following the events of Tiger Zinda Hai, War, and Pathaan, Avinash Singh Rathore returns as Tiger but this time the battle is within. He has to choose between his country or family as an old enemy is after his life, who claims that his family was killed by Tiger. He holds Tiger captive in Pakistan as the Indian agent''s loyalty towards his country faces its biggest test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVYSsDvXPkTNE9WNOUQzbn2Imvj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:720557'),
  ('957199321744587362', 'Tiger Bay', 1959, 'Thriller, Crime', 'J. Lee Thompson, Eric Cross', 'John Hawkesworth, Shelley Smith', 'John Mills, Horst Buchholz, Hayley Mills, Yvonne Mitchell, Megs Jenkins, Anthony Dawson, George Selway, Shari', null, 'In Tiger Bay, the docklands of Cardiff, rough-and-tumble street urchin Gillie witnesses the brutal killing of a young woman at the hands of visiting Polish sailor Korchinsky. Instead of reporting the crime to the authorities, Gillie merely pockets a prize for herself — Korchinsky''s shiny black revolver — and flees the scene. When Detective Graham discovers that Gillie has the murder weapon, the fiery young girl weaves a web of lies to throw him off course.', 'In Tiger Bay, the docklands of Cardiff, rough-and-tumble street urchin Gillie witnesses the brutal killing of a young woman at the hands of visiting Polish sailor Korchinsky. Instead of reporting the crime to the authorities, Gillie merely pockets a prize for herself — Korchinsky''s shiny black revolver — and flees the scene. When Detective Graham discovers that Gillie has the murder weapon, the fiery young girl weaves a web of lies to throw him off course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0YIUi2UsXT0Q9MvDT5EWfVK3aq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43112'),
  ('971665813639117354', 'Tiger Boy', 2012, 'Drama', 'Michele D''Attanasio, Gabriele Mainetti, Matteo Albano', 'Nicola Guaglianone', 'Simone Santini, Francesco Foti, Lidia Vitale, Karim Bartoli, Daniele Trombetti, Fabio Melorio', null, 'Matteo, a nine years old kid, builds a mask identical to the one of his hero: a wrestler of a roman suburb called The Tiger. Once the mask is on, Matteo never wants to take it off. What simply appears as a tantrum is in reality a call for help that nobody seems to hear.', 'Matteo, a nine years old kid, builds a mask identical to the one of his hero: a wrestler of a roman suburb called The Tiger. Once the mask is on, Matteo never wants to take it off. What simply appears as a tantrum is in reality a call for help that nobody seems to hear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Phq6bd0H6oD5ggl4GeI5gvROaf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249707'),
  ('471895382613961963', 'Tiger Cage', 1988, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Chan Man-To, Lee Kin-Keung', 'Anthony Wong Wing-Fai', 'Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Carol Cheng, Simon Yam, Donnie Yen, Irene Wan, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Vincent Lyn', null, 'Something fishy is going on in the anti-Drug Trafficking Unit of the HK Police, and only a few honest cops know that the corruption goes all the way to the top. However, they must prove their case quickly, and by unconventional means, after they are framed for murder and drug-trafficking themselves. Dodging bullets from cops and criminals alike, the race is on to clear their names, protect their loved ones, and bring their corrupt colleagues to justice.', 'Something fishy is going on in the anti-Drug Trafficking Unit of the HK Police, and only a few honest cops know that the corruption goes all the way to the top. However, they must prove their case quickly, and by unconventional means, after they are framed for murder and drug-trafficking themselves. Dodging bullets from cops and criminals alike, the race is on to clear their names, protect their loved ones, and bring their corrupt colleagues to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3evbtScpCceIFxWOc9cIZ1mMhX7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58409'),
  ('955014242530353363', 'Tiger Cage II', 1990, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Mark Lee Ping-Bing, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan', 'Kim Yip Kwong-Kim', 'Donnie Yen, Rosamund Kwan Chi-Lam, David Wu, Robin Shou, Carol Cheng, Cynthia Khan, Leung Lam Ling, Lo Lieh', null, 'An ex-cop and divorce lawyer team up with a gangster to clear their names after getting involved in a dirty money scheme led by a vicious money launderer, who plans to expand his business and wipe out anyone who stands in his way.', 'An ex-cop and divorce lawyer team up with a gangster to clear their names after getting involved in a dirty money scheme led by a vicious money launderer, who plans to expand his business and wipe out anyone who stands in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DKQvMAiYBHBRVNtgc3qAxoAe6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58412'),
  ('481821812225910070', 'Tiger Cage III', 1991, 'Thriller, Action, Crime, Drama', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Ko Chiu-Lam, Chow Wing-Duen', 'Patrick Leung Gin, Anthony Wong Wing-Fai', 'Thomas Cheung Kwok-Leung, Michael Wong, Sharla Cheung, Wong Kam-Kong, John Cheung Ng-Long, Woo Fung, Michael Dinga, Ridley Tsui Bo-Wah', null, 'Police officers John and James investigate the case of Lee, a businessman. They seek help of Suki, a friend who double-crosses them and the two officers regroup after a setback to solve the case.', 'Police officers John and James investigate the case of Lee, a businessman. They seek help of Suki, a friend who double-crosses them and the two officers regroup after a setback to solve the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjqnkVrjHUv4PEn4BpDiYE0NL9c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138529'),
  ('67242849868254976', 'Tiger Claws', 1991, 'Action', 'Kelly Makin, Curtis Petersen', 'J. Stephen Maunder', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Jalal Merhi, Bolo Yeung, Nick Dibley, Fern Figueiredo, Jack Vorvis, Lisa-Marie Thomas, Franz Fridal', null, 'A mysterious martial artist is killing martial arts masters with his unique style, Tiger Claw. Two police detectives, who are also martial arts experts, use unorthodox methods to track down the serial killer.', 'A mysterious martial artist is killing martial arts masters with his unique style, Tiger Claw. Two police detectives, who are also martial arts experts, use unorthodox methods to track down the serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6xwAfDrNvUXRVXtuqiLMhnBTmq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66006'),
  ('1114613801363130543', 'Tiger Claws II', 1996, 'Action', 'J. Stephen Maunder, Mark Willis, Eli Necakov', 'J. Stephen Maunder', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Jalal Merhi, Bolo Yeung, Ong Soo Han, Evan Lurie, Lazar Rockwood, Eric Lee, Paul Rapovski', null, 'Released five years after the first installment, Tiger Claws II finds Yeung''s martial arts serial killer, Chong, busted out of jail by a team of heavies in the employ of gangster Dai Lo Fu, and whisked across the country to San Fransisco''s Chinatown. When NYC cop Tarek Richards learns of a rash of recent killings using Chong''s distinctive M.O.— a claw-like mark across the face of the victim— he contacts his old partner, Linda Masterson, who is now living in L.A., for help. But Chong, as it turns out, has nothing to do with the murders. He''s just being used by crime kingpin Lo Fu, who needs to combine his energy with Chong''s to open some sort of time portal to provide vital supplies for the ancient Shaolin monks. In truth, though, Lo Fu greedily plans to use the portal to smuggle heavy modern artillery back and rule Qing Dynasty-era China himself.', 'Released five years after the first installment, Tiger Claws II finds Yeung''s martial arts serial killer, Chong, busted out of jail by a team of heavies in the employ of gangster Dai Lo Fu, and whisked across the country to San Fransisco''s Chinatown. When NYC cop Tarek Richards learns of a rash of recent killings using Chong''s distinctive M.O.— a claw-like mark across the face of the victim— he contacts his old partner, Linda Masterson, who is now living in L.A., for help. But Chong, as it turns out, has nothing to do with the murders. He''s just being used by crime kingpin Lo Fu, who needs to combine his energy with Chong''s to open some sort of time portal to provide vital supplies for the ancient Shaolin monks. In truth, though, Lo Fu greedily plans to use the portal to smuggle heavy modern artillery back and rule Qing Dynasty-era China himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkOi2jgUiQ1SrFvIJzCvKGovj9C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37677'),
  ('134221908706777764', 'Tiger Claws III', 1999, 'Action, Crime', 'J. Stephen Maunder, Curtis Petersen', 'J. Stephen Maunder', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Jalal Merhi, Loren Avedon, Carter Huang Chia-Ta, Michael Chow, Nicholas Celozzi, Victor Altomare, Russell Peters', null, 'When a psychotic martial artist called Stryker resurrects the long-dead spirits of three ancient Chinese master assassins in an effort to take over the New York underworld, it''s up to supercops Tarek Richards and Linda Masterson to stop him. However, it''s not so easy to battle the undead, and though Richards apparently holds within him the key to defeating these "Masters", he will need the guidance of Stryker''s former master to aid him... let the battle begin.', 'When a psychotic martial artist called Stryker resurrects the long-dead spirits of three ancient Chinese master assassins in an effort to take over the New York underworld, it''s up to supercops Tarek Richards and Linda Masterson to stop him. However, it''s not so easy to battle the undead, and though Richards apparently holds within him the key to defeating these "Masters", he will need the guidance of Stryker''s former master to aid him... let the battle begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/be2r6APp3ot1EQ2YRAksmBQ7Pgk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205680'),
  ('974759228007025963', 'Tiger Cruise', 2004, 'TV Movie, Family, Drama', 'Duwayne Dunham, Robert Seaman, Mark Hansson', 'Bruce Graham, Anna Sandor', 'Hayden Panettiere, Bill Pullman, Troy Evans, Bianca Collins, Nathaniel Lee Jr., Mercedes Colon, Mehcad Brooks, Jansen Panettiere', 'PG', 'On its last leg homeward, from Pearl Harbor, Hawaii to San Diego, the USS Constellation hosts a jolly "tiger cruise" for US Navy, Marines and USNAF relatives, mainly minors ("Navy brats"). Attitudes and emotions vary from simple joy to open frustration, the worst brat being XO commander Gary Dolan''s daughter Maddie, who wants him to refuse a promotion to command for a shore job. Then the news of the WCC terror crisis changes everything, as the crew is recalled to war footing.', 'On its last leg homeward, from Pearl Harbor, Hawaii to San Diego, the USS Constellation hosts a jolly "tiger cruise" for US Navy, Marines and USNAF relatives, mainly minors ("Navy brats"). Attitudes and emotions vary from simple joy to open frustration, the worst brat being XO commander Gary Dolan''s daughter Maddie, who wants him to refuse a promotion to command for a shore job. Then the news of the WCC terror crisis changes everything, as the crew is recalled to war footing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oltUNC3hNkxoHtSuHkSkhCfm5rJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51909'),
  ('1008534805507705970', 'Tiger Girl', 1954, 'Romance, Comedy, Action', 'Aleksandr Ivanovsky, Nadezhda Kosheverova, Apollinariy Dudko', 'Klimenti Mints, Evgeniy Pomeshchikov', 'Pavel Kadochnikov, Lyudmila Kasatkina, Leonid Bykov, Tatyana Pelttser, Sergei Filippov, Nina Urgant, Konstantin Sorokin, Glikeriya Bogdanova-Chesnokova', null, 'The story is about heiress of the circus family who organizes show "Let''s get married" right in the cage for the tigers. Famous motorcyclist Fedya Yermolaev is invited to the circus for a ‘death-defying number’ – to perform a jump on a motorcycle under the big dome! Lena, a custodian at the circus, dreams of becoming a tiger tamer. Stray tigers growl and frighten. Lena enters the cage and...', 'The story is about heiress of the circus family who organizes show "Let''s get married" right in the cage for the tigers. Famous motorcyclist Fedya Yermolaev is invited to the circus for a ‘death-defying number’ – to perform a jump on a motorcycle under the big dome! Lena, a custodian at the circus, dreams of becoming a tiger tamer. Stray tigers growl and frighten. Lena enters the cage and...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7dHScZtV8j4OAgzFvxWVXQw8QF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81206'),
  ('638211360549357343', 'Tiger Girl', 2017, 'Action', 'Jakob Lass', 'Jakob Lass, Ines Schiller, Eva-Maria Reimer', 'Ella Rumpf, Maria Dragus, Enno Trebs, Franz Rogowski, Orce Feldschau, Benjamin Lutzke, Lana Cooper, Robert Gwisdek', null, 'Having failed to get into the police force, Margarete takes up training as a security guard. One night she runs into a sexually agressive ex-colleague who insists on hailing a taxi to take her home to his place. Enter Tiger: short brown hair, a tough girl and a fighter, the cab driver. Realising that the situation is far from consensual, Tiger speeds off with Margarete, leaving her companion standing in the street. It won’t be the last time she rushes to Margarete’s aid. Tiger lives in an attic flat with two men. She knows how to wield a baseball bat. Stealing a uniform from security and renaming Margarete ‘Vanilla’, she begins to steer her life in a completely different direction.', 'Having failed to get into the police force, Margarete takes up training as a security guard. One night she runs into a sexually agressive ex-colleague who insists on hailing a taxi to take her home to his place. Enter Tiger: short brown hair, a tough girl and a fighter, the cab driver. Realising that the situation is far from consensual, Tiger speeds off with Margarete, leaving her companion standing in the street. It won’t be the last time she rushes to Margarete’s aid. Tiger lives in an attic flat with two men. She knows how to wield a baseball bat. Stealing a uniform from security and renaming Margarete ‘Vanilla’, she begins to steer her life in a completely different direction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGnbgXQ39qtopRZDmBnYG9gR3lJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427023'),
  ('1122910296590405097', 'Tiger Heart', 1996, 'Action', 'Georges Chamchoum, Maurice K. McGuire, Ken Blakey', 'William Applegate Jr.', 'Ted Jan Roberts, Carol Potter, Jennifer Lyons, Robert LaSardo, Rance Howard, Timothy Williams, David Michael, Brian Gross', 'PG-13', 'A teen martial arts expert takes on a bunch of thugs who are forcing a community to sell their property in order to build a mall.', 'A teen martial arts expert takes on a bunch of thugs who are forcing a community to sell their property in order to build a mall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrN51VIW2xO6ii5LlBitS7K8yDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126914'),
  ('165176735506915118', 'Tiger House', 2015, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Tom Daley, Willie Nel', 'Simon Lewis', 'Kaya Scodelario, Ed Skrein, Dougray Scott, Brandon Auret, Langley Kirkwood, Julie Summers, Daniel Boyd, Andrew Brent', 'R', 'A young gymnast battles a group of bank robbers at the home of her boyfriend.', 'A young gymnast battles a group of bank robbers at the home of her boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heqehuEfbg2283Z9hFmsVuv3UE3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341077'),
  ('941903722053050868', 'Tiger Milk', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ute Wieland, Felix Cramer', 'Ute Wieland', 'Flora Thiemann, Emily Kusche, Eva Löbau, Lars Rudolph, Ludwig Trepte, Heiko Pinkowski, Thorsten Merten, Narges Rashidi', 'NR', 'Best friends Nini and Jameelah are both 14 years old and live in the same housing complex in Berlin. Jameelah''s family is from Iraq and might be deported if their application for citizenship isn''t approved, but right now, the girls try not to worry about these existential problems. They look forward to the Berlin summer and the school holidays.', 'Best friends Nini and Jameelah are both 14 years old and live in the same housing complex in Berlin. Jameelah''s family is from Iraq and might be deported if their application for citizenship isn''t approved, but right now, the girls try not to worry about these existential problems. They look forward to the Berlin summer and the school holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKyhCDAVuY1h9XhcAG8TdZBr5nV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427028'),
  ('995927353491812133', 'Tiger on the Beat', 1988, 'Action, Crime, Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Cho On-Sun', 'Tsang Kwok-Chi', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Nina Li Chi, Conan Lee, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Shirley Ng Ling, Phillip Ko Fai, Ti Lung', null, 'A seasoned cop and his rookie partner are a pair of mismatched partners in this Hong Kong action-comedy in the style of ''Lethal Weapon''. The wacky twosome are up in arms as they try to solve the murder of a heroin trafficker.', 'A seasoned cop and his rookie partner are a pair of mismatched partners in this Hong Kong action-comedy in the style of ''Lethal Weapon''. The wacky twosome are up in arms as they try to solve the murder of a heroin trafficker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Ti6Swe68KY76maRqcjYUZbMSX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65649'),
  ('494501693017088826', 'Tiger on the Beat 2', 1990, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Yeung Suk-Fan, Mau Kin-Tak', 'Joyee Cheung Lai-Ling, Kelvin Wong Ho-Yee', 'Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Conan Lee, Ellen Chan Nga-Lun, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Maria Cordero, James Wong Jim, Margaret Lee', null, 'Lam, a cop approaching 40 but without much accomplishment, always wants to achieve something memorable before his retirement. He is obliged by his sister to find a decent Chinese girl for his nephew, Baffalo, who is an "American Born Chinese". But Baffalo has an eye for a sweetie, Ellen, who has accidentally witnessed a murder. The incident gets Lam, Baffalo and Ellen being involved in a ruthless underground arms smuggling ring, wich sends the killer to eliminate them.', 'Lam, a cop approaching 40 but without much accomplishment, always wants to achieve something memorable before his retirement. He is obliged by his sister to find a decent Chinese girl for his nephew, Baffalo, who is an "American Born Chinese". But Baffalo has an eye for a sweetie, Ellen, who has accidentally witnessed a murder. The incident gets Lam, Baffalo and Ellen being involved in a ruthless underground arms smuggling ring, wich sends the killer to eliminate them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WREgc9Mu98feIq2vWM6wU3ak6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170804'),
  ('276094888727933642', 'Tiger Robbers', 2021, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Li Yu', 'Li Yu', 'Ma Li, Song Jia, Zhang Haiyu, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Tizzy T, Sha Yi, Yang Di, Zhang Renbo', null, 'Based on Kotaro Isaka''s novel"Sunshine Robber. Four robbers team up to pull off a "fun" heist involving a Bengal tiger.', 'Based on Kotaro Isaka''s novel"Sunshine Robber. Four robbers team up to pull off a "fun" heist involving a Bengal tiger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndCPKLs52CraXHsAH76LI6UOTW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502376'),
  ('5711114063751594', 'Tiger Shark', 1932, 'Drama, Romance', 'Howard Hawks, Tony Gaudio, Richard Rosson', 'Howard Hawks, John Lee Mahin', 'Edward G. Robinson, Richard Arlen, Zita Johann, Leila Bennett, J. Carrol Naish, Vince Barnett, William Ricciardi, Maurice Black', null, 'A Portuguese tuna fisherman catches his bride with his first mate.', 'A Portuguese tuna fisherman catches his bride with his first mate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBnxEG4HCVqtScs6Ew8UrHMMzlj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109262'),
  ('862873831733546115', 'Tiger Stripes', 2023, 'Drama, Horror', 'Amanda Nell Eu, Jimmy Gimferrer, Lim Khai Sim', 'Amanda Nell Eu', 'Zafreen Zairizal, Deena Ezral, Piqa, Shaheizy Sam, June Lojong, Khairunazwan Rodzy, Fatimah Abu Bakar, Bella Rahim', null, 'A carefree student at an all-girls school shows unusual symptoms when she begins puberty, forcing her to grapple with a mysterious and visceral power.', 'A carefree student at an all-girls school shows unusual symptoms when she begins puberty, forcing her to grapple with a mysterious and visceral power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aF09HuGro1aBHoEIbRZypGtJAih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1077693'),
  ('509253166373067383', 'Tiger Team: The Mountain of 1000 Dragons', 2010, 'Adventure, Family', 'Peter Gersina, Ulrike Schürhoff, Carsten Thiele', 'Thomas Brezina, Peter Gersina', 'Helena Siegmund-Schultze, Bruno Schubert, Justus Kammerer, Iris Berben, Stipe Erceg, Soogi Kang, Wang Deshun, Simon Schwarz', null, 'The Viennese detective children Biggi, Patrick and Luke find a key in dragon form, and their curiosity is aroused. They realize that the sinister Lady Q is interested in opening the legendary moon palace and find the elixir which is believed that promises eternal youth. The Tigers must prevent that Lady Q enters into possession of the priceless liquid.', 'The Viennese detective children Biggi, Patrick and Luke find a key in dragon form, and their curiosity is aroused. They realize that the sinister Lady Q is interested in opening the legendary moon palace and find the elixir which is believed that promises eternal youth. The Tigers must prevent that Lady Q enters into possession of the priceless liquid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyNc5nmQ72USlWdc7Q7Bc9rlnOo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63695'),
