  ('804485535923498626', 'Tight Spot', 1955, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Phil Karlson, Burnett Guffey, Milton Feldman', 'William Bowers', 'Ginger Rogers, Edward G. Robinson, Brian Keith, Lucy Marlow, Lorne Greene, Katherine Anderson, Allen Nourse, Peter Leeds', 'NR', 'A former model, serving time in prison, becomes a key witness in a trial against a notorious gangster. She is put under protective watch by the District Attorney in a posh hotel, but the crime kingpin makes attempts to get to her.', 'A former model, serving time in prison, becomes a key witness in a trial against a notorious gangster. She is put under protective watch by the District Attorney in a posh hotel, but the crime kingpin makes attempts to get to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gz0x6YH3WJdw71E9oyb3mKTNiXn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76121'),
