  ('1041699463227587794', 'Tigrero: A Film That Was Never Made', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Mika Kaurismäki, Jacques Cheuiche', 'Mika Kaurismäki', 'Jim Jarmusch, Samuel Fuller', null, 'In 1993, Sam Fuller takes Jim Jarmusch on a trip into Brazil''s Mato Grosso, up the River Araguaia to the village of Santa Isabel Do Morro, where 40 years before, Zanuck had sent Fuller to scout a location and write a script for a movie based on a tigrero, a jaguar hunter. Sam hopes to find people who remember him, and he takes film he shot in 1954. He''s Rip Van Winkle, and, indeed, a great deal changed in the village. There are televisions, watches, and brick houses. But, the same Karajá culture awaits as well. He gathers the villagers to show his old film footage, and people recognize friends and relatives, thanking Fuller for momentarily bringing them back to life.', 'In 1993, Sam Fuller takes Jim Jarmusch on a trip into Brazil''s Mato Grosso, up the River Araguaia to the village of Santa Isabel Do Morro, where 40 years before, Zanuck had sent Fuller to scout a location and write a script for a movie based on a tigrero, a jaguar hunter. Sam hopes to find people who remember him, and he takes film he shot in 1954. He''s Rip Van Winkle, and, indeed, a great deal changed in the village. There are televisions, watches, and brick houses. But, the same Karajá culture awaits as well. He gathers the villagers to show his old film footage, and people recognize friends and relatives, thanking Fuller for momentarily bringing them back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLXywHBqww8uhCiJ6OM5RbOBZz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88030'),
  ('208036058010445173', 'Tih Minh', 1918, 'Adventure, Crime', 'Louis Feuillade, Léon Klausse, Julien Duvivier', 'Georges La Faure, Louis Feuillade', 'Mary Harald, René Cresté, Georges Biscot, Édouard Mathé, Louis Leubas, Gaston Michel, Marcel Marquet, Émile André', null, 'Jacques d''Athys, a French adventurer, returns to his home in Nice after an expedition to Indochina where he has picked up a Eurasian fiancée and a book that, unbeknownst to him, contains a coded message revealing the whereabouts of both secret treasures and sensitive government intelligence. This makes him the target of foreign spies, including a Marquise of mysterious Latin origin, a Hindu hypnotist and an evil German doctor, who will stop at nothing to obtain the book.', 'Jacques d''Athys, a French adventurer, returns to his home in Nice after an expedition to Indochina where he has picked up a Eurasian fiancée and a book that, unbeknownst to him, contains a coded message revealing the whereabouts of both secret treasures and sensitive government intelligence. This makes him the target of foreign spies, including a Marquise of mysterious Latin origin, a Hindu hypnotist and an evil German doctor, who will stop at nothing to obtain the book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drcLhwmeu1ndGH9uafS3QiWKBSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82476'),
  ('272592359022218677', 'Tik Tok', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Li Jun, Lee Byeong-hoon, Jeong Sang-hyeop', 'Xiaoyang Ding', 'Lee Jung-jae, Wallace Chung, Lang Yueting, Lee Chae-young, Ha Seok, Jang Nam-yeol, Ho San, Min Mu-jae', null, 'When a bombing occurs during a soccer match between China and South Korea, the two countries are embroiled in a fierce cat-and-mouse chase.', 'When a bombing occurs during a soccer match between China and South Korea, the two countries are embroiled in a fierce cat-and-mouse chase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Pp5e0rRyDfBjAmi3qzxCByG3Vh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388757'),
  ('524052984653264267', 'Tiku Weds Sheru', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Sai Kabir, Fernando Gayesky', 'Sai Kabir', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Avneet Kaur, Akshat Jain, Khushi Bhardwaj', null, 'Tiku Weds Sheru is a romantic comedy about two quirky characters who dream of becoming film stars. While their romance blooms, they get caught between the chaos of the underworld and drugs, and face one tragedy after the other. Will their relationship survive the odds thrown at them?', 'Tiku Weds Sheru is a romantic comedy about two quirky characters who dream of becoming film stars. While their romance blooms, they get caught between the chaos of the underworld and drugs, and face one tragedy after the other. Will their relationship survive the odds thrown at them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mp4KqqVU6uUNwnpYqAtthik1DB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:919031'),
  ('145723349793717968', 'Til Death Do Us Part', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Hélène Fillières, Stephan Massis', 'Hélène Fillières, Jean-Pierre Améris, Claude Scasso', 'Laurent Gerra, Diane Rouxel, Antoine Duléry, Catherine Frot, Lola Dewaere, Théo Augier, Guillaume Arnault, Jean-Paul Vors', null, 'John Dubury, a fifty-year-old man disappointed by his life, sees his wife die from a fatal fall while they are on vacation together. And while an accident is initially thought to be the cause of death, suspicions soon turn to John... especially since a witness claims to have seen him push his wife.', 'John Dubury, a fifty-year-old man disappointed by his life, sees his wife die from a fatal fall while they are on vacation together. And while an accident is initially thought to be the cause of death, suspicions soon turn to John... especially since a witness claims to have seen him push his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r48yRnBskVL3u7u8rgV3FeF7CAY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1082850'),
  ('1060256594989417357', 'Till', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Felix Jordan, Bobby Bukowski, Rebecca Strickland', 'Michael Reilly, Keith Beauchamp, Chinonye Chukwu', 'Danielle Deadwyler, Jalyn Hall, Frankie Faison, Haley Bennett, John Douglas Thompson, Whoopi Goldberg, Jayme Lawson, Tosin Cole', 'PG-13', 'The true story of Mamie Till Mobley’s relentless pursuit of justice for her 14 year old son, Emmett Till, who, in 1955, was lynched while visiting his cousins in Mississippi.', 'The true story of Mamie Till Mobley’s relentless pursuit of justice for her 14 year old son, Emmett Till, who, in 1955, was lynched while visiting his cousins in Mississippi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmDs0CYlgioyP2AQQTTmavt3uoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854239'),
  ('267507340318396861', 'Till Death', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'SK Dale, Maya Markova, Jamie Cairney', 'Jason Carvey', 'Megan Fox, Eoin Macken, Aml Ameen, Callan Mulvey, Jack Roth, Stefanie Yunger, Teodora Djuric, Lili Rich', 'R', 'After a romantic evening at their secluded lake house, a woman wakes up handcuffed to her dead husband. Trapped and isolated in the dead of winter, she must fight off hired killers to escape her late spouse''s twisted plan.', 'After a romantic evening at their secluded lake house, a woman wakes up handcuffed to her dead husband. Trapped and isolated in the dead of winter, she must fight off hired killers to escape her late spouse''s twisted plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvwMvrX2XqZVOz35YuYbFx3Iggr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672741'),
  ('195944385337980219', 'Till Death Do Us Part', 1982, 'Thriller, Romance, Horror, TV Movie', 'Timothy Bond, François Protat', null, 'Matt Craven, Jack Creley, Helen Hughes, Claude Jutra, James Keach', null, 'Three troubled couples attend a two day marital retreat in hopes of saving their marriages. Unbeknownst to them, their psychiatrist is not who they think he is.', 'Three troubled couples attend a two day marital retreat in hopes of saving their marriages. Unbeknownst to them, their psychiatrist is not who they think he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4Uoav15YZFq9hro8xbHxfldV0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85201'),
  ('15859639939551226', 'Till Death Us Do Part', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Norman Cohen, Harry Waxman, Thelma Graves', 'Johnny Speight', 'Warren Mitchell, Dandy Nichols, Una Stubbs, Anthony Booth, Bill Maynard, Liam Redmond, Brian Blessed, Sam Kydd', 'PG', 'Based on the hit sitcom of the same name; racist, anti-Socialist Tory Alf Garnett and his long-suffering wife Else raise their daughter Rita during the Blitz.', 'Based on the hit sitcom of the same name; racist, anti-Socialist Tory Alf Garnett and his long-suffering wife Else raise their daughter Rita during the Blitz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWb76IrGtl1Ym5GCoSmvfUFEuIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42894'),
  ('433783259695742058', 'Till Human Voices Wake Us', 2002, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Michael Petroni, Roger Lanser', 'Michael Petroni', 'Guy Pearce, Helena Bonham Carter, Frank Gallacher, Lindley Joyner, Brooke Harman, Peter Curtin, Margot Knight, Anthony Martin', 'R', 'Sam and Silvy are best friends. One night, as they are watching a falling star while floating on their backs in a lake, Sylvy disappears from his side. Despite his best efforts, he cannot find her under water. Many years later, Sam, now a psychologist, returns to bury his father. Back in his hometown, he meets a woman called Ruby who reminds him in so many ways of his lost love.', 'Sam and Silvy are best friends. One night, as they are watching a falling star while floating on their backs in a lake, Sylvy disappears from his side. Despite his best efforts, he cannot find her under water. Many years later, Sam, now a psychologist, returns to bury his father. Back in his hometown, he meets a woman called Ruby who reminds him in so many ways of his lost love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVUYqZ2sGjEOYXA0tumra96ZxJI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41820'),
  ('997172653240894567', 'Till Luck Do Us Part', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Santucci, Juarez Pavelak, Cacala Carvana', 'Paulo Cursino, Angélica Lopes', 'Leandro Hassum, Danielle Winits, Kiko Mascarenhas, Rita Elmôr, Aílton Graça, Rodrigo Sant''anna, Julia Dalavia, Henry Fiuka', null, 'Check out the hilarious story of luck and misadventures of Tino, a family man whose life is transformed after he wins the lottery. Dazzled by wealth, this boaster spends all his money on a life of luxury and ostentation. But after finding out that he is bankrupt, he faces comical situations: besides not telling his wife he is broke because she is pregnant and cannot get upset, Tino must accept help from his neighbor who is an extremely thrifty financial adviser and the only one capable of getting him out of the rut.', 'Check out the hilarious story of luck and misadventures of Tino, a family man whose life is transformed after he wins the lottery. Dazzled by wealth, this boaster spends all his money on a life of luxury and ostentation. But after finding out that he is bankrupt, he faces comical situations: besides not telling his wife he is broke because she is pregnant and cannot get upset, Tino must accept help from his neighbor who is an extremely thrifty financial adviser and the only one capable of getting him out of the rut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAd1DeclHsJ0lnrizw4bTYivFqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154441'),
  ('261800522523714672', 'Till Luck Do Us Part 2', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Santucci, João Londres, Shanti Correa', 'Paulo Cursino, Chico Soares', 'Leandro Hassum, Camila Morgado, Kiko Mascarenhas, Rita Elmôr, Julia Dalavia, Henry Fiuka, Charles Paraventi, Rodrigo Sant''anna', null, 'After all the trouble in the first film, Tino and Jane have more fun adventures. Still tasting bitter failure, they see a light at the end of the tunnel with uncle Olavinho’s unexpected inheritance. However, the will carries an unusual request: the rich uncle wants his ashes to be scattered throughout the Grand Canyon. The couple takes the opportunity of the trip to fulfill this wish and decides to go to Las Vegas and end up getting into comical situations. Big time spender Tino will fall into the greatest temptations and indulge in the casinos of the gambling city.', 'After all the trouble in the first film, Tino and Jane have more fun adventures. Still tasting bitter failure, they see a light at the end of the tunnel with uncle Olavinho’s unexpected inheritance. However, the will carries an unusual request: the rich uncle wants his ashes to be scattered throughout the Grand Canyon. The couple takes the opportunity of the trip to fulfill this wish and decides to go to Las Vegas and end up getting into comical situations. Big time spender Tino will fall into the greatest temptations and indulge in the casinos of the gambling city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DOmK1UXPulQWLj3xdArcHKGQ9C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228177'),
  ('968027114841866727', 'Till Luck Do Us: Part 3', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Santucci, Leonardo Teatini, Eduardo Kropf', 'Leo Luz, Paulo Cursino', 'Leandro Hassum, Camila Morgado, Julia Dalavia, Henry Fiuka, Ana Júlia Freitas, Kiko Mascarenhas, Aílton Graça, Leonardo Franco', null, 'After waking from a coma, Tino learns his future in-laws have given him a high-powered financial job, for which he is woefully unqualified.', 'After waking from a coma, Tino learns his future in-laws have given him a high-powered financial job, for which he is woefully unqualified.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oStp9ynfr1dFKBrOSf7U8QYocgR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324465'),
  ('543177493173651240', 'Till Marriage Do Us Part', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Luigi Comencini, Massimo Patrizi, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Luigi Comencini, Ivo Perilli', 'Laura Antonelli, Alberto Lionello, Michele Placido, Jean Rochefort, Ugo Pagliai, Rosemary Dexter, Karin Schubert, Michele Abruzzo', null, 'In early 20th-century Sicily, Eugenia Di Maqueda and Raimondo Corrao discover on their wedding night that they are brother and sister and therefore unable to consummate their marriage. For the sake of the family inheritance and honour, the two decide not to reveal the truth to anyone. In public, they will play the part of husband and wife, but in private they will live in absolute chastity as siblings. Meanwhile, the beautiful Eugenia’s urgent carnal desires become increasingly pressing...', 'In early 20th-century Sicily, Eugenia Di Maqueda and Raimondo Corrao discover on their wedding night that they are brother and sister and therefore unable to consummate their marriage. For the sake of the family inheritance and honour, the two decide not to reveal the truth to anyone. In public, they will play the part of husband and wife, but in private they will live in absolute chastity as siblings. Meanwhile, the beautiful Eugenia’s urgent carnal desires become increasingly pressing...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7XeqlfjguHmXxRzqJXVm6KaGoS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75293'),
  ('183629477429673524', 'Till the Clouds Roll By', 1946, 'Music', 'Richard Whorf, Harry Stradling Sr., Lennie Hayton', 'Jean Holloway, Myles Connolly', 'June Allyson, Lucille Bremer, Judy Garland, Kathryn Grayson, Van Heflin, Lena Horne, Van Johnson, Tony Martin', 'NR', 'Light bio-pic of American Broadway pioneer Jerome Kern, featuring renditions of the famous songs from his musical plays by contemporary stage artists, including a condensed production of his most famous: ''Showboat''.', 'Light bio-pic of American Broadway pioneer Jerome Kern, featuring renditions of the famous songs from his musical plays by contemporary stage artists, including a condensed production of his most famous: ''Showboat''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHy3xEV2wmeRQWVE8Ko3HdWxt97.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18700'),
  ('289554287360624804', 'Till the End of the World', 2018, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Wu Youyin', 'Wu Youyin', 'Mark Chao You-Ting, Yang Zishan, Anastasia Berestova, Sun Di', null, 'The unlikely pairing of a spoiled millionaire venture capitalist scouting for extreme wedding tour locations and a grounded science photographer en route to chronicle the Aurora Australis lights face the ultimate 75 day test for survival and redemption after their twin engine craft crashes during a debilitating snowstorm over the vast desolate nether-regions of Antarctica.', 'The unlikely pairing of a spoiled millionaire venture capitalist scouting for extreme wedding tour locations and a grounded science photographer en route to chronicle the Aurora Australis lights face the ultimate 75 day test for survival and redemption after their twin engine craft crashes during a debilitating snowstorm over the vast desolate nether-regions of Antarctica.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9YKjzJX4B8LcIEZbe2Lyvxu6rl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502086'),
  ('139246477487883327', 'Till the End of Time', 1946, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Edward Dmytryk, Harry J. Wild, Ruby Rosenberg', 'Allen Rivkin', 'Dorothy McGuire, Guy Madison, Robert Mitchum, Bill Williams, Tom Tully, William Gargan, Jean Porter, Johnny Sands', 'NR', 'Three former marines have a hard time readjusting to civilian life. Perry can''t deal with the loss of the use of his legs. William is in trouble with bad debts. And Cliff can''t decide what he wants to do with his life, although he gets encouragement from war widow Pat Ruscomb.', 'Three former marines have a hard time readjusting to civilian life. Perry can''t deal with the loss of the use of his legs. William is in trouble with bad debts. And Cliff can''t decide what he wants to do with his life, although he gets encouragement from war widow Pat Ruscomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTIWI9TLrsnVzNLkfGi4BjwTBQQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101859'),
  ('920399371361368325', 'Till We Meet Again', 2021, 'Fantasy, Romance, Adventure', 'Giddens Ko', 'Giddens Ko', 'Kai Ko, Vivian Sung, Gingle Wang, Umin Boya, Laka Umaw, Honduras, Joelle Lu, Phil Hou', null, 'Ah Lun, who has a choice to make in the underworld, decides to be a god of love in Chinese mythology. As he advances with his tasks on Earth, his biggest challenge is to tie a red string with the woman he loves the most.', 'Ah Lun, who has a choice to make in the underworld, decides to be a god of love in Chinese mythology. As he advances with his tasks on Earth, his biggest challenge is to tie a red string with the woman he loves the most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqb2JeSgkCMzG4JL54Aab8dTwFg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783740'),
  ('46757709337604113', 'Till We Meet Again on the Lily Hill', 2023, 'War, Romance, History', 'Yoichi Narita, KASHIMOTO Shuichi', 'Yoichi Narita, Masahiro Yamaura', 'Haruka Fukuhara, Koshi Mizukami, Kentaro Ito, Shusaku Kamikawa, Hayato Onozuka, Natsuki Deguchi, Yoshiyuki Tsubokura, Keiko Matsuzaka', null, 'Yuri is a high school student in the present day. She isn''t happy with her life at home or school. One day, she has an argument with her mother and runs away from home. Somehow, when Yuri later opens her eyes, she realizes that she is in the year 1945. She happens to meet Akira. He is a pilot for a kamikaze unit in the military.', 'Yuri is a high school student in the present day. She isn''t happy with her life at home or school. One day, she has an argument with her mother and runs away from home. Somehow, when Yuri later opens her eyes, she realizes that she is in the year 1945. She happens to meet Akira. He is a pilot for a kamikaze unit in the military.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VYQWwEWAetTZW6Zrkc1A4Q2wXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1153325'),
  ('1015425827141940853', 'Tilt', 1979, 'Drama', 'Rudy Durand, Richard H. Kline', 'Rudy Durand, Donald Cammell', 'Brooke Shields, Ken Marshall, Charles Durning, Lorenzo Lamas, John Crawford, Karen Lamm, Gregory Walcott, Harvey Lewis', 'PG', 'Tilt is the story of a precocious young girl who is a pinball wizard. Because she does not get on with her parents, Tilt is contemplating running away from home. Skipping school one day, she decides to go to to Mickey''s Bar. Mickey, who is Tilt''s good friend, helps her set up a gambler for a pinball game. Because the gambler is unaware of Tilt''s pinball wizardry, he is easily hustled out of his money. While watching the confrontation, a young man named Neil Gallagher, who is an aspiring musician, is impressed with Tilt''s ability, congratulating her after the win. Neil invites Tilt to watch him sing at a rock concert, and after his performance she believes he can become a great singer. Because Neil needs money for a demo tape of his songs, he has an idea of taking Tilt with him and having her hustle would-be gamblers.', 'Tilt is the story of a precocious young girl who is a pinball wizard. Because she does not get on with her parents, Tilt is contemplating running away from home. Skipping school one day, she decides to go to to Mickey''s Bar. Mickey, who is Tilt''s good friend, helps her set up a gambler for a pinball game. Because the gambler is unaware of Tilt''s pinball wizardry, he is easily hustled out of his money. While watching the confrontation, a young man named Neil Gallagher, who is an aspiring musician, is impressed with Tilt''s ability, congratulating her after the win. Neil invites Tilt to watch him sing at a rock concert, and after his performance she believes he can become a great singer. Because Neil needs money for a demo tape of his songs, he has an idea of taking Tilt with him and having her hustle would-be gamblers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYd3aDe4AbtVnwLrEYrocxHTi4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26460'),
  ('297210715539922982', 'Tim', 1979, 'Romance, Drama', 'Michael Pate, Paul Onorato', 'Michael Pate', 'Piper Laurie, Mel Gibson, Alwyn Kurts, Pat Evison, Peter Gwynne, Deborah Kennedy, Michael Caulfield, Allan Penney', null, 'Handsome but backward gardener Tim Melville has a new woman in his life. She is Mary, his widowed employer, a woman who had given up on love until she had found Tim. At first they are friends. But soon they become lovers, as Mary, drawn to Tim''s innocence and magnetism, begins to teach him all about life - and love.', 'Handsome but backward gardener Tim Melville has a new woman in his life. She is Mary, his widowed employer, a woman who had given up on love until she had found Tim. At first they are friends. But soon they become lovers, as Mary, drawn to Tim''s innocence and magnetism, begins to teach him all about life - and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7UqiUso1CS3EFs3BP6P12Sez47.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31179'),
  ('227874450902072088', 'Tim and Eric''s Billion Dollar Movie', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Eric Wareheim, Tim Heidecker, Rachel Morrison', 'Tim Heidecker, Eric Wareheim', 'Tim Heidecker, Eric Wareheim, John C. Reilly, Zach Galifianakis, Will Ferrell, Robert Loggia, Ray Wise, Jeff Goldblum', 'R', 'Two guys get a billion dollars to make a movie, only to watch their dream run off course.', 'Two guys get a billion dollars to make a movie, only to watch their dream run off course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZg8UBntsaChxIfRjJKjoTsPMo1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79940'),
  ('612456824490290940', 'Tim Maia', 2014, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Mauro Lima, Camila Magalhães, Dudu Miranda', 'Antônia Pellegrino, Mauro Lima', 'Babu Santana, Robson Nunes, Alinne Moraes, Cauã Reymond, Valdineia Soriano, George Sauma, Tito Naville, Jonathan Azevedo', null, 'Biopic of Brazilian singer Tim Maia, from his childhood in Rio de Janeiro until his death at age 55, including his passage by the US, where he discovers a new style of music and is arrested for theft and drug possession.', 'Biopic of Brazilian singer Tim Maia, from his childhood in Rio de Janeiro until his death at age 55, including his passage by the US, where he discovers a new style of music and is arrested for theft and drug possession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZOOkfjr8YVhRsQvZxPUeqw49cx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286256'),
  ('464139712634110826', 'Tim''s Vermeer', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Teller, Shane F. Kelly', 'Penn Jillette, Teller', 'Tim Jenison, Penn Jillette, Martin Mull, Teller, Philip Steadman, David Hockney, Colin Blakemore', 'PG-13', 'Tim Jenison, a Texas based inventor, attempts to solve one of the greatest mysteries in all art: How did Dutch Master Johannes Vermeer manage to paint so photo-realistically 150 years before the invention of photography? Spanning a decade, Jenison''s adventure takes him to Holland, on a pilgrimage to the North coast of Yorkshire to meet artista David Hockney, and eventually even to Buckingham Palace. The epic research project Jenison embarques on is as extraordinary as what he discovers.', 'Tim Jenison, a Texas based inventor, attempts to solve one of the greatest mysteries in all art: How did Dutch Master Johannes Vermeer manage to paint so photo-realistically 150 years before the invention of photography? Spanning a decade, Jenison''s adventure takes him to Holland, on a pilgrimage to the North coast of Yorkshire to meet artista David Hockney, and eventually even to Buckingham Palace. The epic research project Jenison embarques on is as extraordinary as what he discovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEF0f8dktdp4NbUbpi0xSzwUAY8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212063'),
  ('647878638195195271', 'Timber', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King, Frank Tashlin', 'Jack Hannah, Carl Barks', 'Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'Hobo Donald steals dinner off Pegleg Pete''s table. Pete gives Donald a stick of dynamite. Then he puts Donald to work chopping trees. To say Donald is an inept lumberjack is understating the case. After several mishaps, Pete/Pierre chases Donald on railroad handcars.', 'Hobo Donald steals dinner off Pegleg Pete''s table. Pete gives Donald a stick of dynamite. Then he puts Donald to work chopping trees. To say Donald is an inept lumberjack is understating the case. After several mishaps, Pete/Pierre chases Donald on railroad handcars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v62VMOmERWGkyJCybcWgJ1FIRYD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92282'),
  ('443926454766583017', 'Timber', 2014, 'Animation, Drama', 'Nils Hedinger', null, null, null, 'A group of logs is about to freeze to death in a cold, icy desert. When they realize only themselves are possible fuel for a warming fire things start heating up.', 'A group of logs is about to freeze to death in a cold, icy desert. When they realize only themselves are possible fuel for a warming fire things start heating up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ur09g9XfxDnhopsy0wF2ScWwdhN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490763'),
  ('1027454019718346683', 'Timber Falls', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tony Giglio, Toby Moore, Anca Ciubotariu', 'Tony Giglio', 'Josh Randall, Brianna Brown, Nick Searcy, Beth Broderick, Sascha Rosemann, T.W. Leshner, Ryan Wiik, Branden Morgan', null, 'A weekend of camping in the mountains becomes an excursion into hell for a young couple, who become pawns in a grotesque plot hatched by deranged locals.', 'A weekend of camping in the mountains becomes an excursion into hell for a young couple, who become pawns in a grotesque plot hatched by deranged locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6Lgqh0OYLpeKzbIqxPeDXYstKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8875'),
  ('162620139740861732', 'Timbuktu', 2014, 'Drama, War', 'Abderrahmane Sissako, Sofian El Fani', 'Abderrahmane Sissako, Kessen Tall', 'Ibrahim Ahmed, Toulou Kiki, Layla Walet Mohamed, Abel Jafri, Kettly Noël, Hichem Yacoubi, Mehdi A.G. Mohamed, Fatoumata Diawara', null, 'Just outside of the Malian city of Timbuktu, now occupied by militant Islamic rebels who impose the Sharia on civilians and inconvenience their daily life, a cattleman kills a fisherman.', 'Just outside of the Malian city of Timbuktu, now occupied by militant Islamic rebels who impose the Sharia on civilians and inconvenience their daily life, a cattleman kills a fisherman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCpHpn8msgonS9HVDMkrcSZh4an.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265228'),
  ('338321210269724567', 'Time', 2006, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery', 'Kim Ki-duk, Jang Hoon', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Sung Hyun-ah, Ha Jung-woo, Park Ji-yeon, Kim Sung-min, Kiki Sugino, Seo Ji-seok, Kong Jeong-hwan, Jung Gyu-woon', null, 'Consumed by jealousy, a woman takes an extreme step and undergoes surgery for a new face. Although her lover of 2 years misses her, he falls in love with the new face, not knowing it''s the same woman.', 'Consumed by jealousy, a woman takes an extreme step and undergoes surgery for a new face. Although her lover of 2 years misses her, he falls in love with the new face, not knowing it''s the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rB7l4rYzXUpVNEsboQQETtt5zl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25648'),
  ('929087200569539835', 'Time', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Garrett Bradley, Zac Manuel, Justin Zweifach', null, 'Sibil Fox Richardson, Robert Fox Richardson, Freedom Richardson, Justus Richardson, Laurence M. Richardson, Mahlik Richardson, Remington B. Richardson, Robert G. Richardson', 'PG-13', 'Fox Rich, indomitable matriarch and modern-day abolitionist, strives to keep her family together while fighting for the release of her incarcerated husband. An intimate, epic, and unconventional love story, filmed over two decades.', 'Fox Rich, indomitable matriarch and modern-day abolitionist, strives to keep her family together while fighting for the release of her incarcerated husband. An intimate, epic, and unconventional love story, filmed over two decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yLZmlf6vdpkhTaD0oUmIFu8SsM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653729'),
  ('773604266768231705', 'Time Addicts', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Thriller', 'Marcus Cropp, Melanie Mackintosh, Sam Odlum', 'Sam Odlum', 'Freya Tingley, Charles Grounds, Joshua Morton, Elise Jansen', null, 'In debt to their volatile drug dealer, best friends, Denise and Johnny, agree to a sketchy job to pay off their last hit. After breaking into a decrepit stash house to steal a bag of mysterious drugs, escape proves more troublesome, as the pair find themselves trapped inside with a madman. With no way out and not one to miss an opportunity, Johnny smokes the new drug and promptly travels into the past, triggering alarming new events in the future. Separated through time, Denise is left alone to confront her past, their dealer’s real identity, and her very own existence.', 'In debt to their volatile drug dealer, best friends, Denise and Johnny, agree to a sketchy job to pay off their last hit. After breaking into a decrepit stash house to steal a bag of mysterious drugs, escape proves more troublesome, as the pair find themselves trapped inside with a madman. With no way out and not one to miss an opportunity, Johnny smokes the new drug and promptly travels into the past, triggering alarming new events in the future. Separated through time, Denise is left alone to confront her past, their dealer’s real identity, and her very own existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTRfeB6TOupCpQ7lfTCYVE3Dzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020094'),
  ('33600497036046758', 'Time After Time', 1979, 'Adventure, Drama, Comedy, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Nicholas Meyer, Paul Lohmann', 'Nicholas Meyer', 'Malcolm McDowell, David Warner, Mary Steenburgen, Charles Cioffi, Kent Williams, Andonia Katsaros, Patti D''Arbanville, James Garrett', 'PG', 'Writer H. G. Wells pursues Jack the Ripper to modern day San Francisco after the infamous serial killer steals his time machine to escape the 19th century.', 'Writer H. G. Wells pursues Jack the Ripper to modern day San Francisco after the infamous serial killer steals his time machine to escape the 19th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4SXZxQempzTUReRlQiFaYc6KaC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24750'),
  ('1060925938957418100', 'Time and the Wind', 2013, 'Drama, History, War', 'Jayme Monjardim, Affonso Beato', 'Marcelo Ruas, Letícia Wierzchowski, Tabajara Ruas', 'Fernanda Montenegro, Thiago Lacerda, Marjorie Estiano, Cleo, Janaína Kremer, Mayana Moura, Igor Rickli, Leonardo Machado', null, 'Based on Érico Verissimo''s literary trilogy, Time and the Wind follows 150 years of the Terra Cambará family and their opponents, the Amaral family. The struggles between the two families begin in the missions and lasts until the end of the 19th century. The film also features the period of formation of the state of Rio Grande do Sul and the dispute of territory between the Portuguese and Spanish crowns.', 'Based on Érico Verissimo''s literary trilogy, Time and the Wind follows 150 years of the Terra Cambará family and their opponents, the Amaral family. The struggles between the two families begin in the missions and lasts until the end of the 19th century. The film also features the period of formation of the state of Rio Grande do Sul and the dispute of territory between the Portuguese and Spanish crowns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84UsKgym9Lrnp5bGgIa318L6LAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223381'),
  ('917434749896185228', 'Time and Tide', 2000, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Tsui Hark, Herman Yau, Ko Chiu-Lam', 'Koan Hui, Tsui Hark', 'Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Wu Bai, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Cathy Tsui Chi-Kei, Candy Lo Hau-Yam, Joe Lee Yiu-Ming, Jack Kao, Jun Kung', null, 'A streetwise young man becomes a bodyguard to score quick cash. He befriends a disillusioned mercenary determined to begin life anew. They find themselves working together to foil an assassination attempt, but their partnership ultimately can''t last.', 'A streetwise young man becomes a bodyguard to score quick cash. He befriends a disillusioned mercenary determined to begin life anew. They find themselves working together to foil an assassination attempt, but their partnership ultimately can''t last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywm95TI4eZUNrQwXOEamn2diVD6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49291'),
  ('336279094862645887', 'Time at the Top', 1999, 'Mystery, Family, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Jimmy Kaufman', 'Linda Brookover, Alain Silver', 'Timothy Busfield, Elisha Cuthbert, Gabrielle Boni, Matthew Harbour, Lynne Adams, Richard Jutras, Michael Sinelnikoff, Jean LeClerc', 'G', '14-year old Susan Shawson travels back in time in her building''s elevator. As altered by a retired physicist living in her building, it transports her from Philadelphia of 1998 back to the same place in 1881. There she meets Victoria Walker, a girl her own age in need of assistance with her own family problems. Gradually discovering the power of her time machine, Susan, Victoria, and her young brother Robert travel back and forth in time and succeed in changing both the past and the future.', '14-year old Susan Shawson travels back in time in her building''s elevator. As altered by a retired physicist living in her building, it transports her from Philadelphia of 1998 back to the same place in 1881. There she meets Victoria Walker, a girl her own age in need of assistance with her own family problems. Gradually discovering the power of her time machine, Susan, Victoria, and her young brother Robert travel back and forth in time and succeed in changing both the past and the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSvMlx83XbMOlSvcpHIgOOJHoE9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142815'),
  ('9336655318885980', 'Time Bandits', 1981, 'Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Adventure, Comedy', 'Terry Gilliam, Celia Barnett, Philip Chubb', 'Michael Palin, Terry Gilliam', 'Craig Warnock, David Rappaport, Kenny Baker, Mike Edmonds, Malcolm Dixon, Tiny Ross, Jack Purvis, Ian Holm', 'PG', 'Young history buff Kevin can scarcely believe it when six dwarfs emerge from his closet one night. Former employees of the Supreme Being, they''ve purloined a map charting all of the holes in the fabric of time and are using it to steal treasures from different historical eras. Taking Kevin with them, they variously drop in on Napoleon, Robin Hood and King Agamemnon before the Supreme Being catches up with them.', 'Young history buff Kevin can scarcely believe it when six dwarfs emerge from his closet one night. Former employees of the Supreme Being, they''ve purloined a map charting all of the holes in the fabric of time and are using it to steal treasures from different historical eras. Taking Kevin with them, they variously drop in on Napoleon, Robin Hood and King Agamemnon before the Supreme Being catches up with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VZtpwdhHQSa4LUkvujyGAHb1hG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36819'),
  ('929697658966921780', 'Time Barbarians', 1990, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Kevin Morrisey, Joseph John Barmettler', 'Joseph John Barmettler', 'Deron McBee, Joann Ayers, Daniel Martine, Louis Roth, H.S. Smith, Guy Fury, Timothy O''Sullivan, Ingrid Vold', 'R', 'A warrior king has swordfights with ugly savages that crouch around the forest and snarl a lot. An evil bad guy, bent on doing evil things, kills his wife and flees to modern day Los Angeles. The warrior chases after him to avenge his wife''s death.', 'A warrior king has swordfights with ugly savages that crouch around the forest and snarl a lot. An evil bad guy, bent on doing evil things, kills his wife and flees to modern day Los Angeles. The warrior chases after him to avenge his wife''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weS4MdOe64FC97mdH7CGATMznwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41370'),
  ('319149708606379526', 'Time Bomb', 1953, 'Thriller', 'Freddie Young, Ted Tetzlaff', 'Kem Bennett', 'Glenn Ford, Anne Vernon, Maurice Denham, Harcourt Williams, Victor Maddern, Harold Warrender, John Horsley, Campbell Singer', 'NR', 'When a saboteur places an explosive device on a train full of sea mines, the authorities call for bomb expert Peter Lyncort to diffuse the situation, unaware that he has explosive problems of his own.', 'When a saboteur places an explosive device on a train full of sea mines, the authorities call for bomb expert Peter Lyncort to diffuse the situation, unaware that he has explosive problems of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrAQ8efZHPv8S2k1UUqLXss51qn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172908'),
  ('221137056615181461', 'Time Bomb Y2K', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Marley McDonald, Brian Becker', null, null, 'PG', 'As the clock counted down to the the 21st century, the world faced a potential technological disaster: a bug that could cause computers to misinterpret the year 2000 as 1900. Crafted entirely from archival footage and featuring first-hand accounts from computer experts, survivalists, scholars, militia groups, conservative Christians, and pop icons, Time Bomb Y2K is a prescient and often humorous tale about the power and vulnerabilities of technology.', 'As the clock counted down to the the 21st century, the world faced a potential technological disaster: a bug that could cause computers to misinterpret the year 2000 as 1900. Crafted entirely from archival footage and featuring first-hand accounts from computer experts, survivalists, scholars, militia groups, conservative Christians, and pop icons, Time Bomb Y2K is a prescient and often humorous tale about the power and vulnerabilities of technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEvpWSiaVodOD3Uh81aHboWdYRp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088233'),
  ('54022441805757827', 'Time Changer', 2003, 'Drama, Family, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Rich Christiano, Philip Hurn', 'Rich Christiano', 'D. David Morin, Gavin MacLeod, Hal Linden, Jennifer O''Neill, Paul Rodríguez, Richard Riehle, Brad Heller, Kevin Downes', 'PG', 'The year is 1890 and Bible professor Russell Carlisle has written a new manuscript entitled "The Changing Times". His colleague, Dr. Norris Anderson, believes that what Carlisle has written could greatly affect the future of coming generations and, using his secret time machine, Anderson sends Carlisle over 100 years into the future, offering him a glimpse of where his beliefs will lead.', 'The year is 1890 and Bible professor Russell Carlisle has written a new manuscript entitled "The Changing Times". His colleague, Dr. Norris Anderson, believes that what Carlisle has written could greatly affect the future of coming generations and, using his secret time machine, Anderson sends Carlisle over 100 years into the future, offering him a glimpse of where his beliefs will lead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqkfKoK5YLqrOhvnsqdz9Zbgni6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45767'),
  ('574989080858178156', 'Time Chasers', 1994, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Drama', 'David Giancola, Mark Sasahara', 'David Giancola', 'Matthew Bruch, Bonnie Pritchard, Peter Harrington, George Woodard, Michael J. Valentine, Jim Rohn, Ted Pendleton, Becky Fenton', 'PG-13', 'Inventor Nick Miller dreams of traveling through time, of stopping war and curing humanity''s problems. He invents the Transport, a time machine, to better the world. When he sells his invention to a defense contractor, the time machine is used by its evil CEO as a sinister weapon. Nick soon discovers that the future has been changed into a desolate wasteland controlled by gangs. Robertson has sold use of the Transport to anyone who wants to take advantage of knowing the normal course of history. The only way Nick can stop the destruction of the future is to erase his past. If somehow he can prevent his past-self from creating the Transport, the threat will be averted. In this pulse-pounding race through time that takes you from the future of 2041 to the Revolutionary War, Nick must risk everything to try and save the future!', 'Inventor Nick Miller dreams of traveling through time, of stopping war and curing humanity''s problems. He invents the Transport, a time machine, to better the world. When he sells his invention to a defense contractor, the time machine is used by its evil CEO as a sinister weapon. Nick soon discovers that the future has been changed into a desolate wasteland controlled by gangs. Robertson has sold use of the Transport to anyone who wants to take advantage of knowing the normal course of history. The only way Nick can stop the destruction of the future is to erase his past. If somehow he can prevent his past-self from creating the Transport, the threat will be averted. In this pulse-pounding race through time that takes you from the future of 2041 to the Revolutionary War, Nick must risk everything to try and save the future!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/PDxAAvSnsjEIY128Au2Glvo5oM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31380'),
  ('622482987084624936', 'Time Cut', 2024, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Hannah Macpherson, Ali Everett, Terry McShane', 'Hannah Macpherson, Michael Kennedy', 'Madison Bailey, Antonia Gentry, Griffin Gluck, Megan Best, Michael Shanks, Rachael Crawford, Summer H. Howell, Sydney Sabiston', 'PG-13', 'A teen in 2024 accidentally time-travels to 2003, days before a masked killer murders her sister. Can she change the past without destroying the future?', 'A teen in 2024 accidentally time-travels to 2003, days before a masked killer murders her sister. Can she change the past without destroying the future?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzMFMmpJHOmOFKsAhSDac62Dyg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:827931'),
  ('1035802468248385159', 'Time for Him to Come Home for Christmas', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mike Kam, David Winning', 'Marcy Holland', 'Tyler Hynes, Holland Roden, Steve Bacic, Brent Stait, Karen Kruper, Jay Hindle, Iris Quinn, Carey Feehan', 'G', 'Four days before Christmas, Elizabeth Athens receives a voicemail from a number she doesn’t recognize. On the message, a man she doesn’t know makes one final plea to the love of his life for a second chance.', 'Four days before Christmas, Elizabeth Athens receives a voicemail from a number she doesn’t recognize. On the message, a man she doesn’t know makes one final plea to the love of his life for a second chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7GbjyZbtw77dAXShJIub0vc09F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028551'),
  ('386668257669720446', 'Time for Me to Come Home for Christmas', 2018, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Adam Sliwinski, David Winning', null, 'Megan Park, Josh Henderson, Lindsay Maxwell, Eric Keenleyside, Susan Hogan, Paul McGillion, Lucie Guest, Jett Klyne', null, 'Famous musician Heath and small-town girl Cara are each traveling back to Oklahoma for the holidays when they get stranded in Chicago. Despite his fame, she has no idea who he is, but they hit it off—and she even ends up providing some inspiration for the Christmas song he''s writing.', 'Famous musician Heath and small-town girl Cara are each traveling back to Oklahoma for the holidays when they get stranded in Chicago. Despite his fame, she has no idea who he is, but they hit it off—and she even ends up providing some inspiration for the Christmas song he''s writing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jM6szxRXdVepT3Kw48pDWySlCnM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554282'),
  ('1089956009441725253', 'Time for Revenge', 1981, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Adolfo Aristarain, Jorge Gundín, Antonio Barrios', 'Adolfo Aristarain', 'Federico Luppi, Julio De Grazia, Ulises Dumont, Jofre Soares, Aldo Barbero, Enrique Liporace, Arturo Maly, Rodolfo Ranni', 'R', 'Two coworkers decide to blackmail the corrupt demolition company they work for by setting up a fake accident.', 'Two coworkers decide to blackmail the corrupt demolition company they work for by setting up a fake accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toMHQMl23CGboMUX9dR7V3OxbsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43428'),
  ('1108414330945097500', 'Time for Them to Come Home for Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Peter Benson, Geoff Wallace', 'Marcy Holland', 'Jessy Schram, Brendan Penny, Lochlyn Munro, Brendon Zub, Lisa Durupt, April Telek, Agnes Tong, Alix West Lefler', 'G', 'During the holidays, a woman with amnesia catches a ride with her handsome nurse to investigate the only clue to her identity: a newspaper clipping for a Christmas Festival with a cryptic invitation.', 'During the holidays, a woman with amnesia catches a ride with her handsome nurse to investigate the only clue to her identity: a newspaper clipping for a Christmas Festival with a cryptic invitation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oV5r8NlY2qJbttdoH0kVd3q2AnI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874230'),
  ('154356209802683875', 'Time for Us to Come Home for Christmas', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'David Winning', 'Marcy Holland', 'Lacey Chabert, Stephen Huszar, Lini Evans, Leon, Doron Bell, Vienna Leacock, Emma Johnson, Madelyn Grace', null, 'Five guests are mysteriously invited to an inn to celebrate Christmas. With the help of the owner Ben, Sarah discovers that an event from the past may connect them and change their lives forever.', 'Five guests are mysteriously invited to an inn to celebrate Christmas. With the help of the owner Ben, Sarah discovers that an event from the past may connect them and change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/he6XKUtiiaUE58BZ4DswlcgHwth.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746049'),
  ('70842192482854657', 'Time Freak', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Romance', 'Andrew Bowler, Luke Geissbühler', 'Andrew Bowler', 'Asa Butterfield, Sophie Turner, Skyler Gisondo, Will Peltz, Aubrey Reynolds, Jillian Joy, Joseph Park, Caden J. Gregoire', 'PG-13', 'Stillman, a heartbroken physics student, builds a time machine when his girlfriend breaks up with him. Going back in time, he attempts to save their relationship by fixing every mistake he made—while dragging his best friend along in the process.', 'Stillman, a heartbroken physics student, builds a time machine when his girlfriend breaks up with him. Going back in time, he attempts to save their relationship by fixing every mistake he made—while dragging his best friend along in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSDctngY0Oiq6l2LcJDk8k6smvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451925'),
  ('142299339693597069', 'Time Heroes', 2016, 'Family, Adventure', 'Christian Theede', 'Michael Demuth, Ceylan Yildirim', 'Timon Wloka, Timmi Trinks, Janina Fautz, Ugur Ekeroglu, Stephanie Amarell, Stipe Erceg, Antonio Wannek, Mathis Landwehr', null, 'Berlin students Ben, Jonas, Leo, Ozzi and Sophie are on a class trip to "boring" Hildesheim. Their schedule includes visiting the medieval cathedral and witnessing a complete solar eclipse, but destiny intervenes… A bomb goes off at the cathedral and the students are evacuated by the police, only to find themselves in the clutches of an occult secret society calling themselves the Lunaris Cult, who aim to use an ancient pagan artifact, the Irminsul, to harness the vital force of their teenage captives and use it for their own purposes on the eclipse. The evil cultists are after immortality and divine power, and are even prepared to sacrifice the friends'' lives. Ben and his gang manage to escape. Chased from one danger to the next, the cultists pursue them, closing in on them more and more. The fanatics have it all planned out, it seems, leaving nothing to chance. They disable the cell phone networks and satellite connections, leaving the friends to fend for themselves...', 'Berlin students Ben, Jonas, Leo, Ozzi and Sophie are on a class trip to "boring" Hildesheim. Their schedule includes visiting the medieval cathedral and witnessing a complete solar eclipse, but destiny intervenes… A bomb goes off at the cathedral and the students are evacuated by the police, only to find themselves in the clutches of an occult secret society calling themselves the Lunaris Cult, who aim to use an ancient pagan artifact, the Irminsul, to harness the vital force of their teenage captives and use it for their own purposes on the eclipse. The evil cultists are after immortality and divine power, and are even prepared to sacrifice the friends'' lives. Ben and his gang manage to escape. Chased from one danger to the next, the cultists pursue them, closing in on them more and more. The fanatics have it all planned out, it seems, leaving nothing to chance. They disable the cell phone networks and satellite connections, leaving the friends to fend for themselves...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxt71Hf3hAlOnvw9TzsFkoKEBTw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377726'),
  ('1028857641494624836', 'Time Is Up', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Elisa Amoruso, Martina Cocco', 'Patrizia Fiorellini, Elisa Amoruso, Lorenzo Ura', 'Bella Thorne, Benjamin Mascolo, Sebastiano Pigazzi, Bonnie Baddoo, Giampiero Judica, Robert Davide, Nikolay Moss, Emma Lo Bianco', null, 'Vivien, an accomplished student with a passion for physics, and Roy, a troubled young man, are involved in an accident that forces them to reclaim their lives one minute at the time.', 'Vivien, an accomplished student with a passion for physics, and Roy, a troubled young man, are involved in an accident that forces them to reclaim their lives one minute at the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxWHyMY4HoXH8LiEhYlga2OtK5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763148'),
  ('944631184191955589', 'Time Lapse', 2014, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Bradley King, Jonathan Betzler, Jonathan Wenstrup', 'Bradley King, B.P. Cooper', 'Danielle Panabaker, Matt O''Leary, George Finn, John Rhys-Davies, Amin Joseph, Jason Spisak, Sharon Maughan, David Figlioli', 'NR', 'Three friends discover a mysterious machine that takes pictures 24 hours into the future and conspire to use it for personal gain, until disturbing and dangerous images begin to develop.', 'Three friends discover a mysterious machine that takes pictures 24 hours into the future and conspire to use it for personal gain, until disturbing and dangerous images begin to develop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfggWOEZ9pL34XKYisBTJ0vFnFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273271'),
  ('267765564961201526', 'Time Limit', 1957, 'Drama, Mystery, War', 'Karl Malden, Sam Leavitt, Emmett Emerson', 'Henry Denker', 'Richard Widmark, Richard Basehart, Dolores Michaels, June Lockhart, Carl Benton Reid, Martin Balsam, Rip Torn, Khigh Dhiegh', 'NR', 'Military investigator Colonel Edwards is assigned a case involving Major Cargill, a Korean War POW who is accused of treason. Although Cargill admits his guilt and Edwards'' superiors are impatiently pushing Edwards to move this case to court martial, Edwards becomes convinced of Cargill''s innocence.', 'Military investigator Colonel Edwards is assigned a case involving Major Cargill, a Korean War POW who is accused of treason. Although Cargill admits his guilt and Edwards'' superiors are impatiently pushing Edwards to move this case to court martial, Edwards becomes convinced of Cargill''s innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLnvLlclBTlq58JeHE22MniLtqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46580'),
  ('141508033249540956', 'Time Lock', 1957, 'Thriller', 'Gerald Thomas, Peter Hennessy', 'Arthur Hailey', 'Robert Beatty, Lee Patterson, Betty McDowall, Vincent Winter, Robert Ayres, Alan Gifford, Larry Cross, Sandra Francis', null, 'A boy is accidentally locked in a bank vault. With less than 10 hours of oxygen left in the vault, it becomes a race to save the boy.', 'A boy is accidentally locked in a bank vault. With less than 10 hours of oxygen left in the vault, it becomes a race to save the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmppHt7yzL3K0aE1TymxL8GLI3T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263910'),
  ('340547643034068583', 'Time Loop', 2020, 'Science Fiction', 'Ciro Sorrentino, Chris Fennell, Luca Pischedda', 'Ciro Sorrentino', 'Sam Gittins, Mino Sferra, Ellie Poussot, Eliana Manvati, Antonio Agrusta, Michelangelo Gentile, Luca Pischedda', null, 'In a pastoral Italian village, a young Londoner scientist helping his father with physics experiments, has to face the consequences of choices he hasn''t made yet.', 'In a pastoral Italian village, a young Londoner scientist helping his father with physics experiments, has to face the consequences of choices he hasn''t made yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoM5b1J5eDxWodVqmnqdiKVJaTt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647582'),
  ('978447034621940202', 'Time Machine 1973', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Aram Gülyüz, Emre Tanyıldız', 'Kemal Kenan Ergen', 'Gürgen Öz, Seda Bakan, Sinan Bengier, Gülhan Tekin, Ferdi Sancar, Zihni Göktay, Birsu Demir, Esvet Şahin', null, 'Spoiled son of a businessman is expelled from his fathers testament, left only with antique car that his father used in his youth. The car turned out to be the time machine...', 'Spoiled son of a businessman is expelled from his fathers testament, left only with antique car that his father used in his youth. The car turned out to be the time machine...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2k39g7VqlhBmRC7GrSbkkZ989M3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350830'),
  ('795924349356558093', 'Time Masters', 1982, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'René Laloux, Mihály Kovács, András Klausz', 'René Laloux, Jean Giraud', 'Jean Valmont, Michel Elias, Frédéric Legros, Yves-Marie Maurin, Monique Thierry, Sady Rebbot, Patrick Baujin, Pierre Tourneur', null, 'On planet Perdide, an attack of giant hornets leaves young Piel alone in a wrecked car with his dying father. A mayday message reaches their friend Jaffar, an adventurer travelling through space. Onboard Jaffar’s shuttle are the renegade Prince Matton, his fiancée, and Silbad, who knows Perdide well. Thus begins an incredible race across space to save Piel.', 'On planet Perdide, an attack of giant hornets leaves young Piel alone in a wrecked car with his dying father. A mayday message reaches their friend Jaffar, an adventurer travelling through space. Onboard Jaffar’s shuttle are the renegade Prince Matton, his fiancée, and Silbad, who knows Perdide well. Thus begins an incredible race across space to save Piel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ktdTOrJnSk7iCtX6Q2QR0sR9Je.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22501'),
  ('979526777772081430', 'Time of a Dancer', 1998, 'Drama, War', 'Vadim Abdrashitov, Anatoliy Susekov, Sergei Tarasov', 'Aleksandr Mindadze', 'Andrei Yegorov, Yuri Stepanov, Sergey Garmash, Chulpan Khamatova, Sergey Nikonenko, Mikhail Bogdasarov, Vera Voronkova, Zura Kipshidze', null, 'Events are unfolding in one of the hot spots of the Russia. The heroes of the film returned from the war. They are winners and losers, because they have forgotten how to live in peace. The war is over, but it is close and still kills. And they want to live so passionately. But how?', 'Events are unfolding in one of the hot spots of the Russia. The heroes of the film returned from the war. They are winners and losers, because they have forgotten how to live in peace. The war is over, but it is close and still kills. And they want to live so passionately. But how?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vt0boa95nzg8m8RBci9OFVTxUsH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75394'),
  ('854485705017436848', 'Time of EVE: The Movie', 2010, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Yasuhiro Yoshiura, Yasuhiro Yoshiura, Ryusuke Chayama', 'Yasuhiro Yoshiura', 'Jun Fukuyama, Rie Tanaka, Kenji Nojima, Yuko Sanpei, Rina Sato, Yukana, Michio Nakao, Miki Ito', 'PG-13', 'In the not-too-distant future, androids have come into common usage. However, treating androids on the same level as humans is frowned upon, and there is constant paranoia surrounding the possibility of robots defying humans, their masters. Those who appear too trustworthy of their androids are chided and labeled as "android-holics". Rikuo Sakisaka, who has taken robots for granted for his entire life, one day discovers that Sammy, his home android, has been acting independently and coming and going on her own. He finds a strange phrase recorded in her activity log, "Are you enjoying the time of EVE?". He, along with his friend Masakazu Masaki, traces Sammy''s movements and finds an unusual café. Nagi, the barista, informs them that the café''s main rule is to not discriminate between humans and androids. While Rikuo tries to reveal Sammy''s intentions, he begins to question the legitimacy of the fear that drives humans to regard androids as nothing more than mere tools.', 'In the not-too-distant future, androids have come into common usage. However, treating androids on the same level as humans is frowned upon, and there is constant paranoia surrounding the possibility of robots defying humans, their masters. Those who appear too trustworthy of their androids are chided and labeled as "android-holics". Rikuo Sakisaka, who has taken robots for granted for his entire life, one day discovers that Sammy, his home android, has been acting independently and coming and going on her own. He finds a strange phrase recorded in her activity log, "Are you enjoying the time of EVE?". He, along with his friend Masakazu Masaki, traces Sammy''s movements and finds an unusual café. Nagi, the barista, informs them that the café''s main rule is to not discriminate between humans and androids. While Rikuo tries to reveal Sammy''s intentions, he begins to question the legitimacy of the fear that drives humans to regard androids as nothing more than mere tools.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLC4ujr84ib2MCJOdW8L8Hj4zi7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234284'),
  ('84538666535791711', 'Time of Fear', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sérgio Rezende', 'Patrícia Andrade', 'Andréa Beltrão, Denise Weinberg, Lee Taylor, Michel Gomes, Júlio Oliveira, Juliano Cazarré, Giulio Lopes, Rafael Losso', null, 'Year 2006. There are riots in São Paulo. In the middle of the violent situation, widow Lucia is trying to get her young son Rafael from prison.', 'Year 2006. There are riots in São Paulo. In the middle of the violent situation, widow Lucia is trying to get her young son Rafael from prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpuvYN5ppOFLZZYg9K3PGVAwepK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32254'),
  ('559394953207395724', 'Time of Happiness', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Şenol Sönmez', null, 'Elçin Sangu, Barış Arduç, Cengiz Bozkurt, Dila Bayrak, Levent Öktem, Nazlı Kar, Sedef Avci, Yasmin Erbil', null, 'True love is not about perfection, it is hidden in flaws. The movie ''Mutluluk Zamani'' (Time of Happiness) tells the story of Mert (Baris Arduc) who creates his ''perfect'' life without facing his past and Ada (Elcin Sangu) who builds her own way of life based on all of her past experiences.', 'True love is not about perfection, it is hidden in flaws. The movie ''Mutluluk Zamani'' (Time of Happiness) tells the story of Mert (Baris Arduc) who creates his ''perfect'' life without facing his past and Ada (Elcin Sangu) who builds her own way of life based on all of her past experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oHmkRLWoKlEdc7VzJobXyNrpOV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474715'),
  ('444153159261471188', 'Time of Indifference', 1964, 'Drama', 'Francesco Maselli, Biagio Proietti, Rinaldo Ricci', 'Francesco Maselli, Suso Cecchi d''Amico', 'Claudia Cardinale, Rod Steiger, Shelley Winters, Tomas Milian, Paulette Goddard, Adriana Facchetti, Bruno Scipioni, Consalvo Dell''Arti', 'NR', 'A penniless countess falls in love with a cad, unaware that he is also involved on the side with her beautiful daughter.', 'A penniless countess falls in love with a cad, unaware that he is also involved on the side with her beautiful daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRNM1Lj263SqjCOCDFog3Qd9EL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124177'),
  ('801372896091167572', 'Time of Love', 1991, 'Drama', 'Mahmoud Kalari, Mohsen Makhmalbaf', 'Mohsen Makhmalbaf', 'Şiva Gerede, Abdurrahman Palay, Menderes Samancılar, Akın Tunç, Celal Hüsrevşahi', null, 'Three episodes, all with relatively similar plots about a love triangle between a woman and two men.', 'Three episodes, all with relatively similar plots about a love triangle between a woman and two men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVGrI8xOXz4mODrqEcfX0YLdhEn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261887'),
  ('67547036846056370', 'Time of Miracles', 1989, 'Drama', 'Goran Paskaljević', 'Goran Paskaljević', 'Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Dragan Maksimović, Mirjana Karanović, Danilo ''Bata'' Stojković, Svetozar Cvetković, Mirjana Joković, Stole Aranđelović, Ljiljana Jovanović', null, 'September 1945. The new communist authorities go into the church, hang the flag of the Party and paint over the old frescoes, but each time the frescoes miraculously return. A stranger comes to town and works miracles; the townsfolk are convinced he is the Messiah. Director Paskaljevic cut his TV miniseries, based on the novel by Borislav Pekic, to feature film length.', 'September 1945. The new communist authorities go into the church, hang the flag of the Party and paint over the old frescoes, but each time the frescoes miraculously return. A stranger comes to town and works miracles; the townsfolk are convinced he is the Messiah. Director Paskaljevic cut his TV miniseries, based on the novel by Borislav Pekic, to feature film length.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rs4SFCLFsVCqJxqhgBKcBKV59MA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266870'),
  ('374225916615975127', 'Time of Roses', 1969, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Risto Jarva, Antti Peippo', 'Jaakko Pakkasvirta, Peter von Bagh, Risto Jarva', 'Arto Tuominen, Ritva Vepsä, Tarja Markus, Arja Saijonmaa, Eila Pehkonen, Kalle Holmberg, Pekka Streng, Hilkka Kesti', null, 'In the year 2012 historian Raimo Lappalainen wants to illustrate how life was 50 years earlier. He becomes obsessed with the fate of a 1970s nude model Saara Turunen, and finds a perfect actress to reconstruct her life and death in front of a TV camera. Meanwhile, a strike at a nuclear plant is covered up by the media.', 'In the year 2012 historian Raimo Lappalainen wants to illustrate how life was 50 years earlier. He becomes obsessed with the fate of a 1970s nude model Saara Turunen, and finds a perfect actress to reconstruct her life and death in front of a TV camera. Meanwhile, a strike at a nuclear plant is covered up by the media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHUB3HmZD2lTUqfZ4Z8dr0ZH9Jg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161273'),
  ('1036130838634744452', 'Time of the Apes', 1987, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Yoshihiro Mori, Kiyozumi Fukazawa, Atsuo Okunaka', 'Keiichi Abe', 'Reiko Tokunaga, Hiroko Saito, Masaaki Kaiji, Hitoshi Ōmae, Tetsuya Ushio, Baku Hatakeyama, Kazue Takita, Noboru Nakaya', null, 'A female scientist and two children are accidentally transported into a future dominated by primates.', 'A female scientist and two children are accidentally transported into a future dominated by primates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8flqkhabppFOvry4UjRI8TNpWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47444'),
  ('205865252029083562', 'Time of the Wolf', 2003, 'Drama', 'Michael Haneke, Jürgen Jürges', 'Michael Haneke', 'Isabelle Huppert, Patrice Chéreau, Brigitte Roüan, Daniel Duval, Béatrice Dalle, Anaïs Demoustier, Olivier Gourmet, Maurice Bénichou', 'R', 'A middle-class family flees an unspecified disaster that has struck the city and takes refuge in their country home. They think this will allow them to escape the chaos, but they soon realize that getting away won’t be so easy.', 'A middle-class family flees an unspecified disaster that has struck the city and takes refuge in their country home. They think this will allow them to escape the chaos, but they soon realize that getting away won’t be so easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10tjiBzMlvGYPpNpjHUOzMKNC6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24190'),
  ('947104925765352052', 'Time of Violence', 1988, 'Drama, History', 'Ludmil Staikov, Radoslav Spassov', 'Radoslav Spassov, Georgi Danailov, Mihail Kirkov', 'Iossif Surchadzhiev, Rousy Chanev, Ivan Krystev, Anya Pencheva, Valter Toski, Vassil Mihajlov, Kalina Stefanova, Max Freeman', null, 'In the 17th century, a Bulgarian Christian region is selected by the Ottoman rulers to serve as an example of conversion to Islam. A Janissary who was kidnapped from the village as a boy is sent to force the reluctant inhabitants to convert. The Turkish governor seeks a peaceful solution, but ultimately torture, violence, and rebellion break out.', 'In the 17th century, a Bulgarian Christian region is selected by the Ottoman rulers to serve as an example of conversion to Islam. A Janissary who was kidnapped from the village as a boy is sent to force the reluctant inhabitants to convert. The Turkish governor seeks a peaceful solution, but ultimately torture, violence, and rebellion break out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WlHXGwybZQodaVJhVlaix1gdaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48879'),
  ('1072609947881279073', 'Time Off', 1990, 'Drama', 'Eytan Fox, Avraham Karpick', null, 'Gil Frank, Hanoch Re''im, Tzufit Grant', null, 'A young soldier is being treated very harsh by his commanding lieutenant. Just before they will be sent out to Lebanon, their battalion gets one day off to relax in Jerusalem. There the soldier finds out the lieutenant has sex in a public park.', 'A young soldier is being treated very harsh by his commanding lieutenant. Just before they will be sent out to Lebanon, their battalion gets one day off to relax in Jerusalem. There the soldier finds out the lieutenant has sex in a public park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwSDjbbh9kDmQDvJZrNQcgMEa9s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49123'),
  ('961658499106942981', 'Time Out', 1985, 'Fantasy, Animation, Comedy', 'Priit Pärn, Janno Põldma, Merle Rajandu', 'Priit Pärn', null, null, 'An anxious cat, immediately engaged in a flurry of stressful morning activities, works himself into a nervous breakdown.', 'An anxious cat, immediately engaged in a flurry of stressful morning activities, works himself into a nervous breakdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fao16WdDU4qHQR5PgPLh4HdZbvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90937'),
  ('582066913608093662', 'Time Out', 1998, 'Comedy, War', 'Sergio Cabrera, Giovanni Mammolotti', 'Ramón Jimeno, Humberto Dorado, Sergio Cabrera', 'Emma Suárez, Raúl J. Sender, Nicolás Montero, César Mora, Andrea Giordana, Lorena Forteza, Humberto Dorado, Flavio Caballero', null, 'The whimsical and joyous parade of ridiculous events satirize the war that rages in Colombia right now and exposes the real spirit of those who inhabit such a beautiful country.', 'The whimsical and joyous parade of ridiculous events satirize the war that rages in Colombia right now and exposes the real spirit of those who inhabit such a beautiful country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lk5LvFAYdfGJz7cVN59fMemxW3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40529'),
  ('15890171132388528', 'Time Out', 2001, 'Drama', 'Laurent Cantet, Pierre Milon, Christian Alzieu', 'Robin Campillo, Laurent Cantet', 'Aurélien Recoing, Karin Viard, Serge Livrozet, Jean-Pierre Mangeot, Monique Mangeot, Didier Reyes, Philippe Jouannet', null, 'An unemployed man finds his life sinking more and more into trouble as he hides his situation from his family and friends.', 'An unemployed man finds his life sinking more and more into trouble as he hides his situation from his family and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3BBQPRKszYbSRIOSjQcVZIVp26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35651'),
  ('301358214132203635', 'Time Out of Mind', 2015, 'Drama', 'Oren Moverman, Bobby Bukowski', 'Oren Moverman', 'Richard Gere, Ben Vereen, Jena Malone, Steve Buscemi, Danielle Brooks, Abigail Savage, Jeremy Strong, Colman Domingo', 'PG', 'Evicted from his squat and suddenly alone on the streets, George is a man without a home. Struggling with his demons and desperately trying to connect with the daughter he abandoned, he navigates the system, hustling for change and somewhere safe and quiet to gather his thoughts. But the streets are relentless and soon, George finds himself teetering on the edge, alone and abandoned.', 'Evicted from his squat and suddenly alone on the streets, George is a man without a home. Struggling with his demons and desperately trying to connect with the daughter he abandoned, he navigates the system, hustling for change and somewhere safe and quiet to gather his thoughts. But the streets are relentless and soon, George finds himself teetering on the edge, alone and abandoned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/856FAOM1FrHoxDqVFIUuUIwYOFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284294'),
  ('685256777860133530', 'Time Piece', 1965, 'Comedy, Music, Fantasy', 'Jim Henson, Ted Nemeth', 'Jim Henson', 'Jim Henson, Enid Cafritz, Jerry Juhl, Frank Oz, April March, Diana Birkenfield, Dave Bailey, Sandy Patterson', null, 'Dislocation in time, time signatures, time as a philosophical concept, and slavery to time are some of the themes touched upon in this 9-minute experimental film, which was written, directed, and produced by Jim Henson. Screened for the first time at the Museum of Modern Art in May of 1965, "Time Piece" enjoyed an eighteen-month run at one Manhattan movie theater and was nominated for an Academy Award for Outstanding Short Subject.', 'Dislocation in time, time signatures, time as a philosophical concept, and slavery to time are some of the themes touched upon in this 9-minute experimental film, which was written, directed, and produced by Jim Henson. Screened for the first time at the Museum of Modern Art in May of 1965, "Time Piece" enjoyed an eighteen-month run at one Manhattan movie theater and was nominated for an Academy Award for Outstanding Short Subject.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7a4wesc1fdaHQ4DpfsdWy9WuuTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48441'),
  ('786869383756408357', 'Time Raiders', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Daniel Lee', null, 'Lu Han, Jing Boran, Ma Sichun, Wang Jingchun, Zhang Boyu, Joel Adrian, Mallika Sherawat, Peng Bo', 'NR', 'Time Raiders is based on the online novel series Daomu Biji written by Xu Lei. It tells the story of explorers searching for the secrets of immortality in ancient tombs', 'Time Raiders is based on the online novel series Daomu Biji written by Xu Lei. It tells the story of explorers searching for the secrets of immortality in ancient tombs', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtbJL3pWPJIO8KGqZpRLEn4jmQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411442'),
  ('299508569297650374', 'Time Regained', 1999, 'Drama', 'Raúl Ruiz, Ricardo Aronovich, Guillaume Roitfeld', 'Gilles Taurand, Raúl Ruiz', 'Catherine Deneuve, Emmanuelle Béart, Vincent Perez, John Malkovich, Pascal Greggory, Marcello Mazzarella, Marie-France Pisier, Chiara Mastroianni', null, 'In early 1920s France, an author, lying on his deathbed, looks at various photographs and is flooded with memories of the people and events that have shaped his life.', 'In early 1920s France, an author, lying on his deathbed, looks at various photographs and is flooded with memories of the people and events that have shaped his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZbBR18GU7XpVfooWV9NsrV4RGV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47439'),
  ('1093567628132634499', 'Time Renegades', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Lee Seong-je, Kwak Jae-yong, Park Si-hwan', 'Oh Jeong-un', 'Lim Soo-jung, Cho Jung-seok, Lee Jin-uk, Jung Jin-young, Lee Ki-woo, On Ju-wan, Lee Tae-ri, Chun Sin-hwan', null, 'A high-school teacher in 1983 and a detective in 2015 join forces through their dreams to change the perilous fate of the woman they both love—30 years apart.', 'A high-school teacher in 1983 and a detective in 2015 join forces through their dreams to change the perilous fate of the woman they both love—30 years apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enNzmbscuisQVAev4vj7muDwtNq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385962'),
  ('1147330093481385529', 'Time Runner', 1993, 'Science Fiction', 'Michael Mazo, Danny Nowak, Lloyd A. Simandl', 'Chris Hyde, Greg Derochie, Michael Mazo', 'Mark Hamill, Rae Dawn Chong, Brion James, Mark Baur, Gordon Tipple, John Maclaren, Barry W. Levy, Suzy Joachim', null, 'During the alien invasion of 2022, one man flees through a wormhole to 1992, where attempt after attempt is made to catch and kill him.', 'During the alien invasion of 2022, one man flees through a wormhole to 1992, where attempt after attempt is made to catch and kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWUmoHHJ5CJF8xI6UJQa5ZxTNOl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48315'),
  ('237448516178674472', 'Time Share', 2000, 'Comedy, Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Sharon von Wietersheim, Christian Sebaldt', 'Eric Tuchman', 'Nastassja Kinski, Timothy Dalton, Kevin Zegers, Cameron Finley, Billy Kay, Natalie Elizabeth Marston, Kelli Garner, Randolph Mantooth', 'PG', 'Two single parents, one man and one woman, along with their kids, have to involuntarily share a house for their holidays.', 'Two single parents, one man and one woman, along with their kids, have to involuntarily share a house for their holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMPtJVRonWXOWYN9cNmlje6YcN6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20310'),
  ('993053246036875521', 'Time Share', 2018, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Sebastián Hofmann, Matías Penachino', 'Julio Chavezmontes', 'Luis Gerardo Méndez, Miguel Rodarte, Cassandra Ciangherotti, Andrés Almeida, Montserrat Marañon, RJ Mitte, Pablo Guisa Koestinger, Hugo Albores', null, 'While staying at a tropical resort, a man becomes convinced the American timeshare company running it has an evil plan to take away his loved ones.', 'While staying at a tropical resort, a man becomes convinced the American timeshare company running it has an evil plan to take away his loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWwLENF11LVApfrCxjuG936cnID.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387827'),
  ('65385974712756387', 'Time Stands Still', 1982, 'Drama', 'Mara Bóna, Tamás Zilahy, Zsuzsa Bencsik', 'Géza Bereményi, Péter Gothár', 'István Znamenák, Péter Gálfy, Henrik Pauer, Sándor Sőth, Anikó Iván, Lajos Őze, Mária Ronyecz, Tamás Jordán', null, 'A Budapest high school in the beginning of the 1960s. Dini suffers the torments of adolescence. His father had to leave Hungary after the uprise in 1956, and since then Dini''s mother has had to take care of her two sons on her own. A friend of Dini’s father, Bodor, is released from prison and moves in with them. Dini and his brother are far from happy about this intrusion on their family life.', 'A Budapest high school in the beginning of the 1960s. Dini suffers the torments of adolescence. His father had to leave Hungary after the uprise in 1956, and since then Dini''s mother has had to take care of her two sons on her own. A friend of Dini’s father, Bodor, is released from prison and moves in with them. Dini and his brother are far from happy about this intrusion on their family life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Xla9F2wjXnVEcGYVoSsG7nTLvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42132'),
  ('1032239438036806718', 'Time Still Turns the Pages', 2023, 'Drama', 'Nick Cheuk Yik-Him, Meteor Cheung, Lee Hoi-Wah', 'Nick Cheuk Yik-Him', 'Lo Chun-Yip, Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Sean Wong Tsz-Lok, Hanna Chan, Rosa Maria Velasco, Curtis Ho Pak Lim, Yukki Tai, Nancy Kwai', null, 'High school teacher Cheng looks back to his repressed childhood memories, as he finds an anonymous suicide note in the classroom. He strives hard to prevent another tragedy from happening, meanwhile facing a series of family problems, his wife is divorcing him, and his father is dying.', 'High school teacher Cheng looks back to his repressed childhood memories, as he finds an anonymous suicide note in the classroom. He strives hard to prevent another tragedy from happening, meanwhile facing a series of family problems, his wife is divorcing him, and his father is dying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEfOZDdnn2R2JVPgm5Dra9EOiOW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957863'),
  ('567388294441982836', 'Time Stood Still', 1960, 'Drama', 'Ermanno Olmi, Carlo Bellero, Dino Partesano', 'Ermanno Olmi', 'Natale Rossi, Roberto Seveso, Paolo Guadrubbi', null, 'Two middle-aged men work as caretakers on an isolated dam construction site high in the snow-capped Italian Alps. When one of them leaves for the valley to spend Christmas vacation with his family he is temporarily replaced with an adolescent boy. The other man is both annoyed and intrigued by the boy and his habits: he listens to loud music, sleeps too long in the mornings and doesn''t drink any alcohol. They barely speak to one another in the first couple of days. But when an avalanche cuts their small hut from electricity they slowly start growing more fond of each other.', 'Two middle-aged men work as caretakers on an isolated dam construction site high in the snow-capped Italian Alps. When one of them leaves for the valley to spend Christmas vacation with his family he is temporarily replaced with an adolescent boy. The other man is both annoyed and intrigued by the boy and his habits: he listens to loud music, sleeps too long in the mornings and doesn''t drink any alcohol. They barely speak to one another in the first couple of days. But when an avalanche cuts their small hut from electricity they slowly start growing more fond of each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFJ88hhy2Se6eqyul9zrTs6heu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98060'),
  ('51880308550512234', 'Time Sweep', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Hugo Colace, Victor Postiglione', 'Victor Postiglione', 'Guillermo Pfening, María Nela Sinisterra, Luis Luque, María Eugenia Arboleda, Bernardo García', null, 'Still reeling from the loss of his wife, a grieving man goes to great lengths to see her again. But their reunion comes at a stunning cost.', 'Still reeling from the loss of his wife, a grieving man goes to great lengths to see her again. But their reunion comes at a stunning cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iibtfg6qHD9mY0vilgsFTrtQW0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449078'),
  ('1083019262941821353', 'Time Table', 1956, 'Crime', 'Mark Stevens, Charles Van Enger, Louis Germonprez', 'Aben Kandel', 'Mark Stevens, King Calder, Felicia Farr, Marianne Stewart, Wesley Addy, Alan Reed, Rodolfo Hoyos Jr., Jack Klugman', null, 'An insurance detective encounters numerous surprises when he is assigned to investigate a meticulously-planned train robbery in Arizona.', 'An insurance detective encounters numerous surprises when he is assigned to investigate a meticulously-planned train robbery in Arizona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1t1STbnyahTBqXgrDGGvebLXaa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41553'),
  ('290718843511627579', 'Time to Die', 1966, 'Western, Drama', 'Arturo Ripstein, Alex Phillips', 'Gabriel García Márquez, Carlos Fuentes', 'Marga López, Jorge Martínez de Hoyos, Enrique Rocha, Blanca Sánchez, Tito Junco, Quintín Bulnes, Miguel Macía, Carlos Jordán', null, 'A man comes home after serving 18 years in jail for murder in this routine western. Although the man killed in self defense, rumors in town circulated that he murdered the victim in cold blood. The ex-con wants to get his life together, but the two sons of the slain man are gunning for the man who killed their father.', 'A man comes home after serving 18 years in jail for murder in this routine western. Although the man killed in self defense, rumors in town circulated that he murdered the victim in cold blood. The ex-con wants to get his life together, but the two sons of the slain man are gunning for the man who killed their father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMkkTupKVhvULv4H9wolk4JqBl5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246749'),
  ('660471446671296753', 'Time to Die', 2007, 'Drama', 'Dorota Kędzierzawska, Artur Reinhart', 'Dorota Kędzierzawska', 'Danuta Szaflarska, Krzysztof Globisz, Patrycja Szewczyk, Kamil Bitau, Robert Tomaszewski, Agnieszka Podsiadlik, Piotr Ziarkiewicz, Małgorzata Rożniatowska', null, 'An impressionistic, black-and-white portrait of the day-to-day of a nonagenarian woman as she experiences the final act of her life. Danuta Szaflarska stars as Aniela, who lives in a massive yet rapidly-deteriorating wooden house, filled with souvenirs and treasures of eras gone by. Aniela runs into conflict in her dealings with others, particularly a nasty neighbor who sees her property as an eyesore and wants to do everything in his reach to buy it up and tear it down, and her married adult son, who - though kindly - triggers paranoia within Aniela (she cannot help but believe that he is scheming and planning to wheedle the property away from her). Driven aback by these individuals, Aniela finds one of her only sources of comfort and reassurance in her daily talks with her dog, Fila - and develops a great affinity for spying on the neighbors'' doings whenever boredom creeps in.', 'An impressionistic, black-and-white portrait of the day-to-day of a nonagenarian woman as she experiences the final act of her life. Danuta Szaflarska stars as Aniela, who lives in a massive yet rapidly-deteriorating wooden house, filled with souvenirs and treasures of eras gone by. Aniela runs into conflict in her dealings with others, particularly a nasty neighbor who sees her property as an eyesore and wants to do everything in his reach to buy it up and tear it down, and her married adult son, who - though kindly - triggers paranoia within Aniela (she cannot help but believe that he is scheming and planning to wheedle the property away from her). Driven aback by these individuals, Aniela finds one of her only sources of comfort and reassurance in her daily talks with her dog, Fila - and develops a great affinity for spying on the neighbors'' doings whenever boredom creeps in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUeBWbv5lmoLdZPRkvo6es1HgKk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155939'),
  ('882998610573429311', 'Time to Hunt', 2020, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Yoon Sung-hyun, Lim Won-geun', 'Yoon Sung-hyun', 'Lee Je-hoon, Ahn Jae-hong, Choi Woo-shik, Park Jeong-min, Park Hae-soo, Lee Hang-na, Seung Eui-yeol, Song Yo-sep', null, 'Four young men want to leave their dystopian world behind and go to a distant paradise to execute a money robbery, a daring act that will have unexpected consequences.', 'Four young men want to leave their dystopian world behind and go to a distant paradise to execute a money robbery, a daring act that will have unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkuuvDoPkOJpg0ZDzHkUWt8ZG5A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571785'),
  ('1117884650653152551', 'Time to Kill', 1989, 'War, Drama', 'Giuliano Montaldo, Vera Pescarolo, Blasco Giurato', 'Giuliano Montaldo, Furio Scarpelli, Giacomo Scarpelli', 'Nicolas Cage, Ricky Tognazzi, Patrice-Flora Praxo, Gianluca Favilla, Georges Claisse, Robert Liensol, Giancarlo Giannini, Vittorio Amandola', null, 'During the invasion of Ethiopia in 1936, a wounded Italian soldier ends up stranded in the desert after a truck wreck. He makes his way to the nearest army hospital, losing his sanity in the process.', 'During the invasion of Ethiopia in 1936, a wounded Italian soldier ends up stranded in the desert after a truck wreck. He makes his way to the nearest army hospital, losing his sanity in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxhGVRlkc2CfoSqTwAR4AZFeEfN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71642'),
  ('445105130661170895', 'Time to Leave', 2005, 'Drama', 'Jeanne Lapoirie, François Ozon', 'François Ozon', 'Melvil Poupaud, Jeanne Moreau, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Daniel Duval, Marie Rivière, Christian Sengewald, Louise-Anne Hippeau, Henri de Lorme', null, 'Romain, 31, a fashion photographer with terminal cancer, elects to die alone, preparing others to live past him rather than prolong the inevitable with chemotherapy or be smothered in sympathy by those who know him.', 'Romain, 31, a fashion photographer with terminal cancer, elects to die alone, preparing others to live past him rather than prolong the inevitable with chemotherapy or be smothered in sympathy by those who know him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6feRtkzLkYiVsF1BYfHQSsZ8Y5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2566'),
  ('397807786521852854', 'Time to Love', 1965, 'Drama, Romance', 'Metin Erksan, Mengü Yeğin', 'Metin Erksan', 'Müşfik Kenter, Sema Özcan, Süleyman Tekcan, Fadıl Garan, Adnan Uygur, Deniz Çakır, Kemal Ergüvenç, Oya Bulaner', null, 'On the Princes’ Islands to the south of Istanbul, the days are rainy and full of longing. Poor but proud painter Halil gets a job in one of the island’s villas, where he encounters the photograph of a beautiful woman and falls in love with her image.', 'On the Princes’ Islands to the south of Istanbul, the days are rainy and full of longing. Poor but proud painter Halil gets a job in one of the island’s villas, where he encounters the photograph of a beautiful woman and falls in love with her image.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNzracgOnjF6dUoTNkfbxlzHdXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124611'),
  ('642849030469798155', 'Time to Work!', 2024, 'Documentary', 'François Ruffin, Gilles Perret', null, 'François Ruffin, Sarah Saldmann', null, 'Following a heated debate on a French news television channel, Left wing MP François Ruffin defies a TV columnist and attorney, Sarah Saldmann, to work and live one month on the minimum-wage. This humanistic and humoristic documentary highlights the daily struggles and joys of the working-class compared to the fantasy the bourgeoisie has built up in the media. It also raises a thorny question : can the rich be socially reintegrated ?', 'Following a heated debate on a French news television channel, Left wing MP François Ruffin defies a TV columnist and attorney, Sarah Saldmann, to work and live one month on the minimum-wage. This humanistic and humoristic documentary highlights the daily struggles and joys of the working-class compared to the fantasy the bourgeoisie has built up in the media. It also raises a thorny question : can the rich be socially reintegrated ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4hblUhdDzs7HfYY5dtMNKPJ4zu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1356416'),
  ('557632754833399766', 'Time Trap', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Mark Dennis, Ben Foster, Mike Simpson', 'Mark Dennis', 'Andrew Wilson, Cassidy Gifford, Brianne Howey, Reiley McClendon, Olivia Draguicevich, Max Wright, Hans Marrero, Rich Skidmore', 'R', 'A group of students become trapped inside a mysterious cave where they discover time passes differently underground than on the surface.', 'A group of students become trapped inside a mysterious cave where they discover time passes differently underground than on the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/583rpyMn8UL8F2oH26Sz6WoKDDe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455839'),
  ('1124138866437409603', 'Time Travel Mater', 2012, 'Animation, Family, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Rob Gibbs', 'John Lasseter', 'Larry the Cable Guy, Keith Ferguson, John Michael Higgins, Katherine Helmond, Lori Alan, Bob Bergen, Jess Harnell, Danny Mann', 'G', 'When a clock lands on Mater''s engine, he travels back in time to 1909 where he meets Stanley, an ambitious young car on his way to California. With the help of Lightning McQueen, Mater alters history by convincing Stanley to stay and build Radiator Springs. Stanley meets Lizzie and they commemorate the opening of the new courthouse with their wedding.', 'When a clock lands on Mater''s engine, he travels back in time to 1909 where he meets Stanley, an ambitious young car on his way to California. With the help of Lightning McQueen, Mater alters history by convincing Stanley to stay and build Radiator Springs. Stanley meets Lizzie and they commemorate the opening of the new courthouse with their wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuRDv9pDZVHK7SYx9XBWxIYyMFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141528'),
  ('1118897723119159557', 'Time Travelers', 1976, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Alexander Singer, Fred Jackman Jr.', null, 'Sam Groom, Tom Hallick, Francine York, Booth Colman, Richard Basehart, Trish Stewart, Walter Brooke, Patrick Culliton', null, 'When a novel virus devastates the world in 1976, Dr. Earnshaw notices that it resembles a virus that a Dr. Henderson found a cure for in 1871 Chicago. However, the doctor perished and his notes were destroyed in the Great Chicago Fire. Earnshaw is approached by a government agent, Jeffrey Adams, who informs him of a Top Secret time traveling technology and asks for his assistance in finding Dr. Henderson and his cure. But their adventure becomes a race against time when a glitch sends them back to the day before the fire instead of the planned four days.', 'When a novel virus devastates the world in 1976, Dr. Earnshaw notices that it resembles a virus that a Dr. Henderson found a cure for in 1871 Chicago. However, the doctor perished and his notes were destroyed in the Great Chicago Fire. Earnshaw is approached by a government agent, Jeffrey Adams, who informs him of a Top Secret time traveling technology and asks for his assistance in finding Dr. Henderson and his cure. But their adventure becomes a race against time when a glitch sends them back to the day before the fire instead of the planned four days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vffNbdKbiZA2n42ogGftywt8Qz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137662'),
  ('1090269349986860064', 'Time Traveller: The Girl Who Leapt Through Time', 2010, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Masaaki Taniguchi, Shogo Ueno', 'Tomoe Kanno', 'Riisa Naka, Akiyoshi Nakao, Narumi Yasuda, Munetaka Aoki, Anna Ishibashi, Shota Chiyo, Tokio Emoto, Mayu Kitaki', null, 'Akari Yoshiyama is graduating high school soon and is expected to lead new life after she passes the university entrance exam, while her mother is working as a pharmacologist. However, her mother has a car accident and the situation is totally changed. She decides to go to 1972 to fulfill her mother''s wish.', 'Akari Yoshiyama is graduating high school soon and is expected to lead new life after she passes the university entrance exam, while her mother is working as a pharmacologist. However, her mother has a car accident and the situation is totally changed. She decides to go to 1972 to fulfill her mother''s wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hios2NxpDTkSFvdZV7CkgNkeNUC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54770'),
  ('751386648791836681', 'Time Trip App', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Toshio Lee, Osamu Fujiishi, Masanori Kita', 'Taku Mayumura, Atsuko Hashibe', 'Hiroshi Tamaki, Satomi Ishihara, Tokio Emoto, Haruna Kawaguchi, Yudai Chiba, Mitsuki Tanimura, Yoh Yoshida, Kunito Watanabe', null, 'In 1868, a battle between new government forces and shogunate forces are about to take place in Edo. Katsu Kaishu wants to avoid useless bloodshed and sends a peace envoy to Takamori Saigō, but Katsu Kaishu is unable to get a response from Takamori Saigō. One day, Katsu Kaishu meets high school teacher Mikako and her student Masaya who is captivated by the shogunate. Mikako and her student Masaya tells Katsu Kaishu that they are from the future. Katsu Kaishu takes care of Mikako and her student Masaya, while Mikako hopes to go back to the future where she came from.', 'In 1868, a battle between new government forces and shogunate forces are about to take place in Edo. Katsu Kaishu wants to avoid useless bloodshed and sends a peace envoy to Takamori Saigō, but Katsu Kaishu is unable to get a response from Takamori Saigō. One day, Katsu Kaishu meets high school teacher Mikako and her student Masaya who is captivated by the shogunate. Mikako and her student Masaya tells Katsu Kaishu that they are from the future. Katsu Kaishu takes care of Mikako and her student Masaya, while Mikako hopes to go back to the future where she came from.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QUgtvHMyeN7CnZL3S0gmn2fo1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314087'),
  ('352417558956629784', 'Time Under Fire', 1997, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Scott P. Levy, Tripp Reed, Gary Graver', 'Sean McGinly, Tripp Reed', 'Jeff Fahey, Richard Tyson, Jack Coleman, Linda Hoffman, Bryan Cranston, Ken Earl, Kimberly Stevens, Larry Poindexter', null, 'A US submarine runs into a time rift. A special unit goes on a mission to see what''s on the other side. They find themselves in an alternate dystopian America, now a one-man dictatorship. They decide to help the rebels.', 'A US submarine runs into a time rift. A special unit goes on a mission to see what''s on the other side. They find themselves in an alternate dystopian America, now a one-man dictatorship. They decide to help the rebels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5kyfwZZDaL1go0RZMKBgIDHXDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114322'),
  ('334119961506290467', 'Time Walker', 1982, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Tom Kennedy, Robbie Greenberg', 'Tom Friedman, Karen Levitt', 'Ben Murphy, Nina Axelrod, Kevin Brophy, Robert Random, James Karen, Sam Chew Jr., Melissa Prophet, Austin Stoker', 'PG', 'From deep within the tomb of the Egyptian pharaoh Tutankhamun, Professor Douglas McCadden ships the coffin of Ankh-Vanharis to the California Institute of Sciences where X-rays reveal five diamond-like crystals hidden within the coffin. Technician Peter Sharpe steals the crystals but doesn''t notice that the powerful X-ray has revived a green fungus. When the coffin is opened at a university press conference, the reporters uncover more than they bargained for. The mummy has disappeared... and the Time Walker is alive again!', 'From deep within the tomb of the Egyptian pharaoh Tutankhamun, Professor Douglas McCadden ships the coffin of Ankh-Vanharis to the California Institute of Sciences where X-rays reveal five diamond-like crystals hidden within the coffin. Technician Peter Sharpe steals the crystals but doesn''t notice that the powerful X-ray has revived a green fungus. When the coffin is opened at a university press conference, the reporters uncover more than they bargained for. The mummy has disappeared... and the Time Walker is alive again!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzL1rGs3ZSv5Gp3E5U5FdFPWCkm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30049'),
  ('707546394533913764', 'Time Without Pity', 1957, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Joseph Losey, Freddie Francis', 'Ben Barzman', 'Michael Redgrave, Ann Todd, Leo McKern, Paul Daneman, Peter Cushing, Alec McCowen, Renée Houston, Lois Maxwell', 'NR', 'Alec Graham is sentenced to death for the murder of his girlfriend Jennie, with whom he spent a weekend at the English country home of the parents of his friend Brian Stanford. Alec’s father, David Graham, a not-so-successful writer and alcoholic who has neglected his son in the past, flies in from Canada to visit his son on death row. David then goes on a quest to try and clear his son’s name while battling “the bottle.”', 'Alec Graham is sentenced to death for the murder of his girlfriend Jennie, with whom he spent a weekend at the English country home of the parents of his friend Brian Stanford. Alec’s father, David Graham, a not-so-successful writer and alcoholic who has neglected his son in the past, flies in from Canada to visit his son on death row. David then goes on a quest to try and clear his son’s name while battling “the bottle.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3P6XLCD3tGtWTtktfdlGL3fnJ4t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60938'),
  ('501303268509509292', 'Timebomb', 1991, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Avi Nesher, John Wildermuth, Anthony B. Richmond', 'Avi Nesher', 'Michael Biehn, Patsy Kensit, Tracy Scoggins, Richard Jordan, Robert Culp, Raymond St. Jacques, Billy Blanks, Jim Maniaci', 'R', 'When someone tries to murder watchmaker Eddy Kay, the incident triggers a barrage of nightmares and flashbacks into a past that isn''t his own. Fearing for his sanity, Eddy contacts psychiatrist Dr. Anna Nolmar for help. Anna thinks he''s hallucinating until another attack proves the dangers are all too real. The two of them go on the run, trying to discover the truth about Eddie''s past and true identity before it kills them.', 'When someone tries to murder watchmaker Eddy Kay, the incident triggers a barrage of nightmares and flashbacks into a past that isn''t his own. Fearing for his sanity, Eddy contacts psychiatrist Dr. Anna Nolmar for help. Anna thinks he''s hallucinating until another attack proves the dangers are all too real. The two of them go on the run, trying to discover the truth about Eddie''s past and true identity before it kills them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztApTo1ZBqwuDR9ovLo5qrwhKKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44192'),
  ('872499106609326995', 'Timecode', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mike Figgis, Patrick Alexander Stewart, Gary Marcus', 'Mike Figgis', 'Xander Berkeley, Golden Brooks, Saffron Burrows, Viveka Davis, Richard Edson, Aimee Graham, Salma Hayek Pinault, Glenne Headly', 'R', 'A production company begins casting for its next feature, and an up-and-coming actress named Rose tries to manipulate her filmmaker boyfriend, Alex, into giving her a screen test. Alex''s wife, Emma, knows about the affair and is considering divorce, while Rose''s girlfriend secretly spies on her and attempts to sabotage the relationship. The four storylines in the film were each shot in one take and are shown simultaneously, each taking up a quarter of the screen.', 'A production company begins casting for its next feature, and an up-and-coming actress named Rose tries to manipulate her filmmaker boyfriend, Alex, into giving her a screen test. Alex''s wife, Emma, knows about the affair and is considering divorce, while Rose''s girlfriend secretly spies on her and attempts to sabotage the relationship. The four storylines in the film were each shot in one take and are shown simultaneously, each taking up a quarter of the screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptGDBAMfDOxr49RSTgMClxPiHjb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36234'),
  ('390401196682540471', 'Timecode', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Juanjo Giménez Peña, Pere Pueyo, Laura Calavia Safont', 'Juanjo Giménez Peña, Pere Altimira', 'Lali Ayguadé, Nicolas Ricchini, Vicente Gil, Pep Domenech, Daniel Villanueva', null, 'Timecode is a 2016 Spanish live-action short film directed by Juanjo Giménez. Luna and Diego are the parking lot security guards. Diego does the night shift, and Luna works by day. One day, Luna''s boss asks her to investigate a broken tail light. It won the Short Film Palme d''Or award at 69th annual Cannes Film Festival in 2016. It is also nominated for an Academy Award for Best Live Action Short Film at the 89th Academy Awards in 2017.', 'Timecode is a 2016 Spanish live-action short film directed by Juanjo Giménez. Luna and Diego are the parking lot security guards. Diego does the night shift, and Luna works by day. One day, Luna''s boss asks her to investigate a broken tail light. It won the Short Film Palme d''Or award at 69th annual Cannes Film Festival in 2016. It is also nominated for an Academy Award for Best Live Action Short Film at the 89th Academy Awards in 2017.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhIo3dWwyP6hiHjMioUCTp0Zo5n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398395'),
  ('783960700284906977', 'Timecop', 1994, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Action, Crime', 'Peter Hyams, Peter Hyams, Jack Frost Sanders', 'Mark Verheiden', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Mia Sara, Ron Silver, Bruce McGill, Gloria Reuben, Scott Bellis, Jason Schombing, Scott Lawrence', 'R', 'In 2004, an officer for a security agency that regulates time travel must fend for his life against a shady politician who has a tie to his past.', 'In 2004, an officer for a security agency that regulates time travel must fend for his life against a shady politician who has a tie to his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgxP6ws8ErBiarnb4S93vv0lkf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8831'),
  ('1039867981866487610', 'Timecop 2: The Berlin Decision', 2003, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Steve Boyum, Crescenzo G.P. Notarile, Xochi Blymyer', 'Mike Richardson', 'Jason Scott Lee, Thomas Ian Griffith, Mary Page Keller, Sam Ly, Tava Smiley, Wen Yann Shih, John Beck, J.J. Perry', 'R', '20 years after a set of events, the Time Enforcement Commission (TEC), is still going strong. Now Brandon Miller a TEC operative, believes that they have a responsibility to change history hoping that the world will be better but Ryan Chan another Tec operative stops him but kills the woman he loves in the process.', '20 years after a set of events, the Time Enforcement Commission (TEC), is still going strong. Now Brandon Miller a TEC operative, believes that they have a responsibility to change history hoping that the world will be better but Ryan Chan another Tec operative stops him but kills the woman he loves in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7YZPuYSwQPLTJGN6WR0EKqnvda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18051'),
  ('580907517041065600', 'Timecrimes', 2007, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Nacho Vigalondo, Flavio Martínez Labiano', 'Nacho Vigalondo', 'Karra Elejalde, Candela Fernández, Bárbara Goenaga, Nacho Vigalondo, Juan Inciarte, Libby Brien, Nicole Dionne, Philip Hersh', 'R', 'A man accidentally gets into a time machine and travels back in time nearly an hour. Finding himself will be the first of a series of disasters of unforeseeable consequences.', 'A man accidentally gets into a time machine and travels back in time nearly an hour. Finding himself will be the first of a series of disasters of unforeseeable consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdxQRP7mzczMJBwKnv8MCPRq7rQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14139'),
  ('544979603329535518', 'Timeless Bottomless Bad Movie', 1997, 'Drama', 'Jang Sun-woo, Kim Woo-hyung, Cho Yong-kyu', 'Kim Soo-hyun, Jang Sun-woo', 'Kong Hyuk-sin, Lee Hyun-wook, Jang Nam-gyung, Park Gyon-won, Lee Je-gyon, Pyong Sang-yu, Song Kang-ho, Kim Kkot-ji', null, 'Children who refuse to live with their families or give up on the streets work at a bar or steal money. When you don''t have money, you''d rather starve than give up playing. Several people have to bowl as much as they want, jump out of the window with their lives, and dance with real dancers at a rock cafe.', 'Children who refuse to live with their families or give up on the streets work at a bar or steal money. When you don''t have money, you''d rather starve than give up playing. Several people have to bowl as much as they want, jump out of the window with their lives, and dance with real dancers at a rock cafe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxGOc9UtMu0wgNC3D79CUi6yRg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101348'),
  ('253413869743308338', 'Timeless Heroes: Indiana Jones and Harrison Ford', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Laurent Bouzereau', null, 'Harrison Ford, Phoebe Waller-Bridge, Kathleen Kennedy, Frank Marshall, George Lucas, Steven Spielberg, James Mangold, Lawrence Kasdan', null, 'An in-depth look at an incredible moment in film history when Steven Spielberg and George Lucas assembled an amazing creative team to collaborate on another cinematic benchmark featuring never-before-seen footage and interviews with Spielberg, Lucas, Harrison Ford, Kathleen Kennedy, Frank Marshall, James Mangold, and many others as well.', 'An in-depth look at an incredible moment in film history when Steven Spielberg and George Lucas assembled an amazing creative team to collaborate on another cinematic benchmark featuring never-before-seen footage and interviews with Spielberg, Lucas, Harrison Ford, Kathleen Kennedy, Frank Marshall, James Mangold, and many others as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zYaIzbrdnR0AyaTo2HZf2TJNVy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1199447'),
  ('479855522509701344', 'Timeless Love', 2019, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie, Thriller', 'John Lyde, Brian Brough', 'Brittany Wiscombe', 'Rachel Skarsten, Brant Daugherty, Jill Adler, Liz Christensen, Scott Christopher, Rick Macy, Terence Goodman, Cathy Ford', null, 'Megan seems to have the perfect life with a wonderful husband named Thomas and 2 adorable children. Then she finds herself awakening from a coma - and discovers she is not and has never been married. But when she meets Thomas for real, she seizes the chance to help him fall in love with her, again-for the first time.', 'Megan seems to have the perfect life with a wonderful husband named Thomas and 2 adorable children. Then she finds herself awakening from a coma - and discovers she is not and has never been married. But when she meets Thomas for real, she seizes the chance to help him fall in love with her, again-for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owH4AZj42ME7WIGDbBS9rnBdeiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663566'),
  ('251484163552532378', 'Timeless Romance', 1998, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy, Thriller', 'David Lai Tai-Wai, Catherine Sze Oi-Ling, Paul Yip Pak-Ying', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Theresa Lee Yee-Hung, Cho Eun-sook, Tats Lau Yee-Tat, Spencer Lam Seung-Yi, Bobby Yip Kin-Sang, Teresa Lee Fung, Samuel Leung Cheuk-Moon', null, 'Lau (Tony Leung Chiu Wai) is a policeman who meets his true love (Korean actress Chiu Ngan Suk) in the emergency room of a hospital. He''s being treated for severe wounds received in the line of duty, and she''s being treated for an attempted suicide! But she dies, and Lau is unwilling to let her go. He pursues her case, leading to encounters with a variety of quirky individuals (including Tats Lau and Theresa Lee), and finally a freak time accident that transports the whole motley group to the era of the Three Kingdoms! Can he find a way to reclaim his love and make it back to the future?', 'Lau (Tony Leung Chiu Wai) is a policeman who meets his true love (Korean actress Chiu Ngan Suk) in the emergency room of a hospital. He''s being treated for severe wounds received in the line of duty, and she''s being treated for an attempted suicide! But she dies, and Lau is unwilling to let her go. He pursues her case, leading to encounters with a variety of quirky individuals (including Tats Lau and Theresa Lee), and finally a freak time accident that transports the whole motley group to the era of the Three Kingdoms! Can he find a way to reclaim his love and make it back to the future?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b049KpE9S98rTaCZfbcazqWSHPb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160354'),
  ('611635371261314792', 'Timeless: The Film', 2014, 'Music', 'François Hanss, Yvan Cassar', null, 'Mylène Farmer, Yvan Cassar, Gary Jules, Eric Chevalier, Bernard Gregory Suran Jr., Peter Thorn, Jonathan Button, Charlie Paxson', null, 'Timeless (stylized as Timel3ss) was the sixth concert tour by French recording artist, Mylène Farmer. The tour supported the singer''s ninth studio album, Monkey Me. The tour began on September 7, 2013 and ended on December 3, 2013. It played 39 shows in 5 countries. Over 535,000 people saw Mylène Farmer live on this tour.', 'Timeless (stylized as Timel3ss) was the sixth concert tour by French recording artist, Mylène Farmer. The tour supported the singer''s ninth studio album, Monkey Me. The tour began on September 7, 2013 and ended on December 3, 2013. It played 39 shows in 5 countries. Over 535,000 people saw Mylène Farmer live on this tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dhRB0wTFw82qpBDL2bDl9dqhTD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271505'),
  ('270605329734864247', 'Timeline', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Caleb Deschanel, Richard Donner, Gary Freeman', 'Jeff Maguire, George Nolfi', 'Paul Walker, Frances O''Connor, Gerard Butler, Billy Connolly, David Thewlis, Anna Friel, Neal McDonough, Matt Craven', 'PG-13', 'A group of archaeological students become trapped in the past when they go there to retrieve their professor. The group must survive in 14th century France long enough to be rescued.', 'A group of archaeological students become trapped in the past when they go there to retrieve their professor. The group must survive in 14th century France long enough to be rescued.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vexgfnhdlKERRMMdyVYLBXx89LW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9562'),
  ('297382304473604667', 'Timelock', 1996, 'Science Fiction', 'Steve Adcock, Robert Munic', 'J. Reifel, Joseph John Barmettler', 'Maryam D''Abo, Arye Gross, Jeffrey Meek, Ricco Ross, Jeff Speakman, Thomas G. Waites, Nicholas Worth, Martin Kove', null, 'In the 23rd century, a penal colony in a distant galaxy falls into anarchy when an inmate loads a virus into the computer system. While cryonic suspension was used to control the most dangerous criminals there, with the computers down these deadly men are back in circulation and determined to cause mayhem. With a gang of brilliant but dangerous inmates in control, a petty thief and the driver of the prison shuttle must stand against these lawless men for their own survival.', 'In the 23rd century, a penal colony in a distant galaxy falls into anarchy when an inmate loads a virus into the computer system. While cryonic suspension was used to control the most dangerous criminals there, with the computers down these deadly men are back in circulation and determined to cause mayhem. With a gang of brilliant but dangerous inmates in control, a petty thief and the driver of the prison shuttle must stand against these lawless men for their own survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tV2Easm8xczwXFvKIeiUtH4rEaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93016'),
  ('468960023334471471', 'TiMER', 2009, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Jac Schaeffer, Kyle Broom, Harris Charalambous', 'Jac Schaeffer', 'Emma Caulfield, Michelle Borth, John Patrick Amedori, Desmond Harrington, JoBeth Williams, Scott Holroyd, Kelvin Yu, Mark Harelik', 'R', 'When implanted in a person''s wrist, a TiMER counts down to the day the wearer finds true love. But Oona O''Leary faces the rare dilemma of a blank TiMER. Her soul mate - whoever and wherever he is - has yet to have a TiMER implanted. Staring down the barrel of thirty and tired of waiting for her would-be life partner to get off the dime, Oona breaks her own rules and falls for Mikey, a charming and inappropriately young supermarket clerk with a countdown of four months.', 'When implanted in a person''s wrist, a TiMER counts down to the day the wearer finds true love. But Oona O''Leary faces the rare dilemma of a blank TiMER. Her soul mate - whoever and wherever he is - has yet to have a TiMER implanted. Staring down the barrel of thirty and tired of waiting for her would-be life partner to get off the dime, Oona breaks her own rules and falls for Mikey, a charming and inappropriately young supermarket clerk with a countdown of four months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9QHzVqko9YxNCGdH8vnruy78nK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39545'),
  ('82776060494332490', 'Timerider: The Adventure of Lyle Swann', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Western', 'William Dear, Larry Pizer', 'Michael Nesmith, William Dear', 'Fred Ward, Peter Coyote, L.Q. Jones, Tracey Walter, Richard Masur, Belinda Bauer, Ed Lauter, Chris Mulkey', 'PG', 'Lyle Swann is a successful off-road racer who mistakenly gets sent back in time 100 years. When a band of outlaws robs Swann of his motorcycle, he''s forced to outfox the gangsters and give in to the seductions of a gorgeous local lady. With only his smarts and a map from an Exxon station, Lyle must try to make it out of the Old West alive and find a way back to modern times.', 'Lyle Swann is a successful off-road racer who mistakenly gets sent back in time 100 years. When a band of outlaws robs Swann of his motorcycle, he''s forced to outfox the gangsters and give in to the seductions of a gorgeous local lady. With only his smarts and a map from an Exxon station, Lyle must try to make it out of the Old West alive and find a way back to modern times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOWtzBF4mKGes4VMXszU5gbra9P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32014'),
  ('300215270067267091', 'Times and Winds', 2006, 'Drama', 'Reha Erdem, Florent Herry', 'Reha Erdem', 'Ozen Ozkan, Ali Bey Kayali, Elit İşcan, Bülent Emin Yarar, Taner Birsel, Yiğit Özşener, Selma Ergeç, Tarik Sönmez', null, 'In a small, poor village leaning over high rocky mountains, the villagers are simple and diligent people who struggle to cope with a harsh nature. They earn their living off the earth and a few animals they feed. Fathers always prefer one of their sons. Mothers command their daughters ruthlessly. Ömer, the son of the imam, wishes hopelessly for the death of his father. When he understands that wishful thinking does not have any concrete results, he begins to search for childish ways to kill his father. Yakup is in love with his teacher, and one day after seeing his father spying on the teacher he dreams too, like Ömer, of killing his father. Yıldız studies and tries to manage the household chores imposed by her mother. She learns with irritation about the secrets of the relationship between men and women.', 'In a small, poor village leaning over high rocky mountains, the villagers are simple and diligent people who struggle to cope with a harsh nature. They earn their living off the earth and a few animals they feed. Fathers always prefer one of their sons. Mothers command their daughters ruthlessly. Ömer, the son of the imam, wishes hopelessly for the death of his father. When he understands that wishful thinking does not have any concrete results, he begins to search for childish ways to kill his father. Yakup is in love with his teacher, and one day after seeing his father spying on the teacher he dreams too, like Ömer, of killing his father. Yıldız studies and tries to manage the household chores imposed by her mother. She learns with irritation about the secrets of the relationship between men and women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNFveNOjsQPSjacdQ6kNzJfP6ib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5850'),
  ('717778561083782011', 'Times Change You', 2010, 'Music, Drama', 'Uli Edel, Rainer Klausmann', null, 'Bushido, Elyas M''Barek, Moritz Bleibtreu, Hannelore Elsner, Mina Tander, Karoline Schuch, Karel Gott, Katja Flint', null, 'After the bestselling book comes the film about Germany''s most successful rapper: authentic, provocative and radical. Despite all his successes, Bushido has to face the demons of his past again and again.', 'After the bestselling book comes the film about Germany''s most successful rapper: authentic, provocative and radical. Despite all his successes, Bushido has to face the demons of his past again and again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQg5KvJl7D44m7Vq1X4lsOnwteu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32679'),
  ('665538197267260098', 'Times Gone By', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Blasetti, Carlo Montuori, Gábor Pogány', 'Alessandro Blasetti, Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Oreste Biancoli', 'Aldo Fabrizi, Mario Riva, Arnoldo Foà, Paolo Stoppa, Amedeo Nazzari, Gina Lollobrigida, Vittorio De Sica, Marisa Merlini', null, 'A number of different segments taken from 19th century Italian stories.', 'A number of different segments taken from 19th century Italian stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Oht3QXRo4hmedxBJBx01CC95rs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65840'),
  ('207759928958971450', 'Times Have Been Better', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Régis Musset', 'Nicolas Mercier', 'Charlotte de Turckheim, Bernard Le Coq, Arnaud Binard, Olivier Gueritée, Franck de la Personne, Stéphane Boucher, Thierry Desroses, Pierre Deny', null, 'After moving in with his beau, 30ish banker Jérémy decides to let the cat out of the bag, telling his unsuspecting parents, Guy and Rosine, that he''s gay. Though they''ve always envisioned themselves as enlightened, the news staggers Guy and Rosine -- who are determined to get to the root of Jérémy''s homosexuality.', 'After moving in with his beau, 30ish banker Jérémy decides to let the cat out of the bag, telling his unsuspecting parents, Guy and Rosine, that he''s gay. Though they''ve always envisioned themselves as enlightened, the news staggers Guy and Rosine -- who are determined to get to the root of Jérémy''s homosexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1j6igR3Kmafm4IRlf13FQcXlKVX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45122'),
  ('1044649760716713234', 'Times Square', 1980, 'Drama, Music', 'Allan Moyle, Alan Hopkins, Robert E. Warren', 'Jacob Brackman', 'Tim Curry, Trini Alvarado, Robin Johnson, Peter Coffield, Herbert Berghof, David Margulies, Anna Maria Horsford, Michael Margotta', 'R', 'When a 13-year-old girl befriends a defiant antisocial child of the streets, the mismatched runaways set off to the Big Apple to find their own adventure.', 'When a 13-year-old girl befriends a defiant antisocial child of the streets, the mismatched runaways set off to the Big Apple to find their own adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkZtDpfOfUVz0tFWRrkPp6W2iPd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76411'),
