  ('316070082307686216', 'Tin Pan Alley Cats', 1943, 'Animation', 'Robert Clampett', null, null, null, 'A jazz cartoon involving a "Fats Waller"-like cat who leaves the "Uncle Tomcat Mission" for the local jazz club. One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'A jazz cartoon involving a "Fats Waller"-like cat who leaves the "Uncle Tomcat Mission" for the local jazz club. One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3l6jGO9DRRFLHGFf6EGMYYD3cY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205883'),
  ('868114085992012316', 'Tin Soldier', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Brad Furman, Tim Maurice-Jones', 'Jess Fuerst, Brad Furman, Pablo F. Fenjves', 'Scott Eastwood, Jamie Foxx, Robert De Niro, Nora Arnezeder, Joey Bicicchi, John Leguizamo, Shamier Anderson, Rita Ora', null, 'An ex-special forces operative seeks revenge against a cult leader who has corrupted his former comrades, the Shinjas. This leader, known as The Bokushi, promises veterans a purpose and protection, but is revealed to be a destructive influence. The ex-soldier, Nash Cavanaugh, joins forces with military operative Emmanuel Ashburn to infiltrate the Bokushi''s fortress and expose his reign of terror', 'An ex-special forces operative seeks revenge against a cult leader who has corrupted his former comrades, the Shinjas. This leader, known as The Bokushi, promises veterans a purpose and protection, but is revealed to be a destructive influence. The ex-soldier, Nash Cavanaugh, joins forces with military operative Emmanuel Ashburn to infiltrate the Bokushi''s fortress and expose his reign of terror', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFFDrFLXywFhy6khHes1LCFVMsL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977294'),
  ('448235532781428495', 'Tin Tan y las modelos', 1960, null, 'Benito Alazraki', null, 'Germán Valdés, Lorena Velázquez, Pancho Córdova, Marquesita Radell, Martha Elena Cervantes, Marcela Daviland, Dacia González, Héctor Godoy', null, 'Ambitious non-starter gets a job as a bill-collector at a beauty-products company and tries to bluff his way into a management position, then tries a couple of other business schemes with minimal success.', 'Ambitious non-starter gets a job as a bill-collector at a beauty-products company and tries to bluff his way into a management position, then tries a couple of other business schemes with minimal success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSzgPbfI69vFd5jAke9PdTd6wHx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542392'),
  ('476557064485836127', 'Tin Toy', 1988, 'Animation, Family', 'John Lasseter', 'John Lasseter', 'Sárközi Olivér', 'G', 'Babies are hardly monster-like, unless you''re a toy. After escaping a drooling baby, Tinny realizes that he wants to be played with after all. But in the amount of time it takes him to discover this, the baby''s attention moves on to other things only an infant could find interesting.', 'Babies are hardly monster-like, unless you''re a toy. After escaping a drooling baby, Tinny realizes that he wants to be played with after all. But in the amount of time it takes him to discover this, the baby''s attention moves on to other things only an infant could find interesting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMoI7HSGCuvG3yZE35Gs9NQF4Bw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13927'),
