  ('419027221594937741', 'TINA', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Megan Stacey, Dimitri Karakatsanis, T.J. Martin', 'Daniel Lindsay, T.J. Martin', 'Tina Turner, Carl Arrington, Ike Turner, Le''June Fletcher, Oprah Winfrey, Diana Ross, Mary Wells, Angela Bassett', 'R', 'Tina Turner overcame impossible odds to become one of the first female Black artists to reach a mainstream international audience. Her road to superstardom is an undeniable story of triumph over adversity. It’s the ultimate story of survival – and an inspirational story of our times.', 'Tina Turner overcame impossible odds to become one of the first female Black artists to reach a mainstream international audience. Her road to superstardom is an undeniable story of triumph over adversity. It’s the ultimate story of survival – and an inspirational story of our times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swU4ohKgD5sSGpQkRF6VbKT0Os0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:773736'),
  ('139615424954566447', 'Tini: The New Life of Violetta', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Juan Pablo Buscarini', 'Ramón Salazar', 'TINI, Jorge Blanco, Mercedes Lambre, Adrián Salzedo, Sofia Carson, Diego Ramos, Clara Alonso, Georgina Amorós', null, 'A teen star ventures out to the Italian countryside for a summer and emerges a new artist.', 'A teen star ventures out to the Italian countryside for a summer and emerges a new artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iH1d41fxNGPZ53kvQ6GRUFNwp0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360365'),
  ('840635993759578311', 'Tinker Bell', 2008, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Bradley Raymond, Sheryl Sardina Sackett', 'Bradley Raymond', 'Mae Whitman, Kristin Chenoweth, Raven-Symoné, Lucy Liu, America Ferrera, Jane Horrocks, Jesse McCartney, Rob Paulsen', 'G', 'Journey into the secret world of Pixie Hollow and hear Tinker Bell speak for the very first time as the astonishing story of Disney''s most famous fairy is finally revealed in the all-new motion picture "Tinker Bell."', 'Journey into the secret world of Pixie Hollow and hear Tinker Bell speak for the very first time as the astonishing story of Disney''s most famous fairy is finally revealed in the all-new motion picture "Tinker Bell."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Ma0r1n8kfH7UaQMS7bJ9KsYUjT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13179'),
  ('976347547148536729', 'Tinker Bell and the Great Fairy Rescue', 2010, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Bradley Raymond, Sheryl Sardina Sackett', 'Paul Germain, Rob Muir, Joe Ansolabehere', 'Mae Whitman, Lauren Mote, Michael Sheen, Pamela Adlon, Lucy Liu, Raven-Symoné, Kristin Chenoweth, Angela Bartys', 'G', 'During a summer stay on the mainland, Tinker Bell is accidentally discovered while investigating a little girl''s fairy house. As the other fairies, led by the brash Vidia, launch a daring rescue in the middle of a fierce storm, Tink develops a special bond with the lonely, little girl.', 'During a summer stay on the mainland, Tinker Bell is accidentally discovered while investigating a little girl''s fairy house. As the other fairies, led by the brash Vidia, launch a daring rescue in the middle of a fierce storm, Tink develops a special bond with the lonely, little girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cb7PrVIYbwIadQqWxgSU6CGHJjj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44683'),
  ('1131125488644496949', 'Tinker Bell and the Legend of the NeverBeast', 2014, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Steve Loter', 'Tom Rogers, Bob Schooley, Kate Kondell', 'Ginnifer Goodwin, Mae Whitman, Rosario Dawson, Lucy Liu, Raven-Symoné, Megan Hilty, Pamela Adlon, Danai Gurira', 'G', 'An ancient myth of a massive creature sparks the curiosity of Tinker Bell and her good friend Fawn, an animal fairy who’s not afraid to break the rules to help an animal in need. But this creature is not welcome in Pixie Hollow — and the scout fairies are determined to capture the mysterious beast, who they fear will destroy their home. Fawn must convince her fairy friends to risk everything to rescue the NeverBeast.', 'An ancient myth of a massive creature sparks the curiosity of Tinker Bell and her good friend Fawn, an animal fairy who’s not afraid to break the rules to help an animal in need. But this creature is not welcome in Pixie Hollow — and the scout fairies are determined to capture the mysterious beast, who they fear will destroy their home. Fawn must convince her fairy friends to risk everything to rescue the NeverBeast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3S0mmmpYStB3GqodRghcfOt81wQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297270'),
  ('828150758283095937', 'Tinker Bell and the Lost Treasure', 2009, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Klay Hall, Sheryl Sardina Sackett', 'Evan Spiliotopoulos', 'Mae Whitman, Jesse McCartney, Jane Horrocks, Lucy Liu, Raven-Symoné, Kristin Chenoweth, Angela Bartys, Anjelica Huston', 'G', 'A blue harvest moon will rise, allowing the fairies to use a precious moonstone to restore the Pixie Dust Tree, the source of all their magic. But when Tinker Bell accidentally puts all of Pixie Hollow in jeopardy, she must venture out across the sea on a secret quest to set things right.', 'A blue harvest moon will rise, allowing the fairies to use a precious moonstone to restore the Pixie Dust Tree, the source of all their magic. But when Tinker Bell accidentally puts all of Pixie Hollow in jeopardy, she must venture out across the sea on a secret quest to set things right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hg1959yuBkHb4BKbIvETQSfxGCT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25475'),
  ('1070403457466086487', 'Tinker Bell and the Pirate Fairy', 2014, 'Animation, Family', 'Peggy Holmes', 'Jeffrey M. Howard, Kate Kondell', 'Mae Whitman, Christina Hendricks, Tom Hiddleston, Lucy Liu, Raven-Symoné, Megan Hilty, Pamela Adlon, Angela Bartys', 'G', 'Zarina, a smart and ambitious dust-keeper fairy who’s captivated by Blue Pixie Dust and its endless possibilities, flees Pixie Hollow and joins forces with the scheming pirates of Skull Rock, who make her captain of their ship. Tinker Bell and her friends must embark on an epic adventure to find Zarina, and together they go sword-to-sword with the band of pirates led by a cabin boy named James, who’ll soon be known as Captain Hook himself.', 'Zarina, a smart and ambitious dust-keeper fairy who’s captivated by Blue Pixie Dust and its endless possibilities, flees Pixie Hollow and joins forces with the scheming pirates of Skull Rock, who make her captain of their ship. Tinker Bell and her friends must embark on an epic adventure to find Zarina, and together they go sword-to-sword with the band of pirates led by a cabin boy named James, who’ll soon be known as Captain Hook himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81oxrsugqqs8sAVNX9fdlz57cVU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175112'),
  ('1036565949320656393', 'Tinker Tailor Soldier Spy', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Tomas Alfredson, Hoyte van Hoytema, Mark Raggett', 'Peter Straughan, Bridget O''Connor', 'Gary Oldman, Colin Firth, Tom Hardy, John Hurt, Toby Jones, Mark Strong, Benedict Cumberbatch, Ciarán Hinds', 'R', 'George Smiley, the aging master spy of the Cold War and once heir apparent to Control, is brought back out of retirement to flush out a top level mole within the Circus. Smiley must travel back through his life and murky workings of the Circus to unravel the net spun by his nemesis Karla ''The Sandman'' of the KGB and reveal the identity of the mole before he disappears.', 'George Smiley, the aging master spy of the Cold War and once heir apparent to Control, is brought back out of retirement to flush out a top level mole within the Circus. Smiley must travel back through his life and murky workings of the Circus to unravel the net spun by his nemesis Karla ''The Sandman'' of the KGB and reveal the identity of the mole before he disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0dZ7TapGY9HtJ9xk1TUHPEOccl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49517'),
  ('965160116416500793', 'Tinker Ticker', 2014, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kim Jung-hoon, Park Sung-hoon, Lee Dong-hwa', 'Kim Jung-hoon', 'Byun Yo-han, Park Jeong-min, Kim Hee-chang, Oh Chang-kyung, Lee Si-won, Kim Jong-goo, Park Seong-il, Park Hye-jin', null, 'Park Jung-gu sends out homemade bombs to people he finds online who are likely to use them, yet these devices are unused. One day, Jung-gu meets Lee Hyo-min, a delinquent student at his university and sends him a package. Soon an explosion in a delivery truck hits the news. Before long, Hyo-min discovers who is sending him the packages and the two form a tenuous relationship. However, Hyo-min''s unpredictable behavior becomes dangerous and Jung-gu finds himself caught in a situation that he can no longer handle.', 'Park Jung-gu sends out homemade bombs to people he finds online who are likely to use them, yet these devices are unused. One day, Jung-gu meets Lee Hyo-min, a delinquent student at his university and sends him a package. Soon an explosion in a delivery truck hits the news. Before long, Hyo-min discovers who is sending him the packages and the two form a tenuous relationship. However, Hyo-min''s unpredictable behavior becomes dangerous and Jung-gu finds himself caught in a situation that he can no longer handle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yYCjfpvbXACUUHPWZzVxUcHTvc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264746'),
  ('526823692602301513', 'Tinnitus', 2023, 'Drama, Horror, Romance', 'Gregorio Graziosi, Rui Poças', 'Andres Julian Vera, Gregorio Graziosi, Marco Dutra', 'Joana de Verona, Indira Nascimento, Alli Willow, Antônio Pitanga, Thaia Perez, André Guerreiro Lopes, Jéssica Messali, Misaki Tanaka', null, 'Marina Lenk is an experienced synchronized diver. However, an attack of Tinnitus — an unbearable ringing sound in the ears — drags her from the top of her game to the edge of madness.', 'Marina Lenk is an experienced synchronized diver. However, an attack of Tinnitus — an unbearable ringing sound in the ears — drags her from the top of her game to the edge of madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWVCBeQDiQTxmwjuKSuui2Vzjdc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:993292'),
  ('151791110083604722', 'Tinsel Town', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Chris Foggin, David Mackie, Susanne Scheel', 'Piers Ashworth, Fraser Flintham, Adam Brown', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Rebel Wilson, Derek Jacobi, Meera Syal, Danny Dyer, Mawaan Rizwan, Matilda Firth, Theodora Williams', 'PG-13', 'A washed-up Hollywood action hero is tricked into starring in a small English town’s chaotic Christmas pantomime, where a straight-talking dance instructor and his estranged daughter just might help him rediscover the magic of the season.', 'A washed-up Hollywood action hero is tricked into starring in a small English town’s chaotic Christmas pantomime, where a straight-talking dance instructor and his estranged daughter just might help him rediscover the magic of the season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YxpBl5CRAaBiQhQG7uZ86Jw2Hv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1430593'),
  ('807559497028489946', 'Tintarella di Luna', 1985, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Mystery', 'Gaspar Noé', 'Gaspar Noé', 'Olivier Achard, André Dupon, Carlos Kusnir, Antoine Mosin, Luis Felipe Noé, Cécile Ricard', null, 'After a volcanic eruption, a small village from which no one can escape. The plague spreads, and among the survivors, famine rules. For a piece of bread, Charlotte sleeps with the grocer. Night is falling. At the top of a hill, someone is watching.', 'After a volcanic eruption, a small village from which no one can escape. The plague spreads, and among the survivors, famine rules. For a piece of bread, Charlotte sleeps with the grocer. Night is falling. At the top of a hill, someone is watching.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTVZNpYalcdUPTexvlMvR8oYjbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185809'),
  ('301994003454954743', 'Tintin and I', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Anders Østergaard', 'Anders Østergaard', 'Numa Sadoul, Harry Thompson, Michael Farr, Hergé, Raymond Leblanc, Andy Warhol, Patrick Waleffe, Tony Beck', null, 'Why do the comic-strip Adventures of Tintin, about an intrepid boy reporter, continue to fascinate us decades after their publication? "Tintin and I" highlights the potent social and political underpinnings that give Tintin''s world such depth, and delve into the mind of Hergé, Tintin''s work-obsessed Belgian creator, to reveal the creation and development of Tintin over time. Rare and surprisingly candid 1970s interviews reveal the profound insecurities and anxieties that drove Hergé to produce stories that have not only entertained millions of children but also helped to satisfy a personal longing for self-expression.', 'Why do the comic-strip Adventures of Tintin, about an intrepid boy reporter, continue to fascinate us decades after their publication? "Tintin and I" highlights the potent social and political underpinnings that give Tintin''s world such depth, and delve into the mind of Hergé, Tintin''s work-obsessed Belgian creator, to reveal the creation and development of Tintin over time. Rare and surprisingly candid 1970s interviews reveal the profound insecurities and anxieties that drove Hergé to produce stories that have not only entertained millions of children but also helped to satisfy a personal longing for self-expression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iq10XdTs98g6S8CSshyd1H0z1k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75224'),
  ('85417569154495', 'Tintin and the Blue Oranges', 1964, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Philippe Condroyer, Jean Badal', 'André Barret, Rémo Forlani, Philippe Condroyer', 'Jean-Pierre Talbot, Jean Bouise, Félix Fernández, Jenny Orléans, Ángel Álvarez, Franky François, André Marié, Pedro Mari Sánchez', null, 'Professor Calculus''s friend develops a blue-skinned orange that can grow on any kind of land and survive harsh weather (in the manner of Lue Gim Gong) and therefore solve world hunger. The Professor and his friends, however, run afoul of gangsters who also covet the fruit. The adventure takes them from their home in Marlinspike Hall (Moulinsart), a fictional mansion that is presumably in Belgium, to Spain, where Calculus and another scientist are kidnapped.', 'Professor Calculus''s friend develops a blue-skinned orange that can grow on any kind of land and survive harsh weather (in the manner of Lue Gim Gong) and therefore solve world hunger. The Professor and his friends, however, run afoul of gangsters who also covet the fruit. The adventure takes them from their home in Marlinspike Hall (Moulinsart), a fictional mansion that is presumably in Belgium, to Spain, where Calculus and another scientist are kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlYgA1tFhIre1Ou4apLyvXWZDNF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46690'),
  ('1056622264720602573', 'Tintin and the Lake of Sharks', 1972, 'Adventure, Mystery, Family, Animation', 'Raymond Leblanc', 'Greg', 'Jacques Careuil, Claude Bertrand, Micheline Dax, Serge Nadaud, Guy Piérauld, Paul Rieger, Jacques Vinitzki, Marie Vinitzki', null, 'Tintin is sent to guard Professor Calculus, who has invented a machine that can duplicate anything, and is staying in a village near the border of Syldavia and Bodouria. Rastapopoulous, an infamous and ruthless international criminal, tries to lure Calculus and Tintin away by kidnapping two children, who live nearby, in order to get his clutches on the machine.', 'Tintin is sent to guard Professor Calculus, who has invented a machine that can duplicate anything, and is staying in a village near the border of Syldavia and Bodouria. Rastapopoulous, an infamous and ruthless international criminal, tries to lure Calculus and Tintin away by kidnapping two children, who live nearby, in order to get his clutches on the machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oV32sipspRjgTvSwfmdn24dNzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241004'),
  ('563812186880883507', 'Tintin and the Mystery of the Golden Fleece', 1961, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Jean-Jacques Vierne, Raymond Lemoigne, Pierre Lary', 'André Barret, Rémo Forlani', 'Jean-Pierre Talbot, Georges Wilson, Georges Loriot, Charles Vanel, Darío Moreno, Dimos Starenios, Ulvi Uraz, Marcel Bozzuffi', null, 'After the death of Captain Thémistocle Paparanic, Captain Haddock''s old friend, he inherits a ship called the Golden Fleece. Once Tintin and the captain arrive in Istanbul, where the ship is anchored, they meet Mr. Karabine, a businessman who stubbornly insists on buying it even though it is in a dilapidated state.', 'After the death of Captain Thémistocle Paparanic, Captain Haddock''s old friend, he inherits a ship called the Golden Fleece. Once Tintin and the captain arrive in Istanbul, where the ship is anchored, they meet Mr. Karabine, a businessman who stubbornly insists on buying it even though it is in a dilapidated state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TIlqyGZ7PFo9FnkvnKZxInJggQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46521'),
  ('216838244382017082', 'Tintin and the Picaros', 1992, 'Animation, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Bernasconi', 'Bruce Robb, Amélie Aubert', 'Thierry Wermuth, Christian Pelissier, Henri Labussière, Georges Berthomieu, Marie Vincent, Marc Moro, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin', null, 'Tintin falls into a dangerous trap after his friends are falsely arrested in a troubled South American country where a revolution is about to explode.', 'Tintin falls into a dangerous trap after his friends are falsely arrested in a troubled South American country where a revolution is about to explode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJvKgjKh93E5lnGVMF3BVNA10pp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441339'),
  ('433937183972049483', 'Tintin and the Temple of the Sun', 1969, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Claude Monfort, Marcel Colbrant, Vivian Miessen', 'Greg', 'Philippe Ogouz, Claude Bertrand, Lucie Dolène, Georges Atlas, Albert Augier, Geneviève Beau, Jacques Balutin, Bachir Touré', null, 'When seven archaeologists find an ancient Inca temple, they become victims of an ancient curse. Back in Europe, one by one they fall into a deep sleep and only once a day, all at the same time, they wake up for a few minutes and experience hallucinations where the sinister living mummy of Rascar Capac appears.', 'When seven archaeologists find an ancient Inca temple, they become victims of an ancient curse. Back in Europe, one by one they fall into a deep sleep and only once a day, all at the same time, they wake up for a few minutes and experience hallucinations where the sinister living mummy of Rascar Capac appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSiuapguCBSjjF5Cqezj123F2J6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241001'),
  ('1112528736689842359', 'Tintin in America', 1992, 'Animation, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Bernasconi', 'Eric Rondeaux, Robert Réa', 'Thierry Wermuth, Susan Roman, Christian Pelissier, Henri Labussière, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin, Harvey Atkin, Paul Haddad', null, 'In order to assassinate the inquisitive Belgian reporter Tintin, the evil gangster Al Capone orders Smiles, an executive under his command, to lure him to a meeting to be held in Chicago…', 'In order to assassinate the inquisitive Belgian reporter Tintin, the evil gangster Al Capone orders Smiles, an executive under his command, to lure him to a meeting to be held in Chicago…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mDr8s0LBYgaRQxxzgFmJZDnD4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441002'),
  ('725114632653458398', 'Tintin in Tibet', 1992, 'Animation, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Bernasconi', 'Bruce Robb, Christophe Poujol', 'Thierry Wermuth, Christian Pelissier, Henri Labussière, Susan Roman', null, 'Tintin and Captain Haddock travel to Tibet in search of an old friend who has disappeared after a plane crash.', 'Tintin and Captain Haddock travel to Tibet in search of an old friend who has disappeared after a plane crash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keJULBLHwiRkYY2u6AWHJcfOJ9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441333'),
  ('267635046097413851', 'Tintorera: Killer Shark', 1977, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'René Cardona Jr., Jesús Marín, Ramón Bravo', 'René Cardona Jr.', 'Susan George, Hugo Stiglitz, Andrés García, Fiona Lewis, Jennifer Ashley, Eleazar García, Roberto ''El Flaco'' Guzmán, Priscilla Barnes', 'R', 'Two shark hunters flirt with an attractive British lady while hunting down a large tiger shark terrorizing the Mexican East coast.', 'Two shark hunters flirt with an attractive British lady while hunting down a large tiger shark terrorizing the Mexican East coast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjukweJ6BuhZjwXI7w6ZnNrHdaS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81471'),
  ('658903677864042602', 'Tiny Furniture', 2010, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Lena Dunham, Micah Bloomberg, Jody Lee Lipes', 'Lena Dunham', 'Lena Dunham, Laurie Simmons, Cyrus Dunham, Rachel Howe, Merritt Wever, Amy Seimetz, Alex Karpovsky, Jemima Kirke', 'NR', 'After graduating from film school, Aura returns to New York to live with her photographer mother, Siri, and her sister, Nadine, who has just finished high school. Aura is directionless and wonders where to go next in her career and her life. She takes a job in a restaurant and tries unsuccessfully to develop relationships with men, including Keith, a chef where she works, and cult Internet star Jed.', 'After graduating from film school, Aura returns to New York to live with her photographer mother, Siri, and her sister, Nadine, who has just finished high school. Aura is directionless and wonders where to go next in her career and her life. She takes a job in a restaurant and tries unsuccessfully to develop relationships with men, including Keith, a chef where she works, and cult Internet star Jed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apPbKt49bXcf1JDmb6nEkeqU7TB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47607'),
  ('134929234468456236', 'Tiny Times', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Edward Guo, Randy Che, Hao Fang-wei', 'Edward Guo', 'Yang Mi, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Bea Hayden Kuo, Xie Yi-lin, Kai Ko, Li Yue Ming, Rhydian Vaughan, Chen Xuedong', 'NR', 'When four best friends try and move forward in their work and personal life, they realize that trying to live their life''s dream is more difficult than they imagine -- especially in the high fashion world of Shanghai.', 'When four best friends try and move forward in their work and personal life, they realize that trying to live their life''s dream is more difficult than they imagine -- especially in the high fashion world of Shanghai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVjXRBCDKItPfXsEFiV0xJZghhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209049'),
  ('107648151506133498', 'Tiny Times 2', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Edward Guo, Randy Che, Hao Fang-wei', 'Edward Guo', 'Yang Mi, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Bea Hayden Kuo, Xie Yi-lin, Kai Ko, Rhydian Vaughan, Chen Xuedong, Li Yue Ming', null, 'Set four years after the first movie, Lin Xiao, Lily, Nan Xiang, and Ruby, confront opportunities and challenges as their school days come to an end.', 'Set four years after the first movie, Lin Xiao, Lily, Nan Xiang, and Ruby, confront opportunities and challenges as their school days come to an end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kv5XfcyfVRQEz7WfqOUfYEjAx6x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211711'),
  ('833983770669789326', 'Tiny Times 3', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Edward Guo, Randy Che', 'Edward Guo', 'Yang Mi, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Bea Hayden Kuo, Xie Yi-lin, Kai Ko, Chen Xuedong, Vivian Dawson, Lee Hyun-jae', null, 'Lin Xiao, Gu Li, Nan Xiang, Tang Wanru - these four best friends, after waving goodbye to their school campus and entering the workforce, they are faced with various challenges in their life: friendship, love, and career. Together, they become lost in life, having long forgotten their past courage.', 'Lin Xiao, Gu Li, Nan Xiang, Tang Wanru - these four best friends, after waving goodbye to their school campus and entering the workforce, they are faced with various challenges in their life: friendship, love, and career. Together, they become lost in life, having long forgotten their past courage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/portvIHQzA4jzZaGSuoPcZwFzh6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270842'),
  ('559719584960423937', 'Tiny Times 4', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Edward Guo, Randy Che', 'Edward Guo', 'Yang Mi, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Bea Hayden Kuo, Xie Yi-lin, Chen Xuedong, Vivian Dawson, Lee Hyun-jae, Kai Ko', null, 'In the film series finale, Lily finds herself near financial ruin because of the debts left behind by her father, all while battling a newly diagnosed cancer. Too proud to seek solace from anyone around her, Lily sets off a chain of self-destructive events that lead to her estrangement from best friends Lin Xiao, Nan Xiang, and Ruby.', 'In the film series finale, Lily finds herself near financial ruin because of the debts left behind by her father, all while battling a newly diagnosed cancer. Too proud to seek solace from anyone around her, Lily sets off a chain of self-destructive events that lead to her estrangement from best friends Lin Xiao, Nan Xiang, and Ruby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Q8xxzu34NG7UQG9oHe6VSrRD2i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281743'),
  ('391897145301784794', 'Tiny Toon Adventures: How I Spent My Vacation', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Kenji Hachizaki, Kazuhide Tomonaga, Toshihiko Masuda', 'Tom Ruegger, Sherri Stoner, Nicholas Hollander', 'Charlie Adler, Tress MacNeille, Joe Alaskey, Don Messick, Jonathan Winters, Edie McClurg, Frank Welker, Cree Summer', 'G', 'Term-time ends at Acme Looniversity and the Tiny Toon characters look forward to a summer filled with fun. Buster and Babs Bunny turn a water fight into a white-water rafting trip through the dangerous Deep South; Plucky Duck and Hamton Pig share the most impossibly awful car journey imaginable on the way to HappyWorldLand; Fifi''s blind date becomes a "skunknophobic" nightmare; and a safari park is turned upside-down by Elmyra''s search for "cute little kitties to hug and squeeze".', 'Term-time ends at Acme Looniversity and the Tiny Toon characters look forward to a summer filled with fun. Buster and Babs Bunny turn a water fight into a white-water rafting trip through the dangerous Deep South; Plucky Duck and Hamton Pig share the most impossibly awful car journey imaginable on the way to HappyWorldLand; Fifi''s blind date becomes a "skunknophobic" nightmare; and a safari park is turned upside-down by Elmyra''s search for "cute little kitties to hug and squeeze".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuPrC4w2hflbQWLtoQlihmk4xMo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36257'),
  ('141583913675477319', 'Tiny Toon Night Ghoulery', 1995, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, TV Movie, Horror', 'Rich Arons, Michael Gerard, Rusty Mills', 'Peter Hastings, Paul Rugg, Paul Dini', 'John Kassir, Tress MacNeille, Joe Alaskey, Don Messick, Cree Summer, Maurice LaMarche, Gail Matthius, Kath Soucie', 'G', 'In this Halloween Special, Babs Bunny plays the part of host as she and the Tiny Toons gang spoof various popular horror movies and TV shows. Among the works parodied are "Night Gallery", "The Twilight Zone", "The Devil and Daniel Webster", "Frankenstein" and the "Abbott and Costello Meet..." films.', 'In this Halloween Special, Babs Bunny plays the part of host as she and the Tiny Toons gang spoof various popular horror movies and TV shows. Among the works parodied are "Night Gallery", "The Twilight Zone", "The Devil and Daniel Webster", "Frankenstein" and the "Abbott and Costello Meet..." films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/js7O06FmO3y1e0MUifdA6yuSNLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203847'),
  ('843880430220977156', 'Tiny Toon Spring Break', 1994, 'Animation, TV Movie, Comedy, Family', 'Rich Arons, Michael Gerard, Dave Marshall', 'Peter Hastings, Nicholas Hollander, Tom Ruegger', 'John Kassir, Joe Alaskey, Tress MacNeille, Cree Summer, Don Messick, Frank Welker, Maurice LaMarche, Gail Matthius', 'G', 'Buster, Babs and the entire ''Tiny Toons'' gang decided to take a trip to Ft. Lauderdale for Spring Break. Meanwhile, Elmrya believes that Buster is the Easter Bunny, and with the help of Samuel Gerard(Tommy Lee Jones in ''The Fugitive'') they go on a mission to capture Buster. Plucky tries to make a quick buck by sellin'' "The Tan Meiser 6000" but quickly turns his sights on a blonde duck that passes him by. Spoofs of music videos and films of that time (1994) are some of the highlights', 'Buster, Babs and the entire ''Tiny Toons'' gang decided to take a trip to Ft. Lauderdale for Spring Break. Meanwhile, Elmrya believes that Buster is the Easter Bunny, and with the help of Samuel Gerard(Tommy Lee Jones in ''The Fugitive'') they go on a mission to capture Buster. Plucky tries to make a quick buck by sellin'' "The Tan Meiser 6000" but quickly turns his sights on a blonde duck that passes him by. Spoofs of music videos and films of that time (1994) are some of the highlights', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAn2iQ8CtTC9uCdzczfMS2dFBmd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203848'),
  ('170005271263105423', 'Tip Top', 2013, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Serge Bozon, Céline Bozon', 'Axelle Ropert, Serge Bozon, Odile Barski', 'Isabelle Huppert, Sandrine Kiberlain, François Damiens, Karole Rocher, Aymen Saïdi, François Négret, Samy Naceri, Elie Lison', 'NR', 'Two policewomen from Internal Affairs arrive in a provincial precinct to investigate the death of an Algerian woman who was an informer. One punches, the other eyes, tip top.', 'Two policewomen from Internal Affairs arrive in a provincial precinct to investigate the death of an Algerian woman who was an informer. One punches, the other eyes, tip top.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnZP75AsM0qgqf86ZgBEwlHH8yA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190870'),
