  ('420383871521647430', 'Tiresia', 2003, 'Drama', 'Bertrand Bonello', 'Luca Fazzi, Bertrand Bonello', 'Laurent Lucas, Clara Choveaux, Thiago Telès, Célia Catalifo, Lou Castel, Alex Descas, Fred Ulysse, Stella', 'NR', 'Based on the legend of Tiresias, it tells of a transgender woman who is kidnapped by a man and left to die in the woods. She is then saved by a family and receives the gift of telling the future.', 'Based on the legend of Tiresias, it tells of a transgender woman who is kidnapped by a man and left to die in the woods. She is then saved by a family and receives the gift of telling the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wi4vY3Ri4cDlrL3kDHmV3S6xFIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67236'),
