  ('454773706103161611', 'Titan', 2021, 'Drama', 'Valery Carnoy, Arnaud Guez', 'Valery Carnoy', 'Mathéo Kabati, Killyan Guechtoum-Robert, Phénix Brossard, Anne Suarez, Jef Cuppens, Marcel Degotte', null, 'Nathan is thirteen years old boy. Driven by his new friend Malik, he prepares himself for a strange ritual to become a member of a teens gang.', 'Nathan is thirteen years old boy. Driven by his new friend Malik, he prepares himself for a strange ritual to become a member of a teens gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omhbsoAOFdpNcqRqf8aY1r0q4WJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879140'),
  ('675574915441143118', 'Titan A.E.', 2000, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure, Family, Action', 'Don Bluth, Gary Goldman, Jan Carlee', 'Ben Edlund, Joss Whedon, John August', 'Matt Damon, Bill Pullman, Drew Barrymore, John Leguizamo, Nathan Lane, Janeane Garofalo, Jim Breuer, Ken Hudson Campbell', 'PG', 'A young man finds out that he holds the key to restoring hope and ensuring survival for the human race, while an alien species called the Drej are bent on mankind''s destruction.', 'A young man finds out that he holds the key to restoring hope and ensuring survival for the human race, while an alien species called the Drej are bent on mankind''s destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/el2iHk3LTJWfEnwrvcRkvWY501G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7450'),
  ('758916635721683991', 'Titan: The OceanGate Submersible Disaster', 2025, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Mark Monroe, Jake Swantko', null, 'Stockton Rush, Emily Hammermeister, David Lochridge, Tony Nissen, Jason Neubauer, Joseph Assi, Bonnie Carl, David Pogue', 'R', 'OceanGate''s Titan tourist submersible imploded in 2023 on a deep-sea dive to the Titanic. This documentary details how a bold vision ended in tragedy.', 'OceanGate''s Titan tourist submersible imploded in 2023 on a deep-sea dive to the Titanic. This documentary details how a bold vision ended in tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSVJI9P5UmvOLZVTH8sAtlgxsgy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1426306'),
  ('1003943334816662405', 'Titane', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Ruben Impens, Aurore Benoit, Claire Corbetta-Doll', 'Julia Ducournau', 'Vincent Lindon, Agathe Rousselle, Garance Marillier, Laïs Salameh, Mara Cissé, Marin Judas, Diong-Kéba Tacu, Myriem Akheddiou', 'R', 'A woman with a metal plate in her head from a childhood car accident embarks on a bizarre journey, bringing her into contact with a firefighter who''s reunited with his missing son after 10 years.', 'A woman with a metal plate in her head from a childhood car accident embarks on a bizarre journey, bringing her into contact with a firefighter who''s reunited with his missing son after 10 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBlpouG3gqB8WLdP65LCOXb3jFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630240'),
  ('58839673616783171', 'Titanic', 1943, 'Drama, History', 'Werner Klingler, Friedl Behn-Grund, Herbert Selpin', 'Walter Zerlett-Olfenius, Herbert Selpin', 'Sybille Schmitz, Hans Nielsen, Kirsten Heiberg, Karl Schönböck, Otto Wernicke, Franz Schafheitlin, Ernst Fritz Fürbringer, Sepp Rist', null, 'In 1912, the Titanic embarks on its inevitable collision course with history. In the wake of the over-spending required to build the largest luxury ship in the world, White Star Line executive Sir Bruce Ismay schemes to reverse the direction of his company''s plummeting stock value. Onboard the Titanic, brave German 1st Officer Petersen struggles to convince his self-important British superiors not to overexert the ship''s engines.', 'In 1912, the Titanic embarks on its inevitable collision course with history. In the wake of the over-spending required to build the largest luxury ship in the world, White Star Line executive Sir Bruce Ismay schemes to reverse the direction of his company''s plummeting stock value. Onboard the Titanic, brave German 1st Officer Petersen struggles to convince his self-important British superiors not to overexert the ship''s engines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Al7oIXQ4dZAofBTZWm6OiXS3MEa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11021'),
  ('830272496234090118', 'Titanic', 1953, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean Negulesco, Joseph MacDonald, Henry Weinberger', 'Richard L. Breen, Charles Brackett, Walter Reisch', 'Clifton Webb, Barbara Stanwyck, Robert Wagner, Audrey Dalton, Thelma Ritter, Brian Aherne, Richard Basehart, Allyn Joslyn', 'NR', 'Unhappily married, Julia Sturges decides to go to America with her two children on the Titanic. Her husband, Richard also arranges passage on the luxury liner so as to have custody of their two children. All this fades to insignificance once the ship hits an iceberg.', 'Unhappily married, Julia Sturges decides to go to America with her two children on the Titanic. Her husband, Richard also arranges passage on the luxury liner so as to have custody of their two children. All this fades to insignificance once the ship hits an iceberg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEPzO9I6LCk6Mxg1X4BsBk6oA3V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16535'),
  ('78911943182336120', 'Titanic', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Russell Carpenter, James Cameron, Charles Dwight Lee', 'James Cameron', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Kate Winslet, Billy Zane, Kathy Bates, Frances Fisher, Gloria Stuart, Bill Paxton, Bernard Hill', 'PG-13', '101-year-old Rose DeWitt Bukater tells the story of her life aboard the Titanic, 84 years later. A young Rose boards the ship with her mother and fiancé. Meanwhile, Jack Dawson and Fabrizio De Rossi win third-class tickets aboard the ship. Rose tells the whole story from Titanic''s departure through to its death—on its first and last voyage—on April 15, 1912.', '101-year-old Rose DeWitt Bukater tells the story of her life aboard the Titanic, 84 years later. A young Rose boards the ship with her mother and fiancé. Meanwhile, Jack Dawson and Fabrizio De Rossi win third-class tickets aboard the ship. Rose tells the whole story from Titanic''s departure through to its death—on its first and last voyage—on April 15, 1912.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xjZS2rlVxm8SFx8kPC3aIGCOYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597'),
  ('389246942130110516', 'Titanic 2000', 1999, 'Comedy, Horror', 'John Paul Fedele, Timothy Healy', 'Michael L. Raso, Joe Ned, Clancy Fitzsimmons', 'Tammy Parks, Tina Krause, Elizabeth Cintron, David Fine, Bob MacKay, Michael R. Thomas, Suzanne Lenore, Jasi Cotton Lanier', 'R', 'The luxury liner Titanic 2000 has set sail on its maiden voyage, and one of the passengers is the vampire Vladamina. Vladamina is searching for a woman she can turn into a vampire queen, and frustrated rock groupie Shari looks to be a perfect target. As various people get seduced and/or killed as the liner continues on its doomed voyage, Shari must chose between eternity as a living dead sex slave or a frigid grave at the bottom of the ocean.', 'The luxury liner Titanic 2000 has set sail on its maiden voyage, and one of the passengers is the vampire Vladamina. Vladamina is searching for a woman she can turn into a vampire queen, and frustrated rock groupie Shari looks to be a perfect target. As various people get seduced and/or killed as the liner continues on its doomed voyage, Shari must chose between eternity as a living dead sex slave or a frigid grave at the bottom of the ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ib66R8D34o2Bffmp0dk5UUB6WHA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4240'),
  ('1048114934090540575', 'Titanic 666', 2022, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Nick Lyon, Taylor Randall, Ryan Ebert', 'Jacob Cooney, Jason White', 'Keesha Sharp, Jamie Bamber, Lydia Hearst, AnnaLynne McCord, Joseph Gatt, Jhey Castles, Michael J. Chen, Derek Yates', null, 'After a mammoth cruise ship sails over the site of the Titanic’s disaster, dark and deadly events start to occur on board. As the ship’s captain investigates the tragic occurrences, it becomes clear that the passengers and crew from the original Titanic have returned.', 'After a mammoth cruise ship sails over the site of the Titanic’s disaster, dark and deadly events start to occur on board. As the ship’s captain investigates the tragic occurrences, it becomes clear that the passengers and crew from the original Titanic have returned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EX0ITg5YqDgFHjujpTNhEPaJSL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945657'),
  ('973093083504093361', 'Titanic Disaster', 1912, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Incredibly fascinating documentary short that is a truly historic film. We see the actual Titanic leaving for its last voyage and also all the aftermath of the tragedy. We get to view various interesting aspects including seeing Captain Smith minutes before the boat sails, the Mary Sculley and the Carpathia in action, the Carpathia returning to the shore with survivors, Captain Rostrum of the Carpathia, family members at the White Star Office in NY waiting for news and even some of the survivors pulled off the lifeboats. Anyone interested in this historic event would certainly find this film fascinating and it''s pretty sad and spooky to watch it today.', 'Incredibly fascinating documentary short that is a truly historic film. We see the actual Titanic leaving for its last voyage and also all the aftermath of the tragedy. We get to view various interesting aspects including seeing Captain Smith minutes before the boat sails, the Mary Sculley and the Carpathia in action, the Carpathia returning to the shore with survivors, Captain Rostrum of the Carpathia, family members at the White Star Office in NY waiting for news and even some of the survivors pulled off the lifeboats. Anyone interested in this historic event would certainly find this film fascinating and it''s pretty sad and spooky to watch it today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4hs14VdqYeo0wM2YQjC5zGIRfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420341'),
  ('876057564247265361', 'Titanic II', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Romance, Adventure, Drama', 'Shane van Dyke, Alexander Yellen, Glenn Miller', 'Shane van Dyke', 'Shane van Dyke, Marie Westbrook, Bruce Davison, Brooke Burns, Michelle Glavan, Carey van Dyke, Dylan Vox, Wittly Jourdan', 'NR', 'On the 100th anniversary of the original voyage, a modern luxury liner christened "Titanic 2," follows the path of its namesake. But when a tsunami hurls an ice berg into the new ship''s path, the passengers and crew must fight to avoid a similar fate.', 'On the 100th anniversary of the original voyage, a modern luxury liner christened "Titanic 2," follows the path of its namesake. But when a tsunami hurls an ice berg into the new ship''s path, the passengers and crew must fight to avoid a similar fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3m12UeP1DMfhYZyvpLftaJGsyp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44918'),
  ('474075057260809597', 'Titanic: 20 Years Later with James Cameron', 2017, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Thomas C. Grane', 'Richard Brehm', 'James Cameron, Jacqueline Astor Drexel, Robert D. Ballard, Harold Bride, Paul Kurzman, Don Lynch, Ken Marschall, William McMaster Murdoch', 'PG', 'For the 20th anniversary of "Titanic," James Cameron reopens the file on the disaster.', 'For the 20th anniversary of "Titanic," James Cameron reopens the file on the disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5w18P8qU9sHRcW6pH3NVGVVIKFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489493'),
  ('236415125360756062', 'Titanic: Into the Heart of the Wreck', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Thomas Risch', 'Laurent Portes, Thomas Risch, Nicolas Glimois', 'James Cameron, Paul-Henri Nargeolet, Patrick Lahey, Anatoly M. Sagalevitch', 'PG', 'The Titanic is under a new threat. Resting at over 12,500 feet below sea level and 380 nautical miles off the coast of Newfoundland, the most famous shipwreck in the world is being consumed by a colony of iron-eating bacteria. This slow and irreversible decay, according to the most concerned experts, will sweep away all the secrets of the mythic liner within a few decades. This documentary details the underwater odyssey of the greatest Titanic expeditions and the evolution of the most scrutinized shipwreck in the world. From the epic discovery of the wreck by a French-American team in 1985 to the exploratory missions led by James Cameron, and to the treasure hunts that brought back over 5,000 vestiges–experience the unequaled thrill of these extreme dives through the eyes of the explorers who have attempted to unlock Titanic’s secrets.', 'The Titanic is under a new threat. Resting at over 12,500 feet below sea level and 380 nautical miles off the coast of Newfoundland, the most famous shipwreck in the world is being consumed by a colony of iron-eating bacteria. This slow and irreversible decay, according to the most concerned experts, will sweep away all the secrets of the mythic liner within a few decades. This documentary details the underwater odyssey of the greatest Titanic expeditions and the evolution of the most scrutinized shipwreck in the world. From the epic discovery of the wreck by a French-American team in 1985 to the exploratory missions led by James Cameron, and to the treasure hunts that brought back over 5,000 vestiges–experience the unequaled thrill of these extreme dives through the eyes of the explorers who have attempted to unlock Titanic’s secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTqXfXdLtVBhWyo1kBG1xgtV946.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:777797'),
  ('911725861455422918', 'Titanic: The Digital Resurrection', 2025, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Fergus Colville, Andreas Neo, Chris Titus-King', null, 'Josh Goodman, Parks Stephenson, Jennifer Hooper, Chris Hearn, Yasmin Khan, Jeom-Kee Paik, Simon Benson, Stephen Payne', null, 'Using cutting-edge scanning technology and state-of-the-art CGI, a team of experts creates the first high-resolution 3D digital twin of the Titanic wreck. Through a groundbreaking immersive investigation, they uncover the ship’s final moments, shedding light on the acts of heroism and cowardice aboard—and revealing the true story behind the sinking of the “unsinkable” ship.', 'Using cutting-edge scanning technology and state-of-the-art CGI, a team of experts creates the first high-resolution 3D digital twin of the Titanic wreck. Through a groundbreaking immersive investigation, they uncover the ship’s final moments, shedding light on the acts of heroism and cowardice aboard—and revealing the true story behind the sinking of the “unsinkable” ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkK7w1XufrVL7qd4UzKyv0X6Gur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1457124'),
  ('798163132793934125', 'Titanic: The Legend Goes On...', 2000, 'Animation, Family', 'Camillo Teti', 'Camillo Teti', 'Francesca Guadagno, Francesco Pezzulli, Valeria Perilli, Claudia Pittelli, Eliana Lupo, Stefania Romagnoli, Lucio Saccone, Luigi Ferraro', null, 'An animated retelling of the worst passenger ship disaster in history. In this version, love blossoms between the upper-class Sir William and the blue-collar Angelica, who is hoping to find romance in America. At the same time, there are also a number of animal passengers, including talking dogs, cats and mice, who are also looking forward to arriving in the New World.', 'An animated retelling of the worst passenger ship disaster in history. In this version, love blossoms between the upper-class Sir William and the blue-collar Angelica, who is hoping to find romance in America. At the same time, there are also a number of animal passengers, including talking dogs, cats and mice, who are also looking forward to arriving in the New World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1PHRSlos2hIFrtA8Ze0JybJTGb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71235'),
  ('342839628711169562', 'Titeuf', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Zep, Stéphane Sainte-Foi, Patrick Imbert', 'Zep', 'Donald Reignoux, Mélanie Bernier, Nathalie Homs, Sam Karmann, Zabou Breitman, Maria Pacôme, Jean Rochefort, Michael Lonsdale', null, 'Titeuf is a comic series created by Swiss draughtsman Zep (real name Philippe Chapuis) depicting the life of a young boy (the title''s namesake Titeuf, "Tootuff" in the English translation) and his vision of the adult world & themes such as love, sex, seduction and mysteries about the girls. In this film, Titeuf (Donald Reignoux) is off on a new comedic adventure! Things get complicated when Nadia (Melanie Bernier) doesn’t invite Titeuf to her birthday party, which is surely the most horrible moment of his life. Before long, Titeuf’s whole life is turned upside down when his parents are nearly deported. Everything continues to spiral out of control even in the midst of Titeuf’s exhaustive attempts to make matters right.', 'Titeuf is a comic series created by Swiss draughtsman Zep (real name Philippe Chapuis) depicting the life of a young boy (the title''s namesake Titeuf, "Tootuff" in the English translation) and his vision of the adult world & themes such as love, sex, seduction and mysteries about the girls. In this film, Titeuf (Donald Reignoux) is off on a new comedic adventure! Things get complicated when Nadia (Melanie Bernier) doesn’t invite Titeuf to her birthday party, which is surely the most horrible moment of his life. Before long, Titeuf’s whole life is turned upside down when his parents are nearly deported. Everything continues to spiral out of control even in the midst of Titeuf’s exhaustive attempts to make matters right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gNhlzuvJ8TP0utG6fBnqAuuzy2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61672'),
  ('764040120541705935', 'Titicut Follies', 1967, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Frederick Wiseman, John Marshall', 'Frederick Wiseman', null, 'NR', 'A stark and graphic portrayal of the conditions that existed at the State Prison for the Criminally Insane at Bridgewater, Massachusetts, and documents the various ways the inmates are treated by the guards, social workers, and psychiatrists.', 'A stark and graphic portrayal of the conditions that existed at the State Prison for the Criminally Insane at Bridgewater, Massachusetts, and documents the various ways the inmates are treated by the guards, social workers, and psychiatrists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAJOSqWB4FeVV7yi0fRSYFoCwvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41212'),
  ('283259173093695199', 'Titina', 2022, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, History', 'Marie-Laure Guisset, Cecilie Semec, Cathinka Tanberg', 'Per Schreiner', 'Jan Gunnar Røise, Kåre Conradi, Silje Torp, Ninni Spone, Siri Forberg, Anne Marit Jacobsen, Marit Andreassen, Ingar Helge Gimle', null, 'Italian airship engineer Umberto Nobile enjoys a quiet life with his beloved dog Titina. One day, Norwegian explorer superstar Roald Amundsen contacts him and orders an airship to conquer The North Pole.', 'Italian airship engineer Umberto Nobile enjoys a quiet life with his beloved dog Titina. One day, Norwegian explorer superstar Roald Amundsen contacts him and orders an airship to conquer The North Pole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YysUmqmnMN5ZWMBBFaViPIdige.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:678320'),
  ('33323838892436750', 'Titli', 2015, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Kanu Behl, Siddharth Diwan, Parvez Khan', 'Kanu Behl, Sharat Katariya', 'Shashank Arora, Shivani Raghuvanshi, Ranvir Shorey, Amit Sial, Lalit Behl, Prashant Singh, Sarita Sharma, Sumit Gulati', null, 'A young man in Delhi tries to break free from his controlling, criminal brothers.', 'A young man in Delhi tries to break free from his controlling, criminal brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGknAQus2ayOXjVkVA6GJZCnPfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266038'),
  ('914192577959167912', 'Tito', 2004, 'Drama, Crime', 'Tarek Al-Aryan, Sameh Selim, Ahmed El Gendy', 'Mohamed Hefzy', 'Ahmed Al Saqqa, Hanan Turk, Amr Waked, Khaled Saleh, Ahmed Mekky, Diaa Abdel Khaleq, Essam Mohamed, Ashraf Meslehi', null, 'Tito is the second installment in the new-wave Egyptian action movies. After Mafia by Sherif Arafa, which was a breakthrough in Egyptian cinema making, Tarek El-Aryan brings us Tito, the next logical step. Very simply, this movie is about an ex-con who tries to escape his sinful life by starting a new one, but his past comes back to haunt him. The reason, why Tito is better than Mafia is because the script and story line in Tito is more complex, and some of the characters had real depth in them and where fully developed throughout the movie.', 'Tito is the second installment in the new-wave Egyptian action movies. After Mafia by Sherif Arafa, which was a breakthrough in Egyptian cinema making, Tarek El-Aryan brings us Tito, the next logical step. Very simply, this movie is about an ex-con who tries to escape his sinful life by starting a new one, but his past comes back to haunt him. The reason, why Tito is better than Mafia is because the script and story line in Tito is more complex, and some of the characters had real depth in them and where fully developed throughout the movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shzOfwyV2aN6BhQpaD9TEpc6UZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140718'),
  ('1011718927153482188', 'Tito and Me', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Goran Marković', 'Goran Marković', 'Dimitrije Vojnov, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Anica Dobra, Bogdan Diklić, Ljiljana Dragutinović, Rade Marković, Olivera Marković, Jelena Živković', null, 'At his school, 10-year-old Zoran wins the competition for the best essay about Tito. His reward is participation in the march "Revolutionary trails" to Tito''s hometown of Kumrovec.', 'At his school, 10-year-old Zoran wins the competition for the best essay about Tito. His reward is participation in the march "Revolutionary trails" to Tito''s hometown of Kumrovec.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLekdPVjTjqbkauVR8DXDgixrw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41777'),
  ('916315593844157507', 'Tito and the Birds', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Family', 'Gustavo Steinberg, Gabriel Bitar, Andre Catoto Dias', 'Gustavo Steinberg, Eduardo Benain', 'Pedro Henrique, Marina Serretiello, Mateus Solano, Enrico Cardoso, Denise Fraga, Matheus Nachtergaele, Felipe Volpato, Otávio Augusto', null, 'Tito is a shy 10-year-old boy who lives with his mother. Suddenly, an unusual epidemic starts to spread, making people sick whenever they get scared. Tito quickly discovers that the cure is somehow related to his missing father’s research on bird song. He embarks on a journey to save the world from the epidemic with his friends. Tito’s search for the antidote becomes a quest for his missing father and for his own identity.', 'Tito is a shy 10-year-old boy who lives with his mother. Suddenly, an unusual epidemic starts to spread, making people sick whenever they get scared. Tito quickly discovers that the cure is somehow related to his missing father’s research on bird song. He embarks on a journey to save the world from the epidemic with his friends. Tito’s search for the antidote becomes a quest for his missing father and for his own identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlvQDVCIOHhNsq2lrSLhx3Qvt8E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528112'),
  ('608801188405962140', 'Titus', 1999, 'Drama, History', 'Julie Taymor, Luciano Tovoli, Roberto Casale', 'Julie Taymor', 'Anthony Hopkins, Jessica Lange, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Matthew Rhys, Harry Lennix, Angus Macfadyen, Colm Feore, Alan Cumming', 'R', 'Titus Andronicus returns from the wars and sees his sons and daughters taken from him, one by one. Shakespeare''s goriest and earliest tragedy.', 'Titus Andronicus returns from the wars and sees his sons and daughters taken from him, one by one. Shakespeare''s goriest and earliest tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82mCeQoeT2C7h7vR6Ot9MQotE1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12524'),
  ('257429717843154413', 'Tivoli', 1975, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Alberto Isaac', 'Alberto Isaac, Alfonso Arau', 'Alfonso Arau, Pancho Córdova, Lyn May, Carmen Salinas, Mario García ''Harapos'', Héctor Ortega, Dora Guerra, Ernesto Gómez Cruz', null, 'While trying to save the famous Tivoli burlesque theater, the participants uncover a web of commercial corruption.', 'While trying to save the famous Tivoli burlesque theater, the participants uncover a web of commercial corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hb2nUVvfTVJQtotD0X4mvegbpnC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408553'),
  ('184855182348901905', 'Tizoc', 1957, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Alex Phillips, Fernando Martínez', 'Carlos Orellana', 'María Félix, Pedro Infante, Andrés Soler, Alicia del Lago, Eduardo Fajardo, Julio Aldama, Carlos Orellana, Miguel Arenas', null, 'An Indian arouses envy for his expertise in hunting animals without ruining their skins, for his wisdom and his kindness.', 'An Indian arouses envy for his expertise in hunting animals without ruining their skins, for his wisdom and his kindness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ob9OjvAFwX2FTq0AQbRjTYolw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103199'),
  ('9028767545845917', 'Tjorven and Mysak', 1966, 'Family', 'Olle Hellbom', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Eva Stiberg, Maria Johansson, Torsten Lilliecrona, Louise Edlind, Torsten Wahlund, Kajsa Dandenell, Stephen Lindholm, Bengt Eklund', null, 'Tjorven and the other children at Seacrow island have received a play day in a gift. Uncle Melker will find himself ending up in the lake several times. The kids also have found an old ship that will be named Albertina. They divide themselves into two pirate gangs and fights about the wishing stone Mysak.', 'Tjorven and the other children at Seacrow island have received a play day in a gift. Uncle Melker will find himself ending up in the lake several times. The kids also have found an old ship that will be named Albertina. They divide themselves into two pirate gangs and fights about the wishing stone Mysak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGwgJYjXXeyeeFhVfiiIwkHCLeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433398'),
  ('963858952998784090', 'Tjorven and Skrallan', 1965, 'Family', 'Olle Hellbom, Kalle Bergholm', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Torsten Lilliecrona, Louise Edlind, Maria Johansson, Kristina Jämtmark, Kajsa Dandenell, Torsten Wahlund, Björn Söderbäck, Urban Strand', null, 'The residents of Seacrow island get new problems when Malin and Peter get their first child - Skrållan.', 'The residents of Seacrow island get new problems when Malin and Peter get their first child - Skrållan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUO1n5ZyLpce9uemE5Aqk00An5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433396'),
  ('131435987152751351', 'Tjorven, Batsman, and Moses', 1964, 'Comedy, Family', 'Olle Hellbom', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Maria Johansson, Kristina Jämtmark, Torsten Lilliecrona, Louise Edlind, Bengt Eklund, Manne Grünberger', null, 'Vesterman has found a young seal in his fishing nets in the outskirts of the archipelago. When he comes back to the Saltkråkan island he gives the seal to Tjorven, who names it Moses. Peter Malm, a visitor who works at the Zoological Institute in Uppsala, wants to buy the seal, but Tjorven says it''s not for sale. Vesterman is in need of money and tries to get the seal back, to sell it to Peter. The children have to hide the seal, so he won''t find it. Pelle''s rabbit Jocke and one of Söderman''s lambs are found bitten to death. The dog Båtsman is accused of those evil deeds, which means that Tjorven''s father has to shoot her dog. In the last minute Söderman finds out that a fox is the perpetrator. Peter Malm says he won''t buy the seal. Vesterman is disappointed and the seal stays with the children.', 'Vesterman has found a young seal in his fishing nets in the outskirts of the archipelago. When he comes back to the Saltkråkan island he gives the seal to Tjorven, who names it Moses. Peter Malm, a visitor who works at the Zoological Institute in Uppsala, wants to buy the seal, but Tjorven says it''s not for sale. Vesterman is in need of money and tries to get the seal back, to sell it to Peter. The children have to hide the seal, so he won''t find it. Pelle''s rabbit Jocke and one of Söderman''s lambs are found bitten to death. The dog Båtsman is accused of those evil deeds, which means that Tjorven''s father has to shoot her dog. In the last minute Söderman finds out that a fox is the perpetrator. Peter Malm says he won''t buy the seal. Vesterman is disappointed and the seal stays with the children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fP8xZXp2nTh7UsgUgfa5dgem9k3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433600'),
  ('827654421971544214', 'TKKG', 2019, 'Adventure, Family, Crime', 'Robert Thalheim, Henner Besuch, Claudia Beewen', 'Peer Klehmet, Robert Thalheim', 'Ilyes Raoul, Lorenzo Germeno, Emma-Louise Schimpf, Manuel Santos Gelke, Mai Duong Kieu, Phil Laude, Antoine Monot Jr., Trish Osmond', null, 'When Willi''s father is abducted and is only released for a valuable statue from his art collection, Tim is the only one who believes Willi that the police are on the wrong track. Together with the smart policeman''s daughter Gaby and the highly intelligent outsider Karl, they start to investigate on their own. Against all odds the four discover a conspiracy. In the course of their first big detective adventure they grow together into a committed community, and so Tim, Klöschen, Karl and Gaby become the band TKKG.', 'When Willi''s father is abducted and is only released for a valuable statue from his art collection, Tim is the only one who believes Willi that the police are on the wrong track. Together with the smart policeman''s daughter Gaby and the highly intelligent outsider Karl, they start to investigate on their own. Against all odds the four discover a conspiracy. In the course of their first big detective adventure they grow together into a committed community, and so Tim, Klöschen, Karl and Gaby become the band TKKG.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNwMRToWSvCMe8tBC6TucqJxW5J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603641'),
  ('455154569939907209', 'TKKG - The Secret of the Mysterious Mind Machine', 2006, 'Family, Adventure', 'Tomy Wigand, Egon Werdin, Mac Steinmeier', 'Marco Petry', 'Jannis Niewöhner, Jonathan Dümcke, Lukas Eichammer, Svea Bein, Jürgen Vogel, Ulrich Noethen, Jeanette Hain, Robert Dölle', null, 'At first, friendgroup TKKG have no idea that something is amiss when “Jugend forscht” winner Kevin behaves strangely during the presentation of his “Mind Machine” - they blame his nervousness and his unexpected termination of the speech on relationship stress with his girlfriend Nadine. But when Nadine disappears without a trace shortly afterwards, like three other children before her, the amateur detectives know that they have to help the police with their investigation.', 'At first, friendgroup TKKG have no idea that something is amiss when “Jugend forscht” winner Kevin behaves strangely during the presentation of his “Mind Machine” - they blame his nervousness and his unexpected termination of the speech on relationship stress with his girlfriend Nadine. But when Nadine disappears without a trace shortly afterwards, like three other children before her, the amateur detectives know that they have to help the police with their investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBhcv97AcoAWzDQVRsupBTqTL6R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58290'),
  ('846518672494286139', 'TL', 2024, 'Drama', 'Jordan Castillo', null, 'Jenn Rosa, Nico Locco, Armani Hector, Jonica Lazo, Manu Respall, Irish Tan, Erica Dales, Amarah Faith Panlilio', null, 'Brenda, a top agent in a BPO company, is always overlooked for promotion. But not this time; as she gets more than intimate with her TL. Is her long awaited position within her reach? Or did she just put herself in a bad situation?', 'Brenda, a top agent in a BPO company, is always overlooked for promotion. But not this time; as she gets more than intimate with her TL. Is her long awaited position within her reach? Or did she just put herself in a bad situation?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sze10NcTe4gAL7q7Fr8nORRh78Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241755'),
  ('1104118042625187354', 'Tlamess', 2019, 'Drama', 'Ala Eddine Slim, Amine Messadi', 'Ala Eddine Slim', 'Abdullah Miniawy, Souhir Ben Amara, Khaled Benaissa, Mounir Ouni', null, 'S is a young soldier in the southern desert of Tunisia. When S learns about his mother’s death, he obtains a week’s leave and goes back home. He will never return to the camp. In his popular neighborhood starts a man hunt after which S eventually escapes through the mountain. Few years later, F, a young woman married to a rich business man who has just settled in a luxurious villa, learns of her pregnancy. One morning, she goes out alone for a walk in the forest. She will never come back.', 'S is a young soldier in the southern desert of Tunisia. When S learns about his mother’s death, he obtains a week’s leave and goes back home. He will never return to the camp. In his popular neighborhood starts a man hunt after which S eventually escapes through the mountain. Few years later, F, a young woman married to a rich business man who has just settled in a luxurious villa, learns of her pregnancy. One morning, she goes out alone for a walk in the forest. She will never come back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKaxMiC5SoBElYE7sdAbdTrWijW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597108'),
  ('234367837410045807', 'Tlatelolco, Summer of 68''', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Carlos Bolado', 'Carlos Bolado, Carolina Rivera, Luis Felipe Ybarra Rivera', 'Christian Vazquez, Cassandra Ciangherotti, Claudette Maillé, Roberto Sosa, Juan Manuel Bernal, Armando Hernández, Álex Perea, Alejandra Ambrosi', null, 'As Mexico prepares to host the 1968 Olympics, students and civilians are uniting on the streets to protest the authoritarian government. Tensions are running high and the eyes of the world are on Mexico and President Gustavo Diaz Ordaz. Ana Maria, a student photographer and daughter of a high-ranking official, finds herself embroiled in the movement and is swept off her feet by Félix, a working-class architecture student. This film remembers the events that led to one of the darkest chapters in Mexico’s recent history: the massacre at Tlatelolco, 10 days before the opening of the Olympic Games.', 'As Mexico prepares to host the 1968 Olympics, students and civilians are uniting on the streets to protest the authoritarian government. Tensions are running high and the eyes of the world are on Mexico and President Gustavo Diaz Ordaz. Ana Maria, a student photographer and daughter of a high-ranking official, finds herself embroiled in the movement and is swept off her feet by Félix, a working-class architecture student. This film remembers the events that led to one of the darkest chapters in Mexico’s recent history: the massacre at Tlatelolco, 10 days before the opening of the Olympic Games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ib42FWsv5rMjpxWcoJ0oA6EGpVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192128'),
  ('237270989659245103', 'Tlayucan', 1962, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Luis Alcoriza, Ignacio Villareal, Rosalío Solano', 'Jesús "Murciélago" Velázquez, Luis Alcoriza', 'Julio Aldama, Norma Angélica, Andrés Soler, Anita Blanch, Noé Murayama, Jorge Martínez de Hoyos, Pancho Córdova, Eric del Castillo', null, 'Desperate because of his son''s illness, the peasant Eufemio steals a pearl from the image of Santa Lucía in the village church.', 'Desperate because of his son''s illness, the peasant Eufemio steals a pearl from the image of Santa Lucía in the village church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Dnp6WRgU1BRUlMiExxVEawFYpc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194163'),
  ('842329651369516808', 'TMNT', 2007, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Kevin Munroe, Steve Lumley', 'Kevin Munroe', 'James Arnold Taylor, Mitchell Whitfield, Nolan North, Mikey Kelley, Sarah Michelle Gellar, Chris Evans, Mako, Patrick Stewart', 'PG', 'After the defeat of their old arch nemesis, The Shredder, the Turtles have grown apart as a family. Struggling to keep them together, their rat sensei, Splinter, becomes worried when strange things begin to brew in New York City.', 'After the defeat of their old arch nemesis, The Shredder, the Turtles have grown apart as a family. Struggling to keep them together, their rat sensei, Splinter, becomes worried when strange things begin to brew in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZCWn7BGpDLBDigtdiuGyBdEqab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1273'),
