  ('931555355382855163', 'To Beep or Not to Beep', 1963, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc, Paul Julian', 'NR', 'Wile E. Coyote hopes to stop and catch the Road Runner using a huge, boulder-throwing catapult. But no matter where Wile E. positions himself, the catapult drops the boulder on him.', 'Wile E. Coyote hopes to stop and catch the Road Runner using a huge, boulder-throwing catapult. But no matter where Wile E. positions himself, the catapult drops the boulder on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ek0aO2iuOG0ChJ5YSbQKegk4eJ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100377'),
  ('935083392339816524', 'To Begin Again', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'José Luis Garci, Benito Rabal, Manuel Rojas', 'José Luis Garci, Ángel Llorente, Jaime Camino', 'Antonio Ferrandis, Encarna Paso, José Bódalo, Agustín González, Pablo Hoyos, Marta Fernández Muro, Pablo del Hoyo, Alfonso Cabeza', null, 'A Nobel prize winner returns to his natal city looking for his home.', 'A Nobel prize winner returns to his natal city looking for his home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1KY4B6lEyos8Zh28hmr2NKNPMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81346'),
  ('1105067853698438658', 'To Catch a Cheater', 2026, 'Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Damián Romay, Hernan Herrera', 'Rachel Morton', 'Kate Watson, Sheila Leason, Lily Bowen, Jordan Kennedy, Roy Lynam', 'TV-14', 'When her teenage daughter dies under mysterious circumstances, a mother''s search for truth unravels a chain of lies and betrayal among her closest friends, forcing her to confront evil in her own circle.', 'When her teenage daughter dies under mysterious circumstances, a mother''s search for truth unravels a chain of lies and betrayal among her closest friends, forcing her to confront evil in her own circle.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fvvqp5VrA8bhb9aAPGv8V3ovLQ1Y.jpg', 'plex:movie:to-catch-a-cheater-2026-1'),
  ('400746612878732069', 'To Catch a Killer', 1992, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Eric Till, Rene Ohashi', 'Jud Kinberg', 'Brian Dennehy, Michael Riley, Margot Kidder, Meg Foster, Martin Julien, Scott Hylands, John Boylan, David Eisner', null, '"To Catch a Killer" tells the true gruesome story of John Wayne Gacy - a good friend and helpful neighbour, a great child entertainer, a respectful businessman, and a violent serial killer who raped and murdered over 30 young boys.', '"To Catch a Killer" tells the true gruesome story of John Wayne Gacy - a good friend and helpful neighbour, a great child entertainer, a respectful businessman, and a violent serial killer who raped and murdered over 30 young boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjr42PHZPhTnChTxfOdRk1UGqhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51806'),
  ('443348220282259822', 'To Catch a Killer', 2023, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Javier Julia, Vincent Bélisle-Ducharme, Renato De Cotiis', 'Damián Szifron, Jonathan Wakeham', 'Shailene Woodley, Ben Mendelsohn, Jovan Adepo, Ralph Ineson, Richard Zeman, Dusan Dukic, Jason Cavalier, Nick Walker', 'R', 'Baltimore. New Year''s Eve. A talented but troubled police officer is recruited by the FBI''s chief investigator to help profile and track down a mass murderer.', 'Baltimore. New Year''s Eve. A talented but troubled police officer is recruited by the FBI''s chief investigator to help profile and track down a mass murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFp3l4lZg1NSEsyxKrdi0rNK8r1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605886'),
  ('825887231552026368', 'To Catch a Spy', 2021, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Romance', 'Jeff Beesley, Sean Buhagiar, Carolina Pontt', 'Rick Garman', 'Nathalie Kelley, Colin Donnell, Patti Murin, Davy Eduard King, Jonathan Dunn, Joe Azzopardi, Mikhail Basmadjian, Antonella Axisa', 'PG', 'When the newly renovated Hotel Optima in Malta has a grand reopening, Chloe and her team from Destination Traveler Magazine, head over to cover the travel scene in Malta and sees someone fall to their death, right past her hotel window.', 'When the newly renovated Hotel Optima in Malta has a grand reopening, Chloe and her team from Destination Traveler Magazine, head over to cover the travel scene in Malta and sees someone fall to their death, right past her hotel window.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnpIHLdsDzIfU3KvFJDK6hxX47J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821807'),
  ('879324372432223069', 'To Catch a Thief', 1955, 'Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Robert Burks, W. Wallace Kelley', 'John Michael Hayes', 'Cary Grant, Grace Kelly, Jessie Royce Landis, John Williams, Charles Vanel, Brigitte Auber, Jean Martinelli, Georgette Anys', 'PG', 'When a string of jewel robberies hits the French Riviera, suspicion falls on retired thief John “The Cat” Robie. To clear his name, he sets out to trap the copycat himself—entangling a wealthy widow and her beguiling daughter in a seductive game of pursuit, deception, and desire.', 'When a string of jewel robberies hits the French Riviera, suspicion falls on retired thief John “The Cat” Robie. To clear his name, he sets out to trap the copycat himself—entangling a wealthy widow and her beguiling daughter in a seductive game of pursuit, deception, and desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6M6NwjV3XvtayljoiZ8wRHOKCQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381'),
  ('400671248270783530', 'To Catch a Virgin Ghost', 2004, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Shin Jung-won', 'Chang-shi Lee, Hwang In-ho', 'Im Chang-jung, Kwon Oh-joong, Shin Yi, Lim Eun-kyung, Byun Hee-bong, Park Myung-shin, Woo Hyeon, Ahn Nae-sang', null, 'Seok-tae runs away with a huge diamond of his gang and comes to Sisily, a peaceful village. Yang-e runs after him to get the diamond back and finds Seok-tae''s trail in Sisily. But all the town people lie about everything. These people turn out to be scarier than a ghost!', 'Seok-tae runs away with a huge diamond of his gang and comes to Sisily, a peaceful village. Yang-e runs after him to get the diamond back and finds Seok-tae''s trail in Sisily. But all the town people lie about everything. These people turn out to be scarier than a ghost!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/higMXZsQdHRm8OgO7aZrBdidpMY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48895'),
  ('54543301778481639', 'To Catch a Yeti', 1995, 'Action, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Bob Keen, David Perrault', 'Lionel Shenken, Paul Adam', 'Meat Loaf, Chantellese Kent, Richard Howland, Jim Gordon, Leigh Lewis, Jeff Moser, Michael Panton, Mona Matteo', null, 'Big Jake''s after Bigfoot in the Big Apple. It''s the biggest chase this town has ever seen.', 'Big Jake''s after Bigfoot in the Big Apple. It''s the biggest chase this town has ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PNtagTvHqhg97pQ3EZVJv2Nuqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85856'),
  ('141835573907118967', 'To Chiara', 2021, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jonas Carpignano, Tim Curtin', 'Jonas Carpignano', 'Swamy Rotolo, Claudio Rotolo, Grecia Rotolo, Carmela Fumo, Giorgia Rotolo, Antonio Rotolo, Vincenzo Rotolo, Antonina Fumo', 'R', 'The Guerrasio family and friends gather to celebrate Claudio and Carmela’s oldest daughter’s 18th birthday. There is a healthy rivalry between the birthday girl and her 15-year-old sister Chiara as they compete on the dancefloor. It is a happy occasion, and the close-knit family are on top form. However, everything changes the next day when the father disappears. Chiara, unconvinced by the cover story, starts to investigate. As she gets closer to the truth, she is forced to decide what kind of future she wants for herself.', 'The Guerrasio family and friends gather to celebrate Claudio and Carmela’s oldest daughter’s 18th birthday. There is a healthy rivalry between the birthday girl and her 15-year-old sister Chiara as they compete on the dancefloor. It is a happy occasion, and the close-knit family are on top form. However, everything changes the next day when the father disappears. Chiara, unconvinced by the cover story, starts to investigate. As she gets closer to the truth, she is forced to decide what kind of future she wants for herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ak0AM4lpmmkUkT0kXmRdjjxfa7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833420'),
  ('124983284098685324', 'To Dance with the White Dog', 1993, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Glenn Jordan, Neil Roach', null, 'Hume Cronyn, Jessica Tandy, Christine Baranski, Terry Beaver, Harley Cross, Esther Rolle, Frank Whaley, Amy Wright', null, 'When Sam Peek''s beloved wife, Cora, dies, a white dog suddenly materializes as his new companion and confidant.', 'When Sam Peek''s beloved wife, Cora, dies, a white dog suddenly materializes as his new companion and confidant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pewgsWtwQs7unrZB560ctVkzPra.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115831'),
  ('895463875574133361', 'Tô de Graça: O Filme', 2024, 'Comedy', 'César Rodrigues, Marcelo ''Guru'' Duarte', 'Junior Figueiredo, Rodrigo Sant''anna', 'Rodrigo Sant''anna, Isabelle Marques, Roberta Rodrigues, Evelyn Castro, Estevam Nabote, Andy Gercker, Faíska Alves, João Fernandes', null, 'Graça receives an unexpected financial settlement and decides to take part of her large family on a trip to Araruama. The journey quickly descends into chaos as the group faces a series of misadventures: travel mishaps, unexpected encounters, and escalating comedic situations. Along the way, Graça confronts past relationships and family conflicts, leading to humorous and unpredictable outcomes. The story follows the family’s attempts to navigate these challenges, blending farce, misunderstandings, and coincidences, ultimately highlighting the chaos and unpredictability of a large family vacation.', 'Graça receives an unexpected financial settlement and decides to take part of her large family on a trip to Araruama. The journey quickly descends into chaos as the group faces a series of misadventures: travel mishaps, unexpected encounters, and escalating comedic situations. Along the way, Graça confronts past relationships and family conflicts, leading to humorous and unpredictable outcomes. The story follows the family’s attempts to navigate these challenges, blending farce, misunderstandings, and coincidences, ultimately highlighting the chaos and unpredictability of a large family vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPdJRN1Pp5SJOIDXV26Mu74vDuV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1228597'),
  ('595585348780955527', 'To Die For', 1988, 'Horror', 'Deran Sarafian, Allen Kupetsky, Jacques Haitkin', 'Leslie King', 'Brendan Hughes, Sydney Walsh, Amanda Wyss, Scott Jacoby, Micah Grant, Duane Jones, Steve Bond, Remy O''Neill', null, 'L.A. real estate agent Kate Wooten gets a new lease on life when she learns that her new client, a mysterious and handsome man named Vlad, is looking for a house isolated in the Hollywood Hills where he wants to live and doesn''t want to be disturbed. It doesn''t take long for Kate to fall in love with her new client and to learn that he''s a real vampire.', 'L.A. real estate agent Kate Wooten gets a new lease on life when she learns that her new client, a mysterious and handsome man named Vlad, is looking for a house isolated in the Hollywood Hills where he wants to live and doesn''t want to be disturbed. It doesn''t take long for Kate to fall in love with her new client and to learn that he''s a real vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1nqIPvGoP9jdGYY6r9Czn0Comq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86681'),
  ('910696059183658673', 'To Die For', 1995, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Gus Van Sant, Eric Alan Edwards, Andrew Poulos', 'Buck Henry', 'Nicole Kidman, Matt Dillon, Joaquin Phoenix, Casey Affleck, Illeana Douglas, Alison Folland, Dan Hedaya, Wayne Knight', 'R', 'Suzanne Stone wants to be a world-famous news anchor and she is willing to do anything to get what she wants. What she lacks in intelligence, she makes up for in cold determination and diabolical wiles. As she pursues her goal with relentless focus, she is forced to destroy anything and anyone that may stand in her way, regardless of the ultimate cost or means necessary.', 'Suzanne Stone wants to be a world-famous news anchor and she is willing to do anything to get what she wants. What she lacks in intelligence, she makes up for in cold determination and diabolical wiles. As she pursues her goal with relentless focus, she is forced to destroy anything and anyone that may stand in her way, regardless of the ultimate cost or means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whz4bwvqE1OmQHIyqHdZD8jU9CO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:577'),
  ('367957465277296075', 'To Die For', 2018, 'Drama, War', 'Çağatay Tosun', 'Zafer Külünk', 'Burak Özçivit, Kerem Bürsin, Melike İpek Yalova, Süleyman Karaahmet, Sabahattin Yakut, Onur Ayçelik, Özbek Kaplan, Can Baykan', null, 'Civil war reigns in one of the most dangerous areas of the world for 7 years. The Turkish army enters the region without any allied states. Among the officials in the region, there are also the Special Forces team under the command of Captain Alparslan. Together with Captain Pilot Onur, Tim brings out a big trap against the Turkish army. In order to break the trap, the main test for the team that fights the lives of terrorists against the terrorists in the difficult conditions is to be able to survive without losing their conscience.', 'Civil war reigns in one of the most dangerous areas of the world for 7 years. The Turkish army enters the region without any allied states. Among the officials in the region, there are also the Special Forces team under the command of Captain Alparslan. Together with Captain Pilot Onur, Tim brings out a big trap against the Turkish army. In order to break the trap, the main test for the team that fights the lives of terrorists against the terrorists in the difficult conditions is to be able to survive without losing their conscience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRPY8FJtA7XllfnSKyZHlpGZlM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517388'),
  ('815261628652171669', 'To Die for Tano', 1997, 'Music, Comedy', 'Roberta Torre, Daniele Ciprì', 'Roberta Torre, Enzo Paglino, Gianluca Sodaro', 'Ciccio Guarino, Enzo Paglino, Mimma De Rosalia, Maria Aliotta, Annamaria Confalone, Adele Aliotta, Vincenzo di Lorenzo, Lorenzo La Rosa', null, 'Shot in his butcher shop by a rival clan during the Mafia wars of 1988, the Palermo Mobster Tano Guarrasi is mourned by his wife, four unmarried sisters and his daughter. But in truth, his death represents a kind of liberation for the women.', 'Shot in his butcher shop by a rival clan during the Mafia wars of 1988, the Palermo Mobster Tano Guarrasi is mourned by his wife, four unmarried sisters and his daughter. But in truth, his death represents a kind of liberation for the women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTSMN2ntrRgVJbxyLrvLRWNuYnG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57799'),
  ('883611787872190212', 'To Die in Madrid', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Frédéric Rossif, Georges Barsky', 'Madeleine Chapsal', 'John Gielgud, Irene Worth, Suzanne Flon, Germaine Montero', null, 'Morir en Madrid brings together several papers on the Spanish Civil War and integrates capturing different points of view, intended to represent the continuity of the suffering of the Spanish during the Franco regime. The death of Federico Garcia Lorca, Guernica, the defense of Madrid, the International Brigades, are some of the items comprised in this document.', 'Morir en Madrid brings together several papers on the Spanish Civil War and integrates capturing different points of view, intended to represent the continuity of the suffering of the Spanish during the Franco regime. The death of Federico Garcia Lorca, Guernica, the defense of Madrid, the International Brigades, are some of the items comprised in this document.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6xFaWlH1zVv6OBURVgJfmpYqBE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116684'),
  ('13045126246468250', 'To Die Like a Man', 2009, 'Drama, Music', 'João Pedro Rodrigues, Paulo Guilherme, Rui Poças', 'Rui Catalão, João Pedro Rodrigues', 'Fernando Santos, Alexander David, Gonçalo Ferreira De Almeida, Chandra Malatitch, Jenni La Rue, Fernando Gomes, Cindy Scrash, Miguel Loureiro', null, 'A transgender woman attempts to rehabilitate her younger, drug-addicted boyfriend while also dealing with her ne’er-do-well son, a soldier who’s gone AWOL.', 'A transgender woman attempts to rehabilitate her younger, drug-addicted boyfriend while also dealing with her ne’er-do-well son, a soldier who’s gone AWOL.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2SdVFz3lamXDQADrdwEBJN7VI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95538'),
  ('32677035072569404', 'To Die of Love', 1971, 'Drama', 'André Cayatte, Alain Bonnot, Maurice Fellous', 'André Cayatte, Albert Naud', 'Annie Girardot, Bruno Pradal, François Simon, Claude Cerval, Jean-Paul Moulinot, Jean Bouise, Marie-Hélène Breillat, Monique Mélinand', null, 'A love story between a teacher, Danièle, 32 years and one of her students Gérard, 17 during the heated atmosphere of May 68. Danièle is a fiery young woman, very involved politically. Gérard''s parents accuse Danièle of statutory rape and complain. Danièle is trapped and the drama begins...', 'A love story between a teacher, Danièle, 32 years and one of her students Gérard, 17 during the heated atmosphere of May 68. Danièle is a fiery young woman, very involved politically. Gérard''s parents accuse Danièle of statutory rape and complain. Danièle is trapped and the drama begins...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJQwew3pSmHIbBHotRjzjpZPC1K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78372'),
  ('366237482349869890', 'To Duck.... Or Not to Duck', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'Daffy challenges duckhunter Elmer to a boxing match, rigged in his favor with the collusion of the duck referee. In the stands, Elmer''s dog Larrimore suspects that something funny is going on, but he''s drowned out by Daffy''s all-duck cheering section.', 'Daffy challenges duckhunter Elmer to a boxing match, rigged in his favor with the collusion of the duck referee. In the stands, Elmer''s dog Larrimore suspects that something funny is going on, but he''s drowned out by Daffy''s all-duck cheering section.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEBx22WBvSy07NRKKW4lzzk2wEH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205638'),
  ('848139004692123024', 'To Each His Own', 1946, 'Drama', 'Mitchell Leisen, Daniel L. Fapp', 'Jacques Théry, Charles Brackett', 'Olivia de Havilland, John Lund, Mary Anderson, Roland Culver, Phillip Terry, Bill Goodwin, Virginia Welles, Victoria Horne', 'NR', 'During World War I, small-town girl Josephine Norris has an illegitimate son by an itinerant pilot. After a scheme to adopt him ends up giving him to another family, she devotes her life to loving him from afar.', 'During World War I, small-town girl Josephine Norris has an illegitimate son by an itinerant pilot. After a scheme to adopt him ends up giving him to another family, she devotes her life to loving him from afar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDk2Y8U2C7KupYv4GKmMfgx0y2s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54568'),
  ('142817016643856373', 'To Each His Own', 2017, 'Drama', 'Izuru Narushima, Junichi Fujisawa, Nariyuki Ueda', 'Kumi Tawada, Izuru Narushima', 'Sota Fukushi, Asuka Kudo, Haru Kuroki, Eiko Koike, Kotaro Yoshida, Yōko Moriguchi, Narushi Ikeda, Yasuo Katoh', null, 'Takashi Aoyama has way too much work to do and pushes himself mentally too hard. He blacks out and collapses at a railroad station. When he is about to be hit by a train, he is saved by Yamamoto. After his encounter with Yamamoto, Takashi recovers his bright personality and gets better results at work. One day, Takashi sees Yamamoto boarding a bus to the cemetery with a serious expression.', 'Takashi Aoyama has way too much work to do and pushes himself mentally too hard. He blacks out and collapses at a railroad station. When he is about to be hit by a train, he is saved by Yamamoto. After his encounter with Yamamoto, Takashi recovers his bright personality and gets better results at work. One day, Takashi sees Yamamoto boarding a bus to the cemetery with a serious expression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpHDTrGsdCR8uB7nhKGtPzf7E3f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474626'),
  ('1016064264996300494', 'To Each His Own Cinema', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Olivier Assayas, Bille August', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen, Zou Jingzhi', 'Golshifteh Farahani, Taraneh Alidoosti, Pegah Ahangarani, Vishka Asayesh, David Cronenberg, Josh Brolin, Giorgi Babluani, Leonid Alexeenko', null, 'Commissioned to mark the 60th anniversary of the Cannes Film Festival, "To Each His Own Cinema" brought together 33 of the world''s pre-eminent filmmakers to produce short pieces exploring the multifarious facets of cinema and their perspective on the state of their chosen artform in the early 21st century.', 'Commissioned to mark the 60th anniversary of the Cannes Film Festival, "To Each His Own Cinema" brought together 33 of the world''s pre-eminent filmmakers to produce short pieces exploring the multifarious facets of cinema and their perspective on the state of their chosen artform in the early 21st century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bTniamnmxv8TY3AUrxddrNy9rV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36108'),
  ('47818106511949433', 'To Each, Her Own', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Myriam Aziza', 'Myriam Aziza, Denyse Rodriguez-Tomé', 'Sarah Stern, Jean-Christophe Folly, Julia Piaton, Richard Berry, Arié Elmaleh, Catherine Jacob, Stéphane Debac, Clémentine Poidatz', null, 'Just as Simone works up the courage to tell her conservative Jewish family she''s a lesbian, she finds herself attracted to a male Senegalese chef.', 'Just as Simone works up the courage to tell her conservative Jewish family she''s a lesbian, she finds herself attracted to a male Senegalese chef.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGqDq2ZWhmm7G6WkP8CR3fwP4dY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531736'),
  ('1085121962425043861', 'To End All War: Oppenheimer & the Atomic Bomb', 2023, 'Documentary, History', 'Christopher Cassel, Tim Metzger, Brandon Ripley', null, 'J. Robert Oppenheimer, Ellen Bradbury Reid, Christopher Nolan, Jon Else, Kai Bird, Bill Nye, Richard Rhodes, Mareena Robinson Snowden', 'R', 'Explore how one man''s relentless drive and invention of the atomic bomb changed the nature of war forever, led to the deaths of hundreds of thousands of people and unleashed mass hysteria.', 'Explore how one man''s relentless drive and invention of the atomic bomb changed the nature of war forever, led to the deaths of hundreds of thousands of people and unleashed mass hysteria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwkYWcs8aypUtk3xDRUh0ndo4GA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1149947'),
  ('1024274809403541782', 'To End All Wars', 2001, 'Drama, War, Action', 'Greg Gardiner, David L. Cunningham', 'Brian Godawa', 'Ciarán McMenamin, Robert Carlyle, Kiefer Sutherland, Mark Strong, Yugo Saso, Sakae Kimura, James Cosmo, Masayuki Yui', 'R', 'Based on a real-life story, this drama focuses on a small group of Allied soldiers in Burma who are held captive by the Japanese. Capt. Ernest Gordon, Lt. Jim Reardon and Maj. Ian Campbell are among the military officers kept imprisoned and routinely beaten and deprived of food. While Campbell wants to rebel and attempt an escape, Gordon tries to take a more stoic approach, an attitude that proves to be surprisingly resonant.', 'Based on a real-life story, this drama focuses on a small group of Allied soldiers in Burma who are held captive by the Japanese. Capt. Ernest Gordon, Lt. Jim Reardon and Maj. Ian Campbell are among the military officers kept imprisoned and routinely beaten and deprived of food. While Campbell wants to rebel and attempt an escape, Gordon tries to take a more stoic approach, an attitude that proves to be surprisingly resonant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fXRE02M2EckpGPZNbuZIo05dmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1783'),
  ('979512207361166162', 'To Every You I''ve Loved Before', 2022, 'Animation, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Jun Matsumoto, Yohei Konishi, Yumiko Oomae', 'Riko Sakaguchi', 'Hio Miyazawa, Ai Hashimoto, Kimiko Yo, Maki Mizuno, Tokuma Nishioka', 'PG-13', 'While struggling to make friends after his parents’ divorce, Koyomi Takasaki meets Kazune Takigawa, but apparently, they already have. Kazune reveals that she’s from World Line 85, an alternate universe in which she and Koyomi are lovers. But in a reality where moving between dimensions is natural, could Koyomi be the one from another world?', 'While struggling to make friends after his parents’ divorce, Koyomi Takasaki meets Kazune Takigawa, but apparently, they already have. Kazune reveals that she’s from World Line 85, an alternate universe in which she and Koyomi are lovers. But in a reality where moving between dimensions is natural, could Koyomi be the one from another world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yl4WOrXTVFihtd6wcxpwkKD7xoP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874743'),
  ('320192711472213321', 'To Fetch a Bike', 1968, null, 'Roy Andersson', 'Roy Andersson', 'Pierre Bené, Monica Löf', null, 'Roy Andersson''s short movies focus on working class and youth daily life, capturing and portraying a small slice of his characters'' day.', 'Roy Andersson''s short movies focus on working class and youth daily life, capturing and portraying a small slice of his characters'' day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6edGXKo71ZJK4bYRbsw2SAwY9GW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113670'),
  ('152308231384634310', 'To Fly!', 1976, 'Documentary', 'Greg MacGillivray, Brad Ohlund, Jim Freeman', 'Robert M. Young, Greg MacGillivray, Arthur Zegart', 'Ellen Bry', null, 'Early IMAX documentary about the development of human flight.', 'Early IMAX documentary about the development of human flight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fA5Vz8oLFGyuMvFy9Tcrzywaw43.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195012'),
  ('610586610486878255', 'To Fool a Thief', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy, Crime', 'Ariel Winograd, Ricardo DeAngelis', 'Adrián Garelik', 'Daniel Hendler, Valeria Bertuccelli, Pablo Rago, Juan Leyrado, Martín Piroyansky, Martín Neglia, Sebastián Mogordoy, Iair Said', null, 'Sebastian meets Natalia when trying to steal an important piece of art from a museum, and she wins the hand. Rivals declared, the two have to work together later in a robbery more complex: a valuable and unique bottle of Malbec from Bordeaux in the mid-nineteenth century, listed as one of the best wines in the world and jealously guarded in the vault of a bank, in Mendoza. In a world full of glamor, between vineyards and mountains, the thieves will have to display their magic, but while preparing discover theft, each to his own, that nothing will be as thought', 'Sebastian meets Natalia when trying to steal an important piece of art from a museum, and she wins the hand. Rivals declared, the two have to work together later in a robbery more complex: a valuable and unique bottle of Malbec from Bordeaux in the mid-nineteenth century, listed as one of the best wines in the world and jealously guarded in the vault of a bank, in Mendoza. In a world full of glamor, between vineyards and mountains, the thieves will have to display their magic, but while preparing discover theft, each to his own, that nothing will be as thought', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyyCmA8sZLgvOZ10QaULxvBbqoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235478'),
  ('99983482162435694', 'To Forget Venice', 1979, 'Drama', 'Franco Brusati, Romano Albani', 'Franco Brusati, Jaja Fiastri', 'Mariangela Melato, Eleonora Giorgi, Erland Josephson, Nerina Montagnani, David Pontremoli, Armando Brancia, Hella Petri, Fred Personne', null, 'Nicky and Anna, brother and sister, reunite in their childhood home in the Venetian countryside. Accompanied by Anna''s lover, Claudia, and Nicky''s partner, Picchio, they plan to spend a Sunday together when fate intervenes.', 'Nicky and Anna, brother and sister, reunite in their childhood home in the Venetian countryside. Accompanied by Anna''s lover, Claudia, and Nicky''s partner, Picchio, they plan to spend a Sunday together when fate intervenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehMoTXCGtdB1qXcwLXl2KQxdsHf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75748'),
  ('304130630594661524', 'To Gather Around', 2024, 'Drama', 'Xunzimo Liu, Qian Tiantian', 'Xunzimo Liu, 里八神, Zhang Benyu', 'Deng Chao, Deng Jiajia, Zheng Yunlong, Yu Entai, Zhang Benyu, Ke Da, Li Naiwen, Yang Haoyu', null, 'The movie tells the story of Bai Sheng (by Deng Chao), a veteran employee of an Internet company who is forced into a workplace fiasco and decides to join forces with others to break the ice in order to defend his rights, only to be caught up in an even bigger whirlpool of mystery.', 'The movie tells the story of Bai Sheng (by Deng Chao), a veteran employee of an Internet company who is forced into a workplace fiasco and decides to join forces with others to break the ice in order to defend his rights, only to be caught up in an even bigger whirlpool of mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCO3v95JTVHyYp8cKRh8VwaQKrT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241475'),
  ('962399455660709714', 'To Gillian on Her 37th Birthday', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Pressman, Tim Suhrstedt', 'David E. Kelley', 'Peter Gallagher, Michelle Pfeiffer, Claire Danes, Freddie Prinze Jr., Seth Green, Laurie Fortier, Wendy Crewson, Bruce Altman', 'PG-13', 'David loves his wife, Gillian. Unfortunately, she died two years ago. David deals with his grief by continuing his romance with Gillian during walks with her "ghost" on the beach at night. While David lives in the past, other family problems crop up in the present in the real world....', 'David loves his wife, Gillian. Unfortunately, she died two years ago. David deals with his grief by continuing his romance with Gillian during walks with her "ghost" on the beach at night. While David lives in the past, other family problems crop up in the present in the real world....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HGWS6WlsPzBsB7NG5JM4P8NrIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30500'),
  ('494810952611437415', 'To Grandmother''s House We Go', 1992, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Jeff Franklin, Richard Leiterman', 'Jeff Franklin, Boyd Hale', 'Ashley Olsen, Mary-Kate Olsen, Rhea Perlman, Cynthia Geary, J. Eddie Peck, Stuart Margolin, Jerry Van Dyke, Rick Poltaruk', 'G', 'When precocious twins Sarah and Julie feel like Mom is tired of them, they take off on an exciting adventure to their grandmother''s house and encounter a pair of villains along the way.', 'When precocious twins Sarah and Julie feel like Mom is tired of them, they take off on an exciting adventure to their grandmother''s house and encounter a pair of villains along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muzQuNYEQfZEPIN7G5shtKKT3fP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50327'),
