  ('109761725566221396', 'To Have (Or Not)', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Caroline Champetier, Laetitia Masson', 'Laetitia Masson', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Arnaud Giovaninetti, Roschdy Zem, Jean-Michel Fête, Daniel Kiberlain, Claire Denis, Lise Lamétrie, Laetitia Palermo', null, 'Alice, fired from her job on an assembly line, leaves her boyfriend and provincial home for an uncertain new life in Lyon. There she encounters Bruno, a construction worker who''s just been dumped and is severely depressed. Romantic possibilities ensue.', 'Alice, fired from her job on an assembly line, leaves her boyfriend and provincial home for an uncertain new life in Lyon. There she encounters Bruno, a construction worker who''s just been dumped and is severely depressed. Romantic possibilities ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/151eeCpFbj1X2x5SVy6cRHWwwAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124642'),
  ('323165714627299698', 'To Have and Have Not', 1945, 'Adventure, Romance, War', 'Howard Hawks, Sidney Hickox, Don Siegel', 'Jules Furthman, William Faulkner, Whitman Chambers', 'Humphrey Bogart, Walter Brennan, Lauren Bacall, Dolores Moran, Hoagy Carmichael, Sheldon Leonard, Walter Szurovy, Marcel Dalio', 'NR', 'A Martinique charter boat skipper gets mixed up with the underground French resistance operatives during WWII.', 'A Martinique charter boat skipper gets mixed up with the underground French resistance operatives during WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9RYIio23yClaO3fy5tcpYac1Gf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22584'),
  ('262377332866050571', 'To Heaven', 2012, 'Drama', 'Diego Prado', 'María Eugenia Cortajerena', 'Enrique Lunazzi, Ana Angelillo, Mauro Haramboure, Lucas Serra', null, 'Shy teenager Andrés lives in the Argentine city of La Plata and cycles between school, work and home listening to punk rock. One night he finds out that his idol, the lead singer of his favorite band, has committed suicide. His religious mother is worried about him and takes him to the local evangelic church, where he, without putting up much resistance, joins a youth group. Here he meets Alex, the cool guitarist of a band practicing upstairs, and is instantly drawn to him.', 'Shy teenager Andrés lives in the Argentine city of La Plata and cycles between school, work and home listening to punk rock. One night he finds out that his idol, the lead singer of his favorite band, has committed suicide. His religious mother is worried about him and takes him to the local evangelic church, where he, without putting up much resistance, joins a youth group. Here he meets Alex, the cool guitarist of a band practicing upstairs, and is instantly drawn to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJki3rjYe9dzouFw8CA3L01LWyh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206906'),
  ('794203626071958714', 'To Hell and Back', 1955, 'Action, Romance, Drama, History, War', 'Jesse Hibbs, Maury Gertsman', 'Gil Doud', 'Audie Murphy, Marshall Thompson, Charles Drake, Gregg Palmer, David Janssen, Denver Pyle, Jack Kelly, Paul Picerni', null, 'The true WWII story of Audie Murphy, the most decorated soldier in U.S. history. Based on the autobiography of Audie Murphy who stars as himself in the film.', 'The true WWII story of Audie Murphy, the most decorated soldier in U.S. history. Based on the autobiography of Audie Murphy who stars as himself in the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzeK4UwVVzzg5zUmYlfXdGXDOG5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16514'),
  ('743728088809151457', 'To Hell With The Ugly', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Nacho G. Velilla, Pepe Ripoll, David Omedes', 'Oriol Capel, David S. Olivas, Antonio Sánchez', 'Javier Cámara, Carmen Machi, Juan Diego, Tristán Ulloa, Lluís Xavier Villanueva, Hugo Silva, Ingrid Rubio, María Pujalte', null, 'Eliseo is ugly, lame and single. He hasn''t met the woman of his life and has never known love. Nati is ugly, missing a breast and separated. She found the man of her life but, even so, has never experienced true love. Eliseo thinks that the worst of his life is still to come. Nati thinks that the best of her life is still to come. The death of Eliseo''s mother reunites them twenty years on in a last chance to find happiness and love. But what happens when the woman of your life is married to your brother', 'Eliseo is ugly, lame and single. He hasn''t met the woman of his life and has never known love. Nati is ugly, missing a breast and separated. She found the man of her life but, even so, has never experienced true love. Eliseo thinks that the worst of his life is still to come. Nati thinks that the best of her life is still to come. The death of Eliseo''s mother reunites them twenty years on in a last chance to find happiness and love. But what happens when the woman of your life is married to your brother', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyPhqYYnmCkd56LKOG99r1TMbqT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45332'),
  ('46552067333754070', 'To Her', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yang Ho-yeol', null, 'Yoo Ji-won, Ahn So-hee, Kim Jong-sin', null, 'Gwang-ho is bored except for the time he''s taking off his girlfriend''s underwear. He visits his Seoul home at the news that his grandfather is dying. Amidst the awkwardness, he remembers something. Ji-yoon is his cousin who has grown up to be a young lady. Gwang-ho is attracted to the fully grown woman and the same is said for Ji-yoon.', 'Gwang-ho is bored except for the time he''s taking off his girlfriend''s underwear. He visits his Seoul home at the news that his grandfather is dying. Amidst the awkwardness, he remembers something. Ji-yoon is his cousin who has grown up to be a young lady. Gwang-ho is attracted to the fully grown woman and the same is said for Ji-yoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CHTQ06CDJTyvmx6HAyCs9uBY2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474412'),
  ('620691507612629515', 'To Joy', 1950, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Gunnar Fischer, Ingmar Bergman, Eskil Eckert-Lundin', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Maj-Britt Nilsson, Stig Olin, Birger Malmsten, John Ekman, Margit Carlqvist, Victor Sjöström, Sif Ruud, Erland Josephson', null, 'A young orchestra violinist’s fear of mediocrity and drive for artistic success strain his marriage to a fellow musician. Told largely in flashback and shaped by Beethoven’s Ninth Symphony, the film examines ambition, love, and loss in early Ingmar Bergman.', 'A young orchestra violinist’s fear of mediocrity and drive for artistic success strain his marriage to a fellow musician. Told largely in flashback and shaped by Beethoven’s Ninth Symphony, the film examines ambition, love, and loss in early Ingmar Bergman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xvao8GSizgjaMfGijuaWcgjuAs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39284'),
  ('626496307918639528', 'To Kill a Child', 1953, 'Drama', 'Gösta Werner, Sten Dahlgren', 'Gösta Werner', 'Gunnar Sjöberg, Karl-Erik Forsgårdh, Marie-Anne Condé, Georg Årlin, Sissi Kaiser, Kerstin Thörn, Sten Larsson', null, 'In a Swedish village, situated in a rural idyll, a father, mother and little daughter are preparing breakfast on a Sunday morning. The family is looking forward to the boat trip that is to follow. The little girl''s thoughts are already completely on the water. But there is no sugar in the house, so the mother sends her little daughter to the neighbor across the street to quickly get some. Two villages further on, a young man is filling up his car with gas so that he can drive to the Baltic Sea with his girlfriend. In their convertible, the young people feel blithe and free on the country road and race towards the village where the little girl is just crossing the street with the sugar to return home.', 'In a Swedish village, situated in a rural idyll, a father, mother and little daughter are preparing breakfast on a Sunday morning. The family is looking forward to the boat trip that is to follow. The little girl''s thoughts are already completely on the water. But there is no sugar in the house, so the mother sends her little daughter to the neighbor across the street to quickly get some. Two villages further on, a young man is filling up his car with gas so that he can drive to the Baltic Sea with his girlfriend. In their convertible, the young people feel blithe and free on the country road and race towards the village where the little girl is just crossing the street with the sugar to return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3TJR1MultxpmSYLvGy4uDrgvb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550293'),
  ('121539195442288377', 'To Kill a Dragon', 1988, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Mark Zakharov, Vladimir Nakhabtsev, Evgeniy Fyodorov', 'Grigori Gorin, Mark Zakharov', 'Aleksandr Abdulov, Oleg Yankovskiy, Evgeni Leonov, Vyacheslav Tikhonov, Aleksandra Zakharova, Viktor Rakov, Aleksandr Zbruev, Olga Soshnikova', null, 'Dragon is a bloody dictator, who kills every opponent. People live hopelessly, until Lancelot comes to save the beautiful Elsa. Lancelot can only win, if all people become free from fear, that is feeding the Dragon''s power. Dragon''s multiple personalities, ranging from a "dragon" to a "samurai" to a "Nazi", scare the hell out of all people, except Lancelot. Finally Dragon drops all his masks, to become the most dangerous of his incarnations - "himself". And the battle begins', 'Dragon is a bloody dictator, who kills every opponent. People live hopelessly, until Lancelot comes to save the beautiful Elsa. Lancelot can only win, if all people become free from fear, that is feeding the Dragon''s power. Dragon''s multiple personalities, ranging from a "dragon" to a "samurai" to a "Nazi", scare the hell out of all people, except Lancelot. Finally Dragon drops all his masks, to become the most dangerous of his incarnations - "himself". And the battle begins', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wcSIyPe3MmFKL0JwOfmg505BF1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27942'),
  ('1057401838885943865', 'To Kill a King', 2003, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'Eigil Bryld, Chris Lowe, Richard Styles', 'Jenny Mayhew', 'Tim Roth, Dougray Scott, Olivia Williams, James Bolam, Corin Redgrave, Finbar Lynch, Julian Rhind-Tutt, Adrian Scarborough', null, 'A recounting of the relationship between General Fairfax and Oliver Cromwell, as they try to cope with the consequences of deposing King Charles I.', 'A recounting of the relationship between General Fairfax and Oliver Cromwell, as they try to cope with the consequences of deposing King Charles I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yr9xYacCLzrQ57M3nTuce9tU8Jy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18359'),
  ('872956210623173008', 'To Kill a Man', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Eduardo Villalobos, Alejandro Fernández Almendras, Inti Briones', 'Alejandro Fernández Almendras', 'Daniel Antivilo, Daniel Candia, Ariel Mateluna, Alejandra Yañez, Jennifer Salas, Don Willie, Paula Leoncini, Eduardo Villalobos', null, 'Jorge is a peaceful hard-working man who seeks a simple, quiet life for himself and his family. One day, he is mugged and humiliated by a gang of thugs led by Kalule, a delinquent from his neighborhood. This event infuriates his son as much for Jorge’s meek acceptance as for the act itself. The son, looking for retribution, ends up getting himself shot. Kalule is sent to jail and when he gets out 18 months later, begins a campaign of terror against Jorge and his family. The authorities do nothing, so Jorge decides to take matters into his own hands.', 'Jorge is a peaceful hard-working man who seeks a simple, quiet life for himself and his family. One day, he is mugged and humiliated by a gang of thugs led by Kalule, a delinquent from his neighborhood. This event infuriates his son as much for Jorge’s meek acceptance as for the act itself. The son, looking for retribution, ends up getting himself shot. Kalule is sent to jail and when he gets out 18 months later, begins a campaign of terror against Jorge and his family. The authorities do nothing, so Jorge decides to take matters into his own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbXsjomsAYm15bQkBO6apKwMjNq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250374'),
  ('1033569338186055365', 'To Kill a Mockingbird', 1962, 'Drama', 'Robert Mulligan, Russell Harlan, Joseph E. Kenney', 'Horton Foote', 'Gregory Peck, Mary Badham, Phillip Alford, John Megna, Frank Overton, Brock Peters, Rosemary Murphy, Ruth White', 'NR', 'Scout Finch, 6, and her older brother Jem live in sleepy Maycomb, Alabama, spending much of their time with their friend Dill and spying on their reclusive and mysterious neighbor, Boo Radley. When Atticus, their widowed father and a respected lawyer, defends a black man named Tom Robinson against fabricated rape charges, the trial and tangent events expose the children to evils of racism and stereotyping.', 'Scout Finch, 6, and her older brother Jem live in sleepy Maycomb, Alabama, spending much of their time with their friend Dill and spying on their reclusive and mysterious neighbor, Boo Radley. When Atticus, their widowed father and a respected lawyer, defends a black man named Tom Robinson against fabricated rape charges, the trial and tangent events expose the children to evils of racism and stereotyping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZycFUMLx2110dzK3nBNai7gfpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595'),
  ('240442555705554007', 'To Kill a Priest', 1988, 'Drama, Thriller, History', 'Agnieszka Holland, Adam Holender, Mishka Cheyko', 'Jean-Yves Pitoun', 'Christopher Lambert, Ed Harris, Joss Ackland, Tim Roth, Timothy Spall, Pete Postlethwaite, Cherie Lunghi, Joanne Whalley', null, 'A young priest speaks out against the Communist regime in Poland and is killed for it.', 'A young priest speaks out against the Communist regime in Poland and is killed for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogfmZi2EtQUTTdc85g7N86HkK8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47493'),
  ('906293900241188588', 'To Kill a Stranger', 1986, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Álex Phillips Jr., Juan López Moctezuma', 'Emerich Oross, Rafael Buñuel, Michael Elliot', 'Angélica María, Dean Stockwell, Donald Pleasence, Aldo Ray, Juan López Moctezuma, Sergio Aragonés, Ken Grant, Jill Franklyn', null, 'Cristina Carver (Angelica Maria) finds herself in dire straits after she arrives to spend some time with her TV-reporter husband (Dean Stockwell) who is visiting a Latin American country run by a military dictator. After a car accident one day, Cristina brings the helpful Col. Kostik (Donald Pleasence) home and then kills him in self-defense when he violently attempts to rape and murder her. Terrified, she covers up her act and hides the body, yet in spite of her husband''s efforts to protect her, a local police detective starts to figure out what really happened.', 'Cristina Carver (Angelica Maria) finds herself in dire straits after she arrives to spend some time with her TV-reporter husband (Dean Stockwell) who is visiting a Latin American country run by a military dictator. After a car accident one day, Cristina brings the helpful Col. Kostik (Donald Pleasence) home and then kills him in self-defense when he violently attempts to rape and murder her. Terrified, she covers up her act and hides the body, yet in spite of her husband''s efforts to protect her, a local police detective starts to figure out what really happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trEA2NJdSinEudMgSKUhjbAEN9v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198240'),
  ('404040925493782164', 'To Kill a Tiger', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Nisha Pahuja, Mrinal Desai', 'Nisha Pahuja', null, 'NR', 'Ranjit, a farmer in India, takes on the fight of his life when he demands justice for his 13-year-old daughter, the victim of a brutal gang rape. His decision to support his daughter is virtually unheard of, and his journey unprecedented.', 'Ranjit, a farmer in India, takes on the fight of his life when he demands justice for his 13-year-old daughter, the victim of a brutal gang rape. His decision to support his daughter is virtually unheard of, and his journey unprecedented.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxzaYYRAH6gZoyJlnajCvYeL6Ms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1015356'),
  ('967578926182236404', 'To Kill For', 1992, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'John Dirlam, John Dirlam', 'George Putnam', 'Laura Johnson, Ashlyn Gere, Michael Madsen, Antony Hamilton, Tommy Redmond Hicks, Richard Foronjy, Jan Marlyn Reesman, Rob Steinberg', 'R', 'A homicide detective (Michael Madsen) falls for a resort owner (Laura Johnson) suspected of slaying a playboy developer.', 'A homicide detective (Michael Madsen) falls for a resort owner (Laura Johnson) suspected of slaying a playboy developer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82HA5CmfmJLaBry4DpT5D4UiFNR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91534'),
  ('679371003581623977', 'To Kill the Beast', 2021, 'Mystery, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Agustina San Martín, Constanza Sandoval', 'Agustina San Martín', 'Tamara Rocca, Ana Brun, Julieth Micolta, João Miguel, Sabrina Grinchspun, Kaique de Jesus, Carlos Griebler, Melanie Gamonal', null, 'Emilia arrives at her Aunt Ines’ hostel at the Argentina-Brazil border looking for her long lost brother. In this luxuriant jungle, a dangerous beast believed to be the spirit of an evil man taking the form of different animals seems to be roaming around. On a journey to sexual awakening, Emilia will have to confront her past in order to kill the beast.', 'Emilia arrives at her Aunt Ines’ hostel at the Argentina-Brazil border looking for her long lost brother. In this luxuriant jungle, a dangerous beast believed to be the spirit of an evil man taking the form of different animals seems to be roaming around. On a journey to sexual awakening, Emilia will have to confront her past in order to kill the beast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAdkgE8lHelIQWpgrHk4wjEnbxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:856245'),
  ('210408147289528003', 'To Kill The Dragon', 2019, 'Horror', 'Georgina Pretto, Jimena Monteoliva', 'Diego Fleischer', 'Justina Bustos, Guillermo Pfening, Luis Machín, Cecilia Cartasegna, Querelle Delage, Valentina Goldzen, Maitena Dionisi', null, 'The nightmarish tale of two siblings cruelly separated as kids. The youngest, Elena, is confined to the world of darkness, where she leads a miserable life. The eldest, Facundo, remains in paradise, where he lives a peaceful life as a doctor with his wife and two daughters. 25 years later, the two are reunited to face the family tragedy that separated them.', 'The nightmarish tale of two siblings cruelly separated as kids. The youngest, Elena, is confined to the world of darkness, where she leads a miserable life. The eldest, Facundo, remains in paradise, where he lives a peaceful life as a doctor with his wife and two daughters. 25 years later, the two are reunited to face the family tragedy that separated them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loIRe96n7jq9cvjxBOFahDghuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649099'),
  ('533727003110631457', 'To Kill the Mother', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ricardo de Gracia, Omar Ayuso', 'Omar Ayuso', 'La Bien Querida, Iván Pellicer, Julia de Castro, Greta Fernández, Mariona Terés, Jorge Clemente', null, 'In Madrid, Spain, during a rainy day, Dorita, an elegant and magnetic mature woman, meets Noa, an attractive young man.', 'In Madrid, Spain, during a rainy day, Dorita, an elegant and magnetic mature woman, meets Noa, an attractive young man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2PdNP7pC8JdXw49f9QfCYo5SIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999457'),
  ('9763977069610241', 'To Kill with Intrigue', 1977, 'Action, Drama', 'Chan Chung-Yuen, Lo Wei, Chu Hsueh-Liang', 'Gu Long', 'Jackie Chan, Hsu Feng, Shin Il-ryong, Yu Ling-Lung, George Wang, Tung Lin, Ma Chi, Chiang Ching-Hsia', 'PG-13', 'Young master Cao Le chases his pregnant girlfriend away from the family castle. He does it in order to save her from vicious bandits who are going to murder his family.', 'Young master Cao Le chases his pregnant girlfriend away from the family castle. He does it in order to save her from vicious bandits who are going to murder his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4tHrGkapp4LIN5kyj8IvjoYaUf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18758'),
  ('613110974353794717', 'To Leslie', 2022, 'Drama', 'Michael Morris, Larkin Seiple, Haze J.F. Bergeron III', 'Ryan Binaco', 'Andrea Riseborough, Marc Maron, Andre Royo, Owen Teague, Allison Janney, Stephen Root, James Landry Hébert, Matt Lauria', 'R', 'A West Texas single mother wins the lottery and squanders it just as fast, leaving behind a world of heartbreak. Years later, with her charm running out and nowhere to go, she fights to rebuild her life and find redemption.', 'A West Texas single mother wins the lottery and squanders it just as fast, leaving behind a world of heartbreak. Years later, with her charm running out and nowhere to go, she fights to rebuild her life and find redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFTgfsw4cnNjIZZ2r6P363X2Uk3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823147'),
  ('661945284083536446', 'To Let', 2006, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Jaume Balagueró, Goretti Pagès, Pepo Alba', 'Alberto Marini, Jaume Balagueró', 'Macarena Gómez, Adrià Collado, Nuria González, Ruth Díaz, Roberto Romero, David Sandanya', null, 'Mario and Clara, his pregnant girlfriend, try to find a new apartment to settle in as soon as possible, so they go to visit one in a distant neighborhood that seems abandoned. Once there, things are not as they expected.', 'Mario and Clara, his pregnant girlfriend, try to find a new apartment to settle in as soon as possible, so they go to visit one in a distant neighborhood that seems abandoned. Once there, things are not as they expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WyHj8gB12x5pUEG62uPAm74vge.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17214'),
  ('1085156527575967875', 'To Life', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-Jacques Zilbermann, Rémy Chevrin', 'Jean-Jacques Zilbermann, Danièle D''Antoni', 'Julie Depardieu, Suzanne Clément, Hippolyte Girardot, Johanna ter Steege, Béatrice Michel, Mathias Mlekuz, Benjamin Wangermée, Anne-Marie Pisani', null, 'Helen, Rose and Lili have survived the Holocaust and have never seen each other since the war has ended. In 1960, they meet again in Berck, France. They learn to enjoy together simple pleasures in life: nice meals, ballads on the beach, playing in the waves.', 'Helen, Rose and Lili have survived the Holocaust and have never seen each other since the war has ended. In 1960, they meet again in Berck, France. They learn to enjoy together simple pleasures in life: nice meals, ballads on the beach, playing in the waves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qrzWfRk9MV6HP0oleNSQNaE0IW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302634'),
  ('206720077934970586', 'To Live', 1994, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Zhang Yimou, Lü Yue, Quanbao Zheng', 'Lu Wei, Yu Hua', 'Ge You, Gong Li, Niu Ben, Guo Tao, Jiang Wu, Ni Dahong, Liu Tianchi, Zhang Lu', null, 'Married couple Fugui and Jiazhen endure tumultuous events in mid-20th century mainland China as their personal fortunes move from wealthy landownership to peasantry.', 'Married couple Fugui and Jiazhen endure tumultuous events in mid-20th century mainland China as their personal fortunes move from wealthy landownership to peasantry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bv0qREWTw8TPAtgt22ELp1UlKVl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31439'),
  ('402723512116161049', 'To Live', 2010, 'Action, Drama, Mystery', 'Yury Bykov, Kristina Uchuvatkina, Konstantin Sukharkov', 'Yury Bykov', 'Sergei Belyayev, Denis Shvedov, Sergey Sosnovsky, Konstantin Strelnikov, Vladislav Toldykov, Sergey Zharkov, Aleksey Komashko', null, 'Early autumn, godforsaken Russian countryside. A local hunter Michail witnesses a skirmish in the middle of the forest - three men want to kill the forth, Andrey. Kind-hearted Michail helps Andrey escape and together they run from the villains who chase them. Thus, two totally different men start a long and dangerous journey together, constantly arguing with each other regarding their ideology, morals and opinions about life. But life will put everything on its place and make the men understand who they really are.', 'Early autumn, godforsaken Russian countryside. A local hunter Michail witnesses a skirmish in the middle of the forest - three men want to kill the forth, Andrey. Kind-hearted Michail helps Andrey escape and together they run from the villains who chase them. Thus, two totally different men start a long and dangerous journey together, constantly arguing with each other regarding their ideology, morals and opinions about life. But life will put everything on its place and make the men understand who they really are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCcyRdv7QXOAyaV3ZsGq8di6xjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59426'),
  ('205364149255712310', 'To Live and Die in L.A.', 1985, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'William Friedkin, Robby Müller, Robert D. Yeoman', 'Gerald Petievich, William Friedkin', 'William Petersen, Willem Dafoe, John Pankow, Debra Feuer, John Turturro, Dean Stockwell, Darlanne Fluegel, Michael Greene', 'R', 'When his longtime partner on the force is killed, reckless U.S. Secret Service agent Richard Chance vows revenge, setting out to nab dangerous counterfeit artist Eric Masters.', 'When his longtime partner on the force is killed, reckless U.S. Secret Service agent Richard Chance vows revenge, setting out to nab dangerous counterfeit artist Eric Masters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iW3pSihBIhXjnBQmUJ0mAiZbB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9846'),
  ('1045527742004049424', 'To Live in Peace', 1947, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Luigi Zampa, Francesco De Feo, Antonio Altoviti', 'Aldo Fabrizi, Luigi Zampa, Suso Cecchi d''Amico', 'Aldo Fabrizi, Gar Moore, Mirella Monti, John Kitzmiller, Heinrich Bode, Ave Ninchi, Ernesto Almirante, Nando Bruno', null, 'An American prisoner, hidden by some Umbrian farmers, meets, drunk, with a German soldier who is also drunk. The two believe that the war is over and embrace each other emotionally. But it is not so and soon the cannon will thunder. Uncle Tigna, who was hiding the prisoner and two of his companions, will fall victim to the Nazis.', 'An American prisoner, hidden by some Umbrian farmers, meets, drunk, with a German soldier who is also drunk. The two believe that the war is over and embrace each other emotionally. But it is not so and soon the cannon will thunder. Uncle Tigna, who was hiding the prisoner and two of his companions, will fall victim to the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UFla7ld3xutuV0SHpEyneyQhw1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120488'),
  ('729464851364449930', 'To Live Through Death', 2024, 'Action, Crime', 'Ren Gaoliang, Chris Lee Chi-Wa', 'Ren Gaoliang', 'Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Andy On Chi-Kit, Zhao Ziqi, Eleanor Lee, Yu Kang, Jackson Liu, Zhang Di, Bingo Zhou', null, 'On a certain island in the Pacific, an invincible human-smuggling organization kidnaps and defrauds Chinese people. In order to rescue his kidnapped adopted daughter, the usually taciturn Chen does not hesitate to reveal the secret past he has concealed for twenty years, and joins hands with the local young policeman Can to fight against a huge criminal organization, engaging in a life-or-death battle with evil forces.', 'On a certain island in the Pacific, an invincible human-smuggling organization kidnaps and defrauds Chinese people. In order to rescue his kidnapped adopted daughter, the usually taciturn Chen does not hesitate to reveal the secret past he has concealed for twenty years, and joins hands with the local young policeman Can to fight against a huge criminal organization, engaging in a life-or-death battle with evil forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXw9aAAlMdAIwJKZsxFeFTPJUQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1322813'),
  ('221799063511236058', 'To Live, To Die, To Live Again', 2024, 'Drama', 'Karen Hottois, Gaël Morel, Julie Pintos', 'Gaël Morel, Gilles Taurand', 'Victor Belmondo, Lou Lampros, Théo Christine, Elli Medeiros, Sophie Guillemin, Stéphane Rideau, Amanda Lear, Noah Deric', null, 'Emma loves Sammy, who loves Cyril, who loves her back. What could have been a love story at the end of the last century is blown apart by the arrival of AIDS. Expecting the worst, each character''s destiny takes an unexpected turn.', 'Emma loves Sammy, who loves Cyril, who loves her back. What could have been a love story at the end of the last century is blown apart by the arrival of AIDS. Expecting the worst, each character''s destiny takes an unexpected turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7y7YfbpxavSePdSvsn8sr77B4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1190698'),
  ('855146880127242789', 'To Love', 1968, 'Drama, Romance, Documentary', 'Mikhail Kalik, Inna Tumanyan, Dmitri Motornyy', 'Mikhail Kalik', 'Sergei Gurzo Ml., Lev Kruglyy, Antonina Leftiy, Svetlana Svetlichnaya, Alisa Freyndlikh, Ion-Gheorghe Şviţchi, Aleksey Eybozhenko, Marianna Vertinskaya', null, 'Four love stories connected by newsreels of the late 60s. Each short story begins with an epigraph taken from the Song of Songs of the Old Testament. The stories are interconnected by documentary shots and numerous interviews taken on the streets from passers-by who are asked the same question: “what does it mean to love?”.', 'Four love stories connected by newsreels of the late 60s. Each short story begins with an epigraph taken from the Song of Songs of the Old Testament. The stories are interconnected by documentary shots and numerous interviews taken on the streets from passers-by who are asked the same question: “what does it mean to love?”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgde4ewhFvunBIT3yvsHDICkON2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160986'),
  ('946631851018556845', 'To Love Ophelia', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Flavio Mogherini, Manuel Merino, Carlo Carlini', 'Laure Bonin, Flavio Mogherini, Giorgio Salvioni', 'Françoise Fabian, Renato Pozzetto, Giovanna Ralli, Maurizio Arena, Didi Perego, Alberto de Mendoza, Orchidea De Santis, George Rigaud', null, 'Although he is in his thirties, Orlando still feels like a child. He is terrified of the outside world and is stuck in an obsessive relationship with his mother.', 'Although he is in his thirties, Orlando still feels like a child. He is terrified of the outside world and is stuck in an obsessive relationship with his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mg8HdwVp3jVQC0I4o1FMnCPj41W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44719'),
  ('360362819463425414', 'To Make It Back Home', 2026, 'Drama', 'Gazapizm, Ahmet Açıkkol, Volkan Simsek, Gizem Kovankaya', 'Gazapizm', 'Havva Acar, Fatma Acar, Ebru Şam, Erdi Kaçar, Serdar Yavaş', null, 'The film questions the loneliness of the modern urban individual and asks, in a plain yet unflinching voice, "where one can truly return."', 'The film questions the loneliness of the modern urban individual and asks, in a plain yet unflinching voice, "where one can truly return."', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F5JQcd4qoYjoVX1u92l81fHyoVj1.jpg', 'plex:movie:donmek-icin-eve'),
  ('751901822510903861', 'To Mathieu', 2001, 'Drama', 'Xavier Beauvois, Caroline Champetier, Franck Glemin', 'Cédric Anger, Catherine Breillat, Xavier Beauvois', 'Nathalie Baye, Benoît Magimel, Antoine Chappey, Jean-Marie Winling, Fred Ulysse, Françoise Bette, Mélanie Leray, Virginie Dessèvre', null, 'Matthieu and Eric are two brothers who work at the same factory as their father in Normandy. When his father is dismissed for smoking on the factory floor, Matthieu is incensed and tries to have him reinstated, in vain. His brother has just got married and, with a child and mortgage on the way, is reluctant to stir up trouble...', 'Matthieu and Eric are two brothers who work at the same factory as their father in Normandy. When his father is dismissed for smoking on the factory floor, Matthieu is incensed and tries to have him reinstated, in vain. His brother has just got married and, with a child and mortgage on the way, is reluctant to stir up trouble...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRByWOHJIOMoWAV7Ek3y7wPthWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57728'),
  ('377058428556245542', 'To Me, the One Who Loved You', 2022, 'Animation, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Kenichi Kasai, Tomohiko Kan, Yusaku Murakami', 'Riko Sakaguchi', 'Hio Miyazawa, Aju Makita, Ai Hashimoto, Kimiko Yo, Maki Mizuno, Tokuma Nishioka', 'PG-13', 'Koyomi Hidaka and Shiori Sato meet at his father’s research center and begin to fall in love, but so do their parents, who eventually marry. To avoid becoming stepsiblings, they decide to run away to a parallel universe. Traveling between dimensions is common in their world, but not without repercussions. Does a universe exist for the young couple, and what will it cost them to find it?', 'Koyomi Hidaka and Shiori Sato meet at his father’s research center and begin to fall in love, but so do their parents, who eventually marry. To avoid becoming stepsiblings, they decide to run away to a parallel universe. Traveling between dimensions is common in their world, but not without repercussions. Does a universe exist for the young couple, and what will it cost them to find it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gt7kD8MjObtgQYH130pZiLTN0qx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874745'),
  ('926285040196415597', 'To My Beloved', 2016, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Aly Muritiba, Pablo Baião, Eugenia Castello', 'Marisa Merlo, Aly Muritiba', 'Fernando Alves Pinto, Mayana Neiva, Michelle Pucci, Lourinelson Vladmir, Giuly Biancato, Vinicius Torres de Moraes Sabbag, Lindsay Vieira, Cecilia Kemper', null, 'After his wife''s death, Fernando becomes a quiet and introspective man who raises his son, Daniel by himself. Every night, while the boy is sleeping, Fernando "revives" his wife by touching her clothes and organizing her personal belongings. Paulo does not get along well with his mother-in-law, who judges him unprepared to raise the boy without help. Lonely, Paulo has to resist the advances of his recently divorced sister-in-law.', 'After his wife''s death, Fernando becomes a quiet and introspective man who raises his son, Daniel by himself. Every night, while the boy is sleeping, Fernando "revives" his wife by touching her clothes and organizing her personal belongings. Paulo does not get along well with his mother-in-law, who judges him unprepared to raise the boy without help. Lonely, Paulo has to resist the advances of his recently divorced sister-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kM6TdXZ6Ll9OTeZ1xyzpMRfWsQk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352002'),
  ('705133124744796442', 'To My Dear Mother on Her Birthday', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Luciano Salce, Giorgio Gentili, Erico Menczer', 'Sergio Corbucci, Massimo Franciosa, Luciano Salce', 'Paolo Villaggio, Lila Kedrova, Eleonora Giorgi, Antonino Faà di Bruno, Renato Chiantoni, Orchidea De Santis, Guido Cerniglia, Carmine Ferrara', null, 'Count Fernando, called Didino, a shy and sexually repressed man, lives under the oedipal authority of countess Mafalda, his bloodsucking and over-controlling mother, until their family hires a new young maid that changes his life.', 'Count Fernando, called Didino, a shy and sexually repressed man, lives under the oedipal authority of countess Mafalda, his bloodsucking and over-controlling mother, until their family hires a new young maid that changes his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ra3sAROOb0vJsS6rQvFP12g9dc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156140'),
  ('973572027656297120', 'To New Shores', 1937, 'Drama', 'Douglas Sirk, Franz Weihmayr, Fritz Andelfinger', 'Kurt Heuser, Douglas Sirk', 'Zarah Leander, Willy Birgel, Edwin Jürgensen, Carola Höhn, Viktor Staal, Erich Ziegel, Hilde von Stolz, Jakob Tiedtke', null, 'A 19th-century London cabaret singer is deported to prison in Australia. Her crime? Taking the blame when her lover bounces checks.', 'A 19th-century London cabaret singer is deported to prison in Australia. Her crime? Taking the blame when her lover bounces checks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBaM6Qw3HOCH8tiua4BgQ2p1KkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96717'),
  ('752039719912439258', 'To Olivia', 2021, 'Drama', 'Graham Frake, John Hay', 'John Hay, David Logan', 'Hugh Bonneville, Keeley Hawes, Sam Heughan, Michael Jibson, Sam Phillips, Bobby O''Neill, Darcey Ewart, Geoffrey Palmer', null, 'In 1962, Patricia Neal and Roald Dahl retreat to the English countryside to bring up their young family. The seemingly unlikely pair find their relationship put to the test by a tragic loss.', 'In 1962, Patricia Neal and Roald Dahl retreat to the English countryside to bring up their young family. The seemingly unlikely pair find their relationship put to the test by a tragic loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldrwhZLKac9z6jhD5M80mUH9rcU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656584'),
  ('549001499176166776', 'To Paint or Make Love', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Arnaud Larrieu, Jean-Marie Larrieu, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Arnaud Larrieu, Jean-Marie Larrieu', 'Sabine Azéma, Daniel Auteuil, Amira Casar, Philippe Katerine, Sergi López, Hélène de Saint-Père, Sabine Haudepin, Jacques Nolot', null, 'An affluent, middle-aged couple''s uneventful lives are forever changed when they move into an isolated house in the country and befriend an odd, younger couple.', 'An affluent, middle-aged couple''s uneventful lives are forever changed when they move into an isolated house in the country and befriend an odd, younger couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upLGMmutOGS5FMKinRFxniaegjr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15702'),
  ('722133178508489521', 'To Parsifal', 1963, null, 'Bruce Baillie', null, null, 'NR', 'The 16-minute film falls neatly into two nearly equal parts, separated by fades to and from black. Part one depicts a sunrise, a journey out to sea in a boat, then gulls flying around the boat while fish are cleaned, and finally the journey back and the reappearance of land.', 'The 16-minute film falls neatly into two nearly equal parts, separated by fades to and from black. Part one depicts a sunrise, a journey out to sea in a boat, then gulls flying around the boat while fish are cleaned, and finally the journey back and the reappearance of land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nU9wlKVWOaaZXK7IaO16dsXRoqN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269993'),
  ('982888654315577170', 'To Play or to Die', 1990, 'Drama', 'Frank Krom', 'Anna Blaman, Frank Krom', 'Geert Hunaerts, Tjebbo Gerritsma, Simon Gribling, Joost Hienen, Cock van der Lee, Diane Lensink, Titus Muizelaar, Mike Starink', 'NR', 'In this short motion picture, schoolboy Kees is intelligent, introvert and sensitive, but gets ridiculed verbally and physically at an all-boys school by mindlessly cocky class mates and even insensitive teachers, especially in gym, where his physical weakness is mercilessly abused to make him a defenceless laughing stock in front of his smirking peers. His awakening sexual interest goes to boys, and in particular to Charel, a beautiful athletic classmate who probably feels an undetermined interest but would never risk admitting (possibly not even to himself) having any gay or bi appreciation, least of all for a ''sissy'', and thus remains unresponsive to shy Kees'' overtures. When the hunk finally comes over to Kees'' place while his parents are away, a desperate disappointment with a tragical twist is in the making…', 'In this short motion picture, schoolboy Kees is intelligent, introvert and sensitive, but gets ridiculed verbally and physically at an all-boys school by mindlessly cocky class mates and even insensitive teachers, especially in gym, where his physical weakness is mercilessly abused to make him a defenceless laughing stock in front of his smirking peers. His awakening sexual interest goes to boys, and in particular to Charel, a beautiful athletic classmate who probably feels an undetermined interest but would never risk admitting (possibly not even to himself) having any gay or bi appreciation, least of all for a ''sissy'', and thus remains unresponsive to shy Kees'' overtures. When the hunk finally comes over to Kees'' place while his parents are away, a desperate disappointment with a tragical twist is in the making…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3UymGvow8cKMugXzxjso7Mlhv1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44504'),
  ('927902431255595063', 'To Please a Lady', 1950, 'Action, Romance', 'Clarence Brown, Harold Rosson', 'Barré Lyndon, Marge Decker', 'Clark Gable, Barbara Stanwyck, Adolphe Menjou, Will Geer, Roland Winters, William C. McGaw, Lela Bliss, Emory Parnell', 'NR', 'Mike Brannon is a former war hero turned midget car racer. His ruthless racing tactics have made him successful but the fans consider him a villain and boo him mercilessly. Independent, beautiful reporter Regina Forbes tries to interview him but is put off by his gruff chauvinism, and when Brannon''s daredevil tactics cause the death of a fellow driver, he finds himself a pariah in the sport thanks to her articles. When she finds him earning money as a barnstorming daredevil driver hoping for a comeback, they begin to become mutually attracted.', 'Mike Brannon is a former war hero turned midget car racer. His ruthless racing tactics have made him successful but the fans consider him a villain and boo him mercilessly. Independent, beautiful reporter Regina Forbes tries to interview him but is put off by his gruff chauvinism, and when Brannon''s daredevil tactics cause the death of a fellow driver, he finds himself a pariah in the sport thanks to her articles. When she finds him earning money as a barnstorming daredevil driver hoping for a comeback, they begin to become mutually attracted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZ9uaQO3OVcFeLZ9n2pvKPU7MHX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168045'),
  ('246638623946926450', 'To Remove the Heart', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Melissa Elizondo Moreno, Natali Montell, Paloma Petra', 'Melissa Elizondo Moreno', null, null, 'Art is the way in which some children from San Gregorio, Atlapulco, sublimate their trauma when witnessing the 2017 earthquake in Mexico.', 'Art is the way in which some children from San Gregorio, Atlapulco, sublimate their trauma when witnessing the 2017 earthquake in Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QOui9embQswzx8s4D7YAUs3HeS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:719946'),
  ('260348383246922549', 'To Rob a Thief', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Joe Menendez', 'JoJo Henrickson', 'Fernando Colunga, Miguel Varoni, Saúl Lisazo, Ivonne Montero, Oscar Torre, Rubén Garfias, Gabriel Soto, Julie Gonzalo', 'PG-13', 'Emilio, a Colombian con man, arrives in LA with two weeks to complete his plan to rob a former colleague, Claudio Silvestrini, who''s made a fortune using infomercials to peddle snake oil to Latin immigrants. Emilio''s friend Alejandro, who sells pirated DVDs, has assembled a team of amateurs, who, as Alejandro says, will go unnoticed because they''re immigrants. The team must gain entry to Silvestrini''s well-guarded mansion, steal two keys to access a vault, and then get the money off the property. A father and his tomboy daughter, a nervous Cuban actor, a techie, and a muscle man make up the team, plus Alejandro has been courting Silvestrini''s nanny. Will they be enough?', 'Emilio, a Colombian con man, arrives in LA with two weeks to complete his plan to rob a former colleague, Claudio Silvestrini, who''s made a fortune using infomercials to peddle snake oil to Latin immigrants. Emilio''s friend Alejandro, who sells pirated DVDs, has assembled a team of amateurs, who, as Alejandro says, will go unnoticed because they''re immigrants. The team must gain entry to Silvestrini''s well-guarded mansion, steal two keys to access a vault, and then get the money off the property. A father and his tomboy daughter, a nervous Cuban actor, a techie, and a muscle man make up the team, plus Alejandro has been courting Silvestrini''s nanny. Will they be enough?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/px4hQ1HvJBDSzRuY3zNIkrFTlrd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38140'),
  ('565325950852235953', 'To Rome with Love', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gianluca Gamberini, Alberto Mangiante, Barbara Pastrovich', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Roberto Benigni, Penélope Cruz, Alec Baldwin, Judy Davis, Jesse Eisenberg, Greta Gerwig, Elliot Page', 'R', 'Four tales unfold in the Eternal City: While vacationing in Rome, architect John encounters a young man whose romantic woes remind him of a painful incident from his own youth; retired opera director Jerry discovers a mortician with an amazing voice, and he seizes the opportunity to rejuvenate his own flagging career; a young couple have separate romantic interludes; a spotlight shines on an ordinary man.', 'Four tales unfold in the Eternal City: While vacationing in Rome, architect John encounters a young man whose romantic woes remind him of a painful incident from his own youth; retired opera director Jerry discovers a mortician with an amazing voice, and he seizes the opportunity to rejuvenate his own flagging career; a young couple have separate romantic interludes; a spotlight shines on an ordinary man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMmYRgvFRk5Ginhytx7ciU7UwVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81836'),
  ('66883944112593950', 'Tô Ryca 2', 2022, 'Comedy, Family', 'Aline Guerra, Pedro Antônio, Julio Costantini', 'Luanna Guimarães, Fil Braz', 'Samantha Schmütz, Katiuscia Canoro, Evelyn Castro, Anderson Di Rizzi, Marcelo Mello Jr., Rafael Portugal, Wallie Ruy, Maiara Henrique Pereira', null, 'Selminha is back! Now wealthy and willing to pay generously for all her needs and desires. The problem is that a poor person’s happiness is brief: a namesake heir appears claiming that she is the legitimate inheritor and Selminha’s assets are frozen. Her only source of income becomes a minimum wage salary of R$30 per day. However, Selminha has already forgotten how to live the hardships of poverty. And worst, she is the patron of the Quintino community, and with her financial difficulties, the community also feels the squeeze.', 'Selminha is back! Now wealthy and willing to pay generously for all her needs and desires. The problem is that a poor person’s happiness is brief: a namesake heir appears claiming that she is the legitimate inheritor and Selminha’s assets are frozen. Her only source of income becomes a minimum wage salary of R$30 per day. However, Selminha has already forgotten how to live the hardships of poverty. And worst, she is the patron of the Quintino community, and with her financial difficulties, the community also feels the squeeze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84GIm1NIcIxCrPuoLlsaQzZFVH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:687552'),
  ('342038585904227200', 'To Save a Life', 2009, 'Drama', 'Brian Baugh, C. Clifford Jones', 'Jim Britts', 'Randy Wayne, Deja Kreutzberg, Joshua Weigel, Robert Bailey Jr., Bubba Lewis, Kimberly Daugherty, Sean Michael Afable, David Starzyk', 'PG-13', 'Jake Taylor has everything. He has a beautiful girl, he''s the champion in basketball and beer pong, and everyone loves him. Then, an old childhood friend of his commits suicide. Jake wonders what he could''ve done to save his friend''s life. A youth minister tells him that Jake needs God. So Jake becomes a Christian. However, things begin to spin out of control. Jake is going to realize just what it means to be a Christian and how, to save a life.', 'Jake Taylor has everything. He has a beautiful girl, he''s the champion in basketball and beer pong, and everyone loves him. Then, an old childhood friend of his commits suicide. Jake wonders what he could''ve done to save his friend''s life. A youth minister tells him that Jake needs God. So Jake becomes a Christian. However, things begin to spin out of control. Jake is going to realize just what it means to be a Christian and how, to save a life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtJrFdGB5QyatbNgLGXy1BogYtP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41144'),
  ('1006799752270748609', 'To Shores Unknown', 2022, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Nikolaus Leytner, Hermann Dunzendorfer, Anton Maria Aigner', 'Nikolaus Leytner, Anton Maria Aigner', 'Maria Hofstätter, Leonard Hädler Stirský, Karl Fischer, Martin Pechlát, Miriam Fussenegger, Robert Mikluš, Regina Fritsch, Denis Šafařík', null, 'During a joint operation by Czech and Austrian police officers against an illegal rave party in the border forest, young Austrian policewoman Johanna tragically dies and a Czech drug dealer named Sicilian disappears mysteriously. A rookie cop refuses to let the killer of his colleague go unpunished.', 'During a joint operation by Czech and Austrian police officers against an illegal rave party in the border forest, young Austrian policewoman Johanna tragically dies and a Czech drug dealer named Sicilian disappears mysteriously. A rookie cop refuses to let the killer of his colleague go unpunished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOZZkjx0BsCIdakaut9pi2L6L6y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1042643'),
  ('730985176430182588', 'To Sir, with Love', 1967, 'Drama', 'James Clavell, Paul Beeson, Ted Sturgis', 'E.R. Braithwaite, James Clavell', 'Sidney Poitier, Christian Roberts, Judy Geeson, Suzy Kendall, Lulu, Ann Bell, Geoffrey Bayldon, Faith Brook', 'NR', 'A British Guianese engineer starts a job as a high school teacher in London’s East End, where his uninterested and delinquent pupils are in desperate need of attention and care.', 'A British Guianese engineer starts a job as a high school teacher in London’s East End, where his uninterested and delinquent pupils are in desperate need of attention and care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMaVwTfgETmPs5yp3lNK5SeWCtB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25934'),
  ('132231962246095238', 'To Sir, with Love II', 1996, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Peter Bogdanovich, William Birch', 'Philip Rosenberg', 'Sidney Poitier, Christian Payton, Dana Eskelson, Fernando López, Casey Lluberes, Michael Gilio, LZ Granderson, Bernadette Speakes', 'NR', 'After thirty years teaching in London, Mark Thackeray retires and returns to Chicago. There, however, the challenge of teaching kids in an inner city school proves to be too much to resist.', 'After thirty years teaching in London, Mark Thackeray retires and returns to Chicago. There, however, the challenge of teaching kids in an inner city school proves to be too much to resist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94gHDqRoScMy6JIydYWsE3QBwea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86040'),
  ('218861809174433866', 'To Skin a Spy', 1966, 'Thriller', 'Jacques Deray', 'José Giovanni', 'Lino Ventura, Jean Bouise, Marilù Tolo, Adrian Hoven, Charles Regnier, Ellen Bahl, Wolfgang Preiss, Jean Servais', null, 'A French secret agent gets a license to kill when he is sent to Vienna to plug a security leak in this routine spy saga. He is caught in the crossfire of international enemy agents trying to eliminate the French.', 'A French secret agent gets a license to kill when he is sent to Vienna to plug a security leak in this routine spy saga. He is caught in the crossfire of international enemy agents trying to eliminate the French.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWejXVkknXZH1OrrjLerj0MA1lb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82098'),
