  ('114308048296858761', 'To Sleep So as to Dream', 1986, 'Fantasy, Mystery, Comedy', 'Kaizo Hayashi, Yuichi Nagata', 'Kaizo Hayashi', 'Shiro Sano, Moe Kamura, Fujiko Fukamizu, Shunsui Matsuda, Yoshio Yoshida, Akira Ōizumi, Morio Agata, Kazunari Ozasa', null, 'An aging silent film actress hires a private eye and his wacky but helpful assistant to track down her missing daughter, Bellflower. The two follow a succession of bizarre, obscure clues, until they track down the location of the kidnappers and the daughter.', 'An aging silent film actress hires a private eye and his wacky but helpful assistant to track down her missing daughter, Bellflower. The two follow a succession of bizarre, obscure clues, until they track down the location of the kidnappers and the daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opqoKsc2WEtT9NwHtUk8IHNEIOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132702'),
  ('304496285758019293', 'To Sleep with a Vampire', 1993, 'Drama, Horror, Romance, Thriller', 'Adam Friedman, Michael Crain, Jeannette Scheibe', 'Patricia Harrington', 'Scott Valentine, Charlie Spradling, Richard Zobel, Ingrid Vold, Stephanie Hardy, Kristine Rose, Cole S. McKay, Kurt D. Lott', 'R', 'Scott Valentine is a vampire who is torn between his need to feed and his desire to learn about the world of humans. But when he kidnaps Nina, a beautiful but troubled stripper, his world is turned upside down. For after she discovers that he cannot be hurt physically, Nina tries a new tactic... seduction.', 'Scott Valentine is a vampire who is torn between his need to feed and his desire to learn about the world of humans. But when he kidnaps Nina, a beautiful but troubled stripper, his world is turned upside down. For after she discovers that he cannot be hurt physically, Nina tries a new tactic... seduction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OmRwkmvfzq90Vv1xr3dmlP3Iut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53149'),
