  ('557044723851049499', 'Tocata y fuga de Lolita', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Antonio Drove, Sinesio Isla, Manuel Rojas', 'Antonio Drove, José Luis Dibildos', 'Arturo Fernández, Pauline Challoner, Amparo Muñoz, Francisco Algora, Enriqueta Carballeira, Laly Soldevila, Manuel Alexandre, Alberto Fernández', null, 'Carlos, a widower in his forties, lives with his daughter Lolita and his sister Merche. He is a candidate to Spanish Court''s Proctor, so frequently travels outside Madrid. During one of those trips, he is forced to return at home precipitously, because his sister informed him that Lolita has left the house to live with some friends.', 'Carlos, a widower in his forties, lives with his daughter Lolita and his sister Merche. He is a candidate to Spanish Court''s Proctor, so frequently travels outside Madrid. During one of those trips, he is forced to return at home precipitously, because his sister informed him that Lolita has left the house to live with some friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTqMtq9AzhuWl7zUP9gifvrAATD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429866'),
  ('852943098743234610', 'Todas las mujeres', 2013, 'Drama', 'Mariano Barroso, Raquel Fernández Nuñez', 'Mariano Barroso, Alejandro Hernández', 'Eduard Fernández, Michelle Jenner, Nathalie Poza, Petra Martínez, María Morales, Marta Larralde, Lucía Quintana', null, 'Tells the story of Nacho, a veterinarian, who faces women who have meant something in his life. Before him appears his lover, his mother, his psychologist, his partner, his ex-girlfriend and her sister. With all of them have outstanding accounts and they all have to face to resolve.', 'Tells the story of Nacho, a veterinarian, who faces women who have meant something in his life. Before him appears his lover, his mother, his psychologist, his partner, his ex-girlfriend and her sister. With all of them have outstanding accounts and they all have to face to resolve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZayFLw1CLVGoHbnr2dNIQYDtvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226542'),
