  ('1099769215591196119', 'Today Again', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Daniele Poli, Nicola Conversa, Tiziana Forletta', 'Giulia Uda', 'Tommaso Cassissa, Ginevra Francesconi, Francesco Centorame, Katia Follesa, Marilù Pipitone, Edoardo Pagliai, Federica Pagliaroli, Cesare Bocci', null, 'Marco is an anxious nineteen-year-old approaching his final exams, with three subjects to catch up on, a mother glued to her smartphone, and a brother who dreams of becoming an indie singer. He is antisocial and wishes he could love the way people used to. Aria graduated the previous year, has *one day at a time* tattooed on her arm, and lives every day as if it were her last.', 'Marco is an anxious nineteen-year-old approaching his final exams, with three subjects to catch up on, a mother glued to her smartphone, and a brother who dreams of becoming an indie singer. He is antisocial and wishes he could love the way people used to. Aria graduated the previous year, has *one day at a time* tattooed on her arm, and lives every day as if it were her last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWdLlDO50Den8pxTywDsXsRxOKb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1195774'),
  ('1071917215905035402', 'Today Match at 3', 2017, 'Drama', 'Clarisa Navas, Ana Carolina García, Lucas Gabriel Olivares', 'Clarisa Navas', 'Ana Carolina García, Silvana Dorrego, Maria Esprigitto, Heidi Pomis, Yaneth Román, Gustavo Bravo, Angie Sánchez, Horacio "Chirola" Fernández', null, 'Las Indomables await with anxiety the start of a neighborhood women''s soccer tournament. During the wait all kinds of events happen, love, conflicts, politics and even a rain, stalk the passion for which they are there: Play football at all costs', 'Las Indomables await with anxiety the start of a neighborhood women''s soccer tournament. During the wait all kinds of events happen, love, conflicts, politics and even a rain, stalk the passion for which they are there: Play football at all costs', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHfz1wmgpUyyzQ4uvu0mQwPFm3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454399'),
  ('496946537522975126', 'Today We Fix the World', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Fernando Alcalde, Santiago Colombatto, Eliana Roses', 'Mariano Vera', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Benjamín Otero, Natalia Oreiro, Charo López, Luis Luque, Martín Piroyansky, Soledad Silveyra, Diego Peretti', null, 'David Samaras, "el Griego", is the general producer of the popular talk show "Hoy se arregla el mundo", where supposedly ordinary people resolve relationship, couple, friendship, work, parent and child conflicts. The most enduring bond in his life is Benito, his 9-year-old son, the fruit of a casual relationship. The story changes completely when he learns that Benito is not his son. The search for the real dad will lead them to a crossroads much bigger than the one they set out to face.', 'David Samaras, "el Griego", is the general producer of the popular talk show "Hoy se arregla el mundo", where supposedly ordinary people resolve relationship, couple, friendship, work, parent and child conflicts. The most enduring bond in his life is Benito, his 9-year-old son, the fruit of a casual relationship. The story changes completely when he learns that Benito is not his son. The search for the real dad will lead them to a crossroads much bigger than the one they set out to face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNAOqq4x2qXdER1HLThRHRRUeTf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656796'),
  ('269795820440271705', 'Today We Kill, Tomorrow We Die!', 1968, 'Western, Thriller', 'Sergio D''Offizi, Tonino Cervi, Mauro Sacripanti', 'Dario Argento, Tonino Cervi', 'Brett Halsey, Bud Spencer, Wayde Preston, Jeff Cameron, William Berger, Tatsuya Nakadai, Franco Borelli, Dana Ghia', 'PG', 'A man, released after a jail term for a crime he did not commit, raises a gang to go after the man who framed him.', 'A man, released after a jail term for a crime he did not commit, raises a gang to go after the man who framed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvhnbqZmnu3D2LGxSj2bIUZKW3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46570'),
