  ('855573103077243512', 'Todesfrist – Nemez und Sneijder ermitteln', 2019, 'TV Movie, Thriller', 'Christopher Schier', null, 'Josefine Preuß, Raymond Thiry, Ulli Maier, Mavie Hörbiger, Dagny Dewath, Nils Hohenhövel, Stefan Pohl, Heinz Arthur Boltuch', null, 'Based on Andreas Gruber''s bestseller: A female corpse is found in Munich''s Frauenkirche, suffocated by a large amount of ink—a reference to the "bad guys" in "Struwwelpeter." Munich detective Sabine Nemez takes over the investigation. However, parallels to cases in Leipzig and Cologne bring the Federal Criminal Police Office (BKA) into play, where the stubborn but brilliant case analyst and forensic psychologist Maarten S. Sneijder is investigating the series of murders. Reluctantly, but convinced by Sabine''s instinct and talent, Sneijder allows the young detective, for whom solving the case is a personal concern, to continue her involvement in the investigation. The bloody trail leads the quick-witted duo to Vienna, where psychologist Helene Berger has received a package containing a severed thumb—the story of the "thumb-sucker." This makes her part of a bizarre psychological game, for every murder is preceded by a riddle from the murderer...', 'Based on Andreas Gruber''s bestseller: A female corpse is found in Munich''s Frauenkirche, suffocated by a large amount of ink—a reference to the "bad guys" in "Struwwelpeter." Munich detective Sabine Nemez takes over the investigation. However, parallels to cases in Leipzig and Cologne bring the Federal Criminal Police Office (BKA) into play, where the stubborn but brilliant case analyst and forensic psychologist Maarten S. Sneijder is investigating the series of murders. Reluctantly, but convinced by Sabine''s instinct and talent, Sneijder allows the young detective, for whom solving the case is a personal concern, to continue her involvement in the investigation. The bloody trail leads the quick-witted duo to Vienna, where psychologist Helene Berger has received a package containing a severed thumb—the story of the "thumb-sucker." This makes her part of a bizarre psychological game, for every murder is preceded by a riddle from the murderer...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVxoOaQZERFGqVo8iuctslUIK1o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637878'),
  ('31232648219184027', 'Todo el tiempo del mundo', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rosendo Ruíz', 'Micaela Dalesson, Paula Ledesma, Rosendo Ruíz', 'Juan Ignacio Croce, Micaela Dalesson, Paula Ledesma, Maura Muzi', null, 'A high school student invites two classmates to embark on a backpacking trip to find a community located in the middle of the Mountains of Cordoba', 'A high school student invites two classmates to embark on a backpacking trip to find a community located in the middle of the Mountains of Cordoba', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJVox7fZjvPzQQpxUab0hyDOzUt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360936'),
  ('751227961922173279', 'Todo es mentira', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Álvaro Fernández Armero, Antonio Cuevas, Julián Núñez Sánchez', 'Álvaro Fernández Armero', 'Penélope Cruz, Coque Malla, Ariadna Gil, Jordi Mollà, Christina Rosenvinge, Gustavo Salmerón, Irene Bau, Fernando Colomo', null, 'Pablo hates everything. When Lucia comes into his life, he thinks she''s the woman he dreams of, and sees the solution to all his problems. But Lucia, who is rather manipulating, is just what will make Pablo explode. Nobody believes in the ideal couple, not even Pablo''s friends, who live all in couples, and all with problems: Between Ariel and Lola there is a professional rivalty they don''t know how to cope with; Claudio lives on Natalia, and none of them feels good about it; what''s wrong with Alejandro and Beatriz is just the big age difference between them two. Nobody is happy with his partenaire, but everyone will let it be, maybe for conformism, maybe for fear, maybe for lazyness, or maybe because Everything is false.', 'Pablo hates everything. When Lucia comes into his life, he thinks she''s the woman he dreams of, and sees the solution to all his problems. But Lucia, who is rather manipulating, is just what will make Pablo explode. Nobody believes in the ideal couple, not even Pablo''s friends, who live all in couples, and all with problems: Between Ariel and Lola there is a professional rivalty they don''t know how to cope with; Claudio lives on Natalia, and none of them feels good about it; what''s wrong with Alejandro and Beatriz is just the big age difference between them two. Nobody is happy with his partenaire, but everyone will let it be, maybe for conformism, maybe for fear, maybe for lazyness, or maybe because Everything is false.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MGENjueQNXjp6b0ateixcpV3W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115485'),
  ('972369986186939271', 'Todo es posible en Granada', 1982, 'Comedy, Music', 'Rafael Romero Marchent', null, 'Manolo Escobar, Tessa Hood, Manolo Gómez Bur, Luis Varela, Rafael Alonso, Luis Barbero, Félix Dafauce', null, 'Manolo Ortega is a tour guide in Granada and, at night, acting in a cave in Sacromonte. It has a small plot totally barren, and yet does not want to sell it to an American company for uranium prospecting. To convince, Spain bequeathed to Margaret, the director of the company. But before his stubborn refusal, decides encandilarlo. So, shake his friendship and he confesses that there is buried treasure that his ancestor discovered by a spell. Last movie starring Manolo Escobar.', 'Manolo Ortega is a tour guide in Granada and, at night, acting in a cave in Sacromonte. It has a small plot totally barren, and yet does not want to sell it to an American company for uranium prospecting. To convince, Spain bequeathed to Margaret, the director of the company. But before his stubborn refusal, decides encandilarlo. So, shake his friendship and he confesses that there is buried treasure that his ancestor discovered by a spell. Last movie starring Manolo Escobar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIEeFXxMocWoPsIw3KCGqOj8EUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129425'),
  ('1112567742456425436', 'Todo un hombre', 1983, 'Western, Drama, Romance', 'Rafael Villaseñor Kuri, Xavier Cruz', 'Rafael García Travesí', 'Vicente Fernández, Amparo Muñoz, Felipe Arriaga, Eduardo Noriega, Yolanda Ciani, Oscar Traven, Dacia González, Enrique Lucero', null, 'Unsympathetic portrait of a man who''s too macho to display his feelings.', 'Unsympathetic portrait of a man who''s too macho to display his feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJWkw5A8J2EAOJjDvwrupSXztFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366037'),
  ('152941740260686662', 'Todos al suelo', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Fernando Esteso, Andrés Pajares, Antonio Ozores, Juanito Navarro, Azucena Hernández, Paloma Hurtado, Rafaela Aparicio, Beatriz Escudero', null, 'A gang of four poor underdogs plans a bankrobbery. The problems start when they try to make their plans reality and realize that they are robbing a fortune of various millions of pesetas.', 'A gang of four poor underdogs plans a bankrobbery. The problems start when they try to make their plans reality and realize that they are robbing a fortune of various millions of pesetas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Atc0vMAZAiXfB9nwDAU5QVaPrjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142040'),
  ('432586622980830375', 'Todos estamos invitados', 2008, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón, Gonzalo F. Berridi', 'Ángeles González-Sinde, Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón', 'Óscar Jaenada, Jose Coronado, Vanessa Incontrada, Iñaki Miramón, Kike Díaz de Rada, Leire Ucha, Iñaki Font, Paul Zubillaga', null, 'Spain. The Basque Country. Sometime in the 90s. Josu Jon, a young member of a terrorist organization, has suffered an almost complete memory loss after being wounded in a shooting with the Spanish police. As he awaits for his trial, his condition is being treated at the prison hospital. Other inmates belonging to the same organization try to make him remember how brave a "gudari" -a Basque soldier- he is and how he must go back to the armed fight for the independence of their country as soon as he gets out of prison. Meanwhile, Xabier, a college professor who has been death-threatened by the terrorists due to his political views on the Basque situation, is having an affair with Francesca, a young psychologist who happens to end up trying to help Josu Jon recover his memory. A warm feeling of mutual affection grows between her and her patient. At a point, it doesn''t seem to be clear whether Josu Jon really wants to recover his memory or rather forget forever who he actually is.', 'Spain. The Basque Country. Sometime in the 90s. Josu Jon, a young member of a terrorist organization, has suffered an almost complete memory loss after being wounded in a shooting with the Spanish police. As he awaits for his trial, his condition is being treated at the prison hospital. Other inmates belonging to the same organization try to make him remember how brave a "gudari" -a Basque soldier- he is and how he must go back to the armed fight for the independence of their country as soon as he gets out of prison. Meanwhile, Xabier, a college professor who has been death-threatened by the terrorists due to his political views on the Basque situation, is having an affair with Francesca, a young psychologist who happens to end up trying to help Josu Jon recover his memory. A warm feeling of mutual affection grows between her and her patient. At a point, it doesn''t seem to be clear whether Josu Jon really wants to recover his memory or rather forget forever who he actually is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/by2RjlxgcNFasIr5TbkCNIy5BA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83224'),
  ('921486789237959097', 'Todos hemos pecado', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alejandro Ramírez, Omar García', 'Alejandro Ramírez', 'Aleyda Gallardo, Alberto Estrella, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, María Rojo, Mario Almada, Mario Zaragoza, Angélica Aragón, Manuel Ojeda', null, 'No one could ever imagine that one day La Chingada Vieja would fall in love. Because she is always alone, because no one has ever turn to see her, because everyone is always closing the door at her nose, because when they feel her coming they cross themselves, but most of all because no one could ever fall in love with death. But El Hombre sin nombre, has appeared in her life for good. Only the confusion of an avenging town and the desire of four men to arrive to heaven could change the plans of these two beings. Of whom the purist feelings alive have resurrected them.', 'No one could ever imagine that one day La Chingada Vieja would fall in love. Because she is always alone, because no one has ever turn to see her, because everyone is always closing the door at her nose, because when they feel her coming they cross themselves, but most of all because no one could ever fall in love with death. But El Hombre sin nombre, has appeared in her life for good. Only the confusion of an avenging town and the desire of four men to arrive to heaven could change the plans of these two beings. Of whom the purist feelings alive have resurrected them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUi6AO62LW0RSZBmxP88ZhvnO0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114163'),
  ('1036859778906205742', 'Together', 1956, 'Drama', 'Lorenza Mazzetti, Hamed Hadari, Denis Horne', 'Denis Horne', 'Michael Andrews, Eduardo Paolozzi, Vali Myers, Denis Richardson, Cecilia May', null, 'The workaday boredom and crushing hardships of London''s East End in the 1950s, seen from the point of view of two deaf-mutes who share a strong bond of friendship.', 'The workaday boredom and crushing hardships of London''s East End in the 1950s, seen from the point of view of two deaf-mutes who share a strong bond of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crxUdSj1Wyutxrf0D3d5JqqBZZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117475'),
  ('725726245342601134', 'Together', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Ulf Brantås, Lukas Moodysson, Imor Hermann', 'Lukas Moodysson', 'Lisa Lindgren, Michael Nyqvist, Emma Samuelsson, Sam Kessel, Gustaf Hammarsten, Anja Lundqvist, Jessica Liedberg, Ola Rapace', 'R', 'Elisabeth leaves her abusive and drunken husband Rolf, and goes to live with her brother, Göran. The year is 1975 and Göran lives in a commune called Together. Living in this leftist commune Elisabeth learns that the world can be viewed from different perspectives.', 'Elisabeth leaves her abusive and drunken husband Rolf, and goes to live with her brother, Göran. The year is 1975 and Göran lives in a commune called Together. Living in this leftist commune Elisabeth learns that the world can be viewed from different perspectives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIY5xko6dJOcn0hckudIhPXobve.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:742'),
  ('684620667769137021', 'Together', 2002, 'Drama', 'Chen Kaige, Zhao Nan, Kim Hyung-koo', 'Xue Xiaolu, Chen Kaige', 'Yun Tang, Chen Hong, Liu Peiqi, Cheng Qian, Chen Kaige, Hye-ri Kim, Wang Zhiwen, Chen Qiang', null, 'When a violin prodigy Xiaochun and his father head to Beijing seeking fame and fortune, they soon discover a fierce world of cutthroat ambition. But when Xiaochun is "adopted" by a famous music tutor, success finally seems within reach - until a shocking discovery begins to unravel his entire world, and the boy must make the most difficult choice of his life. Can he achieve the fame his father had always hoped for without losing the extraordinary passion that sets him apart?', 'When a violin prodigy Xiaochun and his father head to Beijing seeking fame and fortune, they soon discover a fierce world of cutthroat ambition. But when Xiaochun is "adopted" by a famous music tutor, success finally seems within reach - until a shocking discovery begins to unravel his entire world, and the boy must make the most difficult choice of his life. Can he achieve the fame his father had always hoped for without losing the extraordinary passion that sets him apart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yG67qljsdR06NzwdWM9wBQ5EkyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18385'),
  ('731951576195916501', 'Together', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stephen Daldry, Justin Martin, Iain Struthers', 'Dennis Kelly', 'James McAvoy, Sharon Horgan, Samuel Logan', 'R', 'A husband and wife are forced to re-evaluate themselves and their relationship through the reality of the Covid-19 lockdown.', 'A husband and wife are forced to re-evaluate themselves and their relationship through the reality of the Covid-19 lockdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeocQg0Bhmy0pqqRy50wEo0iwFB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:837548'),
  ('317630278549661884', 'Together', 2025, 'Horror, Romance', 'Germain McMicking, Michael Shanks, Andrew Power', 'Michael Shanks', 'Dave Franco, Alison Brie, Damon Herriman, Mia Morrissey, Karl Richmond, Jack Kenny, Francesca Waters, Aljin Abella', 'R', 'Years into their relationship, Tim and Millie find themselves at a crossroads as they move to the country, abandoning all that is familiar in their lives except each other. With tensions already flaring, a nightmarish encounter with a mysterious, unnatural force threatens to corrupt their lives, their love, and their flesh.', 'Years into their relationship, Tim and Millie find themselves at a crossroads as they move to the country, abandoning all that is familiar in their lives except each other. With tensions already flaring, a nightmarish encounter with a mysterious, unnatural force threatens to corrupt their lives, their love, and their flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80slKYVM5teFH3kz6ouWrZXveqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242011'),
  ('969669416943855479', 'Together 99', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lukas Moodysson, Ellinor Hallin', 'Lukas Moodysson', 'Gustaf Hammarsten, Shanti Roney, Cecilia Frode, Olle Sarri, David Dencik, Clara Christiansson Drake, Jonas Karlsson, Lisa Lindgren', null, 'A group of very different individuals who in 1975 lived in a commune called "Together". Now it is 1999, and the collective has turned into the world''s smallest. The commune consists of only two people - Göran and Klasse. Feeling a bit lonely, the idea occurs of a reunion with their old friends.', 'A group of very different individuals who in 1975 lived in a commune called "Together". Now it is 1999, and the collective has turned into the world''s smallest. The commune consists of only two people - Göran and Klasse. Feeling a bit lonely, the idea occurs of a reunion with their old friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VBMAwJRQCdkqsv5e028RnK0Uo1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977935'),
  ('803182494679635303', 'Together Again', 1944, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Charles Vidor, Joseph Walker, Morris Stoloff', 'Virginia Van Upp, F. Hugh Herbert', 'Irene Dunne, Charles Boyer, Charles Coburn, Mona Freeman, Jerome Courtland, Elizabeth Patterson, Charles Dingle, Brooks Benedict', null, 'Anne Crandall is the mayor of a small town in Vermont. Her deceased husband had been the mayor for years and when he died, she was left to carry on and to raise his daughter from his first marriage. She lives with the daughter, her father-in-law and a housekeeper. In the town square, there was a statue of her late husband and every year since his death, they have an anniversary celebration there. This year during a thunderstorm, the statue is hit by lightning and the head falls off. The daughter insists that a new statue be erected instead of patching the old one. Mayor Crandall is sent to New York to interview the prospective sculptor, George Corday.', 'Anne Crandall is the mayor of a small town in Vermont. Her deceased husband had been the mayor for years and when he died, she was left to carry on and to raise his daughter from his first marriage. She lives with the daughter, her father-in-law and a housekeeper. In the town square, there was a statue of her late husband and every year since his death, they have an anniversary celebration there. This year during a thunderstorm, the statue is hit by lightning and the head falls off. The daughter insists that a new statue be erected instead of patching the old one. Mayor Crandall is sent to New York to interview the prospective sculptor, George Corday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hOTBQVu5Hh2uW5nAG9JQs7VjLG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32130'),
  ('236329200009316095', 'Together Forever', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Pablo Solarz', 'Pablo Solarz', 'Florencia Peña, Peto Menahem, Malena Solda, Mirta Busnelli, Luis Luque, Marta Lubos, Valeria Lois, Silvia Kutika', null, 'Screenwriter Javier Gross denies his past by making up fictional stories. Lucia, his wife, tired of his fiction, starts an affair. But not even the confession of infidelity touches Gross, who is caught up in the story of a script that is writing, whose idea is so powerful that dominates it completely. Lucia, after seeing that Gross is unshakable, decides to leave. But Gross wastes no time: the same day replaces Lucía by Laura. From day one, Gross confuses the names of women. Thus Laura is transformed into a second copy of the true love of Gross.', 'Screenwriter Javier Gross denies his past by making up fictional stories. Lucia, his wife, tired of his fiction, starts an affair. But not even the confession of infidelity touches Gross, who is caught up in the story of a script that is writing, whose idea is so powerful that dominates it completely. Lucia, after seeing that Gross is unshakable, decides to leave. But Gross wastes no time: the same day replaces Lucía by Laura. From day one, Gross confuses the names of women. Thus Laura is transformed into a second copy of the true love of Gross.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2HdW03LclMe5T8gHvCT2aDn6aw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87150'),
  ('371765456087421422', 'Together Is Too Much', 2010, 'Comedy, Family', 'Léa Fazer, Myriam Vinocour', 'Léa Fazer', 'Nathalie Baye, Pierre Arditi, Jocelyn Quivrin, Laurent Lafitte, Éric Cantona, Emilie Chesnais, Jacques Weber, Aïssa Maïga', null, 'Imagine, if you will, a somewhat contented married woman finding out her husband''s infidelity during the celebration of a birthday party. That is what happens to Marie-France, when her husband, Henri, pulls out panties from his pocket to be used as a handkerchief. Marie-France becomes furious, storming out of the house. His son, Sebastian and his wife, Clementine, a struggling couple, decide to take Marie-France to their tiny apartment, something they feel it is a temporary arrangement. Little did they know what they were getting into...', 'Imagine, if you will, a somewhat contented married woman finding out her husband''s infidelity during the celebration of a birthday party. That is what happens to Marie-France, when her husband, Henri, pulls out panties from his pocket to be used as a handkerchief. Marie-France becomes furious, storming out of the house. His son, Sebastian and his wife, Clementine, a struggling couple, decide to take Marie-France to their tiny apartment, something they feel it is a temporary arrangement. Little did they know what they were getting into...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OGkzl0rvx6s88n5OtSj7pkbWat.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53980'),
  ('855565504768249356', 'Together Together', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alexander Armero, Allan Aguilar, Rachel Penner', 'Nikole Beckwith', 'Ed Helms, Patti Harrison, Anna Konkle, Evan Jonigkeit, Tig Notaro, Nora Dunn, Fred Melamed, May Calamawy', 'R', 'When young loner Anna is hired as the surrogate for Matt, a single man in his 40s, the two strangers come to realize this unexpected relationship will quickly challenge their perceptions of connection, boundaries and the particulars of love.', 'When young loner Anna is hired as the surrogate for Matt, a single man in his 40s, the two strangers come to realize this unexpected relationship will quickly challenge their perceptions of connection, boundaries and the particulars of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cFawQz0urWvzsTbxTojbq11JJE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776515');
